uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"প্রকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11861,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11862,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"زَوْجٍۢ","transliteration":"zawjin","translation_bn":"জোড়া জোড়া (উদ্ভিদ)","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11863,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كَرِيمٍ","transliteration":"karīmin","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"كرم","lemma":"كَرِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":11864,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'khalaqa l-samāwāti bighayri ʿamadin tarawnahā wa-alqā fī l-arḍi rawāsiya an tamīda bikum wabatha fīhā min kulli dābbatin wa-anzalnā mina l-samāi māan fa-anbatnā fīhā min kulli zawjin karīmin', 'তিনি আকাশমন্ডলী নির্মাণ করেছেন স্তম্ভ ছাড়া যা তোমরা দেখছ। তিনি পৃথিবীতে স্থাপন করেছেন দৃঢ়ভাবে দন্ডায়মান পর্বতমালা যাতে পৃথিবী তোমাদেরকে নিয়ে নড়াচড়া না করে আর তাতে ছড়িয়ে দিয়েছেন সকল প্রকার জীবজন্তু, আর আমিই আকাশ থেকে পানি বর্ষণ করি, অতঃপর তাতে উদ্গত করি যাবতীয় কল্যাণকর উদ্ভিদ।', 'He created the heavens without pillars that you see and has cast into the earth firmly set mountains, lest it should shift with you, and dispersed therein from every creature. And We sent down rain from the sky and made grow therein [plants] of every noble kind.', 'তিনি আকাশমন্ডলী নির্মাণ করেছেন স্তম্ভ ছাড়া যা তোমরা দেখছ। তিনি পৃথিবীতে স্থাপন করেছেন দৃঢ়ভাবে দন্ডায়মান পর্বতমালা যাতে পৃথিবী তোমাদেরকে নিয়ে নড়াচড়া না করে আর তাতে ছড়িয়ে দিয়েছেন সকল প্রকার জীবজন্তু, আর আমিই আকাশ থেকে পানি বর্ষণ করি, অতঃপর তাতে উদ্গত করি যাবতীয় কল্যাণকর উদ্ভিদ।', 'He created the heavens without pillars that you see and has cast into the earth firmly set mountains, lest it should shift with you, and dispersed therein from every creature. And We sent down rain from the sky and made grow therein [plants] of every noble kind.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031010.mp3', now()),
  (31, 11, '', '[{"id":13131,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":13132,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَلْقُ","transliteration":"khalqu","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13133,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13134,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَأَرُونِى","transliteration":"fa-arūnī","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে দেখাও তোমরা আমাকে","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13135,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَاذَا","transliteration":"mādhā","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":13136,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13137,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":13138,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13139,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13141,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَلِ","transliteration":"bali","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":13142,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13143,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে(লিপ্ত)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13144,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তির","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13145,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13146,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hādhā khalqu l-lahi fa-arūnī mādhā khalaqa alladhīna min dūnihi bali l-ẓālimūna fī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'এগুলো আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি। কাজেই আমাকে দেখাও তিনি ছাড়া অন্যেরা কী সৃষ্টি করেছে। বরং যালিমরা সুস্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে ডুবে আছে।', 'This is the creation of Allah. So show Me what those other than Him have created. Rather, the wrongdoers are in clear error.', 'এগুলো আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি। কাজেই আমাকে দেখাও তিনি ছাড়া অন্যেরা কী সৃষ্টি করেছে। বরং যালিমরা সুস্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে ডুবে আছে।', 'This is the creation of Allah. So show Me what those other than Him have created. Rather, the wrongdoers are in clear error.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031011.mp3', now()),
  (31, 12, '', '[{"id":14433,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14434,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"ātaynā","translation_bn":"দিয়েছিলাম আমরা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14435,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لُقْمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"luq''māna","translation_bn":"লুকমানকে","root":"—","lemma":"لُقْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14436,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحِكْمَةَ","transliteration":"l-ḥik''mata","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞা","root":"حكم","lemma":"حِكْمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14437,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنِ","transliteration":"ani","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":14438,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱشْكُرْ","transliteration":"ush''kur","translation_bn":"\"তুমি কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14439,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌রই\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14441,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14442,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَشْكُرْ","transliteration":"yashkur","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহর) কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14443,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"তখন মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14444,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَشْكُرُ","transliteration":"yashkuru","translation_bn":"সে কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14445,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"linafsihi","translation_bn":"জন্যে নিজের তার","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14447,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14448,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرَ","transliteration":"kafara","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞ হয়","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14449,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14450,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14451,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"غَنِىٌّ","transliteration":"ghaniyyun","translation_bn":"অমুখাপেক্ষী","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14452,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"حَمِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥamīdun","translation_bn":"প্রশংসিত","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14453,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ātaynā luq''māna l-ḥik''mata ani ush''kur lillahi waman yashkur fa-innamā yashkuru linafsihi waman kafara fa-inna l-laha ghaniyyun ḥamīdun', 'আমি লুকমানকে প্রজ্ঞা দান করেছিলাম। (তাকে বলেছিলাম) যে, তুমি আল্লাহর কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর। যে কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে, সে তা নিজের কল্যাণেই করে। আর কেউ অকৃতজ্ঞ হলে (সে জেনে রাখুক যে) আল্লাহ অমুখাপেক্ষী, প্রশংসিত।', 'And We had certainly given Luqman wisdom [and said], "Be grateful to Allah." And whoever is grateful is grateful for [the benefit of] himself. And whoever denies [His favor] - then indeed, Allah is Free of need and Praiseworthy.', 'আমি লুকমানকে প্রজ্ঞা দান করেছিলাম। (তাকে বলেছিলাম) যে, তুমি আল্লাহর কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর। যে কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে, সে তা নিজের কল্যাণেই করে। আর কেউ অকৃতজ্ঞ হলে (সে জেনে রাখুক যে) আল্লাহ অমুখাপেক্ষী, প্রশংসিত।', 'And We had certainly given Luqman wisdom [and said], "Be grateful to Allah." And whoever is grateful is grateful for [the benefit of] himself. And whoever denies [His favor] - then indeed, Allah is Free of need and Praiseworthy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031012.mp3', now()),
  (31, 13, '', '[{"id":15534,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ করো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15535,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15536,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لُقْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"luq''mānu","translation_bn":"লুকমান","root":"—","lemma":"لُقْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15537,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِٱبْنِهِۦ","transliteration":"li-ib''nihi","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে পুত্রের তার","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15538,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে সে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":15539,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَعِظُهُۥ","transliteration":"yaʿiẓuhu","translation_bn":"উপদেশ দিচ্ছিলো তাকে","root":"وعظ","lemma":"وَعَظْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15540,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰبُنَىَّ","transliteration":"yābunayya","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":15541,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":15542,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكْ","transliteration":"tush''rik","translation_bn":"শিরক করো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15543,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"সাথে আল্লাহর(কাউকে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15545,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":15546,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشِّرْكَ","transliteration":"l-shir''ka","translation_bn":"শিরক করা","root":"شرك","lemma":"شِرْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15547,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَظُلْمٌ","transliteration":"laẓul''mun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সীমালঙ্ঘন","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":15548,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"চরম\"","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":15549,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh qāla luq''mānu li-ib''nihi wahuwa yaʿiẓuhu yābunayya lā tush''rik bil-lahi inna l-shir''ka laẓul''mun ʿaẓīmun', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন লুকমান তার ছেলেকে নসীহত ক’রে বলেছিল- হে বৎস! আল্লাহর সাথে কোন কিছুকে শিরক কর না, শিরক হচ্ছে অবশ্যই বিরাট যুলম।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Luqman said to his son while he was instructing him, "O my son, do not associate [anything] with Allah. Indeed, association [with him] is great injustice."', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন লুকমান তার ছেলেকে নসীহত ক’রে বলেছিল- হে বৎস! আল্লাহর সাথে কোন কিছুকে শিরক কর না, শিরক হচ্ছে অবশ্যই বিরাট যুলম।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Luqman said to his son while he was instructing him, "O my son, do not associate [anything] with Allah. Indeed, association [with him] is great injustice."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031013.mp3', now()),
  (31, 14, '', '[{"id":16577,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَوَصَّيْنَا","transliteration":"wawaṣṣaynā","translation_bn":"এবং জোর উপদেশ দিয়েছি আমরা","root":"وصي","lemma":"وَصَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16578,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-insāna","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16579,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","transliteration":"biwālidayhi","translation_bn":"সাথে তার মাতা-পিতার (ভালো ব্যবহারের জন্যে)","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَٰلِدَي","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16580,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَمَلَتْهُ","transliteration":"ḥamalathu","translation_bn":"বহন করেছে তাকে (পেটে)","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16581,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمُّهُۥ","transliteration":"ummuhu","translation_bn":"মা তার","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16582,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهْنًا","transliteration":"wahnan","translation_bn":"কষ্টের","root":"وهن","lemma":"وَهْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16583,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16584,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَهْنٍۢ","transliteration":"wahnin","translation_bn":"কষ্ট (করে)","root":"وهن","lemma":"وَهْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16585,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَفِصَـٰلُهُۥ","transliteration":"wafiṣāluhu","translation_bn":"এবং দুধ ছাড়ান তার","root":"فصل","lemma":"فِصَال","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16586,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16587,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَامَيْنِ","transliteration":"ʿāmayni","translation_bn":"দু''বছরের","root":"عوم","lemma":"عَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16588,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَنِ","transliteration":"ani","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":16589,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱشْكُرْ","transliteration":"ush''kur","translation_bn":"\"কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16590,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমার","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16591,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلِوَٰلِدَيْكَ","transliteration":"waliwālidayka","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতি তোমার মা-বাপেরও","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَٰلِدَي","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16592,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"দিকে আমারই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16593,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"(তোমাদের) প্রত্যাবর্তন","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16594,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wawaṣṣaynā l-insāna biwālidayhi ḥamalathu ummuhu wahnan ʿalā wahnin wafiṣāluhu fī ʿāmayni ani ush''kur lī waliwālidayka ilayya l-maṣīru', 'আমি মানুষকে তার পিতা-মাতার প্রতি সদ্ব্যবহারের নির্দেশ দিয়েছি। তার মা তাকে কষ্টের পর কষ্ট সহ্য করে গর্ভে ধারণ করে। তার দুধ ছাড়ানো হয় দু’বছরে, (নির্দেশ দিচ্ছি) যে, আমার প্রতি ও তোমার পিতামাতার প্রতি কৃতজ্ঞ হও। (তোমাদের সকলের) প্রত্যাবর্তন তো আমারই কাছে।', 'And We have enjoined upon man [care] for his parents. His mother carried him, [increasing her] in weakness upon weakness, and his weaning is in two years. Be grateful to Me and to your parents; to Me is the [final] destination.', 'আমি মানুষকে তার পিতা-মাতার প্রতি সদ্ব্যবহারের নির্দেশ দিয়েছি। তার মা তাকে কষ্টের পর কষ্ট সহ্য করে গর্ভে ধারণ করে। তার দুধ ছাড়ানো হয় দু’বছরে, (নির্দেশ দিচ্ছি) যে, আমার প্রতি ও তোমার পিতামাতার প্রতি কৃতজ্ঞ হও। (তোমাদের সকলের) প্রত্যাবর্তন তো আমারই কাছে।', 'And We have enjoined upon man [care] for his parents. His mother carried him, [increasing her] in weakness upon weakness, and his weaning is in two years. Be grateful to Me and to your parents; to Me is the [final] destination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031014.mp3', now()),
  (31, 15, '', '[{"id":17765,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17766,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰهَدَاكَ","transliteration":"jāhadāka","translation_bn":"তারা দু''জনে তোমাকে চাপ দেয়","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17767,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(এর)উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17768,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":17769,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكَ","transliteration":"tush''rika","translation_bn":"তুমি শিরক করো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17770,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِى","transliteration":"bī","translation_bn":"সাথে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"بِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17771,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17772,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17773,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17774,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17775,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17776,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17777,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تُطِعْهُمَا ۖ","transliteration":"tuṭiʿ''humā","translation_bn":"উভয়ের (কাউকে) মানবে","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17779,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَصَاحِبْهُمَا","transliteration":"waṣāḥib''humā","translation_bn":"তবে উভয়ের সাথে ব্যবহার করবে","root":"صحب","lemma":"تُصَٰحِبْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17780,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17781,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17782,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَعْرُوفًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"maʿrūfan","translation_bn":"সদ্ভাবে","root":"عرف","lemma":"مَّعْرُوف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17784,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبِعْ","transliteration":"wa-ittabiʿ","translation_bn":"এবং অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17785,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلَ","transliteration":"sabīla","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17786,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তার)যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17787,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَنَابَ","transliteration":"anāba","translation_bn":"অভিমুখী হয়েছে","root":"نوب","lemma":"أَنَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17788,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"দিকে আমারই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17790,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17791,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"দিকে আমারই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17792,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مَرْجِعُكُمْ","transliteration":"marjiʿukum","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন তোমাদের(হবে)","root":"رجع","lemma":"مَرْجِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17793,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَأُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"fa-unabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"তখন আমি জানিয়ে দিবো তোমাদেরকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17794,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17795,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17796,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করতে\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17797,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in jāhadāka ʿalā an tush''rika bī mā laysa laka bihi ʿil''mun falā tuṭiʿ''humā waṣāḥib''humā fī l-dun''yā maʿrūfan wa-ittabiʿ sabīla man anāba ilayya thumma ilayya marjiʿukum fa-unabbi-ukum bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'তোমার পিতামাতা যদি তোমাকে পীড়াপীড়ি করে আমার অংশীদার স্থির করার জন্য যার জ্ঞান তোমার নেই, তবে তুমি তাদের কথা মানবে না। কিন্তু পৃথিবীতে তাদের সাথে সদ্ভাবে বসবাস করবে। যে আমার অভিমুখী হয় তার পথ অনুসরণ করবে। অতঃপর আমারই নিকট তোমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন। তখন আমি তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেব তোমরা যা করছিলে।', 'But if they endeavor to make you associate with Me that of which you have no knowledge, do not obey them but accompany them in [this] world with appropriate kindness and follow the way of those who turn back to Me [in repentance]. Then to Me will be your return, and I will inform you about what you used to do.', 'তোমার পিতামাতা যদি তোমাকে পীড়াপীড়ি করে আমার অংশীদার স্থির করার জন্য যার জ্ঞান তোমার নেই, তবে তুমি তাদের কথা মানবে না। কিন্তু পৃথিবীতে তাদের সাথে সদ্ভাবে বসবাস করবে। যে আমার অভিমুখী হয় তার পথ অনুসরণ করবে। অতঃপর আমারই নিকট তোমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন। তখন আমি তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেব তোমরা যা করছিলে।', 'But if they endeavor to make you associate with Me that of which you have no knowledge, do not obey them but accompany them in [this] world with appropriate kindness and follow the way of those who turn back to Me [in repentance]. Then to Me will be your return, and I will inform you about what you used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031015.mp3', now()),
  (31, 16, '', '[{"id":18780,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰبُنَىَّ","transliteration":"yābunayya","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":18781,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهَآ","transliteration":"innahā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":18782,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":18783,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَكُ","transliteration":"taku","translation_bn":"তা হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18784,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِثْقَالَ","transliteration":"mith''qāla","translation_bn":"পরিমাণ","root":"ثقل","lemma":"مِثْقَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18785,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَبَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥabbatin","translation_bn":"দানার","root":"حبب","lemma":"حَبَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18786,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18787,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَرْدَلٍۢ","transliteration":"khardalin","translation_bn":"সরিষার","root":"خردل","lemma":"خَرْدَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18788,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَتَكُن","transliteration":"fatakun","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18789,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18790,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"صَخْرَةٍ","transliteration":"ṣakhratin","translation_bn":"শিলাখন্ডের","root":"صخر","lemma":"صَخْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18791,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18792,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18793,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আসমানসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18794,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18795,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18796,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"জমিনের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18797,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِ","transliteration":"yati","translation_bn":"আসবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18798,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তাকে (তাকে বের করে আনবেন)","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18799,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18801,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":18802,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18803,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لَطِيفٌ","transliteration":"laṭīfun","translation_bn":"সূক্ষ্মদর্শী","root":"لطف","lemma":"لَطِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":18804,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":18805,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yābunayya innahā in taku mith''qāla ḥabbatin min khardalin fatakun fī ṣakhratin aw fī l-samāwāti aw fī l-arḍi yati bihā l-lahu inna l-laha laṭīfun khabīrun', 'হে বৎস! কোন বস্তু যদি সরিষার দানা পরিমাণও হয় আর তা থাকে পাথরের ভিতরে অথবা আকাশে অথবা যমীনের নীচে, আল্লাহ তাকে এনে হাজির করবেন। আল্লাহ সূক্ষ্ণদর্শী, সব কিছুর খবর রাখেন।', '[And Luqman said], "O my son, indeed if wrong should be the weight of a mustard seed and should be within a rock or [anywhere] in the heavens or in the earth, Allah will bring it forth. Indeed, Allah is Subtle and Acquainted.', 'হে বৎস! কোন বস্তু যদি সরিষার দানা পরিমাণও হয় আর তা থাকে পাথরের ভিতরে অথবা আকাশে অথবা যমীনের নীচে, আল্লাহ তাকে এনে হাজির করবেন। আল্লাহ সূক্ষ্ণদর্শী, সব কিছুর খবর রাখেন।', '[And Luqman said], "O my son, indeed if wrong should be the weight of a mustard seed and should be within a rock or [anywhere] in the heavens or in the earth, Allah will bring it forth. Indeed, Allah is Subtle and Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031016.mp3', now()),
  (31, 17, '', '[{"id":19880,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰبُنَىَّ","transliteration":"yābunayya","translation_bn":"হে আমার পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":19881,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَقِمِ","transliteration":"aqimi","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠা করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19882,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19883,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأْمُرْ","transliteration":"wamur","translation_bn":"ও নির্দেশ দাও","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19884,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","transliteration":"bil-maʿrūfi","translation_bn":"প্রতি সৎকাজের","root":"عرف","lemma":"مَّعْرُوف","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19885,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱنْهَ","transliteration":"wa-in''ha","translation_bn":"এবং নিষেধ করো","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19886,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19887,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنكَرِ","transliteration":"l-munkari","translation_bn":"অসৎকাজ","root":"نكر","lemma":"مُنكَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19888,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"wa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"এবং ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19889,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(ঐ বিষয়ের) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19890,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":19891,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَكَ ۖ","transliteration":"aṣābaka","translation_bn":"তোমার উপর আপতিত হবে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19893,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":19894,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":19895,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19896,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَزْمِ","transliteration":"ʿazmi","translation_bn":"দৃঢ় সংকল্পের (সাহসের)","root":"عزم","lemma":"عَزْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19897,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمُورِ","transliteration":"l-umūri","translation_bn":"কাজসমূহের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19898,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yābunayya aqimi l-ṣalata wamur bil-maʿrūfi wa-in''ha ʿani l-munkari wa-iṣ''bir ʿalā mā aṣābaka inna dhālika min ʿazmi l-umūri', 'হে বৎস! তুমি নামায কায়িম কর, সৎ কাজের নির্দেশ দাও আর মন্দ কাজ হতে নিষেধ কর এবং বিপদাপদে ধৈর্যধারণ কর। নিশ্চয় এটা দৃঢ় সংকল্পের কাজ।', 'O my son, establish prayer, enjoin what is right, forbid what is wrong, and be patient over what befalls you. Indeed, [all] that is of the matters [requiring] determination.', 'হে বৎস! তুমি নামায কায়িম কর, সৎ কাজের নির্দেশ দাও আর মন্দ কাজ হতে নিষেধ কর এবং বিপদাপদে ধৈর্যধারণ কর। নিশ্চয় এটা দৃঢ় সংকল্পের কাজ।', 'O my son, establish prayer, enjoin what is right, forbid what is wrong, and be patient over what befalls you. Indeed, [all] that is of the matters [requiring] determination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031017.mp3', now()),
  (31, 18, '', '[{"id":20936,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20937,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُصَعِّرْ","transliteration":"tuṣaʿʿir","translation_bn":"তুমি ফিরাও","root":"صعر","lemma":"تُصَعِّرْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20938,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَدَّكَ","transliteration":"khaddaka","translation_bn":"তোমার গাল","root":"خدد","lemma":"خَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20939,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"থেকে মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20940,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20941,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَمْشِ","transliteration":"tamshi","translation_bn":"চলো","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20942,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20943,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"জমিনের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20944,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَرَحًا ۖ","transliteration":"maraḥan","translation_bn":"দেমাক করে","root":"مرح","lemma":"مَرَح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20946,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20947,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20948,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":20949,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালোবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20950,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20951,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُخْتَالٍۢ","transliteration":"mukh''tālin","translation_bn":"উদ্ধত","root":"خيل","lemma":"مُخْتَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":20952,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَخُورٍۢ","transliteration":"fakhūrin","translation_bn":"অহংকারীকে","root":"فخر","lemma":"فَخُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":20953,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tuṣaʿʿir khaddaka lilnnāsi walā tamshi fī l-arḍi maraḥan inna l-laha lā yuḥibbu kulla mukh''tālin fakhūrin', 'অহংকারের বশবর্তী হয়ে তুমি মানুষকে অবজ্ঞা কর না, আর পৃথিবীতে গর্বভরে চলাফেরা কর না, নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ কোন দাম্ভিক অহংকারীকে পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And do not turn your cheek [in contempt] toward people and do not walk through the earth exultantly. Indeed, Allah does not like everyone self-deluded and boastful.', 'অহংকারের বশবর্তী হয়ে তুমি মানুষকে অবজ্ঞা কর না, আর পৃথিবীতে গর্বভরে চলাফেরা কর না, নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ কোন দাম্ভিক অহংকারীকে পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And do not turn your cheek [in contempt] toward people and do not walk through the earth exultantly. Indeed, Allah does not like everyone self-deluded and boastful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031018.mp3', now()),
  (31, 19, '', '[{"id":22071,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱقْصِدْ","transliteration":"wa-iq''ṣid","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যম পন্থা অবলম্বন করো","root":"قصد","lemma":"ٱقْصِدْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22072,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22073,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَشْيِكَ","transliteration":"mashyika","translation_bn":"তোমার চলার","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَشْي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22074,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱغْضُضْ","transliteration":"wa-ugh''ḍuḍ","translation_bn":"এবং নিচু করো","root":"غضض","lemma":"يَغُضُّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22075,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22076,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"صَوْتِكَ ۚ","transliteration":"ṣawtika","translation_bn":"তোমার কণ্ঠস্বর","root":"صوت","lemma":"صَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22078,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":22079,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنكَرَ","transliteration":"ankara","translation_bn":"অধিক শ্রুতিকটু","root":"نكر","lemma":"أَنكَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22080,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَصْوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-aṣwāti","translation_bn":"স্বরসমূহের মধ্যে","root":"صوت","lemma":"صَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22081,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَصَوْتُ","transliteration":"laṣawtu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আওয়াজ","root":"صوت","lemma":"صَوْت","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":22082,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيرِ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīri","translation_bn":"গাধার\"","root":"حمر","lemma":"حِمَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22083,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-iq''ṣid fī mashyika wa-ugh''ḍuḍ min ṣawtika inna ankara l-aṣwāti laṣawtu l-ḥamīri', 'চলাফেরায় সংযত ভাব অবলম্বন কর এবং কণ্ঠস্বর নীচু কর। স্বরের মধ্যে নিশ্চয়ই গাধার স্বর সর্বাপেক্ষা শ্রুতিকটু।', 'And be moderate in your pace and lower your voice; indeed, the most disagreeable of sounds is the voice of donkeys."', 'চলাফেরায় সংযত ভাব অবলম্বন কর এবং কণ্ঠস্বর নীচু কর। স্বরের মধ্যে নিশ্চয়ই গাধার স্বর সর্বাপেক্ষা শ্রুতিকটু।', 'And be moderate in your pace and lower your voice; indeed, the most disagreeable of sounds is the voice of donkeys."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031019.mp3', now()),
  (31, 20, '', '[{"id":23118,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":23119,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"taraw","translation_bn":"তোমরা দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23120,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":23121,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23122,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَخَّرَ","transliteration":"sakhara","translation_bn":"অধীন করে দিয়েছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23123,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23124,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":23125,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23126,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23127,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23128,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23129,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23130,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأَسْبَغَ","transliteration":"wa-asbagha","translation_bn":"এবং সম্পূর্ণ করে দিয়েছেন","root":"سبغ","lemma":"أَسْبَغَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23131,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23132,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"نِعَمَهُۥ","transliteration":"niʿamahu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহসমূহ তাঁর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23133,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰهِرَةًۭ","transliteration":"ẓāhiratan","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ্য","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَٰهِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23134,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَبَاطِنَةًۭ ۗ","transliteration":"wabāṭinatan","translation_bn":"ও অপ্রকাশ্য","root":"بطن","lemma":"بَاطِنَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23136,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23137,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23138,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ (এমনও আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":23139,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰدِلُ","transliteration":"yujādilu","translation_bn":"তর্ক করে","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23140,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23141,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23142,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23143,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23144,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23145,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"কোনো পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23146,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23147,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ","transliteration":"kitābin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23148,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"مُّنِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"munīrin","translation_bn":"দীপ্তিময়","root":"نور","lemma":"مُّنِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23149,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam taraw anna l-laha sakhara lakum mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi wa-asbagha ʿalaykum niʿamahu ẓāhiratan wabāṭinatan wamina l-nāsi man yujādilu fī l-lahi bighayri ʿil''min walā hudan walā kitābin munīrin', 'তোমরা কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, যা কিছু আসমানসমূহে আর যমীনে আছে, আল্লাহ সমস্তই তোমাদের কল্যাণে নিয়োজিত করেছেন এবং তোমাদের প্রতি তাঁর প্রকাশ্য ও অপ্রকাশ্য নি‘য়ামাতসমূহ পরিপূর্ণ করে দিয়েছেন? কতক মানুষ জ্ঞান ছাড়াই আল্লাহ সম্বন্ধে বাক-বিতন্ডা করে, তাদের না আছে সঠিক পথের দিশা, আর না আছে কোন আলোপ্রদ কিতাব।', 'Do you not see that Allah has made subject to you whatever is in the heavens and whatever is in the earth and amply bestowed upon you His favors, [both] apparent and unapparent? But of the people is he who disputes about Allah without knowledge or guidance or an enlightening Book [from Him].', 'তোমরা কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, যা কিছু আসমানসমূহে আর যমীনে আছে, আল্লাহ সমস্তই তোমাদের কল্যাণে নিয়োজিত করেছেন এবং তোমাদের প্রতি তাঁর প্রকাশ্য ও অপ্রকাশ্য নি‘য়ামাতসমূহ পরিপূর্ণ করে দিয়েছেন? কতক মানুষ জ্ঞান ছাড়াই আল্লাহ সম্বন্ধে বাক-বিতন্ডা করে, তাদের না আছে সঠিক পথের দিশা, আর না আছে কোন আলোপ্রদ কিতাব।', 'Do you not see that Allah has made subject to you whatever is in the heavens and whatever is in the earth and amply bestowed upon you His favors, [both] apparent and unapparent? But of the people is he who disputes about Allah without knowledge or guidance or an enlightening Book [from Him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031020.mp3', now()),
  (31, 21, '', '[{"id":24145,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24146,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24147,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24148,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبِعُوا۟","transliteration":"ittabiʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24149,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":24150,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন\"","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24151,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":24152,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24153,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"\"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":24154,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَتَّبِعُ","transliteration":"nattabiʿu","translation_bn":"আমরা অনুসরণ করবো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24155,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":24156,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَجَدْنَا","transliteration":"wajadnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পেয়েছি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24157,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24158,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآءَنَآ ۚ","transliteration":"ābāanā","translation_bn":"আমার পিতৃ-পুরুষদেরকে\"","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24160,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَوْ","transliteration":"awalaw","translation_bn":"কি যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":24161,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24162,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান (এমন যে)","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24163,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُوهُمْ","transliteration":"yadʿūhum","translation_bn":"ডেকে আসছে তাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24164,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24165,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابِ","transliteration":"ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24166,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّعِيرِ","transliteration":"l-saʿīri","translation_bn":"জ্বলন্ত আগুনের (তবুও অনুসরণ করবেই)","root":"سعر","lemma":"سَعِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24167,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā qīla lahumu ittabiʿū mā anzala l-lahu qālū bal nattabiʿu mā wajadnā ʿalayhi ābāanā awalaw kāna l-shayṭānu yadʿūhum ilā ʿadhābi l-saʿīri', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয়- আল্লাহ যা নাযিল করেছেন তা অনুসরণ কর, তখন তারা বলে- বরং আমরা তারই অনুসরণ করব আমাদের পিতৃ-পুরুষদেরকে যে পথ অনুসরণ করতে দেখেছি। শয়ত্বান যদি তাদেরকে জ্বলন্ত আগুনের শাস্তির দিকে ডাকে, তবুও কি (তারা তারই অনুসরণ করবে)?', 'And when it is said to them, "Follow what Allah has revealed," they say, "Rather, we will follow that upon which we found our fathers." Even if Satan was inviting them to the punishment of the Blaze?', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয়- আল্লাহ যা নাযিল করেছেন তা অনুসরণ কর, তখন তারা বলে- বরং আমরা তারই অনুসরণ করব আমাদের পিতৃ-পুরুষদেরকে যে পথ অনুসরণ করতে দেখেছি। শয়ত্বান যদি তাদেরকে জ্বলন্ত আগুনের শাস্তির দিকে ডাকে, তবুও কি (তারা তারই অনুসরণ করবে)?', 'And when it is said to them, "Follow what Allah has revealed," they say, "Rather, we will follow that upon which we found our fathers." Even if Satan was inviting them to the punishment of the Blaze?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031021.mp3', now()),
  (31, 22, '', '[{"id":25139,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25140,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُسْلِمْ","transliteration":"yus''lim","translation_bn":"সমর্পণ করে","root":"سلم","lemma":"أَسْلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25141,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"wajhahu","translation_bn":"চেহারাকে (নিজেকে) তার","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25142,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25143,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25144,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে সে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":25145,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُحْسِنٌۭ","transliteration":"muḥ''sinun","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মপরায়ণ","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25146,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدِ","transliteration":"faqadi","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25147,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَمْسَكَ","transliteration":"is''tamsaka","translation_bn":"সে শক্ত করে ধরেছে","root":"مسك","lemma":"ٱسْتَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25148,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْعُرْوَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ʿur''wati","translation_bn":"নিয়ে হাতলকে (অর্থাৎ আশ্রয়কে)","root":"عرو","lemma":"عُرْوَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25149,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوُثْقَىٰ ۗ","transliteration":"l-wuth''qā","translation_bn":"সুদৃঢ়","root":"وثق","lemma":"وُثْقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25151,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَى","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25152,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25153,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25154,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمُورِ","transliteration":"l-umūri","translation_bn":"সব ব্যাপারের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25155,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yus''lim wajhahu ilā l-lahi wahuwa muḥ''sinun faqadi is''tamsaka bil-ʿur''wati l-wuth''qā wa-ilā l-lahi ʿāqibatu l-umūri', 'যে কেউ আল্লাহর প্রতি আত্মসমর্পণ করে আর সে সৎকর্মশীল, সে দৃঢ়ভাবে ধারণ করে এক মজবুত হাতল। যাবতীয় কর্ম পরিণাম ফলের জন্য আল্লাহর দিকে ফিরে যায়।', 'And whoever submits his face to Allah while he is a doer of good - then he has grasped the most trustworthy handhold. And to Allah will be the outcome of [all] matters.', 'যে কেউ আল্লাহর প্রতি আত্মসমর্পণ করে আর সে সৎকর্মশীল, সে দৃঢ়ভাবে ধারণ করে এক মজবুত হাতল। যাবতীয় কর্ম পরিণাম ফলের জন্য আল্লাহর দিকে ফিরে যায়।', 'And whoever submits his face to Allah while he is a doer of good - then he has grasped the most trustworthy handhold. And to Allah will be the outcome of [all] matters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031022.mp3', now()),
  (31, 23, '', '[{"id":26246,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26247,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرَ","transliteration":"kafara","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করলো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26248,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না (যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26249,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزُنكَ","transliteration":"yaḥzunka","translation_bn":"চিন্তিত করে তোমাকে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26250,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُفْرُهُۥٓ ۚ","transliteration":"kuf''ruhu","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস তার","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26252,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ilaynā","translation_bn":"দিকে আমাদেরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26253,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَرْجِعُهُمْ","transliteration":"marjiʿuhum","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন তাদের ( হবে )","root":"رجع","lemma":"مَرْجِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26254,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَنُنَبِّئُهُم","transliteration":"fanunabbi-uhum","translation_bn":"তখন আমরা জানিয়ে দিবো তাদের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26255,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26256,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26258,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":26259,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":26260,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":26261,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِذَاتِ","transliteration":"bidhāti","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে অবস্থা","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26262,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26263,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman kafara falā yaḥzunka kuf''ruhu ilaynā marjiʿuhum fanunabbi-uhum bimā ʿamilū inna l-laha ʿalīmun bidhāti l-ṣudūri', 'কেউ কুফরী করলে তার কুফরী তোমাকে যেন মনোকষ্ট না দেয়, তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন আমার কাছেই; অতঃপর আমি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেব তারা কী করত। (মানুষের) অন্তরসমূহে কী আছে সে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহই সবচেয়ে বেশি জানেন।', 'And whoever has disbelieved - let not his disbelief grieve you. To Us is their return, and We will inform them of what they did. Indeed, Allah is Knowing of that within the breasts.', 'কেউ কুফরী করলে তার কুফরী তোমাকে যেন মনোকষ্ট না দেয়, তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন আমার কাছেই; অতঃপর আমি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেব তারা কী করত। (মানুষের) অন্তরসমূহে কী আছে সে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহই সবচেয়ে বেশি জানেন।', 'And whoever has disbelieved - let not his disbelief grieve you. To Us is their return, and We will inform them of what they did. Indeed, Allah is Knowing of that within the breasts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031023.mp3', now()),
  (31, 24, '', '[{"id":27302,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"نُمَتِّعُهُمْ","transliteration":"numattiʿuhum","translation_bn":"আমরা ভোগ করতে দিবো তাদেরকে","root":"متع","lemma":"مَّتَّعْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27303,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"অল্প (কাল)","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27304,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27305,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَضْطَرُّهُمْ","transliteration":"naḍṭarruhum","translation_bn":"আমরা বাধ্য করবো তাদেরকে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ٱضْطُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27306,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27307,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27308,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"غَلِيظٍۢ","transliteration":"ghalīẓin","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"غلظ","lemma":"غَلِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27309,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'numattiʿuhum qalīlan thumma naḍṭarruhum ilā ʿadhābin ghalīẓin', 'অল্প সময়ের জন্য তাদেরকে ভোগ করতে দেব, অবশেষে তাদেরকে গুরুতর শাস্তিতে (প্রবেশ করতে) বাধ্য করব।', 'We grant them enjoyment for a little; then We will force them to a massive punishment.', 'অল্প সময়ের জন্য তাদেরকে ভোগ করতে দেব, অবশেষে তাদেরকে গুরুতর শাস্তিতে (প্রবেশ করতে) বাধ্য করব।', 'We grant them enjoyment for a little; then We will force them to a massive punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031024.mp3', now()),
  (31, 25, '', '[{"id":28347,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28348,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَأَلْتَهُم","transliteration":"sa-altahum","translation_bn":"তুমি প্রশ্ন করো তাদের","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28349,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"\"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":28350,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28351,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশ মন্ডলী","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28352,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবী\"","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28353,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَيَقُولُنَّ","transliteration":"layaqūlunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":28354,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহ্‌\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28356,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28357,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"\"সব প্রশংসা","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28358,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌রই\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28360,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":28361,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ (লোক) তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28362,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":28363,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28364,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wala-in sa-altahum man khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa layaqūlunna l-lahu quli l-ḥamdu lillahi bal aktharuhum lā yaʿlamūna', 'যদি তুমি তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর- আকাশমন্ডলী ও যমীন কে সৃষ্টি করেছে, তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলবে- আল্লাহ। বল, যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহর, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই জানে না।', 'And if you asked them, "Who created the heavens and earth?" they would surely say, "Allah." Say, "[All] praise is [due] to Allah "; but most of them do not know.', 'যদি তুমি তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর- আকাশমন্ডলী ও যমীন কে সৃষ্টি করেছে, তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলবে- আল্লাহ। বল, যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহর, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই জানে না।', 'And if you asked them, "Who created the heavens and earth?" they would surely say, "Allah." Say, "[All] praise is [due] to Allah "; but most of them do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031025.mp3', now()),
  (31, 26, '', '[{"id":29252,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29253,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29254,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29255,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29256,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29258,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29259,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29260,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":29261,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29262,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdu","translation_bn":"প্রশংসিত","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29263,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lillahi mā fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi inna l-laha huwa l-ghaniyu l-ḥamīdu', 'আকাশমন্ডলী আর যমীনে যা আছে সব আল্লাহরই, নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ, তিনি সকল অভাব-মুক্ত, সকল প্রশংসার অধিকারী।', 'To Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. Indeed, Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', 'আকাশমন্ডলী আর যমীনে যা আছে সব আল্লাহরই, নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ, তিনি সকল অভাব-মুক্ত, সকল প্রশংসার অধিকারী।', 'To Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. Indeed, Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031026.mp3', now()),
  (31, 27, '', '[{"id":30205,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি (হয়)","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30206,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّمَا","transliteration":"annamā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30207,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30208,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30209,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30210,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَجَرَةٍ","transliteration":"shajaratin","translation_bn":"গাছ","root":"شجر","lemma":"شَجَرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30211,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَقْلَـٰمٌۭ","transliteration":"aqlāmun","translation_bn":"কলমসমূহ","root":"قلم","lemma":"قَلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30212,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَحْرُ","transliteration":"wal-baḥru","translation_bn":"এবং সমুদ্র(কালি হয়)","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30213,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَمُدُّهُۥ","transliteration":"yamudduhu","translation_bn":"বৃদ্ধি করে তাকে","root":"مدد","lemma":"مَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30214,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30215,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"পর তার","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30216,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَبْعَةُ","transliteration":"sabʿatu","translation_bn":"সাত","root":"سبع","lemma":"سَبْعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30217,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَبْحُرٍۢ","transliteration":"abḥurin","translation_bn":"সমুদ্র ( এবং রবের কথা লেখা হয় )","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30218,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তবুও) না (এবং রবের কথা লেখা হয়)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":30219,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"نَفِدَتْ","transliteration":"nafidat","translation_bn":"শেষ হবে","root":"نفد","lemma":"نَفِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30220,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَـٰتُ","transliteration":"kalimātu","translation_bn":"কথাগুলো (লেখা)","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30221,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30223,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30224,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30225,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"মহাপরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30226,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30227,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw annamā fī l-arḍi min shajaratin aqlāmun wal-baḥru yamudduhu min baʿdihi sabʿatu abḥurin mā nafidat kalimātu l-lahi inna l-laha ʿazīzun ḥakīmun', 'দুনিয়ার সব গাছ যদি কলম হয় আর সমুদ্র (কালি হয়) আর তার সাথে আরো সাত সমুদ্র যুক্ত হয়, তবুও আল্লাহর (প্রশংসার) কথা (লেখা) শেষ হবে না। আল্লাহ মহাপরাক্রমশালী, মহাপ্রজ্ঞার অধিকারী।', 'And if whatever trees upon the earth were pens and the sea [was ink], replenished thereafter by seven [more] seas, the words of Allah would not be exhausted. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise.', 'দুনিয়ার সব গাছ যদি কলম হয় আর সমুদ্র (কালি হয়) আর তার সাথে আরো সাত সমুদ্র যুক্ত হয়, তবুও আল্লাহর (প্রশংসার) কথা (লেখা) শেষ হবে না। আল্লাহ মহাপরাক্রমশালী, মহাপ্রজ্ঞার অধিকারী।', 'And if whatever trees upon the earth were pens and the sea [was ink], replenished thereafter by seven [more] seas, the words of Allah would not be exhausted. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031027.mp3', now()),
  (31, 28, '', '[{"id":31248,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31249,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَلْقُكُمْ","transliteration":"khalqukum","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি তোমাদের","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31250,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31251,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعْثُكُمْ","transliteration":"baʿthukum","translation_bn":"উত্থান তোমাদের","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعْث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31252,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":31253,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَنَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"kanafsin","translation_bn":"মতো(সৃষ্টি ও উত্থান)প্রাণীর","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31254,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدَةٍ ۗ","transliteration":"wāḥidatin","translation_bn":"একটিমাত্র","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31256,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":31257,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31258,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌۢ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"সব শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":31259,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"সব দেখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":31260,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā khalqukum walā baʿthukum illā kanafsin wāḥidatin inna l-laha samīʿun baṣīrun', 'তোমাদের সকলের সৃষ্টি ও পুনরুত্থান একজন মানুষের (সৃষ্টি ও পুনরুত্থানের) মতই। আল্লাহ সর্বশ্রোতা, সর্বদ্রষ্টা।', 'Your creation and your resurrection will not be but as that of a single soul. Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Seeing.', 'তোমাদের সকলের সৃষ্টি ও পুনরুত্থান একজন মানুষের (সৃষ্টি ও পুনরুত্থানের) মতই। আল্লাহ সর্বশ্রোতা, সর্বদ্রষ্টা।', 'Your creation and your resurrection will not be but as that of a single soul. Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Seeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031028.mp3', now()),
  (31, 29, '', '[{"id":32224,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":32225,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32226,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32227,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32228,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُولِجُ","transliteration":"yūliju","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32229,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32230,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32231,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32232,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَيُولِجُ","transliteration":"wayūliju","translation_bn":"ও প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32233,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"l-nahāra","translation_bn":"দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32234,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32235,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32236,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَسَخَّرَ","transliteration":"wasakhara","translation_bn":"এবং নিয়মাধীন করেছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32237,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","transliteration":"l-shamsa","translation_bn":"সূর্যকে","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32238,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ","transliteration":"wal-qamara","translation_bn":"ও চাঁদকে","root":"قمر","lemma":"قَمَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32239,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كُلٌّۭ","transliteration":"kullun","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেকে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32240,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَجْرِىٓ","transliteration":"yajrī","translation_bn":"চলছে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32241,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32242,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"ajalin","translation_bn":"কাল","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32243,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32244,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32245,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32246,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32247,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা করছো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32248,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32249,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara anna l-laha yūliju al-layla fī l-nahāri wayūliju l-nahāra fī al-layli wasakhara l-shamsa wal-qamara kullun yajrī ilā ajalin musamman wa-anna l-laha bimā taʿmalūna khabīrun', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে, আল্লাহ রাত্রিকে দিনে এবং দিনকে রাত্রিতে প্রবিষ্ট করেন এবং সূর্য ও চন্দ্রকে নিয়ন্ত্রণ করেন, প্রত্যেকেই বিচরণ করছে নির্দিষ্টকৃত সময় অনুযায়ী, তোমরা যা কিছু কর আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পূর্ণরূপে অবহিত।', 'Do you not see that Allah causes the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night and has subjected the sun and the moon, each running [its course] for a specified term, and that Allah, with whatever you do, is Acquainted?', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে, আল্লাহ রাত্রিকে দিনে এবং দিনকে রাত্রিতে প্রবিষ্ট করেন এবং সূর্য ও চন্দ্রকে নিয়ন্ত্রণ করেন, প্রত্যেকেই বিচরণ করছে নির্দিষ্টকৃত সময় অনুযায়ী, তোমরা যা কিছু কর আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পূর্ণরূপে অবহিত।', 'Do you not see that Allah causes the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night and has subjected the sun and the moon, each running [its course] for a specified term, and that Allah, with whatever you do, is Acquainted?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031029.mp3', now()),
  (31, 30, '', '[{"id":33061,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":33062,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّ","transliteration":"bi-anna","translation_bn":"একারণে যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33063,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33064,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":33065,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33066,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33067,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":33068,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকছে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33069,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33070,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33071,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَـٰطِلُ","transliteration":"l-bāṭilu","translation_bn":"( তা সবই )অসত্য","root":"بطل","lemma":"بَٰطِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33072,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও সত্য) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33073,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33074,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":33075,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ʿaliyu","translation_bn":"সমুন্নত","root":"علو","lemma":"عَلِيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33076,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَبِيرُ","transliteration":"l-kabīru","translation_bn":"সুমহান","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33077,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-anna l-laha huwa l-ḥaqu wa-anna mā yadʿūna min dūnihi l-bāṭilu wa-anna l-laha huwa l-ʿaliyu l-kabīru', 'এসব প্রমাণ করে যে, আল্লাহ্ই সত্য এবং তাঁর পরিবর্তে তারা যাকে ডাকে তা মিথ্যে। আল্লাহ, তিনি তো হলেন সর্বোচ্চ, সুমহান।', 'That is because Allah is the Truth, and that what they call upon other than Him is falsehood, and because Allah is the Most High, the Grand.', 'এসব প্রমাণ করে যে, আল্লাহ্ই সত্য এবং তাঁর পরিবর্তে তারা যাকে ডাকে তা মিথ্যে। আল্লাহ, তিনি তো হলেন সর্বোচ্চ, সুমহান।', 'That is because Allah is the Truth, and that what they call upon other than Him is falsehood, and because Allah is the Most High, the Grand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031030.mp3', now()),
  (31, 31, '', '[{"id":33992,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":33993,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33994,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33995,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُلْكَ","transliteration":"l-ful''ka","translation_bn":"জলযান","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33996,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"চলে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33997,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33998,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","transliteration":"l-baḥri","translation_bn":"সমুদ্রের","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33999,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِنِعْمَتِ","transliteration":"biniʿ''mati","translation_bn":"সাহায্যে অনুগ্রহের","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34000,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34001,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِيُرِيَكُم","transliteration":"liyuriyakum","translation_bn":"যেন তিনি তোমাদের দেখান","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34002,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34003,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"নির্দেশাবলী তাঁর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34005,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34006,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34007,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":34008,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":34009,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِّكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34010,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"صَبَّارٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣabbārin","translation_bn":"ধৈর্যশীলের","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَّار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34011,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"شَكُورٍۢ","transliteration":"shakūrin","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞের","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34012,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara anna l-ful''ka tajrī fī l-baḥri biniʿ''mati l-lahi liyuriyakum min āyātihi inna fī dhālika laāyātin likulli ṣabbārin shakūrin', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, নৌযানগুলো আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহে সমুদ্রে চলাচল করে যাতে তিনি তোমাদেরকে তাঁর নিদর্শনের কিছু দেখাতে পারেন। এতে অবশ্যই প্রত্যেক ধৈর্যশীল কৃতজ্ঞ ব্যক্তির জন্য নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'Do you not see that ships sail through the sea by the favor of Allah that He may show you of His signs? Indeed in that are signs for everyone patient and grateful.', 'তুমি কি লক্ষ্য কর না যে, নৌযানগুলো আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহে সমুদ্রে চলাচল করে যাতে তিনি তোমাদেরকে তাঁর নিদর্শনের কিছু দেখাতে পারেন। এতে অবশ্যই প্রত্যেক ধৈর্যশীল কৃতজ্ঞ ব্যক্তির জন্য নিদর্শন রয়েছে।', 'Do you not see that ships sail through the sea by the favor of Allah that He may show you of His signs? Indeed in that are signs for everyone patient and grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031031.mp3', now()),
  (31, 32, '', '[{"id":34957,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34958,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"غَشِيَهُم","transliteration":"ghashiyahum","translation_bn":"ঢেকে ফেলে তাদের","root":"غشو","lemma":"غَشِيَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34959,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّوْجٌۭ","transliteration":"mawjun","translation_bn":"ঢেউ","root":"موج","lemma":"مَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34960,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلظُّلَلِ","transliteration":"kal-ẓulali","translation_bn":"মতো চাঁদোয়ার","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظُلَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34961,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دَعَوُا۟","transliteration":"daʿawū","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34962,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34963,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُخْلِصِينَ","transliteration":"mukh''liṣīna","translation_bn":"বিশুদ্ধ করে","root":"خلص","lemma":"مُخْلِص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34964,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34965,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدِّينَ","transliteration":"l-dīna","translation_bn":"আনুগত্যকে","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34966,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34967,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَجَّىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"najjāhum","translation_bn":"তিনিই উদ্ধার করেন তাদেরকে","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34968,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34969,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَرِّ","transliteration":"l-bari","translation_bn":"স্থলের","root":"برر","lemma":"بَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34970,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"famin''hum","translation_bn":"তখন মধ্যে তাদের (কেউ কেউ)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34971,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّقْتَصِدٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"muq''taṣidun","translation_bn":"মধ্যম নীতি গ্রহন করে","root":"قصد","lemma":"مُّقْتَصِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34973,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34974,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَجْحَدُ","transliteration":"yajḥadu","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করে (আর কেউ)","root":"جحد","lemma":"جَحَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34975,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের নিদর্শনগুলোর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34976,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":34977,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34978,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"خَتَّارٍۢ","transliteration":"khattārin","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসঘাতক","root":"ختر","lemma":"خَتَّار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34979,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كَفُورٍۢ","transliteration":"kafūrin","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞ","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34980,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā ghashiyahum mawjun kal-ẓulali daʿawū l-laha mukh''liṣīna lahu l-dīna falammā najjāhum ilā l-bari famin''hum muq''taṣidun wamā yajḥadu biāyātinā illā kullu khattārin kafūrin', 'ঢেউ যখন তাদেরকে (মেঘের) ছায়ার মত ঢেকে নেয়, তখন তারা আল্লাহকে ডাকতে থাকে তাঁর প্রতি একনিষ্ঠ আনুগত্যে। অতঃপর আমি যখন তাদেরকে উদ্ধার ক’রে স্থলে এনে দেই, তখন তাদের কতক ন্যায়পূর্ণ আচরণ করে। কেবল মিথ্যাচারী অকৃতজ্ঞ ব্যক্তিই আমার নিদর্শনাবলী অস্বীকার করে।', 'And when waves come over them like canopies, they supplicate Allah, sincere to Him in religion. But when He delivers them to the land, there are [some] of them who are moderate [in faith]. And none rejects Our signs except everyone treacherous and ungrateful.', 'ঢেউ যখন তাদেরকে (মেঘের) ছায়ার মত ঢেকে নেয়, তখন তারা আল্লাহকে ডাকতে থাকে তাঁর প্রতি একনিষ্ঠ আনুগত্যে। অতঃপর আমি যখন তাদেরকে উদ্ধার ক’রে স্থলে এনে দেই, তখন তাদের কতক ন্যায়পূর্ণ আচরণ করে। কেবল মিথ্যাচারী অকৃতজ্ঞ ব্যক্তিই আমার নিদর্শনাবলী অস্বীকার করে।', 'And when waves come over them like canopies, they supplicate Allah, sincere to Him in religion. But when He delivers them to the land, there are [some] of them who are moderate [in faith]. And none rejects Our signs except everyone treacherous and ungrateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031032.mp3', now()),
  (31, 33, '', '[{"id":35728,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":35729,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানব সম্প্রদায়","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35730,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35731,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbakum","translation_bn":"রবকে তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35732,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱخْشَوْا۟","transliteration":"wa-ikh''shaw","translation_bn":"এবং ভয় করো","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35733,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"yawman","translation_bn":"সেই দিনকে (যখন)","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35734,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":35735,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَجْزِى","transliteration":"yajzī","translation_bn":"প্রতিদান দিবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35736,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَالِدٌ","transliteration":"wālidun","translation_bn":"কোনো পিতা","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَالِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35737,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35738,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدِهِۦ","transliteration":"waladihi","translation_bn":"সন্তানের তার","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35739,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35740,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَوْلُودٌ","transliteration":"mawlūdun","translation_bn":"কোনো সন্তান","root":"ولد","lemma":"مَوْلُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35741,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":35742,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"جَازٍ","transliteration":"jāzin","translation_bn":"প্রতিদান দাতা হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَاز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35743,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35744,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَالِدِهِۦ","transliteration":"wālidihi","translation_bn":"পিতার তার","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَالِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35745,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35747,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35748,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَ","transliteration":"waʿda","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35749,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35750,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"حَقٌّۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥaqqun","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35752,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না(যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35753,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"تَغُرَّنَّكُمُ","transliteration":"taghurrannakumu","translation_bn":"ধোঁকায় ফেলে তোমাদেরকে","root":"غرر","lemma":"غَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35754,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","translation_bn":"জীবন","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35755,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35756,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35757,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَغُرَّنَّكُم","transliteration":"yaghurrannakum","translation_bn":"ধোঁকায় ফেলে তোমাদেরকে","root":"غرر","lemma":"غَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35758,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35759,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَرُورُ","transliteration":"l-gharūru","translation_bn":"কোনো ধোঁকাবাজ (জীন , শয়তান বা মানুষ)","root":"غرر","lemma":"غَرُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35760,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu ittaqū rabbakum wa-ikh''shaw yawman lā yajzī wālidun ʿan waladihi walā mawlūdun huwa jāzin ʿan wālidihi shayan inna waʿda l-lahi ḥaqqun falā taghurrannakumu l-ḥayatu l-dun''yā walā yaghurrannakum bil-lahi l-gharūru', 'হে মানুষ! তোমাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় কর আর ভয় কর সে দিনের, যেদিন পিতা তার সন্তানের কোন উপকার করতে পারবে না। সন্তানও পিতার কোনই উপকার করতে পারবে না। আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য, কাজেই পার্থিব জীবন যেন কিছুতেই তোমাদেরকে ধোঁকায় ফেলতে না পারে আর প্রধান প্রতারক (শয়ত্বান) যেন কিছুতেই তোমাদেরকে আল্লাহ্ সম্পর্কে প্রতারিত না করে।', 'O mankind, fear your Lord and fear a Day when no father will avail his son, nor will a son avail his father at all. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth, so let not the worldly life delude you and be not deceived about Allah by the Deceiver.', 'হে মানুষ! তোমাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় কর আর ভয় কর সে দিনের, যেদিন পিতা তার সন্তানের কোন উপকার করতে পারবে না। সন্তানও পিতার কোনই উপকার করতে পারবে না। আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য, কাজেই পার্থিব জীবন যেন কিছুতেই তোমাদেরকে ধোঁকায় ফেলতে না পারে আর প্রধান প্রতারক (শয়ত্বান) যেন কিছুতেই তোমাদেরকে আল্লাহ্ সম্পর্কে প্রতারিত না করে।', 'O mankind, fear your Lord and fear a Day when no father will avail his son, nor will a son avail his father at all. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth, so let not the worldly life delude you and be not deceived about Allah by the Deceiver.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031033.mp3', now()),
  (31, 34, '', '[{"id":36663,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36664,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (এমন সত্ত্বা)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36665,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عِندَهُۥ","transliteration":"ʿindahu","translation_bn":"কাছে তাঁরই (আছে)","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":36666,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمُ","transliteration":"ʿil''mu","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36667,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36668,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيُنَزِّلُ","transliteration":"wayunazzilu","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই বর্ষণ করেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36669,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْثَ","transliteration":"l-ghaytha","translation_bn":"বৃষ্টি","root":"غيث","lemma":"غَيْث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36670,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36671,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36672,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে(আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36673,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْحَامِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-arḥāmi","translation_bn":"জরায়ুসমূহের","root":"رحم","lemma":"أَرْحَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36675,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36676,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَدْرِى","transliteration":"tadrī","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"دري","lemma":"تَدْرِى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36677,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٌۭ","transliteration":"nafsun","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রাণীই","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36678,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّاذَا","transliteration":"mādhā","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":36679,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَكْسِبُ","transliteration":"taksibu","translation_bn":"সে অর্জন করবে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36680,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"غَدًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"ghadan","translation_bn":"আগামীকাল","root":"غدو","lemma":"غَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36682,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36683,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَدْرِى","transliteration":"tadrī","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"دري","lemma":"تَدْرِى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36684,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٌۢ","transliteration":"nafsun","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রাণীই","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36685,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بِأَىِّ","transliteration":"bi-ayyi","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36686,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَرْضٍۢ","transliteration":"arḍin","translation_bn":"জমিনে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36687,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"تَمُوتُ ۚ","transliteration":"tamūtu","translation_bn":"সে মরবে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36689,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36690,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36691,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36692,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"সব বিষয়ে অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36693,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha ʿindahu ʿil''mu l-sāʿati wayunazzilu l-ghaytha wayaʿlamu mā fī l-arḥāmi wamā tadrī nafsun mādhā taksibu ghadan wamā tadrī nafsun bi-ayyi arḍin tamūtu inna l-laha ʿalīmun khabīrun', 'কিয়ামতের জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহর নিকটই আছে, তিনিই বৃষ্টি বর্ষণ করেন, জরায়ুতে কী আছে তা তিনিই জানেন। কেউ জানে না আগামীকাল সে কী অর্জন করবে, কেউ জানে না কোন্ জায়গায় সে মরবে। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সর্বাধিক অবহিত।', 'Indeed, Allah [alone] has knowledge of the Hour and sends down the rain and knows what is in the wombs. And no soul perceives what it will earn tomorrow, and no soul perceives in what land it will die. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Acquainted.', 'কিয়ামতের জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহর নিকটই আছে, তিনিই বৃষ্টি বর্ষণ করেন, জরায়ুতে কী আছে তা তিনিই জানেন। কেউ জানে না আগামীকাল সে কী অর্জন করবে, কেউ জানে না কোন্ জায়গায় সে মরবে। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সর্বাধিক অবহিত।', 'Indeed, Allah [alone] has knowledge of the Hour and sends down the rain and knows what is in the wombs. And no soul perceives what it will earn tomorrow, and no soul perceives in what land it will die. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/031034.mp3', now())
