থেকে।', 'Who perfected everything which He created and began the creation of man from clay.', 'যিনি সব কিছুকে উত্তমরূপে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, আর মানুষ সৃষ্টির সূচনা করেছেন মাটি থেকে।', 'Who perfected everything which He created and began the creation of man from clay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032007.mp3', now()),
  (32, 8, '', '[{"id":9460,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":9461,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9462,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَسْلَهُۥ","transliteration":"naslahu","translation_bn":"বংশধরকে তার","root":"نسل","lemma":"نَسْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9463,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":9464,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سُلَـٰلَةٍۢ","transliteration":"sulālatin","translation_bn":"নির্যাস","root":"سلل","lemma":"سُلَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9465,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":9466,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّآءٍۢ","transliteration":"māin","translation_bn":"পানির","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9467,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّهِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mahīnin","translation_bn":"তুচ্ছ","root":"مهن","lemma":"مَّهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":9468,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma jaʿala naslahu min sulālatin min māin mahīnin', 'অতঃপর তিনি তার বংশধর সৃষ্টি করেন তুচ্ছ তরল পদার্থের নির্যাস থেকে।', 'Then He made his posterity out of the extract of a liquid disdained.', 'অতঃপর তিনি তার বংশধর সৃষ্টি করেন তুচ্ছ তরল পদার্থের নির্যাস থেকে।', 'Then He made his posterity out of the extract of a liquid disdained.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032008.mp3', now()),
  (32, 9, '', '[{"id":10600,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10601,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَوَّىٰهُ","transliteration":"sawwāhu","translation_bn":"সুঠাম করেছেন তাকে","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10602,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَنَفَخَ","transliteration":"wanafakha","translation_bn":"ও ফুঁকে দিয়েছেন","root":"نفخ","lemma":"نَفَخَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10603,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10604,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10605,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رُّوحِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"rūḥihi","translation_bn":"রূহ তার","root":"روح","lemma":"رُوح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10607,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং দিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10608,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10609,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمْعَ","transliteration":"l-samʿa","translation_bn":"শ্রবণশক্তিসমূহ","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10610,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ","transliteration":"wal-abṣāra","translation_bn":"ও দর্শনশক্তিসমূহ","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10611,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةَ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-afidata","translation_bn":"ও অন্তরসমূহ","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10613,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"কমই","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":10614,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":10615,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashkurūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা স্বীকার করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10616,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma sawwāhu wanafakha fīhi min rūḥihi wajaʿala lakumu l-samʿa wal-abṣāra wal-afidata qalīlan mā tashkurūna', 'অতঃপর তিনি তাকে সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ করেছেন আর তার ভিতরে স্বীয় রূহ হতে ফুঁক দিয়েছেন, আর তোমাদেরকে দিয়েছেন শ্রবণেন্দ্রীয়, দর্শনেন্দ্রিয় ও অন্তঃকরণ; কৃতজ্ঞতা তোমরা সামান্যই প্রকাশ কর।', 'Then He proportioned him and breathed into him from His [created] soul and made for you hearing and vision and hearts; little are you grateful.', 'অতঃপর তিনি তাকে সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ করেছেন আর তার ভিতরে স্বীয় রূহ হতে ফুঁক দিয়েছেন, আর তোমাদেরকে দিয়েছেন শ্রবণেন্দ্রীয়, দর্শনেন্দ্রিয় ও অন্তঃকরণ; কৃতজ্ঞতা তোমরা সামান্যই প্রকাশ কর।', 'Then He proportioned him and breathed into him from His [created] soul and made for you hearing and vision and hearts; little are you grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032009.mp3', now()),
  (32, 10, '', '[{"id":11880,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11881,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَءِذَا","transliteration":"a-idhā","translation_bn":"\"কি যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":11882,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَلْنَا","transliteration":"ḍalalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা মিশে যাবো","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11883,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11884,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"মাটির","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11885,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَءِنَّا","transliteration":"a-innā","translation_bn":"কি নিশ্চয়ই আমরা (হবো)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":11886,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَفِى","transliteration":"lafī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":11887,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَلْقٍۢ","transliteration":"khalqin","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11888,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَدِيدٍۭ ۚ","transliteration":"jadīdin","translation_bn":"নতুন\"","root":"جدد","lemma":"جَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":11890,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":11891,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":11892,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِلِقَآءِ","transliteration":"biliqāi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সাক্ষাত","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11893,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11894,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকারকারী","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11895,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū a-idhā ḍalalnā fī l-arḍi a-innā lafī khalqin jadīdin bal hum biliqāi rabbihim kāfirūna', 'তারা বলে, কী! আমরা মাটিতে মিশিয়ে গেলেও কি আমাদেরকে আবার নতুন ক’রে সৃষ্টি করা হবে? বরং তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সাক্ষাৎকে অস্বীকার করে।', 'And they say, "When we are lost within the earth, will we indeed be [recreated] in a new creation?" Rather, they are, in [the matter of] the meeting with their Lord, disbelievers.', 'তারা বলে, কী! আমরা মাটিতে মিশিয়ে গেলেও কি আমাদেরকে আবার নতুন ক’রে সৃষ্টি করা হবে? বরং তারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সাক্ষাৎকে অস্বীকার করে।', 'And they say, "When we are lost within the earth, will we indeed be [recreated] in a new creation?" Rather, they are, in [the matter of] the meeting with their Lord, disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032010.mp3', now()),
  (32, 11, '', '[{"id":13187,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13188,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","transliteration":"yatawaffākum","translation_bn":"\"প্রাণ নিবে তোমাদের","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13189,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّلَكُ","transliteration":"malaku","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13190,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتِ","transliteration":"l-mawti","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুর","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13191,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":13192,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وُكِّلَ","transliteration":"wukkila","translation_bn":"নিয়োগ করা হয়েছে","root":"وكل","lemma":"وُكِّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13193,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِكُمْ","transliteration":"bikum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13194,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13195,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13196,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"রবের তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13197,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে\"","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13198,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul yatawaffākum malaku l-mawti alladhī wukkila bikum thumma ilā rabbikum tur''jaʿūna', 'বল, তোমাদের প্রাণ হরণের দায়িত্বে নিয়োজিত ফেরেশতা তোমাদের প্রাণ হরণ করবে, অতঃপর তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট তোমাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে।', 'Say, "The angel of death will take you who has been entrusted with you. Then to your Lord you will be returned."', 'বল, তোমাদের প্রাণ হরণের দায়িত্বে নিয়োজিত ফেরেশতা তোমাদের প্রাণ হরণ করবে, অতঃপর তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট তোমাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে।', 'Say, "The angel of death will take you who has been entrusted with you. Then to your Lord you will be returned."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032011.mp3', now()),
  (32, 12, '', '[{"id":14464,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14465,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"tarā","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখতে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14466,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذِ","transliteration":"idhi","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":14467,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimūna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীরা","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14468,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَاكِسُوا۟","transliteration":"nākisū","translation_bn":"অবনতকারী (হবে)","root":"نكس","lemma":"نَاكِسُوا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14469,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رُءُوسِهِمْ","transliteration":"ruūsihim","translation_bn":"মাথাসমূহ তাদের","root":"راس","lemma":"رَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14470,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":14471,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14472,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"(বলবে) হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14473,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَبْصَرْنَا","transliteration":"abṣarnā","translation_bn":"দেখেছি আমরা","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14474,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَسَمِعْنَا","transliteration":"wasamiʿ''nā","translation_bn":"ও শুনেছি আমরা","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14475,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَٱرْجِعْنَا","transliteration":"fa-ir''jiʿ''nā","translation_bn":"এখন ফেরত পাঠান আমাদের","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14476,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَعْمَلْ","transliteration":"naʿmal","translation_bn":"কাজ করবো আমরা","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14477,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14478,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":14479,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُوقِنُونَ","transliteration":"mūqinūna","translation_bn":"দৃঢ়বিশ্বাসী\"","root":"يقن","lemma":"مُّوقِنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14480,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw tarā idhi l-muj''rimūna nākisū ruūsihim ʿinda rabbihim rabbanā abṣarnā wasamiʿ''nā fa-ir''jiʿ''nā naʿmal ṣāliḥan innā mūqinūna', 'তুমি যদি দেখতে যখন অপরাধীরা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সামনে মাথা নীচু করে দাঁড়িয়ে থাকবে (আর বলবে), হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমরা দেখলাম ও শুনলাম; কাজেই আমাদেরকে আবার পাঠিয়ে দিন, আমরা ভাল কাজ করব, আমরা (এখন) দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসী।', 'If you could but see when the criminals are hanging their heads before their Lord, [saying], "Our Lord, we have seen and heard, so return us [to the world]; we will work righteousness. Indeed, we are [now] certain."', 'তুমি যদি দেখতে যখন অপরাধীরা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সামনে মাথা নীচু করে দাঁড়িয়ে থাকবে (আর বলবে), হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমরা দেখলাম ও শুনলাম; কাজেই আমাদেরকে আবার পাঠিয়ে দিন, আমরা ভাল কাজ করব, আমরা (এখন) দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসী।', 'If you could but see when the criminals are hanging their heads before their Lord, [saying], "Our Lord, we have seen and heard, so return us [to the world]; we will work righteousness. Indeed, we are [now] certain."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032012.mp3', now()),
  (32, 13, '', '[{"id":15570,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15571,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"شِئْنَا","transliteration":"shi''nā","translation_bn":"চাইতাম আমরা","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15572,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"laātaynā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই দিতাম আমরা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":15573,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15574,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তিকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15575,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُدَىٰهَا","transliteration":"hudāhā","translation_bn":"পথনির্দেশ তার","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15576,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنْ","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15577,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","translation_bn":"অবধারিত হয়েছে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15578,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","transliteration":"l-qawlu","translation_bn":"(শাস্তির)বাণী","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15579,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنِّى","transliteration":"minnī","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হ''তে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15580,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَأَمْلَأَنَّ","transliteration":"la-amla-anna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই (যে) পূর্ণ করবো আমি\"","root":"ملا","lemma":"مُلِئَتْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":15581,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামকে","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15582,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15583,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنَّةِ","transliteration":"l-jinati","translation_bn":"জিনদের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15584,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"wal-nāsi","translation_bn":"ও মানুষদের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15585,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَجْمَعِينَ","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","translation_bn":"একসাথে","root":"جمع","lemma":"أَجْمَعِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15586,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw shi''nā laātaynā kulla nafsin hudāhā walākin ḥaqqa l-qawlu minnī la-amla-anna jahannama mina l-jinati wal-nāsi ajmaʿīna', 'আমি যদি ইচ্ছে করতাম তাহলে প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তিকে সৎ পথে পরিচালিত করতাম। কিন্তু আমার (এ) কথা অবশ্যই সত্য প্রতিপন্ন হবেঃ আমি নিশ্চয়ই জাহান্নামকে জ্বিন ও মানুষ মিলিয়ে পূর্ণ করব।', 'And if We had willed, We could have given every soul its guidance, but the word from Me will come into effect [that] "I will surely fill Hell with jinn and people all together.', 'আমি যদি ইচ্ছে করতাম তাহলে প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তিকে সৎ পথে পরিচালিত করতাম। কিন্তু আমার (এ) কথা অবশ্যই সত্য প্রতিপন্ন হবেঃ আমি নিশ্চয়ই জাহান্নামকে জ্বিন ও মানুষ মিলিয়ে পূর্ণ করব।', 'And if We had willed, We could have given every soul its guidance, but the word from Me will come into effect [that] "I will surely fill Hell with jinn and people all together.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032013.mp3', now()),
  (32, 14, '', '[{"id":16631,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"fadhūqū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16632,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"একারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16633,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَسِيتُمْ","transliteration":"nasītum","translation_bn":"ভুলে গিয়েছিলে তোমরা","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16634,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِقَآءَ","transliteration":"liqāa","translation_bn":"সাক্ষাৎ","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16635,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِكُمْ","transliteration":"yawmikum","translation_bn":"দিনের তোমাদের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16636,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":16637,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরাও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":16638,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَسِينَـٰكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"nasīnākum","translation_bn":"আমরা ভুলে গিয়েছি তোমাদের","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16640,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"wadhūqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা স্বাদ গ্রহণ করো","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16641,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16642,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخُلْدِ","transliteration":"l-khul''di","translation_bn":"চিরকালীন","root":"خلد","lemma":"خُلْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16643,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16644,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16645,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা  কাজ করতে\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16646,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fadhūqū bimā nasītum liqāa yawmikum hādhā innā nasīnākum wadhūqū ʿadhāba l-khul''di bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'কাজেই (শাস্তির) স্বাদ গ্রহণ কর, কেননা এ দিনের সাক্ষাৎকে তোমরা ভুলে গিয়েছিলে, আমিও তোমাদেরকে ভুলে গেছি। তোমরা চিরস্থায়ী শাস্তি আস্বাদন করতে থাক, তোমরা যা করছিলে তার কারণে।', 'So taste [punishment] because you forgot the meeting of this, your Day; indeed, We have [accordingly] forgotten you. And taste the punishment of eternity for what you used to do."', 'কাজেই (শাস্তির) স্বাদ গ্রহণ কর, কেননা এ দিনের সাক্ষাৎকে তোমরা ভুলে গিয়েছিলে, আমিও তোমাদেরকে ভুলে গেছি। তোমরা চিরস্থায়ী শাস্তি আস্বাদন করতে থাক, তোমরা যা করছিলে তার কারণে।', 'So taste [punishment] because you forgot the meeting of this, your Day; indeed, We have [accordingly] forgotten you. And taste the punishment of eternity for what you used to do."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032014.mp3', now()),
  (32, 15, '', '[{"id":17811,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":17812,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17813,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের নিদর্শনাবলীর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17814,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই)যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17815,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":17816,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذُكِّرُوا۟","transliteration":"dhukkirū","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে স্মরণ করিয়ে দেওয়া হয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذُكِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17817,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দ্বারা এ","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17818,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَرُّوا۟","transliteration":"kharrū","translation_bn":"লুটিয়ে পড়ে","root":"خرر","lemma":"خَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17819,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سُجَّدًۭا","transliteration":"sujjadan","translation_bn":"সিজদায়","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَاجِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17820,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَسَبَّحُوا۟","transliteration":"wasabbaḥū","translation_bn":"ও পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা করে","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17821,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِحَمْدِ","transliteration":"biḥamdi","translation_bn":"সহ প্রশংসা","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17822,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17823,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17824,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":17825,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ ۩","transliteration":"yastakbirūna","translation_bn":"অহংকার করে","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17827,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā yu''minu biāyātinā alladhīna idhā dhukkirū bihā kharrū sujjadan wasabbaḥū biḥamdi rabbihim wahum lā yastakbirūna', 'আমার নিদর্শনাবলীতে কেবল তারাই বিশ্বাস করে যাদেরকে এর দ্বারা উপদেশ দেয়া হলে সিজদায় লুটিয়ে পড়ে আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের প্রশংসা সহকারে তাঁর পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা করে আর তারা অহংকার করে না।[সাজদাহ]', 'Only those believe in Our verses who, when they are reminded by them, fall down in prostration and exalt [Allah] with praise of their Lord, and they are not arrogant.', 'আমার নিদর্শনাবলীতে কেবল তারাই বিশ্বাস করে যাদেরকে এর দ্বারা উপদেশ দেয়া হলে সিজদায় লুটিয়ে পড়ে আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের প্রশংসা সহকারে তাঁর পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা করে আর তারা অহংকার করে না।[সাজদাহ]', 'Only those believe in Our verses who, when they are reminded by them, fall down in prostration and exalt [Allah] with praise of their Lord, and they are not arrogant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032015.mp3', now()),
  (32, 16, '', '[{"id":18856,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تَتَجَافَىٰ","transliteration":"tatajāfā","translation_bn":"আলাদা থাকে","root":"جفو","lemma":"تَتَجَافَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18857,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جُنُوبُهُمْ","transliteration":"junūbuhum","translation_bn":"পাশগুলো তাদের","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَنب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18858,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18859,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَضَاجِعِ","transliteration":"l-maḍājiʿi","translation_bn":"শয্যাগুলো","root":"ضجع","lemma":"مَضَاجِع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18860,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18861,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُمْ","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"রবকে তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18862,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خَوْفًۭا","transliteration":"khawfan","translation_bn":"ভয়ে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَوْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18863,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَطَمَعًۭا","transliteration":"waṭamaʿan","translation_bn":"ও আশায়","root":"طمع","lemma":"طَمَع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18864,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمِمَّا","transliteration":"wamimmā","translation_bn":"এবং তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18865,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি তাদেরকে","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18866,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُونَ","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","translation_bn":"তারা ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18867,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'tatajāfā junūbuhum ʿani l-maḍājiʿi yadʿūna rabbahum khawfan waṭamaʿan wamimmā razaqnāhum yunfiqūna', 'তারা তাদের (দেহের) পার্শ্বগুলো বিছানা থেকে আলাদা ক’রে (জাহান্নামের) ভীতি ও (জান্নাতের) আশা নিয়ে তাদের প্রতিপালককে ডাকে, আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে (আল্লাহর পথে) ব্যয় করে।', 'They arise from [their] beds; they supplicate their Lord in fear and aspiration, and from what We have provided them, they spend.', 'তারা তাদের (দেহের) পার্শ্বগুলো বিছানা থেকে আলাদা ক’রে (জাহান্নামের) ভীতি ও (জান্নাতের) আশা নিয়ে তাদের প্রতিপালককে ডাকে, আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে (আল্লাহর পথে) ব্যয় করে।', 'They arise from [their] beds; they supplicate their Lord in fear and aspiration, and from what We have provided them, they spend.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032016.mp3', now()),
  (32, 17, '', '[{"id":19947,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19948,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"taʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19949,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٌۭ","transliteration":"nafsun","translation_bn":"কোনো ব্যক্তিই","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19950,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَّآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":19951,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُخْفِىَ","transliteration":"ukh''fiya","translation_bn":"লুকিয়ে রাখা হয়েছে","root":"خفي","lemma":"أُخْفِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19952,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19953,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19954,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُرَّةِ","transliteration":"qurrati","translation_bn":"শীতলকারী (জিনিসসমূহ)","root":"قرر","lemma":"قُرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19955,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنٍۢ","transliteration":"aʿyunin","translation_bn":"চোখসমূহের","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19956,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءًۢ","transliteration":"jazāan","translation_bn":"প্রতিদান হিসেবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19957,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19958,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19959,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19960,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā taʿlamu nafsun mā ukh''fiya lahum min qurrati aʿyunin jazāan bimā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'কোন ব্যক্তিই (এখন) জানে না চোখ জুড়ানো কী (জিনিস) তাদের জন্য লুকিয়ে রাখা হয়েছে তাদের কাজের পুরস্কার হিসেবে।', 'And no soul knows what has been hidden for them of comfort for eyes as reward for what they used to do.', 'কোন ব্যক্তিই (এখন) জানে না চোখ জুড়ানো কী (জিনিস) তাদের জন্য লুকিয়ে রাখা হয়েছে তাদের কাজের পুরস্কার হিসেবে।', 'And no soul knows what has been hidden for them of comfort for eyes as reward for what they used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032017.mp3', now()),
  (32, 18, '', '[{"id":20954,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَمَن","transliteration":"afaman","translation_bn":"কি তবে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":20955,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20956,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنًۭا","transliteration":"mu''minan","translation_bn":"মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20957,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَمَن","transliteration":"kaman","translation_bn":"(সে কি তার) মতো যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20958,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20959,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَاسِقًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"fāsiqan","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী (দুষ্কৃতিকারী)","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20961,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":20962,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوُۥنَ","transliteration":"yastawūna","translation_bn":"তারা সমান হতে পারে","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20963,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaman kāna mu''minan kaman kāna fāsiqan lā yastawūna', 'তবে কি, মু’মিন ব্যক্তি পাপাচারীর ন্যায় (হতে পারে)? তারা সমান নয়।', 'Then is one who was a believer like one who was defiantly disobedient? They are not equal.', 'তবে কি, মু’মিন ব্যক্তি পাপাচারীর ন্যায় (হতে পারে)? তারা সমান নয়।', 'Then is one who was a believer like one who was defiantly disobedient? They are not equal.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032018.mp3', now()),
  (32, 19, '', '[{"id":22110,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمَّا","transliteration":"ammā","translation_bn":"(আর তাদের)ব্যাপার","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22111,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":22112,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22113,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22114,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22115,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"falahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22116,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتُ","transliteration":"jannātu","translation_bn":"জান্নাতসমূহ","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22117,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","transliteration":"l-mawā","translation_bn":"বসবাসের","root":"اوي","lemma":"مَأْوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22118,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نُزُلًۢا","transliteration":"nuzulan","translation_bn":"আপ্যায়ন হিসেবে","root":"نزل","lemma":"نُزُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22119,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22120,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22121,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22122,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ammā alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti falahum jannātu l-mawā nuzulan bimā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে তাদের বাসস্থান হবে জান্নাত, তারা যে কাজ করত তার আপ্যায়ন স্বরূপ।', 'As for those who believed and did righteous deeds, for them will be the Gardens of Refuge as accommodation for what they used to do.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে তাদের বাসস্থান হবে জান্নাত, তারা যে কাজ করত তার আপ্যায়ন স্বরূপ।', 'As for those who believed and did righteous deeds, for them will be the Gardens of Refuge as accommodation for what they used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032019.mp3', now()),
  (32, 20, '', '[{"id":23166,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا","transliteration":"wa-ammā","translation_bn":"আর(তাদের)ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23167,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":23168,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَسَقُوا۟","transliteration":"fasaqū","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগ করেছে","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَسَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23169,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"famawāhumu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বাসস্থান হবে তাদের","root":"اوي","lemma":"مَأْوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23170,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23172,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّمَآ","transliteration":"kullamā","translation_bn":"যখনই","root":"كلل\r","lemma":"كُلَّمَا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":23173,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَرَادُوٓا۟","transliteration":"arādū","translation_bn":"তারা ইচ্ছে করবে","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23174,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":23175,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","transliteration":"yakhrujū","translation_bn":"তারা বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23176,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَآ","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23177,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُعِيدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿīdū","translation_bn":"ফিরিয়ে দেওয়া হবে","root":"عود","lemma":"أُعِيدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23178,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23179,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَقِيلَ","transliteration":"waqīla","translation_bn":"এবং বলা হবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23180,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23181,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"dhūqū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23182,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23183,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23184,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":23185,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23186,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23187,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","transliteration":"tukadhibūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করতে\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23188,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ammā alladhīna fasaqū famawāhumu l-nāru kullamā arādū an yakhrujū min''hā uʿīdū fīhā waqīla lahum dhūqū ʿadhāba l-nāri alladhī kuntum bihi tukadhibūna', 'আর যারা পাপাচার করে তাদের বাসস্থান হবে জাহান্নাম। যখনই তারা তাত্থেকে বেরিয়ে আসতে চাইবে, তাদেরকে তাতেই ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হবে, আর তাদেরকে বলা হবে- তোমরা অগ্নির শাস্তি আস্বাদন কর যা তোমরা মিথ্যে ব’লে অস্বীকার করতে।', 'But as for those who defiantly disobeyed, their refuge is the Fire. Every time they wish to emerge from it, they will be returned to it while it is said to them, "Taste the punishment of the Fire which you used to deny."', 'আর যারা পাপাচার করে তাদের বাসস্থান হবে জাহান্নাম। যখনই তারা তাত্থেকে বেরিয়ে আসতে চাইবে, তাদেরকে তাতেই ফিরিয়ে দেয়া হবে, আর তাদেরকে বলা হবে- তোমরা অগ্নির শাস্তি আস্বাদন কর যা তোমরা মিথ্যে ব’লে অস্বীকার করতে।', 'But as for those who defiantly disobeyed, their refuge is the Fire. Every time they wish to emerge from it, they will be returned to it while it is said to them, "Taste the punishment of the Fire which you used to deny."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032020.mp3', now()),
  (32, 21, '', '[{"id":24204,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُم","transliteration":"walanudhīqannahum","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই আস্বাদন করাবোই আমরা তাদের","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24205,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24206,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি (দ্বারা)","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24207,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَدْنَىٰ","transliteration":"l-adnā","translation_bn":"হালকা (দুনিয়ার)","root":"دنو","lemma":"أَدْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24208,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دُونَ","transliteration":"dūna","translation_bn":"ছাড়াও","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":24209,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি (আখেরাতের)","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24210,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَكْبَرِ","transliteration":"l-akbari","translation_bn":"বড়","root":"كبر","lemma":"أَكْبَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24211,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"সম্ভবত তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":24212,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24213,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walanudhīqannahum mina l-ʿadhābi l-adnā dūna l-ʿadhābi l-akbari laʿallahum yarjiʿūna', 'গুরুতর শাস্তির আগে আমি তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই লঘু শাস্তি আস্বাদন করাবো যাতে তারা (অনুশোচনা নিয়ে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And we will surely let them taste the nearer punishment short of the greater punishment that perhaps they will repent.', 'গুরুতর শাস্তির আগে আমি তাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই লঘু শাস্তি আস্বাদন করাবো যাতে তারা (অনুশোচনা নিয়ে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And we will surely let them taste the nearer punishment short of the greater punishment that perhaps they will repent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032021.mp3', now()),
  (32, 22, '', '[{"id":25176,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25177,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَظْلَمُ","transliteration":"aẓlamu","translation_bn":"বড় সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"أَظْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25178,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّن","transliteration":"mimman","translation_bn":"(তার) চেয়ে যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25179,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ذُكِّرَ","transliteration":"dhukkira","translation_bn":"উপদেশ দেওয়া হয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذُكِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25180,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"দিয়ে নিদর্শন সমূহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25181,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِۦ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"রবের তার","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25182,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপরও","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25183,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَعْرَضَ","transliteration":"aʿraḍa","translation_bn":"সে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25184,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَآ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25186,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":25187,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25188,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদের","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25189,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُنتَقِمُونَ","transliteration":"muntaqimūna","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণকারী","root":"نقم","lemma":"مُنتَقِمُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25190,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman aẓlamu mimman dhukkira biāyāti rabbihi thumma aʿraḍa ʿanhā innā mina l-muj''rimīna muntaqimūna', 'তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে আছে যাকে তার প্রতিপালকের আয়াতসমূহ দিয়ে উপদেশ দান করা হলে সে তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়? আমি অপরাধীদেরকে শাস্তি দেব।', 'And who is more unjust than one who is reminded of the verses of his Lord; then he turns away from them? Indeed We, from the criminals, will take retribution.', 'তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে আছে যাকে তার প্রতিপালকের আয়াতসমূহ দিয়ে উপদেশ দান করা হলে সে তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়? আমি অপরাধীদেরকে শাস্তি দেব।', 'And who is more unjust than one who is reminded of the verses of his Lord; then he turns away from them? Indeed We, from the criminals, will take retribution.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032022.mp3', now()),
  (32, 23, '', '[{"id":26281,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26282,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"ātaynā","translation_bn":"দিয়েছি আমরা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26283,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَى","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":26284,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26285,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না (যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26286,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَكُن","transliteration":"takun","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ো (থাকো)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26287,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26288,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِرْيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"mir''yatin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"مري","lemma":"مِرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26289,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26290,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَآئِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"liqāihi","translation_bn":"পাওয়ার তা","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26292,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"wajaʿalnāhu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বানিয়েছিলাম তাকে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26293,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"পথনির্দেশনা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26294,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِّبَنِىٓ","transliteration":"libanī","translation_bn":"জন্যে সন্তানদের","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26295,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":26296,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ātaynā mūsā l-kitāba falā takun fī mir''yatin min liqāihi wajaʿalnāhu hudan libanī is''rāīla', 'আমি মূসাকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম, কাজেই তুমি তার (অর্থাৎ আল কুরআনের) প্রাপ্তিতে সন্দেহে পতিত হয়ো না। আমি ওটাকে বানী ইসরাঈলের জন্য পথপ্রদর্শক করেছিলাম।', 'And We certainly gave Moses the Scripture, so do not be in doubt over his meeting. And we made the Torah guidance for the Children of Israel.', 'আমি মূসাকে কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম, কাজেই তুমি তার (অর্থাৎ আল কুরআনের) প্রাপ্তিতে সন্দেহে পতিত হয়ো না। আমি ওটাকে বানী ইসরাঈলের জন্য পথপ্রদর্শক করেছিলাম।', 'And We certainly gave Moses the Scripture, so do not be in doubt over his meeting. And we made the Torah guidance for the Children of Israel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032023.mp3', now()),
  (32, 24, '', '[{"id":27319,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং মনোনীত করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27320,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্যে থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27321,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَئِمَّةًۭ","transliteration":"a-immatan","translation_bn":"(অনেক) নেতা","root":"امم","lemma":"إِمَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27322,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدُونَ","transliteration":"yahdūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) পথ দেখাতো","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27323,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْرِنَا","transliteration":"bi-amrinā","translation_bn":"অনুসারে আমাদের নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27324,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":27325,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"ṣabarū","translation_bn":"তারা ধৈর্য ধরেছিলো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27327,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27328,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের নিদর্শনগুলোর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27329,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُوقِنُونَ","transliteration":"yūqinūna","translation_bn":"দৃঢ়বিশ্বাস করতো","root":"يقن","lemma":"يُوقِنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27330,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajaʿalnā min''hum a-immatan yahdūna bi-amrinā lammā ṣabarū wakānū biāyātinā yūqinūna', 'আর আমি তাদের মধ্য হতে নেতা মনোনীত করেছিলাম যারা আমার নির্দেশ মুতাবেক সৎপথপ্রদর্শন করত যতদিন তারা ধৈর্য অবলম্বন করেছিল আর আমার আয়াতসমূহের উপর দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসী ছিল।', 'And We made from among them leaders guiding by Our command when they were patient and [when] they were certain of Our signs.', 'আর আমি তাদের মধ্য হতে নেতা মনোনীত করেছিলাম যারা আমার নির্দেশ মুতাবেক সৎপথপ্রদর্শন করত যতদিন তারা ধৈর্য অবলম্বন করেছিল আর আমার আয়াতসমূহের উপর দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসী ছিল।', 'And We made from among them leaders guiding by Our command when they were patient and [when] they were certain of Our signs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032024.mp3', now()),
  (32, 25, '', '[{"id":28365,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":28366,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28367,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":28368,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَفْصِلُ","transliteration":"yafṣilu","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা করে দিবেন","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28369,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":28370,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28371,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28372,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَا","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28373,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28374,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"বিষয়ে সে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28375,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَخْتَلِفُونَ","transliteration":"yakhtalifūna","translation_bn":"তারা মত-বিরোধ করতো","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28376,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna rabbaka huwa yafṣilu baynahum yawma l-qiyāmati fīmā kānū fīhi yakhtalifūna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক, তিনি ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তাদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা করবেন তারা যে বিষয়ে মতভেদ করত।', 'Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক, তিনি ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তাদের মধ্যে ফয়সালা করবেন তারা যে বিষয়ে মতভেদ করত।', 'Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032025.mp3', now()),
  (32, 26, '', '[{"id":29282,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"(এটাও) কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":29283,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِ","transliteration":"yahdi","translation_bn":"পথপ্রদর্শন করে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29284,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29285,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَمْ","transliteration":"kam","translation_bn":"কতই (না)","root":"—","lemma":"كَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":29286,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করেছি আমরা","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29287,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29288,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِم","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29289,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29290,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرُونِ","transliteration":"l-qurūni","translation_bn":"মানবগোষ্ঠীর","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29291,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَمْشُونَ","transliteration":"yamshūna","translation_bn":"তারা বিচরণ করে","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29292,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্য দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29293,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَسَـٰكِنِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"masākinihim","translation_bn":"বাসভূমির তাদের","root":"سكن","lemma":"مَسْكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29295,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29296,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29297,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":29298,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ ۖ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":29300,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":29301,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা শুনবে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29302,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yahdi lahum kam ahlaknā min qablihim mina l-qurūni yamshūna fī masākinihim inna fī dhālika laāyātin afalā yasmaʿūna', 'এটাও কি তাদেরকে সত্য পথ দেখায় না যে, আমি তাদের পূর্বে কত মানব বংশ ধ্বংস করেছি যাদের বাসভূমির উপর দিয়ে তারা (এখন) চলাফেরা করে? এতে অবশ্যই (আল্লাহর) নিদর্শন আছে, তবুও কি তারা শুনবে না?', 'Has it not become clear to them how many generations We destroyed before them, [as] they walk among their dwellings? Indeed in that are signs; then do they not hear?', 'এটাও কি তাদেরকে সত্য পথ দেখায় না যে, আমি তাদের পূর্বে কত মানব বংশ ধ্বংস করেছি যাদের বাসভূমির উপর দিয়ে তারা (এখন) চলাফেরা করে? এতে অবশ্যই (আল্লাহর) নিদর্শন আছে, তবুও কি তারা শুনবে না?', 'Has it not become clear to them how many generations We destroyed before them, [as] they walk among their dwellings? Indeed in that are signs; then do they not hear?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032026.mp3', now()),
  (32, 27, '', '[{"id":30249,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":30250,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30251,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّا","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"যে আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30252,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَسُوقُ","transliteration":"nasūqu","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত করি","root":"سوق","lemma":"سِيقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30253,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَآءَ","transliteration":"l-māa","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30254,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30255,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"ভূমির","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30256,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجُرُزِ","transliteration":"l-juruzi","translation_bn":"(তৃণ পানিবিহীন) ঊষর","root":"جرز","lemma":"جُرُز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30257,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَنُخْرِجُ","transliteration":"fanukh''riju","translation_bn":"এরপর বের করি আমরা","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30258,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30259,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"زَرْعًۭا","transliteration":"zarʿan","translation_bn":"শস্য","root":"زرع","lemma":"زَرْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30260,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُ","transliteration":"takulu","translation_bn":"খায়","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30261,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30262,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنْعَـٰمُهُمْ","transliteration":"anʿāmuhum","translation_bn":"গবাদি পশু তাদের","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30263,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسُهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"wa-anfusuhum","translation_bn":"এবং নিজেরাও তারা","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30265,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবুুও  না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":30266,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُبْصِرُونَ","transliteration":"yub''ṣirūna","translation_bn":"তারা লক্ষ্য করবে (বা বুঝবে)","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30267,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yaraw annā nasūqu l-māa ilā l-arḍi l-juruzi fanukh''riju bihi zarʿan takulu min''hu anʿāmuhum wa-anfusuhum afalā yub''ṣirūna', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, আমি উষর ভূমিতে পানি প্রবাহিত ক’রে তা দিয়ে শষ্য উদগত করি যাথেকে তাদের গবাদি পশু ও তারা নিজেরা খাদ্য গ্রহণ করে, তবুও কি তারা লক্ষ্য করবে না?', 'Have they not seen that We drive the water [in clouds] to barren land and bring forth thereby crops from which their livestock eat and [they] themselves? Then do they not see?', 'তারা কি লক্ষ্য করে না যে, আমি উষর ভূমিতে পানি প্রবাহিত ক’রে তা দিয়ে শষ্য উদগত করি যাথেকে তাদের গবাদি পশু ও তারা নিজেরা খাদ্য গ্রহণ করে, তবুও কি তারা লক্ষ্য করবে না?', 'Have they not seen that We drive the water [in clouds] to barren land and bring forth thereby crops from which their livestock eat and [they] themselves? Then do they not see?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032027.mp3', now()),
  (32, 28, '', '[{"id":31274,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31275,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَتَىٰ","transliteration":"matā","translation_bn":"\"কখন (আসবে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَتَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":31276,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":31277,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَتْحُ","transliteration":"l-fatḥu","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتْح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31278,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":31279,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31280,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31281,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlūna matā hādhā l-fatḥu in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'আর তারা বলেঃ তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও তাহলে বল, এ ফয়সালা কখন হবে?', 'And they say, "When will be this conquest, if you should be truthful?"', 'আর তারা বলেঃ তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও তাহলে বল, এ ফয়সালা কখন হবে?', 'And they say, "When will be this conquest, if you should be truthful?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032028.mp3', now()),
  (32, 29, '', '[{"id":32259,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32260,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"\"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32261,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَتْحِ","transliteration":"l-fatḥi","translation_bn":"মীমাংসার","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتْح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32262,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":32263,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُ","transliteration":"yanfaʿu","translation_bn":"উপকার দিবে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32264,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32265,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32266,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنُهُمْ","transliteration":"īmānuhum","translation_bn":"ঈমান তাদের","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32267,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32268,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":32269,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُنظَرُونَ","transliteration":"yunẓarūna","translation_bn":"অবকাশ দেওয়া হবে\"","root":"نظر","lemma":"يُنظَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32270,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul yawma l-fatḥi lā yanfaʿu alladhīna kafarū īmānuhum walā hum yunẓarūna', 'বল, ফয়সালার দিনে (সব কিছু দেখার পর) কাফিরদের ঈমান আনয়ন তাদের কোন উপকার দিবে না, আর তাদেরকে কোন সময়ও দেয়া হবে না।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "On the Day of Conquest the belief of those who had disbelieved will not benefit them, nor will they be reprieved."', 'বল, ফয়সালার দিনে (সব কিছু দেখার পর) কাফিরদের ঈমান আনয়ন তাদের কোন উপকার দিবে না, আর তাদেরকে কোন সময়ও দেয়া হবে না।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "On the Day of Conquest the belief of those who had disbelieved will not benefit them, nor will they be reprieved."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032029.mp3', now()),
  (32, 30, '', '[{"id":33108,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَعْرِضْ","transliteration":"fa-aʿriḍ","translation_bn":"সুতরাং (এ অবস্থায়) ছেড়ে দাও","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33109,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33110,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱنتَظِرْ","transliteration":"wa-intaẓir","translation_bn":"ও অপেক্ষা করো","root":"نظر","lemma":"يَنتَظِرُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33111,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُم","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারাও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33112,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُّنتَظِرُونَ","transliteration":"muntaẓirūna","translation_bn":"অপেক্ষাকারী","root":"نظر","lemma":"مُنتَظِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33113,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aʿriḍ ʿanhum wa-intaẓir innahum muntaẓirūna', 'কাজেই তুমি তাদেরকে এড়িয়ে চল আর (আল্লাহর ফয়সালার জন্য) অপেক্ষা কর, তারাও (সেই ফয়সালার জন্য আছে) অপেক্ষমান।', 'So turn away from them and wait. Indeed, they are waiting.', 'কাজেই তুমি তাদেরকে এড়িয়ে চল আর (আল্লাহর ফয়সালার জন্য) অপেক্ষা কর, তারাও (সেই ফয়সালার জন্য আছে) অপেক্ষমান।', 'So turn away from them and wait. Indeed, they are waiting.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/032030.mp3', now())
