transliteration":"amru","translation_bn":"আদেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38952,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38953,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"مَفْعُولًۭا","transliteration":"mafʿūlan","translation_bn":"কার্যকর","root":"فعل","lemma":"مَفْعُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38954,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh taqūlu lilladhī anʿama l-lahu ʿalayhi wa-anʿamta ʿalayhi amsik ʿalayka zawjaka wa-ittaqi l-laha watukh''fī fī nafsika mā l-lahu mub''dīhi watakhshā l-nāsa wal-lahu aḥaqqu an takhshāhu falammā qaḍā zaydun min''hā waṭaran zawwajnākahā likay lā yakūna ʿalā l-mu''minīna ḥarajun fī azwāji adʿiyāihim idhā qaḍaw min''hunna waṭaran wakāna amru l-lahi mafʿūlan', 'স্মরণ কর, আল্লাহ যাকে অনুগ্রহ করেছেন আর তুমিও যাকে অনুগ্রহ করেছ তাকে তুমি যখন বলছিলে- তুমি তোমার স্ত্রীকে (বিবাহবন্ধনে) রেখে দাও এবং আল্লাহকে ভয় কর। তুমি তোমার অন্তরে লুকিয়ে রাখছিলে যা আল্লাহ প্রকাশ করতে চান, তুমি লোকদেরকে ভয় করছিলে, অথচ আল্লাহই সবচেয়ে বেশি এ অধিকার রাখেন যে, তুমি তাঁকে ভয় করবে। অতঃপর যায়্দ যখন তার (যায়নাবের) সঙ্গে সম্পর্ক ছিন্ন করল তখন আমি তাকে তোমার সঙ্গে বিবাহবন্ধনে আবদ্ধ করে দিলাম যাতে মু’মিনদের পোষ্যপুত্ররা তাদের স্ত্রীদের সঙ্গে সম্পর্ক ছিন্ন করলে সেসব নারীকে বিবাহ করার ব্যাপারে মু’মিনদের কোন বিঘ্ন না হয়। আল্লাহর আদেশ কার্যকরী হবেই।', 'And [remember, O Muhammad], when you said to the one on whom Allah bestowed favor and you bestowed favor, "Keep your wife and fear Allah," while you concealed within yourself that which Allah is to disclose. And you feared the people, while Allah has more right that you fear Him. So when Zayd had no longer any need for her, We married her to you in order that there not be upon the believers any discomfort concerning the wives of their adopted sons when they no longer have need of them. And ever is the command of Allah accomplished.', 'স্মরণ কর, আল্লাহ যাকে অনুগ্রহ করেছেন আর তুমিও যাকে অনুগ্রহ করেছ তাকে তুমি যখন বলছিলে- তুমি তোমার স্ত্রীকে (বিবাহবন্ধনে) রেখে দাও এবং আল্লাহকে ভয় কর। তুমি তোমার অন্তরে লুকিয়ে রাখছিলে যা আল্লাহ প্রকাশ করতে চান, তুমি লোকদেরকে ভয় করছিলে, অথচ আল্লাহই সবচেয়ে বেশি এ অধিকার রাখেন যে, তুমি তাঁকে ভয় করবে। অতঃপর যায়্দ যখন তার (যায়নাবের) সঙ্গে সম্পর্ক ছিন্ন করল তখন আমি তাকে তোমার সঙ্গে বিবাহবন্ধনে আবদ্ধ করে দিলাম যাতে মু’মিনদের পোষ্যপুত্ররা তাদের স্ত্রীদের সঙ্গে সম্পর্ক ছিন্ন করলে সেসব নারীকে বিবাহ করার ব্যাপারে মু’মিনদের কোন বিঘ্ন না হয়। আল্লাহর আদেশ কার্যকরী হবেই।', 'And [remember, O Muhammad], when you said to the one on whom Allah bestowed favor and you bestowed favor, "Keep your wife and fear Allah," while you concealed within yourself that which Allah is to disclose. And you feared the people, while Allah has more right that you fear Him. So when Zayd had no longer any need for her, We married her to you in order that there not be upon the believers any discomfort concerning the wives of their adopted sons when they no longer have need of them. And ever is the command of Allah accomplished.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033037.mp3', now()),
  (33, 38, '', '[{"id":40140,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":40141,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40142,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40143,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىِّ","transliteration":"l-nabiyi","translation_bn":"নাবীর","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40144,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40145,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَرَجٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥarajin","translation_bn":"বাধা","root":"حرج","lemma":"حَرَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40146,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَا","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40147,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَرَضَ","transliteration":"faraḍa","translation_bn":"বিধিসম্মত করেছেন","root":"فرض","lemma":"فَرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40148,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40149,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40151,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سُنَّةَ","transliteration":"sunnata","translation_bn":"নীতি (ছিলো)","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40152,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40153,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(তাদের) ক্ষেত্রেও","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40154,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40155,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَلَوْا۟","transliteration":"khalaw","translation_bn":"অতীত হয়েছে","root":"خلو","lemma":"خَلَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40156,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40157,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۚ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40159,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40160,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُ","transliteration":"amru","translation_bn":"বিধান","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40161,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40162,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"قَدَرًۭا","transliteration":"qadaran","translation_bn":"সুনির্ধারিত","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40163,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَّقْدُورًا","transliteration":"maqdūran","translation_bn":"অবশ্যম্ভাবী","root":"قدر","lemma":"مَّقْدُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40164,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā kāna ʿalā l-nabiyi min ḥarajin fīmā faraḍa l-lahu lahu sunnata l-lahi fī alladhīna khalaw min qablu wakāna amru l-lahi qadaran maqdūran', 'আল্লাহ নবীর জন্য যা বিধিবদ্ধ করেছেন তার জন্য তা করতে কোন বাধা নেই। পূর্বে যারা অতীত হয়ে গেছে তাদের ক্ষেত্রেও এটাই ছিল আল্লাহর বিধান। আল্লাহর বিধান সুনির্ধারণে নির্ধারিত।', 'There is not to be upon the Prophet any discomfort concerning that which Allah has imposed upon him. [This is] the established way of Allah with those [prophets] who have passed on before. And ever is the command of Allah a destiny decreed.', 'আল্লাহ নবীর জন্য যা বিধিবদ্ধ করেছেন তার জন্য তা করতে কোন বাধা নেই। পূর্বে যারা অতীত হয়ে গেছে তাদের ক্ষেত্রেও এটাই ছিল আল্লাহর বিধান। আল্লাহর বিধান সুনির্ধারণে নির্ধারিত।', 'There is not to be upon the Prophet any discomfort concerning that which Allah has imposed upon him. [This is] the established way of Allah with those [prophets] who have passed on before. And ever is the command of Allah a destiny decreed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033038.mp3', now()),
  (33, 39, '', '[{"id":40562,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40563,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُبَلِّغُونَ","transliteration":"yuballighūna","translation_bn":"পৌঁছায়","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَّغْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40564,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رِسَـٰلَـٰتِ","transliteration":"risālāti","translation_bn":"বাণীসমূহ","root":"رسل","lemma":"رِسَٰلَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40565,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40566,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَخْشَوْنَهُۥ","transliteration":"wayakhshawnahu","translation_bn":"ও তারা ভয় করে তাঁকে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40567,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40568,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَخْشَوْنَ","transliteration":"yakhshawna","translation_bn":"তারা ভয় করে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40569,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدًا","transliteration":"aḥadan","translation_bn":"কাউকেও","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40570,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":40571,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۗ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40573,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَكَفَىٰ","transliteration":"wakafā","translation_bn":"এবং যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40574,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40575,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَسِيبًۭا","transliteration":"ḥasīban","translation_bn":"হিসাব গ্রহণকারীরূপে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":40576,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna yuballighūna risālāti l-lahi wayakhshawnahu walā yakhshawna aḥadan illā l-laha wakafā bil-lahi ḥasīban', 'তারা (নবীগণ) আল্লাহর বাণী প্রচার করত আর তাঁকে ভয় করত। আল্লাহ ছাড়া কাউকে তারা ভয় করত না। (মানুষদের) হিসাব গ্রহণে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট।', '[Allah praises] those who convey the messages of Allah and fear Him and do not fear anyone but Allah. And sufficient is Allah as Accountant.', 'তারা (নবীগণ) আল্লাহর বাণী প্রচার করত আর তাঁকে ভয় করত। আল্লাহ ছাড়া কাউকে তারা ভয় করত না। (মানুষদের) হিসাব গ্রহণে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট।', '[Allah praises] those who convey the messages of Allah and fear Him and do not fear anyone but Allah. And sufficient is Allah as Accountant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033039.mp3', now()),
  (33, 40, '', '[{"id":41776,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":41777,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41778,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُحَمَّدٌ","transliteration":"muḥammadun","translation_bn":"মুহাম্মাদ","root":"—","lemma":"مُحَمَّد","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41779,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَبَآ","transliteration":"abā","translation_bn":"পিতা","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41780,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٍۢ","transliteration":"aḥadin","translation_bn":"কারো","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41781,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যেকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41782,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رِّجَالِكُمْ","transliteration":"rijālikum","translation_bn":"পুরুষদের তোমাদের","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41783,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41784,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّسُولَ","transliteration":"rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41785,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41786,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَخَاتَمَ","transliteration":"wakhātama","translation_bn":"সর্বশেষ (সমাপ্তির ও সিলমোহর)","root":"ختم","lemma":"خَاتَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41787,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ ۗ","transliteration":"l-nabiyīna","translation_bn":"নাবীদের (আগমনের)","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41789,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41790,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41791,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41792,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41793,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿalīman","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":41794,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā kāna muḥammadun abā aḥadin min rijālikum walākin rasūla l-lahi wakhātama l-nabiyīna wakāna l-lahu bikulli shayin ʿalīman', 'মুহাম্মাদ (সাঃ) তোমাদের মধ্যেকার কোন পুরুষের পিতা নয়, কিন্তু (সে) আল্লাহর রাসূল এবং শেষ নবী। আল্লাহ সর্ববিষয়ে সর্বজ্ঞাতা।', 'Muhammad is not the father of [any] one of your men, but [he is] the Messenger of Allah and last of the prophets. And ever is Allah, of all things, Knowing.', 'মুহাম্মাদ (সাঃ) তোমাদের মধ্যেকার কোন পুরুষের পিতা নয়, কিন্তু (সে) আল্লাহর রাসূল এবং শেষ নবী। আল্লাহ সর্ববিষয়ে সর্বজ্ঞাতা।', 'Muhammad is not the father of [any] one of your men, but [he is] the Messenger of Allah and last of the prophets. And ever is Allah, of all things, Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033040.mp3', now()),
  (33, 41, '', '[{"id":41959,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":41960,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41961,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41962,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱذْكُرُوا۟","transliteration":"udh''kurū","translation_bn":"তোমরা স্মরণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41963,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41964,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرًۭا","transliteration":"dhik''ran","translation_bn":"স্মরণ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41965,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অধিক","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":41966,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū udh''kurū l-laha dhik''ran kathīran', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে বেশি বেশি স্মরণ কর।', 'O you who have believed, remember Allah with much remembrance', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে বেশি বেশি স্মরণ কর।', 'O you who have believed, remember Allah with much remembrance', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033041.mp3', now()),
  (33, 42, '', '[{"id":43253,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَسَبِّحُوهُ","transliteration":"wasabbiḥūhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁর পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা করো","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43254,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بُكْرَةًۭ","transliteration":"buk''ratan","translation_bn":"সকালে","root":"بكر","lemma":"بُكْرَة","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":43255,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصِيلًا","transliteration":"wa-aṣīlan","translation_bn":"ও সন্ধ্যায়","root":"اصل","lemma":"أَصِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43256,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wasabbiḥūhu buk''ratan wa-aṣīlan', 'আর সকাল-সন্ধ্যায় তাঁর পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা কর।', 'And exalt Him morning and afternoon.', 'আর সকাল-সন্ধ্যায় তাঁর পবিত্রতা ও মহিমা ঘোষণা কর।', 'And exalt Him morning and afternoon.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033042.mp3', now()),
  (33, 43, '', '[{"id":43991,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":43992,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43993,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُصَلِّى","transliteration":"yuṣallī","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ করেন","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43994,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43995,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَلَـٰٓئِكَتُهُۥ","transliteration":"wamalāikatuhu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতাগণ তাঁর(দোয়া করে)","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43996,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِيُخْرِجَكُم","transliteration":"liyukh''rijakum","translation_bn":"যেন তিনি বের করেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43997,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43998,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারসমূহ","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43999,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44000,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّورِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nūri","translation_bn":"আলোর","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44002,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44003,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"bil-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"প্রতি মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44004,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَحِيمًۭا","transliteration":"raḥīman","translation_bn":"বড় অনুগ্রহশীল","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":44005,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī yuṣallī ʿalaykum wamalāikatuhu liyukh''rijakum mina l-ẓulumāti ilā l-nūri wakāna bil-mu''minīna raḥīman', 'তিনি তোমাদের প্রতি তাঁর অনুগ্রহ বর্ষণ করেন, আর তাঁর ফেরেশতারাও (তোমাদের জন্য) তাঁর অনুগ্রহ প্রার্থনা করে তোমাদেরকে অন্ধকার থেকে বের করে আলোতে আনার জন্যে। মু’মিনদের প্রতি তিনি পরম দয়ালু।', 'It is He who confers blessing upon you, and His angels [ask Him to do so] that He may bring you out from darknesses into the light. And ever is He, to the believers, Merciful.', 'তিনি তোমাদের প্রতি তাঁর অনুগ্রহ বর্ষণ করেন, আর তাঁর ফেরেশতারাও (তোমাদের জন্য) তাঁর অনুগ্রহ প্রার্থনা করে তোমাদেরকে অন্ধকার থেকে বের করে আলোতে আনার জন্যে। মু’মিনদের প্রতি তিনি পরম দয়ালু।', 'It is He who confers blessing upon you, and His angels [ask Him to do so] that He may bring you out from darknesses into the light. And ever is He, to the believers, Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033043.mp3', now()),
  (33, 44, '', '[{"id":44778,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تَحِيَّتُهُمْ","transliteration":"taḥiyyatuhum","translation_bn":"অভিবাদন (হবে)তাদের যেদিন","root":"حيي","lemma":"تَحِيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44779,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যে দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44780,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","transliteration":"yalqawnahu","translation_bn":"তারা সাক্ষাৎ করবে তাঁর সাথে","root":"لقي","lemma":"لَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44781,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"salāmun","translation_bn":"সালাম (দিয়ে)\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44783,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعَدَّ","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","translation_bn":"এবং প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44784,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44785,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرًۭا","transliteration":"ajran","translation_bn":"কর্মফল","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44786,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَرِيمًۭا","transliteration":"karīman","translation_bn":"সম্মানজনক","root":"كرم","lemma":"كَرِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":44787,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'taḥiyyatuhum yawma yalqawnahu salāmun wa-aʿadda lahum ajran karīman', 'যেদিন তারা আল্লাহর সাথে সাক্ষাৎ করবে সেদিন তাদের অভিবাদন হবে ‘সালাম’। তিনি তাদের জন্য প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন সম্মানজনক প্রতিদান।', 'Their greeting the Day they meet Him will be, "Peace." And He has prepared for them a noble reward.', 'যেদিন তারা আল্লাহর সাথে সাক্ষাৎ করবে সেদিন তাদের অভিবাদন হবে ‘সালাম’। তিনি তাদের জন্য প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন সম্মানজনক প্রতিদান।', 'Their greeting the Day they meet Him will be, "Peace." And He has prepared for them a noble reward.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033044.mp3', now()),
  (33, 45, '', '[{"id":45161,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":45162,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","translation_bn":"নাবী","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45163,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّآ","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45164,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","transliteration":"arsalnāka","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি তোমাকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45165,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَـٰهِدًۭا","transliteration":"shāhidan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষীরূপে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَاهِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45166,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمُبَشِّرًۭا","transliteration":"wamubashiran","translation_bn":"এবং সুসংবাদদাতা","root":"بشر","lemma":"مُبَشِّر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45167,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَنَذِيرًۭا","transliteration":"wanadhīran","translation_bn":"ও সতর্ককারী হিসেবে","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45168,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nabiyu innā arsalnāka shāhidan wamubashiran wanadhīran', 'হে নবী (সা.)! আমি তোমাকে পাঠিয়েছি (যুগে যুগে প্রেরিত নবী রসূলগণ যে তাঁদের উম্মাতের কাছে আল্লাহর বাণী পৌঁছে দিয়েছেন- এ কথার) সাক্ষীস্বরূপ এবং সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারীরূপে,', 'O Prophet, indeed We have sent you as a witness and a bringer of good tidings and a warner.', 'হে নবী (সা.)! আমি তোমাকে পাঠিয়েছি (যুগে যুগে প্রেরিত নবী রসূলগণ যে তাঁদের উম্মাতের কাছে আল্লাহর বাণী পৌঁছে দিয়েছেন- এ কথার) সাক্ষীস্বরূপ এবং সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারীরূপে,', 'O Prophet, indeed We have sent you as a witness and a bringer of good tidings and a warner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033045.mp3', now()),
  (33, 46, '', '[{"id":46214,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَدَاعِيًا","transliteration":"wadāʿiyan","translation_bn":"এবং আহবানকারীরূপে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَاعِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46215,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46216,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46217,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِهِۦ","transliteration":"bi-idh''nihi","translation_bn":"অনুসারে অনুমতি তাঁর","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46218,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَسِرَاجًۭا","transliteration":"wasirājan","translation_bn":"ও প্রদীপস্বরূপ","root":"سرج","lemma":"سِرَاج","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46219,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُّنِيرًۭا","transliteration":"munīran","translation_bn":"উজ্জ্বল","root":"نور","lemma":"مُّنِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46220,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wadāʿiyan ilā l-lahi bi-idh''nihi wasirājan munīran', 'আর আল্লাহর অনুমতিক্রমে তাঁর পথে আহবানকারী ও আলোকপ্রদ প্রদীপরূপে।', 'And one who invites to Allah, by His permission, and an illuminating lamp.', 'আর আল্লাহর অনুমতিক্রমে তাঁর পথে আহবানকারী ও আলোকপ্রদ প্রদীপরূপে।', 'And one who invites to Allah, by His permission, and an illuminating lamp.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033046.mp3', now()),
  (33, 47, '', '[{"id":46843,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَبَشِّرِ","transliteration":"wabashiri","translation_bn":"এবং সুসংবাদ দাও","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشِّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46844,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46845,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّ","transliteration":"bi-anna","translation_bn":"যে অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46846,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে (আছে)তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46847,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46848,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46849,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلًۭا","transliteration":"faḍlan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্র্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46850,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kabīran","translation_bn":"বিরাট","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":46851,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wabashiri l-mu''minīna bi-anna lahum mina l-lahi faḍlan kabīran', 'তুমি মু’মিনদেরকে সুসংবাদ দাও যে, তাদের জন্য আল্লাহর নিকট আছে বিশাল অনুগ্রহ।', 'And give good tidings to the believers that they will have from Allah great bounty.', 'তুমি মু’মিনদেরকে সুসংবাদ দাও যে, তাদের জন্য আল্লাহর নিকট আছে বিশাল অনুগ্রহ।', 'And give good tidings to the believers that they will have from Allah great bounty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033047.mp3', now()),
  (33, 48, '', '[{"id":47620,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47621,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُطِعِ","transliteration":"tuṭiʿi","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47622,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47623,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","transliteration":"wal-munāfiqīna","translation_bn":"ও মুনাফিকদের","root":"نفق","lemma":"مُنَٰفِقُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47624,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَدَعْ","transliteration":"wadaʿ","translation_bn":"এবং উপেক্ষা করো","root":"ودع","lemma":"دَعْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47625,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَذَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"adhāhum","translation_bn":"নির্যাতনকে তাদের","root":"اذي","lemma":"أَذًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47626,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَوَكَّلْ","transliteration":"watawakkal","translation_bn":"এবং নির্ভর করো","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47627,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47628,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47630,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَكَفَىٰ","transliteration":"wakafā","translation_bn":"এবং যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47631,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47632,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكِيلًۭا","transliteration":"wakīlan","translation_bn":"কর্মবিধায়ক হিসেবে","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47633,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tuṭiʿi l-kāfirīna wal-munāfiqīna wadaʿ adhāhum watawakkal ʿalā l-lahi wakafā bil-lahi wakīlan', 'তুমি কাফির ও মুনাফিকদের কথা মান্য করো না। তাদের যন্ত্রণাকে মনে স্থান দিও না, আর নির্ভর কর আল্লাহর উপর, কার্যনির্বাহীরূপে আল্লাহ্ই যথেষ্ট।', 'And do not obey the disbelievers and the hypocrites but do not harm them, and rely upon Allah. And sufficient is Allah as Disposer of affairs.', 'তুমি কাফির ও মুনাফিকদের কথা মান্য করো না। তাদের যন্ত্রণাকে মনে স্থান দিও না, আর নির্ভর কর আল্লাহর উপর, কার্যনির্বাহীরূপে আল্লাহ্ই যথেষ্ট।', 'And do not obey the disbelievers and the hypocrites but do not harm them, and rely upon Allah. And sufficient is Allah as Disposer of affairs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033048.mp3', now()),
  (33, 49, '', '[{"id":47845,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":47846,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47847,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47848,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":47849,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَكَحْتُمُ","transliteration":"nakaḥtumu","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিয়ে করবে","root":"نكح","lemma":"نَكَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47850,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-mu''mināti","translation_bn":"মু’মিন নারীদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47851,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47852,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"طَلَّقْتُمُوهُنَّ","transliteration":"ṭallaqtumūhunna","translation_bn":"তালাক দিবে তাদেরকে","root":"طلق","lemma":"طَلَّقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47853,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে (এর)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47854,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্বই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47855,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":47856,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَمَسُّوهُنَّ","transliteration":"tamassūhunna","translation_bn":"তোমরা স্পর্শ করেছো তাদেরকে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47857,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"তখন নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47858,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47859,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47860,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47861,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عِدَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿiddatin","translation_bn":"ইদ্দত পালন","root":"عدد","lemma":"عِدَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47862,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَعْتَدُّونَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"taʿtaddūnahā","translation_bn":"তোমরা গণনা করে থাকো যা","root":"عدد","lemma":"تَعْتَدُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47864,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَمَتِّعُوهُنَّ","transliteration":"famattiʿūhunna","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা ভোগ্যসামগ্রী দাও (কিছু) তাদেরকে","root":"متع","lemma":"مَّتَّعْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47865,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَسَرِّحُوهُنَّ","transliteration":"wasarriḥūhunna","translation_bn":"এবং  বিদায় দাও তাদের","root":"سرح","lemma":"سَرِّحُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47866,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"سَرَاحًۭا","transliteration":"sarāḥan","translation_bn":"বিদায়","root":"سرح","lemma":"سَرَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47867,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيلًۭا","transliteration":"jamīlan","translation_bn":"সৌজন্যের সাথে","root":"جمل","lemma":"جَمِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":47868,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū idhā nakaḥtumu l-mu''mināti thumma ṭallaqtumūhunna min qabli an tamassūhunna famā lakum ʿalayhinna min ʿiddatin taʿtaddūnahā famattiʿūhunna wasarriḥūhunna sarāḥan jamīlan', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা যখন কোন মু’মিন নারীকে বিবাহ কর, অতঃপর তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করার পূর্বেই তাদেরকে তালাক দাও, তখন তাদের জন্য তোমাদেরকে কোন ইদ্দত পালন করতে হবে না যা তোমরা (অন্যক্ষেত্রের তালাকে) গণনা করে থাক। কাজেই কিছু সামগ্রী তাদেরকে দাও আর তাদেরকে বিদায় দাও উত্তম বিদায়ে।', 'O You who have believed, when you marry believing women and then divorce them before you have touched them, then there is not for you any waiting period to count concerning them. So provide for them and give them a gracious release.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা যখন কোন মু’মিন নারীকে বিবাহ কর, অতঃপর তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করার পূর্বেই তাদেরকে তালাক দাও, তখন তাদের জন্য তোমাদেরকে কোন ইদ্দত পালন করতে হবে না যা তোমরা (অন্যক্ষেত্রের তালাকে) গণনা করে থাক। কাজেই কিছু সামগ্রী তাদেরকে দাও আর তাদেরকে বিদায় দাও উত্তম বিদায়ে।', 'O You who have believed, when you marry believing women and then divorce them before you have touched them, then there is not for you any waiting period to count concerning them. So provide for them and give them a gracious release.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033049.mp3', now()),
