َكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"আর হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48611,"position":59,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48612,"position":60,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48613,"position":61,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمًۭا","transliteration":"raḥīman","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48614,"position":62,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nabiyu innā aḥlalnā laka azwājaka allātī ātayta ujūrahunna wamā malakat yamīnuka mimmā afāa l-lahu ʿalayka wabanāti ʿammika wabanāti ʿammātika wabanāti khālika wabanāti khālātika allātī hājarna maʿaka wa-im''ra-atan mu''minatan in wahabat nafsahā lilnnabiyyi in arāda l-nabiyu an yastankiḥahā khāliṣatan laka min dūni l-mu''minīna qad ʿalim''nā mā faraḍnā ʿalayhim fī azwājihim wamā malakat aymānuhum likaylā yakūna ʿalayka ḥarajun wakāna l-lahu ghafūran raḥīman', 'হে নবী (সা.)! আমি তোমার জন্য বৈধ করেছি তোমার স্ত্রীগণকে যাদের মোহরানা তুমি প্রদান করেছ; আর বৈধ করেছি আল্লাহ ফায় (বিনা যুদ্ধে লব্ধ) হিসেবে তোমাকে যা দান করেছেন তার মধ্য হতে যারা তোমার মালিকানাধীন হয়েছে তাদেরকে, আর তোমার চাচার কন্যা ও ফুফুর কন্যাকে, তোমার মামার কন্যা ও তোমার খালার কন্যাকে যারা তোমার সঙ্গে হিজরাত করেছে। আর কোন মু’মিন নারী যদি নবীর নিকট নিজেকে নিবেদন করে আর নবী যদি তাকে বিয়ে করতে চায় সেও বৈধ, এটা মু’মিনদের বাদ দিয়ে বিশেষভাবে তোমার জন্য যাতে তোমার কোন অসুবিধে না হয়। মু’মিনগণের জন্য তাদের স্ত্রী ও দাসীদের ব্যাপারে যা নির্ধারিত করেছি আমার তা জানা আছে। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'O Prophet, indeed We have made lawful to you your wives to whom you have given their due compensation and those your right hand possesses from what Allah has returned to you [of captives] and the daughters of your paternal uncles and the daughters of your paternal aunts and the daughters of your maternal uncles and the daughters of your maternal aunts who emigrated with you and a believing woman if she gives herself to the Prophet [and] if the Prophet wishes to marry her, [this is] only for you, excluding the [other] believers. We certainly know what We have made obligatory upon them concerning their wives and those their right hands possess, [but this is for you] in order that there will be upon you no discomfort. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', 'হে নবী (সা.)! আমি তোমার জন্য বৈধ করেছি তোমার স্ত্রীগণকে যাদের মোহরানা তুমি প্রদান করেছ; আর বৈধ করেছি আল্লাহ ফায় (বিনা যুদ্ধে লব্ধ) হিসেবে তোমাকে যা দান করেছেন তার মধ্য হতে যারা তোমার মালিকানাধীন হয়েছে তাদেরকে, আর তোমার চাচার কন্যা ও ফুফুর কন্যাকে, তোমার মামার কন্যা ও তোমার খালার কন্যাকে যারা তোমার সঙ্গে হিজরাত করেছে। আর কোন মু’মিন নারী যদি নবীর নিকট নিজেকে নিবেদন করে আর নবী যদি তাকে বিয়ে করতে চায় সেও বৈধ, এটা মু’মিনদের বাদ দিয়ে বিশেষভাবে তোমার জন্য যাতে তোমার কোন অসুবিধে না হয়। মু’মিনগণের জন্য তাদের স্ত্রী ও দাসীদের ব্যাপারে যা নির্ধারিত করেছি আমার তা জানা আছে। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'O Prophet, indeed We have made lawful to you your wives to whom you have given their due compensation and those your right hand possesses from what Allah has returned to you [of captives] and the daughters of your paternal uncles and the daughters of your paternal aunts and the daughters of your maternal uncles and the daughters of your maternal aunts who emigrated with you and a believing woman if she gives herself to the Prophet [and] if the Prophet wishes to marry her, [this is] only for you, excluding the [other] believers. We certainly know what We have made obligatory upon them concerning their wives and those their right hands possess, [but this is for you] in order that there will be upon you no discomfort. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033050.mp3', now()),
  (33, 51, '', '[{"id":49493,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ تُرْجِى","transliteration":"tur''jī","translation_bn":"দূরে রাখতে পারো","root":"رجو","lemma":"تُرْجِى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49494,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49495,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَشَآءُ","transliteration":"tashāu","translation_bn":"তুমি চাও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49496,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُنَّ","transliteration":"min''hunna","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে তাদের(অর্থাৎ স্ত্রীদের)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49497,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَتُـْٔوِىٓ","transliteration":"watu''wī","translation_bn":"এবং স্থান দিতে পারো","root":"اوي","lemma":"ءَاوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49498,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49499,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49500,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَشَآءُ ۖ","transliteration":"tashāu","translation_bn":"তুমি চাও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49502,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنِ","transliteration":"wamani","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49503,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْتَغَيْتَ","transliteration":"ib''taghayta","translation_bn":"তুমি কামনা করো","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49504,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّنْ","transliteration":"mimman","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যে থেকে (যাকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49505,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَزَلْتَ","transliteration":"ʿazalta","translation_bn":"তুমি দূরে রেখেছিলে","root":"عزل","lemma":"عَزَلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49506,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"এক্ষেত্রে নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49507,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جُنَاحَ","transliteration":"junāḥa","translation_bn":"কোনো পাপ","root":"جنح","lemma":"جُنَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49508,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"উপর তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49510,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":49511,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَدْنَىٰٓ","transliteration":"adnā","translation_bn":"অধিক নিকটবর্তী","root":"دنو","lemma":"أَدْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49512,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":49513,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَقَرَّ","transliteration":"taqarra","translation_bn":"শীতল হবে","root":"قرر","lemma":"تَقَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49514,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنُهُنَّ","transliteration":"aʿyunuhunna","translation_bn":"চোখগুলো তাদের","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49515,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49516,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزَنَّ","transliteration":"yaḥzanna","translation_bn":"দুঃখ পাবে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49517,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَيَرْضَيْنَ","transliteration":"wayarḍayna","translation_bn":"এবং সন্তুষ্ট থাকবে","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49518,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49519,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْتَهُنَّ","transliteration":"ātaytahunna","translation_bn":"তুমি দিয়েছো তাদেরকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49520,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّهُنَّ ۚ","transliteration":"kulluhunna","translation_bn":"সকলে তাদের","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49522,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49523,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49524,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49525,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49526,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"qulūbikum","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের তোমাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49528,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49529,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49530,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمًا","transliteration":"ʿalīman","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49531,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"حَلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥalīman","translation_bn":"সহনশীল","root":"حلم","lemma":"حَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49532,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'tur''jī man tashāu min''hunna watu''wī ilayka man tashāu wamani ib''taghayta mimman ʿazalta falā junāḥa ʿalayka dhālika adnā an taqarra aʿyunuhunna walā yaḥzanna wayarḍayna bimā ātaytahunna kulluhunna wal-lahu yaʿlamu mā fī qulūbikum wakāna l-lahu ʿalīman ḥalīman', 'তুমি তাদের যাকে ইচ্ছে সরিয়ে রাখতে পার, আর যাকে ইচ্ছে তোমার কাছে আশ্রয় দিতে পার। আর তুমি যাকে আলাদা ক’রে রেখেছ তাকে কামনা করলে তোমার কোন অপরাধ নেই। এতে অধিক সম্ভাবনা আছে যে, তাদের চক্ষু শীতল থাকবে, তারা দুঃখ পাবে না, আর তুমি তাদের সকলকে যা দাও তাতে তারা সন্তুষ্ট থাকবে। তোমাদের অন্তরে যা আছে আল্লাহ তা জানেন। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সহনশীল।', 'You, [O Muhammad], may put aside whom you will of them or take to yourself whom you will. And any that you desire of those [wives] from whom you had [temporarily] separated - there is no blame upon you [in returning her]. That is more suitable that they should be content and not grieve and that they should be satisfied with what you have given them - all of them. And Allah knows what is in your hearts. And ever is Allah Knowing and Forbearing.', 'তুমি তাদের যাকে ইচ্ছে সরিয়ে রাখতে পার, আর যাকে ইচ্ছে তোমার কাছে আশ্রয় দিতে পার। আর তুমি যাকে আলাদা ক’রে রেখেছ তাকে কামনা করলে তোমার কোন অপরাধ নেই। এতে অধিক সম্ভাবনা আছে যে, তাদের চক্ষু শীতল থাকবে, তারা দুঃখ পাবে না, আর তুমি তাদের সকলকে যা দাও তাতে তারা সন্তুষ্ট থাকবে। তোমাদের অন্তরে যা আছে আল্লাহ তা জানেন। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সহনশীল।', 'You, [O Muhammad], may put aside whom you will of them or take to yourself whom you will. And any that you desire of those [wives] from whom you had [temporarily] separated - there is no blame upon you [in returning her]. That is more suitable that they should be content and not grieve and that they should be satisfied with what you have given them - all of them. And Allah knows what is in your hearts. And ever is Allah Knowing and Forbearing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033051.mp3', now()),
  (33, 52, '', '[{"id":50211,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":50212,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحِلُّ","transliteration":"yaḥillu","translation_bn":"বৈধ","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50213,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50214,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنِّسَآءُ","transliteration":"l-nisāu","translation_bn":"(অন্য) মহিলারা","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50215,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50216,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدُ","transliteration":"baʿdu","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50217,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না (এটাও)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50218,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":50219,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَبَدَّلَ","transliteration":"tabaddala","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তন করবে তুমি","root":"بدل","lemma":"يَتَبَدَّلِ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50220,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِنَّ","transliteration":"bihinna","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে তাদের (কাউকে)","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِنَّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50221,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50222,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجٍۢ","transliteration":"azwājin","translation_bn":"(তোমার) স্ত্রীদের","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50223,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50224,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَعْجَبَكَ","transliteration":"aʿjabaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে মুগ্ধ করে","root":"عجب","lemma":"أَعْجَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50225,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حُسْنُهُنَّ","transliteration":"ḥus''nuhunna","translation_bn":"সৌন্দর্য তাদের","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50226,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"(তবে) ব্যতিক্রম","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":50227,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50228,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَلَكَتْ","transliteration":"malakat","translation_bn":"মালিক হয়েছে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50229,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَمِينُكَ ۗ","transliteration":"yamīnuka","translation_bn":"ডানহাত তোমার (অর্থাৎ দাসী)","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50231,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50232,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50233,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপরে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50234,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50235,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50236,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"رَّقِيبًۭا","transliteration":"raqīban","translation_bn":"সজাগ দৃষ্টিবান","root":"رقب","lemma":"رَقِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50237,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yaḥillu laka l-nisāu min baʿdu walā an tabaddala bihinna min azwājin walaw aʿjabaka ḥus''nuhunna illā mā malakat yamīnuka wakāna l-lahu ʿalā kulli shayin raqīban', 'অতঃপর আর কোন নারী তোমার জন্য বৈধ নয়। আর তাদের পরিবর্তে অন্য স্ত্রী গ্রহণ করাও হালাল নয় যদিও তাদের সৌন্দর্য তোমাকে চমৎকৃত করে। তবে তোমার অধিকারভুক্ত দাসীদের ব্যাপারে এই নিয়ম প্রযোজ্য নয়। আল্লাহ সব বিষয়ের উপর দৃষ্টি রাখেন।', 'Not lawful to you, [O Muhammad], are [any additional] women after [this], nor [is it] for you to exchange them for [other] wives, even if their beauty were to please you, except what your right hand possesses. And ever is Allah, over all things, an Observer.', 'অতঃপর আর কোন নারী তোমার জন্য বৈধ নয়। আর তাদের পরিবর্তে অন্য স্ত্রী গ্রহণ করাও হালাল নয় যদিও তাদের সৌন্দর্য তোমাকে চমৎকৃত করে। তবে তোমার অধিকারভুক্ত দাসীদের ব্যাপারে এই নিয়ম প্রযোজ্য নয়। আল্লাহ সব বিষয়ের উপর দৃষ্টি রাখেন।', 'Not lawful to you, [O Muhammad], are [any additional] women after [this], nor [is it] for you to exchange them for [other] wives, even if their beauty were to please you, except what your right hand possesses. And ever is Allah, over all things, an Observer.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033052.mp3', now()),
