ranslation_bn":"গুরুতর (অপরাধ)","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50840,"position":70,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā tadkhulū buyūta l-nabiyi illā an yu''dhana lakum ilā ṭaʿāmin ghayra nāẓirīna ināhu walākin idhā duʿītum fa-ud''khulū fa-idhā ṭaʿim''tum fa-intashirū walā mus''tanisīna liḥadīthin inna dhālikum kāna yu''dhī l-nabiya fayastaḥyī minkum wal-lahu lā yastaḥyī mina l-ḥaqi wa-idhā sa-altumūhunna matāʿan fasalūhunna min warāi ḥijābin dhālikum aṭharu liqulūbikum waqulūbihinna wamā kāna lakum an tu''dhū rasūla l-lahi walā an tankiḥū azwājahu min baʿdihi abadan inna dhālikum kāna ʿinda l-lahi ʿaẓīman', 'তোমরা যারা ঈমান এনেছ শোন! নবীগৃহে প্রবেশ কর না যতক্ষণ না তোমাদেরকে অনুমতি দেয়া হয় খাদ্য গ্রহণের জন্য, (আগেভাগেই এসে পড় না) খাদ্য প্রস্তুতির জন্য অপেক্ষা করে যেন বসে থাকতে না হয়। তবে তোমাদেরকে ডাকা হলে তোমরা প্রবেশ কর। অতঃপর তোমাদের খাওয়া হলে তোমরা চলে যাও। কথাবার্তায় মশগুল হয়ে যেয়ো না। তোমাদের এ কাজ নবীকে কষ্ট দেয়। সে তোমাদেরকে (উঠে যাওয়ার জন্য বলতে) লজ্জাবোধ করে, আল্লাহ সত্য কথা বলতে লজ্জাবোধ করেন না। তোমরা যখন তার স্ত্রীগণের নিকট কোন কিছু চাও, তখন পর্দার আড়াল হতে তাদের কাছে চাও। এটাই তোমাদের ও তাদের অন্তরের জন্য পবিত্রতর। তোমাদের জন্য আল্লাহর রসূলকে কষ্ট দেয়া সঙ্গত নয়। আর তার মৃত্যুর পর তার স্ত্রীগণকে বিয়ে করাও তোমাদের জন্য কক্ষনো বৈধ নয়। আল্লাহর দৃষ্টিতে এটা মহা অপরাধ।', 'O you who have believed, do not enter the houses of the Prophet except when you are permitted for a meal, without awaiting its readiness. But when you are invited, then enter; and when you have eaten, disperse without seeking to remain for conversation. Indeed, that [behavior] was troubling the Prophet, and he is shy of [dismissing] you. But Allah is not shy of the truth. And when you ask [his wives] for something, ask them from behind a partition. That is purer for your hearts and their hearts. And it is not [conceivable or lawful] for you to harm the Messenger of Allah or to marry his wives after him, ever. Indeed, that would be in the sight of Allah an enormity.', 'তোমরা যারা ঈমান এনেছ শোন! নবীগৃহে প্রবেশ কর না যতক্ষণ না তোমাদেরকে অনুমতি দেয়া হয় খাদ্য গ্রহণের জন্য, (আগেভাগেই এসে পড় না) খাদ্য প্রস্তুতির জন্য অপেক্ষা করে যেন বসে থাকতে না হয়। তবে তোমাদেরকে ডাকা হলে তোমরা প্রবেশ কর। অতঃপর তোমাদের খাওয়া হলে তোমরা চলে যাও। কথাবার্তায় মশগুল হয়ে যেয়ো না। তোমাদের এ কাজ নবীকে কষ্ট দেয়। সে তোমাদেরকে (উঠে যাওয়ার জন্য বলতে) লজ্জাবোধ করে, আল্লাহ সত্য কথা বলতে লজ্জাবোধ করেন না। তোমরা যখন তার স্ত্রীগণের নিকট কোন কিছু চাও, তখন পর্দার আড়াল হতে তাদের কাছে চাও। এটাই তোমাদের ও তাদের অন্তরের জন্য পবিত্রতর। তোমাদের জন্য আল্লাহর রসূলকে কষ্ট দেয়া সঙ্গত নয়। আর তার মৃত্যুর পর তার স্ত্রীগণকে বিয়ে করাও তোমাদের জন্য কক্ষনো বৈধ নয়। আল্লাহর দৃষ্টিতে এটা মহা অপরাধ।', 'O you who have believed, do not enter the houses of the Prophet except when you are permitted for a meal, without awaiting its readiness. But when you are invited, then enter; and when you have eaten, disperse without seeking to remain for conversation. Indeed, that [behavior] was troubling the Prophet, and he is shy of [dismissing] you. But Allah is not shy of the truth. And when you ask [his wives] for something, ask them from behind a partition. That is purer for your hearts and their hearts. And it is not [conceivable or lawful] for you to harm the Messenger of Allah or to marry his wives after him, ever. Indeed, that would be in the sight of Allah an enormity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033053.mp3', now()),
  (33, 54, '', '[{"id":51408,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":51409,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُبْدُوا۟","transliteration":"tub''dū","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রকাশ করো","root":"بدو","lemma":"يُبْدِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51410,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51411,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51412,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُخْفُوهُ","transliteration":"tukh''fūhu","translation_bn":"গোপন করো তা","root":"خفي","lemma":"أُخْفِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51413,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবুও নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51414,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51415,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51416,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51417,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুরই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51418,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿalīman","translation_bn":"খুব অবগত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51419,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in tub''dū shayan aw tukh''fūhu fa-inna l-laha kāna bikulli shayin ʿalīman', 'তোমরা কোন বিষয় প্রকাশ কর অথবা তা গোপন কর- আল্লাহ তো সব বিষয়ে সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'Whether you reveal a thing or conceal it, indeed Allah is ever, of all things, Knowing.', 'তোমরা কোন বিষয় প্রকাশ কর অথবা তা গোপন কর- আল্লাহ তো সব বিষয়ে সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'Whether you reveal a thing or conceal it, indeed Allah is ever, of all things, Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033054.mp3', now()),
  (33, 55, '', '[{"id":51938,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51939,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جُنَاحَ","transliteration":"junāḥa","translation_bn":"অপরাধ","root":"جنح","lemma":"جُنَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51940,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51941,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51942,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآئِهِنَّ","transliteration":"ābāihinna","translation_bn":"পিতাদের তাদের(সাথে দেখা সাক্ষাতের)","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51943,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51944,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَبْنَآئِهِنَّ","transliteration":"abnāihinna","translation_bn":"পুত্রদের তাদের","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51945,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51946,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ","transliteration":"ikh''wānihinna","translation_bn":"ভাইদের তাদের","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51947,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51948,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَبْنَآءِ","transliteration":"abnāi","translation_bn":"ছেলেদের","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51949,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ","transliteration":"ikh''wānihinna","translation_bn":"ভাইদের (অর্থাৎ ভাতিজাদের) তাদের","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51950,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51951,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَبْنَآءِ","transliteration":"abnāi","translation_bn":"ছেলেদের","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51952,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَخَوَٰتِهِنَّ","transliteration":"akhawātihinna","translation_bn":"বোনদের (অর্থাৎ ভাগিনাদের) তাদের","root":"اخو","lemma":"أُخْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51953,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51954,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"نِسَآئِهِنَّ","transliteration":"nisāihinna","translation_bn":"নারীদের তাদের","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51955,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর নেই (অপরাধ)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51956,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তাদের সাথে) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51957,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَلَكَتْ","transliteration":"malakat","translation_bn":"মালিক হয়েছে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51958,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنُهُنَّ ۗ","transliteration":"aymānuhunna","translation_bn":"ডানহাত তাদের (অর্থাৎ দাসদাসী)","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51960,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"wa-ittaqīna","translation_bn":"এবং ভয় করো (হে নাবী পত্নীগণ)","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51961,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51963,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51964,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51965,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51966,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51967,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51968,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51969,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"প্রত্যক্ষ সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51970,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā junāḥa ʿalayhinna fī ābāihinna walā abnāihinna walā ikh''wānihinna walā abnāi ikh''wānihinna walā abnāi akhawātihinna walā nisāihinna walā mā malakat aymānuhunna wa-ittaqīna l-laha inna l-laha kāna ʿalā kulli shayin shahīdan', 'কোন অপরাধ নেই (যদি নবীর স্ত্রীগণ সামনে যায়) তাদের পিতৃদের, তাদের পুত্রদের, তাদের ভ্রাতৃদের, তাদের ভ্রাতুষ্পুত্রদের, তাদের ভগ্নীপুত্রদের, তাদের নারীদের ও তাদের অধিকারভুক্ত দাস-দাসীদের। আর (হে নবীর স্ত্রীগণ!) তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ সকল জিনিসেরই প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'There is no blame upon women concerning their fathers or their sons or their brothers or their brothers'' sons or their sisters'' sons or their women or those their right hands possess. And fear Allah. Indeed Allah is ever, over all things, Witness.', 'কোন অপরাধ নেই (যদি নবীর স্ত্রীগণ সামনে যায়) তাদের পিতৃদের, তাদের পুত্রদের, তাদের ভ্রাতৃদের, তাদের ভ্রাতুষ্পুত্রদের, তাদের ভগ্নীপুত্রদের, তাদের নারীদের ও তাদের অধিকারভুক্ত দাস-দাসীদের। আর (হে নবীর স্ত্রীগণ!) তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ সকল জিনিসেরই প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'There is no blame upon women concerning their fathers or their sons or their brothers or their brothers'' sons or their sisters'' sons or their women or those their right hands possess. And fear Allah. Indeed Allah is ever, over all things, Witness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033055.mp3', now()),
  (33, 56, '', '[{"id":52513,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52514,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (প্রশংসা করেন)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52515,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَمَلَـٰٓئِكَتَهُۥ","transliteration":"wamalāikatahu","translation_bn":"ও ফেরেশতাগণ তাঁর","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52516,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُصَلُّونَ","transliteration":"yuṣallūna","translation_bn":"দু''আ পাঠান","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52517,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52518,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىِّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nabiyi","translation_bn":"নাবীর","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52520,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":52521,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52522,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52523,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"صَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"ṣallū","translation_bn":"দরূদ পাঠাও","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52524,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52525,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَسَلِّمُوا۟","transliteration":"wasallimū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা সালাম জানাও","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52526,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَسْلِيمًا","transliteration":"taslīman","translation_bn":"(অতি উত্তম) সালাম","root":"سلم","lemma":"تَسْلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52527,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha wamalāikatahu yuṣallūna ʿalā l-nabiyi yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ṣallū ʿalayhi wasallimū taslīman', 'আল্লাহ নবীর প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেন, তাঁর ফেরেশতাগণ নবীর জন্য অনুগ্রহ প্রার্থনা করে। হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরাও নবীর জন্য অনুগ্রহ প্রার্থনা কর এবং যথাযথ শ্রদ্ধাভরে সালাম জানাও।', 'Indeed, Allah confers blessing upon the Prophet, and His angels [ask Him to do so]. O you who have believed, ask [Allah to confer] blessing upon him and ask [Allah to grant him] peace.', 'আল্লাহ নবীর প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেন, তাঁর ফেরেশতাগণ নবীর জন্য অনুগ্রহ প্রার্থনা করে। হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরাও নবীর জন্য অনুগ্রহ প্রার্থনা কর এবং যথাযথ শ্রদ্ধাভরে সালাম জানাও।', 'Indeed, Allah confers blessing upon the Prophet, and His angels [ask Him to do so]. O you who have believed, ask [Allah to confer] blessing upon him and ask [Allah to grant him] peace.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033056.mp3', now()),
  (33, 57, '', '[{"id":52715,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52716,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52717,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْذُونَ","transliteration":"yu''dhūna","translation_bn":"কষ্ট দেয়","root":"اذي","lemma":"أُوذِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52718,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52719,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও রাসূলকে তাঁর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52720,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَعَنَهُمُ","transliteration":"laʿanahumu","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ দেন তাদেরকে","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52721,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52722,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52723,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52724,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","translation_bn":"ও আখিরাতে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52725,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعَدَّ","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","translation_bn":"এবং প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52726,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52727,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًۭا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52728,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّهِينًۭا","transliteration":"muhīnan","translation_bn":"অপমানকর","root":"هون","lemma":"مُّهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52729,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna yu''dhūna l-laha warasūlahu laʿanahumu l-lahu fī l-dun''yā wal-ākhirati wa-aʿadda lahum ʿadhāban muhīnan', 'যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলকে কষ্ট দেয়, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতে অভিশপ্ত করেছেন আর তাদের জন্য প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন অপমানজনক শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who abuse Allah and His Messenger - Allah has cursed them in this world and the Hereafter and prepared for them a humiliating punishment.', 'যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলকে কষ্ট দেয়, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দুনিয়া ও আখিরাতে অভিশপ্ত করেছেন আর তাদের জন্য প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন অপমানজনক শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who abuse Allah and His Messenger - Allah has cursed them in this world and the Hereafter and prepared for them a humiliating punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033057.mp3', now()),
  (33, 58, '', '[{"id":53553,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53554,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْذُونَ","transliteration":"yu''dhūna","translation_bn":"কষ্ট দেয়","root":"اذي","lemma":"أُوذِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53555,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু’মিনদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53556,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"wal-mu''mināti","translation_bn":"ও মু’মিন নারীদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53557,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53558,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53559,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱكْتَسَبُوا۟","transliteration":"ik''tasabū","translation_bn":"তারা অর্জন (অপরাধ) করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"ٱكْتَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53560,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدِ","transliteration":"faqadi","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53561,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱحْتَمَلُوا۟","transliteration":"iḥ''tamalū","translation_bn":"তারা বহন করবে","root":"حمل","lemma":"ٱحْتَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53562,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بُهْتَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"buh''tānan","translation_bn":"অপবাদ","root":"بهت","lemma":"بُهْتَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53563,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَإِثْمًۭا","transliteration":"wa-ith''man","translation_bn":"ও পাপ","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53564,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينًۭا","transliteration":"mubīnan","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53565,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna yu''dhūna l-mu''minīna wal-mu''mināti bighayri mā ik''tasabū faqadi iḥ''tamalū buh''tānan wa-ith''man mubīnan', 'আর যারা মু’মিন পুরুষ ও মু’মিন নারীদেরকে কষ্ট দেয় তাদের কোন অপরাধ ছাড়াই, তারা অপবাদের ও সুস্পষ্ট পাপের বোঝা বহন করে।', 'And those who harm believing men and believing women for [something] other than what they have earned have certainly born upon themselves a slander and manifest sin.', 'আর যারা মু’মিন পুরুষ ও মু’মিন নারীদেরকে কষ্ট দেয় তাদের কোন অপরাধ ছাড়াই, তারা অপবাদের ও সুস্পষ্ট পাপের বোঝা বহন করে।', 'And those who harm believing men and believing women for [something] other than what they have earned have certainly born upon themselves a slander and manifest sin.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033058.mp3', now()),
  (33, 59, '', '[{"id":54099,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":54100,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","translation_bn":"নাবী","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54101,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54102,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِّأَزْوَٰجِكَ","transliteration":"li-azwājika","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে স্ত্রীদের তোমার","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54103,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَبَنَاتِكَ","transliteration":"wabanātika","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের মেয়েদেরকে","root":"بني","lemma":"بَنَات","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54104,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَنِسَآءِ","transliteration":"wanisāi","translation_bn":"ও নারীদের","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54105,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু’মিনদের (যেন)","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54106,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُدْنِينَ","transliteration":"yud''nīna","translation_bn":"তারা টেনে দেয়","root":"دنو","lemma":"دَنَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54107,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54108,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কিছু অংশ (অর্থাৎ আঁচল)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54109,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَلَـٰبِيبِهِنَّ ۚ","transliteration":"jalābībihinna","translation_bn":"চাদরের তাদের","root":"جلب","lemma":"جَلَٰبِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54111,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":54112,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَدْنَىٰٓ","transliteration":"adnā","translation_bn":"নিকটতর","root":"دنو","lemma":"أَدْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54113,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":54114,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُعْرَفْنَ","transliteration":"yuʿ''rafna","translation_bn":"তাদের চেনা যাবে","root":"عرف","lemma":"عَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54115,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তখন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54116,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْذَيْنَ ۗ","transliteration":"yu''dhayna","translation_bn":"তাদের কষ্ট দেয়া হবে","root":"اذي","lemma":"أُوذِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54118,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54119,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54120,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54121,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمًۭا","transliteration":"raḥīman","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":54122,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nabiyu qul li-azwājika wabanātika wanisāi l-mu''minīna yud''nīna ʿalayhinna min jalābībihinna dhālika adnā an yuʿ''rafna falā yu''dhayna wakāna l-lahu ghafūran raḥīman', 'হে নবী! তুমি তোমার স্ত্রীদেরকে, তোমার কন্যাদেরকে আর মু’মিনদের নারীদেরকে বলে দাও- তারা যেন তাদের চাদরের কিছু অংশ নিজেদের উপর টেনে দেয় (যখন তারা বাড়ীর বাইরে যায়), এতে তাদেরকে চেনা সহজতর হবে এবং তাদেরকে উত্যক্ত করা হবে না। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'O Prophet, tell your wives and your daughters and the women of the believers to bring down over themselves [part] of their outer garments. That is more suitable that they will be known and not be abused. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', 'হে নবী! তুমি তোমার স্ত্রীদেরকে, তোমার কন্যাদেরকে আর মু’মিনদের নারীদেরকে বলে দাও- তারা যেন তাদের চাদরের কিছু অংশ নিজেদের উপর টেনে দেয় (যখন তারা বাড়ীর বাইরে যায়), এতে তাদেরকে চেনা সহজতর হবে এবং তাদেরকে উত্যক্ত করা হবে না। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'O Prophet, tell your wives and your daughters and the women of the believers to bring down over themselves [part] of their outer garments. That is more suitable that they will be known and not be abused. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033059.mp3', now()),
  (33, 60, '', '[{"id":54720,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ لَّئِن","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54721,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54722,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَنتَهِ","transliteration":"yantahi","translation_bn":"বিরত থাকে","root":"نهي","lemma":"ٱنتَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54723,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","transliteration":"l-munāfiqūna","translation_bn":"মুনাফিকরা","root":"نفق","lemma":"مُنَٰفِقُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54724,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54725,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54726,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِم","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54727,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَضٌۭ","transliteration":"maraḍun","translation_bn":"রোগ","root":"مرض","lemma":"مَّرَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54728,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُرْجِفُونَ","transliteration":"wal-mur''jifūna","translation_bn":"এবং গুজব রটনাকারীরা","root":"رجف","lemma":"مُرْجِفُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54729,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54730,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","transliteration":"l-madīnati","translation_bn":"মদিনা (শহরের)","root":"مدن","lemma":"مَدِينَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54731,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَنُغْرِيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"lanugh''riyannaka","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা প্রবল করবো তোমাকে","root":"غرو","lemma":"أَغْرَيْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54732,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54733,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54734,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54735,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُجَاوِرُونَكَ","transliteration":"yujāwirūnaka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতিবেশী হয়ে তারা থাকবে","root":"جور","lemma":"يُجَاوِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54736,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54737,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":54738,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"স্বল্প","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54739,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'la-in lam yantahi l-munāfiqūna wa-alladhīna fī qulūbihim maraḍun wal-mur''jifūna fī l-madīnati lanugh''riyannaka bihim thumma lā yujāwirūnaka fīhā illā qalīlan', 'মুনাফিকরা আর যাদের অন্তরে রোগ আছে তারা আর শহরে গুজব রটনাকারীরা যদি বিরত না হয়, তবে আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদের বিরুদ্ধে তোমাকে তেজোদীপ্ত করব, অতঃপর তারা তোমার প্রতিবেশী হিসেবে এ শহরে থাকতে পারবে না। তবে অল্পদিনের জন্য থাকবে', 'If the hypocrites and those in whose hearts is disease and those who spread rumors in al-Madinah do not cease, We will surely incite you against them; then they will not remain your neighbors therein except for a little.', 'মুনাফিকরা আর যাদের অন্তরে রোগ আছে তারা আর শহরে গুজব রটনাকারীরা যদি বিরত না হয়, তবে আমি অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদের বিরুদ্ধে তোমাকে তেজোদীপ্ত করব, অতঃপর তারা তোমার প্রতিবেশী হিসেবে এ শহরে থাকতে পারবে না। তবে অল্পদিনের জন্য থাকবে', 'If the hypocrites and those in whose hearts is disease and those who spread rumors in al-Madinah do not cease, We will surely incite you against them; then they will not remain your neighbors therein except for a little.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033060.mp3', now()),
  (33, 61, '', '[{"id":54785,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّلْعُونِينَ ۖ","transliteration":"malʿūnīna","translation_bn":"তারা অভিশপ্ত হয়ে","root":"لعن","lemma":"مَّلْعُونِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54787,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَيْنَمَا","transliteration":"aynamā","translation_bn":"যেখানেই","root":"—","lemma":"أَيْن\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":54788,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ثُقِفُوٓا۟","transliteration":"thuqifū","translation_bn":"তাদের পাওয়া যাবে","root":"ثقف","lemma":"ثُقِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54789,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُخِذُوا۟","transliteration":"ukhidhū","translation_bn":"তাদের ধরা হবে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54790,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقُتِّلُوا۟","transliteration":"waquttilū","translation_bn":"ও তাদের হত্যা করা হবে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قُتِّلُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54791,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَقْتِيلًۭا","transliteration":"taqtīlan","translation_bn":"(নির্মমভাবে) হত্যা","root":"قتل","lemma":"تَقْتِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54792,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'malʿūnīna aynamā thuqifū ukhidhū waquttilū taqtīlan', 'অভিশপ্ত অবস্থায়; তাদেরকে যেখানেই পাওয়া যাবে ধরা হবে এবং হত্যা করার মতই হত্যা করা হবে।', 'Accursed wherever they are found, [being] seized and massacred completely.', 'অভিশপ্ত অবস্থায়; তাদেরকে যেখানেই পাওয়া যাবে ধরা হবে এবং হত্যা করার মতই হত্যা করা হবে।', 'Accursed wherever they are found, [being] seized and massacred completely.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033061.mp3', now()),
  (33, 62, '', '[{"id":55828,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سُنَّةَ","transliteration":"sunnata","translation_bn":"রীতি","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55829,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55830,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(তাদের) ক্ষেত্রেও","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55831,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55832,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَلَوْا۟","transliteration":"khalaw","translation_bn":"অতীত হয়েছে","root":"خلو","lemma":"خَلَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55833,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55834,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۖ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55836,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَن","transliteration":"walan","translation_bn":"এবং কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55837,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَجِدَ","transliteration":"tajida","translation_bn":"পাবে তুমি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55838,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِسُنَّةِ","transliteration":"lisunnati","translation_bn":"মধ্যে রীতির","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55839,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55840,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَبْدِيلًۭا","transliteration":"tabdīlan","translation_bn":"কোনো পরিবর্তন","root":"بدل","lemma":"تَبْدِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55841,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sunnata l-lahi fī alladhīna khalaw min qablu walan tajida lisunnati l-lahi tabdīlan', 'যারা অতীত হয়ে গেছে তাদের ক্ষেত্রে এটাই ছিল আল্লাহর বিধান, তুমি আল্লাহর বিধানে কক্ষনো হেরফের পাবে না।', '[This is] the established way of Allah with those who passed on before; and you will not find in the way of Allah any change.', 'যারা অতীত হয়ে গেছে তাদের ক্ষেত্রে এটাই ছিল আল্লাহর বিধান, তুমি আল্লাহর বিধানে কক্ষনো হেরফের পাবে না।', '[This is] the established way of Allah with those who passed on before; and you will not find in the way of Allah any change.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033062.mp3', now()),
  (33, 63, '', '[{"id":56399,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔلُكَ","transliteration":"yasaluka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে প্রশ্ন করছে","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56400,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56401,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56402,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56404,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56405,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56406,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمُهَا","transliteration":"ʿil''muhā","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান তার","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56407,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":56408,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56410,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং কিসে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56411,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُدْرِيكَ","transliteration":"yud''rīka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে জানাবে","root":"دري","lemma":"أَدْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56412,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّ","transliteration":"laʿalla","translation_bn":"সম্ভবত","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56413,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56414,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُ","transliteration":"takūnu","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56415,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبًا","transliteration":"qarīban","translation_bn":"নিকটে\"","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56416,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yasaluka l-nāsu ʿani l-sāʿati qul innamā ʿil''muhā ʿinda l-lahi wamā yud''rīka laʿalla l-sāʿata takūnu qarīban', 'লোকে তোমাকে ক্বিয়ামত সম্পর্কে প্রশ্ন করে। বল, তার জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহর নিকটই আছে। কিসে তোমাকে জানাবে- সম্ভবতঃ ক্বিয়ামত নিকটেই।', 'People ask you concerning the Hour. Say," Knowledge of it is only with Allah. And what may make you perceive? Perhaps the Hour is near."', 'লোকে তোমাকে ক্বিয়ামত সম্পর্কে প্রশ্ন করে। বল, তার জ্ঞান কেবল আল্লাহর নিকটই আছে। কিসে তোমাকে জানাবে- সম্ভবতঃ ক্বিয়ামত নিকটেই।', 'People ask you concerning the Hour. Say," Knowledge of it is only with Allah. And what may make you perceive? Perhaps the Hour is near."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033063.mp3', now()),
  (33, 64, '', '[{"id":56903,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56904,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56905,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَعَنَ","transliteration":"laʿana","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ দেন","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56906,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদেরকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56907,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعَدَّ","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","translation_bn":"এবং প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56908,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56909,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَعِيرًا","transliteration":"saʿīran","translation_bn":"জ্বলন্ত আগুন","root":"سعر","lemma":"سَعِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56910,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha laʿana l-kāfirīna wa-aʿadda lahum saʿīran', 'আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে অভিশাপ দিয়েছেন আর তাদের জন্য জ্বলন্ত অগ্নি প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন।', 'Indeed, Allah has cursed the disbelievers and prepared for them a Blaze.', 'আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে অভিশাপ দিয়েছেন আর তাদের জন্য জ্বলন্ত অগ্নি প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন।', 'Indeed, Allah has cursed the disbelievers and prepared for them a Blaze.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033064.mp3', now()),
  (33, 65, '', '[{"id":57408,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তারা স্থায়ীভাবে থাকবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57409,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57410,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"চিরকাল","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":57412,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57413,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدُونَ","transliteration":"yajidūna","translation_bn":"তারা পাবে","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57414,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيًّۭا","transliteration":"waliyyan","translation_bn":"কোনো অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57415,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57416,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَصِيرًۭا","transliteration":"naṣīran","translation_bn":"কোনো সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57417,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'khālidīna fīhā abadan lā yajidūna waliyyan walā naṣīran', 'তাতে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে, তারা না পাবে কোন অভিভাবক, আর না পাবে কোন সাহায্যকারী।', 'Abiding therein forever, they will not find a protector or a helper.', 'তাতে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে, তারা না পাবে কোন অভিভাবক, আর না পাবে কোন সাহায্যকারী।', 'Abiding therein forever, they will not find a protector or a helper.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033065.mp3', now()),
  (33, 66, '', '[{"id":57872,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যে দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57873,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُقَلَّبُ","transliteration":"tuqallabu","translation_bn":"উলট-পালট করা হবে","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلَّبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57874,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وُجُوهُهُمْ","transliteration":"wujūhuhum","translation_bn":"মুখমণ্ডল তাদের","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57875,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57876,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57877,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57878,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰلَيْتَنَآ","transliteration":"yālaytanā","translation_bn":"\"হায়! আমাদের পরিতাপ","root":"—","lemma":"لَيْت","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":57879,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَطَعْنَا","transliteration":"aṭaʿnā","translation_bn":"আমরা আনুগত্য করতাম (যদি)","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57880,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57881,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطَعْنَا","transliteration":"wa-aṭaʿnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা আনুগত্য করতাম (যদি)","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57882,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولَا۠","transliteration":"l-rasūlā","translation_bn":"রাসূলের\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57883,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma tuqallabu wujūhuhum fī l-nāri yaqūlūna yālaytanā aṭaʿnā l-laha wa-aṭaʿnā l-rasūlā', 'আগুনে যেদিন তাদের মুখ উপুড় করে দেয়া হবে সেদিন তারা বলবে- হায়! আমরা যদি আল্লাহকে মানতাম ও রসূলকে মানতাম।', 'The Day their faces will be turned about in the Fire, they will say, "How we wish we had obeyed Allah and obeyed the Messenger."', 'আগুনে যেদিন তাদের মুখ উপুড় করে দেয়া হবে সেদিন তারা বলবে- হায়! আমরা যদি আল্লাহকে মানতাম ও রসূলকে মানতাম।', 'The Day their faces will be turned about in the Fire, they will say, "How we wish we had obeyed Allah and obeyed the Messenger."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033066.mp3', now()),
  (33, 67, '', '[{"id":58336,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58337,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58338,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّآ","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58339,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَطَعْنَا","transliteration":"aṭaʿnā","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য করেছি আমরা","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58340,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَادَتَنَا","transliteration":"sādatanā","translation_bn":"নেতাদের আমাদের","root":"سود","lemma":"سَيِّد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58341,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَكُبَرَآءَنَا","transliteration":"wakubarāanā","translation_bn":"ও বড়দের আমাদের","root":"كبر","lemma":"كُبَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58342,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَضَلُّونَا","transliteration":"fa-aḍallūnā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা ভ্রষ্ট করেছে আমাদেরকে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58343,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلَا۠","transliteration":"l-sabīlā","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58344,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū rabbanā innā aṭaʿnā sādatanā wakubarāanā fa-aḍallūnā l-sabīlā', 'আর তারা বলবে- হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! আমরা আমাদের নেতাদেরকে ও আমাদের প্রধানদেরকে মান্য করতাম। তারাই আমাদেরকে গুমরাহ করেছিল।', 'And they will say, "Our Lord, indeed we obeyed our masters and our dignitaries, and they led us astray from the [right] way.', 'আর তারা বলবে- হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! আমরা আমাদের নেতাদেরকে ও আমাদের প্রধানদেরকে মান্য করতাম। তারাই আমাদেরকে গুমরাহ করেছিল।', 'And they will say, "Our Lord, indeed we obeyed our masters and our dignitaries, and they led us astray from the [right] way.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033067.mp3', now()),
  (33, 68, '', '[{"id":58807,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58808,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتِهِمْ","transliteration":"ātihim","translation_bn":"দিন তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58809,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ضِعْفَيْنِ","transliteration":"ḍiʿ''fayni","translation_bn":"দ্বিগুণ","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضِعْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58810,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58811,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58812,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْعَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"wal-ʿanhum","translation_bn":"এবং অভিশপ্ত করুন তাদেরকে","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58813,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَعْنًۭا","transliteration":"laʿnan","translation_bn":"অভিশাপে","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58814,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kabīran","translation_bn":"বড়\"","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":58815,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbanā ātihim ḍiʿ''fayni mina l-ʿadhābi wal-ʿanhum laʿnan kabīran', 'হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! তাদেরকে দ্বিগুণ শাস্তি দাও আর তাদেরকে মহা অভিশাপে অভিশাপ দাও।', 'Our Lord, give them double the punishment and curse them with a great curse."', 'হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! তাদেরকে দ্বিগুণ শাস্তি দাও আর তাদেরকে মহা অভিশাপে অভিশাপ দাও।', 'Our Lord, give them double the punishment and curse them with a great curse."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033068.mp3', now()),
  (33, 69, '', '[{"id":59297,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":59298,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59299,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59300,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":59301,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"takūnū","translation_bn":"তোমরা হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59302,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) মতো যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59303,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَاذَوْا۟","transliteration":"ādhaw","translation_bn":"কষ্ট দিয়েছিলো","root":"اذي","lemma":"أُوذِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59304,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59305,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَبَرَّأَهُ","transliteration":"fabarra-ahu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নির্দোষ প্রমাণ করলেন তাকে","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59306,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59307,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয় হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59308,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59310,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59311,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":59312,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59313,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَجِيهًۭا","transliteration":"wajīhan","translation_bn":"মর্যাদাবান","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجِيه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59314,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā takūnū ka-alladhīna ādhaw mūsā fabarra-ahu l-lahu mimmā qālū wakāna ʿinda l-lahi wajīhan', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা তাদের মত হয়ো না যারা মূসাকে কষ্ট দিয়েছিল। অতঃপর তারা যা বলেছিল আল্লাহ তাত্থেকে তাকে নির্দোষ প্রমাণিত করেন। সে ছিল আল্লাহর নিকট সম্মানিত।', 'O you who have believed, be not like those who abused Moses; then Allah cleared him of what they said. And he, in the sight of Allah, was distinguished.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা তাদের মত হয়ো না যারা মূসাকে কষ্ট দিয়েছিল। অতঃপর তারা যা বলেছিল আল্লাহ তাত্থেকে তাকে নির্দোষ প্রমাণিত করেন। সে ছিল আল্লাহর নিকট সম্মানিত।', 'O you who have believed, be not like those who abused Moses; then Allah cleared him of what they said. And he, in the sight of Allah, was distinguished.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033069.mp3', now()),
  (33, 70, '', '[{"id":59723,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":59724,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59725,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59726,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59727,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59728,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"waqūlū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59729,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلًۭا","transliteration":"qawlan","translation_bn":"কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59730,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سَدِيدًۭا","transliteration":"sadīdan","translation_bn":"সঠিক","root":"سدد","lemma":"سَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59731,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ittaqū l-laha waqūlū qawlan sadīdan', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর এবং সরল সঠিক কথা বল।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and speak words of appropriate justice.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর এবং সরল সঠিক কথা বল।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and speak words of appropriate justice.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033070.mp3', now()),
  (33, 71, '', '[{"id":60227,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُصْلِحْ","transliteration":"yuṣ''liḥ","translation_bn":"তিনি সংশোধন করবেন","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60228,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60229,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","translation_bn":"কর্মসমূহকে তোমাদের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60230,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wayaghfir","translation_bn":"এবং ক্ষমা করে দিবেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60231,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60232,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذُنُوبَكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"dhunūbakum","translation_bn":"পাপগুলোকে তোমাদের","root":"ذنب","lemma":"ذَنب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60234,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60235,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُطِعِ","transliteration":"yuṭiʿi","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য করে","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60236,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60237,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও রাসূলের তাঁর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60238,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60239,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَازَ","transliteration":"fāza","translation_bn":"সে সফল হলো","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَازَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60240,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَوْزًا","transliteration":"fawzan","translation_bn":"সাফল্য","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَوْز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60241,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمًا","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60242,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yuṣ''liḥ lakum aʿmālakum wayaghfir lakum dhunūbakum waman yuṭiʿi l-laha warasūlahu faqad fāza fawzan ʿaẓīman', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য তোমাদের আমলগুলোকে ত্রুটিমুক্ত করবেন আর তোমাদের পাপগুলোকে ক্ষমা করে দিবেন। যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আনুগত্য করে সে সাফল্য লাভ করে- মহাসাফল্য।', 'He will [then] amend for you your deeds and forgive you your sins. And whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger has certainly attained a great attainment.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য তোমাদের আমলগুলোকে ত্রুটিমুক্ত করবেন আর তোমাদের পাপগুলোকে ক্ষমা করে দিবেন। যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আনুগত্য করে সে সাফল্য লাভ করে- মহাসাফল্য।', 'He will [then] amend for you your deeds and forgive you your sins. And whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger has certainly attained a great attainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033071.mp3', now()),
  (33, 72, '', '[{"id":60810,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":60811,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَرَضْنَا","transliteration":"ʿaraḍnā","translation_bn":"পেশ করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60812,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمَانَةَ","transliteration":"l-amānata","translation_bn":"এ-আমানত (কুরআন)","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمَٰنَت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60813,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60814,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60815,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60816,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْجِبَالِ","transliteration":"wal-jibāli","translation_bn":"ও পর্বতমালার","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60817,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَأَبَيْنَ","transliteration":"fa-abayna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তারা অস্বীকার করলো","root":"ابي","lemma":"أَبَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60818,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":60819,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَحْمِلْنَهَا","transliteration":"yaḥmil''nahā","translation_bn":"তারা বহন করবে তা","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60820,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَشْفَقْنَ","transliteration":"wa-ashfaqna","translation_bn":"আর তারা ভয় পেলো","root":"شفق","lemma":"أَشْفَقْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60821,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60822,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَحَمَلَهَا","transliteration":"waḥamalahā","translation_bn":"এবং বহন করলো তা","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60823,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-insānu","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60825,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":60826,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60827,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ظَلُومًۭا","transliteration":"ẓalūman","translation_bn":"বড় সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلُوم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60828,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"جَهُولًۭا","transliteration":"jahūlan","translation_bn":"বড় অজ্ঞ","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَهُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60829,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā ʿaraḍnā l-amānata ʿalā l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wal-jibāli fa-abayna an yaḥmil''nahā wa-ashfaqna min''hā waḥamalahā l-insānu innahu kāna ẓalūman jahūlan', 'আমি আসমান, যমীন ও পর্বতের প্রতি (ইসলামের বোঝা বহন করার) আমানাত পেশ করেছিলাম। কিন্তু তারা তা বহন করতে অস্বীকৃতি জানাল, তারা তাতে আশংকিত হল, কিন্তু মানুষ সে দায়িত্ব নিল। সে বড়ই অন্যায়কারী, বড়ই অজ্ঞ।', 'Indeed, we offered the Trust to the heavens and the earth and the mountains, and they declined to bear it and feared it; but man [undertook to] bear it. Indeed, he was unjust and ignorant.', 'আমি আসমান, যমীন ও পর্বতের প্রতি (ইসলামের বোঝা বহন করার) আমানাত পেশ করেছিলাম। কিন্তু তারা তা বহন করতে অস্বীকৃতি জানাল, তারা তাতে আশংকিত হল, কিন্তু মানুষ সে দায়িত্ব নিল। সে বড়ই অন্যায়কারী, বড়ই অজ্ঞ।', 'Indeed, we offered the Trust to the heavens and the earth and the mountains, and they declined to bear it and feared it; but man [undertook to] bear it. Indeed, he was unjust and ignorant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033072.mp3', now()),
  (33, 73, '', '[{"id":61321,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّيُعَذِّبَ","transliteration":"liyuʿadhiba","translation_bn":"(এর পরিণাম হলো এই যে) যেন শাস্তি দিবেন","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61322,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61323,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-munāfiqīna","translation_bn":"মুনাফিক পুরুষদেরকে","root":"نفق","lemma":"مُنَٰفِقُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61324,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقَـٰتِ","transliteration":"wal-munāfiqāti","translation_bn":"ও মুনাফিক নারীদেরকে","root":"نفق","lemma":"مُنَٰفِقَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61325,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"wal-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"এবং মুশরিক পুরুষদেরকে","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61326,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُشْرِكَـٰتِ","transliteration":"wal-mush''rikāti","translation_bn":"ও মুশরিক নারীদেরকে","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِكَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61327,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَتُوبَ","transliteration":"wayatūba","translation_bn":"এবং ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61328,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61329,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61330,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু’মিন পুরুষদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61331,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ۗ","transliteration":"wal-mu''mināti","translation_bn":"ও মু’মিন নারীদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61333,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61334,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61335,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61336,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمًۢا","transliteration":"raḥīman","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61337,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyuʿadhiba l-lahu l-munāfiqīna wal-munāfiqāti wal-mush''rikīna wal-mush''rikāti wayatūba l-lahu ʿalā l-mu''minīna wal-mu''mināti wakāna l-lahu ghafūran raḥīman', 'পরিণামে আল্লাহ মুনাফিক পুরুষ ও মুনাফিক নারী এবং মুশরিক পুরুষ ও মুশরিক নারীকে শাস্তি দিবেন এবং মু’মিন পুরুষ ও মু’মিন নারীকে ক্ষমা প্রদর্শন করবেন। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', '[It was] so that Allah may punish the hypocrite men and hypocrite women and the men and women who associate others with Him and that Allah may accept repentance from the believing men and believing women. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', 'পরিণামে আল্লাহ মুনাফিক পুরুষ ও মুনাফিক নারী এবং মুশরিক পুরুষ ও মুশরিক নারীকে শাস্তি দিবেন এবং মু’মিন পুরুষ ও মু’মিন নারীকে ক্ষমা প্রদর্শন করবেন। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', '[It was] so that Allah may punish the hypocrite men and hypocrite women and the men and women who associate others with Him and that Allah may accept repentance from the believing men and believing women. And ever is Allah Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/033073.mp3', now())
