:"يَقُولُ","transliteration":"yaqūlu","translation_bn":"বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34132,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":34133,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتُضْعِفُوا۟","transliteration":"us''tuḍ''ʿifū","translation_bn":"দুর্বল করে রাখা হয়েছিলো","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ٱسْتَضْعَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34134,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34135,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকারী করেছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34136,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَآ","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"\"যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":34137,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা (থাকতে)","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":34138,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"لَكُنَّا","transliteration":"lakunnā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা হতাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":34139,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন\"","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34140,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla alladhīna kafarū lan nu''mina bihādhā l-qur''āni walā bi-alladhī bayna yadayhi walaw tarā idhi l-ẓālimūna mawqūfūna ʿinda rabbihim yarjiʿu baʿḍuhum ilā baʿḍin l-qawla yaqūlu alladhīna us''tuḍ''ʿifū lilladhīna is''takbarū lawlā antum lakunnā mu''minīna', 'কাফিরগণ বলে- আমরা এ কুরআনে কক্ষনো বিশ্বাস করব না, আর তার আগের কিতাবগুলোতেও না। তুমি যদি দেখতে! যখন যালিমদেরকে তাদের প্রতিপালকের সম্মুখে দাঁড় করানো হবে, তখন তারা পরস্পর বাদানুবাদ করবে। যাদেরকে দুর্বল ক’রে রাখা হয়েছিল তারা দাম্ভিকদেরকে বলবে- তোমরা না থাকলে আমরা অবশ্যই মু’মিন হতাম।', 'And those who disbelieve say, "We will never believe in this Qur''an nor in that before it." But if you could see when the wrongdoers are made to stand before their Lord, refuting each other''s words... Those who were oppressed will say to those who were arrogant, "If not for you, we would have been believers."', 'কাফিরগণ বলে- আমরা এ কুরআনে কক্ষনো বিশ্বাস করব না, আর তার আগের কিতাবগুলোতেও না। তুমি যদি দেখতে! যখন যালিমদেরকে তাদের প্রতিপালকের সম্মুখে দাঁড় করানো হবে, তখন তারা পরস্পর বাদানুবাদ করবে। যাদেরকে দুর্বল ক’রে রাখা হয়েছিল তারা দাম্ভিকদেরকে বলবে- তোমরা না থাকলে আমরা অবশ্যই মু’মিন হতাম।', 'And those who disbelieve say, "We will never believe in this Qur''an nor in that before it." But if you could see when the wrongdoers are made to stand before their Lord, refuting each other''s words... Those who were oppressed will say to those who were arrogant, "If not for you, we would have been believers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034031.mp3', now()),
  (34, 32, '', '[{"id":35063,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35064,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35065,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকারী করেছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35066,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে (তাদের) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35067,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتُضْعِفُوٓا۟","transliteration":"us''tuḍ''ʿifū","translation_bn":"দুর্বল করে রাখা হয়েছিলো","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ٱسْتَضْعَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35068,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَحْنُ","transliteration":"anaḥnu","translation_bn":"\"কি আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":35069,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَدَدْنَـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"ṣadadnākum","translation_bn":"আমরা বাধা দিয়েছিলাম তোমাদেরকে","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35070,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35071,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"সৎপথ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35072,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":35073,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":35074,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُم ۖ","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"এসেছিলো তোমাদের কাছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35076,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":35077,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35078,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধী\"","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35079,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alladhīna is''takbarū lilladhīna us''tuḍ''ʿifū anaḥnu ṣadadnākum ʿani l-hudā baʿda idh jāakum bal kuntum muj''rimīna', 'যাদেরকে দুর্বল ক’রে রাখা হয়েছিল দাম্ভিকরা তাদেরকে বলবে- তোমাদের কাছে সত্য পথের দিশা আসার পর আমরা কি তোমাদেরকে তাত্থেকে বাধা দিয়েছিলাম? বরং তোমরা নিজেরাই ছিলে অপরাধী।', 'Those who were arrogant will say to those who were oppressed, "Did we avert you from guidance after it had come to you? Rather, you were criminals."', 'যাদেরকে দুর্বল ক’রে রাখা হয়েছিল দাম্ভিকরা তাদেরকে বলবে- তোমাদের কাছে সত্য পথের দিশা আসার পর আমরা কি তোমাদেরকে তাত্থেকে বাধা দিয়েছিলাম? বরং তোমরা নিজেরাই ছিলে অপরাধী।', 'Those who were arrogant will say to those who were oppressed, "Did we avert you from guidance after it had come to you? Rather, you were criminals."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034032.mp3', now()),
  (34, 33, '', '[{"id":35908,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35909,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35910,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتُضْعِفُوا۟","transliteration":"us''tuḍ''ʿifū","translation_bn":"দুর্বল করে রাখা হয়েছিলো","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ٱسْتَضْعَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35911,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে (তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35912,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকারী করেছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35913,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"\"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":35914,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَكْرُ","transliteration":"makru","translation_bn":"চক্রান্ত (ছিলো)","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35915,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35916,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"wal-nahāri","translation_bn":"ও দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35917,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":35918,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَأْمُرُونَنَآ","transliteration":"tamurūnanā","translation_bn":"তোমরা নির্দেশ দিতে আমাদেরকে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35919,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":35920,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَّكْفُرَ","transliteration":"nakfura","translation_bn":"আমরা অস্বীকার করি","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35921,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"প্রতি আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35922,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَنَجْعَلَ","transliteration":"wanajʿala","translation_bn":"ও আমরা বানাই (যেন)","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35923,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35924,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَندَادًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"andādan","translation_bn":"সমকক্ষ\"","root":"ندد","lemma":"أَندَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35926,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَسَرُّوا۟","transliteration":"wa-asarrū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা গোপন করবে","root":"سرر","lemma":"أَسَرَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35927,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّدَامَةَ","transliteration":"l-nadāmata","translation_bn":"অনুতাপ","root":"ندم","lemma":"نَّدَامَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35928,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":35929,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"رَأَوُا۟","transliteration":"ra-awū","translation_bn":"তারা দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35930,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35931,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা পরিয়ে দিবো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35932,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَغْلَـٰلَ","transliteration":"l-aghlāla","translation_bn":"শিকলসমূহ","root":"غلل","lemma":"غِلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35933,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35934,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"أَعْنَاقِ","transliteration":"aʿnāqi","translation_bn":"গলাসমূহের","root":"عنق","lemma":"عُنُق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35935,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35936,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35938,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":35939,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"يُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"yuj''zawna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35940,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":35941,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35942,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35943,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35944,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla alladhīna us''tuḍ''ʿifū lilladhīna is''takbarū bal makru al-layli wal-nahāri idh tamurūnanā an nakfura bil-lahi wanajʿala lahu andādan wa-asarrū l-nadāmata lammā ra-awū l-ʿadhāba wajaʿalnā l-aghlāla fī aʿnāqi alladhīna kafarū hal yuj''zawna illā mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'যাদেরকে দুর্বল ক’রে রাখা হয়েছিল তারা দাম্ভিকদের বলবে- তোমরাই তো বরং দিন-রাত চক্রান্ত করতে। তোমরা আমাদেরকে নির্দেশ দিতে যাতে আমরা আল্লাহকে অস্বীকার করি আর তাঁর সমকক্ষ স্থির করি। যখন তারা শাস্তি দেখবে তখন মনের অনুতাপ মনেই লুকিয়ে রাখবে, আর আমি কাফিরদের গলায় শৃঙ্খল পরিয়ে দেব। তারা যা (দুনিয়াতে) করত তার প্রতিফলই তাদেরকে দেয়া হবে।', 'Those who were oppressed will say to those who were arrogant, "Rather, [it was your] conspiracy of night and day when you were ordering us to disbelieve in Allah and attribute to Him equals." But they will [all] confide regret when they see the punishment; and We will put shackles on the necks of those who disbelieved. Will they be recompensed except for what they used to do?', 'যাদেরকে দুর্বল ক’রে রাখা হয়েছিল তারা দাম্ভিকদের বলবে- তোমরাই তো বরং দিন-রাত চক্রান্ত করতে। তোমরা আমাদেরকে নির্দেশ দিতে যাতে আমরা আল্লাহকে অস্বীকার করি আর তাঁর সমকক্ষ স্থির করি। যখন তারা শাস্তি দেখবে তখন মনের অনুতাপ মনেই লুকিয়ে রাখবে, আর আমি কাফিরদের গলায় শৃঙ্খল পরিয়ে দেব। তারা যা (দুনিয়াতে) করত তার প্রতিফলই তাদেরকে দেয়া হবে।', 'Those who were oppressed will say to those who were arrogant, "Rather, [it was your] conspiracy of night and day when you were ordering us to disbelieve in Allah and attribute to Him equals." But they will [all] confide regret when they see the punishment; and We will put shackles on the necks of those who disbelieved. Will they be recompensed except for what they used to do?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034033.mp3', now()),
  (34, 34, '', '[{"id":36808,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36809,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36810,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36811,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"কোনো জনবসতির","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36812,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36813,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَّذِيرٍ","transliteration":"nadhīrin","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36814,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":36815,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36816,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُتْرَفُوهَآ","transliteration":"mut''rafūhā","translation_bn":"বিত্তশালীরা তার","root":"ترف","lemma":"مُتْرَفِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36817,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36818,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"(ঐ বিষয়ে) যা নিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36819,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُرْسِلْتُم","transliteration":"ur''sil''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রেরিত হয়েছো","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36820,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36821,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকারকারী\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36822,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā arsalnā fī qaryatin min nadhīrin illā qāla mut''rafūhā innā bimā ur''sil''tum bihi kāfirūna', 'যখনই কোন জনপদে আমি সতর্ককারী পাঠিয়েছি, সেখানকার বিত্তবানরা বলেছে তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়ে পাঠানো হয়েছে আমরা তা অস্বীকার করছি।', 'And We did not send into a city any warner except that its affluent said, "Indeed we, in that with which you were sent, are disbelievers."', 'যখনই কোন জনপদে আমি সতর্ককারী পাঠিয়েছি, সেখানকার বিত্তবানরা বলেছে তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়ে পাঠানো হয়েছে আমরা তা অস্বীকার করছি।', 'And We did not send into a city any warner except that its affluent said, "Indeed we, in that with which you were sent, are disbelievers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034034.mp3', now()),
  (34, 35, '', '[{"id":37168,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলতো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37169,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"\"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":37170,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُ","transliteration":"aktharu","translation_bn":"অধিক","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37171,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلًۭا","transliteration":"amwālan","translation_bn":"সম্পদসমূহে","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37172,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْلَـٰدًۭا","transliteration":"wa-awlādan","translation_bn":"ও সন্তানাদিতে","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37173,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37174,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":37175,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمُعَذَّبِينَ","transliteration":"bimuʿadhabīna","translation_bn":"শাস্তিপ্রাপ্ত হবো\"","root":"عذب","lemma":"مُعَذَّبِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37176,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū naḥnu aktharu amwālan wa-awlādan wamā naḥnu bimuʿadhabīna', 'তারা বলত- ধন-মাল আর বাল-বাচ্চায় আমরা বেশি, আমরা শাস্তিপ্রাপ্ত হতে পারি না।', 'And they said, "We are more [than the believers] in wealth and children, and we are not to be punished."', 'তারা বলত- ধন-মাল আর বাল-বাচ্চায় আমরা বেশি, আমরা শাস্তিপ্রাপ্ত হতে পারি না।', 'And they said, "We are more [than the believers] in wealth and children, and we are not to be punished."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034035.mp3', now()),
  (34, 36, '', '[{"id":38493,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38494,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38495,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38496,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَبْسُطُ","transliteration":"yabsuṭu","translation_bn":"প্রশস্ততা দেন","root":"بسط","lemma":"بَسَطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38497,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّزْقَ","transliteration":"l-riz''qa","translation_bn":"জীবিকায়","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38498,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"জন্যে যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38499,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38500,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقْدِرُ","transliteration":"wayaqdiru","translation_bn":"আবার পরিমিতও দেন","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38501,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38502,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38503,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38504,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":38505,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38506,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul inna rabbī yabsuṭu l-riz''qa liman yashāu wayaqdiru walākinna akthara l-nāsi lā yaʿlamūna', 'বল- আমার প্রতিপালক যার জন্য চান রিযক প্রশস্ত করেন বা সীমিত করেন, কিন্তু (এর তাৎপর্য) অধিকাংশ লোকই জানে না।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it], but most of the people do not know."', 'বল- আমার প্রতিপালক যার জন্য চান রিযক প্রশস্ত করেন বা সীমিত করেন, কিন্তু (এর তাৎপর্য) অধিকাংশ লোকই জানে না।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it], but most of the people do not know."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034036.mp3', now()),
  (34, 37, '', '[{"id":39326,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39327,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلُكُمْ","transliteration":"amwālukum","translation_bn":"সম্পদসমূহ তোমাদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39328,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39329,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلَـٰدُكُم","transliteration":"awlādukum","translation_bn":"সন্তানাদি তোমাদের","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39330,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"bi-allatī","translation_bn":"ঐসব যা (না)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39331,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُقَرِّبُكُمْ","transliteration":"tuqarribukum","translation_bn":"নিকটবর্তী করবে তোমাদেরকে","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39332,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِندَنَا","transliteration":"ʿindanā","translation_bn":"কাছে আমাদের","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":39333,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"زُلْفَىٰٓ","transliteration":"zul''fā","translation_bn":"নিকটবর্তী","root":"زلف","lemma":"زُلْفَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39334,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":39335,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39336,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39337,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلَ","transliteration":"waʿamila","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39338,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39339,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39340,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের(রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39341,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءُ","transliteration":"jazāu","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39342,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضِّعْفِ","transliteration":"l-ḍiʿ''fi","translation_bn":"বহুগুণ","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضِعْف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39343,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39344,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39345,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39346,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39347,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُرُفَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ghurufāti","translation_bn":"প্রাসাদসমূহের","root":"غرف","lemma":"غُرُفَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39348,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنُونَ","transliteration":"āminūna","translation_bn":"নিরাপদে থাকবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامِنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39349,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā amwālukum walā awlādukum bi-allatī tuqarribukum ʿindanā zul''fā illā man āmana waʿamila ṣāliḥan fa-ulāika lahum jazāu l-ḍiʿ''fi bimā ʿamilū wahum fī l-ghurufāti āminūna', 'ওটা না তোমাদের মাল-ধন, আর না তোমাদের সন্তান-সন্ততি যা তোমাদেরকে আমার নিকটবর্তী করবে। তবে যে কেউ ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে তাদেরই জন্য আছে বহুগুণ প্রতিদান তাদের কাজের জন্য। তারা সুউচ্চ প্রাসাদে নিরাপদে থাকবে।', 'And it is not your wealth or your children that bring you nearer to Us in position, but it is [by being] one who has believed and done righteousness. For them there will be the double reward for what they did, and they will be in the upper chambers [of Paradise], safe [and secure].', 'ওটা না তোমাদের মাল-ধন, আর না তোমাদের সন্তান-সন্ততি যা তোমাদেরকে আমার নিকটবর্তী করবে। তবে যে কেউ ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে তাদেরই জন্য আছে বহুগুণ প্রতিদান তাদের কাজের জন্য। তারা সুউচ্চ প্রাসাদে নিরাপদে থাকবে।', 'And it is not your wealth or your children that bring you nearer to Us in position, but it is [by being] one who has believed and done righteousness. For them there will be the double reward for what they did, and they will be in the upper chambers [of Paradise], safe [and secure].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034037.mp3', now()),
  (34, 38, '', '[{"id":40185,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40186,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"yasʿawna","translation_bn":"চেষ্টা করে","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40187,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40188,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"নিদের্শনাবলীর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40189,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُعَـٰجِزِينَ","transliteration":"muʿājizīna","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থকারী হিসেবে","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعَٰجِزِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40190,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব (লোককে)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":40191,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40192,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40193,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُحْضَرُونَ","transliteration":"muḥ''ḍarūna","translation_bn":"উপস্হিত করা হবে","root":"حضر","lemma":"مُّحْضَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40194,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna yasʿawna fī āyātinā muʿājizīna ulāika fī l-ʿadhābi muḥ''ḍarūna', 'যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহকে ব্যর্থ করার জন্য চেষ্টা চালায়, তাদেরকে ‘আযাবে উপস্থিত করা হবে।', 'And the ones who strive against Our verses to cause [them] failure - those will be brought into the punishment [to remain].', 'যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহকে ব্যর্থ করার জন্য চেষ্টা চালায়, তাদেরকে ‘আযাবে উপস্থিত করা হবে।', 'And the ones who strive against Our verses to cause [them] failure - those will be brought into the punishment [to remain].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034038.mp3', now()),
  (34, 39, '', '[{"id":40471,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40472,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40473,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40474,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَبْسُطُ","transliteration":"yabsuṭu","translation_bn":"প্রশস্ততা দেন","root":"بسط","lemma":"بَسَطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40475,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّزْقَ","transliteration":"l-riz''qa","translation_bn":"জীবিকায়","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40476,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"জন্যে যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40477,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40478,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40479,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"দাসদের তাঁর","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40480,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقْدِرُ","transliteration":"wayaqdiru","translation_bn":"আর পরিমিত দেন (যাকে চান)","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40481,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40483,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40484,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنفَقْتُم","transliteration":"anfaqtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ব্যয় করো","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40485,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40486,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40487,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40488,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُخْلِفُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"yukh''lifuhu","translation_bn":"(আরও) তার প্রতিফল দেন","root":"خلف","lemma":"أَخْلَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40490,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40491,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرُ","transliteration":"khayru","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40492,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّٰزِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-rāziqīna","translation_bn":"জীবিকাদাতা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَّٰزِقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40493,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul inna rabbī yabsuṭu l-riz''qa liman yashāu min ʿibādihi wayaqdiru lahu wamā anfaqtum min shayin fahuwa yukh''lifuhu wahuwa khayru l-rāziqīna', 'বল- আমার প্রতিপালকই তাঁর বান্দাহদের মধ্যে যার জন্য ইচ্ছে রিযক প্রশস্ত করেন, আর যার জন্য ইচ্ছে সীমিত করেন। তোমরা যা কিছু (সৎ কাজে) ব্যয় কর, তিনি তার বিনিময় দেবেন। তিনিই সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ রিযকদাতা।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord extends provision for whom He wills of His servants and restricts [it] for him. But whatever thing you spend [in His cause] - He will compensate it; and He is the best of providers."', 'বল- আমার প্রতিপালকই তাঁর বান্দাহদের মধ্যে যার জন্য ইচ্ছে রিযক প্রশস্ত করেন, আর যার জন্য ইচ্ছে সীমিত করেন। তোমরা যা কিছু (সৎ কাজে) ব্যয় কর, তিনি তার বিনিময় দেবেন। তিনিই সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ রিযকদাতা।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord extends provision for whom He wills of His servants and restricts [it] for him. But whatever thing you spend [in His cause] - He will compensate it; and He is the best of providers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034039.mp3', now()),
  (34, 40, '', '[{"id":41795,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41796,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْشُرُهُمْ","transliteration":"yaḥshuruhum","translation_bn":"তিনি একত্র করবেন তাদের","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41797,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সকলকে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41798,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41799,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُ","transliteration":"yaqūlu","translation_bn":"বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41800,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","transliteration":"lil''malāikati","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতাদেরকে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41801,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"ahāulāi","translation_bn":"\"কি এরাই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41802,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِيَّاكُمْ","transliteration":"iyyākum","translation_bn":"\"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِيَّا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":41803,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41804,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"তারা ইবাদাত করতো\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41805,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yaḥshuruhum jamīʿan thumma yaqūlu lil''malāikati ahāulāi iyyākum kānū yaʿbudūna', 'যেদিন তিনি তাদের সববাইকে একত্রিত করবেন, অতঃপর ফেরেশতাদেরকে বলবে-ওরা কি একমাত্র তোমাদেরই পূজা করত?', 'And [mention] the Day when He will gather them all and then say to the angels, "Did these [people] used to worship you?"', 'যেদিন তিনি তাদের সববাইকে একত্রিত করবেন, অতঃপর ফেরেশতাদেরকে বলবে-ওরা কি একমাত্র তোমাদেরই পূজা করত?', 'And [mention] the Day when He will gather them all and then say to the angels, "Did these [people] used to worship you?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034040.mp3', now()),
  (34, 41, '', '[{"id":42557,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42558,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَكَ","transliteration":"sub''ḥānaka","translation_bn":"\"আপনার সত্ত্বা পবিত্র","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42559,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"আপনিই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":42560,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُّنَا","transliteration":"waliyyunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42561,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42562,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِم ۖ","transliteration":"dūnihim","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42564,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":42565,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42566,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","translation_bn":"তারা ইবাদাত করতো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42567,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنَّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-jina","translation_bn":"জিনদের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42569,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُم","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42570,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِهِم","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42571,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"mu''minūna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসী (ছিলো)\"","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42572,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū sub''ḥānaka anta waliyyunā min dūnihim bal kānū yaʿbudūna l-jina aktharuhum bihim mu''minūna', 'ফেরেশতারা বলবে- পবিত্র মহান তুমি, তুমিই আমাদের অভিভাবক, তারা নয়। বরং তারা জ্বিনদের পূজা করত; ওদের অধিকাংশই ওদের প্রতি বিশ্বাসী ছিল।', 'They will say, "Exalted are You! You, [O Allah], are our benefactor not them. Rather, they used to worship the jinn; most of them were believers in them."', 'ফেরেশতারা বলবে- পবিত্র মহান তুমি, তুমিই আমাদের অভিভাবক, তারা নয়। বরং তারা জ্বিনদের পূজা করত; ওদের অধিকাংশই ওদের প্রতি বিশ্বাসী ছিল।', 'They will say, "Exalted are You! You, [O Allah], are our benefactor not them. Rather, they used to worship the jinn; most of them were believers in them."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034041.mp3', now()),
  (34, 42, '', '[{"id":43257,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"fal-yawma","translation_bn":"সুতরাং আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43258,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":43259,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَمْلِكُ","transliteration":"yamliku","translation_bn":"ক্ষমতা হবে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43260,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُكُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","translation_bn":"কেউ তোমাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43261,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِبَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"libaʿḍin","translation_bn":"জন্যে কারো","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43262,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَّفْعًۭا","transliteration":"nafʿan","translation_bn":"উপকার করার","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43263,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43264,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ضَرًّۭا","transliteration":"ḍarran","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি করার","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43265,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَنَقُولُ","transliteration":"wanaqūlu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বলবো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43266,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে (তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43267,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43268,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"dhūqū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা আস্বাদন করো","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43269,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43270,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43271,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43272,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43273,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43274,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","transliteration":"tukadhibūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করতে\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43275,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fal-yawma lā yamliku baʿḍukum libaʿḍin nafʿan walā ḍarran wanaqūlu lilladhīna ẓalamū dhūqū ʿadhāba l-nāri allatī kuntum bihā tukadhibūna', 'আজ তোমাদের একে অন্যের কোন লাভ বা ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। যারা যুলম করেছিল তাদেরকে আমি বলব- তোমরা জাহান্নামের শাস্তি আস্বাদন কর যা তোমরা মিথ্যে বলে অস্বীকার করতে।', 'But today you do not hold for one another [the power of] benefit or harm, and We will say to those who wronged, "Taste the punishment of the Fire, which you used to deny."', 'আজ তোমাদের একে অন্যের কোন লাভ বা ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। যারা যুলম করেছিল তাদেরকে আমি বলব- তোমরা জাহান্নামের শাস্তি আস্বাদন কর যা তোমরা মিথ্যে বলে অস্বীকার করতে।', 'But today you do not hold for one another [the power of] benefit or harm, and We will say to those who wronged, "Taste the punishment of the Fire, which you used to deny."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034042.mp3', now()),
  (34, 43, '', '[{"id":44025,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44026,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُتْلَىٰ","transliteration":"tut''lā","translation_bn":"তিলাওয়াত করা হয়","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44027,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"কাছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44028,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتُنَا","transliteration":"āyātunā","translation_bn":"আয়াতগুলো আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44029,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":44030,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44031,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44032,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই সে","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":44033,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":44034,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَجُلٌۭ","transliteration":"rajulun","translation_bn":"একজন মানুষ","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44035,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"সে চায়","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44036,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":44037,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَصُدَّكُمْ","transliteration":"yaṣuddakum","translation_bn":"বাধা দিবে তোমাদিগকে","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44038,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"(ঐগুলো) হ''তে যার","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44039,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44040,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَعْبُدُ","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","translation_bn":"ইবাদাত করে এসেছে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44041,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُكُمْ","transliteration":"ābāukum","translation_bn":"পিতৃপুরুষরা তোমাদের\"","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44042,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44043,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44044,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই (কুরআন)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":44045,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":44046,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِفْكٌۭ","transliteration":"if''kun","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা রচনা","root":"افك","lemma":"إِفْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44047,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مُّفْتَرًۭى ۚ","transliteration":"muf''taran","translation_bn":"মনগড়া\"","root":"فري","lemma":"مُّفْتَرًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44049,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44050,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":44051,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44052,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لِلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"lil''ḥaqqi","translation_bn":"প্রতি সত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44053,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":44054,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"এসেছে তাদের (কাছে)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44055,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44056,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":44057,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":44058,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"سِحْرٌۭ","transliteration":"siḥ''run","translation_bn":"জাদু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44059,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44060,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā tut''lā ʿalayhim āyātunā bayyinātin qālū mā hādhā illā rajulun yurīdu an yaṣuddakum ʿammā kāna yaʿbudu ābāukum waqālū mā hādhā illā if''kun muf''taran waqāla alladhīna kafarū lil''ḥaqqi lammā jāahum in hādhā illā siḥ''run mubīnun', 'তাদের সম্মুখে যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াতসমূহ তিলাওয়াত করা হয় তখন তারা বলে- এটা তো এমন একজন মানুষ, যে তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের পূর্বপুরুষ যার ‘ইবাদাত করত তাত্থেকে বাধা দিতে চায়। তারা আরো বলে যে, এটা মনগড়া মিথ্যে ছাড়া আর কিছুই নয়। সত্য যখন কাফিরদের নিকট আসে তখন তারা বলে- এটা তো সুস্পষ্ট যাদু।', 'And when our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, they say, "This is not but a man who wishes to avert you from that which your fathers were worshipping." And they say, "This is not except a lie invented." And those who disbelieve say of the truth when it has come to them, "This is not but obvious magic."', 'তাদের সম্মুখে যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াতসমূহ তিলাওয়াত করা হয় তখন তারা বলে- এটা তো এমন একজন মানুষ, যে তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের পূর্বপুরুষ যার ‘ইবাদাত করত তাত্থেকে বাধা দিতে চায়। তারা আরো বলে যে, এটা মনগড়া মিথ্যে ছাড়া আর কিছুই নয়। সত্য যখন কাফিরদের নিকট আসে তখন তারা বলে- এটা তো সুস্পষ্ট যাদু।', 'And when our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, they say, "This is not but a man who wishes to avert you from that which your fathers were worshipping." And they say, "This is not except a lie invented." And those who disbelieve say of the truth when it has come to them, "This is not but obvious magic."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034043.mp3', now()),
  (34, 44, '', '[{"id":44811,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"অথচ না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44812,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি তাদেরকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44813,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(কোন কিতাব) মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44814,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُتُبٍۢ","transliteration":"kutubin","translation_bn":"কিতাবসমূহের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44815,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَدْرُسُونَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"yadrusūnahā","translation_bn":"তারা অধ্যয়ন করতো যা","root":"درس","lemma":"دَرَسُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44817,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44818,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَآ","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"পাঠিয়েছি অামরা","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44819,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44820,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَكَ","transliteration":"qablaka","translation_bn":"পূর্বে তোমার","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":44821,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44822,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَّذِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"nadhīrin","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44823,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ātaynāhum min kutubin yadrusūnahā wamā arsalnā ilayhim qablaka min nadhīrin', 'আমি তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ মক্কার কুরায়শদের) কোন কিতাব দেইনি যা তারা পাঠ করত আর আমি তোমার পূর্বে তাদের কাছে কোন সতর্ককারীও পাঠাইনি।', 'And We had not given them any scriptures which they could study, and We had not sent to them before you, [O Muhammad], any warner.', 'আমি তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ মক্কার কুরায়শদের) কোন কিতাব দেইনি যা তারা পাঠ করত আর আমি তোমার পূর্বে তাদের কাছে কোন সতর্ককারীও পাঠাইনি।', 'And We had not given them any scriptures which they could study, and We had not sent to them before you, [O Muhammad], any warner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034044.mp3', now()),
  (34, 45, '', '[{"id":45449,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَّبَ","transliteration":"wakadhaba","translation_bn":"এবং মিথ্যারোপ করেছিলো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45450,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাও) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45451,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45452,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"পূর্ব (ছিলো)তাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45453,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45454,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَلَغُوا۟","transliteration":"balaghū","translation_bn":"(এদের কাছে) পৌঁছেছে","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45455,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِعْشَارَ","transliteration":"miʿ''shāra","translation_bn":"দশ ভাগের এক ভাগও","root":"عشر","lemma":"مِعْشَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45456,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45457,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা (ওদেরকে) দিয়েছিলাম","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45458,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَكَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"fakadhabū","translation_bn":"কিন্তু মিথ্যারোপ করেছিলো ওরা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45459,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلِى ۖ","transliteration":"rusulī","translation_bn":"রাসূলদেরকে আমার","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45461,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَكَيْفَ","transliteration":"fakayfa","translation_bn":"(দেখো) তখন কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45462,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45463,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَكِيرِ","transliteration":"nakīri","translation_bn":"আমার শাস্তি","root":"نكر","lemma":"نَكِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45464,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhaba alladhīna min qablihim wamā balaghū miʿ''shāra mā ātaynāhum fakadhabū rusulī fakayfa kāna nakīri', 'তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও (সত্যকে) মিথ্যে বলে অস্বীকার করেছিল। আমি তাদেরকে যা দিয়েছিলাম, এরা তার এক দশমাংশও পায়নি। তবুও ওরা যখন আমার রসূলগণকে অস্বীকার করেছিল তখন কত ভয়ংকর হয়েছিল আমার শাস্তি।', 'And those before them denied, and the people of Makkah have not attained a tenth of what We had given them. But the former peoples denied My messengers, so how [terrible] was My reproach.', 'তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও (সত্যকে) মিথ্যে বলে অস্বীকার করেছিল। আমি তাদেরকে যা দিয়েছিলাম, এরা তার এক দশমাংশও পায়নি। তবুও ওরা যখন আমার রসূলগণকে অস্বীকার করেছিল তখন কত ভয়ংকর হয়েছিল আমার শাস্তি।', 'And those before them denied, and the people of Makkah have not attained a tenth of what We had given them. But the former peoples denied My messengers, so how [terrible] was My reproach.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034045.mp3', now()),
  (34, 46, '', '[{"id":45667,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45668,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45669,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَعِظُكُم","transliteration":"aʿiẓukum","translation_bn":"আমি উপদেশ দিচ্ছি তোমাদেরকে","root":"وعظ","lemma":"وَعَظْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45670,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِوَٰحِدَةٍ ۖ","transliteration":"biwāḥidatin","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে একটি (বিষয়)","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45672,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":45673,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَقُومُوا۟","transliteration":"taqūmū","translation_bn":"তোমরা দাঁড়াও","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45674,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে আল্লাহ তা''লার","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45675,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَثْنَىٰ","transliteration":"mathnā","translation_bn":"দুই দুই জন","root":"ثني","lemma":"مَثْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45676,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَفُرَٰدَىٰ","transliteration":"wafurādā","translation_bn":"অথবা এক এক জন","root":"فرد","lemma":"فُرَٰدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45677,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45678,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَتَفَكَّرُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"tatafakkarū","translation_bn":"তোমরা চিন্তা করে দেখো\"","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45680,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":45681,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِصَاحِبِكُم","transliteration":"biṣāḥibikum","translation_bn":"মধ্যে সাথীর তোমাদের","root":"صحب","lemma":"صَاحِب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45682,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45683,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"جِنَّةٍ ۚ","transliteration":"jinnatin","translation_bn":"পাগলামীর (লেশমাত্রও)","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45685,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":45686,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":45687,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":45688,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"nadhīrun","translation_bn":"একজন সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45689,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45690,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":45691,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَدَىْ","transliteration":"yaday","translation_bn":"হাতের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45692,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45693,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"shadīdin","translation_bn":"কঠোর\"","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":45694,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul innamā aʿiẓukum biwāḥidatin an taqūmū lillahi mathnā wafurādā thumma tatafakkarū mā biṣāḥibikum min jinnatin in huwa illā nadhīrun lakum bayna yaday ʿadhābin shadīdin', 'বল- আমি তোমাদেরকে একটি বিষয়ে নসীহত করছিঃ তোমরা আল্লাহর উদ্দেশ্যে দু’ দু’জন বা এক একজন করে দাঁড়াও, অতঃপর চিন্তা করে দেখ, তোমাদের সঙ্গী উন্মাদ নয়। সে তো সামনের কঠিন শাস্তি সম্পর্কে একজন সতর্ককারী মাত্র।', 'Say, "I only advise you of one [thing] - that you stand for Allah, [seeking truth] in pairs and individually, and then give thought." There is not in your companion any madness. He is only a warner to you before a severe punishment.', 'বল- আমি তোমাদেরকে একটি বিষয়ে নসীহত করছিঃ তোমরা আল্লাহর উদ্দেশ্যে দু’ দু’জন বা এক একজন করে দাঁড়াও, অতঃপর চিন্তা করে দেখ, তোমাদের সঙ্গী উন্মাদ নয়। সে তো সামনের কঠিন শাস্তি সম্পর্কে একজন সতর্ককারী মাত্র।', 'Say, "I only advise you of one [thing] - that you stand for Allah, [seeking truth] in pairs and individually, and then give thought." There is not in your companion any madness. He is only a warner to you before a severe punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034046.mp3', now()),
  (34, 47, '', '[{"id":46878,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46879,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"(যা) কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46880,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَأَلْتُكُم","transliteration":"sa-altukum","translation_bn":"আমি চেয়ে থাকি কাছে তোমাদের","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46881,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46882,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرٍۢ","transliteration":"ajrin","translation_bn":"পারিশ্রমিক","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46883,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46884,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46886,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"(মূলতঃ) নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46887,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرِىَ","transliteration":"ajriya","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার আমার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46888,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":46889,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46890,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46892,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46893,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46894,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46895,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46896,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"shahīdun","translation_bn":"প্রত্যক্ষ সাক্ষী\"","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":46897,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul mā sa-altukum min ajrin fahuwa lakum in ajriya illā ʿalā l-lahi wahuwa ʿalā kulli shayin shahīdun', 'বল- আমি তোমাদের নিকট হতে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাই না, বরং তা তোমাদেরই জন্য। আমার পুরস্কার আছে কেবল আল্লাহর কাছে। তিনি সকল বিষয়ে প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'Say, "Whatever payment I might have asked of you - it is yours. My payment is only from Allah, and He is, over all things, Witness."', 'বল- আমি তোমাদের নিকট হতে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাই না, বরং তা তোমাদেরই জন্য। আমার পুরস্কার আছে কেবল আল্লাহর কাছে। তিনি সকল বিষয়ে প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'Say, "Whatever payment I might have asked of you - it is yours. My payment is only from Allah, and He is, over all things, Witness."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034047.mp3', now()),
  (34, 48, '', '[{"id":47104,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47105,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47106,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47107,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَقْذِفُ","transliteration":"yaqdhifu","translation_bn":"নিক্ষেপ করেন (মিথ্যার উপর)","root":"قذف","lemma":"قَذَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47108,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে সত্যকে (সত্যকে উদ্ভাসিত করতে)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47109,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَّـٰمُ","transliteration":"ʿallāmu","translation_bn":"(তিনি) খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلَّٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":47110,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُيُوبِ","transliteration":"l-ghuyūbi","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যসমূহের (বিষয়ে)\"","root":"غيب","lemma":"غُيُوب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47111,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul inna rabbī yaqdhifu bil-ḥaqi ʿallāmu l-ghuyūbi', 'বল- আমার প্রতিপালক সত্য ছুঁড়ে দেন (অসত্যকে আঘাত করার জন্যে)। (যাবতীয়) অদৃশ্য সম্পর্কে তিনি পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord projects the truth. Knower of the unseen."', 'বল- আমার প্রতিপালক সত্য ছুঁড়ে দেন (অসত্যকে আঘাত করার জন্যে)। (যাবতীয়) অদৃশ্য সম্পর্কে তিনি পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord projects the truth. Knower of the unseen."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034048.mp3', now()),
  (34, 49, '', '[{"id":48281,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48282,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"\"এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48283,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48284,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48285,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُبْدِئُ","transliteration":"yub''di-u","translation_bn":"নতুন সৃষ্টি করতে পারে","root":"بدا","lemma":"يُبْدِئُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48286,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَـٰطِلُ","transliteration":"l-bāṭilu","translation_bn":"অসত্য","root":"بطل","lemma":"بَٰطِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48287,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48288,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُعِيدُ","transliteration":"yuʿīdu","translation_bn":"পুনরাবৃত্তি করতে (অর্থাৎ কিছুই পারে না)\"","root":"عود","lemma":"أُعِيدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48289,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul jāa l-ḥaqu wamā yub''di-u l-bāṭilu wamā yuʿīdu', 'বল- সত্য এসে গেছে, আর মিথ্যের নতুন করে আবির্ভাবও ঘটবে না, আর তার পুনরাবৃত্তিও হবে না।', 'Say, "The truth has come, and falsehood can neither begin [anything] nor repeat [it]."', 'বল- সত্য এসে গেছে, আর মিথ্যের নতুন করে আবির্ভাবও ঘটবে না, আর তার পুনরাবৃত্তিও হবে না।', 'Say, "The truth has come, and falsehood can neither begin [anything] nor repeat [it]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034049.mp3', now()),
  (34, 50, '', '[{"id":48476,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48477,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":48478,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَلْتُ","transliteration":"ḍalaltu","translation_bn":"আমি পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে থাকি","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48479,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"তবে মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48480,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَضِلُّ","transliteration":"aḍillu","translation_bn":"আমি পথভ্রষ্ট হবো","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48481,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48482,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسِى ۖ","transliteration":"nafsī","translation_bn":"আমার নিজের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48484,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِ","transliteration":"wa-ini","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48485,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَدَيْتُ","transliteration":"ih''tadaytu","translation_bn":"আমি সঠিক পথ পেয়ে থাকি","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48486,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَبِمَا","transliteration":"fabimā","translation_bn":"তবে এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48487,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُوحِىٓ","transliteration":"yūḥī","translation_bn":"ওহী করেন","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48488,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"আমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48489,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّىٓ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48491,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48492,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌۭ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"খুব শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48493,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبٌۭ","transliteration":"qarībun","translation_bn":"নিকট (আছেন)\"","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48494,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul in ḍalaltu fa-innamā aḍillu ʿalā nafsī wa-ini ih''tadaytu fabimā yūḥī ilayya rabbī innahu samīʿun qarībun', 'বল- আমি যদি গুমরাহ হই, তবে নিজের ক্ষতি করতেই গুমরাহ হব। আর আমি যদি সৎ পথে চলি, তবে আমার প্রতিপালক যে আমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করেন তার বদৌলতেই। তিনি সর্বশ্রোতা, (সদা) সন্নিকটবর্তী। (আহবানকারীর ডাকে সাড়া দেন।)', 'Say, "If I should err, I would only err against myself. But if I am guided, it is by what my Lord reveals to me. Indeed, He is Hearing and near."', 'বল- আমি যদি গুমরাহ হই, তবে নিজের ক্ষতি করতেই গুমরাহ হব। আর আমি যদি সৎ পথে চলি, তবে আমার প্রতিপালক যে আমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করেন তার বদৌলতেই। তিনি সর্বশ্রোতা, (সদা) সন্নিকটবর্তী। (আহবানকারীর ডাকে সাড়া দেন।)', 'Say, "If I should err, I would only err against myself. But if I am guided, it is by what my Lord reveals to me. Indeed, He is Hearing and near."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034050.mp3', now()),
  (34, 51, '', '[{"id":49553,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49554,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"tarā","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখতে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49555,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":49556,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَزِعُوا۟","transliteration":"faziʿū","translation_bn":"তারা ভয়ে বিহ্বল হবে","root":"فزع","lemma":"فَزِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49557,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49558,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَوْتَ","transliteration":"fawta","translation_bn":"পালাতে পারবে","root":"فوت","lemma":"فَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49559,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأُخِذُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ukhidhū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ধরা পড়বে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49560,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49561,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَانٍۢ","transliteration":"makānin","translation_bn":"স্হান","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49562,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبٍۢ","transliteration":"qarībin","translation_bn":"নিকটবর্তী","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49563,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw tarā idh faziʿū falā fawta wa-ukhidhū min makānin qarībin', 'তুমি যদি দেখতে! যখন তারা ভয়ে কম্পমান হয়ে পড়বে, কিন্তু তারা কোন অব্যাহতি পাবে না। এক্কেবারে কাছের জায়গা থেকেই তাদেরকে ধরে ফেলা হবে।', 'And if you could see when they are terrified but there is no escape, and they will be seized from a place nearby.', 'তুমি যদি দেখতে! যখন তারা ভয়ে কম্পমান হয়ে পড়বে, কিন্তু তারা কোন অব্যাহতি পাবে না। এক্কেবারে কাছের জায়গা থেকেই তাদেরকে ধরে ফেলা হবে।', 'And if you could see when they are terrified but there is no escape, and they will be seized from a place nearby.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034051.mp3', now()),
  (34, 52, '', '[{"id":49798,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49799,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা ঈমান এনেছি","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49800,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাঁর\"","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49801,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"wa-annā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু কোথায়","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49802,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (সম্ভব হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49803,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّنَاوُشُ","transliteration":"l-tanāwushu","translation_bn":"(ঈমানের) নাগাল পাওয়া","root":"نوش","lemma":"تَّنَاوُش","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49804,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49805,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَانٍۭ","transliteration":"makānin","translation_bn":"স্হান","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49806,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿīdin","translation_bn":"দূরবর্তী","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49807,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū āmannā bihi wa-annā lahumu l-tanāwushu min makānin baʿīdin', 'আর তারা বলবে- (এখন) আমরা ঈমান আনলাম। কিন্তু (ঈমান যেখানে আনতে হত সে স্থান থেকে তারা তো বহু দূরে এসে পড়েছে) এত দূরের জায়গা থেকে তারা ঈমানের নাগাল পাবে কীভাবে?', 'And they will [then] say, "We believe in it!" But how for them will be the taking [of faith] from a place far away?', 'আর তারা বলবে- (এখন) আমরা ঈমান আনলাম। কিন্তু (ঈমান যেখানে আনতে হত সে স্থান থেকে তারা তো বহু দূরে এসে পড়েছে) এত দূরের জায়গা থেকে তারা ঈমানের নাগাল পাবে কীভাবে?', 'And they will [then] say, "We believe in it!" But how for them will be the taking [of faith] from a place far away?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034052.mp3', now()),
  (34, 53, '', '[{"id":50841,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"অথচ নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50842,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিলো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50843,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"প্রতি তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50844,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50845,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۖ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50847,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقْذِفُونَ","transliteration":"wayaqdhifūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা (আনুমানিক কথা)ছুঁড়ে মারতো","root":"قذف","lemma":"قَذَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50848,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","translation_bn":"বিষয়ে অদৃশ্য","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50849,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50850,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَانٍۭ","transliteration":"makānin","translation_bn":"স্হান","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50851,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَعِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿīdin","translation_bn":"দূরবর্তী","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50852,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqad kafarū bihi min qablu wayaqdhifūna bil-ghaybi min makānin baʿīdin', 'তারা তো আগেই তা প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছিল। তারা অদৃশ্য বিষয় সম্পর্কে বহু দূর থেকে (আন্দাজ অনুমানে) কথা ছুঁড়ে দিত।', 'And they had already disbelieved in it before and would assault the unseen from a place far away.', 'তারা তো আগেই তা প্রত্যাখ্যান করেছিল। তারা অদৃশ্য বিষয় সম্পর্কে বহু দূর থেকে (আন্দাজ অনুমানে) কথা ছুঁড়ে দিত।', 'And they had already disbelieved in it before and would assault the unseen from a place far away.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034053.mp3', now()),
  (34, 54, '', '[{"id":51035,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَحِيلَ","transliteration":"waḥīla","translation_bn":"এবং অন্তরাল করা হবে","root":"حول","lemma":"حَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51036,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":51037,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَ","transliteration":"wabayna","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে (ঐসব জিনিসের)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51038,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51039,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَشْتَهُونَ","transliteration":"yashtahūna","translation_bn":"তারা বাসনা করবে (অর্থাৎ তা হ''তে বঞ্চিত করা হবে)","root":"شهو","lemma":"ٱشْتَهَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51040,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51041,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فُعِلَ","transliteration":"fuʿila","translation_bn":"করা হয়েছিলো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51042,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِأَشْيَاعِهِم","transliteration":"bi-ashyāʿihim","translation_bn":"সাথে তাদের (একমনা) দলগুলোর (ক্ষেত্রে)","root":"شيع","lemma":"شِيعَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51043,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51044,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۚ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51046,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51047,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51048,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51049,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَكٍّۢ","transliteration":"shakkin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"شكك","lemma":"شَكّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51050,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّرِيبٍۭ","transliteration":"murībin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তিকর","root":"ريب","lemma":"مُرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51051,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waḥīla baynahum wabayna mā yashtahūna kamā fuʿila bi-ashyāʿihim min qablu innahum kānū fī shakkin murībin', 'তাদের এবং তাদের কামনা-বাসনার মাঝে রেখে দেয়া হয়েছে এক প্রাচীর। তাদের মতের ও পথের লোকেদের ক্ষেত্রে পূর্বেও এমনটিই করা হয়েছিল। তারা ছিল সংশয়পূর্ণ সন্দেহে পতিত।', 'And prevention will be placed between them and what they desire, as was done with their kind before. Indeed, they were in disquieting denial.', 'তাদের এবং তাদের কামনা-বাসনার মাঝে রেখে দেয়া হয়েছে এক প্রাচীর। তাদের মতের ও পথের লোকেদের ক্ষেত্রে পূর্বেও এমনটিই করা হয়েছিল। তারা ছিল সংশয়পূর্ণ সন্দেহে পতিত।', 'And prevention will be placed between them and what they desire, as was done with their kind before. Indeed, they were in disquieting denial.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/034054.mp3', now())
