"translation_bn":"গর্ভধারণ করে","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13275,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13276,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أُنثَىٰ","transliteration":"unthā","translation_bn":"নারী","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13277,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13278,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَضَعُ","transliteration":"taḍaʿu","translation_bn":"প্রসব করে সে","root":"وضع","lemma":"وَضَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13279,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":13280,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِعِلْمِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"biʿil''mihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর জানা থাকে","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13282,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13283,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يُعَمَّرُ","transliteration":"yuʿammaru","translation_bn":"আয়ু বৃদ্ধি পায়","root":"عمر","lemma":"يُعَمَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13284,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13285,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مُّعَمَّرٍۢ","transliteration":"muʿammarin","translation_bn":"বয়স্কলোকের","root":"عمر","lemma":"مُّعَمَّر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13286,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13287,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يُنقَصُ","transliteration":"yunqaṣu","translation_bn":"কমিয়ে দেওয়া হয়","root":"نقص","lemma":"يُنقَصُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13288,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13289,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عُمُرِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"ʿumurihi","translation_bn":"তার আয়ু","root":"عمر","lemma":"عُمُر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13290,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":13291,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13292,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٍ ۚ","transliteration":"kitābin","translation_bn":"একটি কিতাবে (লিখিত)","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13294,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":13295,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"সেটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":13296,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13297,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13298,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"yasīrun","translation_bn":"(খুব)সহজ","root":"يسر","lemma":"يَسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13299,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu khalaqakum min turābin thumma min nuṭ''fatin thumma jaʿalakum azwājan wamā taḥmilu min unthā walā taḍaʿu illā biʿil''mihi wamā yuʿammaru min muʿammarin walā yunqaṣu min ʿumurihi illā fī kitābin inna dhālika ʿalā l-lahi yasīrun', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে মাটি থেকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর শুক্র-বিন্দু হতে, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদেরকে করেছেন (স্বামী-স্ত্রীর) জোড়া। তাঁর অবগতি ব্যতীত কোন নারী গর্ভ ধারণ করে না বা (তার বোঝা) হালকা করে না। কোন দীর্ঘায়ুর আয়ু দীর্ঘ করা হয় না, আর তার আয়ু কমানো হয় না কিতাবের লিখন ছাড়া। এটা (অর্থাৎ এ সবের হিসাব রাখা ও তত্ত্বাবধান করা) আল্লাহর জন্য সহজ।', 'And Allah created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop; then He made you mates. And no female conceives nor does she give birth except with His knowledge. And no aged person is granted [additional] life nor is his lifespan lessened but that it is in a register. Indeed, that for Allah is easy.', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে মাটি থেকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, অতঃপর শুক্র-বিন্দু হতে, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদেরকে করেছেন (স্বামী-স্ত্রীর) জোড়া। তাঁর অবগতি ব্যতীত কোন নারী গর্ভ ধারণ করে না বা (তার বোঝা) হালকা করে না। কোন দীর্ঘায়ুর আয়ু দীর্ঘ করা হয় না, আর তার আয়ু কমানো হয় না কিতাবের লিখন ছাড়া। এটা (অর্থাৎ এ সবের হিসাব রাখা ও তত্ত্বাবধান করা) আল্লাহর জন্য সহজ।', 'And Allah created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop; then He made you mates. And no female conceives nor does she give birth except with His knowledge. And no aged person is granted [additional] life nor is his lifespan lessened but that it is in a register. Indeed, that for Allah is easy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035011.mp3', now()),
  (35, 12, '', '[{"id":14560,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14561,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14562,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرَانِ","transliteration":"l-baḥrāni","translation_bn":"দুই সাগর","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14563,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"যেমন (এটা)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":14564,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَذْبٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhbun","translation_bn":"সুমিষ্ট","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14565,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فُرَاتٌۭ","transliteration":"furātun","translation_bn":"সুপেয়","root":"فرت","lemma":"فُرَات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14566,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَآئِغٌۭ","transliteration":"sāighun","translation_bn":"সহজ পেয়","root":"سوغ","lemma":"سَا^ئِغ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14567,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَرَابُهُۥ","transliteration":"sharābuhu","translation_bn":"তার পানীয়","root":"شرب","lemma":"شَرَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14568,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"আর ওটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14569,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِلْحٌ","transliteration":"mil''ḥun","translation_bn":"লোনা","root":"ملح","lemma":"مِلْح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14570,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُجَاجٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ujājun","translation_bn":"বিস্বাদ","root":"اجج","lemma":"أُجَاج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14572,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14573,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُلٍّۢ","transliteration":"kullin","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেকটা","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14574,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُونَ","transliteration":"takulūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14575,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَحْمًۭا","transliteration":"laḥman","translation_bn":"গোশত (মাছ)","root":"لحم","lemma":"لَحْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14576,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"طَرِيًّۭا","transliteration":"ṭariyyan","translation_bn":"তাজা","root":"طرو","lemma":"طَرِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14577,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَتَسْتَخْرِجُونَ","transliteration":"watastakhrijūna","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা বের করো","root":"خرج","lemma":"ٱسْتَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14578,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"حِلْيَةًۭ","transliteration":"ḥil''yatan","translation_bn":"অলংকার (অর্থাৎ মনি-মুক্তা)","root":"حلي","lemma":"حِلْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14579,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَلْبَسُونَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"talbasūnahā","translation_bn":"তা তোমরা পরিধান করো","root":"لبس","lemma":"لَبَسْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14581,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَتَرَى","transliteration":"watarā","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14582,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُلْكَ","transliteration":"l-ful''ka","translation_bn":"নৌকাগুলো","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14583,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14584,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَوَاخِرَ","transliteration":"mawākhira","translation_bn":"পানিবিদীর্ণ করে চলে","root":"مخر","lemma":"مَوَاخِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14585,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لِتَبْتَغُوا۟","transliteration":"litabtaghū","translation_bn":"তোমরা খোঁজ করতে পারো যেন","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14586,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14587,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14588,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"walaʿallakum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14589,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"تَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashkurūna","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14590,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā yastawī l-baḥrāni hādhā ʿadhbun furātun sāighun sharābuhu wahādhā mil''ḥun ujājun wamin kullin takulūna laḥman ṭariyyan watastakhrijūna ḥil''yatan talbasūnahā watarā l-ful''ka fīhi mawākhira litabtaghū min faḍlihi walaʿallakum tashkurūna', 'দু’টি দরিয়াও এক রকম নয়। একটি সুমিষ্ট, সুস্বাদু, সুপেয়; অন্যটি লবণাক্ত, বিস্বাদ। তথাপি তোমরা সকল (প্রকার পানি) থেকে তাজা গোশত আহার কর আর বের কর অলংকার- পরিধান করার জন্যে। তোমরা দেখতে পাও নৌযানগুলো ঢেউয়ের বুক চিরে চলাচল করে যাতে তোমরা তাঁর অনুগ্রহ খোঁজ করতে পার, আর যাতে তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর।', 'And not alike are the two bodies of water. One is fresh and sweet, palatable for drinking, and one is salty and bitter. And from each you eat tender meat and extract ornaments which you wear, and you see the ships plowing through [them] that you might seek of His bounty; and perhaps you will be grateful.', 'দু’টি দরিয়াও এক রকম নয়। একটি সুমিষ্ট, সুস্বাদু, সুপেয়; অন্যটি লবণাক্ত, বিস্বাদ। তথাপি তোমরা সকল (প্রকার পানি) থেকে তাজা গোশত আহার কর আর বের কর অলংকার- পরিধান করার জন্যে। তোমরা দেখতে পাও নৌযানগুলো ঢেউয়ের বুক চিরে চলাচল করে যাতে তোমরা তাঁর অনুগ্রহ খোঁজ করতে পার, আর যাতে তোমরা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ কর।', 'And not alike are the two bodies of water. One is fresh and sweet, palatable for drinking, and one is salty and bitter. And from each you eat tender meat and extract ornaments which you wear, and you see the ships plowing through [them] that you might seek of His bounty; and perhaps you will be grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035012.mp3', now()),
  (35, 13, '', '[{"id":15655,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُولِجُ","transliteration":"yūliju","translation_bn":"তিনি প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15656,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15657,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15658,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15659,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيُولِجُ","transliteration":"wayūliju","translation_bn":"এবং প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15660,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"l-nahāra","translation_bn":"দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15661,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15662,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15663,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَسَخَّرَ","transliteration":"wasakhara","translation_bn":"এবং নিয়ন্ত্রিত করেছেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15664,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّمْسَ","transliteration":"l-shamsa","translation_bn":"সূর্যকে","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15665,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ","transliteration":"wal-qamara","translation_bn":"ও চাঁদকে","root":"قمر","lemma":"قَمَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15666,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُلٌّۭ","transliteration":"kullun","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেকেই","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15667,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَجْرِى","transliteration":"yajrī","translation_bn":"(পরিভ্রমণ করে) আবর্তন করে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15668,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِأَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"li-ajalin","translation_bn":"একটি সময়ের জন্যে","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15669,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۚ","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15671,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","transliteration":"dhālikumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":15672,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ-ই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15673,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15674,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15675,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُلْكُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-mul''ku","translation_bn":"সার্বভৌমত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15677,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15678,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15679,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15680,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15681,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":15682,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَمْلِكُونَ","transliteration":"yamlikūna","translation_bn":"(তারা অধিকারী) অধিকার রাখে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15683,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15684,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"قِطْمِيرٍ","transliteration":"qiṭ''mīrin","translation_bn":"(তুচ্ছাতিতুচ্ছ বস্তুর) খেজুরের আঁটির পর্দা","root":"قطمر","lemma":"قِطْمِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15685,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yūliju al-layla fī l-nahāri wayūliju l-nahāra fī al-layli wasakhara l-shamsa wal-qamara kullun yajrī li-ajalin musamman dhālikumu l-lahu rabbukum lahu l-mul''ku wa-alladhīna tadʿūna min dūnihi mā yamlikūna min qiṭ''mīrin', 'তিনি রাতকে দিনে ঢুকিয়ে দেন, আর দিনকে রাতে ঢুকিয়ে দেন। তিনি সূর্য ও চন্দ্রকে তাঁর নিয়ন্ত্রণের অধীনে (কাজে নিয়োজিত) রেখেছেন। প্রত্যেকেই নির্ধারিত সময় অনুসারে গতিশীল আছে। এই হলেন আল্লাহ, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক। রাজত্ব তাঁরই। তোমরা তাঁর পরিবর্তে যাদেরকে ডাক তারা তো খেজুরের অাঁটি সংলগ্ন (অত্যন্ত পাতলা ও দুর্বল) আবরণেরও মালিক নয়।', 'He causes the night to enter the day, and He causes the day to enter the night and has subjected the sun and the moon - each running [its course] for a specified term. That is Allah, your Lord; to Him belongs sovereignty. And those whom you invoke other than Him do not possess [as much as] the membrane of a date seed.', 'তিনি রাতকে দিনে ঢুকিয়ে দেন, আর দিনকে রাতে ঢুকিয়ে দেন। তিনি সূর্য ও চন্দ্রকে তাঁর নিয়ন্ত্রণের অধীনে (কাজে নিয়োজিত) রেখেছেন। প্রত্যেকেই নির্ধারিত সময় অনুসারে গতিশীল আছে। এই হলেন আল্লাহ, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক। রাজত্ব তাঁরই। তোমরা তাঁর পরিবর্তে যাদেরকে ডাক তারা তো খেজুরের অাঁটি সংলগ্ন (অত্যন্ত পাতলা ও দুর্বল) আবরণেরও মালিক নয়।', 'He causes the night to enter the day, and He causes the day to enter the night and has subjected the sun and the moon - each running [its course] for a specified term. That is Allah, your Lord; to Him belongs sovereignty. And those whom you invoke other than Him do not possess [as much as] the membrane of a date seed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035013.mp3', now()),
  (35, 14, '', '[{"id":16713,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":16714,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُوهُمْ","transliteration":"tadʿūhum","translation_bn":"তোমরা তাদেরকে ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16715,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":16716,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُوا۟","transliteration":"yasmaʿū","translation_bn":"তারা শুনতে পায়","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16717,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دُعَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"duʿāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ডাক","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16718,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16719,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعُوا۟","transliteration":"samiʿū","translation_bn":"তারা শুনেও","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16720,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":16721,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَجَابُوا۟","transliteration":"is''tajābū","translation_bn":"তারা সাড়া দিতে পারে","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16722,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16724,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16725,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16726,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَكْفُرُونَ","transliteration":"yakfurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অস্বীকার করবে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16727,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِشِرْكِكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"bishir''kikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের শিরককে","root":"شرك","lemma":"شِرْك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16729,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16730,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُنَبِّئُكَ","transliteration":"yunabbi-uka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে জানাতে পারে কেউ","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16731,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلُ","transliteration":"mith''lu","translation_bn":"মতো","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16732,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"khabīrin","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ আল্লাহর","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":16733,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in tadʿūhum lā yasmaʿū duʿāakum walaw samiʿū mā is''tajābū lakum wayawma l-qiyāmati yakfurūna bishir''kikum walā yunabbi-uka mith''lu khabīrin', 'তোমরা তাদেরকে ডাকলে তারা তোমাদের ডাক শুনবে না আর যদি শুনেও, তবুও তোমাদের (ডাকে) সাড়া দিতে পারবে না। আর তোমরা যে তাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার গণ্য করতে, ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তা তারা অস্বীকার করবে। কেউই তোমাদেরকে সর্বজ্ঞ আল্লাহর মত খবর জানাতে পারবে না।', 'If you invoke them, they do not hear your supplication; and if they heard, they would not respond to you. And on the Day of Resurrection they will deny your association. And none can inform you like [one] Acquainted [with all matters].', 'তোমরা তাদেরকে ডাকলে তারা তোমাদের ডাক শুনবে না আর যদি শুনেও, তবুও তোমাদের (ডাকে) সাড়া দিতে পারবে না। আর তোমরা যে তাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার গণ্য করতে, ক্বিয়ামতের দিন তা তারা অস্বীকার করবে। কেউই তোমাদেরকে সর্বজ্ঞ আল্লাহর মত খবর জানাতে পারবে না।', 'If you invoke them, they do not hear your supplication; and if they heard, they would not respond to you. And on the Day of Resurrection they will deny your association. And none can inform you like [one] Acquainted [with all matters].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035014.mp3', now()),
  (35, 15, '', '[{"id":17895,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":17896,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানব সম্প্রদায়","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17897,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمُ","transliteration":"antumu","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":17898,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُقَرَآءُ","transliteration":"l-fuqarāu","translation_bn":"মুখাপেক্ষী","root":"فقر","lemma":"فَقِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17899,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17900,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":17902,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"কিন্তু আল্লাহ (এমন যে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":17903,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":17904,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17905,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdu","translation_bn":"প্রশংসিত","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17906,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu antumu l-fuqarāu ilā l-lahi wal-lahu huwa l-ghaniyu l-ḥamīdu', 'হে মানুষ! তোমরাই আল্লাহর মুখাপেক্ষী, আর আল্লাহ তিনি তো অভাবহীন, প্রশংসিত।', 'O mankind, you are those in need of Allah, while Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', 'হে মানুষ! তোমরাই আল্লাহর মুখাপেক্ষী, আর আল্লাহ তিনি তো অভাবহীন, প্রশংসিত।', 'O mankind, you are those in need of Allah, while Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035015.mp3', now()),
  (35, 16, '', '[{"id":18915,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":18916,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَشَأْ","transliteration":"yasha","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18917,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُذْهِبْكُمْ","transliteration":"yudh''hib''kum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে বিলোপ করতে পারেন","root":"ذهب","lemma":"أَذْهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18918,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَأْتِ","transliteration":"wayati","translation_bn":"এবং আনতে পারেন (তোমাদের স্থানে)","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18919,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِخَلْقٍۢ","transliteration":"bikhalqin","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টিকে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18920,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَدِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"jadīdin","translation_bn":"নতুন","root":"جدد","lemma":"جَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":18921,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in yasha yudh''hib''kum wayati bikhalqin jadīdin', 'তিনি ইচ্ছে করলে তোমাদেরকে বিলুপ্ত করতে পারেন, আর এক নতুন সৃষ্টি আনতে পারেন।', 'If He wills, He can do away with you and bring forth a new creation.', 'তিনি ইচ্ছে করলে তোমাদেরকে বিলুপ্ত করতে পারেন, আর এক নতুন সৃষ্টি আনতে পারেন।', 'If He wills, He can do away with you and bring forth a new creation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035016.mp3', now()),
  (35, 17, '', '[{"id":20025,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20026,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":20027,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20028,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20029,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِعَزِيزٍۢ","transliteration":"biʿazīzin","translation_bn":"কোনো কঠিন (কিছু)","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20030,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā dhālika ʿalā l-lahi biʿazīzin', 'এটা আল্লাহর পক্ষে কঠিন নয়।', 'And that is for Allah not difficult.', 'এটা আল্লাহর পক্ষে কঠিন নয়।', 'And that is for Allah not difficult.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035017.mp3', now()),
