root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21074,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তার থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21075,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٌۭ","transliteration":"shayon","translation_bn":"(সামান্য) কিছুও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21076,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21077,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সে হয়ও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21078,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ذَا","transliteration":"dhā","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21079,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قُرْبَىٰٓ ۗ","transliteration":"qur''bā","translation_bn":"কোন নিকট আত্মীয়","root":"قرب","lemma":"قُرْبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21081,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"(তাই হে নাবী) কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":21082,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تُنذِرُ","transliteration":"tundhiru","translation_bn":"তুমি সতর্ক করো","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21083,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":21084,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَخْشَوْنَ","transliteration":"yakhshawna","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21085,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُم","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21086,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","translation_bn":"না দেখা অবস্থায়","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21087,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقَامُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqāmū","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতিষ্ঠা করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21088,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21090,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21091,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"تَزَكَّىٰ","transliteration":"tazakkā","translation_bn":"পবিত্র করে","root":"زكو","lemma":"تَزَكَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21092,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21093,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"يَتَزَكَّىٰ","transliteration":"yatazakkā","translation_bn":"সে পবিত্র করে","root":"زكو","lemma":"تَزَكَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21094,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"linafsihi","translation_bn":"তার নিজের জন্যে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21096,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَى","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21097,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর-ই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":21098,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"(তোমাদের হবে) প্রত্যাবর্তন","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21099,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā taziru wāziratun wiz''ra ukh''rā wa-in tadʿu muth''qalatun ilā ḥim''lihā lā yuḥ''mal min''hu shayon walaw kāna dhā qur''bā innamā tundhiru alladhīna yakhshawna rabbahum bil-ghaybi wa-aqāmū l-ṣalata waman tazakkā fa-innamā yatazakkā linafsihi wa-ilā l-lahi l-maṣīru', 'কোন বহনকারী অন্যের (পাপের) বোঝা বইবে না। কেউ যদি তার গুরুভার বয়ে দেয়ার জন্য অন্যকে ডাকে তবে তার কিছুই বয়ে দেয়া হবে না- নিকটাত্মীয় হলেও। তুমি কেবল তাদেরকেই সতর্ক করতে পার, যারা না দেখেই তাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় করে আর নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে। যে কেউ নিজেকে পরিশুদ্ধ করে সে তো পরিশুদ্ধ করে নিজের কল্যাণেই। আল্লাহর দিকেই (সকলের) প্রত্যাবর্তন।', 'And no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another. And if a heavily laden soul calls [another] to [carry some of] its load, nothing of it will be carried, even if he should be a close relative. You can only warn those who fear their Lord unseen and have established prayer. And whoever purifies himself only purifies himself for [the benefit of] his soul. And to Allah is the [final] destination.', 'কোন বহনকারী অন্যের (পাপের) বোঝা বইবে না। কেউ যদি তার গুরুভার বয়ে দেয়ার জন্য অন্যকে ডাকে তবে তার কিছুই বয়ে দেয়া হবে না- নিকটাত্মীয় হলেও। তুমি কেবল তাদেরকেই সতর্ক করতে পার, যারা না দেখেই তাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় করে আর নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে। যে কেউ নিজেকে পরিশুদ্ধ করে সে তো পরিশুদ্ধ করে নিজের কল্যাণেই। আল্লাহর দিকেই (সকলের) প্রত্যাবর্তন।', 'And no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another. And if a heavily laden soul calls [another] to [carry some of] its load, nothing of it will be carried, even if he should be a close relative. You can only warn those who fear their Lord unseen and have established prayer. And whoever purifies himself only purifies himself for [the benefit of] his soul. And to Allah is the [final] destination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035018.mp3', now()),
  (35, 19, '', '[{"id":22226,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22227,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22228,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"l-aʿmā","translation_bn":"অন্ধ","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22229,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَصِيرُ","transliteration":"wal-baṣīru","translation_bn":"ও চক্ষুষ্মান","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22230,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā yastawī l-aʿmā wal-baṣīru', 'অন্ধ আর চোখওয়ালা সমান নয়।', 'Not equal are the blind and the seeing,', 'অন্ধ আর চোখওয়ালা সমান নয়।', 'Not equal are the blind and the seeing,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035019.mp3', now()),
