a-akhrajnā bihi thamarātin mukh''talifan alwānuhā wamina l-jibāli judadun bīḍun waḥum''run mukh''talifun alwānuhā wagharābību sūdun', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে, আল্লাহ আকাশ হতে পানি বর্ষণ করেন, অতঃপর আমি তা দিয়ে রং বেরংয়ের ফলমূল উদগত করি। পাহাড়ের মধ্যে আছে বিভিন্ন বর্ণের গিরিপথ- সাদা, লাল আর নিকষ কালো।', 'Do you not see that Allah sends down rain from the sky, and We produce thereby fruits of varying colors? And in the mountains are tracts, white and red of varying shades and [some] extremely black.', 'তুমি কি দেখ না যে, আল্লাহ আকাশ হতে পানি বর্ষণ করেন, অতঃপর আমি তা দিয়ে রং বেরংয়ের ফলমূল উদগত করি। পাহাড়ের মধ্যে আছে বিভিন্ন বর্ণের গিরিপথ- সাদা, লাল আর নিকষ কালো।', 'Do you not see that Allah sends down rain from the sky, and We produce thereby fruits of varying colors? And in the mountains are tracts, white and red of varying shades and [some] extremely black.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035027.mp3', now()),
  (35, 28, '', '[{"id":31347,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31348,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31349,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلدَّوَآبِّ","transliteration":"wal-dawābi","translation_bn":"ও জীব জন্তুগুলোর","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31350,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","transliteration":"wal-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"এবং গৃহপালিত পশুদের (মধ্যেও রয়েছে)","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31351,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُخْتَلِفٌ","transliteration":"mukh''talifun","translation_bn":"বিচিত্র","root":"خلف","lemma":"مُّخْتَلِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31352,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَلْوَٰنُهُۥ","transliteration":"alwānuhu","translation_bn":"তার রংসমূহ","root":"لون","lemma":"لَوْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31353,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ ۗ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31355,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":31356,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَخْشَى","transliteration":"yakhshā","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31357,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31358,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31359,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দাসদের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31360,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعُلَمَـٰٓؤُا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ʿulamāu","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানীগণই","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31362,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":31363,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31364,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":31365,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":31366,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina l-nāsi wal-dawābi wal-anʿāmi mukh''talifun alwānuhu kadhālika innamā yakhshā l-laha min ʿibādihi l-ʿulamāu inna l-laha ʿazīzun ghafūrun', 'তেমনিভাবে মানুষ, জীব-জন্তু আর গৃহপালিত পশুদের মধ্যেও রয়েছে তাদের বিভিন্ন রং। আল্লাহর বান্দাহদের মধ্যে তারাই তাঁকে ভয় করে যারা জ্ঞানী। আল্লাহ মহা ক্ষমতাশালী, পরম দয়ালু।', 'And among people and moving creatures and grazing livestock are various colors similarly. Only those fear Allah, from among His servants, who have knowledge. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Forgiving.', 'তেমনিভাবে মানুষ, জীব-জন্তু আর গৃহপালিত পশুদের মধ্যেও রয়েছে তাদের বিভিন্ন রং। আল্লাহর বান্দাহদের মধ্যে তারাই তাঁকে ভয় করে যারা জ্ঞানী। আল্লাহ মহা ক্ষমতাশালী, পরম দয়ালু।', 'And among people and moving creatures and grazing livestock are various colors similarly. Only those fear Allah, from among His servants, who have knowledge. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Forgiving.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035028.mp3', now()),
  (35, 29, '', '[{"id":32307,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32308,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32309,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَتْلُونَ","transliteration":"yatlūna","translation_bn":"পাঠ করে","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32310,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32311,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32312,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقَامُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqāmū","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতিষ্ঠা  করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32313,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32314,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفَقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-anfaqū","translation_bn":"ও ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32315,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32316,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32317,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سِرًّۭا","transliteration":"sirran","translation_bn":"গোপনে","root":"سرر","lemma":"سِرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32318,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَانِيَةًۭ","transliteration":"waʿalāniyatan","translation_bn":"ও প্রকাশ্যে","root":"علن","lemma":"عَلَانِيَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32319,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجُونَ","transliteration":"yarjūna","translation_bn":"তারাই আশা করতে পারে","root":"رجو","lemma":"يَرْجُوا@","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32320,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تِجَـٰرَةًۭ","transliteration":"tijāratan","translation_bn":"(এমন) ব্যবসার","root":"تجر","lemma":"تِجَٰرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32321,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَّن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"(যার) কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":32322,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَبُورَ","transliteration":"tabūra","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থ হবে","root":"بور","lemma":"يَبُورُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32323,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna yatlūna kitāba l-lahi wa-aqāmū l-ṣalata wa-anfaqū mimmā razaqnāhum sirran waʿalāniyatan yarjūna tijāratan lan tabūra', 'যারা আল্লাহর কিতাব তিলাওয়াত করে, নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে আর আল্লাহ তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছেন তাথেকে গোপনে ও প্রকাশ্যে ব্যয় করে, তারা এমন এক ব্যবসায়ের আশা করে যাতে কক্ষনো লোকসান হবে না।', 'Indeed, those who recite the Book of Allah and establish prayer and spend [in His cause] out of what We have provided them, secretly and publicly, [can] expect a profit that will never perish -', 'যারা আল্লাহর কিতাব তিলাওয়াত করে, নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে আর আল্লাহ তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছেন তাথেকে গোপনে ও প্রকাশ্যে ব্যয় করে, তারা এমন এক ব্যবসায়ের আশা করে যাতে কক্ষনো লোকসান হবে না।', 'Indeed, those who recite the Book of Allah and establish prayer and spend [in His cause] out of what We have provided them, secretly and publicly, [can] expect a profit that will never perish -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035029.mp3', now()),
  (35, 30, '', '[{"id":33175,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِيُوَفِّيَهُمْ","transliteration":"liyuwaffiyahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্ণমাত্রায় (আল্লাহ) দেন যেন","root":"وفي","lemma":"وَفَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33176,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُجُورَهُمْ","transliteration":"ujūrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতিফলন","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33177,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَيَزِيدَهُم","transliteration":"wayazīdahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের আরো বেশী দেন","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33178,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33179,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33181,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33182,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33183,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَكُورٌۭ","transliteration":"shakūrun","translation_bn":"গুণগ্রাহী","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33184,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyuwaffiyahum ujūrahum wayazīdahum min faḍlihi innahu ghafūrun shakūrun', 'কারণ, তিনি তাদেরকে তাদের প্রতিফল পূর্ণমাত্রায় দান করবেন এবং নিজ অনুগ্রহে আরো বেশি দিবেন। তিনি অতি ক্ষমাশীল, (ভাল কাজের) বড়ই মর্যাদাদানকারী।', 'That He may give them in full their rewards and increase for them of His bounty. Indeed, He is Forgiving and Appreciative.', 'কারণ, তিনি তাদেরকে তাদের প্রতিফল পূর্ণমাত্রায় দান করবেন এবং নিজ অনুগ্রহে আরো বেশি দিবেন। তিনি অতি ক্ষমাশীল, (ভাল কাজের) বড়ই মর্যাদাদানকারী।', 'That He may give them in full their rewards and increase for them of His bounty. Indeed, He is Forgiving and Appreciative.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035030.mp3', now()),
  (35, 31, '', '[{"id":34224,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","translation_bn":"এবং(হে নাবী) যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34225,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","transliteration":"awḥaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা ওহী করেছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34226,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34227,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34228,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34229,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":34230,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34231,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُصَدِّقًۭا","transliteration":"muṣaddiqan","translation_bn":"(তা) সত্যায়নকারী ও সমর্থক","root":"صدق","lemma":"مُصَدِّق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34232,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"তার যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34233,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"পূর্বে (এসেছে)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":34234,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَدَيْهِ ۗ","transliteration":"yadayhi","translation_bn":"তার","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34236,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34237,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34238,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِعِبَادِهِۦ","transliteration":"biʿibādihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দাসদের সম্পর্কে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34239,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَخَبِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"lakhabīrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সব জানেন","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":34240,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"সব দেখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34241,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhī awḥaynā ilayka mina l-kitābi huwa l-ḥaqu muṣaddiqan limā bayna yadayhi inna l-laha biʿibādihi lakhabīrun baṣīrun', 'আমি যে কিতাবটি হতে তোমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করেছি তা সত্য, পূর্ববর্তী কিতাবের সত্যায়নকারী। আল্লাহ তাঁর বান্দাহদের সম্পর্কে অবশ্যই সব খবর রাখেন এবং সব দেখেন।', 'And that which We have revealed to you, [O Muhammad], of the Book is the truth, confirming what was before it. Indeed, Allah, of His servants, is Acquainted and Seeing.', 'আমি যে কিতাবটি হতে তোমার প্রতি ওয়াহী করেছি তা সত্য, পূর্ববর্তী কিতাবের সত্যায়নকারী। আল্লাহ তাঁর বান্দাহদের সম্পর্কে অবশ্যই সব খবর রাখেন এবং সব দেখেন।', 'And that which We have revealed to you, [O Muhammad], of the Book is the truth, confirming what was before it. Indeed, Allah, of His servants, is Acquainted and Seeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035031.mp3', now()),
  (35, 32, '', '[{"id":35080,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35081,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوْرَثْنَا","transliteration":"awrathnā","translation_bn":"আমরা উত্তরাধিকার বানিয়েছি","root":"ورث","lemma":"أَوْرَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35082,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35083,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"( তাদেরকে ) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35084,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱصْطَفَيْنَا","transliteration":"iṣ''ṭafaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা মনোনীত করেছি","root":"صفو","lemma":"ٱصْطَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35085,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35086,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِنَا ۖ","transliteration":"ʿibādinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের দাসদের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35088,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"famin''hum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35089,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ظَالِمٌۭ","transliteration":"ẓālimun","translation_bn":"(কেউ হয়েছে) অত্যাচারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35090,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِّنَفْسِهِۦ","transliteration":"linafsihi","translation_bn":"তার নিজের প্রতি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35091,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"আবার তাদের মধ্য (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35092,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُّقْتَصِدٌۭ","transliteration":"muq''taṣidun","translation_bn":"(কেউ) মধ্যপন্থী","root":"قصد","lemma":"مُّقْتَصِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35093,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"আবার তাদের মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35094,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَابِقٌۢ","transliteration":"sābiqun","translation_bn":"(কেউ) অগ্রগামী","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَابِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35095,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-khayrāti","translation_bn":"কল্যাণকর কাজসমূহে","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْرَٰت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35096,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِ","transliteration":"bi-idh''ni","translation_bn":"অনুমতিক্রমে","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35097,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35099,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":35100,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সেই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":35101,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلُ","transliteration":"l-faḍlu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35102,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَبِيرُ","transliteration":"l-kabīru","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35103,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma awrathnā l-kitāba alladhīna iṣ''ṭafaynā min ʿibādinā famin''hum ẓālimun linafsihi wamin''hum muq''taṣidun wamin''hum sābiqun bil-khayrāti bi-idh''ni l-lahi dhālika huwa l-faḍlu l-kabīru', 'অতঃপর সেই কিতাবটির উত্তরাধিকারী করেছি আমি আমার বান্দাহদের মধ্যে হতে যাদেরকে বেছে নিয়েছি। অতঃপর তাদের কতক নিজেদের প্রতি অত্যাচার করেছে, আর কতক মধ্যপন্থী। তাদের কতক আল্লাহর নির্দেশে সৎ কাজে অগ্রণী। এটাই (মানুষের প্রতি আল্লাহর) খুবই বড় দয়া।', 'Then we caused to inherit the Book those We have chosen of Our servants; and among them is he who wrongs himself, and among them is he who is moderate, and among them is he who is foremost in good deeds by permission of Allah. That [inheritance] is what is the great bounty.', 'অতঃপর সেই কিতাবটির উত্তরাধিকারী করেছি আমি আমার বান্দাহদের মধ্যে হতে যাদেরকে বেছে নিয়েছি। অতঃপর তাদের কতক নিজেদের প্রতি অত্যাচার করেছে, আর কতক মধ্যপন্থী। তাদের কতক আল্লাহর নির্দেশে সৎ কাজে অগ্রণী। এটাই (মানুষের প্রতি আল্লাহর) খুবই বড় দয়া।', 'Then we caused to inherit the Book those We have chosen of Our servants; and among them is he who wrongs himself, and among them is he who is moderate, and among them is he who is foremost in good deeds by permission of Allah. That [inheritance] is what is the great bounty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035032.mp3', now()),
  (35, 33, '', '[{"id":35945,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتُ","transliteration":"jannātu","translation_bn":"বেহেশতসমূহ (রয়েছে)","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35946,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَدْنٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿadnin","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী","root":"—","lemma":"عَدْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35947,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَدْخُلُونَهَا","transliteration":"yadkhulūnahā","translation_bn":"তাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35948,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُحَلَّوْنَ","transliteration":"yuḥallawna","translation_bn":"অলংকৃত করা হবে(তাদেরকে)","root":"حلي","lemma":"حُلُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35949,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35950,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35951,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَسَاوِرَ","transliteration":"asāwira","translation_bn":"বালা","root":"سور","lemma":"أَسَاوِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35952,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দ্বারা (নির্মিত)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35953,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذَهَبٍۢ","transliteration":"dhahabin","translation_bn":"স্বর্ণের","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35954,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلُؤْلُؤًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"walu''lu-an","translation_bn":"ও মনি মুক্তার","root":"لالا","lemma":"لُؤْلُؤ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35956,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلِبَاسُهُمْ","transliteration":"walibāsuhum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের পোশাক (হবে)","root":"لبس","lemma":"لِبَاس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35957,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35958,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَرِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥarīrun","translation_bn":"রেশমের","root":"حرر","lemma":"حَرِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35959,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'jannātu ʿadnin yadkhulūnahā yuḥallawna fīhā min asāwira min dhahabin walu''lu-an walibāsuhum fīhā ḥarīrun', 'স্থায়ী জান্নাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে। যেখানে তাদেরকে স্বর্ণ ও মুক্তার কঙ্কণে অলঙ্কৃত করা হবে। যেখানে তাদের পোশাক হবে রেশমের।', '[For them are] gardens of perpetual residence which they will enter. They will be adorned therein with bracelets of gold and pearls, and their garments therein will be silk.', 'স্থায়ী জান্নাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে। যেখানে তাদেরকে স্বর্ণ ও মুক্তার কঙ্কণে অলঙ্কৃত করা হবে। যেখানে তাদের পোশাক হবে রেশমের।', '[For them are] gardens of perpetual residence which they will enter. They will be adorned therein with bracelets of gold and pearls, and their garments therein will be silk.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035033.mp3', now()),
  (35, 34, '', '[{"id":36823,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36824,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"\"সব প্রশংসা","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36825,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর-ই জন্য","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36826,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36827,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَذْهَبَ","transliteration":"adhhaba","translation_bn":"দূর করেছেন","root":"ذهب","lemma":"أَذْهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36828,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَنَّا","transliteration":"ʿannā","translation_bn":"আমাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36829,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَزَنَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥazana","translation_bn":"দুশ্চিন্তা","root":"حزن","lemma":"حَزَن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36831,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36832,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36833,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَغَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"laghafūrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":36834,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَكُورٌ","transliteration":"shakūrun","translation_bn":"গুণগ্রাহী","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36835,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū l-ḥamdu lillahi alladhī adhhaba ʿannā l-ḥazana inna rabbanā laghafūrun shakūrun', 'আর তারা বলবে- যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহর যিনি আমাদের দুঃখ কষ্ট দূর করে দিয়েছেন। আমাদের প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই পরম ক্ষমাশীল, (ভাল কাজের) বড়ই মর্যাদাদানকারী।', 'And they will say, "Praise to Allah, who has removed from us [all] sorrow. Indeed, our Lord is Forgiving and Appreciative -', 'আর তারা বলবে- যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহর যিনি আমাদের দুঃখ কষ্ট দূর করে দিয়েছেন। আমাদের প্রতিপালক অবশ্যই পরম ক্ষমাশীল, (ভাল কাজের) বড়ই মর্যাদাদানকারী।', 'And they will say, "Praise to Allah, who has removed from us [all] sorrow. Indeed, our Lord is Forgiving and Appreciative -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035034.mp3', now()),
  (35, 35, '', '[{"id":37617,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37618,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَحَلَّنَا","transliteration":"aḥallanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের জন্যে স্হান দিয়েছেন","root":"حلل","lemma":"أَحَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37619,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دَارَ","transliteration":"dāra","translation_bn":"আরাম","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37620,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُقَامَةِ","transliteration":"l-muqāmati","translation_bn":"স্হায়ী","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُقَامَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37621,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের মাধ্যমে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37622,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37623,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":37624,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَمَسُّنَا","transliteration":"yamassunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের স্পর্শ করবে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37625,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37626,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَصَبٌۭ","transliteration":"naṣabun","translation_bn":"কোনো কষ্ট","root":"نصب","lemma":"نَصَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37627,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37628,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَمَسُّنَا","transliteration":"yamassunā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করবে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37629,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37630,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لُغُوبٌۭ","transliteration":"lughūbun","translation_bn":"কোনো ক্লান্তি\"","root":"لغب","lemma":"لُّغُوب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37631,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhī aḥallanā dāra l-muqāmati min faḍlihi lā yamassunā fīhā naṣabun walā yamassunā fīhā lughūbun', 'যিনি স্বীয় অনুগ্রহে আমাদেরকে স্থায়ী আবাস দান করেছেন। সেখানে ক্লেশ আমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করে না, ক্লান্তিও আমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করে না।', 'He who has settled us in the home of duration out of His bounty. There touches us not in it any fatigue, and there touches us not in it weariness [of mind]."', 'যিনি স্বীয় অনুগ্রহে আমাদেরকে স্থায়ী আবাস দান করেছেন। সেখানে ক্লেশ আমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করে না, ক্লান্তিও আমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করে না।', 'He who has settled us in the home of duration out of His bounty. There touches us not in it any fatigue, and there touches us not in it weariness [of mind]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035035.mp3', now()),
  (35, 36, '', '[{"id":38038,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38039,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38040,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38041,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَارُ","transliteration":"nāru","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38042,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38043,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":38044,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُقْضَىٰ","transliteration":"yuq''ḍā","translation_bn":"আদেশ দেয়া হবে(মৃত্যু)","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38045,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38046,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَيَمُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"fayamūtū","translation_bn":"যে তারা মরবে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":38047,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38048,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُخَفَّفُ","transliteration":"yukhaffafu","translation_bn":"হাল্কা করা হবে","root":"خفف","lemma":"خَفَّفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38049,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُم","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38050,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38051,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابِهَا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿadhābihā","translation_bn":"তার শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38053,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38054,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَجْزِى","transliteration":"najzī","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল দিই আমরা","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38055,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেকে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38056,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَفُورٍۢ","transliteration":"kafūrin","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":38057,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kafarū lahum nāru jahannama lā yuq''ḍā ʿalayhim fayamūtū walā yukhaffafu ʿanhum min ʿadhābihā kadhālika najzī kulla kafūrin', 'আর যারা কুফুরী করে, তাদের জন্য আছে জাহান্নামের আগুন। তাদের জন্য কোন সময় নির্ধারণ করা হবে না যে, তারা (নির্ধারিত সময় আসলে) মরে যাবে, আর তাদের থেকে শাস্তিও কমানো হবে না। প্রত্যেক অকৃতজ্ঞকে আমি এভাবেই প্রতিফল দিয়ে থাকি।', 'And for those who disbelieve will be the fire of Hell. [Death] is not decreed for them so they may die, nor will its torment be lightened for them. Thus do we recompense every ungrateful one.', 'আর যারা কুফুরী করে, তাদের জন্য আছে জাহান্নামের আগুন। তাদের জন্য কোন সময় নির্ধারণ করা হবে না যে, তারা (নির্ধারিত সময় আসলে) মরে যাবে, আর তাদের থেকে শাস্তিও কমানো হবে না। প্রত্যেক অকৃতজ্ঞকে আমি এভাবেই প্রতিফল দিয়ে থাকি।', 'And for those who disbelieve will be the fire of Hell. [Death] is not decreed for them so they may die, nor will its torment be lightened for them. Thus do we recompense every ungrateful one.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035036.mp3', now()),
  (35, 37, '', '[{"id":39350,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39351,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَصْطَرِخُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣṭarikhūna","translation_bn":"চিৎকার করে বলবে","root":"صرخ","lemma":"يَصْطَرِخُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39352,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39353,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39354,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَخْرِجْنَا","transliteration":"akhrij''nā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে বের করুন","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39355,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَعْمَلْ","transliteration":"naʿmal","translation_bn":"আমরা কাজ করবো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39356,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39357,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"(তা হ''তে)ভিন্নতর","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39358,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39359,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39360,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَعْمَلُ ۚ","transliteration":"naʿmalu","translation_bn":"করতেছিলাম\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39362,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"(বলা হবে) নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":39363,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نُعَمِّرْكُم","transliteration":"nuʿammir''kum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের আমরা আয়ু বৃদ্ধি করেছি","root":"عمر","lemma":"يُعَمَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39364,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39365,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","transliteration":"yatadhakkaru","translation_bn":"শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করতে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39366,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39367,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39368,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَذَكَّرَ","transliteration":"tadhakkara","translation_bn":"শিক্ষা নিতে (চাইলে)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39369,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَكُمُ","transliteration":"wajāakumu","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের (কাছে) এসেছিলেন","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39370,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّذِيرُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nadhīru","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39372,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"fadhūqū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39373,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নাই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39374,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"lilẓẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের জন্যে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39375,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39376,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"نَّصِيرٍ","transliteration":"naṣīrin","translation_bn":"সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39377,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahum yaṣṭarikhūna fīhā rabbanā akhrij''nā naʿmal ṣāliḥan ghayra alladhī kunnā naʿmalu awalam nuʿammir''kum mā yatadhakkaru fīhi man tadhakkara wajāakumu l-nadhīru fadhūqū famā lilẓẓālimīna min naṣīrin', 'সেখানে তারা চিৎকার করে বলবে- হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! বের করুন আমাদেরকে, আমরা সৎকাজ করব, আমরা যে কাজ করতাম তা করব না। আমি কি তোমাদেরকে এতটা বয়স দেইনি যে, তখন কেউ নসীহত গ্রহণ করতে চাইলে নসীহত গ্রহণ করতে পারতে? আর তোমাদের কাছে সতর্ককারীও এসেছিল। কাজেই শাস্তি ভোগ কর, যালিমদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', 'And they will cry out therein, "Our Lord, remove us; we will do righteousness - other than what we were doing!" But did We not grant you life enough for whoever would remember therein to remember, and the warner had come to you? So taste [the punishment], for there is not for the wrongdoers any helper.', 'সেখানে তারা চিৎকার করে বলবে- হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! বের করুন আমাদেরকে, আমরা সৎকাজ করব, আমরা যে কাজ করতাম তা করব না। আমি কি তোমাদেরকে এতটা বয়স দেইনি যে, তখন কেউ নসীহত গ্রহণ করতে চাইলে নসীহত গ্রহণ করতে পারতে? আর তোমাদের কাছে সতর্ককারীও এসেছিল। কাজেই শাস্তি ভোগ কর, যালিমদের কোন সাহায্যকারী নেই।', 'And they will cry out therein, "Our Lord, remove us; we will do righteousness - other than what we were doing!" But did We not grant you life enough for whoever would remember therein to remember, and the warner had come to you? So taste [the punishment], for there is not for the wrongdoers any helper.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035037.mp3', now()),
  (35, 38, '', '[{"id":40195,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40196,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40197,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰلِمُ","transliteration":"ʿālimu","translation_bn":"অবগত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40198,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غَيْبِ","transliteration":"ghaybi","translation_bn":"গোপন রহস্যের","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40199,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40200,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40202,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চযই়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40203,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40204,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِذَاتِ","transliteration":"bidhāti","translation_bn":"অবস্থা সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40205,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40206,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha ʿālimu ghaybi l-samāwāti wal-arḍi innahu ʿalīmun bidhāti l-ṣudūri', 'আল্লাহ আসমান যমীনের অদৃশ্য বিষয় সম্পর্কে অবগত। অন্তরে যা আছে সে সম্পর্কে তিনি বিশেষভাবে জ্ঞাত।', 'Indeed, Allah is Knower of the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and earth. Indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts.', 'আল্লাহ আসমান যমীনের অদৃশ্য বিষয় সম্পর্কে অবগত। অন্তরে যা আছে সে সম্পর্কে তিনি বিশেষভাবে জ্ঞাত।', 'Indeed, Allah is Knower of the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and earth. Indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035038.mp3', now()),
