:"mina","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41818,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীতে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41819,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41820,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41821,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شِرْكٌۭ","transliteration":"shir''kun","translation_bn":"অংশ","root":"شرك","lemma":"شِرْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41822,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41823,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41824,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41825,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমরা দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41826,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبًۭا","transliteration":"kitāban","translation_bn":"কোনো কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41827,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41828,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(প্রতিষ্ঠিত) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41829,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَتٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinatin","translation_bn":"প্রমাণের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41830,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ ۚ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41832,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":41833,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":41834,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَعِدُ","transliteration":"yaʿidu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দেয়","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41835,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41836,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُم","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের একে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41837,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضًا","transliteration":"baʿḍan","translation_bn":"অপরকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41838,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":41839,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"غُرُورًا","transliteration":"ghurūran","translation_bn":"ধোঁকা","root":"غرر","lemma":"غُرُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41840,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum shurakāakumu alladhīna tadʿūna min dūni l-lahi arūnī mādhā khalaqū mina l-arḍi am lahum shir''kun fī l-samāwāti am ātaynāhum kitāban fahum ʿalā bayyinatin min''hu bal in yaʿidu l-ẓālimūna baʿḍuhum baʿḍan illā ghurūran', 'বল- তোমরা কি তোমাদের শরীকদেরকে দেখেছ আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে তোমরা যাদেরকে ডেকে থাক? তারা পৃথিবীতে কী সৃষ্টি করেছে তা আমাকে দেখাও; কিংবা আকাশমন্ডলীতে তাদের কোন শরীকানা আছে কি? কিংবা আমি কি তাদেরকে কোন কিতাব দিয়েছি যাত্থেকে কোন সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর তারা আছে? বরং সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা একে অপরকে প্রতারণামূলক ওয়া‘দা দিয়ে থাকে।', 'Say, "Have you considered your ''partners'' whom you invoke besides Allah? Show me what they have created from the earth, or have they partnership [with Him] in the heavens? Or have We given them a book so they are [standing] on evidence therefrom? [No], rather, the wrongdoers do not promise each other except delusion."', 'বল- তোমরা কি তোমাদের শরীকদেরকে দেখেছ আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে তোমরা যাদেরকে ডেকে থাক? তারা পৃথিবীতে কী সৃষ্টি করেছে তা আমাকে দেখাও; কিংবা আকাশমন্ডলীতে তাদের কোন শরীকানা আছে কি? কিংবা আমি কি তাদেরকে কোন কিতাব দিয়েছি যাত্থেকে কোন সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণের উপর তারা আছে? বরং সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা একে অপরকে প্রতারণামূলক ওয়া‘দা দিয়ে থাকে।', 'Say, "Have you considered your ''partners'' whom you invoke besides Allah? Show me what they have created from the earth, or have they partnership [with Him] in the heavens? Or have We given them a book so they are [standing] on evidence therefrom? [No], rather, the wrongdoers do not promise each other except delusion."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035040.mp3', now()),
  (35, 41, '', '[{"id":42580,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":42581,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":42582,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُمْسِكُ","transliteration":"yum''siku","translation_bn":"স্হিরভাবে ধরে রেখেছেন","root":"مسك","lemma":"أَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42583,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশকে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42584,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42585,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন (না)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":42586,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَزُولَا ۚ","transliteration":"tazūlā","translation_bn":"কক্ষচ্যুত হয়","root":"زول","lemma":"زَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42588,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"আর অবশ্য যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42589,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"زَالَتَآ","transliteration":"zālatā","translation_bn":"কক্ষচ্যুত হয়","root":"زول","lemma":"زَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42590,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":42591,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَمْسَكَهُمَا","transliteration":"amsakahumā","translation_bn":"উভয়কে স্হিরভাবে ধরে রাখতে পারবে","root":"مسك","lemma":"أَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42592,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42593,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٍۢ","transliteration":"aḥadin","translation_bn":"কেউ","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42594,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42595,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42597,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":42598,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42599,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"حَلِيمًا","transliteration":"ḥalīman","translation_bn":"সহনশীল","root":"حلم","lemma":"حَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42600,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":42601,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha yum''siku l-samāwāti wal-arḍa an tazūlā wala-in zālatā in amsakahumā min aḥadin min baʿdihi innahu kāna ḥalīman ghafūran', 'আল্লাহই আসমান ও যমীনকে স্থির রাখেন যাতে ও দু’টো টলে না যায়। ও দু’টো যদি টলে যায় তাহলে তিনি ছাড়া কে ও দু’টোকে স্থির রাখবে? তিনি পরম সহিষ্ণু, পরম ক্ষমাশীল।', 'Indeed, Allah holds the heavens and the earth, lest they cease. And if they should cease, no one could hold them [in place] after Him. Indeed, He is Forbearing and Forgiving.', 'আল্লাহই আসমান ও যমীনকে স্থির রাখেন যাতে ও দু’টো টলে না যায়। ও দু’টো যদি টলে যায় তাহলে তিনি ছাড়া কে ও দু’টোকে স্থির রাখবে? তিনি পরম সহিষ্ণু, পরম ক্ষমাশীল।', 'Indeed, Allah holds the heavens and the earth, lest they cease. And if they should cease, no one could hold them [in place] after Him. Indeed, He is Forbearing and Forgiving.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035041.mp3', now()),
  (35, 42, '', '[{"id":43294,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqsamū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা শপথ করে","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43295,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (নামে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43296,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهْدَ","transliteration":"jahda","translation_bn":"কড়া","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43297,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ","transliteration":"aymānihim","translation_bn":"তাদের শপথসমূহ","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43298,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَئِن","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":43299,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসেন","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43300,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"nadhīrun","translation_bn":"কোনো সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43301,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَّيَكُونُنَّ","transliteration":"layakūnunna","translation_bn":"তারা হবে অবশ্যই","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":43302,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَهْدَىٰ","transliteration":"ahdā","translation_bn":"অধিকতর সৎপথে","root":"هدي","lemma":"أَهْدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43303,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43304,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِحْدَى","transliteration":"iḥ''dā","translation_bn":"যে কোনোটির","root":"احد","lemma":"إِحْدَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43305,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمَمِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-umami","translation_bn":"(অন্যান্য) জাতিগুলোর","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43307,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43308,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসলেন","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43309,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"nadhīrun","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43310,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":43311,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"زَادَهُمْ","transliteration":"zādahum","translation_bn":"তাদের বৃদ্ধি করেছে","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43312,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":43313,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"نُفُورًا","transliteration":"nufūran","translation_bn":"পালনো","root":"نفر","lemma":"نُفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43314,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aqsamū bil-lahi jahda aymānihim la-in jāahum nadhīrun layakūnunna ahdā min iḥ''dā l-umami falammā jāahum nadhīrun mā zādahum illā nufūran', 'আর তারা (অর্থাৎ মক্কার মুশরিকরা) শক্তভাবে কসম খেয়ে বলত যে, তাদের কাছে সতর্ককারী আসলে তারা অন্য যে কোন সম্প্রদায়ের চেয়ে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সৎ পথের অধিক অনুসারী হয়ে যাবে। কিন্তু তাদের কাছে যখন সতর্ককারী আসল, তা বাড়িয়েই তুলল তাদের ঘৃণা,', 'And they swore by Allah their strongest oaths that if a warner came to them, they would be more guided than [any] one of the [previous] nations. But when a warner came to them, it did not increase them except in aversion.', 'আর তারা (অর্থাৎ মক্কার মুশরিকরা) শক্তভাবে কসম খেয়ে বলত যে, তাদের কাছে সতর্ককারী আসলে তারা অন্য যে কোন সম্প্রদায়ের চেয়ে অবশ্য অবশ্যই সৎ পথের অধিক অনুসারী হয়ে যাবে। কিন্তু তাদের কাছে যখন সতর্ককারী আসল, তা বাড়িয়েই তুলল তাদের ঘৃণা,', 'And they swore by Allah their strongest oaths that if a warner came to them, they would be more guided than [any] one of the [previous] nations. But when a warner came to them, it did not increase them except in aversion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035042.mp3', now()),
