ot":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43434,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অপেক্ষা করছে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43435,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":43436,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سُنَّتَ","transliteration":"sunnata","translation_bn":"বিধানের","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43437,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-awalīna","translation_bn":"পূর্ববর্তীদের (ক্ষেত্রে গৃহীত)","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43439,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَلَن","transliteration":"falan","translation_bn":"তখন কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43440,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَجِدَ","transliteration":"tajida","translation_bn":"পাবে তুমি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43441,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِسُنَّتِ","transliteration":"lisunnati","translation_bn":"বিধানের ক্ষেত্রে","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43442,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43443,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تَبْدِيلًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"tabdīlan","translation_bn":"কোনো পরিবর্তন","root":"بدل","lemma":"تَبْدِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43445,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَلَن","transliteration":"walan","translation_bn":"এবং কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43446,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"تَجِدَ","transliteration":"tajida","translation_bn":"পাবে তুমি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43447,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لِسُنَّتِ","transliteration":"lisunnati","translation_bn":"বিধানে","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43448,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43449,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"تَحْوِيلًا","transliteration":"taḥwīlan","translation_bn":"ব্যতিক্রম","root":"حول","lemma":"تَحْوِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43450,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'is''tik''bāran fī l-arḍi wamakra l-sayi-i walā yaḥīqu l-makru l-sayi-u illā bi-ahlihi fahal yanẓurūna illā sunnata l-awalīna falan tajida lisunnati l-lahi tabdīlan walan tajida lisunnati l-lahi taḥwīlan', 'যমীনে উদ্ধত আচরণ আর কু-চক্রান্ত। কু-চক্রান্ত তাকেই ঘিরে ধরবে যে তা করবে। তাহলে তারা কি তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদের উপর (আল্লাহর পক্ষ হতে) যে বিধান প্রয়োগ করা হয়েছে তারই অপেক্ষা করছে? তুমি আল্লাহর বিধানে কক্ষনো কোন পরিবর্তন পাবে না। তুমি আল্লাহর বিধানে কক্ষনো কোন ব্যতিক্রম পাবে না।', '[Due to] arrogance in the land and plotting of evil; but the evil plot does not encompass except its own people. Then do they await except the way of the former peoples? But you will never find in the way of Allah any change, and you will never find in the way of Allah any alteration.', 'যমীনে উদ্ধত আচরণ আর কু-চক্রান্ত। কু-চক্রান্ত তাকেই ঘিরে ধরবে যে তা করবে। তাহলে তারা কি তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদের উপর (আল্লাহর পক্ষ হতে) যে বিধান প্রয়োগ করা হয়েছে তারই অপেক্ষা করছে? তুমি আল্লাহর বিধানে কক্ষনো কোন পরিবর্তন পাবে না। তুমি আল্লাহর বিধানে কক্ষনো কোন ব্যতিক্রম পাবে না।', '[Due to] arrogance in the land and plotting of evil; but the evil plot does not encompass except its own people. Then do they await except the way of the former peoples? But you will never find in the way of Allah any change, and you will never find in the way of Allah any alteration.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035043.mp3', now()),
  (35, 44, '', '[{"id":44845,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":44846,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرُوا۟","transliteration":"yasīrū","translation_bn":"তারা ভ্রমণ করে","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44847,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44848,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44849,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَيَنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"fayanẓurū","translation_bn":"তারা তখন দেখে (নাই কি)","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44850,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":44851,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44852,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44853,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদের (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":44854,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পূর্বে ছিলো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44855,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44856,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"অথচ তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44857,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدَّ","transliteration":"ashadda","translation_bn":"অনেক বেশী কঠোর","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44858,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"এদের চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44859,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"quwwatan","translation_bn":"শক্তিতে","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44861,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44862,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44863,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (এমন যে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44864,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِيُعْجِزَهُۥ","transliteration":"liyuʿ''jizahu","translation_bn":"তাঁকে অক্ষম করতে পারে","root":"عجز","lemma":"يُعْجِزَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44865,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44866,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44867,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যেকার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44868,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44869,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44870,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(কোন কিছু) মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44871,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44873,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":44874,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44875,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿalīman","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানী","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44876,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرًۭا","transliteration":"qadīran","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44877,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yasīrū fī l-arḍi fayanẓurū kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu alladhīna min qablihim wakānū ashadda min''hum quwwatan wamā kāna l-lahu liyuʿ''jizahu min shayin fī l-samāwāti walā fī l-arḍi innahu kāna ʿalīman qadīran', 'তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করে না? তাহলে দেখত, তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছিল। তারা তো শক্তিতে ছিল এদের চেয়েও শক্তিশালী। আসমান ও যমীনের কোন কিছুই আল্লাহকে অপারগ করতে পারে না। তিনি সর্বজ্ঞাতা, সকল শক্তির অধিকারী।', 'Have they not traveled through the land and observed how was the end of those before them? And they were greater than them in power. But Allah is not to be caused failure by anything in the heavens or on the earth. Indeed, He is ever Knowing and Competent.', 'তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করে না? তাহলে দেখত, তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছিল। তারা তো শক্তিতে ছিল এদের চেয়েও শক্তিশালী। আসমান ও যমীনের কোন কিছুই আল্লাহকে অপারগ করতে পারে না। তিনি সর্বজ্ঞাতা, সকল শক্তির অধিকারী।', 'Have they not traveled through the land and observed how was the end of those before them? And they were greater than them in power. But Allah is not to be caused failure by anything in the heavens or on the earth. Indeed, He is ever Knowing and Competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035044.mp3', now()),
  (35, 45, '', '[{"id":45523,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45524,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤَاخِذُ","transliteration":"yuākhidhu","translation_bn":"পাকড়াও করতেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"يُؤَاخِذُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45525,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45526,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45527,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45528,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبُوا۟","transliteration":"kasabū","translation_bn":"তারা কামাই করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45529,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":45530,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَرَكَ","transliteration":"taraka","translation_bn":"রেহাই দিতেন","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45531,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45532,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ظَهْرِهَا","transliteration":"ẓahrihā","translation_bn":"তার পৃষ্ঠের","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45533,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45534,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دَآبَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"dābbatin","translation_bn":"চলমান প্রাণীকেই","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45535,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45536,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","transliteration":"yu-akhiruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অবকাশ দিয়ে থাকেন তিনি","root":"اخر","lemma":"أَخَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45537,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45538,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٍۢ","transliteration":"ajalin","translation_bn":"একটা সময়","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45539,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۖ","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45541,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45542,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45543,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلُهُمْ","transliteration":"ajaluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের সময়","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45544,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চযই় তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45545,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45546,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হবেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45547,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِعِبَادِهِۦ","transliteration":"biʿibādihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দাসদের সম্পর্কে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45548,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرًۢا","transliteration":"baṣīran","translation_bn":"খুব দেখেন (অর্থাৎ দেখে নিবেন)","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":45549,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw yuākhidhu l-lahu l-nāsa bimā kasabū mā taraka ʿalā ẓahrihā min dābbatin walākin yu-akhiruhum ilā ajalin musamman fa-idhā jāa ajaluhum fa-inna l-laha kāna biʿibādihi baṣīran', 'আল্লাহ মানুষকে তার কৃতকর্মের জন্য পাকড়াও করতে চাইলে ভূপৃষ্ঠের একটি প্রাণীকেও রেহাই দিতেন না। কিন্তু তিনি তাদের জন্য একটা নির্ধারিত কাল পর্যন্ত সময় বিলম্বিত করেন। অতঃপর তাদের সে নির্ধারিত সময় যখন এসে যায়, (তখন আল্লাহর ফয়সালা কার্যকরী হতে এক মুহূর্তও বিলম্ব ঘটে না), কারণ আল্লাহ (প্রতিটি মুহূর্তে) তাঁর বান্দাহদের পর্যবেক্ষণকারী।', 'And if Allah were to impose blame on the people for what they have earned, He would not leave upon the earth any creature. But He defers them for a specified term. And when their time comes, then indeed Allah has ever been, of His servants, Seeing.', 'আল্লাহ মানুষকে তার কৃতকর্মের জন্য পাকড়াও করতে চাইলে ভূপৃষ্ঠের একটি প্রাণীকেও রেহাই দিতেন না। কিন্তু তিনি তাদের জন্য একটা নির্ধারিত কাল পর্যন্ত সময় বিলম্বিত করেন। অতঃপর তাদের সে নির্ধারিত সময় যখন এসে যায়, (তখন আল্লাহর ফয়সালা কার্যকরী হতে এক মুহূর্তও বিলম্ব ঘটে না), কারণ আল্লাহ (প্রতিটি মুহূর্তে) তাঁর বান্দাহদের পর্যবেক্ষণকারী।', 'And if Allah were to impose blame on the people for what they have earned, He would not leave upon the earth any creature. But He defers them for a specified term. And when their time comes, then indeed Allah has ever been, of His servants, Seeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/035045.mp3', now())
