ould they be saved', 'আমি ইচ্ছে করলে তাদেরকে ডুবিয়ে দিতে পারি, তখন (তাদের ফরিয়াদ শুনার জন্য) কোন সাহায্যকারী থাকবে না, আর তারা পরিত্রাণও পাবে না', 'And if We should will, We could drown them; then no one responding to a cry would there be for them, nor would they be saved', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036043.mp3', now()),
  (36, 44, '', '[{"id":44713,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":44714,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44715,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44716,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمَتَـٰعًا","transliteration":"wamatāʿan","translation_bn":"এবং জীবনোপভোগ","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44717,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44718,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حِينٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥīnin","translation_bn":"কিছুকাল","root":"حين","lemma":"حِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44719,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'illā raḥmatan minnā wamatāʿan ilā ḥīnin', 'আমার রহমত না হলে, আর কিছু কালের জন্য তাদেরকে জীবন উপভোগ করতে না দিলে।', 'Except as a mercy from Us and provision for a time.', 'আমার রহমত না হলে, আর কিছু কালের জন্য তাদেরকে জীবন উপভোগ করতে না দিলে।', 'Except as a mercy from Us and provision for a time.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036044.mp3', now()),
  (36, 45, '', '[{"id":45556,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45557,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45558,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45559,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45560,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(পরিণামের) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45561,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"সামনে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":45562,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيكُمْ","transliteration":"aydīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45563,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45564,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَلْفَكُمْ","transliteration":"khalfakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পিছনে (আছে)","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45565,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের যাতে (উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45566,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تُرْحَمُونَ","transliteration":"tur''ḥamūna","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ করা যায়\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45567,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā qīla lahumu ittaqū mā bayna aydīkum wamā khalfakum laʿallakum tur''ḥamūna', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় ‘‘তোমাদের সামনে যে পরিণাম আসছে তাত্থেকে আর তোমাদের পেছনের (অতীত জাতিগুলোর উপর ঘটে গেছে সে রকম) ‘আযাব থেকে নিজেদেরকে রক্ষা কর যাতে তোমাদের উপর রহম করা হয় (তখন তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়)।’’', 'But when it is said to them, "Beware of what is before you and what is behind you; perhaps you will receive mercy... "', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় ‘‘তোমাদের সামনে যে পরিণাম আসছে তাত্থেকে আর তোমাদের পেছনের (অতীত জাতিগুলোর উপর ঘটে গেছে সে রকম) ‘আযাব থেকে নিজেদেরকে রক্ষা কর যাতে তোমাদের উপর রহম করা হয় (তখন তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়)।’’', 'But when it is said to them, "Beware of what is before you and what is behind you; perhaps you will receive mercy... "', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036045.mp3', now()),
  (36, 46, '', '[{"id":46246,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46247,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيهِم","transliteration":"tatīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে এসেছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46248,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(এমন) কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46249,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةٍۢ","transliteration":"āyatin","translation_bn":"নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46250,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46251,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46252,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46253,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":46254,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46255,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46256,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُعْرِضِينَ","transliteration":"muʿ''riḍīna","translation_bn":"উপেক্ষাকারী","root":"عرض","lemma":"مُّعْرِضُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46257,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā tatīhim min āyatin min āyāti rabbihim illā kānū ʿanhā muʿ''riḍīna', 'তাদের কাছে তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শন থেকে যখনই কোন নিদর্শন আসে তখনই তারা তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।', 'And no sign comes to them from the signs of their Lord except that they are from it turning away.', 'তাদের কাছে তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শন থেকে যখনই কোন নিদর্শন আসে তখনই তারা তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।', 'And no sign comes to them from the signs of their Lord except that they are from it turning away.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036046.mp3', now()),
  (36, 47, '', '[{"id":46922,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46923,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46924,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46925,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنفِقُوا۟","transliteration":"anfiqū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ব্যয় করো","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46926,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তাহ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46927,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقَكُمُ","transliteration":"razaqakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে জীবিকা দিয়েছেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46928,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46929,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46930,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":46931,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46932,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46933,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46934,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنُطْعِمُ","transliteration":"anuṭ''ʿimu","translation_bn":"\"খাওয়াবো আমরা কি","root":"طعم","lemma":"أَطْعَمَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":46935,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে (এমন কাউকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":46936,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":46937,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46938,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46939,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَطْعَمَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"aṭʿamahu","translation_bn":"তাকে খাওয়াতে পারতেন\"","root":"طعم","lemma":"أَطْعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46940,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46941,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":46942,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":46943,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46944,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তির","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46945,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46946,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā qīla lahum anfiqū mimmā razaqakumu l-lahu qāla alladhīna kafarū lilladhīna āmanū anuṭ''ʿimu man law yashāu l-lahu aṭʿamahu in antum illā fī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় ‘আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছেন তাত্থেকে তোমরা (আল্লাহর পথে) ব্যয় কর; তখন কাফিররা মু’মিনদেরকে বলে, ‘‘আমরা কি এমন লোককে খাওয়াবো আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে যাকে খাওয়াতে পারতেন? তোমরা তো স্পষ্ট পথভ্রষ্টতে পড়ে আছ।', 'And when it is said to them, "Spend from that which Allah has provided for you," those who disbelieve say to those who believe, "Should we feed one whom, if Allah had willed, He would have fed? You are not but in clear error."', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় ‘আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছেন তাত্থেকে তোমরা (আল্লাহর পথে) ব্যয় কর; তখন কাফিররা মু’মিনদেরকে বলে, ‘‘আমরা কি এমন লোককে খাওয়াবো আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে যাকে খাওয়াতে পারতেন? তোমরা তো স্পষ্ট পথভ্রষ্টতে পড়ে আছ।', 'And when it is said to them, "Spend from that which Allah has provided for you," those who disbelieve say to those who believe, "Should we feed one whom, if Allah had willed, He would have fed? You are not but in clear error."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036047.mp3', now()),
  (36, 48, '', '[{"id":47051,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47052,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَتَىٰ","transliteration":"matā","translation_bn":"\"কখন (পূর্ণ হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَتَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":47053,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"সেই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":47054,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَعْدُ","transliteration":"l-waʿdu","translation_bn":"(কেয়ামতের) প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47055,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":47056,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47057,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47058,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlūna matā hādhā l-waʿdu in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'আর তারা বলে, ‘‘তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও তাহলে বল, (ক্বিয়ামতের) এ ও‘য়াদা কখন পূর্ণ হবে?’’', 'And they say, "When is this promise, if you should be truthful?"', 'আর তারা বলে, ‘‘তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও তাহলে বল, (ক্বিয়ামতের) এ ও‘য়াদা কখন পূর্ণ হবে?’’', 'And they say, "When is this promise, if you should be truthful?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036048.mp3', now()),
  (36, 49, '', '[{"id":48297,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48298,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অপেক্ষা করছে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48299,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":48300,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صَيْحَةًۭ","transliteration":"ṣayḥatan","translation_bn":"মহাগর্জনের","root":"صيح","lemma":"صَيْحَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48301,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدَةًۭ","transliteration":"wāḥidatan","translation_bn":"একটি মাত্র","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48302,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَأْخُذُهُمْ","transliteration":"takhudhuhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আঘাত করবে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48303,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এ অবস্থায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":48304,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَخِصِّمُونَ","transliteration":"yakhiṣṣimūna","translation_bn":"তর্কাতর্কি করতে থাকবে","root":"خصم","lemma":"ٱخْتَصَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48305,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā yanẓurūna illā ṣayḥatan wāḥidatan takhudhuhum wahum yakhiṣṣimūna', 'তারা যে জন্য অপেক্ষা করছে সেটাতো একটা প্রচন্ড শব্দ যা তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবে যখন তারা নিজেদের মধ্যে বাক-বিতন্ডায় লিপ্ত থাকবে।', 'They do not await except one blast which will seize them while they are disputing.', 'তারা যে জন্য অপেক্ষা করছে সেটাতো একটা প্রচন্ড শব্দ যা তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবে যখন তারা নিজেদের মধ্যে বাক-বিতন্ডায় লিপ্ত থাকবে।', 'They do not await except one blast which will seize them while they are disputing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036049.mp3', now()),
  (36, 50, '', '[{"id":48989,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"না তখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48990,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা সমর্থ হবে","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48991,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَوْصِيَةًۭ","transliteration":"tawṣiyatan","translation_bn":"উপদেশ করতে","root":"وصي","lemma":"تَوْصِيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48992,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48993,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48994,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"ahlihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পরিবারের","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48995,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে যেতে পারবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48996,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā yastaṭīʿūna tawṣiyatan walā ilā ahlihim yarjiʿūna', '(ক্বিয়ামত এমনই হঠাৎ আক্রমণ করবে যে) তারা না পারবে ওসীয়াত করতে আর না পারবে তাদের পরিবার পরিজনের কাছে ফিরে যেতে।', 'And they will not be able [to give] any instruction, nor to their people can they return.', '(ক্বিয়ামত এমনই হঠাৎ আক্রমণ করবে যে) তারা না পারবে ওসীয়াত করতে আর না পারবে তাদের পরিবার পরিজনের কাছে ফিরে যেতে।', 'And they will not be able [to give] any instruction, nor to their people can they return.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036050.mp3', now()),
  (36, 51, '', '[{"id":49601,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنُفِخَ","transliteration":"wanufikha","translation_bn":"এবং ফুঁ দেওয়া হবে","root":"نفخ","lemma":"نَفَخَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49602,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49603,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣūri","translation_bn":"শিঙ্গার","root":"صور","lemma":"صُّور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49604,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"তখন অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49605,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":49606,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49607,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَجْدَاثِ","transliteration":"l-ajdāthi","translation_bn":"কবরসমূহ","root":"جدث","lemma":"أَجْدَاث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49608,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49609,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49610,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَنسِلُونَ","transliteration":"yansilūna","translation_bn":"ছুটে আসবে","root":"نسل","lemma":"يَنسِلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49611,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanufikha fī l-ṣūri fa-idhā hum mina l-ajdāthi ilā rabbihim yansilūna', 'আর যখন শিঙ্গায় ফুঁক দেয়া হবে, তখনই তারা ক্ববর থেকে তাদের পালনকর্তার দিকে ছুটে আসবে।', 'And the Horn will be blown; and at once from the graves to their Lord they will hasten.', 'আর যখন শিঙ্গায় ফুঁক দেয়া হবে, তখনই তারা ক্ববর থেকে তাদের পালনকর্তার দিকে ছুটে আসবে।', 'And the Horn will be blown; and at once from the graves to their Lord they will hasten.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036051.mp3', now()),
  (36, 52, '', '[{"id":50051,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"(ভীত হয়ে) তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50052,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰوَيْلَنَا","transliteration":"yāwaylanā","translation_bn":"\"আমাদের দুর্ভোগ হায়","root":"—","lemma":"وَيْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":50053,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَنۢ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50054,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعَثَنَا","transliteration":"baʿathanā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে উঠালো","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50055,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50056,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّرْقَدِنَا ۜ ۗ","transliteration":"marqadinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের ঘুমের স্হান\"","root":"رقد","lemma":"مَّرْقَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50058,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":50059,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তাই) যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50060,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدَ","transliteration":"waʿada","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছিলেন","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50061,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"দয়াময়","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50062,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدَقَ","transliteration":"waṣadaqa","translation_bn":"এবং সত্যই বলেছিলেন","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50063,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salūna","translation_bn":"রাসূলগণ\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50065,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yāwaylanā man baʿathanā min marqadinā hādhā mā waʿada l-raḥmānu waṣadaqa l-mur''salūna', 'তারা বলবে, ‘হায় আমাদের দুর্ভোগ! আমাদেরকে আমাদের ঘুমের জায়গা থেকে কে উঠালো? (তাদেরকে জবাব দেয়া হবে) ‘‘এটা হল তাই- দয়াময় আল্লাহ যার ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছিলেন, আর রসূলগণও সত্য কথাই বলেছিলেন।’', 'They will say, "O woe to us! Who has raised us up from our sleeping place?" [The reply will be], "This is what the Most Merciful had promised, and the messengers told the truth."', 'তারা বলবে, ‘হায় আমাদের দুর্ভোগ! আমাদেরকে আমাদের ঘুমের জায়গা থেকে কে উঠালো? (তাদেরকে জবাব দেয়া হবে) ‘‘এটা হল তাই- দয়াময় আল্লাহ যার ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছিলেন, আর রসূলগণও সত্য কথাই বলেছিলেন।’', 'They will say, "O woe to us! Who has raised us up from our sleeping place?" [The reply will be], "This is what the Most Merciful had promised, and the messengers told the truth."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036052.mp3', now()),
  (36, 53, '', '[{"id":50878,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":50879,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَتْ","transliteration":"kānat","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50880,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":50881,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صَيْحَةًۭ","transliteration":"ṣayḥatan","translation_bn":"মহাগর্জন","root":"صيح","lemma":"صَيْحَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50882,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدَةًۭ","transliteration":"wāḥidatan","translation_bn":"একটি মাত্র","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50883,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তখনই","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50884,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50885,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعٌۭ","transliteration":"jamīʿun","translation_bn":"সকলকেই","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50886,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَّدَيْنَا","transliteration":"ladaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَدَي\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":50887,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُحْضَرُونَ","transliteration":"muḥ''ḍarūna","translation_bn":"উপস্থিত করা হবে","root":"حضر","lemma":"مُّحْضَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50888,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in kānat illā ṣayḥatan wāḥidatan fa-idhā hum jamīʿun ladaynā muḥ''ḍarūna', 'মাত্র একটা প্রচন্ড শব্দ হবে, তক্ষুণি তাদের সব্বাইকে আমার সামনে হাজির করা হবে।', 'It will not be but one blast, and at once they are all brought present before Us.', 'মাত্র একটা প্রচন্ড শব্দ হবে, তক্ষুণি তাদের সব্বাইকে আমার সামনে হাজির করা হবে।', 'It will not be but one blast, and at once they are all brought present before Us.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036053.mp3', now()),
  (36, 54, '', '[{"id":51460,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"fal-yawma","translation_bn":"অতঃপর (বলা হবে) আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51461,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51462,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُظْلَمُ","transliteration":"tuẓ''lamu","translation_bn":"অবিচার করা হবে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51463,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٌۭ","transliteration":"nafsun","translation_bn":"কাউকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51464,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51465,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51466,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"tuj''zawna","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল দেওয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51467,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":51468,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51469,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51470,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করতেছিলে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51471,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fal-yawma lā tuẓ''lamu nafsun shayan walā tuj''zawna illā mā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'আজ কারো প্রতি কোন যুলম করা হবে না, তোমরা যে ‘আমাল করছিলে তোমাদেরকে কেবল তারই প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে।', 'So today no soul will be wronged at all, and you will not be recompensed except for what you used to do.', 'আজ কারো প্রতি কোন যুলম করা হবে না, তোমরা যে ‘আমাল করছিলে তোমাদেরকে কেবল তারই প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে।', 'So today no soul will be wronged at all, and you will not be recompensed except for what you used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036054.mp3', now()),
  (36, 55, '', '[{"id":51981,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51982,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبَ","transliteration":"aṣḥāba","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীরা","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51983,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51984,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51985,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"থাকবে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51986,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شُغُلٍۢ","transliteration":"shughulin","translation_bn":"(মজার) মগ্ন","root":"شغل","lemma":"شُغُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51987,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰكِهُونَ","transliteration":"fākihūna","translation_bn":"আনন্দে","root":"فكه","lemma":"فَٰكِهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51988,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna aṣḥāba l-janati l-yawma fī shughulin fākihūna', 'সে দিন জান্নাতীরা আনন্দে মশগুল হয়ে থাকবে।', 'Indeed the companions of Paradise, that Day, will be amused in [joyful] occupation -', 'সে দিন জান্নাতীরা আনন্দে মশগুল হয়ে থাকবে।', 'Indeed the companions of Paradise, that Day, will be amused in [joyful] occupation -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036055.mp3', now()),
  (36, 56, '', '[{"id":52528,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52529,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَأَزْوَٰجُهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-azwājuhum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের স্ত্রীরা (হবে)","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52530,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52531,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظِلَـٰلٍ","transliteration":"ẓilālin","translation_bn":"ছায়ার","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظِلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52532,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52533,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرَآئِكِ","transliteration":"l-arāiki","translation_bn":"সুসজ্জিত আসনে","root":"ارك","lemma":"أَرَا^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52534,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُتَّكِـُٔونَ","transliteration":"muttakiūna","translation_bn":"হেলান দিয়ে বসবে","root":"وكا","lemma":"مُتَّكِـ#ِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52535,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hum wa-azwājuhum fī ẓilālin ʿalā l-arāiki muttakiūna', 'তারা আর তাদের স্ত্রীরা সুশীতল ছায়ায়, উঁচু উঁচু আসনে হেলান দিয়ে বসবে।', 'They and their spouses - in shade, reclining on adorned couches.', 'তারা আর তাদের স্ত্রীরা সুশীতল ছায়ায়, উঁচু উঁচু আসনে হেলান দিয়ে বসবে।', 'They and their spouses - in shade, reclining on adorned couches.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036056.mp3', now()),
  (36, 57, '', '[{"id":53032,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53033,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53034,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰكِهَةٌۭ","transliteration":"fākihatun","translation_bn":"ফলমূল","root":"فكه","lemma":"فَٰكِهَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53035,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُم","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের জন্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53036,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53037,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَدَّعُونَ","transliteration":"yaddaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা চাইবে","root":"دعو","lemma":"يَدَّعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53038,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahum fīhā fākihatun walahum mā yaddaʿūna', 'তাদের জন্য সেখানে থাকবে ফলমূল আর তাদের জন্য থাকবে তারা যা কিছু পেতে চাইবে।', 'For them therein is fruit, and for them is whatever they request [or wish]', 'তাদের জন্য সেখানে থাকবে ফলমূল আর তাদের জন্য থাকবে তারা যা কিছু পেতে চাইবে।', 'For them therein is fruit, and for them is whatever they request [or wish]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/036057.mp3', now()),
