And we had over you no authority, but you were a transgressing people.', 'আর তোমাদের উপর আমাদের কোন কর্তৃত্বও ছিল না, বরং তোমরা ছিলে সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী জাতি।', 'And we had over you no authority, but you were a transgressing people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037030.mp3', now()),
  (37, 31, '', '[{"id":34262,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَحَقَّ","transliteration":"faḥaqqa","translation_bn":"সুতরাং সত্য হলো","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34263,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34264,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلُ","transliteration":"qawlu","translation_bn":"কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34265,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّنَآ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34267,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34268,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَذَآئِقُونَ","transliteration":"ladhāiqūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই (শাস্তির) স্বাদ ভোগ করতে হবে","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَا^ئِقُوا","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":34269,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faḥaqqa ʿalaynā qawlu rabbinā innā ladhāiqūna', 'আমাদের বিপক্ষে আমাদের পালনকর্তার উক্তিই সত্য হয়েছে, আমাদেরকে অবশ্যই শাস্তির স্বাদ নিতে হবে।', 'So the word of our Lord has come into effect upon us; indeed, we will taste [punishment].', 'আমাদের বিপক্ষে আমাদের পালনকর্তার উক্তিই সত্য হয়েছে, আমাদেরকে অবশ্যই শাস্তির স্বাদ নিতে হবে।', 'So the word of our Lord has come into effect upon us; indeed, we will taste [punishment].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037031.mp3', now()),
  (37, 32, '', '[{"id":35120,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَغْوَيْنَـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"fa-aghwaynākum","translation_bn":"কারণ তোমাদেরকে আমরা বিভ্রান্ত করেছিলাম","root":"غوي","lemma":"أَغْوَيْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35121,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35122,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35123,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غَـٰوِينَ","transliteration":"ghāwīna","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্ত\"","root":"غوي","lemma":"غَٰوِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35124,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aghwaynākum innā kunnā ghāwīna', 'আসলে আমরাই তোমাদেরকে গোমরাহ করেছিলাম, কারণ আমরা নিজেরাও গোমরাহ ছিলাম।’', 'And we led you to deviation; indeed, we were deviators."', 'আসলে আমরাই তোমাদেরকে গোমরাহ করেছিলাম, কারণ আমরা নিজেরাও গোমরাহ ছিলাম।’', 'And we led you to deviation; indeed, we were deviators."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037032.mp3', now()),
  (37, 33, '', '[{"id":36032,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-innahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36033,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":36034,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36035,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36036,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُشْتَرِكُونَ","transliteration":"mush''tarikūna","translation_bn":"সম অংশীদার হবে","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْتَرِكُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36037,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-innahum yawma-idhin fī l-ʿadhābi mush''tarikūna', 'সেদিন (দুর্বল আর সবল) সবাই ‘আযাবে শরীক হবে।', 'So indeed they, that Day, will be sharing in the punishment.', 'সেদিন (দুর্বল আর সবল) সবাই ‘আযাবে শরীক হবে।', 'So indeed they, that Day, will be sharing in the punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037033.mp3', now()),
  (37, 34, '', '[{"id":36842,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36843,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36844,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَفْعَلُ","transliteration":"nafʿalu","translation_bn":"আমরা করি","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36845,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"bil-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদের সাথে","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36846,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā kadhālika nafʿalu bil-muj''rimīna', 'অপরাধীদের প্রতি আমি এ রকমই (আচরণ) করে থাকি।', 'Indeed, that is how We deal with the criminals.', 'অপরাধীদের প্রতি আমি এ রকমই (আচরণ) করে থাকি।', 'Indeed, that is how We deal with the criminals.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037034.mp3', now()),
