।', 'Indeed they, when it was said to them, "There is no deity but Allah," were arrogant', 'তাদেরকে যখন ‘আল্লাহ ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই’ বলা হত, তখন তারা অহংকার করত।', 'Indeed they, when it was said to them, "There is no deity but Allah," were arrogant', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037035.mp3', now()),
  (37, 36, '', '[{"id":38528,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলতো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38529,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَئِنَّا","transliteration":"a-innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা কি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":38530,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَتَارِكُوٓا۟","transliteration":"latārikū","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ত্যাগকারী হবো","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَارِك","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":38531,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَتِنَا","transliteration":"ālihatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপাস্যদেরকে","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38532,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِشَاعِرٍۢ","transliteration":"lishāʿirin","translation_bn":"এক কবির জন্যে","root":"شعر","lemma":"شَاعِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38533,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّجْنُونٍۭ","transliteration":"majnūnin","translation_bn":"(যে) পাগল\"","root":"جنن","lemma":"مَجْنُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38534,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlūna a-innā latārikū ālihatinā lishāʿirin majnūnin', 'আর তারা বলত, ‘‘আমরা কি এক পাগলা কবির কথা মেনে আমাদের ইলাহগুলোকে ত্যাগ করব?', 'And were saying, "Are we to leave our gods for a mad poet?"', 'আর তারা বলত, ‘‘আমরা কি এক পাগলা কবির কথা মেনে আমাদের ইলাহগুলোকে ত্যাগ করব?', 'And were saying, "Are we to leave our gods for a mad poet?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037036.mp3', now()),
  (37, 37, '', '[{"id":39396,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":39397,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"(এই নাবী) এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39398,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্য নিয়ে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39399,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدَّقَ","transliteration":"waṣaddaqa","translation_bn":"এবং সত্য বলে স্বীকার করেছে","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَّقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39400,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salīna","translation_bn":"(তাঁর পূর্বের) রাসূলদের","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39401,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'bal jāa bil-ḥaqi waṣaddaqa l-mur''salīna', 'বরং সে [অর্থাৎ মুহাম্মাদ (সা.)] সত্য নিয়ে এসেছে এবং (পূর্বে আগমনকারী) রসূলদেরকে সত্যায়িত করেছে।', 'Rather, the Prophet has come with the truth and confirmed the [previous] messengers.', 'বরং সে [অর্থাৎ মুহাম্মাদ (সা.)] সত্য নিয়ে এসেছে এবং (পূর্বে আগমনকারী) রসূলদেরকে সত্যায়িত করেছে।', 'Rather, the Prophet has come with the truth and confirmed the [previous] messengers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037037.mp3', now()),
  (37, 38, '', '[{"id":40221,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40222,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَذَآئِقُوا۟","transliteration":"ladhāiqū","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই স্বাদ ভোগকারী হবে","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَا^ئِقُوا","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":40223,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40224,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَلِيمِ","transliteration":"l-alīmi","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40225,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innakum ladhāiqū l-ʿadhābi l-alīmi', '(এখন তাদেরকে বলা হবে) ‘তোমরা অবশ্যই মর্মান্তিক শাস্তির স্বাদ ভোগ করবে,', 'Indeed, you [disbelievers] will be tasters of the painful punishment,', '(এখন তাদেরকে বলা হবে) ‘তোমরা অবশ্যই মর্মান্তিক শাস্তির স্বাদ ভোগ করবে,', 'Indeed, you [disbelievers] will be tasters of the painful punishment,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/037038.mp3', now()),
