nsliteration":"yakhshawna","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25446,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُمْ","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25447,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25448,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَلِينُ","transliteration":"talīnu","translation_bn":"নরম হয়","root":"لين","lemma":"لِن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25449,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جُلُودُهُمْ","transliteration":"julūduhum","translation_bn":"তাদের দেহ (সারা দেহ)","root":"جلد","lemma":"جُلُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25450,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلُوبُهُمْ","transliteration":"waqulūbuhum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের মনগুলো","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25451,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25452,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرِ","transliteration":"dhik''ri","translation_bn":"স্মরণের","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25453,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25455,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":25456,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"هُدَى","transliteration":"hudā","translation_bn":"পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25457,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25458,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সৎপথে চালান তিনি","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25459,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"এ দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25460,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":25461,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25463,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25464,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلِ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lili","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্ত করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25465,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25466,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"তখন নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25467,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25468,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25469,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"هَادٍ","transliteration":"hādin","translation_bn":"পথ প্রদর্শক","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25470,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu nazzala aḥsana l-ḥadīthi kitāban mutashābihan mathāniya taqshaʿirru min''hu julūdu alladhīna yakhshawna rabbahum thumma talīnu julūduhum waqulūbuhum ilā dhik''ri l-lahi dhālika hudā l-lahi yahdī bihi man yashāu waman yuḍ''lili l-lahu famā lahu min hādin', 'আল্লাহ সর্বোত্তম বাণী অবতীর্ণ করেছেন- এমন কিতাব যা সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ, যার বিষয়াবলী পুনরাবৃত্তি করা হয়েছে। যারা তাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় করে তাদের গা এতে শিউরে উঠে। তখন তাদের দেহ-মন আল্লাহর স্মরণের প্রতি বিনম্র হয়ে যায়। এ হল আল্লাহর হিদায়াত, যাকে ইচ্ছে তদ্দ্বারা হিদায়াত করেন। আর আল্লাহ যাকে পথহারা করেন, তার কোন পথপ্রদর্শক নেই।', 'Allah has sent down the best statement: a consistent Book wherein is reiteration. The skins shiver therefrom of those who fear their Lord; then their skins and their hearts relax at the remembrance of Allah. That is the guidance of Allah by which He guides whom He wills. And one whom Allah leaves astray - for him there is no guide.', 'আল্লাহ সর্বোত্তম বাণী অবতীর্ণ করেছেন- এমন কিতাব যা সামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ, যার বিষয়াবলী পুনরাবৃত্তি করা হয়েছে। যারা তাদের প্রতিপালককে ভয় করে তাদের গা এতে শিউরে উঠে। তখন তাদের দেহ-মন আল্লাহর স্মরণের প্রতি বিনম্র হয়ে যায়। এ হল আল্লাহর হিদায়াত, যাকে ইচ্ছে তদ্দ্বারা হিদায়াত করেন। আর আল্লাহ যাকে পথহারা করেন, তার কোন পথপ্রদর্শক নেই।', 'Allah has sent down the best statement: a consistent Book wherein is reiteration. The skins shiver therefrom of those who fear their Lord; then their skins and their hearts relax at the remembrance of Allah. That is the guidance of Allah by which He guides whom He wills. And one whom Allah leaves astray - for him there is no guide.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039023.mp3', now()),
  (39, 24, '', '[{"id":26481,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَمَن","transliteration":"afaman","translation_bn":"তবে কি যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":26482,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقِى","transliteration":"yattaqī","translation_bn":"ঠেকাতে চাইবে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26483,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِوَجْهِهِۦ","transliteration":"biwajhihi","translation_bn":"তার চেহারা দিয়ে","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26484,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءَ","transliteration":"sūa","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26485,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তিকে","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26486,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26487,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের (বাঁচতে পারবে?)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26489,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَقِيلَ","transliteration":"waqīla","translation_bn":"এবং বলা হবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26490,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"lilẓẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদেরকে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26491,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"dhūqū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26492,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":26493,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26494,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"taksibūna","translation_bn":"অর্জন করেছিলে\"","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26495,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaman yattaqī biwajhihi sūa l-ʿadhābi yawma l-qiyāmati waqīla lilẓẓālimīna dhūqū mā kuntum taksibūna', 'ক্বিয়ামতের দিন যে ব্যক্তি তার (হাত পা বাঁধা থাকার কারণে) মুখমন্ডলের সাহায্যে ভয়ানক ‘আযাবের আঘাত ঠেকাতে চাইবে (সে কি তার মত যে এসব থেকে নিরাপদ)? যালিমদেরকে বলা হবে- তোমরা যা অর্জন করেছ তার স্বাদ গ্রহণ কর।', 'Then is he who will shield with his face the worst of the punishment on the Day of Resurrection [like one secure from it]? And it will be said to the wrongdoers, "Taste what you used to earn."', 'ক্বিয়ামতের দিন যে ব্যক্তি তার (হাত পা বাঁধা থাকার কারণে) মুখমন্ডলের সাহায্যে ভয়ানক ‘আযাবের আঘাত ঠেকাতে চাইবে (সে কি তার মত যে এসব থেকে নিরাপদ)? যালিমদেরকে বলা হবে- তোমরা যা অর্জন করেছ তার স্বাদ গ্রহণ কর।', 'Then is he who will shield with his face the worst of the punishment on the Day of Resurrection [like one secure from it]? And it will be said to the wrongdoers, "Taste what you used to earn."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039024.mp3', now()),
  (39, 25, '', '[{"id":27499,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبَ","transliteration":"kadhaba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছিলো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27500,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":27501,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পূর্বেও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27502,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27503,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَتَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"fa-atāhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর অতঃপর এসেছিলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27504,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27505,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(এমনদিক) হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27506,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَيْثُ","transliteration":"ḥaythu","translation_bn":"যেদিকে","root":"حيث","lemma":"حَيْث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27507,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":27508,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَشْعُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","translation_bn":"তারা কল্পনাও করে","root":"شعر","lemma":"يَشْعُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27509,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kadhaba alladhīna min qablihim fa-atāhumu l-ʿadhābu min ḥaythu lā yashʿurūna', 'তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও (নুবুওয়াতকে) অস্বীকার করেছিল। অতঃপর তাদের কাছে এমন দিক থেকে ‘আযাব এসেছিল যা তারা একটু টেরও পায়নি।', 'Those before them denied, and punishment came upon them from where they did not perceive.', 'তাদের পূর্ববর্তীরাও (নুবুওয়াতকে) অস্বীকার করেছিল। অতঃপর তাদের কাছে এমন দিক থেকে ‘আযাব এসেছিল যা তারা একটু টেরও পায়নি।', 'Those before them denied, and punishment came upon them from where they did not perceive.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039025.mp3', now()),
  (39, 26, '', '[{"id":28520,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَذَاقَهُمُ","transliteration":"fa-adhāqahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে ফলে আস্বাদন করালেন","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28521,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28522,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخِزْىَ","transliteration":"l-khiz''ya","translation_bn":"অপমানের","root":"خزي","lemma":"خِزْى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28523,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28524,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28525,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28527,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَذَابُ","transliteration":"walaʿadhābu","translation_bn":"আর শাস্তি অবশ্যই","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28528,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28529,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَكْبَرُ ۚ","transliteration":"akbaru","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"كبر","lemma":"أَكْبَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":28531,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"(হায়) যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":28532,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28533,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানতো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28534,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-adhāqahumu l-lahu l-khiz''ya fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā walaʿadhābu l-ākhirati akbaru law kānū yaʿlamūna', 'কাজেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দুনিয়ার জিন্দেগিতেই লাঞ্ছনার স্বাদ ভোগ করালেন। আর অবশ্যই আখিরাতের শাস্তি সবচেয়ে কঠিন। তারা যদি জানত!', 'So Allah made them taste disgrace in worldly life. But the punishment of the Hereafter is greater, if they only knew.', 'কাজেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দুনিয়ার জিন্দেগিতেই লাঞ্ছনার স্বাদ ভোগ করালেন। আর অবশ্যই আখিরাতের শাস্তি সবচেয়ে কঠিন। তারা যদি জানত!', 'So Allah made them taste disgrace in worldly life. But the punishment of the Hereafter is greater, if they only knew.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039026.mp3', now()),
  (39, 27, '', '[{"id":29471,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29472,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبْنَا","transliteration":"ḍarabnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পেশ করেছি","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29473,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"লোকদের জন্যে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29474,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29475,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":29476,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","transliteration":"l-qur''āni","translation_bn":"কোরআনের","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29477,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29478,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক রকম","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29479,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلٍۢ","transliteration":"mathalin","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্ত","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29480,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29481,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29482,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ḍarabnā lilnnāsi fī hādhā l-qur''āni min kulli mathalin laʿallahum yatadhakkarūna', 'আমি এ কুরআনে মানুষের জন্য সব রকমের দৃষ্টান্ত ও উপমা উপস্থিত করেছি যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And We have certainly presented for the people in this Qur''an from every [kind of] example - that they might remember.', 'আমি এ কুরআনে মানুষের জন্য সব রকমের দৃষ্টান্ত ও উপমা উপস্থিত করেছি যাতে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে।', 'And We have certainly presented for the people in this Qur''an from every [kind of] example - that they might remember.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039027.mp3', now()),
  (39, 28, '', '[{"id":30476,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُرْءَانًا","transliteration":"qur''ānan","translation_bn":"(এই) কোরআন","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30477,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَرَبِيًّا","transliteration":"ʿarabiyyan","translation_bn":"আরবী (ভাষায়)","root":"عرب","lemma":"عَرَبِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30478,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"(তা) মুক্ত","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30479,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ذِى","transliteration":"dhī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30480,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِوَجٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿiwajin","translation_bn":"বক্রতা বিশিষ্ট","root":"عوج","lemma":"عِوَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30481,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30482,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"yattaqūna","translation_bn":"সতর্ক হয়","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30483,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qur''ānan ʿarabiyyan ghayra dhī ʿiwajin laʿallahum yattaqūna', 'আরবী ভাষায় (অবতীর্ণ) কুরআন, এতে নেই কোন বক্রতা (পেচানো কথা), যাতে তারা (অন্যায় অপকর্ম হতে) বেঁচে চলতে পারে।', '[It is] an Arabic Qur''an, without any deviance that they might become righteous.', 'আরবী ভাষায় (অবতীর্ণ) কুরআন, এতে নেই কোন বক্রতা (পেচানো কথা), যাতে তারা (অন্যায় অপকর্ম হতে) বেঁচে চলতে পারে।', '[It is] an Arabic Qur''an, without any deviance that they might become righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039028.mp3', now()),
  (39, 29, '', '[{"id":31463,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبَ","transliteration":"ḍaraba","translation_bn":"পেশ করেন","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31464,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31465,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًۭا","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"একটি দৃষ্টান্ত","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31466,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَّجُلًۭا","transliteration":"rajulan","translation_bn":"এক ব্যক্তির","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31467,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31468,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءُ","transliteration":"shurakāu","translation_bn":"অনেক অংশীদার (মনিব)","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31469,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُتَشَـٰكِسُونَ","transliteration":"mutashākisūna","translation_bn":"পরস্পরকে দেখতে পারে না","root":"شكس","lemma":"مُتَشَٰكِسُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31470,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرَجُلًۭا","transliteration":"warajulan","translation_bn":"এবং এক ব্যক্তি","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31471,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَلَمًۭا","transliteration":"salaman","translation_bn":"সম্পূর্ণরূপে","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31472,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِّرَجُلٍ","transliteration":"lirajulin","translation_bn":"এক(জনের) (মালিকানায়)","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31473,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":31474,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِيَانِ","transliteration":"yastawiyāni","translation_bn":"দু''জনের (অবস্থা) সমান","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31475,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًا ۚ","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্তে","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31477,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"সব প্রশংসাই","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31478,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর জন্যে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31480,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":31481,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশই তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31482,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31483,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31484,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḍaraba l-lahu mathalan rajulan fīhi shurakāu mutashākisūna warajulan salaman lirajulin hal yastawiyāni mathalan l-ḥamdu lillahi bal aktharuhum lā yaʿlamūna', 'আল্লাহ একটা দৃষ্টান্ত দিচ্ছেনঃ এক ব্যক্তি যার মুনিব অনেক- যারা পরস্পরের বিরোধী। আরেক ব্যক্তি যার সম্পূর্ণ মালিকানা একজনের (উপর ন্যস্ত), তুলনায় এ দু’জন কি সমান? যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহরই (যে তিনি আমাদেরকে নানান দেবদেবীর কবল থেকে রক্ষা ক’রে একমাত্র তাঁরই সঙ্গে সরাসরি যোগাযোগ স্থাপন করার জন্য আমাদেরকে নির্দেশ দিয়েছেন), কিন্তু মানুষদের অধিকাংশ (এ আসল সত্যটা) জানে না।', 'Allah presents an example: a slave owned by quarreling partners and another belonging exclusively to one man - are they equal in comparison? Praise be to Allah! But most of them do not know.', 'আল্লাহ একটা দৃষ্টান্ত দিচ্ছেনঃ এক ব্যক্তি যার মুনিব অনেক- যারা পরস্পরের বিরোধী। আরেক ব্যক্তি যার সম্পূর্ণ মালিকানা একজনের (উপর ন্যস্ত), তুলনায় এ দু’জন কি সমান? যাবতীয় প্রশংসা আল্লাহরই (যে তিনি আমাদেরকে নানান দেবদেবীর কবল থেকে রক্ষা ক’রে একমাত্র তাঁরই সঙ্গে সরাসরি যোগাযোগ স্থাপন করার জন্য আমাদেরকে নির্দেশ দিয়েছেন), কিন্তু মানুষদের অধিকাংশ (এ আসল সত্যটা) জানে না।', 'Allah presents an example: a slave owned by quarreling partners and another belonging exclusively to one man - are they equal in comparison? Praise be to Allah! But most of them do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039029.mp3', now()),
  (39, 30, '', '[{"id":32425,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"তুমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32426,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَيِّتٌۭ","transliteration":"mayyitun","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুবরণ করবে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32427,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُم","transliteration":"wa-innahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32428,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَّيِّتُونَ","transliteration":"mayyitūna","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুবরণ করবে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32429,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innaka mayyitun wa-innahum mayyitūna', 'তুমিও মরবে আর তারাও মরবে।', 'Indeed, you are to die, and indeed, they are to die.', 'তুমিও মরবে আর তারাও মরবে।', 'Indeed, you are to die, and indeed, they are to die.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039030.mp3', now()),
  (39, 31, '', '[{"id":33269,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33270,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"তোমরা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":33271,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33272,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33273,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":33274,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33275,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَخْتَصِمُونَ","transliteration":"takhtaṣimūna","translation_bn":"তর্কাতর্কি করবে","root":"خصم","lemma":"ٱخْتَصَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33276,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma innakum yawma l-qiyāmati ʿinda rabbikum takhtaṣimūna', 'অতঃপর ক্বিয়ামত দিবসে তোমরা তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের সম্মুখে বাদানুবাদ করবে।', 'Then indeed you, on the Day of Resurrection, before your Lord, will dispute.', 'অতঃপর ক্বিয়ামত দিবসে তোমরা তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের সম্মুখে বাদানুবাদ করবে।', 'Then indeed you, on the Day of Resurrection, before your Lord, will dispute.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039031.mp3', now()),
  (39, 32, '', '[{"id":34579,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ فَمَنْ","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34580,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَظْلَمُ","transliteration":"aẓlamu","translation_bn":"বড় সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী (হতে পারে)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"أَظْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34581,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّن","transliteration":"mimman","translation_bn":"(তার) চেয়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34582,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَذَبَ","transliteration":"kadhaba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা বলে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34583,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34584,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34585,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَّبَ","transliteration":"wakadhaba","translation_bn":"ও প্রত্যাখ্যান করে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34586,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلصِّدْقِ","transliteration":"bil-ṣid''qi","translation_bn":"পরম সত্যকে","root":"صدق","lemma":"صِدْق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34587,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":34588,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُۥٓ ۚ","transliteration":"jāahu","translation_bn":"তার কাছে এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34590,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"alaysa","translation_bn":"নয় কি","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":34591,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34592,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34593,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَثْوًۭى","transliteration":"mathwan","translation_bn":"আবাসস্থল","root":"ثوي","lemma":"مَثْوًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34594,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"lil''kāfirīna","translation_bn":"(এমন সব) কাফেরদের জন্যে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34595,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faman aẓlamu mimman kadhaba ʿalā l-lahi wakadhaba bil-ṣid''qi idh jāahu alaysa fī jahannama mathwan lil''kāfirīna', 'যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যারোপ করে আর সত্য সমাগত হওয়ার পর তা অস্বীকার করে তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে আছে? (এমন) কাফিরদের আবাসস্থল কি জাহান্নামে নয়?', 'So who is more unjust than one who lies about Allah and denies the truth when it has come to him? Is there not in Hell a residence for the disbelievers?', 'যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যারোপ করে আর সত্য সমাগত হওয়ার পর তা অস্বীকার করে তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে আছে? (এমন) কাফিরদের আবাসস্থল কি জাহান্নামে নয়?', 'So who is more unjust than one who lies about Allah and denies the truth when it has come to him? Is there not in Hell a residence for the disbelievers?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039032.mp3', now()),
  (39, 33, '', '[{"id":35180,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35181,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35182,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلصِّدْقِ","transliteration":"bil-ṣid''qi","translation_bn":"পরম সত্যসহ","root":"صدق","lemma":"صِدْق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35183,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدَّقَ","transliteration":"waṣaddaqa","translation_bn":"এবং (যারা) সত্য বলে মেনে নিয়েছে","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَّقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35184,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ ۙ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ ۙ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35186,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":35187,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":35188,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqūna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকী","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35189,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhī jāa bil-ṣid''qi waṣaddaqa bihi ulāika humu l-mutaqūna', 'যারা সত্য নিয়ে আগমণ করেছে এবং সত্যকে সত্য হিসেবে মেনে নিয়েছে, তারাই তো মুত্তাকী।', 'And the one who has brought the truth and [they who] believed in it - those are the righteous.', 'যারা সত্য নিয়ে আগমণ করেছে এবং সত্যকে সত্য হিসেবে মেনে নিয়েছে, তারাই তো মুত্তাকী।', 'And the one who has brought the truth and [they who] believed in it - those are the righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039033.mp3', now()),
  (39, 34, '', '[{"id":36101,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36102,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(থাকবে) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36103,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُونَ","transliteration":"yashāūna","translation_bn":"তারা ইচ্ছে করবে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36104,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":36105,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36107,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":36108,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءُ","transliteration":"jazāu","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36109,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''sinīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মপরায়ণদের","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36110,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahum mā yashāūna ʿinda rabbihim dhālika jazāu l-muḥ''sinīna', 'তাদের জন্য তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট আছে যা তারা ইচ্ছে করবে। তা-ই হল সৎকর্মশীলদের প্রতিদান।', 'They will have whatever they desire with their Lord. That is the reward of the doers of good -', 'তাদের জন্য তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট আছে যা তারা ইচ্ছে করবে। তা-ই হল সৎকর্মশীলদের প্রতিদান।', 'They will have whatever they desire with their Lord. That is the reward of the doers of good -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039034.mp3', now()),
  (39, 35, '', '[{"id":36885,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِيُكَفِّرَ","transliteration":"liyukaffira","translation_bn":"মোচন করেন যেন","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَّرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36886,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36887,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36888,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَسْوَأَ","transliteration":"aswa-a","translation_bn":"মন্দকাজ","root":"سوا","lemma":"أَسْوَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36889,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36890,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছিলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36891,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَجْزِيَهُمْ","transliteration":"wayajziyahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের প্রতিফল দেন (যেন)","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36892,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَهُم","transliteration":"ajrahum","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার তাদের","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36893,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِأَحْسَنِ","transliteration":"bi-aḥsani","translation_bn":"উত্তমভাবে","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36894,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(ঐ বিষয়ের) যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36895,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36896,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করেছিলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36897,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyukaffira l-lahu ʿanhum aswa-a alladhī ʿamilū wayajziyahum ajrahum bi-aḥsani alladhī kānū yaʿmalūna', 'যাতে তারা যে সব মন্দ কাজ করেছে আল্লাহ্ তা মুছে দিতে পারেন, আর তারা যে সব সৎ কাজ করেছে তজ্জন্য তাদেরকে পুরস্কৃত করেন।', 'That Allah may remove from them the worst of what they did and reward them their due for the best of what they used to do.', 'যাতে তারা যে সব মন্দ কাজ করেছে আল্লাহ্ তা মুছে দিতে পারেন, আর তারা যে সব সৎ কাজ করেছে তজ্জন্য তাদেরকে পুরস্কৃত করেন।', 'That Allah may remove from them the worst of what they did and reward them their due for the best of what they used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039035.mp3', now()),
  (39, 36, '', '[{"id":37739,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"alaysa","translation_bn":"কি নন","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":37740,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37741,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِكَافٍ","transliteration":"bikāfin","translation_bn":"যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَاف","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37742,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَبْدَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿabdahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর দাসের (জন্যে)","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37744,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيُخَوِّفُونَكَ","transliteration":"wayukhawwifūnaka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাকে  তারা ভয় দেখায়","root":"خوف","lemma":"يُخَوِّفُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37745,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"bi-alladhīna","translation_bn":"অন্যদের সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37746,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37747,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তিনি ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37749,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"অথচ যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37750,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلِ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lili","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37751,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37752,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37753,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37754,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37755,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هَادٍۢ","transliteration":"hādin","translation_bn":"পথ প্রদর্শক","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37756,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alaysa l-lahu bikāfin ʿabdahu wayukhawwifūnaka bi-alladhīna min dūnihi waman yuḍ''lili l-lahu famā lahu min hādin', 'আল্লাহ কি তাঁর বান্দাহর জন্য যথেষ্ট নন? অথচ তোমাকে তারা আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে অন্যদের ভয় দেখায়। আল্লাহ যাকে পথহারা করেন তার জন্য কেউ পথ দেখাবার নেই।', 'Is not Allah sufficient for His Servant [Prophet Muhammad]? And [yet], they threaten you with those [they worship] other than Him. And whoever Allah leaves astray - for him there is no guide.', 'আল্লাহ কি তাঁর বান্দাহর জন্য যথেষ্ট নন? অথচ তোমাকে তারা আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে অন্যদের ভয় দেখায়। আল্লাহ যাকে পথহারা করেন তার জন্য কেউ পথ দেখাবার নেই।', 'Is not Allah sufficient for His Servant [Prophet Muhammad]? And [yet], they threaten you with those [they worship] other than Him. And whoever Allah leaves astray - for him there is no guide.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039036.mp3', now()),
  (39, 37, '', '[{"id":38598,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38599,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِ","transliteration":"yahdi","translation_bn":"পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38600,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38601,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"তখন নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38602,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38603,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38604,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّضِلٍّ ۗ","transliteration":"muḍillin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তকারী","root":"ضلل","lemma":"مُّضِلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38606,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"alaysa","translation_bn":"নন কি","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":38607,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38608,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِعَزِيزٍۢ","transliteration":"biʿazīzin","translation_bn":"মহাপরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38609,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ذِى","transliteration":"dhī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38610,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱنتِقَامٍۢ","transliteration":"intiqāmin","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণকারী","root":"نقم","lemma":"ٱنتِقَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38611,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yahdi l-lahu famā lahu min muḍillin alaysa l-lahu biʿazīzin dhī intiqāmin', 'আর আল্লাহ যাকে পথ দেখান, তাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করার কেউ নেই। আল্লাহ কি মহাশক্তিধর প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণকারী নন?', 'And whoever Allah guides - for him there is no misleader. Is not Allah Exalted in Might and Owner of Retribution?', 'আর আল্লাহ যাকে পথ দেখান, তাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করার কেউ নেই। আল্লাহ কি মহাশক্তিধর প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণকারী নন?', 'And whoever Allah guides - for him there is no misleader. Is not Allah Exalted in Might and Owner of Retribution?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/039037.mp3', now()),
