:"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30508,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كَذِبُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"kadhibuhu","translation_bn":"তার মিথ্যার দায়","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30510,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"কিন্তু যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30511,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَكُ","transliteration":"yaku","translation_bn":"সে হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30512,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"صَادِقًۭا","transliteration":"ṣādiqan","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30513,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يُصِبْكُم","transliteration":"yuṣib''kum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর আপতিত হবে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30514,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُ","transliteration":"baʿḍu","translation_bn":"(তার) কিছু","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30515,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30516,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"يَعِدُكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"yaʿidukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে সে ভয় দেখাচ্ছে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30518,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30519,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30520,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":30521,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30522,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(এমন) কাউকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30523,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":30524,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"مُسْرِفٌۭ","transliteration":"mus''rifun","translation_bn":"সীমালংঘনকারী","root":"سرف","lemma":"مُسْرِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30525,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّابٌۭ","transliteration":"kadhābun","translation_bn":"ডাহা মিথ্যাবাদী","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30526,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla rajulun mu''minun min āli fir''ʿawna yaktumu īmānahu ataqtulūna rajulan an yaqūla rabbiya l-lahu waqad jāakum bil-bayināti min rabbikum wa-in yaku kādhiban faʿalayhi kadhibuhu wa-in yaku ṣādiqan yuṣib''kum baʿḍu alladhī yaʿidukum inna l-laha lā yahdī man huwa mus''rifun kadhābun', 'ফেরাউনের দলের এক মু’মিন ব্যক্তি- যে তার ঈমানকে গোপন রেখেছিল- বলল, তোমরা একজন লোককে শুধু কি এজন্য মেরে ফেলবে যে, সে বলে, আল্লাহ আমার প্রতিপালক। অথচ সে তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ হতে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ নিয়ে এসেছে। সে যদি মিথ্যাবাদী হয় তাহলে তার মিথ্যা বলার পরিণাম সে নিজেই ভুগবে। আর সে যদি সত্যবাদী হয়, তাহলে সে তোমাদেরকে যে শাস্তির ভয় দেখাচ্ছে তার কিছু না কিছু তোমাদের উপর পড়বেই। যে সীমালঙ্ঘন করে আর মিথ্যে বলে আল্লাহ তাকে সঠিক পথ দেখান না।', 'And a believing man from the family of Pharaoh who concealed his faith said, "Do you kill a man [merely] because he says, ''My Lord is Allah'' while he has brought you clear proofs from your Lord? And if he should be lying, then upon him is [the consequence of] his lie; but if he should be truthful, there will strike you some of what he promises you. Indeed, Allah does not guide one who is a transgressor and a liar.', 'ফেরাউনের দলের এক মু’মিন ব্যক্তি- যে তার ঈমানকে গোপন রেখেছিল- বলল, তোমরা একজন লোককে শুধু কি এজন্য মেরে ফেলবে যে, সে বলে, আল্লাহ আমার প্রতিপালক। অথচ সে তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ হতে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ নিয়ে এসেছে। সে যদি মিথ্যাবাদী হয় তাহলে তার মিথ্যা বলার পরিণাম সে নিজেই ভুগবে। আর সে যদি সত্যবাদী হয়, তাহলে সে তোমাদেরকে যে শাস্তির ভয় দেখাচ্ছে তার কিছু না কিছু তোমাদের উপর পড়বেই। যে সীমালঙ্ঘন করে আর মিথ্যে বলে আল্লাহ তাকে সঠিক পথ দেখান না।', 'And a believing man from the family of Pharaoh who concealed his faith said, "Do you kill a man [merely] because he says, ''My Lord is Allah'' while he has brought you clear proofs from your Lord? And if he should be lying, then upon him is [the consequence of] his lie; but if he should be truthful, there will strike you some of what he promises you. Indeed, Allah does not guide one who is a transgressor and a liar.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040028.mp3', now()),
  (40, 29, '', '[{"id":31485,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":31486,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31487,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُلْكُ","transliteration":"l-mul''ku","translation_bn":"রাজত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31488,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31489,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰهِرِينَ","transliteration":"ẓāhirīna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিজয়ী","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَٰهِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31490,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31491,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"দেশের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31492,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"কিন্তু কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31493,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُنَا","transliteration":"yanṣurunā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে সাহায্য করবে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31494,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31495,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسِ","transliteration":"basi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31496,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31497,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":31498,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَنَا ۚ","transliteration":"jāanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর (তা) আসে\"","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31500,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31501,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"ফিরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31502,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31503,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أُرِيكُمْ","transliteration":"urīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে মতামত দিচ্ছি","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31504,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":31505,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31506,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَرَىٰ","transliteration":"arā","translation_bn":"আমি ভালো মনে করি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31507,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31508,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَهْدِيكُمْ","transliteration":"ahdīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে আমি পরিচালনা করছি","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31509,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":31510,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلَ","transliteration":"sabīla","translation_bn":"পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31511,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّشَادِ","transliteration":"l-rashādi","translation_bn":"সঠিক\"","root":"رشد","lemma":"رَّشَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31512,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāqawmi lakumu l-mul''ku l-yawma ẓāhirīna fī l-arḍi faman yanṣurunā min basi l-lahi in jāanā qāla fir''ʿawnu mā urīkum illā mā arā wamā ahdīkum illā sabīla l-rashādi', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আজ তোমাদেরই কর্তৃত্ব চলছে, দেশে আজ তোমরাই বিজয়ী শক্তি। কিন্তু আল্লাহর শাস্তি যদি এসেই পড়ে, তাহলে তাত্থেকে আমাদেরকে কে রক্ষে করবে? ফেরাউন বলল- আমি তোমাদেরকে শুধু তা-ই বলছি, আমি নিজে যা বুঝেছি; আমি তোমাদেরকে সত্যপথই দেখাচ্ছি।', 'O my people, sovereignty is yours today, [your being] dominant in the land. But who would protect us from the punishment of Allah if it came to us?" Pharaoh said, "I do not show you except what I see, and I do not guide you except to the way of right conduct."', 'হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আজ তোমাদেরই কর্তৃত্ব চলছে, দেশে আজ তোমরাই বিজয়ী শক্তি। কিন্তু আল্লাহর শাস্তি যদি এসেই পড়ে, তাহলে তাত্থেকে আমাদেরকে কে রক্ষে করবে? ফেরাউন বলল- আমি তোমাদেরকে শুধু তা-ই বলছি, আমি নিজে যা বুঝেছি; আমি তোমাদেরকে সত্যপথই দেখাচ্ছি।', 'O my people, sovereignty is yours today, [your being] dominant in the land. But who would protect us from the punishment of Allah if it came to us?" Pharaoh said, "I do not show you except what I see, and I do not guide you except to the way of right conduct."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040029.mp3', now()),
  (40, 30, '', '[{"id":32430,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32431,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32432,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32433,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":32434,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32435,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"আমি ভয় করছি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32436,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32437,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلَ","transliteration":"mith''la","translation_bn":"মতো","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32438,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِ","transliteration":"yawmi","translation_bn":"(শাস্তির) দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32439,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَحْزَابِ","transliteration":"l-aḥzābi","translation_bn":"(অতীতের দল বা) জাতিসমূহের","root":"حزب","lemma":"حِزْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32440,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla alladhī āmana yāqawmi innī akhāfu ʿalaykum mith''la yawmi l-aḥzābi', 'যে লোকটি ঈমান এনেছিল সে বলল- হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আগের জাতিগুলোর উপর যেমন (শাস্তির) দিন এসেছিল, আমি তোমাদের উপরও সে রকম (বিপর্যয়ের) আশঙ্কা করছি', 'And he who believed said, "O my people, indeed I fear for you [a fate] like the day of the companies -', 'যে লোকটি ঈমান এনেছিল সে বলল- হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! আগের জাতিগুলোর উপর যেমন (শাস্তির) দিন এসেছিল, আমি তোমাদের উপরও সে রকম (বিপর্যয়ের) আশঙ্কা করছি', 'And he who believed said, "O my people, indeed I fear for you [a fate] like the day of the companies -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040030.mp3', now()),
  (40, 31, '', '[{"id":33516,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَ","transliteration":"mith''la","translation_bn":"মতো","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33517,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دَأْبِ","transliteration":"dabi","translation_bn":"কর্মপন্থা","root":"داب","lemma":"دَأْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33518,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِ","transliteration":"qawmi","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33519,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نُوحٍۢ","transliteration":"nūḥin","translation_bn":"নূহের","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33520,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعَادٍۢ","transliteration":"waʿādin","translation_bn":"ও আ''দের","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33521,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَثَمُودَ","transliteration":"wathamūda","translation_bn":"ও সামূদের","root":"—","lemma":"ثَمُود","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33522,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33523,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33524,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"baʿdihim","translation_bn":"পরে তাদের","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33526,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33527,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33528,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33529,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ظُلْمًۭا","transliteration":"ẓul''man","translation_bn":"অত্যাচার","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33530,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْعِبَادِ","transliteration":"lil''ʿibādi","translation_bn":"দাসদের জন্যে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33531,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mith''la dabi qawmi nūḥin waʿādin wathamūda wa-alladhīna min baʿdihim wamā l-lahu yurīdu ẓul''man lil''ʿibādi', 'যা এসেছিল নূহ, ‘আদ, সামূদ জাতি আর তাদের পরবর্তীদের উপর। আল্লাহ তো বান্দাহদের উপর যুলম করতে চান না (বরং তাদের নিজেদের অন্যায় অপকর্মের কারণেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে শাস্তি দেন)।', 'Like the custom of the people of Noah and of ''Aad and Thamud and those after them. And Allah wants no injustice for [His] servants.', 'যা এসেছিল নূহ, ‘আদ, সামূদ জাতি আর তাদের পরবর্তীদের উপর। আল্লাহ তো বান্দাহদের উপর যুলম করতে চান না (বরং তাদের নিজেদের অন্যায় অপকর্মের কারণেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে শাস্তি দেন)।', 'Like the custom of the people of Noah and of ''Aad and Thamud and those after them. And Allah wants no injustice for [His] servants.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040031.mp3', now()),
  (40, 32, '', '[{"id":34506,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34507,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34508,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"আমি ভয় করছি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34509,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34510,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34511,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّنَادِ","transliteration":"l-tanādi","translation_bn":"আর্তনাদের","root":"ندو","lemma":"تَّنَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34512,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi innī akhāfu ʿalaykum yawma l-tanādi', 'হে আমার জাতি! আমি আশঙ্কা করছি তোমাদের আর্ত চিৎকার আর কান্নাকাটি করার একটি দিনের।', 'And O my people, indeed I fear for you the Day of Calling -', 'হে আমার জাতি! আমি আশঙ্কা করছি তোমাদের আর্ত চিৎকার আর কান্নাকাটি করার একটি দিনের।', 'And O my people, indeed I fear for you the Day of Calling -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040032.mp3', now()),
  (40, 33, '', '[{"id":35201,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35202,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُوَلُّونَ","transliteration":"tuwallūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা পালাবে","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35203,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُدْبِرِينَ","transliteration":"mud''birīna","translation_bn":"পিছনে","root":"دبر","lemma":"مُدْبِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35204,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":35205,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35206,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35207,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35208,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35209,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَاصِمٍۢ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿāṣimin","translation_bn":"রক্ষাকারী","root":"عصم","lemma":"عَاصِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35211,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35212,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلِ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lili","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35213,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35214,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"তখন নাই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35215,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35216,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35217,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هَادٍۢ","transliteration":"hādin","translation_bn":"পথ প্রদর্শক","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35218,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma tuwallūna mud''birīna mā lakum mina l-lahi min ʿāṣimin waman yuḍ''lili l-lahu famā lahu min hādin', 'যেদিন তোমরা পিছন ফিরে পালিয়ে যাবে। কিন্তু আল্লাহ (’র কব্জা) থেকে তোমাদের রক্ষাকারী কেউ হবে না, আর আল্লাহ যাকে বিপথগামী করেন, তার জন্য কোন পথপ্রদর্শনকারী নেই।', 'The Day you will turn your backs fleeing; there is not for you from Allah any protector. And whoever Allah leaves astray - there is not for him any guide.', 'যেদিন তোমরা পিছন ফিরে পালিয়ে যাবে। কিন্তু আল্লাহ (’র কব্জা) থেকে তোমাদের রক্ষাকারী কেউ হবে না, আর আল্লাহ যাকে বিপথগামী করেন, তার জন্য কোন পথপ্রদর্শনকারী নেই।', 'The Day you will turn your backs fleeing; there is not for you from Allah any protector. And whoever Allah leaves astray - there is not for him any guide.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040033.mp3', now()),
  (40, 34, '', '[{"id":36193,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36194,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছিলো তোমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36195,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُوسُفُ","transliteration":"yūsufu","translation_bn":"ইউসুফ","root":"—","lemma":"يُوسُف","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36196,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36197,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"ইতি","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36198,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণসহ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36199,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36200,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"زِلْتُمْ","transliteration":"zil''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে সর্বদা","root":"زيل","lemma":"زَالَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36201,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36202,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَكٍّۢ","transliteration":"shakkin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"شكك","lemma":"شَكّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36203,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36204,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُم","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে এনেছিলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36205,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36207,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"অবশেষে","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":36208,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":36209,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هَلَكَ","transliteration":"halaka","translation_bn":"সে মারা গেলো","root":"هلك","lemma":"هَلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36210,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قُلْتُمْ","transliteration":"qul''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলেছিলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36211,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"\"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":36212,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَبْعَثَ","transliteration":"yabʿatha","translation_bn":"পাঠাবেন","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36213,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36214,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36215,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"তার","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36216,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"কোনো রাসূল\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36218,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36219,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلُّ","transliteration":"yuḍillu","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্ত করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36220,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36221,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36222,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":36223,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مُسْرِفٌۭ","transliteration":"mus''rifun","translation_bn":"সীমালংঘন","root":"سرف","lemma":"مُسْرِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36224,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"مُّرْتَابٌ","transliteration":"mur''tābun","translation_bn":"সংশয়বাদী\"","root":"ريب","lemma":"مُّرْتَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36225,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad jāakum yūsufu min qablu bil-bayināti famā zil''tum fī shakkin mimmā jāakum bihi ḥattā idhā halaka qul''tum lan yabʿatha l-lahu min baʿdihi rasūlan kadhālika yuḍillu l-lahu man huwa mus''rifun mur''tābun', 'ইতোপূর্বে ইউসুফ তোমাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল। কিন্তু সে তোমাদের কাছে যা নিয়ে এসেছিল, সে ব্যাপারে তোমরা সন্দেহ পোষণ করেই চললে। শেষ পর্যন্ত যখন তার মৃত্যু হল তখন তোমরা বললে- ওর পরে আল্লাহ আর কক্ষনো কোন রসূল পাঠাবেন না। সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী ও সন্দেহবাদীদেরকে আল্লাহ এভাবেই পথভ্রষ্ট করেন।', 'And Joseph had already come to you before with clear proofs, but you remained in doubt of that which he brought to you, until when he died, you said, ''Never will Allah send a messenger after him.'' Thus does Allah leave astray he who is a transgressor and skeptic."', 'ইতোপূর্বে ইউসুফ তোমাদের কাছে সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল। কিন্তু সে তোমাদের কাছে যা নিয়ে এসেছিল, সে ব্যাপারে তোমরা সন্দেহ পোষণ করেই চললে। শেষ পর্যন্ত যখন তার মৃত্যু হল তখন তোমরা বললে- ওর পরে আল্লাহ আর কক্ষনো কোন রসূল পাঠাবেন না। সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী ও সন্দেহবাদীদেরকে আল্লাহ এভাবেই পথভ্রষ্ট করেন।', 'And Joseph had already come to you before with clear proofs, but you remained in doubt of that which he brought to you, until when he died, you said, ''Never will Allah send a messenger after him.'' Thus does Allah leave astray he who is a transgressor and skeptic."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040034.mp3', now()),
  (40, 35, '', '[{"id":37020,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37021,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰدِلُونَ","transliteration":"yujādilūna","translation_bn":"তর্কে লিপ্ত হয়","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37022,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37023,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলীর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37024,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37025,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37026,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنٍ","transliteration":"sul''ṭānin","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রমাণ (যা)","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37027,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"atāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে এসেছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37029,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَبُرَ","transliteration":"kabura","translation_bn":"অতিশয় হয়েছে","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبُرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37030,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَقْتًا","transliteration":"maqtan","translation_bn":"ঘৃণা","root":"مقت","lemma":"مَقْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37031,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":37032,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37033,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَعِندَ","transliteration":"waʿinda","translation_bn":"ও কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37034,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37035,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37037,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37038,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَطْبَعُ","transliteration":"yaṭbaʿu","translation_bn":"সীল মেরে দেন","root":"طبع","lemma":"طَبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37039,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37040,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37041,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37042,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"قَلْبِ","transliteration":"qalbi","translation_bn":"অন্তরের (উপর)","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37043,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مُتَكَبِّرٍۢ","transliteration":"mutakabbirin","translation_bn":"(যা) অহংকারী","root":"كبر","lemma":"مُتَكَبِّر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37044,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"جَبَّارٍۢ","transliteration":"jabbārin","translation_bn":"স্বৈরাচারী\"","root":"جبر","lemma":"جَبَّار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":37045,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna yujādilūna fī āyāti l-lahi bighayri sul''ṭānin atāhum kabura maqtan ʿinda l-lahi waʿinda alladhīna āmanū kadhālika yaṭbaʿu l-lahu ʿalā kulli qalbi mutakabbirin jabbārin', 'যারা নিজেদের কাছে কোন যুক্তি-প্রমাণ না আসলেও আল্লাহর নিদর্শনাবলীর ব্যাপারে বাক-বিতন্ডা করে। আল্লাহর দৃষ্টিতে আর মু’মিনদের দৃষ্টিতে (এ আচরণ) খুবই ঘৃণিত। আল্লাহ এভাবে প্রত্যেক দাম্ভিক স্বৈরাচারীর অন্তরের উপর মোহর মেরে দেন।', 'Those who dispute concerning the signs of Allah without an authority having come to them - great is hatred [of them] in the sight of Allah and in the sight of those who have believed. Thus does Allah seal over every heart [belonging to] an arrogant tyrant.', 'যারা নিজেদের কাছে কোন যুক্তি-প্রমাণ না আসলেও আল্লাহর নিদর্শনাবলীর ব্যাপারে বাক-বিতন্ডা করে। আল্লাহর দৃষ্টিতে আর মু’মিনদের দৃষ্টিতে (এ আচরণ) খুবই ঘৃণিত। আল্লাহ এভাবে প্রত্যেক দাম্ভিক স্বৈরাচারীর অন্তরের উপর মোহর মেরে দেন।', 'Those who dispute concerning the signs of Allah without an authority having come to them - great is hatred [of them] in the sight of Allah and in the sight of those who have believed. Thus does Allah seal over every heart [belonging to] an arrogant tyrant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040035.mp3', now()),
  (40, 36, '', '[{"id":37897,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37898,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"ফিরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37899,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰهَـٰمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"yāhāmānu","translation_bn":"\"হে হামান","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰمَٰن","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":37900,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنِ","transliteration":"ib''ni","translation_bn":"নির্মাণ করো","root":"بني","lemma":"بَنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37901,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37902,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"صَرْحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣarḥan","translation_bn":"সুউচ্চ প্রাসাদ","root":"صرح","lemma":"صَرْح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37903,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلِّىٓ","transliteration":"laʿallī","translation_bn":"যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":37904,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَبْلُغُ","transliteration":"ablughu","translation_bn":"আমি পৌঁছি","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37905,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَسْبَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-asbāba","translation_bn":"পথসমূহে","root":"سبب","lemma":"سَبَب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37906,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla fir''ʿawnu yāhāmānu ib''ni lī ṣarḥan laʿallī ablughu l-asbāba', 'ফেরাউন বলল- হে হামান! তুমি আমার জন্য এক সুউচ্চ ইমারত তৈরি কর যাতে আমি উপায় পেয়ে যাই', 'And Pharaoh said, "O Haman, construct for me a tower that I might reach the ways -', 'ফেরাউন বলল- হে হামান! তুমি আমার জন্য এক সুউচ্চ ইমারত তৈরি কর যাতে আমি উপায় পেয়ে যাই', 'And Pharaoh said, "O Haman, construct for me a tower that I might reach the ways -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040036.mp3', now()),
  (40, 37, '', '[{"id":38612,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَسْبَـٰبَ","transliteration":"asbāba","translation_bn":"পথসমূহ","root":"سبب","lemma":"سَبَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38613,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38614,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَأَطَّلِعَ","transliteration":"fa-aṭṭaliʿa","translation_bn":"আমি অতঃপর উঁকি মেরে দেখি","root":"طلع","lemma":"طَّلَعَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":38615,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38616,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهِ","transliteration":"ilāhi","translation_bn":"ইলাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38617,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38618,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّى","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38619,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَأَظُنُّهُۥ","transliteration":"la-aẓunnuhu","translation_bn":"আমি অবশ্যই তাকে মনে করি","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":38620,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰذِبًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"kādhiban","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদী\"","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38622,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38623,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"زُيِّنَ","transliteration":"zuyyina","translation_bn":"শোভন করা হয়েছিলো","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38624,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِفِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"lifir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38625,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءُ","transliteration":"sūu","translation_bn":"খারাপ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38626,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿamalihi","translation_bn":"তার কাজ কর্ম","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38627,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَصُدَّ","transliteration":"waṣudda","translation_bn":"ও বিরত রাখা হয়েছিলো তাকে","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38628,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38629,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-sabīli","translation_bn":"(সঠিক) পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38631,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38632,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كَيْدُ","transliteration":"kaydu","translation_bn":"ষড়যন্ত্র  (কাজে লাগলো)","root":"كيد","lemma":"كَيْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38633,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38634,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":38635,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38636,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"تَبَابٍۢ","transliteration":"tabābin","translation_bn":"ধংসের (পতিত হলো)","root":"تبب","lemma":"تَبَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38637,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'asbāba l-samāwāti fa-aṭṭaliʿa ilā ilāhi mūsā wa-innī la-aẓunnuhu kādhiban wakadhālika zuyyina lifir''ʿawna sūu ʿamalihi waṣudda ʿani l-sabīli wamā kaydu fir''ʿawna illā fī tabābin', 'আকাশে উঠার উপায়, যাতে আমি মূসার ইলাহকে দেখতে পাই; আমি মূসাকে অবশ্যই মিথ্যাবাদী মনে করি। এভাবে ফেরাউনের জন্য তার মন্দ কাজকে সুশোভিত করা হয়েছিল আর সঠিক পথ থেকে তাকে বিরত রাখা হয়েছিল। ফেরাউনের অপকৌশল কেবল তার ধ্বংসই ডেকে এনেছিল।', 'The ways into the heavens - so that I may look at the deity of Moses; but indeed, I think he is a liar." And thus was made attractive to Pharaoh the evil of his deed, and he was averted from the [right] way. And the plan of Pharaoh was not except in ruin.', 'আকাশে উঠার উপায়, যাতে আমি মূসার ইলাহকে দেখতে পাই; আমি মূসাকে অবশ্যই মিথ্যাবাদী মনে করি। এভাবে ফেরাউনের জন্য তার মন্দ কাজকে সুশোভিত করা হয়েছিল আর সঠিক পথ থেকে তাকে বিরত রাখা হয়েছিল। ফেরাউনের অপকৌশল কেবল তার ধ্বংসই ডেকে এনেছিল।', 'The ways into the heavens - so that I may look at the deity of Moses; but indeed, I think he is a liar." And thus was made attractive to Pharaoh the evil of his deed, and he was averted from the [right] way. And the plan of Pharaoh was not except in ruin.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040037.mp3', now()),
  (40, 38, '', '[{"id":39523,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39524,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39525,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39526,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":39527,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبِعُونِ","transliteration":"ittabiʿūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39528,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَهْدِكُمْ","transliteration":"ahdikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে আমি পরিচালিত করবো","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39529,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلَ","transliteration":"sabīla","translation_bn":"পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39530,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّشَادِ","transliteration":"l-rashādi","translation_bn":"সঠিক","root":"رشد","lemma":"رَّشَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39531,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla alladhī āmana yāqawmi ittabiʿūni ahdikum sabīla l-rashādi', 'যে লোকটি ঈমান এনেছিল সে আরো বলল- হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! তোমরা আমার অনুসরণ কর, আমি তোমাদেরকে সঠিক পথ দেখাচ্ছি।', 'And he who believed said, "O my people, follow me, I will guide you to the way of right conduct.', 'যে লোকটি ঈমান এনেছিল সে আরো বলল- হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! তোমরা আমার অনুসরণ কর, আমি তোমাদেরকে সঠিক পথ দেখাচ্ছি।', 'And he who believed said, "O my people, follow me, I will guide you to the way of right conduct.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040038.mp3', now()),
  (40, 39, '', '[{"id":40307,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":40308,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40309,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":40310,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","translation_bn":"জীবন","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40311,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40312,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَتَـٰعٌۭ","transliteration":"matāʿun","translation_bn":"উপভোগের বস্তু (অস্থায়ী)","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40313,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"আর নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40314,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","translation_bn":"পরকাল","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40315,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":40316,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دَارُ","transliteration":"dāru","translation_bn":"ঘর (স্থায়ী)","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40317,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرَارِ","transliteration":"l-qarāri","translation_bn":"অবস্থানের","root":"قرر","lemma":"قَرَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40318,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāqawmi innamā hādhihi l-ḥayatu l-dun''yā matāʿun wa-inna l-ākhirata hiya dāru l-qarāri', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! পার্থিব এ জীবন (অস্থায়ী) ভোগ্য বস্তু মাত্র, আর আখিরাতই হল চিরকালীন আবাসস্থল।', 'O my people, this worldly life is only [temporary] enjoyment, and indeed, the Hereafter - that is the home of [permanent] settlement.', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! পার্থিব এ জীবন (অস্থায়ী) ভোগ্য বস্তু মাত্র, আর আখিরাতই হল চিরকালীন আবাসস্থল।', 'O my people, this worldly life is only [temporary] enjoyment, and indeed, the Hereafter - that is the home of [permanent] settlement.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040039.mp3', now()),
  (40, 40, '', '[{"id":41035,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41036,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلَ","transliteration":"ʿamila","translation_bn":"কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41037,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّئَةًۭ","transliteration":"sayyi-atan","translation_bn":"মন্দ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41038,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41039,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُجْزَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yuj''zā","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল দেওয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41040,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":41041,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"mith''lahā","translation_bn":"তার সমান","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41043,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41044,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلَ","transliteration":"ʿamila","translation_bn":"কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41045,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41046,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41047,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَكَرٍ","transliteration":"dhakarin","translation_bn":"পুরুষের","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41048,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41049,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أُنثَىٰ","transliteration":"unthā","translation_bn":"নারীর","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41050,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় সে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":41051,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنٌۭ","transliteration":"mu''minun","translation_bn":"মু''মিনও","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41052,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ঐ সব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41053,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَدْخُلُونَ","transliteration":"yadkhulūna","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করবে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41054,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ","transliteration":"l-janata","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41055,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يُرْزَقُونَ","transliteration":"yur''zaqūna","translation_bn":"তাদের জীবনোপকরণ দেয়া হবে","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41056,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41057,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়াই","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41058,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"حِسَابٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥisābin","translation_bn":"কোন হিসাব","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41059,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man ʿamila sayyi-atan falā yuj''zā illā mith''lahā waman ʿamila ṣāliḥan min dhakarin aw unthā wahuwa mu''minun fa-ulāika yadkhulūna l-janata yur''zaqūna fīhā bighayri ḥisābin', 'যে খারাপ কাজ করবে তাকে কাজের অনুপাতেই প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে। পুরুষ হোক আর নারী হোক যে ব্যক্তিই সৎ কাজ করবে (উপরন্তু) সে মু’মিনও, তাহলে তারাই জান্নাতে প্রবেশ করবে, তার মধ্যে তারা বে-হিসাব রিযক প্রাপ্ত হবে।', 'Whoever does an evil deed will not be recompensed except by the like thereof; but whoever does righteousness, whether male or female, while he is a believer - those will enter Paradise, being given provision therein without account.', 'যে খারাপ কাজ করবে তাকে কাজের অনুপাতেই প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে। পুরুষ হোক আর নারী হোক যে ব্যক্তিই সৎ কাজ করবে (উপরন্তু) সে মু’মিনও, তাহলে তারাই জান্নাতে প্রবেশ করবে, তার মধ্যে তারা বে-হিসাব রিযক প্রাপ্ত হবে।', 'Whoever does an evil deed will not be recompensed except by the like thereof; but whoever does righteousness, whether male or female, while he is a believer - those will enter Paradise, being given provision therein without account.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040040.mp3', now()),
  (40, 41, '', '[{"id":41949,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"wayāqawmi","translation_bn":"এবং (সে বললো) হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41950,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(এটা)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41951,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِىٓ","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে কেমন আচরণ","root":"—","lemma":"لِىٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41952,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَدْعُوكُمْ","transliteration":"adʿūkum","translation_bn":"আমি তোমাদের ডাকছি","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41953,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41954,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّجَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-najati","translation_bn":"পরিত্রাণের","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَّجَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41955,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَدْعُونَنِىٓ","transliteration":"watadʿūnanī","translation_bn":"অথচ আমাকে তোমরা ডাকছো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":41956,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41957,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41958,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayāqawmi mā lī adʿūkum ilā l-najati watadʿūnanī ilā l-nāri', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! বড়ই আশ্চর্য! আমি তোমাদেরকে ডাকছি মুক্তির দিকে, আর তোমরা ডাকছো আগুনের দিকে।', 'And O my people, how is it that I invite you to salvation while you invite me to the Fire?', 'হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! বড়ই আশ্চর্য! আমি তোমাদেরকে ডাকছি মুক্তির দিকে, আর তোমরা ডাকছো আগুনের দিকে।', 'And O my people, how is it that I invite you to salvation while you invite me to the Fire?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040041.mp3', now()),
  (40, 42, '', '[{"id":42714,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَنِى","transliteration":"tadʿūnanī","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা ডাকছো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42715,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِأَكْفُرَ","transliteration":"li-akfura","translation_bn":"যেন আমি অস্বীকার করি","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42716,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"প্রতি আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42717,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأُشْرِكَ","transliteration":"wa-ush''rika","translation_bn":"ও  শরিক করি (যেন) আমি","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42718,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42719,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42720,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42721,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42722,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42723,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42724,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"এবং আমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42725,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَدْعُوكُمْ","transliteration":"adʿūkum","translation_bn":"ডাকছি তোমাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42726,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42727,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzi","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালীর","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42728,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَفَّـٰرِ","transliteration":"l-ghafāri","translation_bn":"(যিনি) পরম ক্ষমাশীলও","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَّار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42729,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'tadʿūnanī li-akfura bil-lahi wa-ush''rika bihi mā laysa lī bihi ʿil''mun wa-anā adʿūkum ilā l-ʿazīzi l-ghafāri', 'তোমরা আমাকে ডাকছ যেন আমি আল্লাহর সাথে কুফুরী করি এবং তাঁর অংশী স্থাপন করি যে সম্পর্কে আমার কোন জ্ঞান নেই। অপরপক্ষে আমি তোমাদেরকে ডাকছি মহাপরাক্রান্ত ক্ষমাশীল (আল্লাহর) দিকে।', 'You invite me to disbelieve in Allah and associate with Him that of which I have no knowledge, and I invite you to the Exalted in Might, the Perpetual Forgiver.', 'তোমরা আমাকে ডাকছ যেন আমি আল্লাহর সাথে কুফুরী করি এবং তাঁর অংশী স্থাপন করি যে সম্পর্কে আমার কোন জ্ঞান নেই। অপরপক্ষে আমি তোমাদেরকে ডাকছি মহাপরাক্রান্ত ক্ষমাশীল (আল্লাহর) দিকে।', 'You invite me to disbelieve in Allah and associate with Him that of which I have no knowledge, and I invite you to the Exalted in Might, the Perpetual Forgiver.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040042.mp3', now()),
  (40, 43, '', '[{"id":43451,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":43452,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَرَمَ","transliteration":"jarama","translation_bn":"কোনো সন্দেহ","root":"جرم","lemma":"جَرَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43453,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّمَا","transliteration":"annamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":43454,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَنِىٓ","transliteration":"tadʿūnanī","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা ডাকছো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43455,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"যার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43456,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43457,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43458,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دَعْوَةٌۭ","transliteration":"daʿwatun","translation_bn":"কোনো আহবান","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعْوَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43459,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43460,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43461,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43462,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43463,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"পরকালের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43464,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43465,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَرَدَّنَآ","transliteration":"maraddanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন হবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"مَرَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43466,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43467,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":43468,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও সত্য) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43469,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ","transliteration":"l-mus''rifīna","translation_bn":"সীমালংঘনকারী","root":"سرف","lemma":"مُسْرِف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43470,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":43471,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43472,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43473,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā jarama annamā tadʿūnanī ilayhi laysa lahu daʿwatun fī l-dun''yā walā fī l-ākhirati wa-anna maraddanā ilā l-lahi wa-anna l-mus''rifīna hum aṣḥābu l-nāri', 'কোন সন্দেহ নেই তোমরা আমাকে ডাকছ শুধু তার দিকে যে আহবান পাওয়ার যোগ্য নয়- না দুনিয়াতে, না আখিরাতে। আমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন তো হল আল্লাহর দিকে আর সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা হল জাহান্নামের বাসিন্দা।', 'Assuredly, that to which you invite me has no [response to a] supplication in this world or in the Hereafter; and indeed, our return is to Allah, and indeed, the transgressors will be companions of the Fire.', 'কোন সন্দেহ নেই তোমরা আমাকে ডাকছ শুধু তার দিকে যে আহবান পাওয়ার যোগ্য নয়- না দুনিয়াতে, না আখিরাতে। আমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন তো হল আল্লাহর দিকে আর সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা হল জাহান্নামের বাসিন্দা।', 'Assuredly, that to which you invite me has no [response to a] supplication in this world or in the Hereafter; and indeed, our return is to Allah, and indeed, the transgressors will be companions of the Fire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040043.mp3', now()),
  (40, 44, '', '[{"id":44172,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَسَتَذْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"fasatadhkurūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অতঃপর শীঘ্রই স্মরণ করবে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44173,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":44174,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَقُولُ","transliteration":"aqūlu","translation_bn":"আমি বলছি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44175,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44177,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأُفَوِّضُ","transliteration":"wa-ufawwiḍu","translation_bn":"এবং সমর্পণ করছি আমি","root":"فوض","lemma":"أُفَوِّضُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44178,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِىٓ","transliteration":"amrī","translation_bn":"আমার ব্যাপারে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44179,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44180,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44182,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":44183,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44184,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"সবিশেষ দৃষ্টি রাখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":44185,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْعِبَادِ","transliteration":"bil-ʿibādi","translation_bn":"প্রতি দাসদের\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44186,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fasatadhkurūna mā aqūlu lakum wa-ufawwiḍu amrī ilā l-lahi inna l-laha baṣīrun bil-ʿibādi', 'শীঘ্রই তোমরা স্মরণ করবে আমি তোমাদেরকে যা বলছি। আমি আমার নিজের ব্যাপারটা আল্লাহর উপর সোপর্দ করছি (আমার বাঁচা-মরার জন্য আমি মোটেও ভাবি না)। আল্লাহ তাঁর বান্দাহদের উপর (সদাসর্বদা) দৃষ্টি রাখেন।', 'And you will remember what I [now] say to you, and I entrust my affair to Allah. Indeed, Allah is Seeing of [His] servants."', 'শীঘ্রই তোমরা স্মরণ করবে আমি তোমাদেরকে যা বলছি। আমি আমার নিজের ব্যাপারটা আল্লাহর উপর সোপর্দ করছি (আমার বাঁচা-মরার জন্য আমি মোটেও ভাবি না)। আল্লাহ তাঁর বান্দাহদের উপর (সদাসর্বদা) দৃষ্টি রাখেন।', 'And you will remember what I [now] say to you, and I entrust my affair to Allah. Indeed, Allah is Seeing of [His] servants."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040044.mp3', now()),
  (40, 45, '', '[{"id":45568,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَوَقَىٰهُ","transliteration":"fawaqāhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাকে বাঁচালেন","root":"وقي","lemma":"وَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45569,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45570,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّـَٔاتِ","transliteration":"sayyiāti","translation_bn":"অনিষ্টসমূহ হ''তে","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45571,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45572,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَكَرُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"makarū","translation_bn":"তারা চক্রান্ত করেছিলো","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45574,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَحَاقَ","transliteration":"waḥāqa","translation_bn":"এবং ঘিরে ফেললো","root":"حيق","lemma":"حَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45575,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔالِ","transliteration":"biāli","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"اول","lemma":"ءَال","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45576,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45577,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءُ","transliteration":"sūu","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45578,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তিতে","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45579,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fawaqāhu l-lahu sayyiāti mā makarū waḥāqa biāli fir''ʿawna sūu l-ʿadhābi', 'অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাকে তাদের ষড়যন্ত্রের খারাবী থেকে রক্ষা করলেন, আর কঠিন শাস্তি ফেরাউনের লোকজনকে চতুর্দিক থেকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'So Allah protected him from the evils they plotted, and the people of Pharaoh were enveloped by the worst of punishment -', 'অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাকে তাদের ষড়যন্ত্রের খারাবী থেকে রক্ষা করলেন, আর কঠিন শাস্তি ফেরাউনের লোকজনকে চতুর্দিক থেকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'So Allah protected him from the evils they plotted, and the people of Pharaoh were enveloped by the worst of punishment -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040045.mp3', now()),
  (40, 46, '', '[{"id":45651,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ","transliteration":"al-nāru","translation_bn":"(দোজখের) আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45652,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُعْرَضُونَ","transliteration":"yuʿ''raḍūna","translation_bn":"তাদের পেশ করা হয়","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45653,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45654,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غُدُوًّۭا","transliteration":"ghuduwwan","translation_bn":"সকালে","root":"غدو","lemma":"غُدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45655,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعَشِيًّۭا ۖ","transliteration":"waʿashiyyan","translation_bn":"ও সন্ধ্যায়","root":"عشو","lemma":"عَشِىّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45657,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যে দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45658,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَقُومُ","transliteration":"taqūmu","translation_bn":"ঘটবে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45659,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45660,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَدْخِلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"adkhilū","translation_bn":"\"(তখন বলা হবে) প্রবেশ করাও","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45661,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَالَ","transliteration":"āla","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"اول","lemma":"ءَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45662,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45663,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدَّ","transliteration":"ashadda","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":45664,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তিতে\"","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45665,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-nāru yuʿ''raḍūna ʿalayhā ghuduwwan waʿashiyyan wayawma taqūmu l-sāʿatu adkhilū āla fir''ʿawna ashadda l-ʿadhābi', '(ক্ববরে) তাদেরকে সকাল-সন্ধ্যায় জাহান্নামের সামনে উপস্থিত করা হয় আর যেদিন ক্বিয়ামত সংঘটিত হবে সেদিন (বলা হবে) ফেরাউনের জাতি গোষ্ঠীকে কঠিন ‘আযাবে প্রবিষ্ট কর।', 'The Fire, they are exposed to it morning and evening. And the Day the Hour appears [it will be said], "Make the people of Pharaoh enter the severest punishment."', '(ক্ববরে) তাদেরকে সকাল-সন্ধ্যায় জাহান্নামের সামনে উপস্থিত করা হয় আর যেদিন ক্বিয়ামত সংঘটিত হবে সেদিন (বলা হবে) ফেরাউনের জাতি গোষ্ঠীকে কঠিন ‘আযাবে প্রবিষ্ট কর।', 'The Fire, they are exposed to it morning and evening. And the Day the Hour appears [it will be said], "Make the people of Pharaoh enter the severest punishment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040046.mp3', now()),
  (40, 47, '', '[{"id":46947,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (ভেবে দেখো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46948,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَحَآجُّونَ","transliteration":"yataḥājjūna","translation_bn":"তারা তর্কাতর্কি করবে","root":"حجج","lemma":"يَتَحَا^جُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46949,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46950,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46951,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","translation_bn":"তখন বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46952,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضُّعَفَـٰٓؤُا۟","transliteration":"l-ḍuʿafāu","translation_bn":"দুর্বলেরা","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعِيف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46953,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের)-কে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46954,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকার করে (বড় বনে) ছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46955,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":46956,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46957,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46958,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَبَعًۭا","transliteration":"tabaʿan","translation_bn":"অনুসারী","root":"تبع","lemma":"تَبَع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46959,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"কি এখন","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46960,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُم","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":46961,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّغْنُونَ","transliteration":"mugh''nūna","translation_bn":"কাজে আসবে","root":"غني","lemma":"مُّغْنُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46962,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَنَّا","transliteration":"ʿannā","translation_bn":"আমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46963,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"نَصِيبًۭا","transliteration":"naṣīban","translation_bn":"কিছু অংশ (কমাতে)","root":"نصب","lemma":"نَصِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46964,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46965,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"(দোযখের) আগুনের\"","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46966,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh yataḥājjūna fī l-nāri fayaqūlu l-ḍuʿafāu lilladhīna is''takbarū innā kunnā lakum tabaʿan fahal antum mugh''nūna ʿannā naṣīban mina l-nāri', 'জাহান্নামে তারা যখন বাক-বিতন্ডা করবে, তখন দুর্বলেরা দাপটওয়ালাদের বলবে- আমরা তো তোমাদেরই অনুসারী ছিলাম, কাজেই তোমরা কি (এখন) আমাদের আগুনের শাস্তির কিছুটা শেয়ার নেবে?', 'And [mention] when they will argue within the Fire, and the weak will say to those who had been arrogant, "Indeed, we were [only] your followers, so will you relieve us of a share of the Fire?"', 'জাহান্নামে তারা যখন বাক-বিতন্ডা করবে, তখন দুর্বলেরা দাপটওয়ালাদের বলবে- আমরা তো তোমাদেরই অনুসারী ছিলাম, কাজেই তোমরা কি (এখন) আমাদের আগুনের শাস্তির কিছুটা শেয়ার নেবে?', 'And [mention] when they will argue within the Fire, and the weak will say to those who had been arrogant, "Indeed, we were [only] your followers, so will you relieve us of a share of the Fire?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040047.mp3', now()),
  (40, 48, '', '[{"id":47028,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47029,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47030,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকার করে (বড় বনে) ছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47031,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47032,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلٌّۭ","transliteration":"kullun","translation_bn":"সবাই","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47033,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে (একই অবস্থায়)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47034,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47035,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47036,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":47037,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَكَمَ","transliteration":"ḥakama","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা করে দিয়েছেন","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47038,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":47039,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِبَادِ","transliteration":"l-ʿibādi","translation_bn":"দাসদের\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47040,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alladhīna is''takbarū innā kullun fīhā inna l-laha qad ḥakama bayna l-ʿibādi', 'দাপটওয়ালারা বলবে- আগুনে আমরা সবাই তো আছি, আল্লাহ বান্দাহদের বিচার তো করেই ফেলেছেন।', 'Those who had been arrogant will say, "Indeed, all [of us] are in it. Indeed, Allah has judged between the servants."', 'দাপটওয়ালারা বলবে- আগুনে আমরা সবাই তো আছি, আল্লাহ বান্দাহদের বিচার তো করেই ফেলেছেন।', 'Those who had been arrogant will say, "Indeed, all [of us] are in it. Indeed, Allah has judged between the servants."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040048.mp3', now()),
  (40, 49, '', '[{"id":48247,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48248,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":48249,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48250,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48251,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِخَزَنَةِ","transliteration":"likhazanati","translation_bn":"প্রহরীদেরকে","root":"خزن","lemma":"خَزَنَت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48252,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48253,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"id''ʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা প্রার্থনা করো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48254,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের কাছে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48255,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُخَفِّفْ","transliteration":"yukhaffif","translation_bn":"কমিয়ে দেন (যেন)","root":"خفف","lemma":"خَفَّفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48256,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَنَّا","transliteration":"ʿannā","translation_bn":"আমাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48257,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"yawman","translation_bn":"একদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48258,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48259,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির\"","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48260,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla alladhīna fī l-nāri likhazanati jahannama id''ʿū rabbakum yukhaffif ʿannā yawman mina l-ʿadhābi', 'আগুনের বাসিন্দারা জাহান্নামের রক্ষীদের বলবে- তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট দু‘আ কর, তিনি যেন আমাদের থেকে একদিনের শাস্তি কমিয়ে দেন।', 'And those in the Fire will say to the keepers of Hell, "Supplicate your Lord to lighten for us a day from the punishment."', 'আগুনের বাসিন্দারা জাহান্নামের রক্ষীদের বলবে- তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট দু‘আ কর, তিনি যেন আমাদের থেকে একদিনের শাস্তি কমিয়ে দেন।', 'And those in the Fire will say to the keepers of Hell, "Supplicate your Lord to lighten for us a day from the punishment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040049.mp3', now()),
  (40, 50, '', '[{"id":48963,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48964,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"\"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48965,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَكُ","transliteration":"taku","translation_bn":"\"","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48966,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيكُمْ","transliteration":"tatīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48967,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُكُم","transliteration":"rusulukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রাসূলগণ","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48968,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণসহ\"","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48970,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"(দোযখীরা) বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48971,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"balā","translation_bn":"\"হ্যাঁ\"","root":"—","lemma":"بَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":48973,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"(প্রহরীরা) বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48974,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱدْعُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"fa-id''ʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরাই প্রার্থনা করো তাহ''লে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48976,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48977,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دُعَـٰٓؤُا۟","transliteration":"duʿāu","translation_bn":"প্রার্থনা","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48978,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফেরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48979,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":48980,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48981,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থতার\"","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48982,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū awalam taku tatīkum rusulukum bil-bayināti qālū balā qālū fa-id''ʿū wamā duʿāu l-kāfirīna illā fī ḍalālin', 'রক্ষীগণ বলবে- রসূলগণ কি স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ নিয়ে তোমাদের কাছে আসেনি? তারা (উত্তরে) বলবে, হাঁ (এসেছিল)। জাহান্নামের রক্ষীরা বলবে- তাহলে তোমরাই দু‘আ কর, কাফিরদের দু‘আ নিষ্ফলই হয়।', 'They will say, "Did there not come to you your messengers with clear proofs?" They will say, "Yes." They will reply, "Then supplicate [yourselves], but the supplication of the disbelievers is not except in error."', 'রক্ষীগণ বলবে- রসূলগণ কি স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ নিয়ে তোমাদের কাছে আসেনি? তারা (উত্তরে) বলবে, হাঁ (এসেছিল)। জাহান্নামের রক্ষীরা বলবে- তাহলে তোমরাই দু‘আ কর, কাফিরদের দু‘আ নিষ্ফলই হয়।', 'They will say, "Did there not come to you your messengers with clear proofs?" They will say, "Yes." They will reply, "Then supplicate [yourselves], but the supplication of the disbelievers is not except in error."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040050.mp3', now()),
  (40, 51, '', '[{"id":49576,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49577,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَنَنصُرُ","transliteration":"lananṣuru","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সাহায্য করবো","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":49578,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلَنَا","transliteration":"rusulanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রাসূলগণকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49579,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49580,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে (তাদেরকে)","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49581,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49582,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49583,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49584,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49585,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَقُومُ","transliteration":"yaqūmu","translation_bn":"দাঁড়াবে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49586,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَشْهَـٰدُ","transliteration":"l-ashhādu","translation_bn":"সাক্ষীরা","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَاهِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49587,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā lananṣuru rusulanā wa-alladhīna āmanū fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā wayawma yaqūmu l-ashhādu', 'আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে আর মু’মিনদেরকে অবশ্যই সাহায্য করব দুনিয়ার জীবনে আর (ক্বিয়ামতে) যে দিন সাক্ষীরা দাঁড়াবে।', 'Indeed, We will support Our messengers and those who believe during the life of this world and on the Day when the witnesses will stand -', 'আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে আর মু’মিনদেরকে অবশ্যই সাহায্য করব দুনিয়ার জীবনে আর (ক্বিয়ামতে) যে দিন সাক্ষীরা দাঁড়াবে।', 'Indeed, We will support Our messengers and those who believe during the life of this world and on the Day when the witnesses will stand -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040051.mp3', now()),
  (40, 52, '', '[{"id":49728,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49729,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":49730,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُ","transliteration":"yanfaʿu","translation_bn":"উপকার দিবে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49731,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের (জন্য)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49732,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَعْذِرَتُهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"maʿdhiratuhum","translation_bn":"অযুহাত তাদের","root":"عذر","lemma":"مَعْذِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49734,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمُ","transliteration":"walahumu","translation_bn":"আর তাদের জন্যে রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49735,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّعْنَةُ","transliteration":"l-laʿnatu","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعْنَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49736,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49737,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءُ","transliteration":"sūu","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49738,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّارِ","transliteration":"l-dāri","translation_bn":"আবাস (হবে জাহান্নাম)","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49739,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma lā yanfaʿu l-ẓālimīna maʿdhiratuhum walahumu l-laʿnatu walahum sūu l-dāri', 'যেদিন যালিমদের ওজর-আপত্তি কোন উপকারে আসবে না। তাদের জন্য আছে লা‘নত, তাদের জন্য আছে নিকৃষ্ট বাসস্থান।', 'The Day their excuse will not benefit the wrongdoers, and they will have the curse, and they will have the worst home.', 'যেদিন যালিমদের ওজর-আপত্তি কোন উপকারে আসবে না। তাদের জন্য আছে লা‘নত, তাদের জন্য আছে নিকৃষ্ট বাসস্থান।', 'The Day their excuse will not benefit the wrongdoers, and they will have the curse, and they will have the worst home.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040052.mp3', now()),
  (40, 53, '', '[{"id":50861,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50862,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"ātaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50863,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَى","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50864,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"পথের দিশা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50865,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْرَثْنَا","transliteration":"wa-awrathnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা উত্তরাধিকারী করেছিলাম","root":"ورث","lemma":"أَوْرَثَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50866,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَنِىٓ","transliteration":"banī","translation_bn":"সন্তানদেরকে","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50867,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50868,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50869,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ātaynā mūsā l-hudā wa-awrathnā banī is''rāīla l-kitāba', 'ইতোপূর্বে আমি মূসাকে দিয়েছিলাম- পথ নির্দেশ আর বানী ইসরাঈলকে করেছিলাম (মূসার নিকট প্রদত্ত) কিতাবের উত্তরাধিকারী।', 'And We had certainly given Moses guidance, and We caused the Children of Israel to inherit the Scripture', 'ইতোপূর্বে আমি মূসাকে দিয়েছিলাম- পথ নির্দেশ আর বানী ইসরাঈলকে করেছিলাম (মূসার নিকট প্রদত্ত) কিতাবের উত্তরাধিকারী।', 'And We had certainly given Moses guidance, and We caused the Children of Israel to inherit the Scripture', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040053.mp3', now()),
  (40, 54, '', '[{"id":50974,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"পথ নির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50975,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَذِكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"wadhik''rā","translation_bn":"ও উপদেশ স্বরূপ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50976,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِأُو۟لِى","transliteration":"li-ulī","translation_bn":"সম্পন্নদের জন্যে","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50977,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-albābi","translation_bn":"বুদ্ধি-বিবেক","root":"لبب","lemma":"أَلْبَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50978,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hudan wadhik''rā li-ulī l-albābi', '(সে কিতাব ছিল) জ্ঞানবুদ্ধিসম্পন্ন লোকেদের জন্য সঠিক পথের দিশারী ও উপদেশ।', 'As guidance and a reminder for those of understanding.', '(সে কিতাব ছিল) জ্ঞানবুদ্ধিসম্পন্ন লোকেদের জন্য সঠিক পথের দিশারী ও উপদেশ।', 'As guidance and a reminder for those of understanding.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040054.mp3', now()),
  (40, 55, '', '[{"id":51823,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"সুতরাং ধৈর্য্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51824,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51825,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَ","transliteration":"waʿda","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51826,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51827,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَقٌّۭ","transliteration":"ḥaqqun","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51828,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wa-is''taghfir","translation_bn":"এবং ক্ষমা চাও","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51829,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِذَنۢبِكَ","transliteration":"lidhanbika","translation_bn":"তোমার পাপের জন্যে","root":"ذنب","lemma":"ذَنب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51830,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَسَبِّحْ","transliteration":"wasabbiḥ","translation_bn":"ও পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা করো","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51831,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِحَمْدِ","transliteration":"biḥamdi","translation_bn":"প্রশংসাসহ","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51832,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51833,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْعَشِىِّ","transliteration":"bil-ʿashiyi","translation_bn":"সন্ধ্যাসমূহে","root":"عشو","lemma":"عَشِىّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51834,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِبْكَـٰرِ","transliteration":"wal-ib''kāri","translation_bn":"ও সকালসমূহে","root":"بكر","lemma":"إِبْكَٰر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51835,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iṣ''bir inna waʿda l-lahi ḥaqqun wa-is''taghfir lidhanbika wasabbiḥ biḥamdi rabbika bil-ʿashiyi wal-ib''kāri', 'কাজেই তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর, (তুমি দেখতে পাবে) আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য। তুমি তোমার ভুল-ভ্রান্তির জন্য ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর আর সকাল-সন্ধ্যা তোমার প্রতিপালকের প্রশংসা সহকারে পবিত্রতা বর্ণনা কর।', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad]. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And ask forgiveness for your sin and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord in the evening and the morning.', 'কাজেই তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর, (তুমি দেখতে পাবে) আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য। তুমি তোমার ভুল-ভ্রান্তির জন্য ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর আর সকাল-সন্ধ্যা তোমার প্রতিপালকের প্রশংসা সহকারে পবিত্রতা বর্ণনা কর।', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad]. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And ask forgiveness for your sin and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord in the evening and the morning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040055.mp3', now()),
  (40, 56, '', '[{"id":52081,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52082,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52083,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰدِلُونَ","transliteration":"yujādilūna","translation_bn":"তর্ক করে","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52084,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52085,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"আয়াতসমূহে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52086,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52087,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52088,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنٍ","transliteration":"sul''ṭānin","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রমাণ","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52089,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰهُمْ ۙ","transliteration":"atāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে (যা) এসেছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52091,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52092,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52093,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"صُدُورِهِمْ","transliteration":"ṣudūrihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরসমূহের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52094,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":52095,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كِبْرٌۭ","transliteration":"kib''run","translation_bn":"(বড়ত্বের) অহংকার","root":"كبر","lemma":"كِبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52096,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(যাতে) না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52097,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52098,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِبَـٰلِغِيهِ ۚ","transliteration":"bibālighīhi","translation_bn":"পৌঁছিবে","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَٰلِغ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52100,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَعِذْ","transliteration":"fa-is''taʿidh","translation_bn":"সুতরাং আশ্রয় চাও","root":"عوذ","lemma":"ٱسْتَعِذْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52101,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (কাছে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52103,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52104,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52105,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","translation_bn":"সবকিছু শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52106,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-baṣīru","translation_bn":"সবকিছু দেখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52107,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna yujādilūna fī āyāti l-lahi bighayri sul''ṭānin atāhum in fī ṣudūrihim illā kib''run mā hum bibālighīhi fa-is''taʿidh bil-lahi innahu huwa l-samīʿu l-baṣīru', 'কোন সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ না পেয়েই যারা আল্লাহর আয়াত সম্পর্কে তর্ক করে, তাদের বুকের ভিতর আছে কেবল অহংকার, কিন্তু তারা তা (অর্থাৎ প্রকৃত বড়ত্ব ও শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব আল্লাহর দয়া ছাড়া) কক্ষনো অর্জন করতে পারে না। কাজেই আল্লাহর কাছে আশ্রয় চাও, (কারণ) তিনি সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু দেখেন।', 'Indeed, those who dispute concerning the signs of Allah without [any] authority having come to them - there is not within their breasts except pride, [the extent of] which they cannot reach. So seek refuge in Allah. Indeed, it is He who is the Hearing, the Seeing.', 'কোন সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ না পেয়েই যারা আল্লাহর আয়াত সম্পর্কে তর্ক করে, তাদের বুকের ভিতর আছে কেবল অহংকার, কিন্তু তারা তা (অর্থাৎ প্রকৃত বড়ত্ব ও শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব আল্লাহর দয়া ছাড়া) কক্ষনো অর্জন করতে পারে না। কাজেই আল্লাহর কাছে আশ্রয় চাও, (কারণ) তিনি সব কিছু শোনেন, সব কিছু দেখেন।', 'Indeed, those who dispute concerning the signs of Allah without [any] authority having come to them - there is not within their breasts except pride, [the extent of] which they cannot reach. So seek refuge in Allah. Indeed, it is He who is the Hearing, the Seeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040056.mp3', now()),
  (40, 57, '', '[{"id":52566,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَخَلْقُ","transliteration":"lakhalqu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সৃষ্টি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":52567,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52568,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52569,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَكْبَرُ","transliteration":"akbaru","translation_bn":"অনেক কঠিন","root":"كبر","lemma":"أَكْبَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":52570,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52571,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَلْقِ","transliteration":"khalqi","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52572,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52573,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52574,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52575,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষই","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52576,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52577,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52578,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lakhalqu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi akbaru min khalqi l-nāsi walākinna akthara l-nāsi lā yaʿlamūna', 'অবশ্যই আসমান ও যমীনের সৃষ্টি মানুষ সৃষ্টির চেয়ে বড় (ব্যাপার)। কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষ (অজ্ঞতা ও চিন্তা না করার কারণে) তা জানে না।', 'The creation of the heavens and earth is greater than the creation of mankind, but most of the people do not know.', 'অবশ্যই আসমান ও যমীনের সৃষ্টি মানুষ সৃষ্টির চেয়ে বড় (ব্যাপার)। কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষ (অজ্ঞতা ও চিন্তা না করার কারণে) তা জানে না।', 'The creation of the heavens and earth is greater than the creation of mankind, but most of the people do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040057.mp3', now()),
  (40, 58, '', '[{"id":53292,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53293,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53294,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"l-aʿmā","translation_bn":"অন্ধ","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53295,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَصِيرُ","transliteration":"wal-baṣīru","translation_bn":"আর চক্ষুষ্মান","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53296,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53297,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53298,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53299,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ (তারা)","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53300,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53301,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسِىٓءُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-musīu","translation_bn":"দুষ্কৃতিকারীরা (সমান হয়)","root":"سوا","lemma":"مُسِى^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53303,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"(খুব) কমই","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53304,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53305,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَتَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"tatadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53306,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā yastawī l-aʿmā wal-baṣīru wa-alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti walā l-musīu qalīlan mā tatadhakkarūna', 'অন্ধ আর চক্ষুষ্মান সমান নয়, (সমান নয়) যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে আর যারা অন্যায়কারী। উপদেশ থেকে শিক্ষা তোমরা সামান্যই গ্রহণ কর।', 'And not equal are the blind and the seeing, nor are those who believe and do righteous deeds and the evildoer. Little do you remember.', 'অন্ধ আর চক্ষুষ্মান সমান নয়, (সমান নয়) যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে আর যারা অন্যায়কারী। উপদেশ থেকে শিক্ষা তোমরা সামান্যই গ্রহণ কর।', 'And not equal are the blind and the seeing, nor are those who believe and do righteous deeds and the evildoer. Little do you remember.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040058.mp3', now()),
  (40, 59, '', '[{"id":54060,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":54061,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54062,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔاتِيَةٌۭ","transliteration":"laātiyatun","translation_bn":"আসবে অবশ্যই","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تِي","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54063,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54064,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَيْبَ","transliteration":"rayba","translation_bn":"কোনো সন্দেহ","root":"ريب","lemma":"رَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54065,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54066,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54067,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54068,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষই","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54069,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54070,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54071,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-sāʿata laātiyatun lā rayba fīhā walākinna akthara l-nāsi lā yu''minūna', 'ক্বিয়ামত অবশ্যই আসবে, এতে কোন সন্দেহ নেই, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ লোক (তা) বিশ্বাস করে না।', 'Indeed, the Hour is coming - no doubt about it - but most of the people do not believe.', 'ক্বিয়ামত অবশ্যই আসবে, এতে কোন সন্দেহ নেই, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ লোক (তা) বিশ্বাস করে না।', 'Indeed, the Hour is coming - no doubt about it - but most of the people do not believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040059.mp3', now()),
  (40, 60, '', '[{"id":54233,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54234,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمُ","transliteration":"rabbukumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54235,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُونِىٓ","transliteration":"id''ʿūnī","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ডাকো আমাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54236,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَسْتَجِبْ","transliteration":"astajib","translation_bn":"সাড়া দিবো আমি","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54237,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54239,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":54240,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54241,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastakbirūna","translation_bn":"অহংকার করে (বিমুখ থাকে)","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54242,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54243,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادَتِى","transliteration":"ʿibādatī","translation_bn":"আমার ইবাদাত","root":"عبد","lemma":"عِبَادَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54244,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَيَدْخُلُونَ","transliteration":"sayadkhulūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা প্রবেশ করবে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":54245,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামে","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54246,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"دَاخِرِينَ","transliteration":"dākhirīna","translation_bn":"অপমানিত হয়ে\"","root":"دخر","lemma":"دَٰخِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54247,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla rabbukumu id''ʿūnī astajib lakum inna alladhīna yastakbirūna ʿan ʿibādatī sayadkhulūna jahannama dākhirīna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক বলেন- তোমরা আমাকে ডাকো, আমি (তোমাদের ডাকে) সাড়া দেব। যারা অহংকারবশতঃ আমার ‘ইবাদাত করে না, নিশ্চিতই তারা লাঞ্ছিত অবস্থায় জাহান্নামে প্রবেশ করবে।', 'And your Lord says, "Call upon Me; I will respond to you." Indeed, those who disdain My worship will enter Hell [rendered] contemptible.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক বলেন- তোমরা আমাকে ডাকো, আমি (তোমাদের ডাকে) সাড়া দেব। যারা অহংকারবশতঃ আমার ‘ইবাদাত করে না, নিশ্চিতই তারা লাঞ্ছিত অবস্থায় জাহান্নামে প্রবেশ করবে।', 'And your Lord says, "Call upon Me; I will respond to you." Indeed, those who disdain My worship will enter Hell [rendered] contemptible.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040060.mp3', now()),
  (40, 61, '', '[{"id":55267,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"(তিনিই) আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55268,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55269,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55270,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55271,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55272,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِتَسْكُنُوا۟","transliteration":"litaskunū","translation_bn":"তোমরা যেন শান্তি পাও","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55273,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55274,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","translation_bn":"এবং দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55275,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُبْصِرًا ۚ","transliteration":"mub''ṣiran","translation_bn":"উজ্জ্বল (বানিয়েছেন)","root":"بصر","lemma":"مُبْصِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55277,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55278,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55279,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَذُو","transliteration":"ladhū","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":55280,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلٍ","transliteration":"faḍlin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহশীল","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55281,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55282,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55283,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55284,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55285,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষই","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55286,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":55287,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashkurūna","translation_bn":"তারা কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55288,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī jaʿala lakumu al-layla litaskunū fīhi wal-nahāra mub''ṣiran inna l-laha ladhū faḍlin ʿalā l-nāsi walākinna akthara l-nāsi lā yashkurūna', 'আল্লাহ যিনি তোমাদের জন্য রাত্রি বানিয়েছেন যাতে তোমরা তাতে প্রশান্তি লাভ করতে পার, আর দিনকে করেছেন আলোকময়। আল্লাহ মানুষদের প্রতি বড়ই অনুগ্রহশীল, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষই (আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ লাভের পরও) কৃতজ্ঞতা স্বীকার করে না।', 'It is Allah who made for you the night that you may rest therein and the day giving sight. Indeed, Allah is full of bounty to the people, but most of the people are not grateful.', 'আল্লাহ যিনি তোমাদের জন্য রাত্রি বানিয়েছেন যাতে তোমরা তাতে প্রশান্তি লাভ করতে পার, আর দিনকে করেছেন আলোকময়। আল্লাহ মানুষদের প্রতি বড়ই অনুগ্রহশীল, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষই (আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ লাভের পরও) কৃতজ্ঞতা স্বীকার করে না।', 'It is Allah who made for you the night that you may rest therein and the day giving sight. Indeed, Allah is full of bounty to the people, but most of the people are not grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040061.mp3', now()),
  (40, 62, '', '[{"id":55868,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","transliteration":"dhālikumu","translation_bn":"তিনিই তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":55869,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55870,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55871,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِقُ","transliteration":"khāliqu","translation_bn":"স্রষ্টা","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَٰلِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55872,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55873,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55874,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":55875,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55876,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":55877,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":55879,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"fa-annā","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে কোথায়","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55880,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْفَكُونَ","transliteration":"tu''fakūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ফিরানো হচ্ছে","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55881,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālikumu l-lahu rabbukum khāliqu kulli shayin lā ilāha illā huwa fa-annā tu''fakūna', 'এ হলেন আল্লাহ, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক, সব কিছুর সৃষ্টিকর্তা। তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই; এমতাবস্থায় তোমাদেরকে সত্য থেকে কীভাবে বিভ্রান্ত করা হচ্ছে?', 'That is Allah, your Lord, Creator of all things; there is no deity except Him, so how are you deluded?', 'এ হলেন আল্লাহ, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক, সব কিছুর সৃষ্টিকর্তা। তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই; এমতাবস্থায় তোমাদেরকে সত্য থেকে কীভাবে বিভ্রান্ত করা হচ্ছে?', 'That is Allah, your Lord, Creator of all things; there is no deity except Him, so how are you deluded?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040062.mp3', now()),
  (40, 63, '', '[{"id":56264,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56265,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْفَكُ","transliteration":"yu''faku","translation_bn":"ফিরানো হয়েছে","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56266,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56267,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56268,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"নির্দেশনাবলীকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56269,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56270,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَجْحَدُونَ","transliteration":"yajḥadūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করতো","root":"جحد","lemma":"جَحَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56271,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kadhālika yu''faku alladhīna kānū biāyāti l-lahi yajḥadūna', 'বিভ্রান্ত এভাবেই করা হয় তাদেরকে যারা আল্লাহর আয়াতকে অস্বীকার করে।', 'Thus were those [before you] deluded who were rejecting the signs of Allah.', 'বিভ্রান্ত এভাবেই করা হয় তাদেরকে যারা আল্লাহর আয়াতকে অস্বীকার করে।', 'Thus were those [before you] deluded who were rejecting the signs of Allah.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040063.mp3', now()),
  (40, 64, '', '[{"id":56459,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"(তিনিই) আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56460,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56461,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56462,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56463,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56464,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَرَارًۭا","transliteration":"qarāran","translation_bn":"বাসস্থান","root":"قرر","lemma":"قَرَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56465,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّمَآءَ","transliteration":"wal-samāa","translation_bn":"ও আকাশকে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56466,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِنَآءًۭ","transliteration":"bināan","translation_bn":"এবং (চাঁদোয়ার মত) ছাদ","root":"بني","lemma":"بِنَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56467,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَصَوَّرَكُمْ","transliteration":"waṣawwarakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে আকৃতি দিয়েছেন","root":"صور","lemma":"صَوَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56468,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَأَحْسَنَ","transliteration":"fa-aḥsana","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সুন্দর করেছেন","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56469,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"صُوَرَكُمْ","transliteration":"ṣuwarakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের আকৃতিসমূহ","root":"صور","lemma":"صُورَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56470,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَزَقَكُم","transliteration":"warazaqakum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের জীবিকা দিয়েছেন","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56471,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56472,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ṭayibāti","translation_bn":"পবিত্র জিনিস সমূহের","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّبَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56474,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","transliteration":"dhālikumu","translation_bn":"তিনিই তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":56475,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56476,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56478,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَتَبَارَكَ","transliteration":"fatabāraka","translation_bn":"অতএব কত মহান","root":"برك","lemma":"تَبَارَكَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56479,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56480,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّ","transliteration":"rabbu","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56481,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্ব জগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56482,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī jaʿala lakumu l-arḍa qarāran wal-samāa bināan waṣawwarakum fa-aḥsana ṣuwarakum warazaqakum mina l-ṭayibāti dhālikumu l-lahu rabbukum fatabāraka l-lahu rabbu l-ʿālamīna', 'আল্লাহ যিনি তোমাদের জন্য যমীনকে করেছেন মেঝে, আর আকাশকে করেছেন ছাদ। তিনি তোমাদেরকে আকৃতি দিয়েছেন, অতঃপর তোমাদের আকৃতিকে সুন্দর করেছেন। তিনি পবিত্র বস্তু থেকে তোমাদেরকে রিযক দান করেন। এ হলেন আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতিপালক। কাজেই মহিমা গৌরব আল্লাহর যিনি বিশ্ব জগতের প্রতিপালক।', 'It is Allah who made for you the earth a place of settlement and the sky a ceiling and formed you and perfected your forms and provided you with good things. That is Allah, your Lord; then blessed is Allah, Lord of the worlds.', 'আল্লাহ যিনি তোমাদের জন্য যমীনকে করেছেন মেঝে, আর আকাশকে করেছেন ছাদ। তিনি তোমাদেরকে আকৃতি দিয়েছেন, অতঃপর তোমাদের আকৃতিকে সুন্দর করেছেন। তিনি পবিত্র বস্তু থেকে তোমাদেরকে রিযক দান করেন। এ হলেন আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতিপালক। কাজেই মহিমা গৌরব আল্লাহর যিনি বিশ্ব জগতের প্রতিপালক।', 'It is Allah who made for you the earth a place of settlement and the sky a ceiling and formed you and perfected your forms and provided you with good things. That is Allah, your Lord; then blessed is Allah, Lord of the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040064.mp3', now()),
  (40, 65, '', '[{"id":57017,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":57018,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَىُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥayu","translation_bn":"চিরঞ্জীব","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57019,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57020,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57021,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":57022,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":57023,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَٱدْعُوهُ","transliteration":"fa-id''ʿūhu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তাঁকেই ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57024,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُخْلِصِينَ","transliteration":"mukh''liṣīna","translation_bn":"একনিষ্ঠ হয়ে","root":"خلص","lemma":"مُخْلِص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57025,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁরই জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57026,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدِّينَ ۗ","transliteration":"l-dīna","translation_bn":"আনুগত্যকে (নির্দিষ্ট করে)","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57028,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"সব প্রশংসা","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57029,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর জন্যে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57030,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57031,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57032,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa l-ḥayu lā ilāha illā huwa fa-id''ʿūhu mukh''liṣīna lahu l-dīna l-ḥamdu lillahi rabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'চিরঞ্জীব তিনি, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই। কাজেই তাঁকে ডাক আনুগত্যকে একমাত্র তাঁরই জন্য বিশুদ্ধ করে। যাবতীয় প্রশংসা বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহরই জন্য।', 'He is the Ever-Living; there is no deity except Him, so call upon Him, [being] sincere to Him in religion. [All] praise is [due] to Allah, Lord of the worlds.', 'চিরঞ্জীব তিনি, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই। কাজেই তাঁকে ডাক আনুগত্যকে একমাত্র তাঁরই জন্য বিশুদ্ধ করে। যাবতীয় প্রশংসা বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহরই জন্য।', 'He is the Ever-Living; there is no deity except Him, so call upon Him, [being] sincere to Him in religion. [All] praise is [due] to Allah, Lord of the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040065.mp3', now()),
  (40, 66, '', '[{"id":57659,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57660,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57661,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُهِيتُ","transliteration":"nuhītu","translation_bn":"নিষেধ করা হয়েছে","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57662,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন (না)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":57663,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَعْبُدَ","transliteration":"aʿbuda","translation_bn":"ইবাদত করি আমি","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57664,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57665,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57666,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57667,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57668,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57669,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":57670,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَنِىَ","transliteration":"jāaniya","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57671,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ","transliteration":"l-bayinātu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শন","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57672,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57673,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57674,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَأُمِرْتُ","transliteration":"wa-umir''tu","translation_bn":"এবং আমাকে আদেশ করা হয়েছে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57675,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":57676,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أُسْلِمَ","transliteration":"us''lima","translation_bn":"আত্মসমর্পণ করি আমি","root":"سلم","lemma":"أَسْلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57677,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِرَبِّ","transliteration":"lirabbi","translation_bn":"রবের কাছে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57678,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57679,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul innī nuhītu an aʿbuda alladhīna tadʿūna min dūni l-lahi lammā jāaniya l-bayinātu min rabbī wa-umir''tu an us''lima lirabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'বল, আমার প্রতিপালকের কাছ থেকে আমার কাছে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ এসেছে, এমতাবস্থায় আমাকে তাদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে নিষেধ করা হয়েছে আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে তোমরা আহবান কর। আর আমাকে আদেশ দেয়া হয়েছে বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের নিকট আত্মসমর্পণ করার জন্য।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Indeed, I have been forbidden to worship those you call upon besides Allah once the clear proofs have come to me from my Lord, and I have been commanded to submit to the Lord of the worlds."', 'বল, আমার প্রতিপালকের কাছ থেকে আমার কাছে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ এসেছে, এমতাবস্থায় আমাকে তাদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে নিষেধ করা হয়েছে আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে তোমরা আহবান কর। আর আমাকে আদেশ দেয়া হয়েছে বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের নিকট আত্মসমর্পণ করার জন্য।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Indeed, I have been forbidden to worship those you call upon besides Allah once the clear proofs have come to me from my Lord, and I have been commanded to submit to the Lord of the worlds."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040066.mp3', now()),
  (40, 67, '', '[{"id":58133,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":58134,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58135,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَكُم","transliteration":"khalaqakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58136,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58137,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُرَابٍۢ","transliteration":"turābin","translation_bn":"মাটি","root":"ترب","lemma":"تُرَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58138,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58139,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58140,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نُّطْفَةٍۢ","transliteration":"nuṭ''fatin","translation_bn":"শুক্রবিন্দু","root":"نطف","lemma":"نُّطْفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58141,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58142,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58143,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَقَةٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿalaqatin","translation_bn":"জমাট রক্ত","root":"علق","lemma":"عَلَقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58144,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58145,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُخْرِجُكُمْ","transliteration":"yukh''rijukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বের করেন","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58146,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"طِفْلًۭا","transliteration":"ṭif''lan","translation_bn":"শিশুরূপে","root":"طفل","lemma":"طِفْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58147,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর (বৃদ্ধি দেন)","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58148,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِتَبْلُغُوٓا۟","transliteration":"litablughū","translation_bn":"তোমরা যেন উপনীত হও","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58149,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَشُدَّكُمْ","transliteration":"ashuddakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের যৌবনে","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشُدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58150,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58151,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لِتَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"litakūnū","translation_bn":"তোমরাও যেন হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58152,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"شُيُوخًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"shuyūkhan","translation_bn":"বৃদ্ধ","root":"شيخ","lemma":"شَيْخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58154,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنكُم","transliteration":"waminkum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58155,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58156,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يُتَوَفَّىٰ","transliteration":"yutawaffā","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুবরণ করে (বৃদ্ধ হওয়ার)","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58157,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58158,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۖ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58160,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتَبْلُغُوٓا۟","transliteration":"walitablughū","translation_bn":"আর (এসব এজন্যে) যেন উপনীত হও","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58161,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلًۭا","transliteration":"ajalan","translation_bn":"একটি মেয়াদে","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58162,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58163,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"walaʿallakum","translation_bn":"এবং যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58164,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"অনুধাবন করো","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58165,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī khalaqakum min turābin thumma min nuṭ''fatin thumma min ʿalaqatin thumma yukh''rijukum ṭif''lan thumma litablughū ashuddakum thumma litakūnū shuyūkhan waminkum man yutawaffā min qablu walitablughū ajalan musamman walaʿallakum taʿqilūna', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন মাটি থেকে, অতঃপর শুক্রবিন্দু থেকে, অতঃপর জমাট বাঁধা রক্ত থেকে, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে বের করে এনেছেন শিশুরূপে, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের বৃদ্ধি দান করেন যাতে তোমরা তোমাদের পূর্ণ শক্তির বয়সে পৌঁছতে পার, অতঃপর আরো বৃদ্ধি দেন যাতে তোমরা বৃদ্ধ হও। তোমাদের মধ্যে কারো কারো আগেই মৃত্যু ঘটান যাতে তোমরা তোমাদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট সময়ে পৌঁছে যাও আর যাতে তোমরা (আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি কুশলতা) অনুধাবন কর।', 'It is He who created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop, then from a clinging clot; then He brings you out as a child; then [He develops you] that you reach your [time of] maturity, then [further] that you become elders. And among you is he who is taken in death before [that], so that you reach a specified term; and perhaps you will use reason.', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন মাটি থেকে, অতঃপর শুক্রবিন্দু থেকে, অতঃপর জমাট বাঁধা রক্ত থেকে, অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে বের করে এনেছেন শিশুরূপে, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের বৃদ্ধি দান করেন যাতে তোমরা তোমাদের পূর্ণ শক্তির বয়সে পৌঁছতে পার, অতঃপর আরো বৃদ্ধি দেন যাতে তোমরা বৃদ্ধ হও। তোমাদের মধ্যে কারো কারো আগেই মৃত্যু ঘটান যাতে তোমরা তোমাদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট সময়ে পৌঁছে যাও আর যাতে তোমরা (আল্লাহর সৃষ্টি কুশলতা) অনুধাবন কর।', 'It is He who created you from dust, then from a sperm-drop, then from a clinging clot; then He brings you out as a child; then [He develops you] that you reach your [time of] maturity, then [further] that you become elders. And among you is he who is taken in death before [that], so that you reach a specified term; and perhaps you will use reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040067.mp3', now()),
  (40, 68, '', '[{"id":58445,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":58446,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58447,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُحْىِۦ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yī","translation_bn":"জীবন দেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58448,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيُمِيتُ ۖ","transliteration":"wayumītu","translation_bn":"ও মৃত্যু ঘটান","root":"موت","lemma":"أَمَاتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58450,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58451,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَضَىٰٓ","transliteration":"qaḍā","translation_bn":"সিদ্ধান্ত নেন","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58452,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرًۭا","transliteration":"amran","translation_bn":"কোনো ব্যাপারে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58453,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"শুধু তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58454,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُ","transliteration":"yaqūlu","translation_bn":"বলেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58455,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58456,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُن","transliteration":"kun","translation_bn":"\"হও\"","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58457,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَيَكُونُ","transliteration":"fayakūnu","translation_bn":"তখনই তা হয়ে যায়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58458,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī yuḥ''yī wayumītu fa-idhā qaḍā amran fa-innamā yaqūlu lahu kun fayakūnu', 'তিনিই জীবন দেন ও মৃত্যু ঘটান। যখন কোন কিছু করার সিদ্ধান্ত করেন, তার জন্য তিনি বলেন- হও, তখন তা হয়ে যায়।', 'He it is who gives life and causes death; and when He decrees a matter, He but says to it, "Be," and it is.', 'তিনিই জীবন দেন ও মৃত্যু ঘটান। যখন কোন কিছু করার সিদ্ধান্ত করেন, তার জন্য তিনি বলেন- হও, তখন তা হয়ে যায়।', 'He it is who gives life and causes death; and when He decrees a matter, He but says to it, "Be," and it is.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040068.mp3', now()),
  (40, 69, '', '[{"id":59176,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":59177,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59178,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59179,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59180,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰدِلُونَ","transliteration":"yujādilūna","translation_bn":"বিতর্ক করে","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59181,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59182,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলীর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59183,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59184,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"কোথায়","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":59185,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُصْرَفُونَ","transliteration":"yuṣ''rafūna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে ফিরানো হচ্ছে (অর্থাৎ বিভ্রান্ত করা হচ্ছে)","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59186,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara ilā alladhīna yujādilūna fī āyāti l-lahi annā yuṣ''rafūna', 'তুমি কি তাদের প্রতি লক্ষ্য কর না যারা আল্লাহর নির্দশনগুলো সম্পর্কে বাক-বিতন্ডা করে? (সত্য থেকে) তাদেরকে কীভাবে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হচ্ছে?', 'Do you not consider those who dispute concerning the signs of Allah - how are they averted?', 'তুমি কি তাদের প্রতি লক্ষ্য কর না যারা আল্লাহর নির্দশনগুলো সম্পর্কে বাক-বিতন্ডা করে? (সত্য থেকে) তাদেরকে কীভাবে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হচ্ছে?', 'Do you not consider those who dispute concerning the signs of Allah - how are they averted?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040069.mp3', now()),
  (40, 70, '', '[{"id":59348,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59349,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59350,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"bil-kitābi","translation_bn":"(এই) কিতাবের প্রতি","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59351,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَبِمَآ","transliteration":"wabimā","translation_bn":"এবং ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59352,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59353,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"যাসহ (অন্যান্য কিতাব)","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59354,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلَنَا ۖ","transliteration":"rusulanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রাসূলগণকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59356,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59357,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানতে পারবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59358,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna kadhabū bil-kitābi wabimā arsalnā bihi rusulanā fasawfa yaʿlamūna', 'যারা কিতাবকে আর আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে যা দিয়ে পাঠিয়েছি তাকে অস্বীকার করে, তারা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে।', 'Those who deny the Book and that with which We sent Our messengers - they are going to know,', 'যারা কিতাবকে আর আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে যা দিয়ে পাঠিয়েছি তাকে অস্বীকার করে, তারা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে।', 'Those who deny the Book and that with which We sent Our messengers - they are going to know,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040070.mp3', now()),
  (40, 71, '', '[{"id":60108,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِذِ","transliteration":"idhi","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":60109,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَغْلَـٰلُ","transliteration":"l-aghlālu","translation_bn":"বেড়িসমূহ (পরানো হবে)","root":"غلل","lemma":"غِلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60110,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60111,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَعْنَـٰقِهِمْ","transliteration":"aʿnāqihim","translation_bn":"তাদের গলায়","root":"عنق","lemma":"عُنُق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60112,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّلَـٰسِلُ","transliteration":"wal-salāsilu","translation_bn":"এবং শিকল (গলায় দেওয়া হবে)","root":"سلسل","lemma":"سِلْسِلَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60113,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُسْحَبُونَ","transliteration":"yus''ḥabūna","translation_bn":"তাদের টেনে নিয়ে যাওয়া হবে","root":"سحب","lemma":"يُسْحَبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60114,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'idhi l-aghlālu fī aʿnāqihim wal-salāsilu yus''ḥabūna', 'যখন তাদের গলায় থাকবে বেড়ি আর শিকল; তাদের টেনে নিয়ে যাওয়া হবে', 'When the shackles are around their necks and the chains; they will be dragged', 'যখন তাদের গলায় থাকবে বেড়ি আর শিকল; তাদের টেনে নিয়ে যাওয়া হবে', 'When the shackles are around their necks and the chains; they will be dragged', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040071.mp3', now()),
  (40, 72, '', '[{"id":60402,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60403,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيمِ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīmi","translation_bn":"ফুটন্ত পানির","root":"حمم","lemma":"حَمِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60404,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60405,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60406,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60407,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُسْجَرُونَ","transliteration":"yus''jarūna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে পোড়ানো হবে","root":"سجر","lemma":"يُسْجَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60408,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fī l-ḥamīmi thumma fī l-nāri yus''jarūna', 'ফুটন্ত পানিতে, অতঃপর তাদেরকে আগুনে দগ্ধ করা হবে।', 'In boiling water; then in the Fire they will be filled [with flame].', 'ফুটন্ত পানিতে, অতঃপর তাদেরকে আগুনে দগ্ধ করা হবে।', 'In boiling water; then in the Fire they will be filled [with flame].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040072.mp3', now()),
  (40, 73, '', '[{"id":61101,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61102,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61103,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61104,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْنَ","transliteration":"ayna","translation_bn":"\"কোথায় (এখন)","root":"—","lemma":"أَيْن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":61105,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তারা) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":61106,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61107,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"tush''rikūna","translation_bn":"শরিক করছিলে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61108,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma qīla lahum ayna mā kuntum tush''rikūna', 'অতঃপর তাদেরকে বলা হবে- তারা কোথায় তোমরা যাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) শরীক গণ্য করতে', 'Then it will be said to them, "Where is that which you used to associate [with Him in worship]', 'অতঃপর তাদেরকে বলা হবে- তারা কোথায় তোমরা যাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) শরীক গণ্য করতে', 'Then it will be said to them, "Where is that which you used to associate [with Him in worship]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040073.mp3', now()),
  (40, 74, '', '[{"id":61566,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61567,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61568,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61570,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61571,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ضَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"ḍallū","translation_bn":"\"তারা উধাও হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61572,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَنَّا","transliteration":"ʿannā","translation_bn":"আমাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61573,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَل","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":61574,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61575,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَكُن","transliteration":"nakun","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61576,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَّدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"nadʿū","translation_bn":"আমরা ডাকতাম","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61577,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61578,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61579,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছুকেই\"","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61581,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61582,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلُّ","transliteration":"yuḍillu","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্ত করবেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61583,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61584,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফেরদেরকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61585,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'min dūni l-lahi qālū ḍallū ʿannā bal lam nakun nadʿū min qablu shayan kadhālika yuḍillu l-lahu l-kāfirīna', 'আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে? (উত্তরে) তারা বলবে- তারা আমাদের কাছ থেকে উধাও হয়ে গেছে। না, আমরা আগে (যার অস্তিত্ব আছে এমন) কোন কিছুকেই ডাকিনি। এভাবে আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট হওয়ার সুযোগ দেন।', 'Other than Allah?" They will say, "They have departed from us; rather, we did not used to invoke previously anything." Thus does Allah put astray the disbelievers.', 'আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে? (উত্তরে) তারা বলবে- তারা আমাদের কাছ থেকে উধাও হয়ে গেছে। না, আমরা আগে (যার অস্তিত্ব আছে এমন) কোন কিছুকেই ডাকিনি। এভাবে আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট হওয়ার সুযোগ দেন।', 'Other than Allah?" They will say, "They have departed from us; rather, we did not used to invoke previously anything." Thus does Allah put astray the disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040074.mp3', now()),
  (40, 75, '', '[{"id":62136,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُم","transliteration":"dhālikum","translation_bn":"\"তোমাদের এ অবস্থা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":62137,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62138,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62139,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَفْرَحُونَ","transliteration":"tafraḥūna","translation_bn":"উল্লাস করছিলে","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62140,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62141,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62142,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62143,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"(অন্যায় ভাবে)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62144,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَبِمَا","transliteration":"wabimā","translation_bn":"এবং এ কারণে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62145,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62146,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَمْرَحُونَ","transliteration":"tamraḥūna","translation_bn":"দেমাক করছিলে","root":"مرح","lemma":"تَمْرَحُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62147,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālikum bimā kuntum tafraḥūna fī l-arḍi bighayri l-ḥaqi wabimā kuntum tamraḥūna', 'এর কারণ এই যে, তোমরা অসত্য নিয়ে উল্লাস করতে, আর এজন্য যে, তোমরা গর্ব অহংকার করতে।', '[The angels will say], "That was because you used to exult upon the earth without right and you used to behave insolently.', 'এর কারণ এই যে, তোমরা অসত্য নিয়ে উল্লাস করতে, আর এজন্য যে, তোমরা গর্ব অহংকার করতে।', '[The angels will say], "That was because you used to exult upon the earth without right and you used to behave insolently.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040075.mp3', now()),
  (40, 76, '', '[{"id":62370,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْخُلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ud''khulū","translation_bn":"(এখন যাও) তোমরা প্রবেশ করো","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62371,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَبْوَٰبَ","transliteration":"abwāba","translation_bn":"দরজা দিয়ে","root":"بوب","lemma":"بَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62372,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62373,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তোমরা স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62374,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۖ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62376,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"fabi''sa","translation_bn":"অতএব কত নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62377,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَثْوَى","transliteration":"mathwā","translation_bn":"বাসস্থান","root":"ثوي","lemma":"مَثْوًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62378,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَكَبِّرِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutakabirīna","translation_bn":"অহংকারীদের (জন্যে)\"","root":"كبر","lemma":"مُتَكَبِّر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62379,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ud''khulū abwāba jahannama khālidīna fīhā fabi''sa mathwā l-mutakabirīna', 'তোমরা জাহান্নামের দরজাগুলো দিয়ে প্রবেশ কর, চিরকাল তার ভিতরে থাকার জন্য। দাম্ভিকদের বাসস্থান কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'Enter the gates of Hell to abide eternally therein, and wretched is the residence of the arrogant."', 'তোমরা জাহান্নামের দরজাগুলো দিয়ে প্রবেশ কর, চিরকাল তার ভিতরে থাকার জন্য। দাম্ভিকদের বাসস্থান কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'Enter the gates of Hell to abide eternally therein, and wretched is the residence of the arrogant."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040076.mp3', now()),
  (40, 77, '', '[{"id":62994,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) তাই ধৈর্য্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62995,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62996,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَ","transliteration":"waʿda","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62997,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62998,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَقٌّۭ ۚ","transliteration":"ḥaqqun","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63000,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِمَّا","transliteration":"fa-immā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং হয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63001,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نُرِيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"nuriyannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে দেখাবো আমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63002,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَ","transliteration":"baʿḍa","translation_bn":"কিছুটা","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63003,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":63004,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَعِدُهُمْ","transliteration":"naʿiduhum","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দিই আমরা তাদেরকে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63005,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63006,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"natawaffayannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে মৃত্যু ঘটাই আমরা","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63007,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَإِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"fa-ilaynā","translation_bn":"তবে আমাদের দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63008,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"yur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তাদের ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63009,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iṣ''bir inna waʿda l-lahi ḥaqqun fa-immā nuriyannaka baʿḍa alladhī naʿiduhum aw natawaffayannaka fa-ilaynā yur''jaʿūna', 'অতএব তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর, (কেননা) আল্লাহর ওয়া‘দা সত্য। অতঃপর আমি তাদেরকে (শাস্তির) যে ওয়া‘দা দিয়েছি তার কিছু যদি তোমাকে (এ পৃথিবীতেই) দেখিয়ে দেই অথবা (তাদেরকে শাস্তি দেয়ার পূর্বেই) তোমার মৃত্যু ঘটাই, (উভয় অবস্থাতেই) তাদেরকে আমার কাছেই ফিরে আসতে হবে। (আমার শাস্তি থেকে তারা রেহাই পাবে না)।', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad]; indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And whether We show you some of what We have promised them or We take you in death, it is to Us they will be returned.', 'অতএব তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর, (কেননা) আল্লাহর ওয়া‘দা সত্য। অতঃপর আমি তাদেরকে (শাস্তির) যে ওয়া‘দা দিয়েছি তার কিছু যদি তোমাকে (এ পৃথিবীতেই) দেখিয়ে দেই অথবা (তাদেরকে শাস্তি দেয়ার পূর্বেই) তোমার মৃত্যু ঘটাই, (উভয় অবস্থাতেই) তাদেরকে আমার কাছেই ফিরে আসতে হবে। (আমার শাস্তি থেকে তারা রেহাই পাবে না)।', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad]; indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And whether We show you some of what We have promised them or We take you in death, it is to Us they will be returned.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040077.mp3', now()),
