র পূর্বে অনেক রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম। তাদের মধ্যে কারো কারো কাহিনী আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করেছি, তাদের মধ্যে কারো কারো কথা আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করিনি। আল্লাহর অনুমতি ছাড়া কোন নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসা কোন রসূলের পক্ষে সম্ভব নয়। আল্লাহর নির্দেশ যখন জারী হয়ে যায়, তখন ন্যায়সঙ্গতভাবে (বিষয়টির) ফয়সালা করা হয়। আর যারা মিথ্যার উপর দাঁড়িয়েছিল তারা তখনকার তখনই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়ে পড়ে।', 'And We have already sent messengers before you. Among them are those [whose stories] We have related to you, and among them are those [whose stories] We have not related to you. And it was not for any messenger to bring a sign [or verse] except by permission of Allah. So when the command of Allah comes, it will be concluded in truth, and the falsifiers will thereupon lose [all].', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বে অনেক রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম। তাদের মধ্যে কারো কারো কাহিনী আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করেছি, তাদের মধ্যে কারো কারো কথা আমি তোমার কাছে বর্ণনা করিনি। আল্লাহর অনুমতি ছাড়া কোন নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসা কোন রসূলের পক্ষে সম্ভব নয়। আল্লাহর নির্দেশ যখন জারী হয়ে যায়, তখন ন্যায়সঙ্গতভাবে (বিষয়টির) ফয়সালা করা হয়। আর যারা মিথ্যার উপর দাঁড়িয়েছিল তারা তখনকার তখনই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়ে পড়ে।', 'And We have already sent messengers before you. Among them are those [whose stories] We have related to you, and among them are those [whose stories] We have not related to you. And it was not for any messenger to bring a sign [or verse] except by permission of Allah. So when the command of Allah comes, it will be concluded in truth, and the falsifiers will thereupon lose [all].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040078.mp3', now()),
  (40, 79, '', '[{"id":63778,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"(তিনিই) আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63779,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":63780,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63781,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63782,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمَ","transliteration":"l-anʿāma","translation_bn":"গবাদি পশুগুলো","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63783,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِتَرْكَبُوا۟","transliteration":"litarkabū","translation_bn":"তোমরা আরোহণ করতে পারো যেন","root":"ركب","lemma":"رَكِبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63784,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে হ''তে (কোনটির উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63785,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهَا","transliteration":"wamin''hā","translation_bn":"এবং তার মধ্যে হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63786,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُونَ","transliteration":"takulūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা খাও (কোনটির গোশত)","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63787,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī jaʿala lakumu l-anʿāma litarkabū min''hā wamin''hā takulūna', 'আল্লাহ- যিনি তোমাদের জন্য গবাদি পশু সৃষ্টি করেছেন, যাতে তোমরা তাদের কতকগুলোর উপর আরোহণ করতে পার, আর কতকগুলো থেকে আহার করতে পার।', 'It is Allah who made for you the grazing animals upon which you ride, and some of them you eat.', 'আল্লাহ- যিনি তোমাদের জন্য গবাদি পশু সৃষ্টি করেছেন, যাতে তোমরা তাদের কতকগুলোর উপর আরোহণ করতে পার, আর কতকগুলো থেকে আহার করতে পার।', 'It is Allah who made for you the grazing animals upon which you ride, and some of them you eat.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040079.mp3', now()),
  (40, 80, '', '[{"id":64209,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"walakum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64210,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64211,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَنَـٰفِعُ","transliteration":"manāfiʿu","translation_bn":"(অনেক) উপকার","root":"نفع","lemma":"مَنَٰفِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64212,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتَبْلُغُوا۟","transliteration":"walitablughū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা মেটাতে পারো যেন","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64213,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার সাহায্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64214,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَاجَةًۭ","transliteration":"ḥājatan","translation_bn":"প্রয়োজন (বোধ করলে)","root":"حوج","lemma":"حَاجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64215,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64216,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صُدُورِكُمْ","transliteration":"ṣudūrikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মনের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64217,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"waʿalayhā","translation_bn":"এবং তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64218,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَى","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"এবং উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64219,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُلْكِ","transliteration":"l-ful''ki","translation_bn":"নৌযানের","root":"فلك","lemma":"فُلْك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64220,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تُحْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"tuḥ''malūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বহন করা হয়","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64221,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walakum fīhā manāfiʿu walitablughū ʿalayhā ḥājatan fī ṣudūrikum waʿalayhā waʿalā l-ful''ki tuḥ''malūna', 'ওগুলোতে তোমাদের জন্য আছে বহু উপকার। তোমরা তোমাদের অন্তরে যে প্রয়োজনবোধ কর, যাতে ওগুলোর দ্বারা তা মিটাতে পার। ওগুলোর উপর আর নৌযানে তোমাদেরকে বহন করা হয়।', 'And for you therein are [other] benefits and that you may realize upon them a need which is in your breasts; and upon them and upon ships you are carried.', 'ওগুলোতে তোমাদের জন্য আছে বহু উপকার। তোমরা তোমাদের অন্তরে যে প্রয়োজনবোধ কর, যাতে ওগুলোর দ্বারা তা মিটাতে পার। ওগুলোর উপর আর নৌযানে তোমাদেরকে বহন করা হয়।', 'And for you therein are [other] benefits and that you may realize upon them a need which is in your breasts; and upon them and upon ships you are carried.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040080.mp3', now()),
  (40, 81, '', '[{"id":64725,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيُرِيكُمْ","transliteration":"wayurīkum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের দেখান তিনি","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64726,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64727,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَأَىَّ","transliteration":"fa-ayya","translation_bn":"সুতরাং কোন","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64728,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64729,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64730,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُنكِرُونَ","transliteration":"tunkirūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অস্বীকার করবে","root":"نكر","lemma":"يُنكِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64731,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayurīkum āyātihi fa-ayya āyāti l-lahi tunkirūna', 'তিনি তোমাদেরকে তাঁর নিদর্শন দেখান। কাজেই আল্লাহর কোন্ নিদর্শনকে তোমরা অস্বীকার কর?', 'And He shows you His signs. So which of the signs of Allah do you deny?', 'তিনি তোমাদেরকে তাঁর নিদর্শন দেখান। কাজেই আল্লাহর কোন্ নিদর্শনকে তোমরা অস্বীকার কর?', 'And He shows you His signs. So which of the signs of Allah do you deny?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040081.mp3', now()),
  (40, 82, '', '[{"id":65070,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَمْ","transliteration":"afalam","translation_bn":"নি তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":65071,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرُوا۟","transliteration":"yasīrū","translation_bn":"তারা ভ্রমণ করে","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65072,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65073,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65074,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَيَنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"fayanẓurū","translation_bn":"তারা অতঃপর দেখে (নি কি)","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65075,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":65076,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65077,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণতি","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65078,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65079,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65080,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে (ছিলো)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65082,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65083,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"(সংখ্যায়) বেশী","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65084,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"এদের চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65085,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَشَدَّ","transliteration":"wa-ashadda","translation_bn":"ও প্রবল","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65086,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةًۭ","transliteration":"quwwatan","translation_bn":"শক্তিতে","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65087,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاثَارًۭا","transliteration":"waāthāran","translation_bn":"ও কীর্তিতে","root":"اثر","lemma":"أَثَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65088,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65089,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65090,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَمَآ","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65091,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"aghnā","translation_bn":"কাজে আসলো","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65092,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُم","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65093,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65094,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65095,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"yaksibūna","translation_bn":"অর্জন করেছিলো","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65096,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afalam yasīrū fī l-arḍi fayanẓurū kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu alladhīna min qablihim kānū akthara min''hum wa-ashadda quwwatan waāthāran fī l-arḍi famā aghnā ʿanhum mā kānū yaksibūna', 'তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করে না? করলে তারা দেখত, তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল। দুনিয়ায় এদের চেয়ে তারা সংখ্যায় অধিক ছিল, আর শক্তি সামর্থ্য ও কীর্তি চিহ্নে বেশি প্রবল ছিল। কিন্তু তারা যা অর্জন করেছিল তা তাদের কোন উপকারে আসেনি।', 'Have they not traveled through the land and observed how was the end of those before them? They were more numerous than themselves and greater in strength and in impression on the land, but they were not availed by what they used to earn.', 'তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করে না? করলে তারা দেখত, তাদের পূর্ববর্তীদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল। দুনিয়ায় এদের চেয়ে তারা সংখ্যায় অধিক ছিল, আর শক্তি সামর্থ্য ও কীর্তি চিহ্নে বেশি প্রবল ছিল। কিন্তু তারা যা অর্জন করেছিল তা তাদের কোন উপকারে আসেনি।', 'Have they not traveled through the land and observed how was the end of those before them? They were more numerous than themselves and greater in strength and in impression on the land, but they were not availed by what they used to earn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040082.mp3', now()),
  (40, 83, '', '[{"id":65337,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65338,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْهُمْ","transliteration":"jāathum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65339,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُهُم","transliteration":"rusuluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের রাসূলগণ","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65340,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণসহ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65341,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَرِحُوا۟","transliteration":"fariḥū","translation_bn":"তারা খুশীতে মগ্ন রইলো","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65342,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65343,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِندَهُم","transliteration":"ʿindahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":65344,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অংশ বিশেষ","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65345,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''mi","translation_bn":"(নিজস্ব) জ্ঞানের","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65346,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَحَاقَ","transliteration":"waḥāqa","translation_bn":"এবং ঘিরে ফেললো","root":"حيق","lemma":"حَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65347,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِهِم","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65348,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তাই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65349,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65350,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"যে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65351,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","transliteration":"yastahziūna","translation_bn":"ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রুপ করতো","root":"هزا","lemma":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65352,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāathum rusuluhum bil-bayināti fariḥū bimā ʿindahum mina l-ʿil''mi waḥāqa bihim mā kānū bihi yastahziūna', 'তাদের কাছে যখন তাদের রসূলগণ স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসল, তখন তারা তাদের নিজেদের কাছে যে জ্ঞান ও বিদ্যা ছিল তাতেই উৎফুল্ল হয়ে উঠল। অতঃপর যা নিয়ে তারা ঠাট্টা বিদ্রুপ করত তা-ই তাদেরকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'And when their messengers came to them with clear proofs, they [merely] rejoiced in what they had of knowledge, but they were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.', 'তাদের কাছে যখন তাদের রসূলগণ স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে আসল, তখন তারা তাদের নিজেদের কাছে যে জ্ঞান ও বিদ্যা ছিল তাতেই উৎফুল্ল হয়ে উঠল। অতঃপর যা নিয়ে তারা ঠাট্টা বিদ্রুপ করত তা-ই তাদেরকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'And when their messengers came to them with clear proofs, they [merely] rejoiced in what they had of knowledge, but they were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040083.mp3', now()),
  (40, 84, '', '[{"id":65621,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65622,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَأَوْا۟","transliteration":"ra-aw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখলো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65623,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسَنَا","transliteration":"basanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের শাস্তি","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65624,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65625,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা ঈমান এনেছি","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65626,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65627,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَحْدَهُۥ","transliteration":"waḥdahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর একারই","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَحْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65628,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَكَفَرْنَا","transliteration":"wakafarnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা অস্বীকার করছি","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65629,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"তা সবকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65630,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65631,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"যার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65632,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"শরিককারী\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65633,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā ra-aw basanā qālū āmannā bil-lahi waḥdahu wakafarnā bimā kunnā bihi mush''rikīna', 'আমার শাস্তি তারা যখন দেখল তখন তারা বলল- আমরা এক আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনলাম আর যাদেরকে আমরা (আল্লাহর) শরীক গণ্য করতাম তাদেরকে প্রত্যাখ্যান করলাম।', 'And when they saw Our punishment, they said," We believe in Allah alone and disbelieve in that which we used to associate with Him."', 'আমার শাস্তি তারা যখন দেখল তখন তারা বলল- আমরা এক আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনলাম আর যাদেরকে আমরা (আল্লাহর) শরীক গণ্য করতাম তাদেরকে প্রত্যাখ্যান করলাম।', 'And when they saw Our punishment, they said," We believe in Allah alone and disbelieve in that which we used to associate with Him."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040084.mp3', now()),
  (40, 85, '', '[{"id":66101,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمْ","transliteration":"falam","translation_bn":"অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66102,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَكُ","transliteration":"yaku","translation_bn":"পারে নি","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66103,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُهُمْ","transliteration":"yanfaʿuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপকার করতে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66104,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنُهُمْ","transliteration":"īmānuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ঈমান","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66105,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":66106,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَأَوْا۟","transliteration":"ra-aw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখলো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66107,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسَنَا ۖ","transliteration":"basanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের শাস্তি","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66109,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سُنَّتَ","transliteration":"sunnata","translation_bn":"বিধান","root":"سنن","lemma":"سُنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66110,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (নির্ধারিত)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66111,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِى","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66112,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":66113,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"خَلَتْ","transliteration":"khalat","translation_bn":"(চলে এসেছে)অতীত হয়েছে","root":"خلو","lemma":"خَلَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66114,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66115,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দাসদের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66117,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَخَسِرَ","transliteration":"wakhasira","translation_bn":"এবং ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَسِرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66118,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هُنَالِكَ","transliteration":"hunālika","translation_bn":"এমন অবস্হায়","root":"—","lemma":"هُنَالِك\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":66119,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirūna","translation_bn":"কাফেররা","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66120,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falam yaku yanfaʿuhum īmānuhum lammā ra-aw basanā sunnata l-lahi allatī qad khalat fī ʿibādihi wakhasira hunālika l-kāfirūna', 'তারা যখন আমার শাস্তি দেখল তখন তাদের ঈমান (গ্রহণ) তাদের কোন উপকারে আসল না। আল্লাহর (এ) বিধান তাঁর বান্দাহদের উপর (বহু) পূর্ব হতেই (কার্যকর হয়ে) চলে আসছে। আর এ ক্ষেত্রে কাফিররাই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়।', 'But never did their faith benefit them once they saw Our punishment. [It is] the established way of Allah which has preceded among His servants. And the disbelievers thereupon lost [all].', 'তারা যখন আমার শাস্তি দেখল তখন তাদের ঈমান (গ্রহণ) তাদের কোন উপকারে আসল না। আল্লাহর (এ) বিধান তাঁর বান্দাহদের উপর (বহু) পূর্ব হতেই (কার্যকর হয়ে) চলে আসছে। আর এ ক্ষেত্রে কাফিররাই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়।', 'But never did their faith benefit them once they saw Our punishment. [It is] the established way of Allah which has preceded among His servants. And the disbelievers thereupon lost [all].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/040085.mp3', now())
