4,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ءَاذَنَّـٰكَ","transliteration":"ādhannāka","translation_bn":"\"আপনাকে নিবেদন করছি","root":"اذن","lemma":"ءَاذَن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46335,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(আজ) নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46336,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مِنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46337,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46338,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"shahīdin","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী (শরিকের পক্ষে)\"","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46339,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ilayhi yuraddu ʿil''mu l-sāʿati wamā takhruju min thamarātin min akmāmihā wamā taḥmilu min unthā walā taḍaʿu illā biʿil''mihi wayawma yunādīhim ayna shurakāī qālū ādhannāka mā minnā min shahīdin', 'ক্বিয়ামত কখন সংঘটিত হবে সে সম্পর্কিত জ্ঞান একমাত্র তাঁর কাছেই আছে। কোন ফলই তার আবরণ থেকে বেরিয়ে আসে না, এবং কোন নারী গর্ভধারণ করে না আর সন্তান প্রসব করে না তাঁর অজ্ঞাতে। যে দিন তিনি তাদেরকে ডেকে বলবেন- আমার শরীকরা কোথায় (তোমরা যেগুলো বানিয়ে নিয়েছিলে)? তারা বলবে- আপনাকে নিশ্চয়তা দিচ্ছি যে, (আজ) আমাদের কেউ (আপনার শরীক থাকার ব্যাপারে) সাক্ষ্য দাতা হবে না।', 'To him [alone] is attributed knowledge of the Hour. And fruits emerge not from their coverings nor does a female conceive or give birth except with His knowledge. And the Day He will call to them, "Where are My ''partners''?" they will say, "We announce to You that there is [no longer] among us any witness [to that]."', 'ক্বিয়ামত কখন সংঘটিত হবে সে সম্পর্কিত জ্ঞান একমাত্র তাঁর কাছেই আছে। কোন ফলই তার আবরণ থেকে বেরিয়ে আসে না, এবং কোন নারী গর্ভধারণ করে না আর সন্তান প্রসব করে না তাঁর অজ্ঞাতে। যে দিন তিনি তাদেরকে ডেকে বলবেন- আমার শরীকরা কোথায় (তোমরা যেগুলো বানিয়ে নিয়েছিলে)? তারা বলবে- আপনাকে নিশ্চয়তা দিচ্ছি যে, (আজ) আমাদের কেউ (আপনার শরীক থাকার ব্যাপারে) সাক্ষ্য দাতা হবে না।', 'To him [alone] is attributed knowledge of the Hour. And fruits emerge not from their coverings nor does a female conceive or give birth except with His knowledge. And the Day He will call to them, "Where are My ''partners''?" they will say, "We announce to You that there is [no longer] among us any witness [to that]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041047.mp3', now()),
  (41, 48, '', '[{"id":47059,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَضَلَّ","transliteration":"waḍalla","translation_bn":"এবং হারিয়ে যাবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47060,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُم","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47061,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(ঐসব ইলাহ) যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47062,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47063,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"ডাকতে থাকতো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47064,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47065,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۖ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"ইতি","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47067,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَظَنُّوا۟","transliteration":"waẓannū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ভাববে","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47068,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":47069,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47070,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47071,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَّحِيصٍۢ","transliteration":"maḥīṣin","translation_bn":"নিষ্কৃতি","root":"حيص","lemma":"مَّحِيص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47072,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waḍalla ʿanhum mā kānū yadʿūna min qablu waẓannū mā lahum min maḥīṣin', 'পূর্বে তারা যাদেরকে ডাকত তারা তাদের থেকে উধাও হয়ে যাবে, আর তারা বুঝতে পারবে যে, তাদের পালানোর কোন জায়গা নেই।', 'And lost from them will be those they were invoking before, and they will be certain that they have no place of escape.', 'পূর্বে তারা যাদেরকে ডাকত তারা তাদের থেকে উধাও হয়ে যাবে, আর তারা বুঝতে পারবে যে, তাদের পালানোর কোন জায়গা নেই।', 'And lost from them will be those they were invoking before, and they will be certain that they have no place of escape.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041048.mp3', now()),
  (41, 49, '', '[{"id":47739,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":47740,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔمُ","transliteration":"yasamu","translation_bn":"ক্লান্ত হয়","root":"سام","lemma":"يَسْـ#َمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47741,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-insānu","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47742,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47743,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دُعَآءِ","transliteration":"duʿāi","translation_bn":"দুআ","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47744,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَيْرِ","transliteration":"l-khayri","translation_bn":"ধন-সম্পদের (অথবা কল্যাণের)","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47745,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47746,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّسَّهُ","transliteration":"massahu","translation_bn":"তাকে স্পর্শ করে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47747,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّرُّ","transliteration":"l-sharu","translation_bn":"দুঃখদৈন্য","root":"شرر","lemma":"شَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47748,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَيَـُٔوسٌۭ","transliteration":"fayaūsun","translation_bn":"তখন হতাশ হয়","root":"ياس","lemma":"يَـ#ُوس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47749,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَنُوطٌۭ","transliteration":"qanūṭun","translation_bn":"নিরাশ (হয়)","root":"قنط","lemma":"قَنُوط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47750,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yasamu l-insānu min duʿāi l-khayri wa-in massahu l-sharu fayaūsun qanūṭun', 'মানুষ নিজের কল্যাণ কামনায় দু‘আ প্রার্থনা করতে ক্লান্ত হয় না, আর মন্দ যখন তাকে স্পর্শ করে, তখন সে নৈরাশ্যে ডুবে যায়।', 'Man is not weary of supplication for good [things], but if evil touches him, he is hopeless and despairing.', 'মানুষ নিজের কল্যাণ কামনায় দু‘আ প্রার্থনা করতে ক্লান্ত হয় না, আর মন্দ যখন তাকে স্পর্শ করে, তখন সে নৈরাশ্যে ডুবে যায়।', 'Man is not weary of supplication for good [things], but if evil touches him, he is hopeless and despairing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041049.mp3', now()),
  (41, 50, '', '[{"id":48392,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِنْ","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"কিন্তু অবশ্য যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48393,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَذَقْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"adhaqnāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা তাকে আস্বাদন করাই","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48394,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48395,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48396,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48397,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48398,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَّآءَ","transliteration":"ḍarrāa","translation_bn":"বিপদাপদের","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَرَّا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48399,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَسَّتْهُ","transliteration":"massathu","translation_bn":"(যা) তাকে স্পর্শ করেছিলো","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48400,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَيَقُولَنَّ","transliteration":"layaqūlanna","translation_bn":"সে বলে অবশ্যই","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":48401,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":48402,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমারই (প্রাপ্য)","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48403,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং (বলে) না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48404,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَظُنُّ","transliteration":"aẓunnu","translation_bn":"মনে করি আমি","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48405,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48406,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَآئِمَةًۭ","transliteration":"qāimatan","translation_bn":"ঘটবে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَا^ئِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48407,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48408,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رُّجِعْتُ","transliteration":"rujiʿ''tu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তিত হই আমি","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48409,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48410,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّىٓ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48411,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48412,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48413,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عِندَهُۥ","transliteration":"ʿindahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর কাছে (থাকবে)","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":48414,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لَلْحُسْنَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"lalḥus''nā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই খুব কল্যাণ\"","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":48416,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فَلَنُنَبِّئَنَّ","transliteration":"falanunabbi-anna","translation_bn":"আমরা অথচ জানিয়ে দিবোই","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48417,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":48418,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48419,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48420,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছিলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48421,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُم","transliteration":"walanudhīqannahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে আমরা অবশ্যই আস্বাদন করাবোই","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48422,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48423,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48424,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"غَلِيظٍۢ","transliteration":"ghalīẓin","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"غلظ","lemma":"غَلِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":48425,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wala-in adhaqnāhu raḥmatan minnā min baʿdi ḍarrāa massathu layaqūlanna hādhā lī wamā aẓunnu l-sāʿata qāimatan wala-in rujiʿ''tu ilā rabbī inna lī ʿindahu lalḥus''nā falanunabbi-anna alladhīna kafarū bimā ʿamilū walanudhīqannahum min ʿadhābin ghalīẓin', 'দুঃখ-বিপদ মানুষকে স্পর্শ করার পর আমি যখন তাকে আমার অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করাই তখন সে অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলে- এটা আমার ন্যায্য পাওনা। ক্বিয়ামত যে সংঘটিত হবে আমি মোটেই তা মনে করি না। আর যদি আমাকে আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হয়ই, তবে তাঁর কাছে আমার জন্য অবশ্যই কল্যাণ আছে। অতঃপর আমি কাফিরদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই জানিয়ে দেব তারা (দুনিয়াতে) কী কাজ করেছিল। আর অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদেরকে আমি কঠিন শাস্তি আস্বাদন করাব।', 'And if We let him taste mercy from Us after an adversity which has touched him, he will surely say, "This is [due] to me, and I do not think the Hour will occur; and [even] if I should be returned to my Lord, indeed, for me there will be with Him the best." But We will surely inform those who disbelieved about what they did, and We will surely make them taste a massive punishment.', 'দুঃখ-বিপদ মানুষকে স্পর্শ করার পর আমি যখন তাকে আমার অনুগ্রহ আস্বাদন করাই তখন সে অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলে- এটা আমার ন্যায্য পাওনা। ক্বিয়ামত যে সংঘটিত হবে আমি মোটেই তা মনে করি না। আর যদি আমাকে আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হয়ই, তবে তাঁর কাছে আমার জন্য অবশ্যই কল্যাণ আছে। অতঃপর আমি কাফিরদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই জানিয়ে দেব তারা (দুনিয়াতে) কী কাজ করেছিল। আর অবশ্য অবশ্যই তাদেরকে আমি কঠিন শাস্তি আস্বাদন করাব।', 'And if We let him taste mercy from Us after an adversity which has touched him, he will surely say, "This is [due] to me, and I do not think the Hour will occur; and [even] if I should be returned to my Lord, indeed, for me there will be with Him the best." But We will surely inform those who disbelieved about what they did, and We will surely make them taste a massive punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041050.mp3', now()),
  (41, 51, '', '[{"id":49478,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَآ","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49479,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنْعَمْنَا","transliteration":"anʿamnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অনুগ্রহ করি","root":"نعم","lemma":"أَنْعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49480,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49481,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-insāni","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49482,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَعْرَضَ","transliteration":"aʿraḍa","translation_bn":"সে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49483,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَنَـَٔا","transliteration":"wanaā","translation_bn":"এবং এড়িয়ে চলে","root":"ناي","lemma":"نَـ#َا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49484,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِجَانِبِهِۦ","transliteration":"bijānibihi","translation_bn":"তার পাশ দিয়ে (অহংকার বশতঃ)","root":"جنب","lemma":"جَانِب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49485,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49486,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَسَّهُ","transliteration":"massahu","translation_bn":"তাকে স্পর্শ করে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49487,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّرُّ","transliteration":"l-sharu","translation_bn":"দুঃখদৈন্য","root":"شرر","lemma":"شَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49488,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَذُو","transliteration":"fadhū","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49489,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دُعَآءٍ","transliteration":"duʿāin","translation_bn":"প্রার্থনার","root":"دعو","lemma":"دُعَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49490,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَرِيضٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿarīḍin","translation_bn":"দীর্ঘ (করে)","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرِيض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49491,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā anʿamnā ʿalā l-insāni aʿraḍa wanaā bijānibihi wa-idhā massahu l-sharu fadhū duʿāin ʿarīḍin', 'আমি যখন মানুষকে নি‘মাত দেই তখন সে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, আর পাশ কেটে (আমার থেকে দূরে) সরে যায়। আর যখন মন্দ তাকে স্পর্শ করে, তখন সে লম্বা-চওড়া দু‘আ করতে থাকে।', 'And when We bestow favor upon man, he turns away and distances himself; but when evil touches him, then he is full of extensive supplication.', 'আমি যখন মানুষকে নি‘মাত দেই তখন সে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, আর পাশ কেটে (আমার থেকে দূরে) সরে যায়। আর যখন মন্দ তাকে স্পর্শ করে, তখন সে লম্বা-চওড়া দু‘আ করতে থাকে।', 'And when We bestow favor upon man, he turns away and distances himself; but when evil touches him, then he is full of extensive supplication.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041051.mp3', now()),
  (41, 52, '', '[{"id":49750,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49751,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা (ভেবে) দেখেছো কি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":49752,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":49753,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয় (এই কুরআন)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49754,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49755,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عِندِ","transliteration":"ʿindi","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49756,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49757,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49758,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرْتُم","transliteration":"kafartum","translation_bn":"তোমরা অস্বীকার করছো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49759,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49760,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49761,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَضَلُّ","transliteration":"aḍallu","translation_bn":"অধিক ভ্রান্ত (হতে পারে)","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49762,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّنْ","transliteration":"mimman","translation_bn":"তার চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49763,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":49764,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49765,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شِقَاقٍۭ","transliteration":"shiqāqin","translation_bn":"বিরোধীতার","root":"شقق","lemma":"شِقَاق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49766,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَعِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿīdin","translation_bn":"ঘোর (চলে গিয়েছে)\"","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49767,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum in kāna min ʿindi l-lahi thumma kafartum bihi man aḍallu mimman huwa fī shiqāqin baʿīdin', 'বল- তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ এ (কুরআন) যদি আল্লাহর পক্ষ থেকেই এসে থাকে, আর তোমরা সেটাকে অস্বীকার করতেই থাক, তাহলে সে ব্যক্তি ছাড়া অধিক পথভ্রষ্ট আর কে আছে, যে বিরোধিতায় বহু দূরে চলে গেছে?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if the Qur''an is from Allah and you disbelieved in it, who would be more astray than one who is in extreme dissension?"', 'বল- তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ এ (কুরআন) যদি আল্লাহর পক্ষ থেকেই এসে থাকে, আর তোমরা সেটাকে অস্বীকার করতেই থাক, তাহলে সে ব্যক্তি ছাড়া অধিক পথভ্রষ্ট আর কে আছে, যে বিরোধিতায় বহু দূরে চলে গেছে?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if the Qur''an is from Allah and you disbelieved in it, who would be more astray than one who is in extreme dissension?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041052.mp3', now()),
  (41, 53, '', '[{"id":50377,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَنُرِيهِمْ","transliteration":"sanurīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের আমরা শীঘ্রই দেখাবো","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":50378,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50379,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50380,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔافَاقِ","transliteration":"l-āfāqi","translation_bn":"দিগন্তসমূহের","root":"افق","lemma":"أُفُق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50381,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَفِىٓ","transliteration":"wafī","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50382,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50383,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50384,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَتَبَيَّنَ","transliteration":"yatabayyana","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট হয়ে যায়","root":"بين","lemma":"تَبَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50385,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50386,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"(এ কথা) যে তা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50387,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"বাস্তবিকই সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50389,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"নয় কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":50390,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَكْفِ","transliteration":"yakfi","translation_bn":"যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50391,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّكَ","transliteration":"birabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50392,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"যে তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50393,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50394,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50395,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50396,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدٌ","transliteration":"shahīdun","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":50397,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sanurīhim āyātinā fī l-āfāqi wafī anfusihim ḥattā yatabayyana lahum annahu l-ḥaqu awalam yakfi birabbika annahu ʿalā kulli shayin shahīdun', 'আমি তাদেরকে আমার নিদর্শনাবলী দেখাব দূর দিগন্তে (অর্থাৎ দূর পর্যন্ত ইসলামের আলো বিচ্ছুরিত হবে) আর তাদের নিজেদের মধ্যেও (অর্থাৎ কাফিররা নতজানু হয়ে ইসলাম কবূল করবে) যখন তাদের কাছে স্পষ্ট হয়ে যাবে যে, এ কুরআন সত্য। এটা কি যথেষ্ট নয় যে, তোমার প্রতিপালক সব কিছুরই সাক্ষী।', 'We will show them Our signs in the horizons and within themselves until it becomes clear to them that it is the truth. But is it not sufficient concerning your Lord that He is, over all things, a Witness?', 'আমি তাদেরকে আমার নিদর্শনাবলী দেখাব দূর দিগন্তে (অর্থাৎ দূর পর্যন্ত ইসলামের আলো বিচ্ছুরিত হবে) আর তাদের নিজেদের মধ্যেও (অর্থাৎ কাফিররা নতজানু হয়ে ইসলাম কবূল করবে) যখন তাদের কাছে স্পষ্ট হয়ে যাবে যে, এ কুরআন সত্য। এটা কি যথেষ্ট নয় যে, তোমার প্রতিপালক সব কিছুরই সাক্ষী।', 'We will show them Our signs in the horizons and within themselves until it becomes clear to them that it is the truth. But is it not sufficient concerning your Lord that He is, over all things, a Witness?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041053.mp3', now()),
  (41, 54, '', '[{"id":51021,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"জেনে রাখো","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":51022,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"তারা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51023,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51024,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِرْيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"mir''yatin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"مري","lemma":"مِرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51025,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51026,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَآءِ","transliteration":"liqāi","translation_bn":"সাক্ষাতের","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51027,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ ۗ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51029,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"জেনে রাখো","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":51030,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51031,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51032,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51033,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُّحِيطٌۢ","transliteration":"muḥīṭun","translation_bn":"পরিবেষ্টনকারী (অর্থাৎ ঘিরে রেখেছেন)","root":"حوط","lemma":"مُحِيط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51034,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alā innahum fī mir''yatin min liqāi rabbihim alā innahu bikulli shayin muḥīṭun', 'শুনে রাখ, এরা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সঙ্গে সাক্ষাতের ব্যাপারে সন্দেহে পড়ে আছে। শুনে রাখ, তিনি সব কিছুকেই বেষ্টন করে আছেন।', 'Unquestionably, they are in doubt about the meeting with their Lord. Unquestionably He is, of all things, encompassing.', 'শুনে রাখ, এরা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সঙ্গে সাক্ষাতের ব্যাপারে সন্দেহে পড়ে আছে। শুনে রাখ, তিনি সব কিছুকেই বেষ্টন করে আছেন।', 'Unquestionably, they are in doubt about the meeting with their Lord. Unquestionably He is, of all things, encompassing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/041054.mp3', now())
