ḍibū hum yaghfirūna', 'যারা বড় বড় পাপ এবং অশ্লীল কার্যকলাপ হতে বেঁচে চলে এবং রাগান্বিত হয়েও ক্ষমা করে।', 'And those who avoid the major sins and immoralities, and when they are angry, they forgive,', 'যারা বড় বড় পাপ এবং অশ্লীল কার্যকলাপ হতে বেঁচে চলে এবং রাগান্বিত হয়েও ক্ষমা করে।', 'And those who avoid the major sins and immoralities, and when they are angry, they forgive,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042037.mp3', now()),
  (42, 38, '', '[{"id":39554,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39555,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَجَابُوا۟","transliteration":"is''tajābū","translation_bn":"সাড়া দেয় ডাকে","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39556,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِرَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"lirabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39557,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقَامُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqāmū","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠা করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39558,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39559,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْرُهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-amruhum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের কাজ (সম্পন্ন করে)","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39560,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"شُورَىٰ","transliteration":"shūrā","translation_bn":"পরামর্শেরর মাধ্যমে","root":"شور","lemma":"شُورَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39561,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":39562,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمِمَّا","transliteration":"wamimmā","translation_bn":"এবং তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39563,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের আমরা জীবিকা দিয়েছি","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39564,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُونَ","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","translation_bn":"তারা ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39565,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna is''tajābū lirabbihim wa-aqāmū l-ṣalata wa-amruhum shūrā baynahum wamimmā razaqnāhum yunfiqūna', 'যারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের (নির্দেশ পালনের মাধ্যমে তাঁর) প্রতি সাড়া দেয়, নিয়মিত নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে, পারস্পরিক পরামর্শের ভিত্তিতে নিজেদের কার্যাদি পরিচালনা করে। আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে ব্যয় করে।', 'And those who have responded to their lord and established prayer and whose affair is [determined by] consultation among themselves, and from what We have provided them, they spend.', 'যারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের (নির্দেশ পালনের মাধ্যমে তাঁর) প্রতি সাড়া দেয়, নিয়মিত নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে, পারস্পরিক পরামর্শের ভিত্তিতে নিজেদের কার্যাদি পরিচালনা করে। আর আমি তাদেরকে যে রিযক দিয়েছি তাত্থেকে ব্যয় করে।', 'And those who have responded to their lord and established prayer and whose affair is [determined by] consultation among themselves, and from what We have provided them, they spend.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042038.mp3', now()),
  (42, 39, '', '[{"id":40364,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা (এমন যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40365,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":40366,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَهُمُ","transliteration":"aṣābahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের পৌঁছে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40367,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَغْىُ","transliteration":"l-baghyu","translation_bn":"নির্যাতন (বাড়াবাড়ি)","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغْي","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40368,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":40369,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَنتَصِرُونَ","transliteration":"yantaṣirūna","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করে (মোকাবেলা করে)","root":"نصر","lemma":"ٱنتَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40370,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna idhā aṣābahumu l-baghyu hum yantaṣirūna', 'আর তাদের উপর অতিরিক্ত বাড়াবাড়ি করা হলে নিজেদের প্রতিরক্ষার ব্যবস্থা করে।', 'And those who, when tyranny strikes them, they defend themselves,', 'আর তাদের উপর অতিরিক্ত বাড়াবাড়ি করা হলে নিজেদের প্রতিরক্ষার ব্যবস্থা করে।', 'And those who, when tyranny strikes them, they defend themselves,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042039.mp3', now()),
  (42, 40, '', '[{"id":41179,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَزَٰٓؤُا۟","transliteration":"wajazāu","translation_bn":"এবং প্রতিফল","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41180,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّئَةٍۢ","transliteration":"sayyi-atin","translation_bn":"মন্দের","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41181,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّئَةٌۭ","transliteration":"sayyi-atun","translation_bn":"মন্দ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41182,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلُهَا ۖ","transliteration":"mith''luhā","translation_bn":"তার সমান","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41184,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنْ","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"তবে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41185,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَفَا","transliteration":"ʿafā","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করবে","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41186,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْلَحَ","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥa","translation_bn":"ও আপোষ  নিষ্পত্তি করবে","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41187,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَأَجْرُهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-ajruhu","translation_bn":"তবে তার পুরষ্কার (রয়েছে)","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41188,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41189,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41191,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":41192,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":41193,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালোবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41194,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদেরকে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41195,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajazāu sayyi-atin sayyi-atun mith''luhā faman ʿafā wa-aṣlaḥa fa-ajruhu ʿalā l-lahi innahu lā yuḥibbu l-ẓālimīna', 'অন্যায়ের প্রতিবিধান হল অনুরূপ অন্যায়। অতঃপর যে ক্ষমা করে এবং সমঝোতা করে, তার প্রতিদান দেয়া আল্লাহর যিম্মায়। সীমাঙ্ঘনকারীদেরকে আল্লাহ পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And the retribution for an evil act is an evil one like it, but whoever pardons and makes reconciliation - his reward is [due] from Allah. Indeed, He does not like wrongdoers.', 'অন্যায়ের প্রতিবিধান হল অনুরূপ অন্যায়। অতঃপর যে ক্ষমা করে এবং সমঝোতা করে, তার প্রতিদান দেয়া আল্লাহর যিম্মায়। সীমাঙ্ঘনকারীদেরকে আল্লাহ পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And the retribution for an evil act is an evil one like it, but whoever pardons and makes reconciliation - his reward is [due] from Allah. Indeed, He does not like wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042040.mp3', now()),
  (42, 41, '', '[{"id":41978,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَنِ","transliteration":"walamani","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্য যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41979,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱنتَصَرَ","transliteration":"intaṣara","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ নেয়","root":"نصر","lemma":"ٱنتَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41980,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":41981,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظُلْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"ẓul''mihi","translation_bn":"তার নির্যাতনের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41982,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"তাদের তবে","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41983,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":41984,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41985,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41986,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلٍ","transliteration":"sabīlin","translation_bn":"ব্যবস্থা","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41987,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walamani intaṣara baʿda ẓul''mihi fa-ulāika mā ʿalayhim min sabīlin', 'কেউ অত্যাচারিত হয়ে নিজের প্রতিরক্ষার ব্যবস্থা নিলে, তার বিরুদ্ধে কোন অভিযোগ নেই।', 'And whoever avenges himself after having been wronged - those have not upon them any cause [for blame].', 'কেউ অত্যাচারিত হয়ে নিজের প্রতিরক্ষার ব্যবস্থা নিলে, তার বিরুদ্ধে কোন অভিযোগ নেই।', 'And whoever avenges himself after having been wronged - those have not upon them any cause [for blame].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042041.mp3', now()),
  (42, 42, '', '[{"id":42730,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":42731,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلُ","transliteration":"l-sabīlu","translation_bn":"ব্যবস্থা গ্রহণ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42732,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42733,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42734,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَظْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"yaẓlimūna","translation_bn":"অত্যাচার করে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42735,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষের (উপর)","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42736,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَبْغُونَ","transliteration":"wayabghūna","translation_bn":"এবং বিদ্রোহ করে","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42737,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42738,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42739,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42740,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"অহেতুক","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42742,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":42743,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42744,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42745,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"যন্ত্রণাদায়ক","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":42746,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā l-sabīlu ʿalā alladhīna yaẓlimūna l-nāsa wayabghūna fī l-arḍi bighayri l-ḥaqi ulāika lahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'অভিযোগ তো তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যারা মানুষের প্রতি অত্যাচার করে, আর অন্যায়ভাবে যমীনে বিদ্রোহ সৃষ্টি করে; তাদের জন্য আছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'The cause is only against the ones who wrong the people and tyrannize upon the earth without right. Those will have a painful punishment.', 'অভিযোগ তো তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যারা মানুষের প্রতি অত্যাচার করে, আর অন্যায়ভাবে যমীনে বিদ্রোহ সৃষ্টি করে; তাদের জন্য আছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'The cause is only against the ones who wrong the people and tyrannize upon the earth without right. Those will have a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042042.mp3', now()),
  (42, 43, '', '[{"id":43486,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَن","transliteration":"walaman","translation_bn":"এবং যে অবশ্য","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43487,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرَ","transliteration":"ṣabara","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য্য ধরে","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43488,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَغَفَرَ","transliteration":"waghafara","translation_bn":"ও মাফ করে","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43489,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":43490,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":43491,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَمِنْ","transliteration":"lamin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":43492,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَزْمِ","transliteration":"ʿazmi","translation_bn":"দৃঢ়সংকল্পের (উচ্চমানের)","root":"عزم","lemma":"عَزْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43493,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمُورِ","transliteration":"l-umūri","translation_bn":"কাজসমুহের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43494,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaman ṣabara waghafara inna dhālika lamin ʿazmi l-umūri', 'আর যে ব্যক্তি (অত্যাচারিত হওয়ার পরও) ধৈর্য ধারণ করে, আর (অত্যাচারীকে) ক্ষমা করে দেয়, তাহলে তা অবশ্যই দৃঢ় চিত্ততার কাজ।', 'And whoever is patient and forgives - indeed, that is of the matters [requiring] determination.', 'আর যে ব্যক্তি (অত্যাচারিত হওয়ার পরও) ধৈর্য ধারণ করে, আর (অত্যাচারীকে) ক্ষমা করে দেয়, তাহলে তা অবশ্যই দৃঢ় চিত্ততার কাজ।', 'And whoever is patient and forgives - indeed, that is of the matters [requiring] determination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042043.mp3', now()),
