িশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45001,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45002,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45003,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45004,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مُّقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"muqīmin","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":45005,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watarāhum yuʿ''raḍūna ʿalayhā khāshiʿīna mina l-dhuli yanẓurūna min ṭarfin khafiyyin waqāla alladhīna āmanū inna l-khāsirīna alladhīna khasirū anfusahum wa-ahlīhim yawma l-qiyāmati alā inna l-ẓālimīna fī ʿadhābin muqīmin', 'তুমি (আরো) দেখবে, তাদেরকে জাহান্নামের সম্মুখে উপস্থিত করা হবে, তারা থাকবে অপমানে অবনত, তারা লুকিয়ে তাকাবে। আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা বলবে, সত্যিকার ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত তো তারাই যারা ক্বিয়ামতের দিনে নিজেদেরকে এবং নিজেদের পরিবার-পরিজনকে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করেছে। সাবধান! যালিমরা থাকবে স্থায়ী ‘আযাবে।', 'And you will see them being exposed to the Fire, humbled from humiliation, looking from [behind] a covert glance. And those who had believed will say, "Indeed, the [true] losers are the ones who lost themselves and their families on the Day of Resurrection. Unquestionably, the wrongdoers are in an enduring punishment."', 'তুমি (আরো) দেখবে, তাদেরকে জাহান্নামের সম্মুখে উপস্থিত করা হবে, তারা থাকবে অপমানে অবনত, তারা লুকিয়ে তাকাবে। আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা বলবে, সত্যিকার ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত তো তারাই যারা ক্বিয়ামতের দিনে নিজেদেরকে এবং নিজেদের পরিবার-পরিজনকে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করেছে। সাবধান! যালিমরা থাকবে স্থায়ী ‘আযাবে।', 'And you will see them being exposed to the Fire, humbled from humiliation, looking from [behind] a covert glance. And those who had believed will say, "Indeed, the [true] losers are the ones who lost themselves and their families on the Day of Resurrection. Unquestionably, the wrongdoers are in an enduring punishment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042045.mp3', now()),
  (42, 46, '', '[{"id":45730,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45731,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45732,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45733,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45734,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","transliteration":"awliyāa","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45735,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُونَهُم","transliteration":"yanṣurūnahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে সাহায্য করতে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45736,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45737,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45738,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45740,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45741,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلِ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lili","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45742,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45743,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"তখন নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45744,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45745,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45746,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلٍ","transliteration":"sabīlin","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45747,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna lahum min awliyāa yanṣurūnahum min dūni l-lahi waman yuḍ''lili l-lahu famā lahu min sabīlin', 'তাদের কোন অভিভাবক থাকবে না আল্লাহ্ ব্যতীত যারা তাদেরকে সাহায্য করতে পারে। আল্লাহ যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তার (শাস্তি থেকে বাঁচার) কোন রাস্তা নেই।', 'And there will not be for them any allies to aid them other than Allah. And whoever Allah sends astray - for him there is no way.', 'তাদের কোন অভিভাবক থাকবে না আল্লাহ্ ব্যতীত যারা তাদেরকে সাহায্য করতে পারে। আল্লাহ যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তার (শাস্তি থেকে বাঁচার) কোন রাস্তা নেই।', 'And there will not be for them any allies to aid them other than Allah. And whoever Allah sends astray - for him there is no way.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042046.mp3', now()),
  (42, 47, '', '[{"id":46367,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَجِيبُوا۟","transliteration":"is''tajībū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাকে সাড়া দাও (মেনে নাও)","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46368,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِرَبِّكُم","transliteration":"lirabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের (কথা)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46369,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46370,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"(এর) পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46371,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":46372,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46373,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"yawmun","translation_bn":"(এমন) দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46374,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46375,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَرَدَّ","transliteration":"maradda","translation_bn":"প্রতিরোধ","root":"ردد","lemma":"مَرَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46376,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46377,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46378,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46380,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46381,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46382,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46383,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَّلْجَإٍۢ","transliteration":"malja-in","translation_bn":"আশ্রয়স্থল","root":"لجا","lemma":"مَّلْجَإ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46384,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":46385,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46386,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46387,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46388,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"نَّكِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"nakīrin","translation_bn":"প্রতিরোধকারী","root":"نكر","lemma":"نَّكِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46389,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'is''tajībū lirabbikum min qabli an yatiya yawmun lā maradda lahu mina l-lahi mā lakum min malja-in yawma-idhin wamā lakum min nakīrin', 'তোমরা তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের কথায় সাড়া দাও সেই দিন আসার পূর্বে আল্লাহ (’র হুকুমে যা সংঘটিত হওয়া) থেকে ফিরিয়ে রাখার কেউ নেই। সেদিন তোমাদের জন্য আশ্রয়স্থল থাকবে না, থাকবে না তোমাদের জন্য কোন প্রতিরোধকারী।', 'Respond to your Lord before a Day comes from Allah of which there is no repelling. No refuge will you have that day, nor for you will there be any denial.', 'তোমরা তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের কথায় সাড়া দাও সেই দিন আসার পূর্বে আল্লাহ (’র হুকুমে যা সংঘটিত হওয়া) থেকে ফিরিয়ে রাখার কেউ নেই। সেদিন তোমাদের জন্য আশ্রয়স্থল থাকবে না, থাকবে না তোমাদের জন্য কোন প্রতিরোধকারী।', 'Respond to your Lord before a Day comes from Allah of which there is no repelling. No refuge will you have that day, nor for you will there be any denial.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042047.mp3', now()),
  (42, 48, '', '[{"id":47112,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنْ","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতএব যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47113,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَعْرَضُوا۟","transliteration":"aʿraḍū","translation_bn":"তারা মুখ ফেরায়","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47114,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَمَآ","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47115,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","transliteration":"arsalnāka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47116,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47117,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَفِيظًا ۖ","transliteration":"ḥafīẓan","translation_bn":"রক্ষক করে","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47119,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":47120,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার উপর (দায়িত্ব)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47121,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":47122,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-balāghu","translation_bn":"পৌঁছানো","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47124,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّآ","transliteration":"wa-innā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47125,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":47126,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَذَقْنَا","transliteration":"adhaqnā","translation_bn":"আস্বাদন করাই","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47127,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-insāna","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47128,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنَّا","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47129,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"raḥmatan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47130,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَرِحَ","transliteration":"fariḥa","translation_bn":"উৎফুল্ল হয়","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47131,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তা দ্বারা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47133,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47134,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تُصِبْهُمْ","transliteration":"tuṣib''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের পৌঁছে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47135,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّئَةٌۢ","transliteration":"sayyi-atun","translation_bn":"অনিষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47136,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47137,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"قَدَّمَتْ","transliteration":"qaddamat","translation_bn":"আগে করেছে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47138,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের হাতগুলো","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47139,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47140,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-insāna","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47141,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"kafūrun","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞ হয়","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":47142,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in aʿraḍū famā arsalnāka ʿalayhim ḥafīẓan in ʿalayka illā l-balāghu wa-innā idhā adhaqnā l-insāna minnā raḥmatan fariḥa bihā wa-in tuṣib''hum sayyi-atun bimā qaddamat aydīhim fa-inna l-insāna kafūrun', 'এতদসত্ত্বেও তারা যদি মুখ ফিরিয়েই নেয় (তাহলে ফিরিয়ে নিক, কারণ) আমি তোমাকে তাদের হিফাযাতকারী বানিয়ে পাঠাইনি। কথা পৌঁছে দেয়াই তোমার দায়িত্ব। আমি যখন মানুষকে আমার রহমত আস্বাদন করাই, তখন সে উৎফুল্ল হয়। আর যখন তাদের কৃতকর্মের কারণে তাদের কোন অনিষ্ট হয়, তখন মানুষ অকৃতজ্ঞ হয়ে যায়।', 'But if they turn away - then We have not sent you, [O Muhammad], over them as a guardian; upon you is only [the duty of] notification. And indeed, when We let man taste mercy from us, he rejoices in it; but if evil afflicts him for what his hands have put forth, then indeed, man is ungrateful.', 'এতদসত্ত্বেও তারা যদি মুখ ফিরিয়েই নেয় (তাহলে ফিরিয়ে নিক, কারণ) আমি তোমাকে তাদের হিফাযাতকারী বানিয়ে পাঠাইনি। কথা পৌঁছে দেয়াই তোমার দায়িত্ব। আমি যখন মানুষকে আমার রহমত আস্বাদন করাই, তখন সে উৎফুল্ল হয়। আর যখন তাদের কৃতকর্মের কারণে তাদের কোন অনিষ্ট হয়, তখন মানুষ অকৃতজ্ঞ হয়ে যায়।', 'But if they turn away - then We have not sent you, [O Muhammad], over them as a guardian; upon you is only [the duty of] notification. And indeed, when We let man taste mercy from us, he rejoices in it; but if evil afflicts him for what his hands have put forth, then indeed, man is ungrateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042048.mp3', now()),
  (42, 49, '', '[{"id":47771,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই জন্যে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47772,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُلْكُ","transliteration":"mul''ku","translation_bn":"সার্বভৌমত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47773,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47774,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47776,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَخْلُقُ","transliteration":"yakhluqu","translation_bn":"তিনি সৃষ্টি করেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47777,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47778,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47780,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَهَبُ","transliteration":"yahabu","translation_bn":"তিনি দেন","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47781,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47782,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47783,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَـٰثًۭا","transliteration":"ināthan","translation_bn":"কন্যাসমূহ","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47784,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَهَبُ","transliteration":"wayahabu","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি দেন","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47785,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47786,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47787,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذُّكُورَ","transliteration":"l-dhukūra","translation_bn":"পুত্রসমূহ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47788,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lillahi mul''ku l-samāwāti wal-arḍi yakhluqu mā yashāu yahabu liman yashāu ināthan wayahabu liman yashāu l-dhukūra', 'আসমান ও যমীনের রাজত্ব আল্লাহরই, যা চান তিনি সৃষ্টি করেন। যাকে চান কন্যা-সন্তান দেন, যাকে চান পুত্র সন্তান দেন।', 'To Allah belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth; He creates what he wills. He gives to whom He wills female [children], and He gives to whom He wills males.', 'আসমান ও যমীনের রাজত্ব আল্লাহরই, যা চান তিনি সৃষ্টি করেন। যাকে চান কন্যা-সন্তান দেন, যাকে চান পুত্র সন্তান দেন।', 'To Allah belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth; He creates what he wills. He gives to whom He wills female [children], and He gives to whom He wills males.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042049.mp3', now()),
  (42, 50, '', '[{"id":48443,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48444,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُزَوِّجُهُمْ","transliteration":"yuzawwijuhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে মিলিয়ে দেন","root":"زوج","lemma":"زُوِّجَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48445,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذُكْرَانًۭا","transliteration":"dhuk''rānan","translation_bn":"পুত্রসমূহ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48446,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَـٰثًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"wa-ināthan","translation_bn":"ও কন্যাসমূহ","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48448,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَلُ","transliteration":"wayajʿalu","translation_bn":"এবং করে দেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48449,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":48450,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48451,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَقِيمًا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿaqīman","translation_bn":"বন্ধ্যা","root":"عقم","lemma":"عَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48453,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48454,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ (সবকিছু জানেন)","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48455,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48456,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aw yuzawwijuhum dhuk''rānan wa-ināthan wayajʿalu man yashāu ʿaqīman innahu ʿalīmun qadīrun', 'অথবা তাদেরকে দেন পুত্র ও কন্যা উভয়ই। আর যাকে ইচ্ছে বন্ধ্যা করেন। তিনি সর্ব বিষয়ে সর্বাধিক অবহিত ও ক্ষমতাবান।', 'Or He makes them [both] males and females, and He renders whom He wills barren. Indeed, He is Knowing and Competent.', 'অথবা তাদেরকে দেন পুত্র ও কন্যা উভয়ই। আর যাকে ইচ্ছে বন্ধ্যা করেন। তিনি সর্ব বিষয়ে সর্বাধিক অবহিত ও ক্ষমতাবান।', 'Or He makes them [both] males and females, and He renders whom He wills barren. Indeed, He is Knowing and Competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042050.mp3', now()),
  (42, 51, '', '[{"id":49100,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয় (মর্যাদা)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49101,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49102,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِبَشَرٍ","transliteration":"libasharin","translation_bn":"মানুষের জন্যে","root":"بشر","lemma":"بَشَر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49103,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":49104,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُكَلِّمَهُ","transliteration":"yukallimahu","translation_bn":"তার সাথে কথা বলবেন","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49105,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49106,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":49107,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَحْيًا","transliteration":"waḥyan","translation_bn":"ওহী","root":"وحي","lemma":"وَحْى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49108,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49109,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49110,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَرَآئِ","transliteration":"warāi","translation_bn":"আড়াল","root":"وري","lemma":"وَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49111,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حِجَابٍ","transliteration":"ḥijābin","translation_bn":"পর্দার","root":"حجب","lemma":"حِجَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49112,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49113,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُرْسِلَ","transliteration":"yur''sila","translation_bn":"প্রেরণ করেন","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49114,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"দূত হিসেবে (ফেরেশতা)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49115,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَيُوحِىَ","transliteration":"fayūḥiya","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ওহী করে","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49116,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِهِۦ","transliteration":"bi-idh''nihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুমতিক্রমে","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49117,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49118,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49120,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49121,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَلِىٌّ","transliteration":"ʿaliyyun","translation_bn":"মহান","root":"علو","lemma":"عَلِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49122,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":49123,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna libasharin an yukallimahu l-lahu illā waḥyan aw min warāi ḥijābin aw yur''sila rasūlan fayūḥiya bi-idh''nihi mā yashāu innahu ʿaliyyun ḥakīmun', 'কোন মানুষের এ মর্যাদা নেই যে, আল্লাহ তার সাথে (সরাসরি) কথা বলবেন ওয়াহীর মাধ্যম বা পর্দার আড়াল বা কোন দূত প্রেরণ ছাড়া। অতঃপর আল্লাহর অনুমতিক্রমে সে (মনোনীত মানুষের কাছে) ওয়াহী করে যা তিনি (আল্লাহ) চান। তিনি সুমহান ও মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'And it is not for any human being that Allah should speak to him except by revelation or from behind a partition or that He sends a messenger to reveal, by His permission, what He wills. Indeed, He is Most High and Wise.', 'কোন মানুষের এ মর্যাদা নেই যে, আল্লাহ তার সাথে (সরাসরি) কথা বলবেন ওয়াহীর মাধ্যম বা পর্দার আড়াল বা কোন দূত প্রেরণ ছাড়া। অতঃপর আল্লাহর অনুমতিক্রমে সে (মনোনীত মানুষের কাছে) ওয়াহী করে যা তিনি (আল্লাহ) চান। তিনি সুমহান ও মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'And it is not for any human being that Allah should speak to him except by revelation or from behind a partition or that He sends a messenger to reveal, by His permission, what He wills. Indeed, He is Most High and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042051.mp3', now()),
  (42, 52, '', '[{"id":49768,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49769,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","transliteration":"awḥaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা ওহী পাঠিয়েছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49770,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49771,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رُوحًۭا","transliteration":"rūḥan","translation_bn":"রূহ (অর্থাৎ ওহী) বা কোরআন","root":"روح","lemma":"رُوح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49772,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49773,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِنَا ۚ","transliteration":"amrinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49775,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":49776,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49777,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَدْرِى","transliteration":"tadrī","translation_bn":"জানতে","root":"دري","lemma":"تَدْرِى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49778,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49779,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ","transliteration":"l-kitābu","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49780,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না (জানতে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49781,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِيمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-īmānu","translation_bn":"ঈমান","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49782,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49783,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhu","translation_bn":"তাকে আমরা করেছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49784,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نُورًۭا","transliteration":"nūran","translation_bn":"আলো''","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49785,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"نَّهْدِى","transliteration":"nahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখাই আমরা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49786,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49787,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49788,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"نَّشَآءُ","transliteration":"nashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করি আমরা","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49789,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49790,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِنَا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿibādinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের দাসদের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49792,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّكَ","transliteration":"wa-innaka","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49793,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَتَهْدِىٓ","transliteration":"latahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখাচ্ছো তুমি অবশ্যই","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":49794,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49795,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49796,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল-সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49797,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika awḥaynā ilayka rūḥan min amrinā mā kunta tadrī mā l-kitābu walā l-īmānu walākin jaʿalnāhu nūran nahdī bihi man nashāu min ʿibādinā wa-innaka latahdī ilā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'এভাবে (উপরোক্ত ৩টি উপায়েই) আমার নির্দেশের মূল শিক্ষাকে তোমার কাছে আমি ওয়াহী যোগে প্রেরণ করেছি। তুমি জানতে না কিতাব কী, ঈমান কী, কিন্তু আমি একে (অর্থাৎ ওয়াহী যোগে প্রেরিত কুরআনকে) করেছি আলো, যার সাহায্যে আমার বান্দাহদের মধ্য হতে যাকে ইচ্ছে আমি সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করি। তুমি নিশ্চিতই (মানুষদেরকে) সঠিক পথের দিকে নির্দেশ করছ।', 'And thus We have revealed to you an inspiration of Our command. You did not know what is the Book or [what is] faith, but We have made it a light by which We guide whom We will of Our servants. And indeed, [O Muhammad], you guide to a straight path -', 'এভাবে (উপরোক্ত ৩টি উপায়েই) আমার নির্দেশের মূল শিক্ষাকে তোমার কাছে আমি ওয়াহী যোগে প্রেরণ করেছি। তুমি জানতে না কিতাব কী, ঈমান কী, কিন্তু আমি একে (অর্থাৎ ওয়াহী যোগে প্রেরিত কুরআনকে) করেছি আলো, যার সাহায্যে আমার বান্দাহদের মধ্য হতে যাকে ইচ্ছে আমি সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করি। তুমি নিশ্চিতই (মানুষদেরকে) সঠিক পথের দিকে নির্দেশ করছ।', 'And thus We have revealed to you an inspiration of Our command. You did not know what is the Book or [what is] faith, but We have made it a light by which We guide whom We will of Our servants. And indeed, [O Muhammad], you guide to a straight path -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042052.mp3', now()),
  (42, 53, '', '[{"id":50398,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطِ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭi","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50399,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50400,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি (এমন সত্ত্বা যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50401,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁরই জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50402,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50403,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50404,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50405,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50406,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50407,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50409,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"জেনে রাখো","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":50410,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50411,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50412,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَصِيرُ","transliteration":"taṣīru","translation_bn":"ফিরে যায়","root":"صير","lemma":"تَصِيرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50413,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","transliteration":"l-umūru","translation_bn":"সকল বিষয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50414,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ṣirāṭi l-lahi alladhī lahu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi alā ilā l-lahi taṣīru l-umūru', 'যা কিছু আকাশে আছে আর যমীনে আছে এসবের মালিক যিনি সেই আল্লাহর পথে। শুনে রাখ! আল্লাহর কাছেই সব বিষয় ফিরে যায়।', 'The path of Allah, to whom belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. Unquestionably, to Allah do [all] matters evolve.', 'যা কিছু আকাশে আছে আর যমীনে আছে এসবের মালিক যিনি সেই আল্লাহর পথে। শুনে রাখ! আল্লাহর কাছেই সব বিষয় ফিরে যায়।', 'The path of Allah, to whom belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. Unquestionably, to Allah do [all] matters evolve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/042053.mp3', now())
