ককারী (নবী-রসূল) পাঠিয়েছি, তখনই তাদের সম্পদশালী লোকেরা বলেছে- আমরা আমাদের পূর্বপুরুষদেরকে এক ধর্মমত পালনরত পেয়েছি আর আমরা তাদেরই পদাঙ্ক অনুসরণ করছি।', 'And similarly, We did not send before you any warner into a city except that its affluent said, "Indeed, we found our fathers upon a religion, and we are, in their footsteps, following."', 'এভাবে তোমার পূর্বে যখনই আমি কোন জনপদে সতর্ককারী (নবী-রসূল) পাঠিয়েছি, তখনই তাদের সম্পদশালী লোকেরা বলেছে- আমরা আমাদের পূর্বপুরুষদেরকে এক ধর্মমত পালনরত পেয়েছি আর আমরা তাদেরই পদাঙ্ক অনুসরণ করছি।', 'And similarly, We did not send before you any warner into a city except that its affluent said, "Indeed, we found our fathers upon a religion, and we are, in their footsteps, following."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043023.mp3', now()),
  (43, 24, '', '[{"id":26673,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قَـٰلَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(প্রত্যেক নাবী) বলতো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26674,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَوْ","transliteration":"awalaw","translation_bn":"\"যদিও কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":26675,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتُكُم","transliteration":"ji''tukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আসি","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26676,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِأَهْدَىٰ","transliteration":"bi-ahdā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে অধিক নির্ভুল পথ","root":"هدي","lemma":"أَهْدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26677,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তার চেয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26678,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَجَدتُّمْ","transliteration":"wajadttum","translation_bn":"তোমরা পেয়েছো","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26679,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"যার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26680,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآءَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ābāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বাপ-দাদাদেরকে\"","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26682,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলতো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26683,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":26684,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"যা নিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26685,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُرْسِلْتُم","transliteration":"ur''sil''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রেরিত হয়েছো","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26686,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26687,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাখানকারী\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26688,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla awalaw ji''tukum bi-ahdā mimmā wajadttum ʿalayhi ābāakum qālū innā bimā ur''sil''tum bihi kāfirūna', 'তখন সেই সতর্ককারী বলত- তোমরা তোমাদের পিতৃপুরুষকে যে ধর্মমতের উপর পেয়েছ, আমি যদি তোমাদের কাছে তার চেয়ে উৎকৃষ্ট ধর্মমত নিয়ে আসি (তবুও কি তোমরা তাদেরই অনুসরণ করবে)? তারা বলতঃ তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়ে পাঠানো হয়েছে আমরা তা প্রত্যাখ্যান করি।', '[Each warner] said, "Even if I brought you better guidance than that [religion] upon which you found your fathers?" They said, "Indeed we, in that with which you were sent, are disbelievers."', 'তখন সেই সতর্ককারী বলত- তোমরা তোমাদের পিতৃপুরুষকে যে ধর্মমতের উপর পেয়েছ, আমি যদি তোমাদের কাছে তার চেয়ে উৎকৃষ্ট ধর্মমত নিয়ে আসি (তবুও কি তোমরা তাদেরই অনুসরণ করবে)? তারা বলতঃ তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়ে পাঠানো হয়েছে আমরা তা প্রত্যাখ্যান করি।', '[Each warner] said, "Even if I brought you better guidance than that [religion] upon which you found your fathers?" They said, "Indeed we, in that with which you were sent, are disbelievers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043024.mp3', now()),
  (43, 25, '', '[{"id":27692,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنتَقَمْنَا","transliteration":"fa-intaqamnā","translation_bn":"আমরা তখন প্রতিশোধ নিয়েছি","root":"نقم","lemma":"ٱنتَقَمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27693,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27695,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দেখো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27696,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":27697,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27698,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27699,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"l-mukadhibīna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপকারীদের (সত্য অমান্যকারীদের)","root":"كذب","lemma":"مُّكَذِّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27700,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-intaqamnā min''hum fa-unẓur kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu l-mukadhibīna', 'অতঃপর আমি তাদের উপর প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করলাম, এখন দেখ, মিথ্যুকদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল।', 'So we took retribution from them; then see how was the end of the deniers.', 'অতঃপর আমি তাদের উপর প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করলাম, এখন দেখ, মিথ্যুকদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল।', 'So we took retribution from them; then see how was the end of the deniers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043025.mp3', now()),
  (43, 26, '', '[{"id":28661,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ করো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28662,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28663,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīmu","translation_bn":"ইব্রাহীম","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28664,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِأَبِيهِ","transliteration":"li-abīhi","translation_bn":"তার পিতাকে","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28665,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْمِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"waqawmihi","translation_bn":"ও তার জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28666,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّنِى","transliteration":"innanī","translation_bn":"\"আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":28667,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَرَآءٌۭ","transliteration":"barāon","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কমুক্ত","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28668,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28669,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"taʿbudūna","translation_bn":"পূজা করছো তোমরা","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28670,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh qāla ib''rāhīmu li-abīhi waqawmihi innanī barāon mimmā taʿbudūna', 'স্মরণ কর, ইবরাহীম (আ.) যখন তার পিতাকে ও তার জাতিকে বলেছিল- তোমরা যেগুলোর পূজা কর, সেগুলো থেকে আমি সম্পর্কহীন।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Abraham said to his father and his people, "Indeed, I am disassociated from that which you worship', 'স্মরণ কর, ইবরাহীম (আ.) যখন তার পিতাকে ও তার জাতিকে বলেছিল- তোমরা যেগুলোর পূজা কর, সেগুলো থেকে আমি সম্পর্কহীন।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Abraham said to his father and his people, "Indeed, I am disassociated from that which you worship', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043026.mp3', now()),
  (43, 27, '', '[{"id":29559,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু (এবাদত করি)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":29560,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(তার) যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29561,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَطَرَنِى","transliteration":"faṭaranī","translation_bn":"আমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"فطر","lemma":"فَطَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29562,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-innahu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29563,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَيَهْدِينِ","transliteration":"sayahdīni","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই আমাকে পথ দেখাবেন\"","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":29564,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'illā alladhī faṭaranī fa-innahu sayahdīni', 'আমার সম্পর্ক আছে শুধু তাঁর সাথে যিনি আমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তিনিই আমাকে সঠিক পথ দেখাবেন।', 'Except for He who created me; and indeed, He will guide me."', 'আমার সম্পর্ক আছে শুধু তাঁর সাথে যিনি আমাকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তিনিই আমাকে সঠিক পথ দেখাবেন।', 'Except for He who created me; and indeed, He will guide me."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043027.mp3', now()),
  (43, 28, '', '[{"id":30571,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَهَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalahā","translation_bn":"এবং তা সে রেখে গিয়েছে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30572,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةًۢ","transliteration":"kalimatan","translation_bn":"একটি বাণী হিসেবে","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30573,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَاقِيَةًۭ","transliteration":"bāqiyatan","translation_bn":"চিরন্তন","root":"بقي","lemma":"بَاقِيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30574,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30575,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَقِبِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿaqibihi","translation_bn":"তার পরবর্তীদের","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَقِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30576,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা যেন","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30577,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30578,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajaʿalahā kalimatan bāqiyatan fī ʿaqibihi laʿallahum yarjiʿūna', 'এ কথাটিকে সে স্থায়ী বাণীরূপে তার পরবর্তীদের মধ্যে রেখে গেছে, যাতে তারা (আল্লাহর পথে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And he made it a word remaining among his descendants that they might return [to it].', 'এ কথাটিকে সে স্থায়ী বাণীরূপে তার পরবর্তীদের মধ্যে রেখে গেছে, যাতে তারা (আল্লাহর পথে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And he made it a word remaining among his descendants that they might return [to it].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043028.mp3', now()),
  (43, 29, '', '[{"id":31593,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":31594,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَتَّعْتُ","transliteration":"mattaʿtu","translation_bn":"আমি ভোগের সুযোগ দিয়েছি","root":"متع","lemma":"مَّتَّعْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31595,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":31596,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَءَابَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"waābāahum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের পূর্বপুরুষদেরকে","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31597,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"অবশেষে","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31598,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمُ","transliteration":"jāahumu","translation_bn":"এসেছে তাদের (কাছে)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31599,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31600,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولٌۭ","transliteration":"warasūlun","translation_bn":"এবং রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31601,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31602,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'bal mattaʿtu hāulāi waābāahum ḥattā jāahumu l-ḥaqu warasūlun mubīnun', 'হ্যাঁ, আমিই তাদেরকে আর তাদের পূর্বপুরুষকে ভোগের সামগ্রী দিয়েছিলাম। অবশেষে তাদের কাছে আসলো সত্য এবং সবকিছু স্পষ্টকারী রসূল।', 'However, I gave enjoyment to these [people of Makkah] and their fathers until there came to them the truth and a clear Messenger.', 'হ্যাঁ, আমিই তাদেরকে আর তাদের পূর্বপুরুষকে ভোগের সামগ্রী দিয়েছিলাম। অবশেষে তাদের কাছে আসলো সত্য এবং সবকিছু স্পষ্টকারী রসূল।', 'However, I gave enjoyment to these [people of Makkah] and their fathers until there came to them the truth and a clear Messenger.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043029.mp3', now()),
  (43, 30, '', '[{"id":32927,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32928,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمُ","transliteration":"jāahumu","translation_bn":"আসলো তাদের কাছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32929,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32930,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32931,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":32932,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سِحْرٌۭ","transliteration":"siḥ''run","translation_bn":"যাদু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32933,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّا","transliteration":"wa-innā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32934,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32935,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকারকারী\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32936,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā jāahumu l-ḥaqu qālū hādhā siḥ''run wa-innā bihi kāfirūna', 'সত্য যখন তাদের কাছে আসল তখন তারা বলল- এটা যাদু, আমরা এটা মানি না।', 'But when the truth came to them, they said, "This is magic, and indeed we are, concerning it, disbelievers."', 'সত্য যখন তাদের কাছে আসল তখন তারা বলল- এটা যাদু, আমরা এটা মানি না।', 'But when the truth came to them, they said, "This is magic, and indeed we are, concerning it, disbelievers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043030.mp3', now()),
  (43, 31, '', '[{"id":33352,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33353,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"\"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":33354,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُزِّلَ","transliteration":"nuzzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ হলো","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33355,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":33356,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","transliteration":"l-qur''ānu","translation_bn":"কুরআন","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33357,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33358,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَجُلٍۢ","transliteration":"rajulin","translation_bn":"এক ব্যক্তির","root":"رجل","lemma":"رَجُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33359,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33360,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْيَتَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-qaryatayni","translation_bn":"(মাক্কা ও তায়েফের) দু''টি জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33361,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٍ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","translation_bn":"(যে) বড় বা প্রতিপত্তিশালীর\"","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33362,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū lawlā nuzzila hādhā l-qur''ānu ʿalā rajulin mina l-qaryatayni ʿaẓīmin', 'তারা বলল- এ কুরআন (মক্কা ও তায়েফ এ) দু’ জনপদের কোন গণ্যমান্য ব্যক্তির উপর কেন অবতীর্ণ হল না?', 'And they said, "Why was this Qur''an not sent down upon a great man from [one of] the two cities?"', 'তারা বলল- এ কুরআন (মক্কা ও তায়েফ এ) দু’ জনপদের কোন গণ্যমান্য ব্যক্তির উপর কেন অবতীর্ণ হল না?', 'And they said, "Why was this Qur''an not sent down upon a great man from [one of] the two cities?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043031.mp3', now()),
  (43, 32, '', '[{"id":34402,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَهُمْ","transliteration":"ahum","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে বলো) তারা কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":34403,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَقْسِمُونَ","transliteration":"yaqsimūna","translation_bn":"বণ্টন করে","root":"قسم","lemma":"قَسَمْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34404,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَتَ","transliteration":"raḥmata","translation_bn":"(দয়া-করুণা) অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34405,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34407,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":34408,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَسَمْنَا","transliteration":"qasamnā","translation_bn":"বণ্টন করি","root":"قسم","lemma":"قَسَمْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34409,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُم","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":34410,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّعِيشَتَهُمْ","transliteration":"maʿīshatahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জীবিকা","root":"عيش","lemma":"مَعِيشَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34411,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34412,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34413,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34415,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَفَعْنَا","transliteration":"warafaʿnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা উন্নত করি","root":"رفع","lemma":"رَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34416,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাউকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34417,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَ","transliteration":"fawqa","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34418,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"কারও","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34419,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"darajātin","translation_bn":"মর্যাদাসমূহে","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34420,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَتَّخِذَ","transliteration":"liyattakhidha","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করে যেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34421,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُم","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের একে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34422,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضًۭا","transliteration":"baʿḍan","translation_bn":"অপরকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34423,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"سُخْرِيًّۭا ۗ","transliteration":"sukh''riyyan","translation_bn":"সেবকরূপে","root":"سخر","lemma":"سُخْرِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34425,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَتُ","transliteration":"waraḥmatu","translation_bn":"আর অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34426,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34427,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34428,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34429,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَجْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yajmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা জমা করছে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34430,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ahum yaqsimūna raḥmata rabbika naḥnu qasamnā baynahum maʿīshatahum fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā warafaʿnā baʿḍahum fawqa baʿḍin darajātin liyattakhidha baʿḍuhum baʿḍan sukh''riyyan waraḥmatu rabbika khayrun mimmā yajmaʿūna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমত কি তারা বণ্টন করে (যে তাদের মর্জিমত কুরআন নাযিল করতে হবে)? তাদের মাঝে তাদের জীবিকা আমিই বণ্টন করেছি পার্থিব জীবনে এবং মর্যাদায় এককে অন্যের উপর উন্নত করি যাতে একে অপরের সহায়তা গ্রহণ করতে পারে। তারা যা সঞ্চয় করে, তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমত তাত্থেকে উত্তম', 'Do they distribute the mercy of your Lord? It is We who have apportioned among them their livelihood in the life of this world and have raised some of them above others in degrees [of rank] that they may make use of one another for service. But the mercy of your Lord is better than whatever they accumulate.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমত কি তারা বণ্টন করে (যে তাদের মর্জিমত কুরআন নাযিল করতে হবে)? তাদের মাঝে তাদের জীবিকা আমিই বণ্টন করেছি পার্থিব জীবনে এবং মর্যাদায় এককে অন্যের উপর উন্নত করি যাতে একে অপরের সহায়তা গ্রহণ করতে পারে। তারা যা সঞ্চয় করে, তোমার প্রতিপালকের রহমত তাত্থেকে উত্তম', 'Do they distribute the mercy of your Lord? It is We who have apportioned among them their livelihood in the life of this world and have raised some of them above others in degrees [of rank] that they may make use of one another for service. But the mercy of your Lord is better than whatever they accumulate.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043032.mp3', now()),
  (43, 33, '', '[{"id":35323,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْلَآ","transliteration":"walawlā","translation_bn":"এবং না যদি (আশংকা থাকতো)","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35324,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":35325,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35326,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"সব মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35327,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةًۭ","transliteration":"ummatan","translation_bn":"মতাবলম্বী","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35328,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدَةًۭ","transliteration":"wāḥidatan","translation_bn":"একই (কুফরীর ক্ষেত্রে)","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35329,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"lajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"দিতাম অবশ্যই আমরা বানিয়ে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":35330,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35331,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَكْفُرُ","transliteration":"yakfuru","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35332,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"bil-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়কে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35333,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِبُيُوتِهِمْ","transliteration":"libuyūtihim","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের ঘরগুলোর","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35334,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سُقُفًۭا","transliteration":"suqufan","translation_bn":"ছাদসমূহকে","root":"سقف","lemma":"سَقْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35335,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35336,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِضَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"fiḍḍatin","translation_bn":"রূপা","root":"فضض","lemma":"فِضَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35337,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَمَعَارِجَ","transliteration":"wamaʿārija","translation_bn":"ও সিঁড়িগুলো","root":"عرج","lemma":"مَعَارِج","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35338,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"যার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35339,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَظْهَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaẓharūna","translation_bn":"তারা চড়ে","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35340,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walawlā an yakūna l-nāsu ummatan wāḥidatan lajaʿalnā liman yakfuru bil-raḥmāni libuyūtihim suqufan min fiḍḍatin wamaʿārija ʿalayhā yaẓharūna', '(সত্যকে অস্বীকার ক’রে) সব এক জাতিতে পরিণত হবে এ আশঙ্কা না থাকলে যারা দয়াময় আল্লাহকে অস্বীকার করে তাদেরকে অবশ্যই দিতাম তাদের গৃহের জন্য রৌপ্য নির্মিত ছাদ আর সিঁড়ি যাতে তারা আরোহণ করত।', 'And if it were not that the people would become one community [of disbelievers], We would have made for those who disbelieve in the Most Merciful - for their houses - ceilings and stairways of silver upon which to mount', '(সত্যকে অস্বীকার ক’রে) সব এক জাতিতে পরিণত হবে এ আশঙ্কা না থাকলে যারা দয়াময় আল্লাহকে অস্বীকার করে তাদেরকে অবশ্যই দিতাম তাদের গৃহের জন্য রৌপ্য নির্মিত ছাদ আর সিঁড়ি যাতে তারা আরোহণ করত।', 'And if it were not that the people would become one community [of disbelievers], We would have made for those who disbelieve in the Most Merciful - for their houses - ceilings and stairways of silver upon which to mount', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043033.mp3', now()),
  (43, 34, '', '[{"id":36509,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِبُيُوتِهِمْ","transliteration":"walibuyūtihim","translation_bn":"ও জন্যে তাদের ঘরগুলোর","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36510,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَبْوَٰبًۭا","transliteration":"abwāban","translation_bn":"দরজাসমূহকে","root":"بوب","lemma":"بَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36511,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَسُرُرًا","transliteration":"wasururan","translation_bn":"ও পালঙ্কসমূহকে","root":"سرر","lemma":"سُرُر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36512,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"যার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36513,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّكِـُٔونَ","transliteration":"yattakiūna","translation_bn":"তারা হেলান দেয়","root":"وكا","lemma":"يَتَّكِـ#ُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36514,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walibuyūtihim abwāban wasururan ʿalayhā yattakiūna', 'আর তাদের গৃহের জন্য দিতাম দরজা ও পালঙ্ক যাতে তারা হেলান দিয়ে বসত।', 'And for their houses - doors and couches [of silver] upon which to recline', 'আর তাদের গৃহের জন্য দিতাম দরজা ও পালঙ্ক যাতে তারা হেলান দিয়ে বসত।', 'And for their houses - doors and couches [of silver] upon which to recline', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043034.mp3', now()),
  (43, 35, '', '[{"id":36961,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَزُخْرُفًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"wazukh''rufan","translation_bn":"ও সোনার (বানাতাম)","root":"زخرف","lemma":"زُخْرُف","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36963,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36964,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36965,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এসব","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":36966,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"لَّمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":36967,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَتَـٰعُ","transliteration":"matāʿu","translation_bn":"ভোগসম্ভার","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36968,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36969,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36971,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","transliteration":"wal-ākhiratu","translation_bn":"আর পরকালই","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36972,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":36973,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36974,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"lil''muttaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদের জন্য (নির্দিষ্ট)","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36975,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wazukh''rufan wa-in kullu dhālika lammā matāʿu l-ḥayati l-dun''yā wal-ākhiratu ʿinda rabbika lil''muttaqīna', 'আর স্বর্ণ নির্মিতও দিতাম। এগুলো সবই তো পার্থিব জীবনের ভোগ্য সামগ্রী মাত্র। আর আখিরাত তোমার প্রতিপালকের কাছে তাদেরই জন্য যারা (আল্লাহকে) ভয় করে।', 'And gold ornament. But all that is not but the enjoyment of worldly life. And the Hereafter with your Lord is for the righteous.', 'আর স্বর্ণ নির্মিতও দিতাম। এগুলো সবই তো পার্থিব জীবনের ভোগ্য সামগ্রী মাত্র। আর আখিরাত তোমার প্রতিপালকের কাছে তাদেরই জন্য যারা (আল্লাহকে) ভয় করে।', 'And gold ornament. But all that is not but the enjoyment of worldly life. And the Hereafter with your Lord is for the righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043035.mp3', now()),
  (43, 36, '', '[{"id":37835,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37836,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَعْشُ","transliteration":"yaʿshu","translation_bn":"বিমুখ হয়","root":"عشو","lemma":"يَعْشُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37837,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37838,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرِ","transliteration":"dhik''ri","translation_bn":"স্মরণ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37839,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37840,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نُقَيِّضْ","transliteration":"nuqayyiḍ","translation_bn":"নিয়োজিত করি আমরা","root":"قيض","lemma":"قَيَّضْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37841,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37842,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَيْطَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"shayṭānan","translation_bn":"শয়তানকে","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37843,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"তখন সে","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37844,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে হয়","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37845,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَرِينٌۭ","transliteration":"qarīnun","translation_bn":"সঙ্গী","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37846,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yaʿshu ʿan dhik''ri l-raḥmāni nuqayyiḍ lahu shayṭānan fahuwa lahu qarīnun', 'যে ব্যক্তি দয়াময় আল্লাহর স্মরণ থেকে নিজেকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়, আমি তার জন্য শয়ত্বানকে নিয়োজিত করি, অতঃপর সে হয় তার ঘনিষ্ঠ সহচর।', 'And whoever is blinded from remembrance of the Most Merciful - We appoint for him a devil, and he is to him a companion.', 'যে ব্যক্তি দয়াময় আল্লাহর স্মরণ থেকে নিজেকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়, আমি তার জন্য শয়ত্বানকে নিয়োজিত করি, অতঃপর সে হয় তার ঘনিষ্ঠ সহচর।', 'And whoever is blinded from remembrance of the Most Merciful - We appoint for him a devil, and he is to him a companion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043036.mp3', now()),
  (43, 37, '', '[{"id":38685,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-innahum","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38686,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَيَصُدُّونَهُمْ","transliteration":"layaṣuddūnahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে বাধা দেয় অবশ্যই","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":38687,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38688,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","transliteration":"l-sabīli","translation_bn":"(হেদায়াতের) পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38689,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَحْسَبُونَ","transliteration":"wayaḥsabūna","translation_bn":"ও তারা মনে করে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38690,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُم","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38691,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّهْتَدُونَ","transliteration":"muh''tadūna","translation_bn":"সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38692,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-innahum layaṣuddūnahum ʿani l-sabīli wayaḥsabūna annahum muh''tadūna', 'তারাই মানুষকে সৎপথে চলতে অবশ্যই বাধা দেয়, আর মানুষ মনে করে যে, তারা সঠিক পথে রয়েছে।', 'And indeed, the devils avert them from the way [of guidance] while they think that they are [rightly] guided', 'তারাই মানুষকে সৎপথে চলতে অবশ্যই বাধা দেয়, আর মানুষ মনে করে যে, তারা সঠিক পথে রয়েছে।', 'And indeed, the devils avert them from the way [of guidance] while they think that they are [rightly] guided', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043037.mp3', now()),
  (43, 38, '', '[{"id":39863,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"শেষপর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":39864,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":39865,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَنَا","transliteration":"jāanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39866,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলবে (শয়তানকে)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39867,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰلَيْتَ","transliteration":"yālayta","translation_bn":"\"হায়","root":"—","lemma":"لَيْت","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":39868,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِى","transliteration":"baynī","translation_bn":"আমার মাঝে","root":"بين\r","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":39869,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَكَ","transliteration":"wabaynaka","translation_bn":"ও তোমার মাঝে (থাকতো)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39870,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بُعْدَ","transliteration":"buʿ''da","translation_bn":"দুরত্ব","root":"بعد","lemma":"بُعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39871,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَشْرِقَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-mashriqayni","translation_bn":"পূর্ব ও পশ্চিমের\"","root":"شرق","lemma":"مَشْرِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39872,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"fabi''sa","translation_bn":"অতএব কত নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39873,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرِينُ","transliteration":"l-qarīnu","translation_bn":"সঙ্গী (শয়তান)","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39874,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ḥattā idhā jāanā qāla yālayta baynī wabaynaka buʿ''da l-mashriqayni fabi''sa l-qarīnu', 'অবশেষে সে যখন আমার কাছে আসবে, তখন শয়ত্বানকে বলবে, হায়! আমার ও তোমার মাঝে যদি পূর্ব ও পশ্চিমের ব্যবধান থাকত! কতই না নিকৃষ্ট সহচর সে!', 'Until, when he comes to Us [at Judgement], he says [to his companion], "Oh, I wish there was between me and you the distance between the east and west - how wretched a companion."', 'অবশেষে সে যখন আমার কাছে আসবে, তখন শয়ত্বানকে বলবে, হায়! আমার ও তোমার মাঝে যদি পূর্ব ও পশ্চিমের ব্যবধান থাকত! কতই না নিকৃষ্ট সহচর সে!', 'Until, when he comes to Us [at Judgement], he says [to his companion], "Oh, I wish there was between me and you the distance between the east and west - how wretched a companion."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043038.mp3', now()),
  (43, 39, '', '[{"id":40371,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَن","transliteration":"walan","translation_bn":"এবং (বলা হবে) কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40372,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعَكُمُ","transliteration":"yanfaʿakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কল্যাণ দিবে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40373,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ (তোমাদের অনুতাপ)","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40374,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":40375,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَّلَمْتُمْ","transliteration":"ẓalamtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40376,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"annakum","translation_bn":"(এও) যে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40377,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হবে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40378,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40379,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُشْتَرِكُونَ","transliteration":"mush''tarikūna","translation_bn":"(তোমরা ও শয়তান) সমঅংশ গ্রহণকারী","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْتَرِكُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40380,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walan yanfaʿakumu l-yawma idh ẓalamtum annakum fī l-ʿadhābi mush''tarikūna', 'তোমাদের হা-হুতাশ আজ তোমাদের কোন কাজে আসবে না যেহেতু তোমরা সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলে। তোমরা হবে শাস্তির অংশীদার।', 'And never will it benefit you that Day, when you have wronged, that you are [all] sharing in the punishment.', 'তোমাদের হা-হুতাশ আজ তোমাদের কোন কাজে আসবে না যেহেতু তোমরা সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলে। তোমরা হবে শাস্তির অংশীদার।', 'And never will it benefit you that Day, when you have wronged, that you are [all] sharing in the punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043039.mp3', now()),
  (43, 40, '', '[{"id":41103,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأَنتَ","transliteration":"afa-anta","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) তুমি তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَفَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41104,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"শুনাবে","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41105,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّمَّ","transliteration":"l-ṣuma","translation_bn":"বধিরকে","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41106,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41107,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَهْدِى","transliteration":"tahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখাবে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41108,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعُمْىَ","transliteration":"l-ʿum''ya","translation_bn":"অন্ধকে","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41109,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং (তাকে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41110,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41111,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41112,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তির","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41113,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41114,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afa-anta tus''miʿu l-ṣuma aw tahdī l-ʿum''ya waman kāna fī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'তুমি কি বধিরকে শুনাতে পারবে অথবা যে অন্ধ আর যে আছে সুস্পষ্ট পথভ্রষ্টের মধ্যে তাকে সৎপথ দেখাতে পারবে?', 'Then will you make the deaf hear, [O Muhammad], or guide the blind or he who is in clear error?', 'তুমি কি বধিরকে শুনাতে পারবে অথবা যে অন্ধ আর যে আছে সুস্পষ্ট পথভ্রষ্টের মধ্যে তাকে সৎপথ দেখাতে পারবে?', 'Then will you make the deaf hear, [O Muhammad], or guide the blind or he who is in clear error?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043040.mp3', now()),
  (43, 41, '', '[{"id":41988,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِمَّا","transliteration":"fa-immā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41989,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَذْهَبَنَّ","transliteration":"nadhhabanna","translation_bn":"আমরা উঠিয়ে নিই","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41990,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِكَ","transliteration":"bika","translation_bn":"তোমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41991,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّا","transliteration":"fa-innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয় তবুও আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41992,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের হাতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41993,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُّنتَقِمُونَ","transliteration":"muntaqimūna","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণকারী (অর্থাৎ শাস্তি দিবো)","root":"نقم","lemma":"مُنتَقِمُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41994,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-immā nadhhabanna bika fa-innā min''hum muntaqimūna', 'আমি যদি তোমাকে (দুনিয়া থেকে) নিয়েও যাই, তবু আমি তাদের কাছ থেকে প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করব।', 'And whether [or not] We take you away [in death], indeed, We will take retribution upon them.', 'আমি যদি তোমাকে (দুনিয়া থেকে) নিয়েও যাই, তবু আমি তাদের কাছ থেকে প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করব।', 'And whether [or not] We take you away [in death], indeed, We will take retribution upon them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043041.mp3', now()),
  (43, 42, '', '[{"id":43026,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43027,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُرِيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"nuriyannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে দেখাই আমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43028,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43029,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"waʿadnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমরা প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43030,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّا","transliteration":"fa-innā","translation_bn":"তবুও আমরা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43031,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43032,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّقْتَدِرُونَ","transliteration":"muq''tadirūna","translation_bn":"পূর্ণ ক্ষমতাবান","root":"قدر","lemma":"مُّقْتَدِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43033,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aw nuriyannaka alladhī waʿadnāhum fa-innā ʿalayhim muq''tadirūna', 'অথবা আমি তাদেরকে যে ‘আযাবের ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছি তা যদি তোমাকে দেখিয়ে দেই (আমার পক্ষে সবই সম্ভব), কারণ তাদের উপর আমার পূর্ণ ক্ষমতা আছে।', 'Or whether [or not] We show you that which We have promised them, indeed, We are Perfect in Ability.', 'অথবা আমি তাদেরকে যে ‘আযাবের ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছি তা যদি তোমাকে দেখিয়ে দেই (আমার পক্ষে সবই সম্ভব), কারণ তাদের উপর আমার পূর্ণ ক্ষমতা আছে।', 'Or whether [or not] We show you that which We have promised them, indeed, We are Perfect in Ability.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043042.mp3', now()),
  (43, 43, '', '[{"id":43495,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَمْسِكْ","transliteration":"fa-is''tamsik","translation_bn":"তুমি অতএব দৃঢ়ভাবে ধারণ করো","root":"مسك","lemma":"ٱسْتَمْسَكَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43496,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"bi-alladhī","translation_bn":"তার ওপর যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43497,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُوحِىَ","transliteration":"ūḥiya","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়েছে","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43498,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43500,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"তুমি নিশ্চয়ই (আছো)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":43501,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43502,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43503,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43504,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-is''tamsik bi-alladhī ūḥiya ilayka innaka ʿalā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'কাজেই তোমার প্রতি যা ওয়াহী করা হয় তুমি তা দৃঢ়ভাবে আঁকড়ে ধর, কেননা তুমি তো আছ সরল সঠিক পথে।', 'So adhere to that which is revealed to you. Indeed, you are on a straight path.', 'কাজেই তোমার প্রতি যা ওয়াহী করা হয় তুমি তা দৃঢ়ভাবে আঁকড়ে ধর, কেননা তুমি তো আছ সরল সঠিক পথে।', 'So adhere to that which is revealed to you. Indeed, you are on a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043043.mp3', now()),
  (43, 44, '', '[{"id":44273,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-innahu","translation_bn":"এবং তা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44274,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَذِكْرٌۭ","transliteration":"ladhik''run","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সম্মানের বিষয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":44275,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَّكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44276,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِقَوْمِكَ ۖ","transliteration":"waliqawmika","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার জাতির জন্যে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44278,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"wasawfa","translation_bn":"এবং শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44279,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُسْـَٔلُونَ","transliteration":"tus''alūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জিজ্ঞাসিত হবে","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44280,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-innahu ladhik''run laka waliqawmika wasawfa tus''alūna', 'কুরআন হল অবশ্যই তোমার জন্য আর তোমার জাতির জন্য উপদেশ বাণী। আর এ সম্পর্কে অচিরেই তোমাদেরকে জওয়াবদিহি করতে হবে।', 'And indeed, it is a remembrance for you and your people, and you [all] are going to be questioned.', 'কুরআন হল অবশ্যই তোমার জন্য আর তোমার জাতির জন্য উপদেশ বাণী। আর এ সম্পর্কে অচিরেই তোমাদেরকে জওয়াবদিহি করতে হবে।', 'And indeed, it is a remembrance for you and your people, and you [all] are going to be questioned.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043044.mp3', now()),
  (43, 45, '', '[{"id":45027,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَسْـَٔلْ","transliteration":"wasal","translation_bn":"এবং জিজ্ঞেস করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45028,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45029,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45030,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45031,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45032,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45033,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رُّسُلِنَآ","transliteration":"rusulinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রাসূলগণের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45034,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"ajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা  নির্দিষ্ট করেছি কি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":45035,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45036,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45037,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45038,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَةًۭ","transliteration":"ālihatan","translation_bn":"(অন্য কোন) উপাস্যকে","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45039,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُعْبَدُونَ","transliteration":"yuʿ''badūna","translation_bn":"উপাসনা করা হবে (যার)","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45040,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wasal man arsalnā min qablika min rusulinā ajaʿalnā min dūni l-raḥmāni ālihatan yuʿ''badūna', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বে যে সব রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর (অর্থাৎ তাদের কিতাব দেখ ও তাদের সত্যিকার অনুসারীদের নিকট যাচাই কর) আমি কি দয়াময় আল্লাহ ছাড়া কোন ইলাহ স্থির করেছিলাম যাদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে হবে?', 'And ask those We sent before you of Our messengers; have We made besides the Most Merciful deities to be worshipped?', 'আমি তোমার পূর্বে যে সব রসূল পাঠিয়েছিলাম তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর (অর্থাৎ তাদের কিতাব দেখ ও তাদের সত্যিকার অনুসারীদের নিকট যাচাই কর) আমি কি দয়াময় আল্লাহ ছাড়া কোন ইলাহ স্থির করেছিলাম যাদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে হবে?', 'And ask those We sent before you of Our messengers; have We made besides the Most Merciful deities to be worshipped?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043045.mp3', now()),
  (43, 46, '', '[{"id":45970,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45971,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45972,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45973,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশনাবলীসহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45974,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45975,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরআউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45976,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦ","transliteration":"wamala-ihi","translation_bn":"ও তার পারিষদবর্গের","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45977,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالَ","transliteration":"faqāla","translation_bn":"তখন সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45978,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":45979,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولُ","transliteration":"rasūlu","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45980,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45981,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্ব জগতের\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45982,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā mūsā biāyātinā ilā fir''ʿawna wamala-ihi faqāla innī rasūlu rabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'আমি মূসাকে আমার নিদর্শনসহ ফেরাউন ও তার প্রধানদের নিকট পাঠিয়েছিলাম। মূসা (আ.) বলেছিল- আমি বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের রসূল।', 'And certainly did We send Moses with Our signs to Pharaoh and his establishment, and he said, "Indeed, I am the messenger of the Lord of the worlds."', 'আমি মূসাকে আমার নিদর্শনসহ ফেরাউন ও তার প্রধানদের নিকট পাঠিয়েছিলাম। মূসা (আ.) বলেছিল- আমি বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের রসূল।', 'And certainly did We send Moses with Our signs to Pharaoh and his establishment, and he said, "Indeed, I am the messenger of the Lord of the worlds."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043046.mp3', now()),
  (43, 47, '', '[{"id":46419,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46420,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُم","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46421,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের নির্দেশনাবলীসহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46422,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":46423,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":46424,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46425,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَضْحَكُونَ","transliteration":"yaḍḥakūna","translation_bn":"হাসিঠাট্টা করতে লাগলো","root":"ضحك","lemma":"ضَحِكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46426,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāahum biāyātinā idhā hum min''hā yaḍḥakūna', 'যখন সে আমার আয়াতসমূহ নিয়ে তাদের কাছে আসলো, তখন তারা তা নিয়ে হাসি-ঠাট্টা করতে লাগল।', 'But when he brought them Our signs, at once they laughed at them.', 'যখন সে আমার আয়াতসমূহ নিয়ে তাদের কাছে আসলো, তখন তারা তা নিয়ে হাসি-ঠাট্টা করতে লাগল।', 'But when he brought them Our signs, at once they laughed at them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043047.mp3', now()),
  (43, 48, '', '[{"id":47073,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47074,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُرِيهِم","transliteration":"nurīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের দেখাই আমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47075,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47076,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةٍ","transliteration":"āyatin","translation_bn":"নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47077,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":47078,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"তা ছিলো","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":47079,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَكْبَرُ","transliteration":"akbaru","translation_bn":"উৎকৃষ্ট","root":"كبر","lemma":"أَكْبَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47080,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47081,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أُخْتِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"ukh''tihā","translation_bn":"তার (পূর্বেকার) অনুরূপ","root":"اخو","lemma":"أُخْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47083,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخَذْنَـٰهُم","transliteration":"wa-akhadhnāhum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে আমরা ধরেছিলাম","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47084,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"bil-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি দিয়ে","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47085,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47086,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47087,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā nurīhim min āyatin illā hiya akbaru min ukh''tihā wa-akhadhnāhum bil-ʿadhābi laʿallahum yarjiʿūna', 'আমি তাদেরকে যে নিদর্শনই দেখাতাম তা হত পূর্ববর্তী নিদর্শন থেকে বড়। আমি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দ্বারা পাকড়াও করলাম যাতে তারা (আমার পথে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And We showed them not a sign except that it was greater than its sister, and We seized them with affliction that perhaps they might return [to faith].', 'আমি তাদেরকে যে নিদর্শনই দেখাতাম তা হত পূর্ববর্তী নিদর্শন থেকে বড়। আমি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দ্বারা পাকড়াও করলাম যাতে তারা (আমার পথে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And We showed them not a sign except that it was greater than its sister, and We seized them with affliction that perhaps they might return [to faith].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043048.mp3', now()),
  (43, 49, '', '[{"id":47789,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং (প্রত্যেকবার) তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47790,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَ","transliteration":"yāayyuha","translation_bn":"\"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":47791,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاحِرُ","transliteration":"l-sāḥiru","translation_bn":"যাদুকর","root":"سحر","lemma":"سَٰحِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47792,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُ","transliteration":"ud''ʿu","translation_bn":"দু''আ করো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47793,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَنَا","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47794,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের কাছে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47795,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"তার ভিত্তিতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47796,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَهِدَ","transliteration":"ʿahida","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার করেছেন","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47797,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِندَكَ","transliteration":"ʿindaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":47798,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّنَا","transliteration":"innanā","translation_bn":"আমরা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47799,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَمُهْتَدُونَ","transliteration":"lamuh''tadūna","translation_bn":"সৎপথপ্রাপ্ত হবো অবশ্যই\"","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":47800,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū yāayyuha l-sāḥiru ud''ʿu lanā rabbaka bimā ʿahida ʿindaka innanā lamuh''tadūna', '(শাস্তিতে আক্রান্ত হয়ে) তারা বলেছিল- ওহে যাদুকর! তুমি আমাদের জন্য তোমার প্রতিপালকের কাছে তা চাও যার ও‘য়াদা তিনি তোমার কাছে করেছেন। আমরা অবশ্যই সৎপথে চলব।', 'And they said [to Moses], "O magician, invoke for us your Lord by what He has promised you. Indeed, we will be guided."', '(শাস্তিতে আক্রান্ত হয়ে) তারা বলেছিল- ওহে যাদুকর! তুমি আমাদের জন্য তোমার প্রতিপালকের কাছে তা চাও যার ও‘য়াদা তিনি তোমার কাছে করেছেন। আমরা অবশ্যই সৎপথে চলব।', 'And they said [to Moses], "O magician, invoke for us your Lord by what He has promised you. Indeed, we will be guided."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043049.mp3', now()),
  (43, 50, '', '[{"id":48679,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48680,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَشَفْنَا","transliteration":"kashafnā","translation_bn":"আমরা দূর করলাম","root":"كشف","lemma":"كَشَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48681,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمُ","transliteration":"ʿanhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48682,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48683,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখনই","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":48684,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":48685,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَنكُثُونَ","transliteration":"yankuthūna","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার ভঙ্গ করে","root":"نكث","lemma":"نَّكَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48686,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā kashafnā ʿanhumu l-ʿadhāba idhā hum yankuthūna', 'কিন্তু যখনই আমি তাদের থেকে শাস্তি সরিয়ে দিলাম, তখনই তারা অঙ্গীকার ভঙ্গ করে বসল।', 'But when We removed from them the affliction, at once they broke their word.', 'কিন্তু যখনই আমি তাদের থেকে শাস্তি সরিয়ে দিলাম, তখনই তারা অঙ্গীকার ভঙ্গ করে বসল।', 'But when We removed from them the affliction, at once they broke their word.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043050.mp3', now()),
  (43, 51, '', '[{"id":49080,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَادَىٰ","transliteration":"wanādā","translation_bn":"এবং (একদিন) ডেকে বললো","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49081,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"ফিরআউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49082,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49083,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"তার জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49084,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49085,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে জাতি আমার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":49086,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"alaysa","translation_bn":"নয় কি","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":49087,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমারই","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49088,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُلْكُ","transliteration":"mul''ku","translation_bn":"রাজত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49089,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِصْرَ","transliteration":"miṣ''ra","translation_bn":"মিসরে","root":"مصر","lemma":"مِصْر","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49090,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"wahādhihi","translation_bn":"এবং এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49091,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"নদীগুলো","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49092,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"বয়ে যায় (নাকি)","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49093,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49094,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِىٓ ۖ","transliteration":"taḥtī","translation_bn":"আমার অধীনে","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49096,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"তবে কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":49097,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُبْصِرُونَ","transliteration":"tub''ṣirūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা দেখতে পাও","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49098,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanādā fir''ʿawnu fī qawmihi qāla yāqawmi alaysa lī mul''ku miṣ''ra wahādhihi l-anhāru tajrī min taḥtī afalā tub''ṣirūna', 'ফেরাউন তার সম্প্রদায়ের মাঝে ঘোষণা দিল। বলল- হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! মিসরের রাজত্ব কি আমার নয়? আর এ সব নদনদী আমার নীচ দিয়ে বয়ে যাচ্ছে, তোমরা কি তা দেখ না?', 'And Pharaoh called out among his people; he said, "O my people, does not the kingdom of Egypt belong to me, and these rivers flowing beneath me; then do you not see?', 'ফেরাউন তার সম্প্রদায়ের মাঝে ঘোষণা দিল। বলল- হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! মিসরের রাজত্ব কি আমার নয়? আর এ সব নদনদী আমার নীচ দিয়ে বয়ে যাচ্ছে, তোমরা কি তা দেখ না?', 'And Pharaoh called out among his people; he said, "O my people, does not the kingdom of Egypt belong to me, and these rivers flowing beneath me; then do you not see?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043051.mp3', now()),
  (43, 52, '', '[{"id":49808,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49809,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি (নই কি)","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":49810,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49811,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49812,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই (মুসার)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":49813,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(এমন) যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49814,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":49815,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَهِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mahīnun","translation_bn":"হীন","root":"مهن","lemma":"مَّهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49816,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49817,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَكَادُ","transliteration":"yakādu","translation_bn":"প্রায়","root":"كود","lemma":"كَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49818,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُبِينُ","transliteration":"yubīnu","translation_bn":"স্পষ্ট বর্ণনা করতে পারে (কথা)","root":"بين","lemma":"يُبِينُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49819,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am anā khayrun min hādhā alladhī huwa mahīnun walā yakādu yubīnu', 'আমি কি এ লোক থেকে শ্রেষ্ঠ নই যে নীচ, যে নিজের কথাটিও স্পষ্ট করে বলতে অক্ষম!', 'Or am I [not] better than this one who is insignificant and hardly makes himself clear?', 'আমি কি এ লোক থেকে শ্রেষ্ঠ নই যে নীচ, যে নিজের কথাটিও স্পষ্ট করে বলতে অক্ষম!', 'Or am I [not] better than this one who is insignificant and hardly makes himself clear?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043052.mp3', now()),
  (43, 53, '', '[{"id":50415,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَوْلَآ","transliteration":"falawlā","translation_bn":"না তবে কেন","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50416,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُلْقِىَ","transliteration":"ul''qiya","translation_bn":"দেওয়া হলো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50417,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50418,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَسْوِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"aswiratun","translation_bn":"বালা","root":"سور","lemma":"أَسَاوِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50419,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরী","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50420,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذَهَبٍ","transliteration":"dhahabin","translation_bn":"সোনার","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50421,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50422,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসলো (না কেন)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50423,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"তার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":50424,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50425,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُقْتَرِنِينَ","transliteration":"muq''tarinīna","translation_bn":"দলবেঁধে\"","root":"قرن","lemma":"مُقْتَرِنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50426,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falawlā ul''qiya ʿalayhi aswiratun min dhahabin aw jāa maʿahu l-malāikatu muq''tarinīna', '(সে যদি আল্লাহর রসূলই হয়ে থাকে) তাহলে তাঁকে কেন স্বর্ণ কঙ্কন দেয়া হল না? অথবা সারিবদ্ধভাবে ফেরেশতারা কেন তার সাথে আসল না?', 'Then why have there not been placed upon him bracelets of gold or come with him the angels in conjunction?"', '(সে যদি আল্লাহর রসূলই হয়ে থাকে) তাহলে তাঁকে কেন স্বর্ণ কঙ্কন দেয়া হল না? অথবা সারিবদ্ধভাবে ফেরেশতারা কেন তার সাথে আসল না?', 'Then why have there not been placed upon him bracelets of gold or come with him the angels in conjunction?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043053.mp3', now()),
  (43, 54, '', '[{"id":51235,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَخَفَّ","transliteration":"fa-is''takhaffa","translation_bn":"সে এভাবে বোকা বানালো","root":"خفف","lemma":"ٱسْتَخَفَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51236,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَهُۥ","transliteration":"qawmahu","translation_bn":"তার জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51237,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَأَطَاعُوهُ ۚ","transliteration":"fa-aṭāʿūhu","translation_bn":"তখন তাকে তারা মেনে নিলো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51239,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"তারা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51240,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51241,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51242,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰسِقِينَ","transliteration":"fāsiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51243,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-is''takhaffa qawmahu fa-aṭāʿūhu innahum kānū qawman fāsiqīna', 'এভাবে সে তার জাতির লোকেদের বোকা বানিয়ে দিল। ফলে তারা তার কথা মেনে নিল। তারা ছিল এক পাপাচারী সম্প্রদায়।', 'So he bluffed his people, and they obeyed him. Indeed, they were [themselves] a people defiantly disobedient [of Allah].', 'এভাবে সে তার জাতির লোকেদের বোকা বানিয়ে দিল। ফলে তারা তার কথা মেনে নিল। তারা ছিল এক পাপাচারী সম্প্রদায়।', 'So he bluffed his people, and they obeyed him. Indeed, they were [themselves] a people defiantly disobedient [of Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043054.mp3', now()),
  (43, 55, '', '[{"id":51582,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51583,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاسَفُونَا","transliteration":"āsafūnā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে বিরক্ত করলো","root":"اسف","lemma":"ءَاسَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51584,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱنتَقَمْنَا","transliteration":"intaqamnā","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রতিশোধ নিলাম","root":"نقم","lemma":"ٱنتَقَمْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51585,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51586,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَغْرَقْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-aghraqnāhum","translation_bn":"তখন তাদেরকে আমরা ডুবিয়ে দিলাম","root":"غرق","lemma":"أُغْرِقُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51587,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَجْمَعِينَ","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","translation_bn":"সকলকেই","root":"جمع","lemma":"أَجْمَعِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51588,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā āsafūnā intaqamnā min''hum fa-aghraqnāhum ajmaʿīna', 'তারা যখন আমাকে রাগান্বিত করল, তখন আমি তাদের উপর প্রতিশোধ নিলাম, অতঃপর সব্বাইকে ডুবিয়ে মারলাম।', 'And when they angered Us, We took retribution from them and drowned them all.', 'তারা যখন আমাকে রাগান্বিত করল, তখন আমি তাদের উপর প্রতিশোধ নিলাম, অতঃপর সব্বাইকে ডুবিয়ে মারলাম।', 'And when they angered Us, We took retribution from them and drowned them all.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043055.mp3', now()),
  (43, 56, '', '[{"id":52132,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"fajaʿalnāhum","translation_bn":"এরপর তাদেরকে আমরা রেখে দিলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52133,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَلَفًۭا","transliteration":"salafan","translation_bn":"অতীতের ইতিহাস","root":"سلف","lemma":"سَلَف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52134,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَمَثَلًۭا","transliteration":"wamathalan","translation_bn":"ও (শিক্ষার) দৃষ্টান্ত করে","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52135,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْـَٔاخِرِينَ","transliteration":"lil''ākhirīna","translation_bn":"পরবর্তীদের জন্যে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52136,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fajaʿalnāhum salafan wamathalan lil''ākhirīna', 'এভাবে আমি তাদেরকে করলাম অতীতের মানুষ আর পরবর্তীদের জন্য দৃষ্টান্ত।', 'And We made them a precedent and an example for the later peoples.', 'এভাবে আমি তাদেরকে করলাম অতীতের মানুষ আর পরবর্তীদের জন্য দৃষ্টান্ত।', 'And We made them a precedent and an example for the later peoples.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043056.mp3', now()),
  (43, 57, '', '[{"id":52680,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52681,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ضُرِبَ","transliteration":"ḍuriba","translation_bn":"পেশ করা হলো","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52682,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنُ","transliteration":"ub''nu","translation_bn":"পুত্রকে","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52683,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَرْيَمَ","transliteration":"maryama","translation_bn":"মারইয়ামের","root":"—","lemma":"مَرْيَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52684,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًا","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্তরূপে","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52685,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"তখনই","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":52686,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمُكَ","transliteration":"qawmuka","translation_bn":"তোমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52687,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52688,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَصِدُّونَ","transliteration":"yaṣiddūna","translation_bn":"হৈ চৈ শুরু করলো","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52689,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā ḍuriba ub''nu maryama mathalan idhā qawmuka min''hu yaṣiddūna', 'যখন মারইয়াম-পুত্র ‘ঈসার দৃষ্টান্ত তুলে ধরা হয়, তখন তোমার জাতির লোকেরা হট্টগোল শুরু করে দেয়,', 'And when the son of Mary was presented as an example, immediately your people laughed aloud.', 'যখন মারইয়াম-পুত্র ‘ঈসার দৃষ্টান্ত তুলে ধরা হয়, তখন তোমার জাতির লোকেরা হট্টগোল শুরু করে দেয়,', 'And when the son of Mary was presented as an example, immediately your people laughed aloud.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043057.mp3', now()),
  (43, 58, '', '[{"id":53275,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53276,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَأَـٰلِهَتُنَا","transliteration":"aālihatunā","translation_bn":"\"আমাদের দেবতারা কি","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":53277,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53278,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"না কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53279,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۚ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে\"","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۚ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":53281,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53282,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبُوهُ","transliteration":"ḍarabūhu","translation_bn":"তারা পেশ করেছে তা","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53283,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكَ","transliteration":"laka","translation_bn":"তোমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكَ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53284,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53285,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَدَلًۢا ۚ","transliteration":"jadalan","translation_bn":"বিতর্ক করার (উদ্দেশ্যে)","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَدَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53287,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":53288,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":53289,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53290,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"خَصِمُونَ","transliteration":"khaṣimūna","translation_bn":"ঝগড়াটে","root":"خصم","lemma":"خَصِمُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":53291,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū aālihatunā khayrun am huwa mā ḍarabūhu laka illā jadalan bal hum qawmun khaṣimūna', 'এবং বলে আমাদের উপাস্যরা উত্তম না ‘ঈসা? (কারণ খৃস্টানরা ‘ঈসাকে উপাস্য বানিয়েছে আর আমরা মক্কাবাসীরা উপাস্য বানিয়েছি অন্যদেরকে)। তারা শুধু বিতর্ক সৃষ্টির উদ্দেশ্যেই তোমার সামনে এ দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করে। আসলে তারা হল এক ঝগড়াটে জাতি।', 'And they said, "Are your gods better, or is he?" They did not present the comparison except for [mere] argument. But, [in fact], they are a people prone to dispute.', 'এবং বলে আমাদের উপাস্যরা উত্তম না ‘ঈসা? (কারণ খৃস্টানরা ‘ঈসাকে উপাস্য বানিয়েছে আর আমরা মক্কাবাসীরা উপাস্য বানিয়েছি অন্যদেরকে)। তারা শুধু বিতর্ক সৃষ্টির উদ্দেশ্যেই তোমার সামনে এ দৃষ্টান্ত পেশ করে। আসলে তারা হল এক ঝগড়াটে জাতি।', 'And they said, "Are your gods better, or is he?" They did not present the comparison except for [mere] argument. But, [in fact], they are a people prone to dispute.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043058.mp3', now()),
  (43, 59, '', '[{"id":53699,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53700,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে (অর্থাৎ ঈসা আঃ)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":53701,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53702,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَبْدٌ","transliteration":"ʿabdun","translation_bn":"এক দাস","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53703,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنْعَمْنَا","transliteration":"anʿamnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অনুগ্রহ করেছিলাম","root":"نعم","lemma":"أَنْعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53704,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53705,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"wajaʿalnāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তাকে আমরা করেছিলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53706,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًۭا","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"আদর্শস্বরূপ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53707,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّبَنِىٓ","transliteration":"libanī","translation_bn":"সন্তানদের জন্যে","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53708,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53709,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in huwa illā ʿabdun anʿamnā ʿalayhi wajaʿalnāhu mathalan libanī is''rāīla', 'মারইয়াম-পুত্র তো শুধু একজন বান্দাহ যার প্রতি আমি অনুগ্রহ করেছিলাম আর বানী ইসরাঈলের জন্য আমি তাকে করেছিলাম (আমার কুদরাতের বিশেষ এক) নমুনা।', 'Jesus was not but a servant upon whom We bestowed favor, and We made him an example for the Children of Israel.', 'মারইয়াম-পুত্র তো শুধু একজন বান্দাহ যার প্রতি আমি অনুগ্রহ করেছিলাম আর বানী ইসরাঈলের জন্য আমি তাকে করেছিলাম (আমার কুদরাতের বিশেষ এক) নমুনা।', 'Jesus was not but a servant upon whom We bestowed favor, and We made him an example for the Children of Israel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043059.mp3', now()),
  (43, 60, '', '[{"id":54430,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54431,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَشَآءُ","transliteration":"nashāu","translation_bn":"আমরা চাইতাম","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54432,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"lajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অবশ্যই সৃষ্টি করতাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54433,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُم","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54434,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّلَـٰٓئِكَةًۭ","transliteration":"malāikatan","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54435,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54436,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54437,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَخْلُفُونَ","transliteration":"yakhlufūna","translation_bn":"তারা স্থলাভিষিক্ত হতো (তোমাদের)","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54438,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw nashāu lajaʿalnā minkum malāikatan fī l-arḍi yakhlufūna', 'আমি ইচ্ছে করলে তোমাদের মধ্য হতে ফেরেশতা পয়দা করতে পারি যারা পর পর উত্তরাধিকারী হবে।', 'And if We willed, We could have made [instead] of you angels succeeding [one another] on the earth.', 'আমি ইচ্ছে করলে তোমাদের মধ্য হতে ফেরেশতা পয়দা করতে পারি যারা পর পর উত্তরাধিকারী হবে।', 'And if We willed, We could have made [instead] of you angels succeeding [one another] on the earth.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043060.mp3', now()),
  (43, 61, '', '[{"id":54805,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-innahu","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54806,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَعِلْمٌۭ","transliteration":"laʿil''mun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শন","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54807,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِّلسَّاعَةِ","transliteration":"lilssāʿati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের জন্যে","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54808,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54809,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَمْتَرُنَّ","transliteration":"tamtarunna","translation_bn":"তোমরা সন্দেহ করো","root":"مري","lemma":"يَمْتَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54810,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তা সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54811,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبِعُونِ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-ittabiʿūni","translation_bn":"এবং আমাকে তোমরা অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54813,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":54814,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٌۭ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭun","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54815,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmun","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54816,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-innahu laʿil''mun lilssāʿati falā tamtarunna bihā wa-ittabiʿūni hādhā ṣirāṭun mus''taqīmun', '‘ঈসা (’র দুনিয়াতে পুনরায় আগমন) ক্বিয়ামতের একটি নিশ্চিত নিদর্শন। অতএব তোমরা ক্বিয়ামতে সন্দেহ পোষণ করো না আর আমার অনুসরণ কর, এটাই সরল সঠিক পথ।', 'And indeed, Jesus will be [a sign for] knowledge of the Hour, so be not in doubt of it, and follow Me. This is a straight path.', '‘ঈসা (’র দুনিয়াতে পুনরায় আগমন) ক্বিয়ামতের একটি নিশ্চিত নিদর্শন। অতএব তোমরা ক্বিয়ামতে সন্দেহ পোষণ করো না আর আমার অনুসরণ কর, এটাই সরল সঠিক পথ।', 'And indeed, Jesus will be [a sign for] knowledge of the Hour, so be not in doubt of it, and follow Me. This is a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043061.mp3', now()),
  (43, 62, '', '[{"id":55544,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55545,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَصُدَّنَّكُمُ","transliteration":"yaṣuddannakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে বাঁধা দিতে পারে (যেন)","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55546,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55548,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55549,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55550,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوٌّۭ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","translation_bn":"শত্রু","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55551,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ্য","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55552,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yaṣuddannakumu l-shayṭānu innahu lakum ʿaduwwun mubīnun', 'শয়ত্বান তোমাদেরকে (সৎ পথে চলতে) কিছুতেই যেন বাধাগ্রস্ত করতে না পারে, সে তোমাদের খোলাখুলি দুশমন।', 'And never let Satan avert you. Indeed, he is to you a clear enemy.', 'শয়ত্বান তোমাদেরকে (সৎ পথে চলতে) কিছুতেই যেন বাধাগ্রস্ত করতে না পারে, সে তোমাদের খোলাখুলি দুশমন।', 'And never let Satan avert you. Indeed, he is to you a clear enemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043062.mp3', now()),
  (43, 63, '', '[{"id":55995,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55996,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"এসেছিলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55997,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عِيسَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿīsā","translation_bn":"ঈসা","root":"—","lemma":"عِيسَى","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55998,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শনাবলীসহ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55999,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56000,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":56001,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتُكُم","transliteration":"ji''tukum","translation_bn":"আমি তোমাদের কাছে এসেছি","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56002,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحِكْمَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ḥik''mati","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাসহ","root":"حكم","lemma":"حِكْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56003,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلِأُبَيِّنَ","transliteration":"wali-ubayyina","translation_bn":"এবং আমি সুস্পষ্ট করার জন্যে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56004,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56005,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَ","transliteration":"baʿḍa","translation_bn":"এমন কিছু","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56006,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56007,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَخْتَلِفُونَ","transliteration":"takhtalifūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা মতভেদ করছো","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56008,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۖ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56010,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56011,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56012,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُونِ","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿūni","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা আনুগত্য করো আমার","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56013,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā jāa ʿīsā bil-bayināti qāla qad ji''tukum bil-ḥik''mati wali-ubayyina lakum baʿḍa alladhī takhtalifūna fīhi fa-ittaqū l-laha wa-aṭīʿūni', '‘ঈসা যখন স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল তখন সে বলেছিল- আমি তোমাদের কাছে হিকমত নিয়ে এসেছি আর এসেছি কতকগুলো বিষয় স্পষ্ট করার জন্য যাতে তোমরা মতভেদ করছ। কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আর আমার কথা মান্য কর।', 'And when Jesus brought clear proofs, he said, "I have come to you with wisdom and to make clear to you some of that over which you differ, so fear Allah and obey me.', '‘ঈসা যখন স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন নিয়ে এসেছিল তখন সে বলেছিল- আমি তোমাদের কাছে হিকমত নিয়ে এসেছি আর এসেছি কতকগুলো বিষয় স্পষ্ট করার জন্য যাতে তোমরা মতভেদ করছ। কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আর আমার কথা মান্য কর।', 'And when Jesus brought clear proofs, he said, "I have come to you with wisdom and to make clear to you some of that over which you differ, so fear Allah and obey me.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043063.mp3', now()),
  (43, 64, '', '[{"id":56538,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":56539,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56540,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":56541,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56542,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"warabbukum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56543,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْبُدُوهُ ۚ","transliteration":"fa-uʿ''budūhu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তাঁরই তোমরা ইবাদত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56545,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":56546,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٌۭ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭun","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56547,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmun","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক\"","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56548,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha huwa rabbī warabbukum fa-uʿ''budūhu hādhā ṣirāṭun mus''taqīmun', 'আল্লাহ তিনি তো আমারও রব্ব আর তোমাদেরও রব্ব, কাজেই তোমরা তাঁরই ‘ইবাদাত কর, এটাই সরল সঠিক পথ।', 'Indeed, Allah is my Lord and your Lord, so worship Him. This is a straight path."', 'আল্লাহ তিনি তো আমারও রব্ব আর তোমাদেরও রব্ব, কাজেই তোমরা তাঁরই ‘ইবাদাত কর, এটাই সরল সঠিক পথ।', 'Indeed, Allah is my Lord and your Lord, so worship Him. This is a straight path."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043064.mp3', now()),
  (43, 65, '', '[{"id":57084,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱخْتَلَفَ","transliteration":"fa-ikh''talafa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর মতভেদ করলো","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57085,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَحْزَابُ","transliteration":"l-aḥzābu","translation_bn":"বিভিন্ন দল","root":"حزب","lemma":"حِزْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57086,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57087,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"baynihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57089,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَوَيْلٌۭ","transliteration":"fawaylun","translation_bn":"সুতরাং দুর্ভোগ","root":"—","lemma":"وَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57090,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57091,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57092,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57093,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابِ","transliteration":"ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57094,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٍ","transliteration":"yawmin","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57095,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٍ","transliteration":"alīmin","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":57096,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ikh''talafa l-aḥzābu min baynihim fawaylun lilladhīna ẓalamū min ʿadhābi yawmin alīmin', 'অতঃপর তাদের বিভিন্ন দল নিজেদের মধ্যে মতানৈক্য করল। কাজেই যালিমদের জন্য যন্ত্রণাদায়ক দিনের ‘আযাবের দুর্ভোগ।', 'But the denominations from among them differed [and separated], so woe to those who have wronged from the punishment of a painful Day.', 'অতঃপর তাদের বিভিন্ন দল নিজেদের মধ্যে মতানৈক্য করল। কাজেই যালিমদের জন্য যন্ত্রণাদায়ক দিনের ‘আযাবের দুর্ভোগ।', 'But the denominations from among them differed [and separated], so woe to those who have wronged from the punishment of a painful Day.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043065.mp3', now()),
  (43, 66, '', '[{"id":57491,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":57492,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অপেক্ষা করছে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57493,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":57494,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের (দিনের)","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57495,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":57496,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَهُم","transliteration":"tatiyahum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57497,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَغْتَةًۭ","transliteration":"baghtatan","translation_bn":"হঠাৎ","root":"بغت","lemma":"بَغْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57498,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":57499,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57500,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَشْعُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","translation_bn":"টেরও পাবে","root":"شعر","lemma":"يَشْعُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57501,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hal yanẓurūna illā l-sāʿata an tatiyahum baghtatan wahum lā yashʿurūna', 'তারা কি তাদের উপর ক্বিয়ামত অকস্মাৎ এসে পড়ার অপেক্ষা করছে যা তারা টেরও পাবে না।', 'Are they waiting except for the Hour to come upon them suddenly while they perceive not?', 'তারা কি তাদের উপর ক্বিয়ামত অকস্মাৎ এসে পড়ার অপেক্ষা করছে যা তারা টেরও পাবে না।', 'Are they waiting except for the Hour to come upon them suddenly while they perceive not?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043066.mp3', now()),
  (43, 67, '', '[{"id":57961,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَخِلَّآءُ","transliteration":"al-akhilāu","translation_bn":"বন্ধুরা","root":"خلل","lemma":"خَلِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57962,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَئِذٍۭ","transliteration":"yawma-idhin","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"—","lemma":"يَوْمَئِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":57963,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের একে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57964,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِبَعْضٍ","transliteration":"libaʿḍin","translation_bn":"অপরের জন্যে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57965,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوٌّ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","translation_bn":"শত্রু (হবে)","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57966,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":57967,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীরা","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57968,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-akhilāu yawma-idhin baʿḍuhum libaʿḍin ʿaduwwun illā l-mutaqīna', 'বন্ধুরা সেদিন হয়ে যাবে একজন আরেকজনের দুশমন, তবে মুত্তাকীরা ছাড়া।', 'Close friends, that Day, will be enemies to each other, except for the righteous', 'বন্ধুরা সেদিন হয়ে যাবে একজন আরেকজনের দুশমন, তবে মুত্তাকীরা ছাড়া।', 'Close friends, that Day, will be enemies to each other, except for the righteous', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043067.mp3', now()),
  (43, 68, '', '[{"id":58481,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰعِبَادِ","transliteration":"yāʿibādi","translation_bn":"\"(বলা হবে) হে আমার দাসরা","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":58482,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58483,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَوْفٌ","transliteration":"khawfun","translation_bn":"কোনো ভয়","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَوْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58484,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58485,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58486,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58487,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":58488,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَحْزَنُونَ","transliteration":"taḥzanūna","translation_bn":"চিন্তা করবে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58489,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāʿibādi lā khawfun ʿalaykumu l-yawma walā antum taḥzanūna', '(মুত্তাকীদেরকে বলা হবে) হে আমার বান্দাগণ! আজ তোমাদের কোন ভয় নেই আর তোমরা দুঃখিতও হবে না-', '[To whom Allah will say], "O My servants, no fear will there be concerning you this Day, nor will you grieve,', '(মুত্তাকীদেরকে বলা হবে) হে আমার বান্দাগণ! আজ তোমাদের কোন ভয় নেই আর তোমরা দুঃখিতও হবে না-', '[To whom Allah will say], "O My servants, no fear will there be concerning you this Day, nor will you grieve,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043068.mp3', now()),
  (43, 69, '', '[{"id":58972,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58973,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58974,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের আয়াতগুলোর উপর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58975,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58976,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"mus''limīna","translation_bn":"আত্মসমর্পণকারী (অর্থাৎ মুসলমান)","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58977,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna āmanū biāyātinā wakānū mus''limīna', 'তোমরা যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহে বিশ্বাস করেছিলে এবং অনুগত ছিলে।', '[You] who believed in Our verses and were Muslims.', 'তোমরা যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহে বিশ্বাস করেছিলে এবং অনুগত ছিলে।', '[You] who believed in Our verses and were Muslims.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043069.mp3', now()),
  (43, 70, '', '[{"id":59359,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","transliteration":"ud''khulū","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে বলা হবে) তোমরা প্রবেশ করো","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59360,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ","transliteration":"l-janata","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59361,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":59362,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَزْوَٰجُكُمْ","transliteration":"wa-azwājukum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের স্ত্রীরা","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59363,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُحْبَرُونَ","transliteration":"tuḥ''barūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সন্তুষ্ট করে দেওয়া হবে\"","root":"حبر","lemma":"يُحْبَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59364,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ud''khulū l-janata antum wa-azwājukum tuḥ''barūna', 'সানন্দে জান্নাতে প্রবেশ কর তোমরা আর তোমাদের স্ত্রীরা।', 'Enter Paradise, you and your kinds, delighted."', 'সানন্দে জান্নাতে প্রবেশ কর তোমরা আর তোমাদের স্ত্রীরা।', 'Enter Paradise, you and your kinds, delighted."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043070.mp3', now()),
  (43, 71, '', '[{"id":60280,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُطَافُ","transliteration":"yuṭāfu","translation_bn":"পরিবেশন করা হবে","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60281,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60282,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِصِحَافٍۢ","transliteration":"biṣiḥāfin","translation_bn":"থালাসমূহকে","root":"صحف","lemma":"صِحَاف","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60283,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"তৈরী","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60284,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ذَهَبٍۢ","transliteration":"dhahabin","translation_bn":"স্বর্ণের","root":"ذهب","lemma":"ذَهَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60285,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَكْوَابٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"wa-akwābin","translation_bn":"এবং পানপাত্রসমুহও (স্বর্ণের)","root":"كوب","lemma":"أَكْوَاب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60287,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَفِيهَا","transliteration":"wafīhā","translation_bn":"এবং তার মধ্যে থাকবে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60288,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60289,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَشْتَهِيهِ","transliteration":"tashtahīhi","translation_bn":"তা চাইবে","root":"شهو","lemma":"ٱشْتَهَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60290,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنفُسُ","transliteration":"l-anfusu","translation_bn":"(তাদের) অন্তরগুলো","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60291,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَتَلَذُّ","transliteration":"wataladhu","translation_bn":"এবং তৃপ্ত হবে (তা দেখে)","root":"لذذ","lemma":"تَلَذُّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60292,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْيُنُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-aʿyunu","translation_bn":"(তাদের) চোখগুলো","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60294,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wa-antum","translation_bn":"এবং (বলা হবে) তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60295,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60296,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","transliteration":"khālidūna","translation_bn":"চিরকাল","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60297,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yuṭāfu ʿalayhim biṣiḥāfin min dhahabin wa-akwābin wafīhā mā tashtahīhi l-anfusu wataladhu l-aʿyunu wa-antum fīhā khālidūna', 'তাদের কাছে চক্রাকারে পরিবেশন করা হবে স্বর্ণের থালা ও পান পাত্র। সেখানে তা-ই আছে মন যা চাইবে, আর চোখ যাতে তৃপ্ত হবে। তোমরা তাতে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Circulated among them will be plates and vessels of gold. And therein is whatever the souls desire and [what] delights the eyes, and you will abide therein eternally.', 'তাদের কাছে চক্রাকারে পরিবেশন করা হবে স্বর্ণের থালা ও পান পাত্র। সেখানে তা-ই আছে মন যা চাইবে, আর চোখ যাতে তৃপ্ত হবে। তোমরা তাতে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Circulated among them will be plates and vessels of gold. And therein is whatever the souls desire and [what] delights the eyes, and you will abide therein eternally.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043071.mp3', now()),
  (43, 72, '', '[{"id":60433,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتِلْكَ","transliteration":"watil''ka","translation_bn":"এবং এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60434,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةُ","transliteration":"l-janatu","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60435,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِىٓ","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"(সেই) যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60436,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُورِثْتُمُوهَا","transliteration":"ūrith''tumūhā","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে তার উত্তরাধিকারী করা হয়েছে","root":"ورث","lemma":"أَوْرَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60437,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60438,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60439,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করেছিলে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60440,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watil''ka l-janatu allatī ūrith''tumūhā bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'এই হল জান্নাত তোমাদেরকে যার উত্তরাধিকারী করা হয়েছে, কারণ তোমরা (সৎ) ‘আমাল করেছিলে।', 'And that is Paradise which you are made to inherit for what you used to do.', 'এই হল জান্নাত তোমাদেরকে যার উত্তরাধিকারী করা হয়েছে, কারণ তোমরা (সৎ) ‘আমাল করেছিলে।', 'And that is Paradise which you are made to inherit for what you used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043072.mp3', now()),
  (43, 73, '', '[{"id":60905,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60906,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60907,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰكِهَةٌۭ","transliteration":"fākihatun","translation_bn":"ফলমূল","root":"فكه","lemma":"فَٰكِهَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60908,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"kathīratun","translation_bn":"প্রচুর","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60909,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60910,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُونَ","transliteration":"takulūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা খাবে","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60911,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lakum fīhā fākihatun kathīratun min''hā takulūna', 'তোমাদের জন্য সেখানে আছে প্রচুর ফল যাত্থেকে তোমরা খাবে।', 'For you therein is much fruit from which you will eat.', 'তোমাদের জন্য সেখানে আছে প্রচুর ফল যাত্থেকে তোমরা খাবে।', 'For you therein is much fruit from which you will eat.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043073.mp3', now()),
  (43, 74, '', '[{"id":61375,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61376,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীরা","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61377,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(হবে) মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61378,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابِ","transliteration":"ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61379,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61380,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","transliteration":"khālidūna","translation_bn":"তারা স্থায়ী হবে (সেখানে)","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61381,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-muj''rimīna fī ʿadhābi jahannama khālidūna', '(আর অন্যদিকে) অপরাধীরা জাহান্নামের ‘আযাবে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Indeed, the criminals will be in the punishment of Hell, abiding eternally.', '(আর অন্যদিকে) অপরাধীরা জাহান্নামের ‘আযাবে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Indeed, the criminals will be in the punishment of Hell, abiding eternally.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043074.mp3', now()),
  (43, 75, '', '[{"id":61838,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":61839,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُفَتَّرُ","transliteration":"yufattaru","translation_bn":"কম করা হবে","root":"فتر","lemma":"يُفَتَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61840,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে (শাস্তি)","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61841,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61842,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61843,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُبْلِسُونَ","transliteration":"mub''lisūna","translation_bn":"হতাশ হয়ে পড়ে থাকবে","root":"بلس","lemma":"مُبْلِسُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61844,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yufattaru ʿanhum wahum fīhi mub''lisūna', 'তাদের শাস্তি কমানো হবে না, আর তাতে তারা হতাশ হয়ে পড়বে।', 'It will not be allowed to subside for them, and they, therein, are in despair.', 'তাদের শাস্তি কমানো হবে না, আর তাতে তারা হতাশ হয়ে পড়বে।', 'It will not be allowed to subside for them, and they, therein, are in despair.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043075.mp3', now()),
  (43, 76, '', '[{"id":62346,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62347,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"ẓalamnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমরা অত্যাচার করেছি","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62348,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62349,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62350,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":62351,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী (তাদের নিজেদের উপর)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62352,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ẓalamnāhum walākin kānū humu l-ẓālimīna', 'আমি তাদের উপর যুলম করিনি, বরং তারা নিজেরাই যালিম ছিল।', 'And We did not wrong them, but it was they who were the wrongdoers.', 'আমি তাদের উপর যুলম করিনি, বরং তারা নিজেরাই যালিম ছিল।', 'And We did not wrong them, but it was they who were the wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043076.mp3', now()),
  (43, 77, '', '[{"id":62852,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنَادَوْا۟","transliteration":"wanādaw","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ডেকে বলবে","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62853,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمَـٰلِكُ","transliteration":"yāmāliku","translation_bn":"\"হে মালিক (জাহান্নামের প্রহরী)","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَٰلِك2","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":62854,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِيَقْضِ","transliteration":"liyaqḍi","translation_bn":"শেষ করে দিক","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62855,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর (ব্যাপারটা)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62856,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62858,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62859,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُم","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62860,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّـٰكِثُونَ","transliteration":"mākithūna","translation_bn":"অবস্থানকারী (এভাবেই)\"","root":"مكث","lemma":"مَّٰكِثِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62861,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanādaw yāmāliku liyaqḍi ʿalaynā rabbuka qāla innakum mākithūna', 'তারা চীৎকার ক’রে বলবে- হে ‘মালেক (জাহান্নামের দাড়োয়ান)! তোমার প্রতিপালক যেন আমাদের দফারফা ক’রে দেন। সে জওয়াব দিবে- ‘তোমরা (এ অবস্থাতেই পড়ে) থাকবে’।', 'And they will call, "O Malik, let your Lord put an end to us!" He will say, "Indeed, you will remain."', 'তারা চীৎকার ক’রে বলবে- হে ‘মালেক (জাহান্নামের দাড়োয়ান)! তোমার প্রতিপালক যেন আমাদের দফারফা ক’রে দেন। সে জওয়াব দিবে- ‘তোমরা (এ অবস্থাতেই পড়ে) থাকবে’।', 'And they will call, "O Malik, let your Lord put an end to us!" He will say, "Indeed, you will remain."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043077.mp3', now()),
  (43, 78, '', '[{"id":63267,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":63268,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جِئْنَـٰكُم","transliteration":"ji''nākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আমরা এসেছিলাম","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63269,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্যসহ","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63270,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63271,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَكُمْ","transliteration":"aktharakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বেশীর ভাগই (ছিলে)","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63272,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"lil''ḥaqqi","translation_bn":"সত্যের প্রতি","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63273,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰرِهُونَ","transliteration":"kārihūna","translation_bn":"বিমুখ","root":"كره","lemma":"كَٰرِهُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63274,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad ji''nākum bil-ḥaqi walākinna aktharakum lil''ḥaqqi kārihūna', 'আমি তো তোমাদের কাছে সত্য নিয়ে গিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু তোমাদের অধিকাংশই ছিলে সত্যকে অপছন্দকারী।', 'We had certainly brought you the truth, but most of you, to the truth, were averse.', 'আমি তো তোমাদের কাছে সত্য নিয়ে গিয়েছিলাম, কিন্তু তোমাদের অধিকাংশই ছিলে সত্যকে অপছন্দকারী।', 'We had certainly brought you the truth, but most of you, to the truth, were averse.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043078.mp3', now()),
  (43, 79, '', '[{"id":63707,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63708,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَبْرَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"abramū","translation_bn":"তারা সিদ্ধান্ত নিয়েছে","root":"برم","lemma":"أَبْرَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63709,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرًۭا","transliteration":"amran","translation_bn":"একটি বিষয়ে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63710,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّا","transliteration":"fa-innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তবে আমরাও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63711,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُبْرِمُونَ","transliteration":"mub''rimūna","translation_bn":"সিদ্ধান্ত গ্রহণকারী (তাদের ব্যাপারে)","root":"برم","lemma":"مُبْرِمُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63712,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am abramū amran fa-innā mub''rimūna', 'তারা কি (নিজেদের মধ্যে সলা-পরামর্শ করে কোন) চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্ত নিয়েছে? চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্ত তো আমিই নিয়ে থাকি (যাবতীয় ব্যাপারে আল্লাহ যা চান তাই শেষে ঘটে)।', 'Or have they devised [some] affair? But indeed, We are devising [a plan].', 'তারা কি (নিজেদের মধ্যে সলা-পরামর্শ করে কোন) চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্ত নিয়েছে? চূড়ান্ত সিদ্ধান্ত তো আমিই নিয়ে থাকি (যাবতীয় ব্যাপারে আল্লাহ যা চান তাই শেষে ঘটে)।', 'Or have they devised [some] affair? But indeed, We are devising [a plan].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043079.mp3', now()),
  (43, 80, '', '[{"id":64052,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"না কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64053,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْسَبُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥsabūna","translation_bn":"তারা মনে করেছে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64054,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّا","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"যে আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64055,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64056,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَسْمَعُ","transliteration":"nasmaʿu","translation_bn":"আমরা শুনি","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64057,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سِرَّهُمْ","transliteration":"sirrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের গোপন কথাবার্তা","root":"سرر","lemma":"سِرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64058,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَنَجْوَىٰهُم ۚ","transliteration":"wanajwāhum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের গোপন পরামর্শ","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجْوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64060,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰ","transliteration":"balā","translation_bn":"হ্যাঁ (সবই শুনি)","root":"—","lemma":"بَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":64061,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلُنَا","transliteration":"warusulunā","translation_bn":"এবং আমাদের ফেরেশতারা","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64062,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَدَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ladayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَدَي\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":64063,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَكْتُبُونَ","transliteration":"yaktubūna","translation_bn":"তারা লিখছে","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64064,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am yaḥsabūna annā lā nasmaʿu sirrahum wanajwāhum balā warusulunā ladayhim yaktubūna', 'তারা কি মনে করে যে, আমি তাদের গোপন কথা, গোপন পরামর্শ শুনি না? নিশ্চয়ই শুনি, আর আমার ফেরেশতারাহ তাদের কাছে থেকে লিখে নেয়।', 'Or do they think that We hear not their secrets and their private conversations? Yes, [We do], and Our messengers are with them recording.', 'তারা কি মনে করে যে, আমি তাদের গোপন কথা, গোপন পরামর্শ শুনি না? নিশ্চয়ই শুনি, আর আমার ফেরেশতারাহ তাদের কাছে থেকে লিখে নেয়।', 'Or do they think that We hear not their secrets and their private conversations? Yes, [We do], and Our messengers are with them recording.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043080.mp3', now()),
  (43, 81, '', '[{"id":64743,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64744,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":64745,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"থাকতো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64746,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"lilrraḥmāni","translation_bn":"দয়াময়ের জন্যে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64747,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدٌۭ","transliteration":"waladun","translation_bn":"কোনো ছেলে","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64748,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"fa-anā","translation_bn":"তবে আমি","root":"—","lemma":"فَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64749,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّلُ","transliteration":"awwalu","translation_bn":"প্রথম (হতাম)","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64750,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰبِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿābidīna","translation_bn":"উপাসকদের মধ্যে\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَابِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64751,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul in kāna lilrraḥmāni waladun fa-anā awwalu l-ʿābidīna', 'বল- দয়াময়ের কোন সন্তান থাকলে আমিই তার সর্বপ্রথম ‘ইবাদাতকারী হতাম।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "If the Most Merciful had a son, then I would be the first of [his] worshippers."', 'বল- দয়াময়ের কোন সন্তান থাকলে আমিই তার সর্বপ্রথম ‘ইবাদাতকারী হতাম।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "If the Most Merciful had a son, then I would be the first of [his] worshippers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043081.mp3', now()),
  (43, 82, '', '[{"id":64941,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","transliteration":"sub''ḥāna","translation_bn":"মহান পবিত্র","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64942,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64943,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64944,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64945,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64946,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَرْشِ","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","translation_bn":"আরশের","root":"عرش","lemma":"عَرْش","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64947,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"তা হ''তে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64948,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَصِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣifūna","translation_bn":"তারা আরোপ করে","root":"وصف","lemma":"يَصِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64949,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sub''ḥāna rabbi l-samāwāti wal-arḍi rabbi l-ʿarshi ʿammā yaṣifūna', 'তারা যা (তাঁর প্রতি) আরোপ করে তা হতে আকাশ ও পৃথিবীর প্রতিপালক ‘আরশের পালনকর্তা মহান, পবিত্র।', 'Exalted is the Lord of the heavens and the earth, Lord of the Throne, above what they describe.', 'তারা যা (তাঁর প্রতি) আরোপ করে তা হতে আকাশ ও পৃথিবীর প্রতিপালক ‘আরশের পালনকর্তা মহান, পবিত্র।', 'Exalted is the Lord of the heavens and the earth, Lord of the Throne, above what they describe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043082.mp3', now()),
  (43, 83, '', '[{"id":65594,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَذَرْهُمْ","transliteration":"fadharhum","translation_bn":"সুতরাং ছেড়ে দাও তাদেরকে","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65595,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَخُوضُوا۟","transliteration":"yakhūḍū","translation_bn":"বাকবিতন্ডা করতে","root":"خوض","lemma":"خَاضُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65596,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَيَلْعَبُوا۟","transliteration":"wayalʿabū","translation_bn":"ও ক্রীড়া-কৌতুক করতে","root":"لعب","lemma":"يَلْعَبْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65597,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65598,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُلَـٰقُوا۟","transliteration":"yulāqū","translation_bn":"তারা সাক্ষাত পায়","root":"لقي","lemma":"يُلَٰقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65599,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَهُمُ","transliteration":"yawmahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65600,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65601,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُوعَدُونَ","transliteration":"yūʿadūna","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতিশ্রুতি দেয়া হচ্ছে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65602,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fadharhum yakhūḍū wayalʿabū ḥattā yulāqū yawmahumu alladhī yūʿadūna', 'কাজেই তাদেরকে বাক-চতুরতা ও ক্রীড়া-কৌতুক করতে দাও সে দিনের সাক্ষাৎ পর্যন্ত যে দিনের ও‘য়াদা তাদেরকে দেয়া হয়েছে।', 'So leave them to converse vainly and amuse themselves until they meet their Day which they are promised.', 'কাজেই তাদেরকে বাক-চতুরতা ও ক্রীড়া-কৌতুক করতে দাও সে দিনের সাক্ষাৎ পর্যন্ত যে দিনের ও‘য়াদা তাদেরকে দেয়া হয়েছে।', 'So leave them to converse vainly and amuse themselves until they meet their Day which they are promised.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043083.mp3', now()),
  (43, 84, '', '[{"id":65656,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65657,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65658,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছেন","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65659,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65660,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65661,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَفِى","transliteration":"wafī","translation_bn":"এবং আছেন","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65662,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীতেও","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65663,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65665,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65666,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানী","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65667,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65668,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī fī l-samāi ilāhun wafī l-arḍi ilāhun wahuwa l-ḥakīmu l-ʿalīmu', 'আকাশমন্ডলে তিনিই ইলাহ, যমীনে তিনিই ইলাহ, তিনি মহাবিজ্ঞ, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And it is Allah who is [the only] deity in the heaven, and on the earth [the only] deity. And He is the Wise, the Knowing.', 'আকাশমন্ডলে তিনিই ইলাহ, যমীনে তিনিই ইলাহ, তিনি মহাবিজ্ঞ, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And it is Allah who is [the only] deity in the heaven, and on the earth [the only] deity. And He is the Wise, the Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043084.mp3', now()),
  (43, 85, '', '[{"id":66270,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَبَارَكَ","transliteration":"watabāraka","translation_bn":"এবং মহান তিনি","root":"برك","lemma":"تَبَارَكَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66271,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি (এমন সত্ত্বা যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66272,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66273,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُلْكُ","transliteration":"mul''ku","translation_bn":"সার্বভৌমত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66274,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66275,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66276,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66277,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمَا","transliteration":"baynahumā","translation_bn":"তাদের উভয়ের মাঝে আছে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":66278,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَعِندَهُۥ","transliteration":"waʿindahu","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁরই কাছে আছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66279,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمُ","transliteration":"ʿil''mu","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66280,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66281,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"এবং তাঁরই দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66282,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে ফিরে যেতে হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66283,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watabāraka alladhī lahu mul''ku l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wamā baynahumā waʿindahu ʿil''mu l-sāʿati wa-ilayhi tur''jaʿūna', 'অতি মহান ও পবিত্র তিনি, আকাশ, পৃথিবী ও এ দু’য়ের মাঝে যা আছে তার একচ্ছত্র কর্তৃত্ব যাঁর হাতে, ক্বিয়ামতের জ্ঞান তাঁর কাছেই আছে (যে তা কখন ঘটবে), আর তোমাদেরকে তাঁর কাছেই ফিরে যেতে হবে।', 'And blessed is He to whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them and with whom is knowledge of the Hour and to whom you will be returned.', 'অতি মহান ও পবিত্র তিনি, আকাশ, পৃথিবী ও এ দু’য়ের মাঝে যা আছে তার একচ্ছত্র কর্তৃত্ব যাঁর হাতে, ক্বিয়ামতের জ্ঞান তাঁর কাছেই আছে (যে তা কখন ঘটবে), আর তোমাদেরকে তাঁর কাছেই ফিরে যেতে হবে।', 'And blessed is He to whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them and with whom is knowledge of the Hour and to whom you will be returned.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043085.mp3', now()),
  (43, 86, '', '[{"id":66412,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66413,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَمْلِكُ","transliteration":"yamliku","translation_bn":"ক্ষমতা রাখে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66414,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66415,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66416,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66417,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তাঁকে ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66418,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةَ","transliteration":"l-shafāʿata","translation_bn":"সুপারিশের","root":"شفع","lemma":"شَفَٰعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66419,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":66420,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66421,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَهِدَ","transliteration":"shahida","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দেয়","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66422,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66423,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"তারা যখন","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66424,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানেও","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66425,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yamliku alladhīna yadʿūna min dūnihi l-shafāʿata illā man shahida bil-ḥaqi wahum yaʿlamūna', 'আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে যাদেরকে তারা ডাকে তারা সুপারিশের অধিকারী নয়, তবে যে জ্ঞানের ভিত্তিতে সত্যের সাক্ষ্য দেয় সে ছাড়া।', 'And those they invoke besides Him do not possess [power of] intercession; but only those who testify to the truth [can benefit], and they know.', 'আল্লাহর পরিবর্তে যাদেরকে তারা ডাকে তারা সুপারিশের অধিকারী নয়, তবে যে জ্ঞানের ভিত্তিতে সত্যের সাক্ষ্য দেয় সে ছাড়া।', 'And those they invoke besides Him do not possess [power of] intercession; but only those who testify to the truth [can benefit], and they know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043086.mp3', now()),
  (43, 87, '', '[{"id":66985,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66986,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَأَلْتَهُم","transliteration":"sa-altahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে তুমি জিজ্ঞেস করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66987,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66988,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَهُمْ","transliteration":"khalaqahum","translation_bn":"তাদের সৃষ্টি করেছে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66989,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَيَقُولُنَّ","transliteration":"layaqūlunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":66990,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহ\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66992,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"fa-annā","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে কোথায়","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66993,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْفَكُونَ","transliteration":"yu''fakūna","translation_bn":"তাদের ফিরানো হচ্ছে","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66994,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wala-in sa-altahum man khalaqahum layaqūlunna l-lahu fa-annā yu''fakūna', 'তুমি যদি তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর- তাদেরকে কে সৃষ্টি করেছে, তাহলে তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলবে, আল্লাহ। অত:পর তারা কোথায় ফিরে যাচ্ছে?', 'And if you asked them who created them, they would surely say, "Allah." So how are they deluded?', 'তুমি যদি তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস কর- তাদেরকে কে সৃষ্টি করেছে, তাহলে তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই বলবে, আল্লাহ। অত:পর তারা কোথায় ফিরে যাচ্ছে?', 'And if you asked them who created them, they would surely say, "Allah." So how are they deluded?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043087.mp3', now()),
  (43, 88, '', '[{"id":67430,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقِيلِهِۦ","transliteration":"waqīlihi","translation_bn":"শপথ তার (অর্থাৎ নাবীর) কথার","root":"قول","lemma":"قِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67431,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰرَبِّ","transliteration":"yārabbi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":67432,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":67433,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"এসব","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67434,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67435,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67436,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে\"","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67437,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqīlihi yārabbi inna hāulāi qawmun lā yu''minūna', 'রসূলের এ উক্তির শপথঃ ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! এ জাতির লোকেরা ঈমান আনবে না।’', 'And [Allah acknowledges] his saying, "O my Lord, indeed these are a people who do not believe."', 'রসূলের এ উক্তির শপথঃ ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! এ জাতির লোকেরা ঈমান আনবে না।’', 'And [Allah acknowledges] his saying, "O my Lord, indeed these are a people who do not believe."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043088.mp3', now()),
  (43, 89, '', '[{"id":67852,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْفَحْ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''faḥ","translation_bn":"সুতরাং উপেক্ষা করো","root":"صفح","lemma":"يَصْفَحُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67853,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67854,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلْ","transliteration":"waqul","translation_bn":"এবং বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67855,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"salāmun","translation_bn":"\"সালাম\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67857,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67858,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানতে পারবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67859,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iṣ''faḥ ʿanhum waqul salāmun fasawfa yaʿlamūna', 'কাজেই তুমি তাদের থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও আর বল- (তোমাদের প্রতি) সালাম। শীঘ্রই তারা জানতে পারবে (তাদের আচরণের পরিণতি কী)।', 'So turn aside from them and say, "Peace." But they are going to know.', 'কাজেই তুমি তাদের থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও আর বল- (তোমাদের প্রতি) সালাম। শীঘ্রই তারা জানতে পারবে (তাদের আচরণের পরিণতি কী)।', 'So turn aside from them and say, "Peace." But they are going to know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/043089.mp3', now())
