dhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":7347,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سِحْرٌۭ","transliteration":"siḥ''run","translation_bn":"জাদু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7348,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7349,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā tut''lā ʿalayhim āyātunā bayyinātin qāla alladhīna kafarū lil''ḥaqqi lammā jāahum hādhā siḥ''run mubīnun', 'তাদের কাছে যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াত আবৃত্তি করা হয় আর সত্য যখন তাদের কাছে উপস্থিত হয়, তখন কাফিররা বলে- এটাতো প্রকাশ্য যাদু।', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who disbelieve say of the truth when it has come to them, "This is obvious magic."', 'তাদের কাছে যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াত আবৃত্তি করা হয় আর সত্য যখন তাদের কাছে উপস্থিত হয়, তখন কাফিররা বলে- এটাতো প্রকাশ্য যাদু।', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who disbelieve say of the truth when it has come to them, "This is obvious magic."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046007.mp3', now()),
  (46, 8, '', '[{"id":8615,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8616,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8617,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۖ","transliteration":"if''tarāhu","translation_bn":"\"সে তা রচনা করেছে\"","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8619,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8620,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنِ","transliteration":"ini","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":8621,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَيْتُهُۥ","transliteration":"if''taraytuhu","translation_bn":"তা আমি রচনা করে থাকি","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8622,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"না তবে","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8623,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَمْلِكُونَ","transliteration":"tamlikūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা সক্ষম","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8624,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমাকে (রক্ষা করতে)","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8625,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8626,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":8627,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا ۖ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","l