,"lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17078,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"تَرْضَىٰهُ","transliteration":"tarḍāhu","translation_bn":"যা পছন্দ কর তুমি","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17079,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْلِحْ","transliteration":"wa-aṣliḥ","translation_bn":"এবং যোগ্যতা সৃষ্টি করে দাও","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17080,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"لِى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"আমার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17081,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17082,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّتِىٓ ۖ","transliteration":"dhurriyyatī","translation_bn":"আমার সন্তানদের","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17084,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":17085,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"تُبْتُ","transliteration":"tub''tu","translation_bn":"তওবা করছি","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17086,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17087,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنِّى","transliteration":"wa-innī","translation_bn":"এবং আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17088,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17089,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-mus''limīna","translation_bn":"আত্মসমর্পণকারীদের\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17090,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wawaṣṣaynā l-insāna biwālidayhi iḥ''sānan ḥamalathu ummuhu kur''han wawaḍaʿathu kur''han waḥamluhu wafiṣāluhu thalāthūna shahran ḥattā idhā balagha ashuddahu wabalagha arbaʿīna sanatan qāla rabbi awziʿ''nī an ashkura niʿ''mataka allatī anʿamta ʿalayya waʿalā wālidayya wa-an aʿmala ṣāliḥan tarḍāhu wa-aṣliḥ lī fī dhurriyyatī innī tub''tu ilayka wa-innī mina l-mus''limīna', 'আমি মানুষকে নির্দেশ দিয়েছি তার পিতামাতার প্রতি সদয় আচরণের। তার মা তাকে বহন করেছে কষ্টের সাথে, আর তাকে প্রসব করেছে কষ্টের সাথে। তাকে গর্ভে ধারণ ও দুধপান ছাড়ানোয় সময় লাগে ত্রিশ মাস। অবশেষে সে যখন পূর্ণ শক্তি লাভ করে এবং চল্লিশ বছরে পৌঁছে যায়, তখন সে বলে, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাকে আর আমার পিতা-মাতাকে যে নি‘মাত দান করেছ তজ্জন্য কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করার শক্তি আমাকে দান কর, আর আমাকে এমন সৎকর্ম করার সামর্থ দাও যাতে তুমি সন্তুষ্ট হও, আমার সন্তানদেরকে সৎকর্মপরায়ণ ক’রে আমার প্রতি অনুগ্রহ কর, আমি অনুশোচনাভরে তোমার দিকে ফিরে আসছি, আর আমি অনুগত বান্দাহদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And We have enjoined upon man, to his parents, good treatment. His mother carried him with hardship and gave birth to him with hardship, and his gestation and weaning [period] is thirty months. [He grows] until, when he reaches maturity and reaches [the age of] forty years, he says, "My Lord, enable me to be grateful for Your favor which You have bestowed upon me and upon my parents and to work righteousness of which You will approve and make righteous for me my offspring. Indeed, I have repented to You, and indeed, I am of the Muslims."', 'আমি মানুষকে নির্দেশ দিয়েছি তার পিতামাতার প্রতি সদয় আচরণের। তার মা তাকে বহন করেছে কষ্টের সাথে, আর তাকে প্রসব করেছে কষ্টের সাথে। তাকে গর্ভে ধারণ ও দুধপান ছাড়ানোয় সময় লাগে ত্রিশ মাস। অবশেষে সে যখন পূর্ণ শক্তি লাভ করে এবং চল্লিশ বছরে পৌঁছে যায়, তখন সে বলে, ‘হে আমার প্রতিপালক! তুমি আমাকে আর আমার পিতা-মাতাকে যে নি‘মাত দান করেছ তজ্জন্য কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করার শক্তি আমাকে দান কর, আর আমাকে এমন সৎকর্ম করার সামর্থ দাও যাতে তুমি সন্তুষ্ট হও, আমার সন্তানদেরকে সৎকর্মপরায়ণ ক’রে আমার প্রতি অনুগ্রহ কর, আমি অনুশোচনাভরে তোমার দিকে ফিরে আসছি, আর আমি অনুগত বান্দাহদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And We have enjoined upon man, to his parents, good treatment. His mother carried him with hardship and gave birth to him with hardship, and his gestation and weaning [period] is thirty months. [He grows] until, when he reaches maturity and reaches [the age of] forty years, he says, "My Lord, enable me to be grateful for Your favor which You have bestowed upon me and upon my parents and to work righteousness of which You will approve and make righteous for me my offspring. Indeed, I have repented to You, and indeed, I am of the Muslims."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046015.mp3', now()),
  (46, 16, '', '[{"id":18127,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":18128,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18129,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَتَقَبَّلُ","transliteration":"nataqabbalu","translation_bn":"আমরা গ্রহণ করি","root":"قبل","lemma":"تَقَبَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18130,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18131,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنَ","transliteration":"aḥsana","translation_bn":"সর্বোত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18132,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18133,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18134,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَنَتَجَاوَزُ","transliteration":"wanatajāwazu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা মার্জনা করি","root":"جوز","lemma":"نَتَجَاوَزُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18135,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18136,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","transliteration":"sayyiātihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মন্দকাজগুলোকে","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18137,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18138,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبِ","transliteration":"aṣḥābi","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদের","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18139,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18141,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَ","transliteration":"waʿda","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18142,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصِّدْقِ","transliteration":"l-ṣid''qi","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"صدق","lemma":"صِدْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18143,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18144,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"দেওয়া হয়েছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18145,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يُوعَدُونَ","transliteration":"yūʿadūna","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18146,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika alladhīna nataqabbalu ʿanhum aḥsana mā ʿamilū wanatajāwazu ʿan sayyiātihim fī aṣḥābi l-janati waʿda l-ṣid''qi alladhī kānū yūʿadūna', 'এই লোকদের হতে আমি তাদের সর্বোত্তম ‘আমালগুলো গ্রহণ করি আর তাদের মন্দ কাজগুলো ক্ষমা করে দেই, তারা জান্নাতবাসীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত। তাদেরকে যে ও‘য়াদা দেয়া হয়েছে তা সত্য ও‘য়াদা।', 'Those are the ones from whom We will accept the best of what they did and overlook their misdeeds, [their being] among the companions of Paradise. [That is] the promise of truth which they had been promised.', 'এই লোকদের হতে আমি তাদের সর্বোত্তম ‘আমালগুলো গ্রহণ করি আর তাদের মন্দ কাজগুলো ক্ষমা করে দেই, তারা জান্নাতবাসীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত। তাদেরকে যে ও‘য়াদা দেয়া হয়েছে তা সত্য ও‘য়াদা।', 'Those are the ones from whom We will accept the best of what they did and overlook their misdeeds, [their being] among the companions of Paradise. [That is] the promise of truth which they had been promised.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046016.mp3', now()),
  (46, 17, '', '[{"id":19168,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19169,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19170,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","transliteration":"liwālidayhi","translation_bn":"তার পিতামাতাকে","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَٰلِدَي","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19171,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُفٍّۢ","transliteration":"uffin","translation_bn":"\"ধিক (আফসোস)","root":"افف","lemma":"أُفّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19172,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمَآ","transliteration":"lakumā","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দু''জনের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمَآ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19173,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَتَعِدَانِنِىٓ","transliteration":"ataʿidāninī","translation_bn":"আমাকে কি তোমরা ভয় দেখাচ্ছ","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":19174,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":19175,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُخْرَجَ","transliteration":"ukh''raja","translation_bn":"আমাকে বের করে আনা হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19176,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"অথচ নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19177,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَلَتِ","transliteration":"khalati","translation_bn":"অতীত হয়েছে","root":"خلو","lemma":"خَلَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19178,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرُونُ","transliteration":"l-qurūnu","translation_bn":"বহু জনগোষ্ঠী","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19179,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"\"","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19180,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِى","transliteration":"qablī","translation_bn":"আমার পূর্বে\"","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19181,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمَا","transliteration":"wahumā","translation_bn":"এবং তারা দু''জন","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19182,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَغِيثَانِ","transliteration":"yastaghīthāni","translation_bn":"ফরিয়াদ করে","root":"غوث","lemma":"ٱسْتَغَٰثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19183,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর কাছে (এবং বলে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19184,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَيْلَكَ","transliteration":"waylaka","translation_bn":"\"তোমার জন্যে দুর্ভোগ","root":"—","lemma":"وَيْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19185,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنْ","transliteration":"āmin","translation_bn":"ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19186,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":19187,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَ","transliteration":"waʿda","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19188,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19189,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"حَقٌّۭ","transliteration":"ḥaqqun","translation_bn":"সত্য\"","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19190,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19191,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":19192,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَآ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":19193,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":19194,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَسَـٰطِيرُ","transliteration":"asāṭīru","translation_bn":"উপকথা সমূহ","root":"سطر","lemma":"أَسَٰطِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19195,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"l-awalīna","translation_bn":"পুরাতনকালের লোকদের\"","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19196,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhī qāla liwālidayhi uffin lakumā ataʿidāninī an ukh''raja waqad khalati l-qurūnu min qablī wahumā yastaghīthāni l-laha waylaka āmin inna waʿda l-lahi ḥaqqun fayaqūlu mā hādhā illā asāṭīru l-awalīna', 'আর যে নিজ পিতামাতাকে বলে, ‘তোমাদের জন্য আফসোস! তোমরা কি আমাকে ভয় দেখাও যে, (মৃতুর পর) আমাকে উঠানো হবে অথচ আমার পূর্বে বহু মানব গোষ্ঠী অতীত হয়ে গেছে (কই, কেউ তো উঠে আসল না)। বাপ-মা আল্লাহর কাছে প্রার্থনা জানিয়ে (সন্তানকে তিরস্কার করে) বলে- দুর্ভোগ তোমার জন্য, তুমি ঈমান আন, আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য।’ তখন সে বলে- ‘এ সব পুরান কালের কাহিনী ছাড়া আর কিছুই না।’', 'But one who says to his parents, "Uff to you; do you promise me that I will be brought forth [from the earth] when generations before me have already passed on [into oblivion]?" while they call to Allah for help [and to their son], "Woe to you! Believe! Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth." But he says, "This is not but legends of the former people" -', 'আর যে নিজ পিতামাতাকে বলে, ‘তোমাদের জন্য আফসোস! তোমরা কি আমাকে ভয় দেখাও যে, (মৃতুর পর) আমাকে উঠানো হবে অথচ আমার পূর্বে বহু মানব গোষ্ঠী অতীত হয়ে গেছে (কই, কেউ তো উঠে আসল না)। বাপ-মা আল্লাহর কাছে প্রার্থনা জানিয়ে (সন্তানকে তিরস্কার করে) বলে- দুর্ভোগ তোমার জন্য, তুমি ঈমান আন, আল্লাহর ও‘য়াদা সত্য।’ তখন সে বলে- ‘এ সব পুরান কালের কাহিনী ছাড়া আর কিছুই না।’', 'But one who says to his parents, "Uff to you; do you promise me that I will be brought forth [from the earth] when generations before me have already passed on [into oblivion]?" while they call to Allah for help [and to their son], "Woe to you! Believe! Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth." But he says, "This is not but legends of the former people" -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046017.mp3', now()),
  (46, 18, '', '[{"id":20269,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":20270,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":20271,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","translation_bn":"অবধারিত হয়েছে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20272,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمُ","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20273,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","transliteration":"l-qawlu","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহর) বাণী","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20274,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(তারা হবে) অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20275,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُمَمٍۢ","transliteration":"umamin","translation_bn":"(শাস্তিপ্রাপ্ত) সম্প্রদায়গুলোর","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20276,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":20277,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَلَتْ","transliteration":"khalat","translation_bn":"(যারা) অতীত হয়েছে","root":"خلو","lemma":"خَلَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20278,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20279,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِم","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20280,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20281,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنِّ","transliteration":"l-jini","translation_bn":"জিন","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20282,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِنسِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-insi","translation_bn":"ও মানুষের","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20284,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"তারা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20285,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20286,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰسِرِينَ","transliteration":"khāsirīna","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَٰسِرِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20287,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika alladhīna ḥaqqa ʿalayhimu l-qawlu fī umamin qad khalat min qablihim mina l-jini wal-insi innahum kānū khāsirīna', 'এরা হল তারাই যাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর ‘আযাবের সিদ্ধান্ত হয়ে গেছে, তাদের মত জ্বিন ও মানুষের মধ্যে হতে যারা তাদের পূর্বে গত হয়ে গেছে। এরা চরমভাবে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Those are the ones upon whom the word has come into effect, [who will be] among nations which had passed on before them of jinn and men. Indeed, they [all] were losers.', 'এরা হল তারাই যাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর ‘আযাবের সিদ্ধান্ত হয়ে গেছে, তাদের মত জ্বিন ও মানুষের মধ্যে হতে যারা তাদের পূর্বে গত হয়ে গেছে। এরা চরমভাবে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Those are the ones upon whom the word has come into effect, [who will be] among nations which had passed on before them of jinn and men. Indeed, they [all] were losers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046018.mp3', now()),
  (46, 19, '', '[{"id":21376,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِكُلٍّۢ","transliteration":"walikullin","translation_bn":"এবং প্রত্যেকের জন্যে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21377,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٌۭ","transliteration":"darajātun","translation_bn":"মর্যাদা (রয়েছে)","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21378,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21379,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21381,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُوَفِّيَهُمْ","transliteration":"waliyuwaffiyahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে যেন পূর্ণ দেন","root":"وفي","lemma":"وَفَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21382,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাজের (প্রতিফল)","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21383,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের (উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21384,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":21385,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُظْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yuẓ''lamūna","translation_bn":"অবিচার করা হবে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21386,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walikullin darajātun mimmā ʿamilū waliyuwaffiyahum aʿmālahum wahum lā yuẓ''lamūna', 'প্রত্যেকের জন্য মর্যাদা আছে তার কৃতকর্ম অনুসারে, যেন আল্লাহ তাদের কর্মের পুরোপুরি প্রতিফল দেন। তাদের উপর কক্ষনো যুলম করা হবে না।', 'And for all there are degrees [of reward and punishment] for what they have done, and [it is] so that He may fully compensate them for their deeds, and they will not be wronged.', 'প্রত্যেকের জন্য মর্যাদা আছে তার কৃতকর্ম অনুসারে, যেন আল্লাহ তাদের কর্মের পুরোপুরি প্রতিফল দেন। তাদের উপর কক্ষনো যুলম করা হবে না।', 'And for all there are degrees [of reward and punishment] for what they have done, and [it is] so that He may fully compensate them for their deeds, and they will not be wronged.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046019.mp3', now()),
  (46, 20, '', '[{"id":22416,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22417,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُعْرَضُ","transliteration":"yuʿ''raḍu","translation_bn":"উপস্থিত করা হবে","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22418,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":22419,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিল","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22420,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22421,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের (বলা হবে)","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22422,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَذْهَبْتُمْ","transliteration":"adhhabtum","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা নিঃশেষ করেছ","root":"ذهب","lemma":"أَذْهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22423,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبَـٰتِكُمْ","transliteration":"ṭayyibātikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সুখ-সুবিধাগুলোকে","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّبَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22424,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22425,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَيَاتِكُمُ","transliteration":"ḥayātikumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22426,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22427,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَمْتَعْتُم","transliteration":"wa-is''tamtaʿtum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভোগ করেছ","root":"متع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمْتَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22428,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তার দ্বারা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22429,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"fal-yawma","translation_bn":"অতএব আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22430,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"tuj''zawna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতিফল দেওয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22431,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22432,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُونِ","transliteration":"l-hūni","translation_bn":"অপমানের","root":"هون","lemma":"هُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22433,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22434,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা করছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22435,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","transliteration":"tastakbirūna","translation_bn":"অহংকার","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22436,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22437,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22438,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22439,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"অধিকার","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22440,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَبِمَا","transliteration":"wabimā","translation_bn":"এবং এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22441,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা করছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22442,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تَفْسُقُونَ","transliteration":"tafsuqūna","translation_bn":"পাপাচার\"","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَسَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22443,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yuʿ''raḍu alladhīna kafarū ʿalā l-nāri adhhabtum ṭayyibātikum fī ḥayātikumu l-dun''yā wa-is''tamtaʿtum bihā fal-yawma tuj''zawna ʿadhāba l-hūni bimā kuntum tastakbirūna fī l-arḍi bighayri l-ḥaqi wabimā kuntum tafsuqūna', 'যেদিন কাফিরদেরকে জাহান্নামের সামনে হাজির করা হবে, (তাদেরকে বলা হবে)- ‘তোমরা তোমাদের পার্থিব জীবনেই তোমাদের অংশের নি‘মাতগুলো নিঃশেষ করেছ আর তা ভোগ করেছ। কাজেই আজ তোমাদেরকে অপমানজনক শাস্তি দ্বারা প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে, কেননা তোমরা দুনিয়াতে অন্যায়ভাবে অহঙ্কার করেছিলে আর না-ফরমানী করেছিলে।', 'And the Day those who disbelieved are exposed to the Fire [it will be said], "You exhausted your pleasures during your worldly life and enjoyed them, so this Day you will be awarded the punishment of [extreme] humiliation because you were arrogant upon the earth without right and because you were defiantly disobedient."', 'যেদিন কাফিরদেরকে জাহান্নামের সামনে হাজির করা হবে, (তাদেরকে বলা হবে)- ‘তোমরা তোমাদের পার্থিব জীবনেই তোমাদের অংশের নি‘মাতগুলো নিঃশেষ করেছ আর তা ভোগ করেছ। কাজেই আজ তোমাদেরকে অপমানজনক শাস্তি দ্বারা প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে, কেননা তোমরা দুনিয়াতে অন্যায়ভাবে অহঙ্কার করেছিলে আর না-ফরমানী করেছিলে।', 'And the Day those who disbelieved are exposed to the Fire [it will be said], "You exhausted your pleasures during your worldly life and enjoyed them, so this Day you will be awarded the punishment of [extreme] humiliation because you were arrogant upon the earth without right and because you were defiantly disobedient."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046020.mp3', now()),
  (46, 21, '', '[{"id":23559,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَٱذْكُرْ","transliteration":"wa-udh''kur","translation_bn":"এবং স্মরণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23560,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَخَا","transliteration":"akhā","translation_bn":"ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23561,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَادٍ","transliteration":"ʿādin","translation_bn":"আ''দের (অর্থাৎ হুদের কথা)","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23562,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":23563,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنذَرَ","transliteration":"andhara","translation_bn":"সে সতর্ক করেছিল","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23564,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَهُۥ","transliteration":"qawmahu","translation_bn":"তার জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23565,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْأَحْقَافِ","transliteration":"bil-aḥqāfi","translation_bn":"আহকাফ (উপত্যকায়)","root":"حقف","lemma":"أَحْقَاف","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23566,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23567,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَلَتِ","transliteration":"khalati","translation_bn":"অতীত হয়েছে","root":"خلو","lemma":"خَلَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23568,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّذُرُ","transliteration":"l-nudhuru","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারীরা","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23569,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23570,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِ","transliteration":"bayni","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23571,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَدَيْهِ","transliteration":"yadayhi","translation_bn":"তার নিকট অতীতেও","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23572,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23573,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَلْفِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"khalfihi","translation_bn":"তার পরেও (এই বলে)","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23574,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"\"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":23575,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَعْبُدُوٓا۟","transliteration":"taʿbudū","translation_bn":"তোমরা এবাদত করো (অন্য কারো)","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23576,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":23577,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23578,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"আমি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":23579,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"ভয় করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23580,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23581,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23582,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٍ","transliteration":"yawmin","translation_bn":"(এমন এক) দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23583,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","translation_bn":"(যা) বড় কঠিন\"","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":23584,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-udh''kur akhā ʿādin idh andhara qawmahu bil-aḥqāfi waqad khalati l-nudhuru min bayni yadayhi wamin khalfihi allā taʿbudū illā l-laha innī akhāfu ʿalaykum ʿadhāba yawmin ʿaẓīmin', 'স্মরণ কর ‘আদ জাতির ভ্রাতার (হূদ) কথা। সে তার আহকাফবাসী সম্প্রদায়কে সতর্ক করেছিল। (এ ধরনের) সতর্ককারীরা তার পূর্বেও এসেছিল আর তার পরেও এসেছিল (যারা বলেছিল) যে, ‘তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া কারো ‘ইবাদাত করো না। আমি তোমাদের উপর এক ভয়াবহ দিনের ‘আযাবের আশঙ্কা করছি।’', 'And mention, [O Muhammad], the brother of ''Aad, when he warned his people in the [region of] al-Ahqaf - and warners had already passed on before him and after him - [saying], "Do not worship except Allah. Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a terrible day."', 'স্মরণ কর ‘আদ জাতির ভ্রাতার (হূদ) কথা। সে তার আহকাফবাসী সম্প্রদায়কে সতর্ক করেছিল। (এ ধরনের) সতর্ককারীরা তার পূর্বেও এসেছিল আর তার পরেও এসেছিল (যারা বলেছিল) যে, ‘তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া কারো ‘ইবাদাত করো না। আমি তোমাদের উপর এক ভয়াবহ দিনের ‘আযাবের আশঙ্কা করছি।’', 'And mention, [O Muhammad], the brother of ''Aad, when he warned his people in the [region of] al-Ahqaf - and warners had already passed on before him and after him - [saying], "Do not worship except Allah. Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a terrible day."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046021.mp3', now()),
  (46, 22, '', '[{"id":24589,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24590,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَجِئْتَنَا","transliteration":"aji''tanā","translation_bn":"\"তুমি আমাদের কাছে এসেছ কি","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":24591,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِتَأْفِكَنَا","transliteration":"litafikanā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে ফিরাবে তুমি","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24592,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24593,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَتِنَا","transliteration":"ālihatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপাস্যগুলো","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24594,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأْتِنَا","transliteration":"fatinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে আন তাহলে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24595,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয় নিয়ে যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24596,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَعِدُنَآ","transliteration":"taʿidunā","translation_bn":"তুমি আমাদেরকে ভয় দেখাচ্ছ","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24597,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":24598,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24599,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24600,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদীদের\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24601,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū aji''tanā litafikanā ʿan ālihatinā fatinā bimā taʿidunā in kunta mina l-ṣādiqīna', 'লোকেরা বলেছিল- ‘তুমি কি আমাদেরকে আমাদের উপাস্যগুলো হতে সরিয়ে নেয়ার জন্য আমাদের কাছে এসেছ। কাজেই তুমি আমাদেরকে যে শাস্তির ভয় দেখাচ্ছ তা নিয়ে এসো আমাদের কাছে যদি তুমি সত্যবাদী হও।’', 'They said, "Have you come to delude us away from our gods? Then bring us what you promise us, if you should be of the truthful."', 'লোকেরা বলেছিল- ‘তুমি কি আমাদেরকে আমাদের উপাস্যগুলো হতে সরিয়ে নেয়ার জন্য আমাদের কাছে এসেছ। কাজেই তুমি আমাদেরকে যে শাস্তির ভয় দেখাচ্ছ তা নিয়ে এসো আমাদের কাছে যদি তুমি সত্যবাদী হও।’', 'They said, "Have you come to delude us away from our gods? Then bring us what you promise us, if you should be of the truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046022.mp3', now()),
  (46, 23, '', '[{"id":25671,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25672,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":25673,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''mu","translation_bn":"এ জ্ঞান (আছে)","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25674,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"(শুধুমাত্র) নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":25675,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25676,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأُبَلِّغُكُم","transliteration":"wa-uballighukum","translation_bn":"এবং আমি তোমাদের পৌঁছাই","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَّغْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25677,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"সেই (পয়গাম)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":25678,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُرْسِلْتُ","transliteration":"ur''sil''tu","translation_bn":"আমি প্রেরিত হয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25679,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"যা নিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25680,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"walākinnī","translation_bn":"কিন্তু আমি","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25681,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَرَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"arākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে দেখছি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25682,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"(এমন) লোক","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25683,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَجْهَلُونَ","transliteration":"tajhalūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) মূর্খতা করছ\"","root":"جهل","lemma":"يَجْهَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25684,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla innamā l-ʿil''mu ʿinda l-lahi wa-uballighukum mā ur''sil''tu bihi walākinnī arākum qawman tajhalūna', 'সে বলল (‘আযাব কখন আসবে না আসবে) ‘সে বিষয়ের জ্ঞান তো আল্লাহর নিকট আছে। আমি যা নিয়ে প্রেরিত হয়েছি তাই শুধু তোমাদের কাছে পৌঁছে দিচ্ছি। কিন্তু আমি দেখছি তোমরা এমন এক জাতি যারা মূর্খের আচরণ করছে।', 'He said, "Knowledge [of its time] is only with Allah, and I convey to you that with which I was sent; but I see you [to be] a people behaving ignorantly."', 'সে বলল (‘আযাব কখন আসবে না আসবে) ‘সে বিষয়ের জ্ঞান তো আল্লাহর নিকট আছে। আমি যা নিয়ে প্রেরিত হয়েছি তাই শুধু তোমাদের কাছে পৌঁছে দিচ্ছি। কিন্তু আমি দেখছি তোমরা এমন এক জাতি যারা মূর্খের আচরণ করছে।', 'He said, "Knowledge [of its time] is only with Allah, and I convey to you that with which I was sent; but I see you [to be] a people behaving ignorantly."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046023.mp3', now()),
  (46, 24, '', '[{"id":26740,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26741,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَأَوْهُ","transliteration":"ra-awhu","translation_bn":"তারা তা দেখলো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26742,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَارِضًۭا","transliteration":"ʿāriḍan","translation_bn":"মেঘমালারূপে","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَارِض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26743,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقْبِلَ","transliteration":"mus''taqbila","translation_bn":"আগ্রসরমান","root":"قبل","lemma":"مُّسْتَقْبِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26744,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَوْدِيَتِهِمْ","transliteration":"awdiyatihim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপত্যকাগুলোর (দিকে)","root":"ودي","lemma":"أَوْدِيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26745,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26746,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":26747,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَارِضٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿāriḍun","translation_bn":"মেঘমালা","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَارِض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26748,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّمْطِرُنَا ۚ","transliteration":"mum''ṭirunā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে বৃষ্টি দিবে\"","root":"مطر","lemma":"مُّمْطِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26750,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং না","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":26751,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সেই (জিনিস)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":26752,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":26753,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَعْجَلْتُم","transliteration":"is''taʿjaltum","translation_bn":"তোমরা তাড়াতাড়ি চেয়েছিলে","root":"عجل","lemma":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26754,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26756,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رِيحٌۭ","transliteration":"rīḥun","translation_bn":"(এটা) ঝড়ো বাতাস","root":"روح","lemma":"رِيح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26757,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26758,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26759,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"বড় যন্ত্রণাদায়ক","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":26760,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā ra-awhu ʿāriḍan mus''taqbila awdiyatihim qālū hādhā ʿāriḍun mum''ṭirunā bal huwa mā is''taʿjaltum bihi rīḥun fīhā ʿadhābun alīmun', 'অতঃপর তারা যখন তাদের উপত্যকার দিকে মেঘ আসতে দেখল তখন তারা বলল- ‘এ তো মেঘ, আমাদেরকে বৃষ্টি দিবে।’ না, তা হল সেই জিনিস তোমরা যা তাড়াতাড়ি নিয়ে আসতে চেয়েছিলে। এ হল ঝড়, যাতে আছে ভয়াবহ ‘আযাব।', 'And when they saw it as a cloud approaching their valleys, they said, "This is a cloud bringing us rain!" Rather, it is that for which you were impatient: a wind, within it a painful punishment,', 'অতঃপর তারা যখন তাদের উপত্যকার দিকে মেঘ আসতে দেখল তখন তারা বলল- ‘এ তো মেঘ, আমাদেরকে বৃষ্টি দিবে।’ না, তা হল সেই জিনিস তোমরা যা তাড়াতাড়ি নিয়ে আসতে চেয়েছিলে। এ হল ঝড়, যাতে আছে ভয়াবহ ‘আযাব।', 'And when they saw it as a cloud approaching their valleys, they said, "This is a cloud bringing us rain!" Rather, it is that for which you were impatient: a wind, within it a painful punishment,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046024.mp3', now()),
  (46, 25, '', '[{"id":27749,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"تُدَمِّرُ","transliteration":"tudammiru","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করে দিবে","root":"دمر","lemma":"دَمَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27750,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27751,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۭ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"জিনিসকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27752,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْرِ","transliteration":"bi-amri","translation_bn":"নির্দেশের মাধ্যমে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27753,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهَا","transliteration":"rabbihā","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27754,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা হয়ে গেল (এমন যে)","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27755,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":27756,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yurā","translation_bn":"দেখা যাচ্ছিল (আর কিছু)","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27757,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":27758,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَسَـٰكِنُهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"masākinuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের বসতিগুলো","root":"سكن","lemma":"مَسْكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27760,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27761,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَجْزِى","transliteration":"najzī","translation_bn":"আমরা কর্মফল দিই","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27762,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27763,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"(যারা) অপরাধী","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27764,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'tudammiru kulla shayin bi-amri rabbihā fa-aṣbaḥū lā yurā illā masākinuhum kadhālika najzī l-qawma l-muj''rimīna', 'ওটা তার প্রতিপালকের নির্দেশে সবকিছু ধ্বংস করে দেবে। অবস্থা এই দাঁড়াল যে, তাদের (ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্ত) বসতিগুলো ছাড়া আর কিছু দেখা যাচ্ছিল না। অপরাধী জাতিকে আমি এভাবেই প্রতিফল দিয়ে থাকি।', 'Destroying everything by command of its Lord. And they became so that nothing was seen [of them] except their dwellings. Thus do We recompense the criminal people.', 'ওটা তার প্রতিপালকের নির্দেশে সবকিছু ধ্বংস করে দেবে। অবস্থা এই দাঁড়াল যে, তাদের (ধ্বংসপ্রাপ্ত) বসতিগুলো ছাড়া আর কিছু দেখা যাচ্ছিল না। অপরাধী জাতিকে আমি এভাবেই প্রতিফল দিয়ে থাকি।', 'Destroying everything by command of its Lord. And they became so that nothing was seen [of them] except their dwellings. Thus do We recompense the criminal people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046025.mp3', now()),
  (46, 26, '', '[{"id":29000,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29001,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَكَّنَّـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"makkannāhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আমরা ক্ষমতা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"مكن","lemma":"مَكَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29002,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَآ","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"এমন বিষয়ে যার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29003,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":29004,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَّنَّـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"makkannākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে আমরা ক্ষমতা দিয়েছি","root":"مكن","lemma":"مَكَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29005,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"সেসব বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29006,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29007,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29008,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَمْعًۭا","transliteration":"samʿan","translation_bn":"কান","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29009,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبْصَـٰرًۭا","transliteration":"wa-abṣāran","translation_bn":"ও চোখ","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29010,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَفْـِٔدَةًۭ","transliteration":"wa-afidatan","translation_bn":"ও হৃদয়","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29011,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَمَآ","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29012,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"aghnā","translation_bn":"কাজে আসল","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29013,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29014,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَمْعُهُمْ","transliteration":"samʿuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের কান","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29015,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29016,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَبْصَـٰرُهُمْ","transliteration":"abṣāruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের চোখ","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29017,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29018,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَفْـِٔدَتُهُم","transliteration":"afidatuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তর","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29019,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29020,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29021,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":29022,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"করছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29023,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَجْحَدُونَ","transliteration":"yajḥadūna","translation_bn":"তারা অস্বীকার","root":"جحد","lemma":"جَحَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29024,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"আয়াতগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29025,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29026,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَحَاقَ","transliteration":"waḥāqa","translation_bn":"এবং ঘিরে নিল","root":"حيق","lemma":"حَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29027,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"بِهِم","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29028,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তাই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29029,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29030,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"যে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29031,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","transliteration":"yastahziūna","translation_bn":"ঠাট্টা-বিদ্রুপ করত","root":"هزا","lemma":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29032,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad makkannāhum fīmā in makkannākum fīhi wajaʿalnā lahum samʿan wa-abṣāran wa-afidatan famā aghnā ʿanhum samʿuhum walā abṣāruhum walā afidatuhum min shayin idh kānū yajḥadūna biāyāti l-lahi waḥāqa bihim mā kānū bihi yastahziūna', 'তাদেরকে আমি যতটা সুদৃঢ়ভাবে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করেছিলাম, তোমাদেরকে (হে কুরায়শ!) তেমন সুদৃঢ়ভাবে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করিনি আর তাদেরকে দিয়েছিলাম কান, চোখ ও হৃদয়। কিন্তু তাদের কান, তাদের চোখ আর তাদের হৃদয় তাদের কোন উপকারে আসেনি যেহেতু তারা আল্লাহর আয়াতসমূহকে অস্বীকার করত। তারা যা নিয়ে ঠাট্টা বিদ্রূপ করত তা-ই তাদেরকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'And We had certainly established them in such as We have not established you, and We made for them hearing and vision and hearts. But their hearing and vision and hearts availed them not from anything [of the punishment] when they were [continually] rejecting the signs of Allah; and they were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.', 'তাদেরকে আমি যতটা সুদৃঢ়ভাবে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করেছিলাম, তোমাদেরকে (হে কুরায়শ!) তেমন সুদৃঢ়ভাবে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করিনি আর তাদেরকে দিয়েছিলাম কান, চোখ ও হৃদয়। কিন্তু তাদের কান, তাদের চোখ আর তাদের হৃদয় তাদের কোন উপকারে আসেনি যেহেতু তারা আল্লাহর আয়াতসমূহকে অস্বীকার করত। তারা যা নিয়ে ঠাট্টা বিদ্রূপ করত তা-ই তাদেরকে ঘিরে ফেলল।', 'And We had certainly established them in such as We have not established you, and We made for them hearing and vision and hearts. But their hearing and vision and hearts availed them not from anything [of the punishment] when they were [continually] rejecting the signs of Allah; and they were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046026.mp3', now()),
  (46, 27, '', '[{"id":29599,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29600,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29601,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29602,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَوْلَكُم","transliteration":"ḥawlakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের চারপাশে (আজ দেখছ)","root":"حول","lemma":"حَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29603,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29604,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনপদ সমূহের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29605,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَصَرَّفْنَا","transliteration":"waṣarrafnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বিভিন্নভাবে বর্ণনা করেছি","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَّفْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29606,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"আমার নিদর্শন সমূহকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29607,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29608,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29609,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ahlaknā mā ḥawlakum mina l-qurā waṣarrafnā l-āyāti laʿallahum yarjiʿūna', 'আমি ধ্বংস করেছিলাম তোমাদের চারপাশের জনপদ। আমি নানাভাবে নিদর্শন দেখিয়েছিলাম যাতে তারা (সঠিক পথে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And We have already destroyed what surrounds you of [those] cities, and We have diversified the signs [or verses] that perhaps they might return [from disbelief].', 'আমি ধ্বংস করেছিলাম তোমাদের চারপাশের জনপদ। আমি নানাভাবে নিদর্শন দেখিয়েছিলাম যাতে তারা (সঠিক পথে) ফিরে আসে।', 'And We have already destroyed what surrounds you of [those] cities, and We have diversified the signs [or verses] that perhaps they might return [from disbelief].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046027.mp3', now()),
  (46, 28, '', '[{"id":30633,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"falawlā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30634,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَصَرَهُمُ","transliteration":"naṣarahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে সাহায্য করল","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30635,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(সেসব সত্তা) যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30636,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","translation_bn":"তারা গ্রহণ করেছিল","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30637,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30638,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30639,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30640,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُرْبَانًا","transliteration":"qur''bānan","translation_bn":"নৈকট্যের মাধ্যম","root":"قرب","lemma":"قُرْبَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30641,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَةًۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ālihatan","translation_bn":"উপাস্যরূপে","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30643,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":30644,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ضَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"ḍallū","translation_bn":"তারা হারিয়ে গেল","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30645,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30647,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এটাই (পরিণতি)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30648,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِفْكُهُمْ","transliteration":"if''kuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের মিথ্যার","root":"افك","lemma":"إِفْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30649,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30650,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30651,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"রচনা করছিল","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30652,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falawlā naṣarahumu alladhīna ittakhadhū min dūni l-lahi qur''bānan ālihatan bal ḍallū ʿanhum wadhālika if''kuhum wamā kānū yaftarūna', 'আল্লাহর নৈকট্য লাভের উদ্দেশ্যে আল্লাহ ব্যতিরেকে যাদেরকে তারা ইলাহরূপে গ্রহণ করেছে তারা তাদেরকে সাহায্য করল না কেন? বরং তারা (অর্থাৎ কল্পিত ইলাহ) তাদের থেকে হারিয়ে গেল। আসলে তা ছিল তাদের মিথ্যাচার আর মনগড়া উদ্ভাবন।', 'Then why did those they took besides Allah as deities by which to approach [Him] not aid them? But they had strayed from them. And that was their falsehood and what they were inventing.', 'আল্লাহর নৈকট্য লাভের উদ্দেশ্যে আল্লাহ ব্যতিরেকে যাদেরকে তারা ইলাহরূপে গ্রহণ করেছে তারা তাদেরকে সাহায্য করল না কেন? বরং তারা (অর্থাৎ কল্পিত ইলাহ) তাদের থেকে হারিয়ে গেল। আসলে তা ছিল তাদের মিথ্যাচার আর মনগড়া উদ্ভাবন।', 'Then why did those they took besides Allah as deities by which to approach [Him] not aid them? But they had strayed from them. And that was their falsehood and what they were inventing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046028.mp3', now()),
  (46, 29, '', '[{"id":31658,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ কর)যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31659,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"صَرَفْنَآ","transliteration":"ṣarafnā","translation_bn":"আমরা আকৃষ্ট করে দিয়েছিলাম","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31660,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31661,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَفَرًۭا","transliteration":"nafaran","translation_bn":"এক দলকে","root":"نفر","lemma":"نَفَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31662,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31663,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنِّ","transliteration":"l-jini","translation_bn":"জিনদের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31664,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَمِعُونَ","transliteration":"yastamiʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা শুনতে পায়","root":"سمع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31665,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","transliteration":"l-qur''āna","translation_bn":"কুরআন (তেলাওয়াত)","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31666,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31667,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَضَرُوهُ","transliteration":"ḥaḍarūhu","translation_bn":"তারা সেখানে উপস্থিত হলো","root":"حضر","lemma":"حَضَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31668,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31669,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَنصِتُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"anṣitū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা চুপ করে শোনো\"","root":"نصت","lemma":"أَنصِتُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31671,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31672,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قُضِىَ","transliteration":"quḍiya","translation_bn":"শেষ হল","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31673,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"wallaw","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে গেল","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31674,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31675,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِم","transliteration":"qawmihim","translation_bn":"তাদের জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31676,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مُّنذِرِينَ","transliteration":"mundhirīna","translation_bn":"সতর্ককারী হয়ে","root":"نذر","lemma":"مُنذِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31677,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh ṣarafnā ilayka nafaran mina l-jini yastamiʿūna l-qur''āna falammā ḥaḍarūhu qālū anṣitū falammā quḍiya wallaw ilā qawmihim mundhirīna', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন জ্বিনদের একটি দলকে তোমার প্রতি ফিরিয়ে দিয়েছিলাম যারা কুরআন শুনছিল। তারা যখন সে স্থানে উপস্থিত হল, তখন তারা পরস্পরে বলল- চুপ করে শুন। পড়া যখন শেষ হল তখন তারা তাদের সম্প্রদায়ের কাছে ফিরে গেল সতর্ককারীরূপে।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when We directed to you a few of the jinn, listening to the Qur''an. And when they attended it, they said, "Listen quietly." And when it was concluded, they went back to their people as warners.', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন জ্বিনদের একটি দলকে তোমার প্রতি ফিরিয়ে দিয়েছিলাম যারা কুরআন শুনছিল। তারা যখন সে স্থানে উপস্থিত হল, তখন তারা পরস্পরে বলল- চুপ করে শুন। পড়া যখন শেষ হল তখন তারা তাদের সম্প্রদায়ের কাছে ফিরে গেল সতর্ককারীরূপে।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when We directed to you a few of the jinn, listening to the Qur''an. And when they attended it, they said, "Listen quietly." And when it was concluded, they went back to their people as warners.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046029.mp3', now()),
  (46, 30, '', '[{"id":32548,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32549,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمَنَآ","transliteration":"yāqawmanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":32550,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"আমরা নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32551,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعْنَا","transliteration":"samiʿ''nā","translation_bn":"আমরা শুনেছি","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32552,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبًا","transliteration":"kitāban","translation_bn":"এক কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32553,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32554,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32555,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32556,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মুসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32557,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُصَدِّقًۭا","transliteration":"muṣaddiqan","translation_bn":"সত্যায়নকারী/ সমর্থনকারী","root":"صدق","lemma":"مُصَدِّق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32558,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"তার যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32559,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"তার পূর্বে (এসেছে)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":32560,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَدَيْهِ","transliteration":"yadayhi","translation_bn":"তার পূর্বে (এসেছে)","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32561,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِىٓ","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"(এই কিতাব) পথ দেখায়","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32562,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32563,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32564,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32565,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"طَرِيقٍۢ","transliteration":"ṭarīqin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"طرق","lemma":"طَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32566,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32567,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū yāqawmanā innā samiʿ''nā kitāban unzila min baʿdi mūsā muṣaddiqan limā bayna yadayhi yahdī ilā l-ḥaqi wa-ilā ṭarīqin mus''taqīmin', '(ফিরে গিয়ে) তারা বলল- হে আমাদের সম্প্রদায়! আমরা একটি কিতাব (এর পাঠ) শুনেছি যা মূসার পরে অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে, তা পূর্বেকার কিতাবগুলোর সত্যতা প্রতিপন্ন করে, সত্যের দিকে আর সঠিক পথের দিকে পরিচালিত করে।', 'They said, "O our people, indeed we have heard a [recited] Book revealed after Moses confirming what was before it which guides to the truth and to a straight path.', '(ফিরে গিয়ে) তারা বলল- হে আমাদের সম্প্রদায়! আমরা একটি কিতাব (এর পাঠ) শুনেছি যা মূসার পরে অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে, তা পূর্বেকার কিতাবগুলোর সত্যতা প্রতিপন্ন করে, সত্যের দিকে আর সঠিক পথের দিকে পরিচালিত করে।', 'They said, "O our people, indeed we have heard a [recited] Book revealed after Moses confirming what was before it which guides to the truth and to a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046030.mp3', now()),
  (46, 31, '', '[{"id":33443,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمَنَآ","transliteration":"yāqawmanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাদের জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":33444,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَجِيبُوا۟","transliteration":"ajībū","translation_bn":"তোমরা সাড়া দাও","root":"جوب","lemma":"أُجِيبَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33445,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دَاعِىَ","transliteration":"dāʿiya","translation_bn":"আহবানকারীর (ডাকে)","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَاعِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33446,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (দিকে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33447,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَءَامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"waāminū","translation_bn":"এবং ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33448,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33449,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"yaghfir","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করবেন (আল্লাহ)","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33450,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33451,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33452,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذُنُوبِكُمْ","transliteration":"dhunūbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পাপ গুলোকে","root":"ذنب","lemma":"ذَنب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33453,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَيُجِرْكُم","transliteration":"wayujir''kum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের রক্ষা করবেন","root":"جور","lemma":"يُجِيرُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33454,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33455,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33456,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"alīmin","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ কষ্টকর","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33457,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāqawmanā ajībū dāʿiya l-lahi waāminū bihi yaghfir lakum min dhunūbikum wayujir''kum min ʿadhābin alīmin', 'হে আমাদের সম্প্রদায়! আল্লাহর দিকে আহবানকারীর প্রতি সাড়া দাও এবং তার প্রতি ঈমান আন, আল্লাহ তোমাদের গুনাহ মাফ করে দেবেন আর তোমাদেরকে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক ‘আযাব থেকে রক্ষা করবেন।', 'O our people, respond to the Messenger of Allah and believe in him; Allah will forgive for you your sins and protect you from a painful punishment.', 'হে আমাদের সম্প্রদায়! আল্লাহর দিকে আহবানকারীর প্রতি সাড়া দাও এবং তার প্রতি ঈমান আন, আল্লাহ তোমাদের গুনাহ মাফ করে দেবেন আর তোমাদেরকে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক ‘আযাব থেকে রক্ষা করবেন।', 'O our people, respond to the Messenger of Allah and believe in him; Allah will forgive for you your sins and protect you from a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046031.mp3', now()),
  (46, 32, '', '[{"id":34464,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34465,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":34466,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُجِبْ","transliteration":"yujib","translation_bn":"সাড়া দেয়","root":"جوب","lemma":"أُجِيبَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34467,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"دَاعِىَ","transliteration":"dāʿiya","translation_bn":"আহবানকারীর (ডাকে)","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَاعِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34468,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (দিকে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34469,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"falaysa","translation_bn":"তবে সে নয়","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34470,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمُعْجِزٍۢ","transliteration":"bimuʿ''jizin","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহকে) ব্যর্থ করে দিতে সক্ষম","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعْجِز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34471,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34472,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34473,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"walaysa","translation_bn":"আর নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34474,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34475,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34476,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34477,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"awliyāu","translation_bn":"কোন পৃষ্ঠপোষক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34479,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":34480,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(পড়ে আছে) মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34481,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তির","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34482,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34483,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman lā yujib dāʿiya l-lahi falaysa bimuʿ''jizin fī l-arḍi walaysa lahu min dūnihi awliyāu ulāika fī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'আর যে আল্লাহর দিকে আহবানকারীর প্রতি সাড়া দিবে না, দুনিয়াতে সে আল্লাহকে ব্যর্থ করতে পারবে না, আর আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে নেই তার কোন সাহায্যকারী, পৃষ্ঠপোষক। তারা আছে সুস্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে।', 'But he who does not respond to the Caller of Allah will not cause failure [to Him] upon earth, and he will not have besides Him any protectors. Those are in manifest error."', 'আর যে আল্লাহর দিকে আহবানকারীর প্রতি সাড়া দিবে না, দুনিয়াতে সে আল্লাহকে ব্যর্থ করতে পারবে না, আর আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে নেই তার কোন সাহায্যকারী, পৃষ্ঠপোষক। তারা আছে সুস্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে।', 'But he who does not respond to the Caller of Allah will not cause failure [to Him] upon earth, and he will not have besides Him any protectors. Those are in manifest error."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046032.mp3', now()),
  (46, 33, '', '[{"id":35456,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":35457,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা অনুধাবন করে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35458,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35459,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":35460,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35461,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35462,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35463,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35464,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35465,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعْىَ","transliteration":"yaʿya","translation_bn":"ক্লান্তি বোধ করেন","root":"عيي","lemma":"عَيِي","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35466,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِخَلْقِهِنَّ","transliteration":"bikhalqihinna","translation_bn":"তাদের সৃষ্টিতে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35467,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِقَـٰدِرٍ","transliteration":"biqādirin","translation_bn":"(তিনিই তো) সক্ষম","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَادِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35468,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(এর) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35469,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":35470,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُحْـِۧىَ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yiya","translation_bn":"তিনি জীবিত করবেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35471,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"l-mawtā","translation_bn":"মৃতদেরকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35473,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"balā","translation_bn":"কেন নয়?","root":"—","lemma":"بَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":35474,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"তিনি নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35475,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35476,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35477,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35478,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35479,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yaraw anna l-laha alladhī khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa walam yaʿya bikhalqihinna biqādirin ʿalā an yuḥ''yiya l-mawtā balā innahu ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun', 'তারা কি দেখে না যে, আল্লাহ, যিনি আকাশ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন আর ওগুলোর সৃষ্টিতে তিনি ক্লান্ত হননি, তিনি মৃতদেরকে জীবন দিতে সক্ষম? নিঃসন্দেহে তিনি সকল বিষয়ের উপর ক্ষমতাবান।', 'Do they not see that Allah, who created the heavens and earth and did not fail in their creation, is able to give life to the dead? Yes. Indeed, He is over all things competent.', 'তারা কি দেখে না যে, আল্লাহ, যিনি আকাশ ও যমীন সৃষ্টি করেছেন আর ওগুলোর সৃষ্টিতে তিনি ক্লান্ত হননি, তিনি মৃতদেরকে জীবন দিতে সক্ষম? নিঃসন্দেহে তিনি সকল বিষয়ের উপর ক্ষমতাবান।', 'Do they not see that Allah, who created the heavens and earth and did not fail in their creation, is able to give life to the dead? Yes. Indeed, He is over all things competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046033.mp3', now()),
  (46, 34, '', '[{"id":36275,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36276,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُعْرَضُ","transliteration":"yuʿ''raḍu","translation_bn":"উপস্থিত করা হবে","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرَضَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36277,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36278,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36279,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36280,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36281,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"alaysa","translation_bn":"\"(বলা হবে) নয় কি","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":36282,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":36283,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্য\"","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36285,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36286,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰ","transliteration":"balā","translation_bn":"\"হ্যাঁ নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"بَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":36287,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبِّنَا ۚ","transliteration":"warabbinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রবের শপথ (এটা সত্য)\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36289,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36290,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"fadhūqū","translation_bn":"\"এখন তোমরা স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36291,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36292,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36293,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা করছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36294,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَكْفُرُونَ","transliteration":"takfurūna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36295,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yuʿ''raḍu alladhīna kafarū ʿalā l-nāri alaysa hādhā bil-ḥaqi qālū balā warabbinā qāla fadhūqū l-ʿadhāba bimā kuntum takfurūna', 'কাফিরদেরকে যেদিন জাহান্নামের সামনে হাজির করা হবে (তখন তাদেরকে বলা হবে) এটা কি সত্য নয়? তারা বলবে, ‘কসম আমাদের প্রতিপালকের! এটা সত্য।’ তাদেরকে বলা হবে, ‘তাহলে ‘আযাব আস্বাদন কর, যেহেতু তোমরা সত্যকে অমান্য করেছিলে।', 'And the Day those who disbelieved are exposed to the Fire [it will be said], "Is this not the truth?" They will say, "Yes, by our Lord." He will say, "Then taste the punishment because you used to disbelieve."', 'কাফিরদেরকে যেদিন জাহান্নামের সামনে হাজির করা হবে (তখন তাদেরকে বলা হবে) এটা কি সত্য নয়? তারা বলবে, ‘কসম আমাদের প্রতিপালকের! এটা সত্য।’ তাদেরকে বলা হবে, ‘তাহলে ‘আযাব আস্বাদন কর, যেহেতু তোমরা সত্যকে অমান্য করেছিলে।', 'And the Day those who disbelieved are exposed to the Fire [it will be said], "Is this not the truth?" They will say, "Yes, by our Lord." He will say, "Then taste the punishment because you used to disbelieve."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046034.mp3', now()),
  (46, 35, '', '[{"id":37064,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"অতএব (হে নবী) ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37065,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37066,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرَ","transliteration":"ṣabara","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য ধরেছে","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37067,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لُوا۟","transliteration":"ulū","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37068,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزْمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿazmi","translation_bn":"দৃঢ়সংকল্পসম্পন্ন","root":"عزم","lemma":"عَزْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37069,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37070,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرُّسُلِ","transliteration":"l-rusuli","translation_bn":"রাসূলগণের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37071,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37072,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَعْجِل","transliteration":"tastaʿjil","translation_bn":"তাড়াহুড়া করো","root":"عجل","lemma":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37073,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37075,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"ka-annahum","translation_bn":"তারা যেন (ভাববে)","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":37076,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37077,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْنَ","transliteration":"yarawna","translation_bn":"তারা দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37078,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা (আজ)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37079,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُوعَدُونَ","transliteration":"yūʿadūna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে ভয় দেখানো হচ্ছে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37080,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":37081,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَلْبَثُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yalbathū","translation_bn":"তারা অবস্থান করে","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37082,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":37083,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَاعَةًۭ","transliteration":"sāʿatan","translation_bn":"একদণ্ড","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37084,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37085,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"نَّهَارٍۭ ۚ","transliteration":"nahārin","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37087,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بَلَـٰغٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"balāghun","translation_bn":"এ এক ঘোষণা (কথা)","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37089,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37090,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يُهْلَكُ","transliteration":"yuh''laku","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করা হবে (অন্য কাউকে)","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37091,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":37092,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمُ","transliteration":"l-qawmu","translation_bn":"(যারা) সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37093,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","transliteration":"l-fāsiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37094,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iṣ''bir kamā ṣabara ulū l-ʿazmi mina l-rusuli walā tastaʿjil lahum ka-annahum yawma yarawna mā yūʿadūna lam yalbathū illā sāʿatan min nahārin balāghun fahal yuh''laku illā l-qawmu l-fāsiqūna', 'কাজেই তুমি ধৈর্য ধর যেমনভাবে ধৈর্য ধারণ করেছিল দৃঢ় সংকল্পের অধিকারী রসূলগণ। আর এই লোকেদের ব্যাপারে তাড়াহুড়া করো না। কারণ যে বিষয়ে তাদেরকে সাবধান করা হয়েছে যেদিন তারা তা দেখবে, সেদিন তারা মনে করবে যে, একদিনের কিছু অংশের অধিক তারা দুনিয়াতে অবস্থান করেনি। (তোমার দায়িত্ব) পৌঁছানো, অতঃপর পাপাচারী সম্প্রদায় ছাড়া আর কে ধ্বংস হবে?', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad], as were those of determination among the messengers and do not be impatient for them. It will be - on the Day they see that which they are promised - as though they had not remained [in the world] except an hour of a day. [This is] notification. And will [any] be destroyed except the defiantly disobedient people?', 'কাজেই তুমি ধৈর্য ধর যেমনভাবে ধৈর্য ধারণ করেছিল দৃঢ় সংকল্পের অধিকারী রসূলগণ। আর এই লোকেদের ব্যাপারে তাড়াহুড়া করো না। কারণ যে বিষয়ে তাদেরকে সাবধান করা হয়েছে যেদিন তারা তা দেখবে, সেদিন তারা মনে করবে যে, একদিনের কিছু অংশের অধিক তারা দুনিয়াতে অবস্থান করেনি। (তোমার দায়িত্ব) পৌঁছানো, অতঃপর পাপাচারী সম্প্রদায় ছাড়া আর কে ধ্বংস হবে?', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad], as were those of determination among the messengers and do not be impatient for them. It will be - on the Day they see that which they are promised - as though they had not remained [in the world] except an hour of a day. [This is] notification. And will [any] be destroyed except the defiantly disobedient people?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/046035.mp3', now())
