ni":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":3445,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"فَلَن","transliteration":"falan","translation_bn":"সেক্ষেত্রে কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":3446,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلَّ","transliteration":"yuḍilla","translation_bn":"তিনি নিষ্ফল করবেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":3447,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কর্ম সমুহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":3448,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-idhā laqītumu alladhīna kafarū faḍarba l-riqābi ḥattā idhā athkhantumūhum fashuddū l-wathāqa fa-immā mannan baʿdu wa-immā fidāan ḥattā taḍaʿa l-ḥarbu awzārahā dhālika walaw yashāu l-lahu la-intaṣara min''hum walākin liyabluwā baʿḍakum bibaʿḍin wa-alladhīna qutilū fī sabīli l-lahi falan yuḍilla aʿmālahum', 'অতঃপর যখন তোমরা কাফিরদের সঙ্গে যুদ্ধে অবতীর্ণ হও, তখন তাদের ঘাড়ে আঘাত হানো, অবশেষে যখন তাদেরকে পূর্ণরূপে পরাস্ত কর, তখন তাদেরকে শক্তভাবে বেঁধে ফেল। অতঃপর হয় তাদের প্রতি অনুগ্রহ কর, না হয় তাদের থেকে মুক্তিপণ গ্রহণ কর। তোমরা যুদ্ধ চালিয়ে যাবে, যে পর্যন্ত না শত্রুপক্ষ অস্ত্র সমর্পণ করে। এ নির্দেশই তোমাদেরকে দেয়া হল। আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে (নিজেই) তাদের থেকে প্রতিশোধ নিতে পারতেন। কিন্তু তিনি তোমাদের একজনকে অন্যের দ্বারা পরীক্ষা করতে চান (এজন্য তোমাদেরকে যুদ্ধ করার সুযোগ দেন)। যারা আল্লাহর পথে শহীদ হয় তিনি তাদের কর্মফল কক্ষনো বিনষ্ট করবেন না।', 'So when you meet those who disbelieve [in battle], strike [their] necks until, when you have inflicted slaughter upon them, then secure their bonds, and either [confer] favor afterwards or ransom [them] until the war lays down its burdens. That [is the command]. And if Allah had willed, He could have taken vengeance upon them [Himself], but [He ordered armed struggle] to test some of you by means of others. And those who are killed in the cause of Allah - never will He waste their deeds.', 'অতঃপর যখন তোমরা কাফিরদের সঙ্গে যুদ্ধে অবতীর্ণ হও, তখন তাদের ঘাড়ে আঘাত হানো, অবশেষে যখন তাদেরকে পূর্ণরূপে পরাস্ত কর, তখন তাদেরকে শক্তভাবে বেঁধে ফেল। অতঃপর হয় তাদের প্রতি অনুগ্রহ কর, না হয় তাদের থেকে মুক্তিপণ গ্রহণ কর। তোমরা যুদ্ধ চালিয়ে যাবে, যে পর্যন্ত না শত্রুপক্ষ অস্ত্র সমর্পণ করে। এ নির্দেশই তোমাদেরকে দেয়া হল। আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে (নিজেই) তাদের থেকে প্রতিশোধ নিতে পারতেন। কিন্তু তিনি তোমাদের একজনকে অন্যের দ্বারা পরীক্ষা করতে চান (এজন্য তোমাদেরকে যুদ্ধ করার সুযোগ দেন)। যারা আল্লাহর পথে শহীদ হয় তিনি তাদের কর্মফল কক্ষনো বিনষ্ট করবেন না।', 'So when you meet those who disbelieve [in battle], strike [their] necks until, when you have inflicted slaughter upon them, then secure their bonds, and either [confer] favor afterwards or ransom [them] until the war lays down its burdens. That [is the command]. And if Allah had willed, He could have taken vengeance upon them [Himself], but [He ordered armed struggle] to test some of you by means of others. And those who are killed in the cause of Allah - never will He waste their deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047004.mp3', now()),
  (47, 5, '', '[{"id":4796,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَيَهْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"sayahdīhim","translation_bn":"তিনি অচিরেই তাদেরকে পরিচালিত করবেন সৎ পথে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":4797,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَيُصْلِحُ","transliteration":"wayuṣ''liḥu","translation_bn":"ও ভালো করবেন","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":4798,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَالَهُمْ","transliteration":"bālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের অবস্থা","root":"بول","lemma":"بَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":4799,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sayahdīhim wayuṣ''liḥu bālahum', 'তিনি তাদেরকে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন আর তাদের অবস্থা ভাল করে দেন।', 'He will guide them and amend their condition', 'তিনি তাদেরকে সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন আর তাদের অবস্থা ভাল করে দেন।', 'He will guide them and amend their condition', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047005.mp3', now()),
  (47, 6, '', '[{"id":6032,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيُدْخِلُهُمُ","transliteration":"wayud''khiluhumu","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের প্রবেশ করাবেন","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":6033,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ","transliteration":"l-janata","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6034,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَرَّفَهَا","transliteration":"ʿarrafahā","translation_bn":"তার পরিচয় তিনি জানিয়েছেন","root":"عرف","lemma":"عَرَّفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6035,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6036,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayud''khiluhumu l-janata ʿarrafahā lahum', 'অতঃপর তিনি তাদেরকে জান্নাতে প্রবিষ্ট করবেন যা তাদেরকে তিনি জানিয়ে দিয়েছেন।', 'And admit them to Paradise, which He has made known to them.', 'অতঃপর তিনি তাদেরকে জান্নাতে প্রবিষ্ট করবেন যা তাদেরকে তিনি জানিয়ে দিয়েছেন।', 'And admit them to Paradise, which He has made known to them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047006.mp3', now()),
  (47, 7, '', '[{"id":7355,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":7356,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":7357,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7358,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":7359,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَنصُرُوا۟","transliteration":"tanṣurū","translation_bn":"তোমরা সাহায্য কর","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7360,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":7361,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرْكُمْ","transliteration":"yanṣur''kum","translation_bn":"তিনি তোমাদেরকে সাহায্য করবেন","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7362,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيُثَبِّتْ","transliteration":"wayuthabbit","translation_bn":"ও সুদৃঢ় করবেন","root":"ثبت","lemma":"ثَبَّتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7363,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَقْدَامَكُمْ","transliteration":"aqdāmakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পা গুলোকে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7364,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū in tanṣurū l-laha yanṣur''kum wayuthabbit aqdāmakum', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা যদি আল্লাহকে সাহায্য কর, তিনি তোমাদেরকে সাহায্য করবেন আর তোমাদের পাগুলোকে দৃঢ়প্রতিষ্ঠ করবেন।', 'O you who have believed, if you support Allah, He will support you and plant firmly your feet.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা যদি আল্লাহকে সাহায্য কর, তিনি তোমাদেরকে সাহায্য করবেন আর তোমাদের পাগুলোকে দৃঢ়প্রতিষ্ঠ করবেন।', 'O you who have believed, if you support Allah, He will support you and plant firmly your feet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047007.mp3', now()),
  (47, 8, '', '[{"id":8645,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8646,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8647,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَتَعْسًۭا","transliteration":"fataʿsan","translation_bn":"দুর্গতি সেক্ষেত্রে","root":"تعس","lemma":"تَعْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8648,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8649,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَضَلَّ","transliteration":"wa-aḍalla","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি পণ্ড করে দিয়েছেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8650,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কর্মসমূহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8651,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kafarū fataʿsan lahum wa-aḍalla aʿmālahum', 'যারা কুফরী করে তাদের জন্য দুর্ভোগ আর তিনি তাদের কর্মকে বিনষ্ট করে দেবেন।', 'But those who disbelieve - for them is misery, and He will waste their deeds.', 'যারা কুফরী করে তাদের জন্য দুর্ভোগ আর তিনি তাদের কর্মকে বিনষ্ট করে দেবেন।', 'But those who disbelieve - for them is misery, and He will waste their deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047008.mp3', now()),
  (47, 9, '', '[{"id":9844,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":9845,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":9846,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَرِهُوا۟","transliteration":"karihū","translation_bn":"অপছন্দ করেছে","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرِهَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9847,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":9848,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"নাযিল করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9849,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":9850,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَحْبَطَ","transliteration":"fa-aḥbaṭa","translation_bn":"অতএব তিনি নষ্ট করে দিয়েছেন","root":"حبط","lemma":"أَحْبَطَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":9851,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কর্মসমূহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":9852,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-annahum karihū mā anzala l-lahu fa-aḥbaṭa aʿmālahum', 'তা এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তারা তা অপছন্দ করে, কাজেই আল্লাহ তাদের কর্ম ব্যর্থ করেন।', 'That is because they disliked what Allah revealed, so He rendered worthless their deeds.', 'তা এজন্য যে, আল্লাহ যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তারা তা অপছন্দ করে, কাজেই আল্লাহ তাদের কর্ম ব্যর্থ করেন।', 'That is because they disliked what Allah revealed, so He rendered worthless their deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047009.mp3', now()),
  (47, 10, '', '[{"id":11021,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ أَفَلَمْ","transliteration":"afalam","translation_bn":"নি তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":11022,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرُوا۟","transliteration":"yasīrū","translation_bn":"তারা ভ্রমণ করে","root":"سير","lemma":"سَارَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11023,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11024,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11025,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَيَنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"fayanẓurū","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে তখন (নাই)","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11026,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":11027,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11028,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11029,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":11030,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11031,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে (ছিল)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11033,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دَمَّرَ","transliteration":"dammara","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছেন","root":"دمر","lemma":"دَمَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11034,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11035,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11037,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"walil''kāfirīna","translation_bn":"এবং কাফেরদের জন্য (নির্দিষ্ট হয়ে আছে)","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11038,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَمْثَـٰلُهَا","transliteration":"amthāluhā","translation_bn":"তার অনুরূপ পরিণতি","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11039,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afalam yasīrū fī l-arḍi fayanẓurū kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu alladhīna min qablihim dammara l-lahu ʿalayhim walil''kāfirīna amthāluhā', 'তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করেনি অতঃপর দেখেনি তাদের আগে যারা ছিল তাদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছে? আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছেন, কাফিরদের জন্য আছে অনুরূপ শাস্তি।', 'Have they not traveled through the land and seen how was the end of those before them? Allah destroyed [everything] over them, and for the disbelievers is something comparable.', 'তারা কি পৃথিবীতে ভ্রমণ করেনি অতঃপর দেখেনি তাদের আগে যারা ছিল তাদের পরিণাম কী হয়েছে? আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছেন, কাফিরদের জন্য আছে অনুরূপ শাস্তি।', 'Have they not traveled through the land and seen how was the end of those before them? Allah destroyed [everything] over them, and for the disbelievers is something comparable.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047010.mp3', now()),
  (47, 11, '', '[{"id":12306,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":12307,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّ","transliteration":"bi-anna","translation_bn":"এ জন্যে যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12308,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":12309,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَوْلَى","transliteration":"mawlā","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12310,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12311,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12312,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12313,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফেরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12314,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":12315,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَوْلَىٰ","transliteration":"mawlā","translation_bn":"কোনো অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12316,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12317,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-anna l-laha mawlā alladhīna āmanū wa-anna l-kāfirīna lā mawlā lahum', 'এর কারণ এই যে, যারা ঈমান আনে আল্লাহ তাদের অভিভাবক আর কাফিরদের কোন অভিভাবক নেই।', 'That is because Allah is the protector of those who have believed and because the disbelievers have no protector.', 'এর কারণ এই যে, যারা ঈমান আনে আল্লাহ তাদের অভিভাবক আর কাফিরদের কোন অভিভাবক নেই।', 'That is because Allah is the protector of those who have believed and because the disbelievers have no protector.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047011.mp3', now()),
  (47, 12, '', '[{"id":13654,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":13655,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13656,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُدْخِلُ","transliteration":"yud''khilu","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করাবেন","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13657,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":13658,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13659,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13660,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎকর্ম","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13661,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13662,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্র্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13663,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13664,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তার নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13665,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্না ধারাসমুহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13667,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13668,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13669,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَتَمَتَّعُونَ","transliteration":"yatamattaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ভোগবিলাস করছে","root":"متع","lemma":"تَمَتَّعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13670,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَيَأْكُلُونَ","transliteration":"wayakulūna","translation_bn":"ও তারা খাচ্ছে","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13671,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13672,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُ","transliteration":"takulu","translation_bn":"খায়","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13673,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمُ","transliteration":"l-anʿāmu","translation_bn":"চতুষ্পদ জন্তু","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13674,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّارُ","transliteration":"wal-nāru","translation_bn":"এবং জাহান্নামই","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13675,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَثْوًۭى","transliteration":"mathwan","translation_bn":"নিবাস","root":"ثوي","lemma":"مَثْوًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13676,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13677,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha yud''khilu alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti jannātin tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru wa-alladhīna kafarū yatamattaʿūna wayakulūna kamā takulu l-anʿāmu wal-nāru mathwan lahum', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে প্রবিষ্ট করবেন জান্নাতে যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত। আর যারা কুফুরী করে তারা ভোগ বিলাসে মত্ত থাকে আর আহার করে যেভাবে আহার করে জন্তু জানোয়াররা। জাহান্নামই তাদের বাসস্থান।', 'Indeed, Allah will admit those who have believed and done righteous deeds to gardens beneath which rivers flow, but those who disbelieve enjoy themselves and eat as grazing livestock eat, and the Fire will be a residence for them.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে প্রবিষ্ট করবেন জান্নাতে যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত। আর যারা কুফুরী করে তারা ভোগ বিলাসে মত্ত থাকে আর আহার করে যেভাবে আহার করে জন্তু জানোয়াররা। জাহান্নামই তাদের বাসস্থান।', 'Indeed, Allah will admit those who have believed and done righteous deeds to gardens beneath which rivers flow, but those who disbelieve enjoy themselves and eat as grazing livestock eat, and the Fire will be a residence for them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047012.mp3', now()),
  (47, 13, '', '[{"id":14842,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن","transliteration":"waka-ayyin","translation_bn":"এবং কতই না","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَيِّن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14843,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14844,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনপদ (বিলীন হয়েছে)","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14845,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"যা (ছিল)","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":14846,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدُّ","transliteration":"ashaddu","translation_bn":"অধিকতর দৃঢ়","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14847,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُوَّةًۭ","transliteration":"quwwatan","translation_bn":"শক্তিতে","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14848,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14849,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَتِكَ","transliteration":"qaryatika","translation_bn":"তোমার জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14850,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّتِىٓ","transliteration":"allatī","translation_bn":"যা (হতে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":14851,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَخْرَجَتْكَ","transliteration":"akhrajatka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে বের করেছে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14852,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"ahlaknāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা তাদেরকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14853,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না  (ছিল)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14854,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَاصِرَ","transliteration":"nāṣira","translation_bn":"কোনো সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَاصِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14855,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14856,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waka-ayyin min qaryatin hiya ashaddu quwwatan min qaryatika allatī akhrajatka ahlaknāhum falā nāṣira lahum', 'তোমার যে জনপদ থেকে তারা তোমাকে বের করে দিয়েছে তার অপেক্ষা শক্তিশালী কত জনপদকে আমি ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি, অতঃপর কেউ ছিল না তাদের সাহায্যকারী।', 'And how many a city was stronger than your city [Makkah] which drove you out? We destroyed them; and there was no helper for them.', 'তোমার যে জনপদ থেকে তারা তোমাকে বের করে দিয়েছে তার অপেক্ষা শক্তিশালী কত জনপদকে আমি ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি, অতঃপর কেউ ছিল না তাদের সাহায্যকারী।', 'And how many a city was stronger than your city [Makkah] which drove you out? We destroyed them; and there was no helper for them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047013.mp3', now()),
