ṣaffan walahum fīhā min kulli l-thamarāti wamaghfiratun min rabbihim kaman huwa khālidun fī l-nāri wasuqū māan ḥamīman faqaṭṭaʿa amʿāahum', 'মুত্তাক্বীদেরকে যে জান্নাতের ও‘য়াদা দেয়া হয়েছে তার উপমা হলঃ তাতে আছে নির্মল পানির ঝর্ণা, আর আছে দুধের নদী যার স্বাদ অপরিবর্তনীয়, আছে পানকারীদের জন্য সুস্বাদু মদের নদী আর পরিশোধিত মধুর নদী। তাদের জন্য সেখানে আছে সব রকম ফলমূল আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে ক্ষমা। (এরা কি) তাদের মত যারা চিরকাল থাকবে জাহান্নামে যাদেরকে পান করতে দেয়া হবে গরম পানীয় যা তাদের নাড়িভুঁড়ি ছিন্ন ভিন্ন করে ফেলবে?', 'Is the description of Paradise, which the righteous are promised, wherein are rivers of water unaltered, rivers of milk the taste of which never changes, rivers of wine delicious to those who drink, and rivers of purified honey, in which they will have from all [kinds of] fruits and forgiveness from their Lord, like [that of] those who abide eternally in the Fire and are given to drink scalding water that will sever their intestines?', 'মুত্তাক্বীদেরকে যে জান্নাতের ও‘য়াদা দেয়া হয়েছে তার উপমা হলঃ তাতে আছে নির্মল পানির ঝর্ণা, আর আছে দুধের নদী যার স্বাদ অপরিবর্তনীয়, আছে পানকারীদের জন্য সুস্বাদু মদের নদী আর পরিশোধিত মধুর নদী। তাদের জন্য সেখানে আছে সব রকম ফলমূল আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে ক্ষমা। (এরা কি) তাদের মত যারা চিরকাল থাকবে জাহান্নামে যাদেরকে পান করতে দেয়া হবে গরম পানীয় যা তাদের নাড়িভুঁড়ি ছিন্ন ভিন্ন করে ফেলবে?', 'Is the description of Paradise, which the righteous are promised, wherein are rivers of water unaltered, rivers of milk the taste of which never changes, rivers of wine delicious to those who drink, and rivers of purified honey, in which they will have from all [kinds of] fruits and forgiveness from their Lord, like [that of] those who abide eternally in the Fire and are given to drink scalding water that will sever their intestines?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047015.mp3', now()),
  (47, 16, '', '[{"id":18147,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18148,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ (এমন আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18149,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَمِعُ","transliteration":"yastamiʿu","translation_bn":"যে শুনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18150,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার দিকে মনোযোগ দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18151,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"এমন কি","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":18152,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":18153,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خَرَجُوا۟","transliteration":"kharajū","translation_bn":"তারা বের হয়ে যায়","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18154,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18155,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِندِكَ","transliteration":"ʿindika","translation_bn":"তোমার নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18156,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18157,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের (আহলে-কিতাবদেরকে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18158,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"দেওয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18159,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمَ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''ma","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18160,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَاذَا","transliteration":"mādhā","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":18161,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18162,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ءَانِفًا ۚ","transliteration":"ānifan","translation_bn":"এইমাত্র\"","root":"انف","lemma":"ءَانِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18164,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":18165,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18166,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"طَبَعَ","transliteration":"ṭabaʿa","translation_bn":"মোহর মেরে দিয়েছেন","root":"طبع","lemma":"طَبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18167,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18168,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18169,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তর গুলোর","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18170,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18171,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَهْوَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"ahwāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের খেয়াল খুশির","root":"هوي","lemma":"أَهْوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18172,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin''hum man yastamiʿu ilayka ḥattā idhā kharajū min ʿindika qālū lilladhīna ūtū l-ʿil''ma mādhā qāla ānifan ulāika alladhīna ṭabaʿa l-lahu ʿalā qulūbihim wa-ittabaʿū ahwāahum', 'তাদের মধ্যে কতক লোক তোমার কথা শুনে, অতঃপর যখন তারা তোমার কাছ থেকে বেরিয়ে যায়, তখন যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছে তাদেরকে বলে- এই মাত্র সে কী বলল? এদের অন্তরে আল্লাহ মোহর মেরে দিয়েছেন আর তারা নিজেদের খেয়ালখুশির অনুসরণ করে।', 'And among them, [O Muhammad], are those who listen to you, until when they depart from you, they say to those who were given knowledge, "What has he said just now?" Those are the ones of whom Allah has sealed over their hearts and who have followed their [own] desires.', 'তাদের মধ্যে কতক লোক তোমার কথা শুনে, অতঃপর যখন তারা তোমার কাছ থেকে বেরিয়ে যায়, তখন যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দেয়া হয়েছে তাদেরকে বলে- এই মাত্র সে কী বলল? এদের অন্তরে আল্লাহ মোহর মেরে দিয়েছেন আর তারা নিজেদের খেয়ালখুশির অনুসরণ করে।', 'And among them, [O Muhammad], are those who listen to you, until when they depart from you, they say to those who were given knowledge, "What has he said just now?" Those are the ones of whom Allah has sealed over their hearts and who have followed their [own] desires.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047016.mp3', now()),
  (47, 17, '', '[{"id":19202,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19203,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَدَوْا۟","transliteration":"ih''tadaw","translation_bn":"সৎপথ অবলম্বন করেছে","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19204,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"زَادَهُمْ","transliteration":"zādahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে (আল্লাহ্‌) বাড়িয়ে দেন","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19205,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هُدًۭى","transliteration":"hudan","translation_bn":"সৎপথে চলার শক্তি","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19206,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"waātāhum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের দান করেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19207,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَقْوَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"taqwāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের তাকওয়া","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19208,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna ih''tadaw zādahum hudan waātāhum taqwāhum', 'যারা সঠিক পথে চলে আল্লাহ তাদের সৎপথ প্রাপ্তি বৃদ্ধি করে দেন আর তাদেরকে তাক্বওয়া দান করেন।', 'And those who are guided - He increases them in guidance and gives them their righteousness.', 'যারা সঠিক পথে চলে আল্লাহ তাদের সৎপথ প্রাপ্তি বৃদ্ধি করে দেন আর তাদেরকে তাক্বওয়া দান করেন।', 'And those who are guided - He increases them in guidance and gives them their righteousness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047017.mp3', now()),
  (47, 18, '', '[{"id":20288,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"তবে (কি)","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20289,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অপেক্ষা করছে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20290,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":20291,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","translation_bn":"কিয়ামতের","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20292,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":20293,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَهُم","transliteration":"tatiyahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20294,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَغْتَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"baghtatan","translation_bn":"হঠাৎ করে","root":"بغت","lemma":"بَغْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20296,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20297,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20298,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَاطُهَا ۚ","transliteration":"ashrāṭuhā","translation_bn":"তার লক্ষণসমূহ","root":"شرط","lemma":"أَشْرَاط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20300,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"fa-annā","translation_bn":"অতএব কেমন করে","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20301,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20302,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":20303,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْهُمْ","transliteration":"jāathum","translation_bn":"তা তাদের কাছে আসবে (কিয়ামত)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20304,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"dhik''rāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের উপদেশ (গ্রহণ সম্ভব হবে?)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20305,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fahal yanẓurūna illā l-sāʿata an tatiyahum baghtatan faqad jāa ashrāṭuhā fa-annā lahum idhā jāathum dhik''rāhum', 'তারা কি শুধু এ অপেক্ষায় আছে যে, ক্বিয়ামত তাদের কাছে অকস্মাৎ এসে পড়ুক? ক্বিয়ামতের লক্ষণগুলো তো এসেই গেছে। কাজেই তা এসে পড়লে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করবে কেমন করে?', 'Then do they await except that the Hour should come upon them unexpectedly? But already there have come [some of] its indications. Then what good to them, when it has come, will be their remembrance?', 'তারা কি শুধু এ অপেক্ষায় আছে যে, ক্বিয়ামত তাদের কাছে অকস্মাৎ এসে পড়ুক? ক্বিয়ামতের লক্ষণগুলো তো এসেই গেছে। কাজেই তা এসে পড়লে তারা উপদেশ গ্রহণ করবে কেমন করে?', 'Then do they await except that the Hour should come upon them unexpectedly? But already there have come [some of] its indications. Then what good to them, when it has come, will be their remembrance?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047018.mp3', now()),
  (47, 19, '', '[{"id":21387,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْلَمْ","transliteration":"fa-iʿ''lam","translation_bn":"অতএব জেনে রাখো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21388,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":21389,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":21390,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ (যে ইবাদাত পেতে পারে)","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21391,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":21392,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":21393,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wa-is''taghfir","translation_bn":"এবং ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করো","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21394,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِذَنۢبِكَ","transliteration":"lidhanbika","translation_bn":"তোমার পাপের জন্যে","root":"ذنب","lemma":"ذَنب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21395,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"walil''mu''minīna","translation_bn":"এবং মু''মিন পুরুষদের জন্যে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21396,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ۗ","transliteration":"wal-mu''mināti","translation_bn":"এবং মু''মিন নারীদের জন্যে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21398,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21399,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21400,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُتَقَلَّبَكُمْ","transliteration":"mutaqallabakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের গতিবিধি","root":"قلب","lemma":"مُتَقَلَّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21401,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمَثْوَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"wamathwākum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের অবস্থান","root":"ثوي","lemma":"مَثْوًى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21402,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iʿ''lam annahu lā ilāha illā l-lahu wa-is''taghfir lidhanbika walil''mu''minīna wal-mu''mināti wal-lahu yaʿlamu mutaqallabakum wamathwākum', 'কাজেই জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহ ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর তোমার ভুলত্রুটির জন্য আর মু’মিন ও মু’মিনাদের জন্য, আল্লাহ তোমাদের গতিবিধি ও অবস্থান সম্পর্কে অবগত।', 'So know, [O Muhammad], that there is no deity except Allah and ask forgiveness for your sin and for the believing men and believing women. And Allah knows of your movement and your resting place.', 'কাজেই জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহ ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর তোমার ভুলত্রুটির জন্য আর মু’মিন ও মু’মিনাদের জন্য, আল্লাহ তোমাদের গতিবিধি ও অবস্থান সম্পর্কে অবগত।', 'So know, [O Muhammad], that there is no deity except Allah and ask forgiveness for your sin and for the believing men and believing women. And Allah knows of your movement and your resting place.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047019.mp3', now()),
  (47, 20, '', '[{"id":22464,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"wayaqūlu","translation_bn":"এবং বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22465,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":22466,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22467,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"\"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":22468,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نُزِّلَتْ","transliteration":"nuzzilat","translation_bn":"নাযিল করা হয়","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22469,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سُورَةٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"sūratun","translation_bn":"একটি সূরাহ (যুদ্ধাদেশ দিয়ে)\"","root":"سور","lemma":"سُورَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22471,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَآ","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22472,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَتْ","transliteration":"unzilat","translation_bn":"নাযিল করা হলো","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22473,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سُورَةٌۭ","transliteration":"sūratun","translation_bn":"একটি সূরাহ","root":"سور","lemma":"سُورَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22474,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُّحْكَمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"muḥ''kamatun","translation_bn":"দ্ব্যর্থহীন","root":"حكم","lemma":"مُّحْكَمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22475,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَذُكِرَ","transliteration":"wadhukira","translation_bn":"এবং উল্লেখ করা ছিল","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22476,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22477,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِتَالُ ۙ","transliteration":"l-qitālu","translation_bn":"যুদ্ধের (নির্দেশ)","root":"قتل","lemma":"قِتَال","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22479,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَأَيْتَ","transliteration":"ra-ayta","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখলে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22480,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে (যাদের)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":22481,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22482,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِم","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরসমূহে","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22483,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَضٌۭ","transliteration":"maraḍun","translation_bn":"রোগ","root":"مرض","lemma":"مَّرَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22484,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","translation_bn":"তারা তাকাচ্ছে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22485,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22486,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"نَظَرَ","transliteration":"naẓara","translation_bn":"(এমন) দৃষ্টিতে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَظَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22487,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَغْشِىِّ","transliteration":"l-maghshiyi","translation_bn":"ছেয়ে গেছে","root":"غشو","lemma":"مَغْشِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22488,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"যার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22489,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22490,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-mawti","translation_bn":"মৃত্যু","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22492,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَأَوْلَىٰ","transliteration":"fa-awlā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং দুর্ভোগ","root":"ولي","lemma":"أَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22493,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22494,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlu alladhīna āmanū lawlā nuzzilat sūratun fa-idhā unzilat sūratun muḥ''kamatun wadhukira fīhā l-qitālu ra-ayta alladhīna fī qulūbihim maraḍun yanẓurūna ilayka naẓara l-maghshiyi ʿalayhi mina l-mawti fa-awlā lahum', 'মু’মিনরা বলে- একটি সূরাহ নাযিল হয় না কেন? অতঃপর যখন কোন সুস্পষ্ট অর্থবোধক সূরাহ অবতীর্ণ হয় আর তাতে যুদ্ধের কথা উল্লেখ থাকে, তখন যাদের অন্তরে রোগ আছে তুমি তাদেরকে দেখবে মৃত্যুর ভয়ে জ্ঞানহারা লোকের মত তোমার দিকে তাকাচ্ছে। কাজেই ধ্বংস তাদের জন্য।', 'Those who believe say, "Why has a surah not been sent down? But when a precise surah is revealed and fighting is mentioned therein, you see those in whose hearts is hypocrisy looking at you with a look of one overcome by death. And more appropriate for them [would have been]', 'মু’মিনরা বলে- একটি সূরাহ নাযিল হয় না কেন? অতঃপর যখন কোন সুস্পষ্ট অর্থবোধক সূরাহ অবতীর্ণ হয় আর তাতে যুদ্ধের কথা উল্লেখ থাকে, তখন যাদের অন্তরে রোগ আছে তুমি তাদেরকে দেখবে মৃত্যুর ভয়ে জ্ঞানহারা লোকের মত তোমার দিকে তাকাচ্ছে। কাজেই ধ্বংস তাদের জন্য।', 'Those who believe say, "Why has a surah not been sent down? But when a precise surah is revealed and fighting is mentioned therein, you see those in whose hearts is hypocrisy looking at you with a look of one overcome by death. And more appropriate for them [would have been]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047020.mp3', now()),
  (47, 21, '', '[{"id":23624,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"طَاعَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ṭāʿatun","translation_bn":"(তাদের মুখে তো) আনুগত্য","root":"طوع","lemma":"طَاعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23625,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْلٌۭ","transliteration":"waqawlun","translation_bn":"ও কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23626,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّعْرُوفٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"maʿrūfun","translation_bn":"ন্যায়সংগত / ভালো ভালো","root":"عرف","lemma":"مَّعْرُوف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23628,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23629,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَزَمَ","transliteration":"ʿazama","translation_bn":"চূড়ান্ত হলো","root":"عزم","lemma":"عَزَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23630,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","transliteration":"l-amru","translation_bn":"(জিহাদের) বিষয়টি","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23631,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَلَوْ","transliteration":"falaw","translation_bn":"তখন যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23632,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صَدَقُوا۟","transliteration":"ṣadaqū","translation_bn":"তারা সত্য প্রমাণ করত","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23633,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে( দেওয়া ওয়াদা)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23634,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكَانَ","transliteration":"lakāna","translation_bn":"অবশই হতো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":23635,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23636,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23637,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ṭāʿatun waqawlun maʿrūfun fa-idhā ʿazama l-amru falaw ṣadaqū l-laha lakāna khayran lahum', '(আল্লাহর) আনুগত্য করা ও ন্যায়সঙ্গত কথা বলা। অতঃপর যুদ্ধের সিদ্ধান্ত হলে তারা যদি আল্লাহর নিকট দেয়া অঙ্গীকার পূর্ণ করত, তবে তা তাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর হত।', 'Obedience and good words. And when the matter [of fighting] was determined, if they had been true to Allah, it would have been better for them.', '(আল্লাহর) আনুগত্য করা ও ন্যায়সঙ্গত কথা বলা। অতঃপর যুদ্ধের সিদ্ধান্ত হলে তারা যদি আল্লাহর নিকট দেয়া অঙ্গীকার পূর্ণ করত, তবে তা তাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর হত।', 'Obedience and good words. And when the matter [of fighting] was determined, if they had been true to Allah, it would have been better for them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047021.mp3', now()),
  (47, 22, '', '[{"id":24602,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24603,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَسَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ʿasaytum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের হতে  এ সম্ভাবনা আছে?","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24604,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":24605,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّيْتُمْ","transliteration":"tawallaytum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ক্ষমতায় অধিষ্ঠিত হও","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24606,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":24607,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُفْسِدُوا۟","transliteration":"tuf''sidū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করবে","root":"فسد","lemma":"أَفْسَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24608,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24609,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24610,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَتُقَطِّعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"watuqaṭṭiʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ছিন্ন করবে","root":"قطع","lemma":"قَطَّعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24611,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَرْحَامَكُمْ","transliteration":"arḥāmakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের আত্মীয়তার বন্ধনসমূহকে","root":"رحم","lemma":"أَرْحَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24612,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fahal ʿasaytum in tawallaytum an tuf''sidū fī l-arḍi watuqaṭṭiʿū arḥāmakum', 'ক্ষমতা পেলে সম্ভবতঃ তোমরা পৃথিবীতে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করবে আর আত্মীয়তার বন্ধন ছিন্ন করবে।', 'So would you perhaps, if you turned away, cause corruption on earth and sever your [ties of] relationship?', 'ক্ষমতা পেলে সম্ভবতঃ তোমরা পৃথিবীতে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করবে আর আত্মীয়তার বন্ধন ছিন্ন করবে।', 'So would you perhaps, if you turned away, cause corruption on earth and sever your [ties of] relationship?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047022.mp3', now()),
  (47, 23, '', '[{"id":25685,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":25686,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":25687,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَعَنَهُمُ","transliteration":"laʿanahumu","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে অভিশাপ দিয়েছেন","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25688,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25689,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصَمَّهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-aṣammahum","translation_bn":"এরপর তাদেরকে বধির করে দিয়েছেন","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25690,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعْمَىٰٓ","transliteration":"wa-aʿmā","translation_bn":"ও অন্ধ করে দিয়েছেন","root":"عمي","lemma":"عَمِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25691,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَبْصَـٰرَهُمْ","transliteration":"abṣārahum","translation_bn":"তাদের দৃষ্টি শক্তিকে","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25692,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika alladhīna laʿanahumu l-lahu fa-aṣammahum wa-aʿmā abṣārahum', 'এদের প্রতিই আল্লাহ অভিসম্পাত করেন, অতঃপর তাদেরকে বধির করেন আর তাদের দৃষ্টিশক্তিকে করেন অন্ধ।', 'Those [who do so] are the ones that Allah has cursed, so He deafened them and blinded their vision.', 'এদের প্রতিই আল্লাহ অভিসম্পাত করেন, অতঃপর তাদেরকে বধির করেন আর তাদের দৃষ্টিশক্তিকে করেন অন্ধ।', 'Those [who do so] are the ones that Allah has cursed, so He deafened them and blinded their vision.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047023.mp3', now()),
  (47, 24, '', '[{"id":26638,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"না তবে কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":26639,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَدَبَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatadabbarūna","translation_bn":"তারা চিন্তা গবেষণা করে","root":"دبر","lemma":"يَتَدَبَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26640,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","transliteration":"l-qur''āna","translation_bn":"কুরআন (সম্বন্ধে)","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26641,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26642,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26643,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبٍ","transliteration":"qulūbin","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26644,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَقْفَالُهَآ","transliteration":"aqfāluhā","translation_bn":"তাদের তালা (পড়েছে)","root":"قفل","lemma":"أَقْفَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26645,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afalā yatadabbarūna l-qur''āna am ʿalā qulūbin aqfāluhā', 'তারা কি কুরআন সম্বন্ধে গভীরভাবে চিন্তা করে না, না তাদের অন্তরে তালা দেয়া আছে?', 'Then do they not reflect upon the Qur''an, or are there locks upon [their] hearts?', 'তারা কি কুরআন সম্বন্ধে গভীরভাবে চিন্তা করে না, না তাদের অন্তরে তালা দেয়া আছে?', 'Then do they not reflect upon the Qur''an, or are there locks upon [their] hearts?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047024.mp3', now()),
  (47, 25, '', '[{"id":27772,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":27773,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":27774,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱرْتَدُّوا۟","transliteration":"ir''taddū","translation_bn":"ফিরে যায়","root":"ردد","lemma":"ٱرْتَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27775,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27776,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَدْبَـٰرِهِم","transliteration":"adbārihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পিছনের","root":"دبر","lemma":"دُبُر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27777,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27778,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"এরপরেও","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27779,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":27780,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَبَيَّنَ","transliteration":"tabayyana","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"بين","lemma":"تَبَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27781,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27782,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَى ۙ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) সৎপথ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27784,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27785,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَوَّلَ","transliteration":"sawwala","translation_bn":"শোভন করে দেখায়","root":"سول","lemma":"سَوَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27786,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (একাজ)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27787,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْلَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-amlā","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা আশা দেয়","root":"ملو","lemma":"أَمْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27788,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27789,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna ir''taddū ʿalā adbārihim min baʿdi mā tabayyana lahumu l-hudā l-shayṭānu sawwala lahum wa-amlā lahum', 'যাদের কাছে সঠিক পথ সুস্পষ্ট হওয়ার পর তারা পিছনে ফিরে যায়, শয়ত্বান তাদের জন্য তাদের কাজকে সুন্দর করে দেখায়, আর তাদেরকে দেয় মিথ্যা আশা।', 'Indeed, those who reverted back [to disbelief] after guidance had become clear to them - Satan enticed them and prolonged hope for them.', 'যাদের কাছে সঠিক পথ সুস্পষ্ট হওয়ার পর তারা পিছনে ফিরে যায়, শয়ত্বান তাদের জন্য তাদের কাজকে সুন্দর করে দেখায়, আর তাদেরকে দেয় মিথ্যা আশা।', 'Indeed, those who reverted back [to disbelief] after guidance had become clear to them - Satan enticed them and prolonged hope for them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047025.mp3', now()),
  (47, 26, '', '[{"id":28725,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":28726,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28727,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28728,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের)-কে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28729,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَرِهُوا۟","transliteration":"karihū","translation_bn":"অপছন্দ করেছে","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرِهَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28730,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":28731,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَزَّلَ","transliteration":"nazzala","translation_bn":"অবতরণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28732,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28733,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَنُطِيعُكُمْ","transliteration":"sanuṭīʿukum","translation_bn":"\"অচিরেই আমরা তোমাদের আনুগত্য করব","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":28734,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28735,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضِ","transliteration":"baʿḍi","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28736,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-amri","translation_bn":"বিষয়ের\"","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28738,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28739,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28740,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَارَهُمْ","transliteration":"is''rārahum","translation_bn":"তাদের গোপন অভিসন্ধি (সম্পর্কে)","root":"سرر","lemma":"إِسْرَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28741,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-annahum qālū lilladhīna karihū mā nazzala l-lahu sanuṭīʿukum fī baʿḍi l-amri wal-lahu yaʿlamu is''rārahum', 'এ কারণেই আল্লাহ যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তাকে যারা অপছন্দ করে তাদেরকে তারা বলে দিয়েছে যে, কোন কোন ব্যাপারে আমরা তোমাদেরকে মানবো। আল্লাহ তাদের গোপন কথাবার্তাকে খুব ভাল করেই জানেন।', 'That is because they said to those who disliked what Allah sent down, "We will obey you in part of the matter." And Allah knows what they conceal.', 'এ কারণেই আল্লাহ যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তাকে যারা অপছন্দ করে তাদেরকে তারা বলে দিয়েছে যে, কোন কোন ব্যাপারে আমরা তোমাদেরকে মানবো। আল্লাহ তাদের গোপন কথাবার্তাকে খুব ভাল করেই জানেন।', 'That is because they said to those who disliked what Allah sent down, "We will obey you in part of the matter." And Allah knows what they conceal.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047026.mp3', now()),
  (47, 27, '', '[{"id":29610,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكَيْفَ","transliteration":"fakayfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কেমন হবে","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29611,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"(তখন) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":29612,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَوَفَّتْهُمُ","transliteration":"tawaffathumu","translation_bn":"তাদের প্রান হরণ করবে","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29613,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29614,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَضْرِبُونَ","transliteration":"yaḍribūna","translation_bn":"তারা মারবে","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29615,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وُجُوهَهُمْ","transliteration":"wujūhahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মুখমন্ডলগুলোতে","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29616,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَدْبَـٰرَهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-adbārahum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের পিঠে","root":"دبر","lemma":"دُبُر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29617,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakayfa idhā tawaffathumu l-malāikatu yaḍribūna wujūhahum wa-adbārahum', 'তখন কেমন দশা হবে যখন ফেরেশতারা তাদের মুখে আর পিঠে মারতে মারতে তাদের জান বের করবে।', 'Then how [will it be] when the angels take them in death, striking their faces and their backs?', 'তখন কেমন দশা হবে যখন ফেরেশতারা তাদের মুখে আর পিঠে মারতে মারতে তাদের জান বের করবে।', 'Then how [will it be] when the angels take them in death, striking their faces and their backs?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047027.mp3', now()),
  (47, 28, '', '[{"id":30653,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":30654,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمُ","transliteration":"bi-annahumu","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30655,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعُوا۟","transliteration":"ittabaʿū","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করেছিল (সেই পথের)","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30656,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30657,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَسْخَطَ","transliteration":"askhaṭa","translation_bn":"অসন্তুষ্ট করেছে","root":"سخط","lemma":"أَسْخَطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30658,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30659,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَكَرِهُوا۟","transliteration":"wakarihū","translation_bn":"ও তারা অপছন্দ করেছে","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرِهَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30660,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رِضْوَٰنَهُۥ","transliteration":"riḍ''wānahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর সন্তুষ্টির (পথ)","root":"رضو","lemma":"رِضْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30661,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَأَحْبَطَ","transliteration":"fa-aḥbaṭa","translation_bn":"ফলে তিনি নষ্ট করে দিয়েছেন","root":"حبط","lemma":"أَحْبَطَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30662,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কর্মসমূহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30663,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bi-annahumu ittabaʿū mā askhaṭa l-laha wakarihū riḍ''wānahu fa-aḥbaṭa aʿmālahum', 'এর কারণ এই যে, তারা তারই অনুসরণ করে যা আল্লাহকে অসন্তুষ্ট করে, আর তারা তাঁর সন্তোষকে অপছন্দ করে, ফলে তিনি তাদের সমস্ত ‘আমাল নষ্ট করে দিয়েছেন।', 'That is because they followed what angered Allah and disliked [what earns] His pleasure, so He rendered worthless their deeds.', 'এর কারণ এই যে, তারা তারই অনুসরণ করে যা আল্লাহকে অসন্তুষ্ট করে, আর তারা তাঁর সন্তোষকে অপছন্দ করে, ফলে তিনি তাদের সমস্ত ‘আমাল নষ্ট করে দিয়েছেন।', 'That is because they followed what angered Allah and disliked [what earns] His pleasure, so He rendered worthless their deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047028.mp3', now()),
