","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am ḥasiba alladhīna fī qulūbihim maraḍun an lan yukh''rija l-lahu aḍghānahum', 'যাদের অন্তরে রোগ আছে তারা কি মনে করে যে, আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাদের লুকানো বিদ্বেষভাব প্রকাশ করে দিবেন না?', 'Or do those in whose hearts is disease think that Allah would never expose their [feelings of] hatred?', 'যাদের অন্তরে রোগ আছে তারা কি মনে করে যে, আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাদের লুকানো বিদ্বেষভাব প্রকাশ করে দিবেন না?', 'Or do those in whose hearts is disease think that Allah would never expose their [feelings of] hatred?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047029.mp3', now()),
  (47, 30, '', '[{"id":32568,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32569,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَشَآءُ","transliteration":"nashāu","translation_bn":"আমরা ইচ্ছে করি","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32570,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَأَرَيْنَـٰكَهُمْ","transliteration":"la-araynākahum","translation_bn":"আমরা অবশ্যই তাদের দেখাতে পারি","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":32571,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَعَرَفْتَهُم","transliteration":"falaʿaraftahum","translation_bn":"তুমি তখন তাদের চিনবেই","root":"عرف","lemma":"عَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32572,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِسِيمَـٰهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"bisīmāhum","translation_bn":"দ্বারা তাদের লক্ষণগুলো","root":"سوم","lemma":"سِيمَٰ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32574,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَتَعْرِفَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"walataʿrifannahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে তুমি অবশ্যই চিনবে","root":"عرف","lemma":"عَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32575,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32576,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَحْنِ","transliteration":"laḥni","translation_bn":"ভংগিতে","root":"لحن","lemma":"لَحْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32577,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-qawli","translation_bn":"কথা (বলার)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32579,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌ই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32580,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32581,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কর্মসমূহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32582,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw nashāu la-araynākahum falaʿaraftahum bisīmāhum walataʿrifannahum fī laḥni l-qawli wal-lahu yaʿlamu aʿmālakum', 'আমি যদি ইচ্ছে করতাম তাহলে আমি তোমায় ওদেরকে দেখিয়ে দিতাম। তুমি তাদের মুখ দেখে অবশ্যই চিনতে পারবে আর তাদের কথাবার্তার ধরন দেখে তুমি তাদেরকে অবশ্যই অবশ্যই চিনতে পারবে। আল্লাহ তোমাদের ‘আমাল সম্পর্কে ভালভাবেই জানেন।', 'And if We willed, We could show them to you, and you would know them by their mark; but you will surely know them by the tone of [their] speech. And Allah knows your deeds.', 'আমি যদি ইচ্ছে করতাম তাহলে আমি তোমায় ওদেরকে দেখিয়ে দিতাম। তুমি তাদের মুখ দেখে অবশ্যই চিনতে পারবে আর তাদের কথাবার্তার ধরন দেখে তুমি তাদেরকে অবশ্যই অবশ্যই চিনতে পারবে। আল্লাহ তোমাদের ‘আমাল সম্পর্কে ভালভাবেই জানেন।', 'And if We willed, We could show them to you, and you would know them by their mark; but you will surely know them by the tone of [their] speech. And Allah knows your deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047030.mp3', now()),
  (47, 31, '', '[{"id":33458,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَنَبْلُوَنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"walanabluwannakum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমাদের পরীক্ষা করব  আমরা অবশ্যই","root":"بلو","lemma":"بَلَوْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33459,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33460,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"naʿlama","translation_bn":"আমরা জানবো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33461,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجَـٰهِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-mujāhidīna","translation_bn":"মুজাহিদদেরকে","root":"جهد","lemma":"مُجَٰهِدِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33462,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33463,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","transliteration":"wal-ṣābirīna","translation_bn":"ও ধৈর্যশীলদেরকে","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَابِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33464,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَنَبْلُوَا۟","transliteration":"wanabluwā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা পরীক্ষা করবো","root":"بلو","lemma":"بَلَوْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33465,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَخْبَارَكُمْ","transliteration":"akhbārakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের খবরাদি","root":"خبر","lemma":"أَخْبَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33466,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walanabluwannakum ḥattā naʿlama l-mujāhidīna minkum wal-ṣābirīna wanabluwā akhbārakum', 'আমি তোমাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই পরীক্ষা করব যতক্ষণ না আমি জেনে নিতে পারি তোমাদের মধ্যে মুজাহিদ আর ধৈর্যশীলদেরকে, আর তোমাদের অবস্থা যাচাই করতে পারি।', 'And We will surely test you until We make evident those who strive among you [for the cause of Allah] and the patient, and We will test your affairs.', 'আমি তোমাদেরকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই পরীক্ষা করব যতক্ষণ না আমি জেনে নিতে পারি তোমাদের মধ্যে মুজাহিদ আর ধৈর্যশীলদেরকে, আর তোমাদের অবস্থা যাচাই করতে পারি।', 'And We will surely test you until We make evident those who strive among you [for the cause of Allah] and the patient, and We will test your affairs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047031.mp3', now()),
  (47, 32, '', '[{"id":34484,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":34485,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":34486,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34487,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدُّوا۟","transliteration":"waṣaddū","translation_bn":"ও বাধা দিয়েছে (লোকদেরকে)","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34488,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34489,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34490,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34491,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَشَآقُّوا۟","transliteration":"washāqqū","translation_bn":"এবং বিরোধিতা করেছে","root":"شقق","lemma":"شَا^قُّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34492,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","transliteration":"l-rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসুলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34493,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34494,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"এরপরেও","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34495,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":34496,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَبَيَّنَ","transliteration":"tabayyana","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"بين","lemma":"تَبَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34497,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34498,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) সৎপথ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34499,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":34500,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَضُرُّوا۟","transliteration":"yaḍurrū","translation_bn":"তারা ক্ষতি করতে পারবে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34501,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34502,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্রও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34503,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَسَيُحْبِطُ","transliteration":"wasayuḥ''biṭu","translation_bn":"এবং অচিরেই তিনি বিনষ্ট করে দিবেন","root":"حبط","lemma":"أَحْبَطَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":34504,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কর্মসমূহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34505,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna kafarū waṣaddū ʿan sabīli l-lahi washāqqū l-rasūla min baʿdi mā tabayyana lahumu l-hudā lan yaḍurrū l-laha shayan wasayuḥ''biṭu aʿmālahum', 'যারা কুফুরী করে আর আল্লাহর পথে চলতে বাধা সৃষ্টি করে, আর তাদের নিকট সত্য পথ স্পষ্ট হয়ে যাওয়ার পরও রসূলের বিরোধিতা করে, তারা আল্লাহর কোনই ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। আল্লাহ তাদের যাবতীয় ‘আমাল নষ্ট করে দিবেন।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieved and averted [people] from the path of Allah and opposed the Messenger after guidance had become clear to them - never will they harm Allah at all, and He will render worthless their deeds.', 'যারা কুফুরী করে আর আল্লাহর পথে চলতে বাধা সৃষ্টি করে, আর তাদের নিকট সত্য পথ স্পষ্ট হয়ে যাওয়ার পরও রসূলের বিরোধিতা করে, তারা আল্লাহর কোনই ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। আল্লাহ তাদের যাবতীয় ‘আমাল নষ্ট করে দিবেন।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieved and averted [people] from the path of Allah and opposed the Messenger after guidance had become clear to them - never will they harm Allah at all, and He will render worthless their deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047032.mp3', now()),
  (47, 33, '', '[{"id":36021,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":36022,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36023,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36024,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36025,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36026,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"ও আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36027,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","transliteration":"l-rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসুলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36028,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36029,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُبْطِلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tub''ṭilū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিনষ্ট করো","root":"بطل","lemma":"يُبْطِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36030,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কর্মসমূহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36031,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū aṭīʿū l-laha wa-aṭīʿū l-rasūla walā tub''ṭilū aʿmālakum', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহর আনুগত্য কর আর রসূলের আনুগত্য কর আর তোমাদের ‘আমালগুলোকে নষ্ট করে দিও না।', 'O you who have believed, obey Allah and obey the Messenger and do not invalidate your deeds.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহর আনুগত্য কর আর রসূলের আনুগত্য কর আর তোমাদের ‘আমালগুলোকে নষ্ট করে দিও না।', 'O you who have believed, obey Allah and obey the Messenger and do not invalidate your deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047033.mp3', now()),
  (47, 34, '', '[{"id":36296,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36297,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36298,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36299,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدُّوا۟","transliteration":"waṣaddū","translation_bn":"ও বাধা দিয়েছে (লোকদেরকে)","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36300,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36301,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36302,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36303,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"তারপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36304,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"mātū","translation_bn":"তারা মারা গেছে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36305,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্থায় যে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":36306,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُفَّارٌۭ","transliteration":"kuffārun","translation_bn":"কাফের (ছিল)","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36307,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَلَن","transliteration":"falan","translation_bn":"ফলে কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36308,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَغْفِرَ","transliteration":"yaghfira","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36309,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36310,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36311,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna kafarū waṣaddū ʿan sabīli l-lahi thumma mātū wahum kuffārun falan yaghfira l-lahu lahum', 'যারা কুফরী করে আর (মানুষকে) আল্লাহর পথে চলতে বাধা দেয় আর এভাবে কাফির অবস্থাতেই মৃত্যুবরণ করে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে কক্ষনো ক্ষমা করবেন না।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieved and averted [people] from the path of Allah and then died while they were disbelievers - never will Allah forgive them.', 'যারা কুফরী করে আর (মানুষকে) আল্লাহর পথে চলতে বাধা দেয় আর এভাবে কাফির অবস্থাতেই মৃত্যুবরণ করে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে কক্ষনো ক্ষমা করবেন না।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieved and averted [people] from the path of Allah and then died while they were disbelievers - never will Allah forgive them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047034.mp3', now()),
  (47, 35, '', '[{"id":37095,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37096,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَهِنُوا۟","transliteration":"tahinū","translation_bn":"তোমরা সাহস হারিয়ো না","root":"وهن","lemma":"وَهَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37097,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَتَدْعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"watadʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা আহবান করো (না)","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37098,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37099,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّلْمِ","transliteration":"l-salmi","translation_bn":"সন্ধির","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَّلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37100,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمُ","transliteration":"wa-antumu","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরাই (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمُ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":37101,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْلَوْنَ","transliteration":"l-aʿlawna","translation_bn":"বিজয়ী","root":"علو","lemma":"أَعْلَوْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37102,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37103,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكُمْ","transliteration":"maʿakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাথে (আছেন)","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":37104,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَن","transliteration":"walan","translation_bn":"এবং কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37105,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَتِرَكُمْ","transliteration":"yatirakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কমাবেন","root":"وتر","lemma":"يَتِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37106,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কর্মসমূহকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37107,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā tahinū watadʿū ilā l-salmi wa-antumu l-aʿlawna wal-lahu maʿakum walan yatirakum aʿmālakum', 'কাজেই তোমরা সাহস-হারা হয়ে যেও না আর সন্ধির আবেদন করে বসো না, প্রবল তো তোমরাই। আল্লাহ তোমাদের সঙ্গে আছেন, তিনি তোমাদের ‘আমাল কক্ষনো বিনষ্ট করবেন না।', 'So do not weaken and call for peace while you are superior; and Allah is with you and will never deprive you of [the reward of] your deeds.', 'কাজেই তোমরা সাহস-হারা হয়ে যেও না আর সন্ধির আবেদন করে বসো না, প্রবল তো তোমরাই। আল্লাহ তোমাদের সঙ্গে আছেন, তিনি তোমাদের ‘আমাল কক্ষনো বিনষ্ট করবেন না।', 'So do not weaken and call for peace while you are superior; and Allah is with you and will never deprive you of [the reward of] your deeds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047035.mp3', now()),
  (47, 36, '', '[{"id":37907,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":37908,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","translation_bn":"জীবন","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37909,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37910,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَعِبٌۭ","transliteration":"laʿibun","translation_bn":"খেলা","root":"لعب","lemma":"لَعِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37911,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهْوٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"walahwun","translation_bn":"ও তামাশা (মাত্র)","root":"لهو","lemma":"لَهْو","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37913,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37914,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْمِنُوا۟","transliteration":"tu''minū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37915,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَتَتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"watattaqū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা ভয় করে চল","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37916,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِكُمْ","transliteration":"yu''tikum","translation_bn":"তিনি তোমাদের দান করবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37917,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أُجُورَكُمْ","transliteration":"ujūrakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কর্মফলসমূহকে","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37918,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37919,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔلْكُمْ","transliteration":"yasalkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের থেকে তিনি চান","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37920,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلَكُمْ","transliteration":"amwālakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সম্পদগুলোকে","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37921,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā l-ḥayatu l-dun''yā laʿibun walahwun wa-in tu''minū watattaqū yu''tikum ujūrakum walā yasalkum amwālakum', 'দুনিয়ার এ জীবন তো খেলা আর তামাশা মাত্র। তোমরা যদি ঈমান আন, আর আল্লাহকে ভয় করে চল, তিনি তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের প্রতিফল দিবেন (আর এর বিপরীতে) তিনি তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের মাল ধন চাইবেন না।', '[This] worldly life is only amusement and diversion. And if you believe and fear Allah, He will give you your rewards and not ask you for your properties.', 'দুনিয়ার এ জীবন তো খেলা আর তামাশা মাত্র। তোমরা যদি ঈমান আন, আর আল্লাহকে ভয় করে চল, তিনি তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের প্রতিফল দিবেন (আর এর বিপরীতে) তিনি তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের মাল ধন চাইবেন না।', '[This] worldly life is only amusement and diversion. And if you believe and fear Allah, He will give you your rewards and not ask you for your properties.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047036.mp3', now()),
  (47, 37, '', '[{"id":39292,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":39293,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔلْكُمُوهَا","transliteration":"yasalkumūhā","translation_bn":"তা তোমাদের থেকে চান তিনি","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39294,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَيُحْفِكُمْ","transliteration":"fayuḥ''fikum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তোমাদেরকে  চাপ দেন","root":"حفو","lemma":"يُحْفِ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39295,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَبْخَلُوا۟","transliteration":"tabkhalū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কৃপণতা করবে","root":"بخل","lemma":"بَخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39296,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيُخْرِجْ","transliteration":"wayukh''rij","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি প্রকাশ করবেন","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39297,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَضْغَـٰنَكُمْ","transliteration":"aḍghānakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের গোপন ত্রুটিকে","root":"ضغن","lemma":"أَضْغَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39298,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in yasalkumūhā fayuḥ''fikum tabkhalū wayukh''rij aḍghānakum', 'তিনি যদি তোমাদের কাছে তা চাইতেন আর সেজন্য চাপ দিতেন তাহলে তোমরা কৃপণতা করতে আর তাতে তিনি তোমাদের বিদ্বেষভাব প্রকাশ করে দিতেন।', 'If He should ask you for them and press you, you would withhold, and He would expose your unwillingness.', 'তিনি যদি তোমাদের কাছে তা চাইতেন আর সেজন্য চাপ দিতেন তাহলে তোমরা কৃপণতা করতে আর তাতে তিনি তোমাদের বিদ্বেষভাব প্রকাশ করে দিতেন।', 'If He should ask you for them and press you, you would withhold, and He would expose your unwillingness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047037.mp3', now()),
  (47, 38, '', '[{"id":39594,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"hāantum","translation_bn":"তোমরা দেখ","root":"—","lemma":"هَـٰٓأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":39595,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক (যাদের)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":39596,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُدْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"tud''ʿawna","translation_bn":"আহবান করা হচ্ছে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39597,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِتُنفِقُوا۟","transliteration":"litunfiqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা খরচ কর যেন","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39598,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39599,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39600,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39601,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنكُم","transliteration":"faminkum","translation_bn":"তখন তোমাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39602,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39603,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَبْخَلُ ۖ","transliteration":"yabkhalu","translation_bn":"কৃপণতা করে","root":"بخل","lemma":"بَخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39605,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"অথচ যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39606,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَبْخَلْ","transliteration":"yabkhal","translation_bn":"কৃপণতা করে","root":"بخل","lemma":"بَخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39607,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"fa-innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39608,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَبْخَلُ","transliteration":"yabkhalu","translation_bn":"সে কৃপণতা করে","root":"بخل","lemma":"بَخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39609,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39610,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَّفْسِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"nafsihi","translation_bn":"তার নিজের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39612,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39613,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39614,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمُ","transliteration":"wa-antumu","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمُ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":39615,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفُقَرَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-fuqarāu","translation_bn":"অভাবগ্রস্ত","root":"فقر","lemma":"فَقِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39617,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39618,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَتَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tatawallaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা মুখ ফিরাও (তবে)","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39619,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَبْدِلْ","transliteration":"yastabdil","translation_bn":"তিনি পরিবর্তন করে আনবেন","root":"بدل","lemma":"يَسْتَبْدِلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39620,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"(অন্য এক) জাতিকে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39621,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَكُمْ","transliteration":"ghayrakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ব্যতীত","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39622,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39623,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39624,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yakūnū","translation_bn":"তারা হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39625,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"أَمْثَـٰلَكُم","transliteration":"amthālakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মতো","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39626,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hāantum hāulāi tud''ʿawna litunfiqū fī sabīli l-lahi faminkum man yabkhalu waman yabkhal fa-innamā yabkhalu ʿan nafsihi wal-lahu l-ghaniyu wa-antumu l-fuqarāu wa-in tatawallaw yastabdil qawman ghayrakum thumma lā yakūnū amthālakum', 'দেখ, তোমরা তো তারাই, তোমাদেরকে আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করার জন্য ডাক দেয়া হচ্ছে, তখন তোমাদের কিছু লোক কৃপণতা করছে। যে কৃপণতা করে, সে কৃপণতা করে কেবল নিজের আত্মার সাথে। আল্লাহ তো অভাবহীন আর তোমরাই অভাবী। তোমরা যদি মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও তাহলে তিনি তোমাদের পরিবর্তে অন্য জাতিকে নিয়ে আসবেন, তখন তারা তোমাদের মত হবে না।', 'Here you are - those invited to spend in the cause of Allah - but among you are those who withhold [out of greed]. And whoever withholds only withholds [benefit] from himself; and Allah is the Free of need, while you are the needy. And if you turn away, He will replace you with another people; then they will not be the likes of you.', 'দেখ, তোমরা তো তারাই, তোমাদেরকে আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করার জন্য ডাক দেয়া হচ্ছে, তখন তোমাদের কিছু লোক কৃপণতা করছে। যে কৃপণতা করে, সে কৃপণতা করে কেবল নিজের আত্মার সাথে। আল্লাহ তো অভাবহীন আর তোমরাই অভাবী। তোমরা যদি মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও তাহলে তিনি তোমাদের পরিবর্তে অন্য জাতিকে নিয়ে আসবেন, তখন তারা তোমাদের মত হবে না।', 'Here you are - those invited to spend in the cause of Allah - but among you are those who withhold [out of greed]. And whoever withholds only withholds [benefit] from himself; and Allah is the Free of need, while you are the needy. And if you turn away, He will replace you with another people; then they will not be the likes of you.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/047038.mp3', now())
