mar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27836,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"لَعَذَّبْنَا","transliteration":"laʿadhabnā","translation_bn":"আমরা শাস্তি দিতাম অবশ্যই","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":27837,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":27838,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27839,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27840,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27841,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمًا","transliteration":"alīman","translation_bn":"যন্ত্রণাদায়ক","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27842,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'humu alladhīna kafarū waṣaddūkum ʿani l-masjidi l-ḥarāmi wal-hadya maʿkūfan an yablugha maḥillahu walawlā rijālun mu''minūna wanisāon mu''minātun lam taʿlamūhum an taṭaūhum fatuṣībakum min''hum maʿarratun bighayri ʿil''min liyud''khila l-lahu fī raḥmatihi man yashāu law tazayyalū laʿadhabnā alladhīna kafarū min''hum ʿadhāban alīman', 'কুফুরী তো তারাই করেছিল আর তোমাদেরকে মাসজিদুল হারাম থেকে বাধা দিয়েছিল। বাধা দিয়েছিল কুরবানীর পশুগুলোকে কুরবানীর স্থানে পৌঁছতে। মু’মিন পুরুষ আর মু’মিন নারীরা যদি (মাক্কায় কাফিরদের মাঝে) না থাকত যাদের সম্পর্কে তোমরা জান না আর অজ্ঞতাবশতই তোমরা তাদেরকে পর্যুদস্ত করে দিবে যার ফলে তোমাদের উপর কলঙ্ক লেপন হবে-এমন সম্ভাবনা না থাকত, তাহলে তোমাদেরকে যুদ্ধের আদেশ দেয়া হত। যুদ্ধের আদেশ দেয়া হয়নি যাতে আল্লাহ যাকে ইচ্ছে তাঁর রহমাতের মধ্যে শামিল করে নিতে পারেন। (মাক্কায় অনেক মু’মিন আর কাফিররা একত্রিত না থেকে) যদি তারা পৃথক হয়ে থাকত, তাহলে আমি তাদের মধ্যে কাফিরদেরকে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি দিতাম।', 'They are the ones who disbelieved and obstructed you from al-Masjid al-Haram while the offering was prevented from reaching its place of sacrifice. And if not for believing men and believing women whom you did not know - that you might trample them and there would befall you because of them dishonor without [your] knowledge - [you would have been permitted to enter Makkah]. [This was so] that Allah might admit to His mercy whom He willed. If they had been apart [from them], We would have punished those who disbelieved among them with painful punishment', 'কুফুরী তো তারাই করেছিল আর তোমাদেরকে মাসজিদুল হারাম থেকে বাধা দিয়েছিল। বাধা দিয়েছিল কুরবানীর পশুগুলোকে কুরবানীর স্থানে পৌঁছতে। মু’মিন পুরুষ আর মু’মিন নারীরা যদি (মাক্কায় কাফিরদের মাঝে) না থাকত যাদের সম্পর্কে তোমরা জান না আর অজ্ঞতাবশতই তোমরা তাদেরকে পর্যুদস্ত করে দিবে যার ফলে তোমাদের উপর কলঙ্ক লেপন হবে-এমন সম্ভাবনা না থাকত, তাহলে তোমাদেরকে যুদ্ধের আদেশ দেয়া হত। যুদ্ধের আদেশ দেয়া হয়নি যাতে আল্লাহ যাকে ইচ্ছে তাঁর রহমাতের মধ্যে শামিল করে নিতে পারেন। (মাক্কায় অনেক মু’মিন আর কাফিররা একত্রিত না থেকে) যদি তারা পৃথক হয়ে থাকত, তাহলে আমি তাদের মধ্যে কাফিরদেরকে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি দিতাম।', 'They are the ones who disbelieved and obstructed you from al-Masjid al-Haram while the offering was prevented from reaching its place of sacrifice. And if not for believing men and believing women whom you did not know - that you might trample them and there would befall you because of them dishonor without [your] knowledge - [you would have been permitted to enter Makkah]. [This was so] that Allah might admit to His mercy whom He willed. If they had been apart [from them], We would have punished those who disbelieved among them with painful punishment', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/048025.mp3', now()),
  (48, 26, '', '[{"id":28762,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":28763,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"পোষণ করল","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28764,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":28765,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিল","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28766,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28767,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمُ","transliteration":"qulūbihimu","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরগুলোর","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28768,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيَّةَ","transliteration":"l-ḥamiyata","translation_bn":"হঠকারিতা","root":"حمي","lemma":"حَمِيَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28769,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَمِيَّةَ","transliteration":"ḥamiyyata","translation_bn":"হঠকারিতা","root":"حمي","lemma":"حَمِيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28770,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِيَّةِ","transliteration":"l-jāhiliyati","translation_bn":"অজ্ঞতার","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَٰهِلِيَّة2","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28771,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنزَلَ","transliteration":"fa-anzala","translation_bn":"তখন অবতীর্ণ করলেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28772,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28773,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَكِينَتَهُۥ","transliteration":"sakīnatahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর প্রশান্তি","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكِينَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28774,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28775,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"rasūlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28776,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَى","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"ও উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28777,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28778,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَأَلْزَمَهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-alzamahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে সংহত করলেন","root":"لزم","lemma":"أَلْزَمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28779,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةَ","transliteration":"kalimata","translation_bn":"(কথায়) নীতিতে","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28780,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","transliteration":"l-taqwā","translation_bn":"তাকওয়ার","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28781,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28782,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَحَقَّ","transliteration":"aḥaqqa","translation_bn":"অধিক যোগ্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"أَحَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28783,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28784,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلَهَا ۚ","transliteration":"wa-ahlahā","translation_bn":"ও তার উপযুক্ত","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28786,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28787,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28788,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28789,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"সবকিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28790,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿalīman","translation_bn":"খুব জ্ঞাত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":28791,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'idh jaʿala alladhīna kafarū fī qulūbihimu l-ḥamiyata ḥamiyyata l-jāhiliyati fa-anzala l-lahu sakīnatahu ʿalā rasūlihi waʿalā l-mu''minīna wa-alzamahum kalimata l-taqwā wakānū aḥaqqa bihā wa-ahlahā wakāna l-lahu bikulli shayin ʿalīman', 'কাফিররা যখন তাদের অন্তরে জিদ ও হঠকারিতা জাগিয়ে তুলল- অজ্ঞতার যুগের জিদ ও হঠকারিতা- তখন আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূল ও মু’মিনদের উপর স্বীয় প্রশান্তি অবতীর্ণ করলেন আর তাদের জন্য তাকওয়া অবলম্বনের নির্দেশ-বাণী অপরিহার্য (রূপে পালনীয়) ক’রে দিলেন; আর তারাই ছিল এর সবচেয়ে বেশি হকদার ও যোগ্য অধিকারী। আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সর্বাধিক জ্ঞানের অধিকারী।', 'When those who disbelieved had put into their hearts chauvinism - the chauvinism of the time of ignorance. But Allah sent down His tranquillity upon His Messenger and upon the believers and imposed upon them the word of righteousness, and they were more deserving of it and worthy of it. And ever is Allah, of all things, Knowing.', 'কাফিররা যখন তাদের অন্তরে জিদ ও হঠকারিতা জাগিয়ে তুলল- অজ্ঞতার যুগের জিদ ও হঠকারিতা- তখন আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূল ও মু’মিনদের উপর স্বীয় প্রশান্তি অবতীর্ণ করলেন আর তাদের জন্য তাকওয়া অবলম্বনের নির্দেশ-বাণী অপরিহার্য (রূপে পালনীয়) ক’রে দিলেন; আর তারাই ছিল এর সবচেয়ে বেশি হকদার ও যোগ্য অধিকারী। আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সর্বাধিক জ্ঞানের অধিকারী।', 'When those who disbelieved had put into their hearts chauvinism - the chauvinism of the time of ignorance. But Allah sent down His tranquillity upon His Messenger and upon the believers and imposed upon them the word of righteousness, and they were more deserving of it and worthy of it. And ever is Allah, of all things, Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/048026.mp3', now()),
  (48, 27, '', '[{"id":29867,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":29868,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"صَدَقَ","transliteration":"ṣadaqa","translation_bn":"সত্য করে দেখিয়েছেন","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29869,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29870,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولَهُ","transliteration":"rasūlahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসুলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29871,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرُّءْيَا","transliteration":"l-ru''yā","translation_bn":"স্বপ্নকে","root":"راي","lemma":"رُّءْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29872,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সঠিকভাবে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29874,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَتَدْخُلُنَّ","transliteration":"latadkhulunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমরা প্রবেশ করবে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":29875,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَسْجِدَ","transliteration":"l-masjida","translation_bn":"মসজিদে","root":"سجد","lemma":"مَسْجِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29876,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرَامَ","transliteration":"l-ḥarāma","translation_bn":"হারামে","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29877,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":29878,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29879,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29880,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنِينَ","transliteration":"āminīna","translation_bn":"নিরাপদে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامِنِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29881,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُحَلِّقِينَ","transliteration":"muḥalliqīna","translation_bn":"(কেউ কেউ) মুণ্ডনকারী","root":"حلق","lemma":"مُحَلِّقِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29882,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رُءُوسَكُمْ","transliteration":"ruūsakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মাথা","root":"راس","lemma":"رَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29883,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمُقَصِّرِينَ","transliteration":"wamuqaṣṣirīna","translation_bn":"ও (কেউ কেউ) চুল ছোটকারী হয়ে","root":"قصر","lemma":"مُقَصِّرِين","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29884,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":29885,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَخَافُونَ ۖ","transliteration":"takhāfūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় পাবে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29887,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلِمَ","transliteration":"faʿalima","translation_bn":"তিনি বস্তুতঃ জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29888,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29889,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":29890,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"taʿlamū","translation_bn":"তোমরা জান","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29891,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"fajaʿala","translation_bn":"তাই তিনি দিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29892,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29893,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29894,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"সেটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":29895,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"فَتْحًۭا","transliteration":"fatḥan","translation_bn":"একটি বিজয়","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتْح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29896,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبًا","transliteration":"qarīban","translation_bn":"আসন্ন","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":29897,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad ṣadaqa l-lahu rasūlahu l-ru''yā bil-ḥaqi latadkhulunna l-masjida l-ḥarāma in shāa l-lahu āminīna muḥalliqīna ruūsakum wamuqaṣṣirīna lā takhāfūna faʿalima mā lam taʿlamū fajaʿala min dūni dhālika fatḥan qarīban', 'আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলকে প্রকৃত সত্য স্বপ্নই দেখিয়েছিলেন। আল্লাহর ইচ্ছায় তোমরা অবশ্য অবশ্যই মাসজিদে হারামে প্রবেশ করবে নিরাপদে, মস্তক মুন্ডিত অবস্থায় ও চুল কেটে, ভয়ভীতিহীন হয়ে। আল্লাহ জানেন, যা তোমরা জান না। (সেই স্বপ্ন তো পূর্ণ হবেই) তদুপরি তিনি দিলেন (হুদাইবিয়ার চুক্তি সম্পাদনের মাধ্যমে) নিকটাসন্ন বিজয়।', 'Certainly has Allah showed to His Messenger the vision in truth. You will surely enter al-Masjid al-Haram, if Allah wills, in safety, with your heads shaved and [hair] shortened, not fearing [anyone]. He knew what you did not know and has arranged before that a conquest near [at hand].', 'আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলকে প্রকৃত সত্য স্বপ্নই দেখিয়েছিলেন। আল্লাহর ইচ্ছায় তোমরা অবশ্য অবশ্যই মাসজিদে হারামে প্রবেশ করবে নিরাপদে, মস্তক মুন্ডিত অবস্থায় ও চুল কেটে, ভয়ভীতিহীন হয়ে। আল্লাহ জানেন, যা তোমরা জান না। (সেই স্বপ্ন তো পূর্ণ হবেই) তদুপরি তিনি দিলেন (হুদাইবিয়ার চুক্তি সম্পাদনের মাধ্যমে) নিকটাসন্ন বিজয়।', 'Certainly has Allah showed to His Messenger the vision in truth. You will surely enter al-Masjid al-Haram, if Allah wills, in safety, with your heads shaved and [hair] shortened, not fearing [anyone]. He knew what you did not know and has arranged before that a conquest near [at hand].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/048027.mp3', now()),
  (48, 28, '', '[{"id":30664,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":30665,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30666,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلَ","transliteration":"arsala","translation_bn":"প্রেরণ করেছেন","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30667,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"rasūlahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসুলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30668,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"bil-hudā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে দিক-নির্দেশনা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30669,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَدِينِ","transliteration":"wadīni","translation_bn":"ও দীন","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30670,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্য (দিয়ে)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30671,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِيُظْهِرَهُۥ","transliteration":"liyuẓ''hirahu","translation_bn":"তা বিজয়ী করার জন্যে","root":"ظهر","lemma":"أَظْهَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30672,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30673,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"l-dīni","translation_bn":"দীনের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30674,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"kullihi","translation_bn":"অন্যান্য সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30676,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَفَىٰ","transliteration":"wakafā","translation_bn":"এবং যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30677,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই এ বিষয়ে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30678,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًۭا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী হিসেবে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30679,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī arsala rasūlahu bil-hudā wadīni l-ḥaqi liyuẓ''hirahu ʿalā l-dīni kullihi wakafā bil-lahi shahīdan', 'তিনিই তাঁর রসূলকে পাঠিয়েছেন হিদায়াত ও সত্য দ্বীন সহকারে সকল দ্বীনের উপর সেটিকে বিজয়ী করার জন্য। (এ ব্যাপারে) সাক্ষী হিসেবে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট।', 'It is He who sent His Messenger with guidance and the religion of truth to manifest it over all religion. And sufficient is Allah as Witness.', 'তিনিই তাঁর রসূলকে পাঠিয়েছেন হিদায়াত ও সত্য দ্বীন সহকারে সকল দ্বীনের উপর সেটিকে বিজয়ী করার জন্য। (এ ব্যাপারে) সাক্ষী হিসেবে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট।', 'It is He who sent His Messenger with guidance and the religion of truth to manifest it over all religion. And sufficient is Allah as Witness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/048028.mp3', now()),
