"translation_bn":"প্রভাবে","root":"اثر","lemma":"أَثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31704,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسُّجُودِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-sujūdi","translation_bn":"সিজদাসমূহের","root":"سجد","lemma":"سُّجُود","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31706,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":31707,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلُهُمْ","transliteration":"mathaluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের গুণ পরিচয়","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31708,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31709,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-tawrāti","translation_bn":"তাওরাতের","root":"—","lemma":"تَّوْرَىٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31711,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَمَثَلُهُمْ","transliteration":"wamathaluhum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের গুণ পরিচয়","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31712,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31713,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنجِيلِ","transliteration":"l-injīli","translation_bn":"ইনজিলেরও","root":"—","lemma":"إِنجِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31714,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"كَزَرْعٍ","transliteration":"kazarʿin","translation_bn":"(তাদের) উপমা একটি চারাগাছের","root":"زرع","lemma":"زَرْع","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31715,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"أَخْرَجَ","transliteration":"akhraja","translation_bn":"(যা) নির্গত করে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31716,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"شَطْـَٔهُۥ","transliteration":"shaṭahu","translation_bn":"তার অংকুর","root":"شطا","lemma":"شَطْـ#","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31717,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"فَـَٔازَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"faāzarahu","translation_bn":"এরপর তাকে শক্তিশালী করে","root":"ازر","lemma":"ا^زَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31718,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَغْلَظَ","transliteration":"fa-is''taghlaẓa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর মোটা হয়","root":"غلظ","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْلَظَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31719,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَوَىٰ","transliteration":"fa-is''tawā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর দৃঢ়ভাবে দাঁড়ায়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31720,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31721,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"سُوقِهِۦ","transliteration":"sūqihi","translation_bn":"তার কাণ্ডের","root":"سوق","lemma":"سُّوق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31722,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"يُعْجِبُ","transliteration":"yuʿ''jibu","translation_bn":"আনন্দ দেয়","root":"عجب","lemma":"أَعْجَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31723,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزُّرَّاعَ","transliteration":"l-zurāʿa","translation_bn":"চাষীদেরকে","root":"زرع","lemma":"زُّرَّاع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31724,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"لِيَغِيظَ","transliteration":"liyaghīẓa","translation_bn":"তিনি জ্বালা সৃষ্টি করেন যেন","root":"غيظ","lemma":"يَغِيظُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31725,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمُ","transliteration":"bihimu","translation_bn":"তাদের কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31726,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفَّارَ ۗ","transliteration":"l-kufāra","translation_bn":"কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31728,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدَ","transliteration":"waʿada","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31729,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31730,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31731,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31732,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31733,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎকর্ম","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31734,"position":51,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31735,"position":52,"text_uthmani":"مَّغْفِرَةًۭ","transliteration":"maghfiratan","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা","root":"غفر","lemma":"مَّغْفِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31736,"position":53,"text_uthmani":"وَأَجْرًا","transliteration":"wa-ajran","translation_bn":"ও পুরস্কার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31737,"position":54,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمًۢا","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":31738,"position":55,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'muḥammadun rasūlu l-lahi wa-alladhīna maʿahu ashiddāu ʿalā l-kufāri ruḥamāu baynahum tarāhum rukkaʿan sujjadan yabtaghūna faḍlan mina l-lahi wariḍ''wānan sīmāhum fī wujūhihim min athari l-sujūdi dhālika mathaluhum fī l-tawrāti wamathaluhum fī l-injīli kazarʿin akhraja shaṭahu faāzarahu fa-is''taghlaẓa fa-is''tawā ʿalā sūqihi yuʿ''jibu l-zurāʿa liyaghīẓa bihimu l-kufāra waʿada l-lahu alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti min''hum maghfiratan wa-ajran ʿaẓīman', 'মুহাম্মাদ আল্লাহর রসুল। আর যে সব লোক তাঁর সঙ্গে আছে তারা কাফিরদের প্রতি অত্যন্ত কঠোর, নিজেদের পরস্পরের প্রতি দয়াশীল। তাদেরকে তুমি দেখবে রুকূ‘ ও সাজদায় অবনত অবস্থায়, তারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও সন্তুষ্টি অনুসন্ধানে নিয়োজিত। তাদের চিহ্ন হল, তাদের মুখমন্ডলে সেজদা্র প্রভাব পরিস্ফুট হয়ে আছে। তাদের এমন দৃষ্টান্তের কথা তাওরাতে আছে, তাদের দৃষ্টান্ত ইঞ্জিলেও আছে। (তারা) যেন একটা চারাগাছ তার কচিপাতা বের করে, তারপর তা শক্ত হয়, অতঃপর তা কান্ডের উপর মজবুত হয়ে দাঁড়িয়ে যায়- যা চাষীকে আনন্দ দেয়। (এভাবে আল্লাহ মু’মিনদেরকে দুর্বল অবস্থা থেকে দৃঢ় ভিত্তির উপর দাঁড় ক’রে দেন) যাতে কাফিরদের অন্তর গোস্বায় জ্বলে যায়। তাদের মধ্য থেকে যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকর্ম করে, আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য ক্ষমা ও মহা পুরস্কারের প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন।', 'Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah; and those with him are forceful against the disbelievers, merciful among themselves. You see them bowing and prostrating [in prayer], seeking bounty from Allah and [His] pleasure. Their mark is on their faces from the trace of prostration. That is their description in the Torah. And their description in the Gospel is as a plant which produces its offshoots and strengthens them so they grow firm and stand upon their stalks, delighting the sowers - so that Allah may enrage by them the disbelievers. Allah has promised those who believe and do righteous deeds among them forgiveness and a great reward.', 'মুহাম্মাদ আল্লাহর রসুল। আর যে সব লোক তাঁর সঙ্গে আছে তারা কাফিরদের প্রতি অত্যন্ত কঠোর, নিজেদের পরস্পরের প্রতি দয়াশীল। তাদেরকে তুমি দেখবে রুকূ‘ ও সাজদায় অবনত অবস্থায়, তারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও সন্তুষ্টি অনুসন্ধানে নিয়োজিত। তাদের চিহ্ন হল, তাদের মুখমন্ডলে সেজদা্র প্রভাব পরিস্ফুট হয়ে আছে। তাদের এমন দৃষ্টান্তের কথা তাওরাতে আছে, তাদের দৃষ্টান্ত ইঞ্জিলেও আছে। (তারা) যেন একটা চারাগাছ তার কচিপাতা বের করে, তারপর তা শক্ত হয়, অতঃপর তা কান্ডের উপর মজবুত হয়ে দাঁড়িয়ে যায়- যা চাষীকে আনন্দ দেয়। (এভাবে আল্লাহ মু’মিনদেরকে দুর্বল অবস্থা থেকে দৃঢ় ভিত্তির উপর দাঁড় ক’রে দেন) যাতে কাফিরদের অন্তর গোস্বায় জ্বলে যায়। তাদের মধ্য থেকে যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকর্ম করে, আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য ক্ষমা ও মহা পুরস্কারের প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন।', 'Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah; and those with him are forceful against the disbelievers, merciful among themselves. You see them bowing and prostrating [in prayer], seeking bounty from Allah and [His] pleasure. Their mark is on their faces from the trace of prostration. That is their description in the Torah. And their description in the Gospel is as a plant which produces its offshoots and strengthens them so they grow firm and stand upon their stalks, delighting the sowers - so that Allah may enrage by them the disbelievers. Allah has promised those who believe and do righteous deeds among them forgiveness and a great reward.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/048029.mp3', now())
INSERT INTO public.quran_verses (surah, ayah, text_uthmani, words, transliteration, bn_text, en_text, conventional_bn, conventional_en, core_meaning_bn, core_meaning_en, modern_translation_bn, modern_translation_en, meta_bn, meta_en, lexicon_modern_notes, audio_url, updated_at)
VALUES
  (49, 1, '', '[{"id":238,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":239,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":240,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":241,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":242,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُقَدِّمُوا۟","transliteration":"tuqaddimū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অগ্রসর হয়ো (কোন বিষয়ে)","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":243,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"আগে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":244,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَدَىِ","transliteration":"yadayi","translation_bn":"আগে","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":245,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":246,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসুলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":248,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":249,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":251,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":252,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":253,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":254,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":255,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১)","root":"—","lemma":"١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā tuqaddimū bayna yadayi l-lahi warasūlihi wa-ittaqū l-laha inna l-laha samīʿun ʿalīmun', 'ওহে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা (কোন বিষয়েই) আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আগে বেড়ে যেয়ো না, আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ সর্বশ্রোতা, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'O you who have believed, do not put [yourselves] before Allah and His Messenger but fear Allah. Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', 'ওহে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা (কোন বিষয়েই) আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আগে বেড়ে যেয়ো না, আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ সর্বশ্রোতা, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'O you who have believed, do not put [yourselves] before Allah and His Messenger but fear Allah. Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049001.mp3', now()),
  (49, 2, '', '[{"id":1072,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":1073,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":1074,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1075,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":1076,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَرْفَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tarfaʿū","translation_bn":"তোমরা উঁচু করো","root":"رفع","lemma":"رَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1077,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَصْوَٰتَكُمْ","transliteration":"aṣwātakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কন্ঠস্বরকে","root":"صوت","lemma":"صَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":1078,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَ","transliteration":"fawqa","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":1079,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صَوْتِ","transliteration":"ṣawti","translation_bn":"কন্ঠস্বরের","root":"صوت","lemma":"صَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":1080,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىِّ","transliteration":"l-nabiyi","translation_bn":"নবীর","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":1081,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":1082,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَجْهَرُوا۟","transliteration":"tajharū","translation_bn":"তোমরা উচ্চ করো (আওয়াজ)","root":"جهر","lemma":"جَهَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1083,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":1084,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقَوْلِ","transliteration":"bil-qawli","translation_bn":"কথা বলার ক্ষেত্রে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":1085,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَجَهْرِ","transliteration":"kajahri","translation_bn":"যেমন উচ্চ হয় (আওয়াজ)","root":"جهر","lemma":"جَهْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":1086,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضِكُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের একে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":1087,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِبَعْضٍ","transliteration":"libaʿḍin","translation_bn":"অপরের (সাথে)","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":1088,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এমন না হয়) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":1089,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَحْبَطَ","transliteration":"taḥbaṭa","translation_bn":"নষ্ট হয়ে যায়","root":"حبط","lemma":"حَبِطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1090,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের আমলগুলো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":1091,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wa-antum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":1092,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":1093,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَشْعُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashʿurūna","translation_bn":"টেরও পাবে","root":"شعر","lemma":"يَشْعُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":1094,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā tarfaʿū aṣwātakum fawqa ṣawti l-nabiyi walā tajharū lahu bil-qawli kajahri baʿḍikum libaʿḍin an taḥbaṭa aʿmālukum wa-antum lā tashʿurūna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা নবীর আওয়াজের উপর তোমাদের আওয়াজ উচ্চ করো না। তোমরা নিজেরা পরস্পরে যেমন উচ্চ আওয়াজে কথা বল, তাঁর সঙ্গে সে রকম উচ্চ আওয়াজে কথা বলো না। তা করলে তোমাদের (যাবতীয়) কাজকর্ম নিস্ফল হয়ে যাবে, আর তোমরা একটু টেরও পাবে না।', 'O you who have believed, do not raise your voices above the voice of the Prophet or be loud to him in speech like the loudness of some of you to others, lest your deeds become worthless while you perceive not.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা নবীর আওয়াজের উপর তোমাদের আওয়াজ উচ্চ করো না। তোমরা নিজেরা পরস্পরে যেমন উচ্চ আওয়াজে কথা বল, তাঁর সঙ্গে সে রকম উচ্চ আওয়াজে কথা বলো না। তা করলে তোমাদের (যাবতীয়) কাজকর্ম নিস্ফল হয়ে যাবে, আর তোমরা একটু টেরও পাবে না।', 'O you who have believed, do not raise your voices above the voice of the Prophet or be loud to him in speech like the loudness of some of you to others, lest your deeds become worthless while you perceive not.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049002.mp3', now()),
  (49, 3, '', '[{"id":2161,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":2162,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":2163,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَغُضُّونَ","transliteration":"yaghuḍḍūna","translation_bn":"নিচু রাখে","root":"غضض","lemma":"يَغُضُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":2164,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَصْوَٰتَهُمْ","transliteration":"aṣwātahum","translation_bn":"তাদের আওয়াজ","root":"صوت","lemma":"صَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":2165,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":2166,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولِ","transliteration":"rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসুলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":2167,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":2168,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":2169,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":2170,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْتَحَنَ","transliteration":"im''taḥana","translation_bn":"যাচাই করে নিয়েছেন","root":"محن","lemma":"ٱمْتَحَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":2171,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":2172,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبَهُمْ","transliteration":"qulūbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরসমূহকে","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":2173,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِلتَّقْوَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"lilttaqwā","translation_bn":"তাকওয়ার জন্য","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":2175,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":2176,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"maghfiratun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা","root":"غفر","lemma":"مَّغْفِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":2177,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَأَجْرٌ","transliteration":"wa-ajrun","translation_bn":"ও পুরস্কার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":2178,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":2179,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna yaghuḍḍūna aṣwātahum ʿinda rasūli l-lahi ulāika alladhīna im''taḥana l-lahu qulūbahum lilttaqwā lahum maghfiratun wa-ajrun ʿaẓīmun', 'যারা আল্লাহর রসূলের সামনে তাদের আওয়াজ নীচু করে, আল্লাহ তাদের অন্তরগুলোকে তাকওয়ার জন্য যাচাই-বাছাই করে নিয়েছেন। তাদের জন্য আছে ক্ষমা আর বিরাট পুরস্কার।', 'Indeed, those who lower their voices before the Messenger of Allah - they are the ones whose hearts Allah has tested for righteousness. For them is forgiveness and great reward.', 'যারা আল্লাহর রসূলের সামনে তাদের আওয়াজ নীচু করে, আল্লাহ তাদের অন্তরগুলোকে তাকওয়ার জন্য যাচাই-বাছাই করে নিয়েছেন। তাদের জন্য আছে ক্ষমা আর বিরাট পুরস্কার।', 'Indeed, those who lower their voices before the Messenger of Allah - they are the ones whose hearts Allah has tested for righteousness. For them is forgiveness and great reward.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049003.mp3', now()),
  (49, 4, '', '[{"id":3486,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":3487,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":3488,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُنَادُونَكَ","transliteration":"yunādūnaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে ডাকাডাকি করে","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":3489,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":3490,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَآءِ","transliteration":"warāi","translation_bn":"পেছন","root":"وري","lemma":"وَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":3491,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُجُرَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ḥujurāti","translation_bn":"কক্ষের","root":"حجر","lemma":"حُجُرَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":3492,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অধিকাংশই","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":3493,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":3494,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানবুদ্ধি রাখে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":3495,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna yunādūnaka min warāi l-ḥujurāti aktharuhum lā yaʿqilūna', 'যারা তোমাকে হুজরার বাইরে থেকে (উচ্চঃস্বরে) ডাকে, তাদের অধিকাংশেরই কোন জ্ঞান নেই।', 'Indeed, those who call you, [O Muhammad], from behind the chambers - most of them do not use reason.', 'যারা তোমাকে হুজরার বাইরে থেকে (উচ্চঃস্বরে) ডাকে, তাদের অধিকাংশেরই কোন জ্ঞান নেই।', 'Indeed, those who call you, [O Muhammad], from behind the chambers - most of them do not use reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049004.mp3', now()),
  (49, 5, '', '[{"id":4840,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি (এমন হতো)","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":4841,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":4842,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"صَبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"ṣabarū","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য ধরত","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":4843,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":4844,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَخْرُجَ","transliteration":"takhruja","translation_bn":"তুমি বের হতে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":4845,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":4846,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَكَانَ","transliteration":"lakāna","translation_bn":"হতো অবশ্যই","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":4847,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":4848,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":4850,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":4851,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":4852,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":4853,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw annahum ṣabarū ḥattā takhruja ilayhim lakāna khayran lahum wal-lahu ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'তারা যদি ধৈর্য ধরত যে পর্যন্ত না তুমি তাদের কাছে বেরিয়ে আস, সেটাই তাদের জন্য উত্তম হত। আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'And if they had been patient until you [could] come out to them, it would have been better for them. But Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'তারা যদি ধৈর্য ধরত যে পর্যন্ত না তুমি তাদের কাছে বেরিয়ে আস, সেটাই তাদের জন্য উত্তম হত। আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'And if they had been patient until you [could] come out to them, it would have been better for them. But Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049005.mp3', now()),
  (49, 6, '', '[{"id":6077,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":6078,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":6079,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6080,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":6081,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আসে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6082,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَاسِقٌۢ","transliteration":"fāsiqun","translation_bn":"কোনো সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":6083,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِنَبَإٍۢ","transliteration":"binaba-in","translation_bn":"কোনো খবর নিয়ে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6084,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fatabayyanū","translation_bn":"তোমরা তখন পরীক্ষা করো","root":"بين","lemma":"تَبَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6085,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এমন না হয়) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":6086,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تُصِيبُوا۟","transliteration":"tuṣībū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ক্ষতি করে বস","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6087,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۢا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":6088,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِجَهَـٰلَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bijahālatin","translation_bn":"অজ্ঞতার কারণে","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَهَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6089,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَتُصْبِحُوا۟","transliteration":"fatuṣ''biḥū","translation_bn":"তাহলে","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6090,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6091,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":6092,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلْتُمْ","transliteration":"faʿaltum","translation_bn":"তোমরা করেছ","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6093,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"نَـٰدِمِينَ","transliteration":"nādimīna","translation_bn":"অনুতাপকারী/ লজ্জিত","root":"ندم","lemma":"نَٰدِمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":6094,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū in jāakum fāsiqun binaba-in fatabayyanū an tuṣībū qawman bijahālatin fatuṣ''biḥū ʿalā mā faʿaltum nādimīna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! কোন পাপাচারী যদি তোমাদের কাছে কোন খবর নিয়ে আসে, তাহলে তার সত্যতা যাচাই করে লও, তা না হলে তোমরা অজ্ঞতাবশতঃ কোন সম্প্রদায়ের ক্ষতি করে বসবে, অতঃপর তোমরা যা করেছ সেজন্য তোমাদেরকে অনুতপ্ত হতে হবে।', 'O you who have believed, if there comes to you a disobedient one with information, investigate, lest you harm a people out of ignorance and become, over what you have done, regretful.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! কোন পাপাচারী যদি তোমাদের কাছে কোন খবর নিয়ে আসে, তাহলে তার সত্যতা যাচাই করে লও, তা না হলে তোমরা অজ্ঞতাবশতঃ কোন সম্প্রদায়ের ক্ষতি করে বসবে, অতঃপর তোমরা যা করেছ সেজন্য তোমাদেরকে অনুতপ্ত হতে হবে।', 'O you who have believed, if there comes to you a disobedient one with information, investigate, lest you harm a people out of ignorance and become, over what you have done, regretful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049006.mp3', now()),
  (49, 7, '', '[{"id":7393,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-iʿ''lamū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা জেনে রাখ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7394,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":7395,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِيكُمْ","transliteration":"fīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7396,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولَ","transliteration":"rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসুল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7397,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":7399,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":7400,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُطِيعُكُمْ","transliteration":"yuṭīʿukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মেনে নেয় সে","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7401,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ভাগ","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7402,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"kathīrin","translation_bn":"বেশির","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7403,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7404,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرِ","transliteration":"l-amri","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7405,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَعَنِتُّمْ","transliteration":"laʿanittum","translation_bn":"তোমরা অবশ্যই কষ্ট পাবে","root":"عنت","lemma":"عَنِ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":7406,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7407,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":7408,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَبَّبَ","transliteration":"ḥabbaba","translation_bn":"প্রিয় করেছেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"حَبَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7409,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ilaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7410,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِيمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-īmāna","translation_bn":"ঈমানকে","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7411,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَزَيَّنَهُۥ","transliteration":"wazayyanahu","translation_bn":"এবং তা শোভন করে দিয়েছেন","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7412,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7413,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِكُمْ","transliteration":"qulūbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের অন্তরের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7414,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَكَرَّهَ","transliteration":"wakarraha","translation_bn":"এবং অপ্রিয় করে দিয়েছেন","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرَّهَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7415,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ilaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7416,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفْرَ","transliteration":"l-kuf''ra","translation_bn":"কুফরী/ অবিশ্বাস","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7417,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْفُسُوقَ","transliteration":"wal-fusūqa","translation_bn":"ও সত্যত্যাগ","root":"فسق","lemma":"فُسُوق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7418,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْعِصْيَانَ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-ʿiṣ''yāna","translation_bn":"এবং অবাধ্যতা (প্রতি)","root":"عصي","lemma":"عِصْيَان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7420,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"এসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":7421,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":7422,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّٰشِدُونَ","transliteration":"l-rāshidūna","translation_bn":"সঠিক পথগামী","root":"رشد","lemma":"رَّٰشِدُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7423,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-iʿ''lamū anna fīkum rasūla l-lahi law yuṭīʿukum fī kathīrin mina l-amri laʿanittum walākinna l-laha ḥabbaba ilaykumu l-īmāna wazayyanahu fī qulūbikum wakarraha ilaykumu l-kuf''ra wal-fusūqa wal-ʿiṣ''yāna ulāika humu l-rāshidūna', 'তোমরা জেনে রেখ যে, তোমাদের মধ্যে আল্লাহর রসূল বর্তমান আছে। সে যদি অধিকাংশ বিষয়ে তোমাদের কথা মেনে নিত, তাহলে তোমরা অবশ্যই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হতে। কিন্তু আল্লাহ তোমাদের কাছে ঈমানকে প্রিয় করে দিয়েছেন। তোমাদের অন্তরে সেটিকে সুশোভিত করেছেন আর তোমাদের কাছে কুফুরী, পাপাচার ও অবাধ্যতাকে ঘৃণিত করেছেন। তারাই সত্য পথপ্রাপ্ত।', 'And know that among you is the Messenger of Allah. If he were to obey you in much of the matter, you would be in difficulty, but Allah has endeared to you the faith and has made it pleasing in your hearts and has made hateful to you disbelief, defiance and disobedience. Those are the [rightly] guided.', 'তোমরা জেনে রেখ যে, তোমাদের মধ্যে আল্লাহর রসূল বর্তমান আছে। সে যদি অধিকাংশ বিষয়ে তোমাদের কথা মেনে নিত, তাহলে তোমরা অবশ্যই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হতে। কিন্তু আল্লাহ তোমাদের কাছে ঈমানকে প্রিয় করে দিয়েছেন। তোমাদের অন্তরে সেটিকে সুশোভিত করেছেন আর তোমাদের কাছে কুফুরী, পাপাচার ও অবাধ্যতাকে ঘৃণিত করেছেন। তারাই সত্য পথপ্রাপ্ত।', 'And know that among you is the Messenger of Allah. If he were to obey you in much of the matter, you would be in difficulty, but Allah has endeared to you the faith and has made it pleasing in your hearts and has made hateful to you disbelief, defiance and disobedience. Those are the [rightly] guided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049007.mp3', now()),
  (49, 8, '', '[{"id":8684,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلًۭا","transliteration":"faḍlan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহে","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8685,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8686,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":8687,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَنِعْمَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"waniʿ''matan","translation_bn":"ও (তাঁর) অনুগ্রহ","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8689,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8690,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":8691,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":8692,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faḍlan mina l-lahi waniʿ''matan wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', '(যা) আল্লাহর করুণা ও অনুগ্রহ। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, প্রজ্ঞাময়।', '[It is] as bounty from Allah and favor. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', '(যা) আল্লাহর করুণা ও অনুগ্রহ। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, প্রজ্ঞাময়।', '[It is] as bounty from Allah and favor. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049008.mp3', now()),
