য় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13729,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَجَسَّسُوا۟","transliteration":"tajassasū","translation_bn":"তোমরা দোষ খোঁজ করো","root":"جسس","lemma":"تَجَسَّسُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13730,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13731,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَغْتَب","transliteration":"yaghtab","translation_bn":"নিন্দা করো","root":"غيب","lemma":"يَغْتَب","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13732,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَّعْضُكُم","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কেউ","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13733,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضًا ۚ","transliteration":"baʿḍan","translation_bn":"কাউকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13735,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَيُحِبُّ","transliteration":"ayuḥibbu","translation_bn":"পছন্দ করে কি","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":13736,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدُكُمْ","transliteration":"aḥadukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কেউ","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13737,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":13738,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَأْكُلَ","transliteration":"yakula","translation_bn":"সে খাবে","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13739,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَحْمَ","transliteration":"laḥma","translation_bn":"গোশত","root":"لحم","lemma":"لَحْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13740,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَخِيهِ","transliteration":"akhīhi","translation_bn":"তার ভাইয়ের","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13741,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَيْتًۭا","transliteration":"maytan","translation_bn":"(যে) মৃত","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13742,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَكَرِهْتُمُوهُ ۚ","transliteration":"fakarih''tumūhu","translation_bn":"বস্তুতঃ তা তোমরা ঘৃণাই কর","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرِهَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13744,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13745,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13747,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":13748,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13749,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"تَوَّابٌۭ","transliteration":"tawwābun","translation_bn":"তওবা কবুলকারী","root":"توب","lemma":"تَوَّاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13750,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13751,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ij''tanibū kathīran mina l-ẓani inna baʿḍa l-ẓani ith''mun walā tajassasū walā yaghtab baʿḍukum baʿḍan ayuḥibbu aḥadukum an yakula laḥma akhīhi maytan fakarih''tumūhu wa-ittaqū l-laha inna l-laha tawwābun raḥīmun', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা অধিক ধারণা হতে বিরত থাক। কতক ধারণা পাপের অন্তর্ভুক্ত। তোমরা অন্যের দোষ খোঁজাখুঁজি করো না, একে অন্যের অনুপস্থিতিতে দোষ-ত্রুটি বর্ণনা করো না। তোমাদের কেউ কি তার মৃত ভাইয়ের গোশত খেতে পছন্দ করবে? তোমরা তো সেটাকে ঘৃণাই করে থাক। আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ খুব বেশি তাওবাহ ক্ববূলকারী, অতি দয়ালু।', 'O you who have believed, avoid much [negative] assumption. Indeed, some assumption is sin. And do not spy or backbite each other. Would one of you like to eat the flesh of his brother when dead? You would detest it. And fear Allah; indeed, Allah is Accepting of repentance and Merciful.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা অধিক ধারণা হতে বিরত থাক। কতক ধারণা পাপের অন্তর্ভুক্ত। তোমরা অন্যের দোষ খোঁজাখুঁজি করো না, একে অন্যের অনুপস্থিতিতে দোষ-ত্রুটি বর্ণনা করো না। তোমাদের কেউ কি তার মৃত ভাইয়ের গোশত খেতে পছন্দ করবে? তোমরা তো সেটাকে ঘৃণাই করে থাক। আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ খুব বেশি তাওবাহ ক্ববূলকারী, অতি দয়ালু।', 'O you who have believed, avoid much [negative] assumption. Indeed, some assumption is sin. And do not spy or backbite each other. Would one of you like to eat the flesh of his brother when dead? You would detest it. And fear Allah; indeed, Allah is Accepting of repentance and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049012.mp3', now()),
  (49, 13, '', '[{"id":14884,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":14885,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14886,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":14887,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقْنَـٰكُم","transliteration":"khalaqnākum","translation_bn":"আমরা তোমাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14888,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14889,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذَكَرٍۢ","transliteration":"dhakarin","translation_bn":"এক পুরুষ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14890,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأُنثَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-unthā","translation_bn":"ও এক মহিলা","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14891,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"wajaʿalnākum","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা তোমাদেরকে  বিভক্ত করেছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14892,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شُعُوبًۭا","transliteration":"shuʿūban","translation_bn":"বিভিন্ন সম্প্রদায়","root":"شعب","lemma":"شُعُوب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14893,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَقَبَآئِلَ","transliteration":"waqabāila","translation_bn":"ও (বিভিন্ন) গোত্রে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبَا^ئِل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14894,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِتَعَارَفُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"litaʿārafū","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা একে অপরের সাথে পরিচিত হতে পার","root":"عرف","lemma":"يَتَعَارَفُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14896,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":14897,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَكْرَمَكُمْ","transliteration":"akramakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যে বেশি মর্যাদাসম্পন্ন","root":"كرم","lemma":"أَكْرَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14898,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":14899,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14900,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَتْقَىٰكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"atqākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যে যে সর্বাধিক মুত্তাকি","root":"وقي","lemma":"أَتْقَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14902,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":14903,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14904,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14905,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":14906,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu innā khalaqnākum min dhakarin wa-unthā wajaʿalnākum shuʿūban waqabāila litaʿārafū inna akramakum ʿinda l-lahi atqākum inna l-laha ʿalīmun khabīrun', 'হে মানুষ! তোমাদেরকে এক পুরুষ ও এক নারী থেকে সৃষ্টি করেছি এবং তোমাদেরকে বিভিন্ন জাতি ও গোষ্ঠীতে বিভক্ত করেছি যাতে তোমরা পরস্পরকে চিনতে পার। তোমাদের মধ্যে আল্লাহর নিকট সেই লোকই অধিক সম্মানীয় যে লোক অধিক মুত্তাক্বী। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সব খবর রাখেন।', 'O mankind, indeed We have created you from male and female and made you peoples and tribes that you may know one another. Indeed, the most noble of you in the sight of Allah is the most righteous of you. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Acquainted.', 'হে মানুষ! তোমাদেরকে এক পুরুষ ও এক নারী থেকে সৃষ্টি করেছি এবং তোমাদেরকে বিভিন্ন জাতি ও গোষ্ঠীতে বিভক্ত করেছি যাতে তোমরা পরস্পরকে চিনতে পার। তোমাদের মধ্যে আল্লাহর নিকট সেই লোকই অধিক সম্মানীয় যে লোক অধিক মুত্তাক্বী। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, সব খবর রাখেন।', 'O mankind, indeed We have created you from male and female and made you peoples and tribes that you may know one another. Indeed, the most noble of you in the sight of Allah is the most righteous of you. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049013.mp3', now()),
  (49, 14, '', '[{"id":15958,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قَالَتِ","transliteration":"qālati","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15959,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْرَابُ","transliteration":"l-aʿrābu","translation_bn":"মরুবাসীরা","root":"عرب","lemma":"أَعْرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15960,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا ۖ","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা ঈমান এনেছি\"","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15962,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15963,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"\"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":15964,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْمِنُوا۟","transliteration":"tu''minū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান আনো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15965,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15966,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُولُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qūlū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15967,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَسْلَمْنَا","transliteration":"aslamnā","translation_bn":"\"আমরা বশ্যতা স্বীকার করেছি\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"أَسْلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15968,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং এখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15969,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَدْخُلِ","transliteration":"yadkhuli","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করেছে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15970,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِيمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-īmānu","translation_bn":"ঈমান","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15971,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15972,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"qulūbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের অন্তরসমূহের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15974,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15975,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تُطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"tuṭīʿū","translation_bn":"তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15976,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15977,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসুলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15978,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":15979,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَلِتْكُم","transliteration":"yalit''kum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কম করবেন (প্রতিফল দানে)","root":"ليت","lemma":"يَلِتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15980,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15981,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلِكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmālikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কর্মসমূহের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15982,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15984,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":15985,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15986,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":15987,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":15988,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālati l-aʿrābu āmannā qul lam tu''minū walākin qūlū aslamnā walammā yadkhuli l-īmānu fī qulūbikum wa-in tuṭīʿū l-laha warasūlahu lā yalit''kum min aʿmālikum shayan inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'বেদুঈনরা বলে, ‘আমরা ঈমান এনেছি’। বল- ‘তোমরা ঈমান আননি, বরং তোমরা বল, ‘আমরা (মৌখিক) আনুগত্য স্বীকার করেছি’, এখন পর্যন্ত তোমাদের অন্তরে ঈমান প্রবেশ করেনি। তোমরা যদি আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলকে মান্য কর তাহলে তোমাদের কৃতকর্মের কিছুই কমতি করা হবে না। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'The bedouins say, "We have believed." Say, "You have not [yet] believed; but say [instead], ''We have submitted,'' for faith has not yet entered your hearts. And if you obey Allah and His Messenger, He will not deprive you from your deeds of anything. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful."', 'বেদুঈনরা বলে, ‘আমরা ঈমান এনেছি’। বল- ‘তোমরা ঈমান আননি, বরং তোমরা বল, ‘আমরা (মৌখিক) আনুগত্য স্বীকার করেছি’, এখন পর্যন্ত তোমাদের অন্তরে ঈমান প্রবেশ করেনি। তোমরা যদি আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলকে মান্য কর তাহলে তোমাদের কৃতকর্মের কিছুই কমতি করা হবে না। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'The bedouins say, "We have believed." Say, "You have not [yet] believed; but say [instead], ''We have submitted,'' for faith has not yet entered your hearts. And if you obey Allah and His Messenger, He will not deprive you from your deeds of anything. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049014.mp3', now()),
  (49, 15, '', '[{"id":17193,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":17194,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17195,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17196,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17197,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17198,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসুলের (উপর)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17199,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17200,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":17201,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَرْتَابُوا۟","transliteration":"yartābū","translation_bn":"তারা সন্দেহ করে","root":"ريب","lemma":"ٱرْتَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17202,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰهَدُوا۟","transliteration":"wajāhadū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা জিহাদ করেছে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17203,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ধনসম্পদ দিয়ে","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17204,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের জানজীবন (দিয়ে)","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17205,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17206,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17207,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":17209,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":17210,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":17211,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقُونَ","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17212,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā l-mu''minūna alladhīna āmanū bil-lahi warasūlihi thumma lam yartābū wajāhadū bi-amwālihim wa-anfusihim fī sabīli l-lahi ulāika humu l-ṣādiqūna', 'মু’মিন তারাই যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের উপর ঈমান আনে, অতঃপর কোনরূপ সন্দেহ করে না, আর তাদের মাল দিয়ে ও জান দিয়ে আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদ করে; তারাই সত্যবাদী।', 'The believers are only the ones who have believed in Allah and His Messenger and then doubt not but strive with their properties and their lives in the cause of Allah. It is those who are the truthful.', 'মু’মিন তারাই যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের উপর ঈমান আনে, অতঃপর কোনরূপ সন্দেহ করে না, আর তাদের মাল দিয়ে ও জান দিয়ে আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদ করে; তারাই সত্যবাদী।', 'The believers are only the ones who have believed in Allah and His Messenger and then doubt not but strive with their properties and their lives in the cause of Allah. It is those who are the truthful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049015.mp3', now()),
  (49, 16, '', '[{"id":18219,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18220,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَتُعَلِّمُونَ","transliteration":"atuʿallimūna","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা কি জানাচ্ছ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":18221,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18222,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِدِينِكُمْ","transliteration":"bidīnikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দীন (পালন) সম্পর্কে","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18223,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"অথচ আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":18224,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18225,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":18226,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18227,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18228,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18229,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18230,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18232,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18233,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18234,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"সব জিনিসের","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18235,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":18236,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul atuʿallimūna l-laha bidīnikum wal-lahu yaʿlamu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi wal-lahu bikulli shayin ʿalīmun', 'বল, ‘তোমরা কি তোমাদের দ্বীন সম্পর্কে আল্লাহকে অবগত করতে চাও’? আল্লাহ তো জানেন যা আছে আসমানে আর যা আছে যমীনে। আল্লাহ প্রতিটি বিষয় সম্পর্কে সবিশেষ অবগত।', 'Say, "Would you acquaint Allah with your religion while Allah knows whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth, and Allah is Knowing of all things?"', 'বল, ‘তোমরা কি তোমাদের দ্বীন সম্পর্কে আল্লাহকে অবগত করতে চাও’? আল্লাহ তো জানেন যা আছে আসমানে আর যা আছে যমীনে। আল্লাহ প্রতিটি বিষয় সম্পর্কে সবিশেষ অবগত।', 'Say, "Would you acquaint Allah with your religion while Allah knows whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth, and Allah is Knowing of all things?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049016.mp3', now()),
  (49, 17, '', '[{"id":19251,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَمُنُّونَ","transliteration":"yamunnūna","translation_bn":"তারা অনুগ্রহ প্রকাশ করে","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19252,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19253,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":19254,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَسْلَمُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"aslamū","translation_bn":"তারা ইসলাম গ্রহণ করেছে","root":"سلم","lemma":"أَسْلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19256,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19257,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":19258,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَمُنُّوا۟","transliteration":"tamunnū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অনুগ্রহ বলে মনে করো","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19259,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىَّ","transliteration":"ʿalayya","translation_bn":"আমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19260,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِسْلَـٰمَكُم ۖ","transliteration":"is''lāmakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ইসলাম গ্রহণের","root":"سلم","lemma":"إِسْلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19262,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَلِ","transliteration":"bali","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":19263,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19264,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَمُنُّ","transliteration":"yamunnu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ করেছেন","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19265,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19266,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":19267,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هَدَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"hadākum","translation_bn":"তিনি তোমাদেরকে পথ দেখিয়েছেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19268,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِلْإِيمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"lil''īmāni","translation_bn":"ঈমানের দিকে","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19269,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":19270,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19271,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী (ঈমানের দাবিতে)","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19272,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yamunnūna ʿalayka an aslamū qul lā tamunnū ʿalayya is''lāmakum bali l-lahu yamunnu ʿalaykum an hadākum lil''īmāni in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'এই লোকেরা মনে করে যে, তারা ইসলাম কবূল ক’রে তোমার প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেছে। তাদেরকে বলে দাও, ‘তোমরা তোমাদের ইসলাম কবূলের দ্বারা আমার প্রতি কোন অনুগ্রহ করনি বরং আল্লাহ্ই তোমাদেরকে ঈমানের পথে পরিচালিত ক’রে তোমাদের প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেছেন, তোমরা যদি (তোমাদের ঈমান আনার দাবীতে) সত্যবাদী হয়েই থাক।', 'They consider it a favor to you that they have accepted Islam. Say, "Do not consider your Islam a favor to me. Rather, Allah has conferred favor upon you that He has guided you to the faith, if you should be truthful."', 'এই লোকেরা মনে করে যে, তারা ইসলাম কবূল ক’রে তোমার প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেছে। তাদেরকে বলে দাও, ‘তোমরা তোমাদের ইসলাম কবূলের দ্বারা আমার প্রতি কোন অনুগ্রহ করনি বরং আল্লাহ্ই তোমাদেরকে ঈমানের পথে পরিচালিত ক’রে তোমাদের প্রতি অনুগ্রহ করেছেন, তোমরা যদি (তোমাদের ঈমান আনার দাবীতে) সত্যবাদী হয়েই থাক।', 'They consider it a favor to you that they have accepted Islam. Say, "Do not consider your Islam a favor to me. Rather, Allah has conferred favor upon you that He has guided you to the faith, if you should be truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049017.mp3', now()),
  (49, 18, '', '[{"id":20336,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20337,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20338,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20339,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غَيْبَ","transliteration":"ghayba","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্য (সম্পর্কে)","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20340,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20341,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20343,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20344,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু দেখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":20345,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়েও যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20346,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা করছ\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20347,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha yaʿlamu ghayba l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wal-lahu baṣīrun bimā taʿmalūna', 'আসমান ও যমীনের গোপন বিষয়ের খবর আল্লাহই জানেন। তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তা দেখেন।', 'Indeed, Allah knows the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and the earth. And Allah is Seeing of what you do.', 'আসমান ও যমীনের গোপন বিষয়ের খবর আল্লাহই জানেন। তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তা দেখেন।', 'Indeed, Allah knows the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and the earth. And Allah is Seeing of what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/049018.mp3', now())
