আযাবে নিক্ষেপ কর।', 'Who made [as equal] with Allah another deity; then throw him into the severe punishment."', 'যে আল্লাহর সঙ্গে অন্যকে ইলাহ্ বানিয়ে নিয়েছিল। কাজেই তোমরা উভয়ে তাকে কঠিন ‘আযাবে নিক্ষেপ কর।', 'Who made [as equal] with Allah another deity; then throw him into the severe punishment."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050026.mp3', now()),
  (50, 27, '', '[{"id":30413,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30414,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَرِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"qarīnuhu","translation_bn":"তার সঙ্গী (অর্থাৎ শয়তান)","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30415,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30416,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":30417,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَطْغَيْتُهُۥ","transliteration":"aṭghaytuhu","translation_bn":"তাকে আমি অবাধ্য করি","root":"طغي","lemma":"أَطْغَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30418,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30419,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(নিজেই) সে ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30420,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30421,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۭ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তির","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30422,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَعِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿīdin","translation_bn":"(অনেক) ঘোর\"","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30423,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla qarīnuhu rabbanā mā aṭghaytuhu walākin kāna fī ḍalālin baʿīdin', 'তার সঙ্গী বলবে, ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমি তাকে বিদ্রোহী বানাইনি বরং সে নিজেই ছিল সুদূর গুমরাহীর মধ্যে।’', 'His [devil] companion will say, "Our Lord, I did not make him transgress, but he [himself] was in extreme error."', 'তার সঙ্গী বলবে, ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমি তাকে বিদ্রোহী বানাইনি বরং সে নিজেই ছিল সুদূর গুমরাহীর মধ্যে।’', 'His [devil] companion will say, "Our Lord, I did not make him transgress, but he [himself] was in extreme error."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050027.mp3', now()),
  (50, 28, '', '[{"id":30683,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) বলবেন","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30684,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":30685,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَخْتَصِمُوا۟","transliteration":"takhtaṣimū","translation_bn":"তোমরা তর্কাতর্কি করো","root":"خصم","lemma":"ٱخْتَصَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30686,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَدَىَّ","transliteration":"ladayya","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَدَي\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":30687,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30688,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَدَّمْتُ","transliteration":"qaddamtu","translation_bn":"আমি পূর্বে পাঠিয়েছি","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30689,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ilaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30690,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْوَعِيدِ","transliteration":"bil-waʿīdi","translation_bn":"(খারাপ পরিণতির) সতর্কবাণী","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعِيد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30691,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla lā takhtaṣimū ladayya waqad qaddamtu ilaykum bil-waʿīdi', 'আল্লাহ বলবেন, ‘আমার সামনে বাদানুবাদ করো না, আমি আগেই তোমাদেরকে সতর্ক করে দিয়েছিলাম।', '[Allah] will say, "Do not dispute before Me, while I had already presented to you the warning.', 'আল্লাহ বলবেন, ‘আমার সামনে বাদানুবাদ করো না, আমি আগেই তোমাদেরকে সতর্ক করে দিয়েছিলাম।', '[Allah] will say, "Do not dispute before Me, while I had already presented to you the warning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050028.mp3', now()),
  (50, 29, '', '[{"id":31764,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31765,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُبَدَّلُ","transliteration":"yubaddalu","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তন হয়","root":"بدل","lemma":"بَدَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31766,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","transliteration":"l-qawlu","translation_bn":"কথার","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31767,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَدَىَّ","transliteration":"ladayya","translation_bn":"আমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَدَي\r","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":31768,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31769,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":31770,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِظَلَّـٰمٍۢ","transliteration":"biẓallāmin","translation_bn":"অবিচারক","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَّٰم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31771,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْعَبِيدِ","transliteration":"lil''ʿabīdi","translation_bn":"বান্দাদেরকে/ দাসদেরকে\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31772,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā yubaddalu l-qawlu ladayya wamā anā biẓallāmin lil''ʿabīdi', 'আমার কথা কক্ষনো বদলে না, আর আমি আমার বান্দাহদের প্রতি যুলমকারীও নই।', 'The word will not be changed with Me, and never will I be unjust to the servants."', 'আমার কথা কক্ষনো বদলে না, আর আমি আমার বান্দাহদের প্রতি যুলমকারীও নই।', 'The word will not be changed with Me, and never will I be unjust to the servants."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050029.mp3', now()),
  (50, 30, '', '[{"id":32605,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32606,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَقُولُ","transliteration":"naqūlu","translation_bn":"বলব আমরা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32607,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِجَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"lijahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামকে","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32608,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَلِ","transliteration":"hali","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":32609,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْتَلَأْتِ","transliteration":"im''talati","translation_bn":"তুমি পূর্ণ হয়েছ\"","root":"ملا","lemma":"ٱمْتَلَأْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32610,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَتَقُولُ","transliteration":"wataqūlu","translation_bn":"এবং সে বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32611,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"(আছে) কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":32612,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32613,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّزِيدٍۢ","transliteration":"mazīdin","translation_bn":"আরও\"","root":"زيد","lemma":"مَّزِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32614,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma naqūlu lijahannama hali im''talati wataqūlu hal min mazīdin', 'সে দিন আমি জাহান্নামকে জিজ্ঞেস করব, ‘তুমি কি পরিপূর্ণ হয়েছ’? সে বলবে, ‘আরো বেশি আছে কি?’', 'On the Day We will say to Hell, "Have you been filled?" and it will say, "Are there some more,"', 'সে দিন আমি জাহান্নামকে জিজ্ঞেস করব, ‘তুমি কি পরিপূর্ণ হয়েছ’? সে বলবে, ‘আরো বেশি আছে কি?’', 'On the Day We will say to Hell, "Have you been filled?" and it will say, "Are there some more,"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050030.mp3', now()),
  (50, 31, '', '[{"id":33496,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأُزْلِفَتِ","transliteration":"wa-uz''lifati","translation_bn":"নিকটে আনা হবে","root":"زلف","lemma":"أُزْلِفَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33497,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةُ","transliteration":"l-janatu","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33498,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"lil''muttaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদের জন্যে","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33499,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"না","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33500,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعِيدٍ","transliteration":"baʿīdin","translation_bn":"দূরত্বে (থাকবে)","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":33501,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-uz''lifati l-janatu lil''muttaqīna ghayra baʿīdin', 'মুত্তাক্বীদের জন্য জান্নাতকে নিকটে আনা হবে- তা মোটেই দূরে থাকবে না।', 'And Paradise will be brought near to the righteous, not far,', 'মুত্তাক্বীদের জন্য জান্নাতকে নিকটে আনা হবে- তা মোটেই দূরে থাকবে না।', 'And Paradise will be brought near to the righteous, not far,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050031.mp3', now()),
  (50, 32, '', '[{"id":34528,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"(বলা হবে) এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":34529,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তাই) যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":34530,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُوعَدُونَ","transliteration":"tūʿadūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে প্রতিশ্রুতি দেওয়া হয়েছিল","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34531,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":34532,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّابٍ","transliteration":"awwābin","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তনকারীর (আল্লাহর দিকে)","root":"اوب","lemma":"أَوَّاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34533,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَفِيظٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥafīẓin","translation_bn":"সংরক্ষণকারীর (আল্লাহর সীমার)","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":34534,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hādhā mā tūʿadūna likulli awwābin ḥafīẓin', '(বলা হবে) ‘এ হল তাই যার ও‘য়াদা তোমাদেরকে দেয়া হয়েছিল- প্রত্যেক আল্লাহ অভিমুখী ও (গুনাহ থেকে) খুব বেশি হিফাযাতকারীর জন্য।', '[It will be said], "This is what you were promised - for every returner [to Allah] and keeper [of His covenant]', '(বলা হবে) ‘এ হল তাই যার ও‘য়াদা তোমাদেরকে দেয়া হয়েছিল- প্রত্যেক আল্লাহ অভিমুখী ও (গুনাহ থেকে) খুব বেশি হিফাযাতকারীর জন্য।', '[It will be said], "This is what you were promised - for every returner [to Allah] and keeper [of His covenant]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050032.mp3', now()),
  (50, 33, '', '[{"id":35401,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35402,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَشِىَ","transliteration":"khashiya","translation_bn":"ভয় করত","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35403,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"l-raḥmāna","translation_bn":"দয়াময়কে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35404,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","translation_bn":"না দেখেই","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35405,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَ","transliteration":"wajāa","translation_bn":"এবং এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":35406,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِقَلْبٍۢ","transliteration":"biqalbin","translation_bn":"অন্তরসহ","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35407,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّنِيبٍ","transliteration":"munībin","translation_bn":"বিনীত","root":"نوب","lemma":"مُّنِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35408,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man khashiya l-raḥmāna bil-ghaybi wajāa biqalbin munībin', 'যে না দেখেই দয়াময় (আল্লাহকে) ভয় করত, আর আল্লাহর নির্দেশ পালনের জন্য বিনয়ে অবনত অন্তর নিয়ে উপস্থিত হত।', 'Who feared the Most Merciful unseen and came with a heart returning [in repentance].', 'যে না দেখেই দয়াময় (আল্লাহকে) ভয় করত, আর আল্লাহর নির্দেশ পালনের জন্য বিনয়ে অবনত অন্তর নিয়ে উপস্থিত হত।', 'Who feared the Most Merciful unseen and came with a heart returning [in repentance].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050033.mp3', now()),
  (50, 34, '', '[{"id":36328,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْخُلُوهَا","transliteration":"ud''khulūhā","translation_bn":"প্রবেশ করো তাতে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36329,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِسَلَـٰمٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"bisalāmin","translation_bn":"শান্তি ও নিরাপত্তা সহ","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36331,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"(এটা) সেই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":36332,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمُ","transliteration":"yawmu","translation_bn":"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36333,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخُلُودِ","transliteration":"l-khulūdi","translation_bn":"চিরন্তন (জীবনের)\"","root":"خلد","lemma":"خُلُود","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36334,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ud''khulūhā bisalāmin dhālika yawmu l-khulūdi', '(তাদেরকে বলা হবে) ‘শান্তির সঙ্গে এতে প্রবেশ কর, এটা চিরস্থায়ী জীবনের দিন।’', 'Enter it in peace. This is the Day of Eternity."', '(তাদেরকে বলা হবে) ‘শান্তির সঙ্গে এতে প্রবেশ কর, এটা চিরস্থায়ী জীবনের দিন।’', 'Enter it in peace. This is the Day of Eternity."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050034.mp3', now()),
  (50, 35, '', '[{"id":37516,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37517,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তাই) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37518,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُونَ","transliteration":"yashāūna","translation_bn":"তারা চাইবে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37519,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37520,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدَيْنَا","transliteration":"waladaynā","translation_bn":"এবং আমাদের কাছে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَدَي\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37521,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَزِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"mazīdun","translation_bn":"আরও অনেক","root":"زيد","lemma":"مَّزِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37522,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahum mā yashāūna fīhā waladaynā mazīdun', 'সেখানে তাদের জন্য তা-ই আছে যা তারা ইচ্ছে করবে, আর আমার কাছে (তাছাড়াও) আরো বেশি আছে।', 'They will have whatever they wish therein, and with Us is more.', 'সেখানে তাদের জন্য তা-ই আছে যা তারা ইচ্ছে করবে, আর আমার কাছে (তাছাড়াও) আরো বেশি আছে।', 'They will have whatever they wish therein, and with Us is more.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050035.mp3', now()),
  (50, 36, '', '[{"id":37932,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَمْ","transliteration":"wakam","translation_bn":"এবং কত","root":"—","lemma":"كَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37933,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكْنَا","transliteration":"ahlaknā","translation_bn":"আমরা ধ্বংস করেছি","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37934,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَهُم","transliteration":"qablahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":37935,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37936,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَرْنٍ","transliteration":"qarnin","translation_bn":"জনগোষ্ঠী","root":"قرن","lemma":"قَرْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37937,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা (ছিল)","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":37938,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدُّ","transliteration":"ashaddu","translation_bn":"অধিক প্রবল","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37939,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37940,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَطْشًۭا","transliteration":"baṭshan","translation_bn":"শক্তিতে","root":"بطش","lemma":"بَطْش","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37941,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَنَقَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"fanaqqabū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা  ভ্রমণ করত","root":"نقب","lemma":"نَقَّبُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37942,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37943,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبِلَـٰدِ","transliteration":"l-bilādi","translation_bn":"দেশ বিদেশের","root":"بلد","lemma":"بَلَد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37944,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"(ছিল) কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":37945,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37946,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّحِيصٍ","transliteration":"maḥīṣin","translation_bn":"আশ্রয়স্থল (তাদের জন্যে)","root":"حيص","lemma":"مَّحِيص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37947,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakam ahlaknā qablahum min qarnin hum ashaddu min''hum baṭshan fanaqqabū fī l-bilādi hal min maḥīṣin', 'তাদের পূর্বে আমি কত জাতিকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি যারা শক্তিতে ছিল তাদের চেয়ে প্রবল, যার ফলে তারা দুনিয়া চষে বেড়াত; তারা পালানোর কোন জায়গা পেয়েছিল কি?', 'And how many a generation before them did We destroy who were greater than them in [striking] power and had explored throughout the lands. Is there any place of escape?', 'তাদের পূর্বে আমি কত জাতিকে ধ্বংস করে দিয়েছি যারা শক্তিতে ছিল তাদের চেয়ে প্রবল, যার ফলে তারা দুনিয়া চষে বেড়াত; তারা পালানোর কোন জায়গা পেয়েছিল কি?', 'And how many a generation before them did We destroy who were greater than them in [striking] power and had explored throughout the lands. Is there any place of escape?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050036.mp3', now()),
  (50, 37, '', '[{"id":38762,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38763,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38764,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":38765,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَذِكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"ladhik''rā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই উপদেশ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":38766,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38767,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38768,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38769,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَلْبٌ","transliteration":"qalbun","translation_bn":"অন্তর","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38770,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38771,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقَى","transliteration":"alqā","translation_bn":"নিবিষ্ট করে","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38772,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمْعَ","transliteration":"l-samʿa","translation_bn":"কান","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38773,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্থায় সে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":38774,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"shahīdun","translation_bn":"উপস্থিত (মনেপ্রাণে)","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38775,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna fī dhālika ladhik''rā liman kāna lahu qalbun aw alqā l-samʿa wahuwa shahīdun', 'এতে অবশ্যই উপদেশ রয়েছে তার জন্য যার আছে (বোধশক্তিসম্পন্ন) অন্তর কিংবা যে খুব মন দিয়ে কথা শুনে।', 'Indeed in that is a reminder for whoever has a heart or who listens while he is present [in mind].', 'এতে অবশ্যই উপদেশ রয়েছে তার জন্য যার আছে (বোধশক্তিসম্পন্ন) অন্তর কিংবা যে খুব মন দিয়ে কথা শুনে।', 'Indeed in that is a reminder for whoever has a heart or who listens while he is present [in mind].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050037.mp3', now()),
  (50, 38, '', '[{"id":39658,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39659,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقْنَا","transliteration":"khalaqnā","translation_bn":"আমরা সৃষ্টি করেছি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39660,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39661,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"এবং পৃথিবীকে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39662,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39663,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمَا","transliteration":"baynahumā","translation_bn":"উভয়ের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":39664,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39665,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سِتَّةِ","transliteration":"sittati","translation_bn":"ছয়","root":"ستت","lemma":"سِتَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39666,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَيَّامٍۢ","transliteration":"ayyāmin","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39667,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39668,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَسَّنَا","transliteration":"massanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের স্পর্শ করেছে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39669,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39670,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لُّغُوبٍۢ","transliteration":"lughūbin","translation_bn":"ক্লান্তি","root":"لغب","lemma":"لُّغُوب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39671,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad khalaqnā l-samāwāti wal-arḍa wamā baynahumā fī sittati ayyāmin wamā massanā min lughūbin', 'আকাশ, যমীন আর এ দু’য়ের মাঝে যা আছে তা আমি ছ’ দিনে সৃষ্টি করেছি; ক্লান্তি আমাকে স্পর্শ করেনি। (আমি সকল মানুষকে বিচারের জন্য হাজির করবই)।', 'And We did certainly create the heavens and earth and what is between them in six days, and there touched Us no weariness.', 'আকাশ, যমীন আর এ দু’য়ের মাঝে যা আছে তা আমি ছ’ দিনে সৃষ্টি করেছি; ক্লান্তি আমাকে স্পর্শ করেনি। (আমি সকল মানুষকে বিচারের জন্য হাজির করবই)।', 'And We did certainly create the heavens and earth and what is between them in six days, and there touched Us no weariness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050038.mp3', now()),
  (50, 39, '', '[{"id":40857,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرْ","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''bir","translation_bn":"অতএব ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40858,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40859,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40860,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলছে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40861,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَسَبِّحْ","transliteration":"wasabbiḥ","translation_bn":"এবং পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা করো","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40862,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِحَمْدِ","transliteration":"biḥamdi","translation_bn":"প্রশংসাসহ","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40863,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40864,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":40865,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"طُلُوعِ","transliteration":"ṭulūʿi","translation_bn":"উদয়ের","root":"طلع","lemma":"طُلُوع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40866,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّمْسِ","transliteration":"l-shamsi","translation_bn":"সূর্যের","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40867,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَقَبْلَ","transliteration":"waqabla","translation_bn":"ও পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40868,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُرُوبِ","transliteration":"l-ghurūbi","translation_bn":"(সূর্য) অস্তের","root":"غرب","lemma":"غُرُوب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40869,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-iṣ''bir ʿalā mā yaqūlūna wasabbiḥ biḥamdi rabbika qabla ṭulūʿi l-shamsi waqabla l-ghurūbi', 'কাজেই তারা (মিথ্যা, উপহাসপূর্ণ ও অপমানজনক কথা) যা বলে তাতে তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর আর সূর্যোদয়ের পূর্বে আর সূর্যাস্তের পূর্বে তোমার প্রতিপালকের মহিমা ও প্রশংসা ঘোষণা কর।', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad], over what they say and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord before the rising of the sun and before its setting,', 'কাজেই তারা (মিথ্যা, উপহাসপূর্ণ ও অপমানজনক কথা) যা বলে তাতে তুমি ধৈর্য ধারণ কর আর সূর্যোদয়ের পূর্বে আর সূর্যাস্তের পূর্বে তোমার প্রতিপালকের মহিমা ও প্রশংসা ঘোষণা কর।', 'So be patient, [O Muhammad], over what they say and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord before the rising of the sun and before its setting,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050039.mp3', now()),
  (50, 40, '', '[{"id":41157,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং কিছু অংশে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41158,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41159,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَسَبِّحْهُ","transliteration":"fasabbiḥ''hu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাঁর পবিত্রতা ঘোষণা করো","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41160,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَدْبَـٰرَ","transliteration":"wa-adbāra","translation_bn":"এবং পরে","root":"دبر","lemma":"دُبُر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41161,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","transliteration":"l-sujūdi","translation_bn":"(নামাজের) সিজদাসমূহেরও","root":"سجد","lemma":"سُّجُود","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41162,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina al-layli fasabbiḥ''hu wa-adbāra l-sujūdi', 'আর তাঁর প্রশংসা ঘোষণা কর রাত্রির একাংশে আর নামাযের পরে।', 'And [in part] of the night exalt Him and after prostration.', 'আর তাঁর প্রশংসা ঘোষণা কর রাত্রির একাংশে আর নামাযের পরে।', 'And [in part] of the night exalt Him and after prostration.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050040.mp3', now()),
  (50, 41, '', '[{"id":42055,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَمِعْ","transliteration":"wa-is''tamiʿ","translation_bn":"এবং শোনো","root":"سمع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42056,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যে দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42057,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُنَادِ","transliteration":"yunādi","translation_bn":"ডাকবে","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42058,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنَادِ","transliteration":"l-munādi","translation_bn":"একজন ঘোষণাকারী","root":"ندو","lemma":"مُنَاد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42059,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42060,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَانٍۢ","transliteration":"makānin","translation_bn":"স্থান","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42061,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبٍۢ","transliteration":"qarībin","translation_bn":"নিকটবর্তী","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":42062,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-is''tamiʿ yawma yunādi l-munādi min makānin qarībin', 'আর শোন, যেদিন এক ঘোষণাকারী (প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তির) নিকটবর্তী স্থান থেকে ডাক দিবে,', 'And listen on the Day when the Caller will call out from a place that is near -', 'আর শোন, যেদিন এক ঘোষণাকারী (প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তির) নিকটবর্তী স্থান থেকে ডাক দিবে,', 'And listen on the Day when the Caller will call out from a place that is near -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050041.mp3', now()),
  (50, 42, '', '[{"id":42796,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42797,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা শুনতে পারবে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42798,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّيْحَةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣayḥata","translation_bn":"মহাগর্জন","root":"صيح","lemma":"صَيْحَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42799,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"যথাযথভাবে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42801,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":42802,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمُ","transliteration":"yawmu","translation_bn":"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42803,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخُرُوجِ","transliteration":"l-khurūji","translation_bn":"(কবর হতে) বের হওয়ার","root":"خرج","lemma":"خُرُوج","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42804,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma yasmaʿūna l-ṣayḥata bil-ḥaqi dhālika yawmu l-khurūji', 'যেদিন সমস্ত মানুষ প্রকৃতই শুনতে পাবে এক (ভয়ংকর) ধ্বনি। সেদিনটি হবে (ভূগর্ভ থেকে সকল আত্মার) বের হওয়ার দিন।', 'The Day they will hear the blast [of the Horn] in truth. That is the Day of Emergence [from the graves].', 'যেদিন সমস্ত মানুষ প্রকৃতই শুনতে পাবে এক (ভয়ংকর) ধ্বনি। সেদিনটি হবে (ভূগর্ভ থেকে সকল আত্মার) বের হওয়ার দিন।', 'The Day they will hear the blast [of the Horn] in truth. That is the Day of Emergence [from the graves].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050042.mp3', now()),
  (50, 43, '', '[{"id":43572,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":43573,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরাই","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":43574,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُحْىِۦ","transliteration":"nuḥ''yī","translation_bn":"জীবন দিই","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43575,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَنُمِيتُ","transliteration":"wanumītu","translation_bn":"এবং মৃত্যু দিই আমরাই","root":"موت","lemma":"أَمَاتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43576,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"wa-ilaynā","translation_bn":"এবং আমাদের দিকেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43577,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তনস্থল","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43578,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā naḥnu nuḥ''yī wanumītu wa-ilaynā l-maṣīru', 'আমিই জীবন দেই, আমিই মুত্যু দেই, আর আমার কাছেই (সব্বাইকে) ফিরে আসতে হবে।', 'Indeed, it is We who give life and cause death, and to Us is the destination', 'আমিই জীবন দেই, আমিই মুত্যু দেই, আর আমার কাছেই (সব্বাইকে) ফিরে আসতে হবে।', 'Indeed, it is We who give life and cause death, and to Us is the destination', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050043.mp3', now()),
  (50, 44, '', '[{"id":44693,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":44694,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَشَقَّقُ","transliteration":"tashaqqaqu","translation_bn":"বিদীর্ণ হবে","root":"شقق","lemma":"يَشَّقَّقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44695,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"l-arḍu","translation_bn":"পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44696,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ভিতর হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44697,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سِرَاعًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"sirāʿan","translation_bn":"ত্রস্তব্যস্ত","root":"سرع","lemma":"سِرَاع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44699,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":44700,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَشْرٌ","transliteration":"ḥashrun","translation_bn":"সমবেত করা","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44701,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44702,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"yasīrun","translation_bn":"খুবই সহজ","root":"يسر","lemma":"يَسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":44703,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma tashaqqaqu l-arḍu ʿanhum sirāʿan dhālika ḥashrun ʿalaynā yasīrun', 'যেদিন পৃথিবী দীর্ণ বিদীর্ণ হবে, আর মানুষ ছুটে যাবে (হাশরের পানে)। এই একত্রীকরণ আমার জন্য খুবই সহজ।', 'On the Day the earth breaks away from them [and they emerge] rapidly; that is a gathering easy for Us.', 'যেদিন পৃথিবী দীর্ণ বিদীর্ণ হবে, আর মানুষ ছুটে যাবে (হাশরের পানে)। এই একত্রীকরণ আমার জন্য খুবই সহজ।', 'On the Day the earth breaks away from them [and they emerge] rapidly; that is a gathering easy for Us.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050044.mp3', now()),
  (50, 45, '', '[{"id":45089,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"نَّحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"(হে নবী) আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَّحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":45090,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানি","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45091,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45092,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ ۖ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45094,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45095,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":45096,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45097,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِجَبَّارٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"bijabbārin","translation_bn":"জবরদস্তিকারী","root":"جبر","lemma":"جَبَّار","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45099,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَذَكِّرْ","transliteration":"fadhakkir","translation_bn":"সুতরাং উপদেশ দাও","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذُكِّرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45100,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقُرْءَانِ","transliteration":"bil-qur''āni","translation_bn":"কুরআনের সাহায্যে","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45101,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাকে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45102,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَخَافُ","transliteration":"yakhāfu","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45103,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَعِيدِ","transliteration":"waʿīdi","translation_bn":"আমার সতর্কীকরণকে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45104,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'naḥnu aʿlamu bimā yaqūlūna wamā anta ʿalayhim bijabbārin fadhakkir bil-qur''āni man yakhāfu waʿīdi', 'তারা (তোমার বিরুদ্ধে) যা বলে তা আমি ভাল করেই জানি, তুমি তাদের উপর জবরদস্তিকারী নও। কাজেই যে আমার শাস্তির ভয়প্রদর্শনকে ভয় করে, তাকে তুমি কুরআনের সাহায্যে উপদেশ দাও।', 'We are most knowing of what they say, and you are not over them a tyrant. But remind by the Qur''an whoever fears My threat.', 'তারা (তোমার বিরুদ্ধে) যা বলে তা আমি ভাল করেই জানি, তুমি তাদের উপর জবরদস্তিকারী নও। কাজেই যে আমার শাস্তির ভয়প্রদর্শনকে ভয় করে, তাকে তুমি কুরআনের সাহায্যে উপদেশ দাও।', 'We are most knowing of what they say, and you are not over them a tyrant. But remind by the Qur''an whoever fears My threat.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/050045.mp3', now())
