  (54, 15, '', '[{"id":17278,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَد","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":17279,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَّرَكْنَـٰهَآ","transliteration":"taraknāhā","translation_bn":"তা আমরা রেখেছি","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17280,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةًۭ","transliteration":"āyatan","translation_bn":"একটি নিদর্শন হিসেবে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17281,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"কি তবে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17282,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17283,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُّدَّكِرٍۢ","transliteration":"muddakirin","translation_bn":"উপদেশ গ্রহণকারী","root":"ذكر","lemma":"مُّدَّكِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17284,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad taraknāhā āyatan fahal min muddakirin', 'এ (ঘটনা) টিকে আমি (চিরকালের জন্য) নিদর্শন হিসেবে রেখে দিলাম, অতএব উপদেশ গ্রহণ করার কেউ আছে কি?', 'And We left it as a sign, so is there any who will remember?', 'এ (ঘটনা) টিকে আমি (চিরকালের জন্য) নিদর্শন হিসেবে রেখে দিলাম, অতএব উপদেশ গ্রহণ করার কেউ আছে কি?', 'And We left it as a sign, so is there any who will remember?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/054015.mp3', now()),
