আগুনের মধ্যে হিঁচড়ে টেনে আনা হবে (তখন বলা হবে) ‘জাহান্নামের স্পর্শ আস্বাদন কর।’', 'The Day they are dragged into the Fire on their faces [it will be said], "Taste the touch of Saqar."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/054048.mp3', now()),
  (54, 49, '', '[{"id":47874,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":47875,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47876,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"জিনিসকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47877,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"khalaqnāhu","translation_bn":"তা আমরা সৃষ্টি করেছি","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47878,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِقَدَرٍۢ","transliteration":"biqadarin","translation_bn":"নির্ধারিত পরিমাণ দিয়ে","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47879,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā kulla shayin khalaqnāhu biqadarin', 'আমি সব কিছু সৃষ্টি করেছি নির্ধারিত পরিমাপে।', 'Indeed, all things We created with predestination.', 'আমি সব কিছু সৃষ্টি করেছি নির্ধারিত পরিমাপে।', 'Indeed, all things We created with predestination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/054049.mp3', now()),
