,"root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":3677,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa fī sittati ayyāmin thumma is''tawā ʿalā l-ʿarshi yaʿlamu mā yaliju fī l-arḍi wamā yakhruju min''hā wamā yanzilu mina l-samāi wamā yaʿruju fīhā wahuwa maʿakum ayna mā kuntum wal-lahu bimā taʿmalūna baṣīrun', 'তিনি আসমান ও যমীনকে ছয় দিনে সৃষ্টি করেছেন অতঃপর আরশে সমুন্নত হয়েছেন। তিনি জানেন যা যমীনে প্রবেশ করে, আর যা তাত্থেকে বের হয়, আর যা আকাশ থেকে অবতীর্ণ হয়, আর যা তাতে উঠে যায়, তোমরা যেখানেই থাক তিনি তোমাদের সঙ্গে আছেন, তোমরা যে কাজই কর না কেন, আল্লাহ তা দেখেন।', 'It is He who created the heavens and earth in six days and then established Himself above the Throne. He knows what penetrates into the earth and what emerges from it and what descends from the heaven and what ascends therein; and He is with you wherever you are. And Allah, of what you do, is Seeing.', 'তিনি আসমান ও যমীনকে ছয় দিনে সৃষ্টি করেছেন অতঃপর আরশে সমুন্নত হয়েছেন। তিনি জানেন যা যমীনে প্রবেশ করে, আর যা তাত্থেকে বের হয়, আর যা আকাশ থেকে অবতীর্ণ হয়, আর যা তাতে উঠে যায়, তোমরা যেখানেই থাক তিনি তোমাদের সঙ্গে আছেন, তোমরা যে কাজই কর না কেন, আল্লাহ তা দেখেন।', 'It is He who created the heavens and earth in six days and then established Himself above the Throne. He knows what penetrates into the earth and what emerges from it and what descends from the heaven and what ascends therein; and He is with you wherever you are. And Allah, of what you do, is Seeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057004.mp3', now()),
  (57, 5, '', '[{"id":4974,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁরই জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":4975,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُلْكُ","transliteration":"mul''ku","translation_bn":"সার্বভৌমত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":4976,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":4977,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":4979,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَى","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":4980,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":4981,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তিত হয়","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":4982,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","transliteration":"l-umūru","translation_bn":"(সমস্ত) সব বিষয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":4983,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahu mul''ku l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wa-ilā l-lahi tur''jaʿu l-umūru', 'আসমান ও যমীনের রাজত্ব তাঁরই, যাবতীয় বিষয় তাঁরই দিকে ফিরে যায় (চূড়ান্ত ফয়সালার জন্য)।', 'His is the dominion of the heavens and earth. And to Allah are returned [all] matters.', 'আসমান ও যমীনের রাজত্ব তাঁরই, যাবতীয় বিষয় তাঁরই দিকে ফিরে যায় (চূড়ান্ত ফয়সালার জন্য)।', 'His is the dominion of the heavens and earth. And to Allah are returned [all] matters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057005.mp3', now()),
  (57, 6, '', '[{"id":6215,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُولِجُ","transliteration":"yūliju","translation_bn":"তিনি প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":6216,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6217,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6218,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6219,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيُولِجُ","transliteration":"wayūliju","translation_bn":"ও প্রবেশ করান","root":"ولج","lemma":"يُولِجُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":6220,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"l-nahāra","translation_bn":"দিনকে","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6221,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6222,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ ۚ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6224,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":6225,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":6226,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِذَاتِ","transliteration":"bidhāti","translation_bn":"অবস্থা সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":6227,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","translation_bn":"অন্তর সমূহের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":6228,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yūliju al-layla fī l-nahāri wayūliju l-nahāra fī al-layli wahuwa ʿalīmun bidhāti l-ṣudūri', 'তিনিই রাতকে প্রবেশ করান দিনের ভিতর, আর দিনকে ঢুকিয়ে দেন রাতের ভিতর, অন্তরের গোপনতত্ত্ব সম্পর্কে তিনি পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'He causes the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night, and he is Knowing of that within the breasts.', 'তিনিই রাতকে প্রবেশ করান দিনের ভিতর, আর দিনকে ঢুকিয়ে দেন রাতের ভিতর, অন্তরের গোপনতত্ত্ব সম্পর্কে তিনি পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'He causes the night to enter the day and causes the day to enter the night, and he is Knowing of that within the breasts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057006.mp3', now()),
  (57, 7, '', '[{"id":7597,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"āminū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7598,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7599,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের উপর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7600,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفِقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-anfiqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা খরচ করো","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7601,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7602,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَكُم","transliteration":"jaʿalakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7603,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَخْلَفِينَ","transliteration":"mus''takhlafīna","translation_bn":"উত্তরাধিকারী","root":"خلف","lemma":"مُّسْتَخْلَفِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7604,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۖ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"যাতে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7606,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"অতঃএব যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7607,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":7608,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7609,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفَقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-anfaqū","translation_bn":"ও খরচ করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":7610,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":7611,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرٌۭ","transliteration":"ajrun","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7612,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"kabīrun","translation_bn":"বড়","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":7613,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'āminū bil-lahi warasūlihi wa-anfiqū mimmā jaʿalakum mus''takhlafīna fīhi fa-alladhīna āmanū minkum wa-anfaqū lahum ajrun kabīrun', 'তোমরা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি ঈমান আনো, আর তিনি তোমাদেরকে যার উত্তরাধিকারী করেছেন তাত্থেকে (আল্লাহর পথে) ব্যয় কর। কারণ তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান আনে আর ব্যয় করে, তাদের জন্য আছে বিরাট প্রতিফল।', 'Believe in Allah and His Messenger and spend out of that in which He has made you successors. For those who have believed among you and spent, there will be a great reward.', 'তোমরা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি ঈমান আনো, আর তিনি তোমাদেরকে যার উত্তরাধিকারী করেছেন তাত্থেকে (আল্লাহর পথে) ব্যয় কর। কারণ তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান আনে আর ব্যয় করে, তাদের জন্য আছে বিরাট প্রতিফল।', 'Believe in Allah and His Messenger and spend out of that in which He has made you successors. For those who have believed among you and spent, there will be a great reward.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057007.mp3', now()),
  (57, 8, '', '[{"id":8797,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং কি হয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8798,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8799,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(যে) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":8800,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"tu''minūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8801,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ ۙ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8803,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلرَّسُولُ","transliteration":"wal-rasūlu","translation_bn":"অথচ রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":8804,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُوكُمْ","transliteration":"yadʿūkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে ডাকছেন","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8805,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِتُؤْمِنُوا۟","transliteration":"litu''minū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান যেন আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8806,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"birabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের উপর","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8807,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8808,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذَ","transliteration":"akhadha","translation_bn":"তিনি নিয়েছেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8809,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ","transliteration":"mīthāqakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وثق","lemma":"مِّيثَٰق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8810,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":8811,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8812,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মুমিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8813,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā lakum lā tu''minūna bil-lahi wal-rasūlu yadʿūkum litu''minū birabbikum waqad akhadha mīthāqakum in kuntum mu''minīna', 'তোমাদের কী হল যে, তোমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনবে না যখন রসূল তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের উপর ঈমান আনার জন্য ডাকছে আর তিনি তোমাদের কাছ থেকে প্রতিশ্রুতি গ্রহণ করেছেন, যদি তোমরা বিশ্বাসী হয়েই থাক।', 'And why do you not believe in Allah while the Messenger invites you to believe in your Lord and He has taken your covenant, if you should [truly] be believers?', 'তোমাদের কী হল যে, তোমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনবে না যখন রসূল তোমাদেরকে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের উপর ঈমান আনার জন্য ডাকছে আর তিনি তোমাদের কাছ থেকে প্রতিশ্রুতি গ্রহণ করেছেন, যদি তোমরা বিশ্বাসী হয়েই থাক।', 'And why do you not believe in Allah while the Messenger invites you to believe in your Lord and He has taken your covenant, if you should [truly] be believers?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057008.mp3', now()),
  (57, 9, '', '[{"id":10021,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই (সেই আল্লাহ্‌)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":10022,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":10023,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُنَزِّلُ","transliteration":"yunazzilu","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10024,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10025,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَبْدِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"ʿabdihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর বান্দার/ দাসের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10026,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","transliteration":"āyātin","translation_bn":"আয়াত সমূহ","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10027,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":10028,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِّيُخْرِجَكُم","transliteration":"liyukh''rijakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বের করার জন্যে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10029,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10030,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারসমূহ","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10031,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10032,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّورِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nūri","translation_bn":"আলোর","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10034,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10035,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":10036,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِكُمْ","transliteration":"bikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10037,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَرَءُوفٌۭ","transliteration":"laraūfun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই করুণাময়","root":"راف","lemma":"رَءُوف","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":10038,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":10039,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī yunazzilu ʿalā ʿabdihi āyātin bayyinātin liyukh''rijakum mina l-ẓulumāti ilā l-nūri wa-inna l-laha bikum laraūfun raḥīmun', 'তিনিই তাঁর বান্দাহর উপর সুস্পষ্ট আয়াত অবতীর্ণ করেন তোমাদেরকে ঘোর অন্ধকার থেকে আলোতে আনার জন্য, আল্লাহ অবশ্যই তোমাদের প্রতি বড়ই করুণাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'It is He who sends down upon His Servant [Muhammad] verses of clear evidence that He may bring you out from darknesses into the light. And indeed, Allah is to you Kind and Merciful.', 'তিনিই তাঁর বান্দাহর উপর সুস্পষ্ট আয়াত অবতীর্ণ করেন তোমাদেরকে ঘোর অন্ধকার থেকে আলোতে আনার জন্য, আল্লাহ অবশ্যই তোমাদের প্রতি বড়ই করুণাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'It is He who sends down upon His Servant [Muhammad] verses of clear evidence that He may bring you out from darknesses into the light. And indeed, Allah is to you Kind and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057009.mp3', now()),
  (57, 10, '', '[{"id":11214,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11215,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের হয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11216,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":11217,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تُنفِقُوا۟","transliteration":"tunfiqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ব্যয় করছ","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11218,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11219,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11220,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11221,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"অথচ আল্লাহ্‌রই জন্য","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":11222,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِيرَٰثُ","transliteration":"mīrāthu","translation_bn":"উত্তারাধিকার (অর্থাৎ মালিকানা)","root":"ورث","lemma":"مِيرَٰث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11223,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11224,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11226,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":11227,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11228,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُم","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11229,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":11230,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَنفَقَ","transliteration":"anfaqa","translation_bn":"ব্যয় করেছে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11231,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11232,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11233,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَتْحِ","transliteration":"l-fatḥi","translation_bn":"বিজয়ের","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتْح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11234,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَقَـٰتَلَ ۚ","transliteration":"waqātala","translation_bn":"এবং জিহাদ করেছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11236,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":11237,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَعْظَمُ","transliteration":"aʿẓamu","translation_bn":"শ্রেস্ততর","root":"عظم","lemma":"أَعْظَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11238,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَةًۭ","transliteration":"darajatan","translation_bn":"মর্যাদায়","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11239,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"(তাদের) চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11240,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":11241,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"أَنفَقُوا۟","transliteration":"anfaqū","translation_bn":"ব্যয় করেছে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11242,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11243,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدُ","transliteration":"baʿdu","translation_bn":"(বিজয়ের) পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11244,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَقَـٰتَلُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"waqātalū","translation_bn":"ও যুদ্ধ করেছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11246,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلًّۭا","transliteration":"wakullan","translation_bn":"তবে প্রত্যেককে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11247,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدَ","transliteration":"waʿada","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছেন","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11248,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11249,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"কল্যাণকর","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11251,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11252,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11253,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11254,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবগত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11255,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā lakum allā tunfiqū fī sabīli l-lahi walillahi mīrāthu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi lā yastawī minkum man anfaqa min qabli l-fatḥi waqātala ulāika aʿẓamu darajatan mina alladhīna anfaqū min baʿdu waqātalū wakullan waʿada l-lahu l-ḥus''nā wal-lahu bimā taʿmalūna khabīrun', 'তোমাদের হল কী যে তোমরা আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করবে না! আকাশ ও পৃথিবীর উত্তরাধিকার তো আল্লাহরই জন্য (কাজেই তাঁর পথে ব্যয় করলে তোমরা গরীব হয়ে যাবে এ আশঙ্কার কোন কারণ নেই)। তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা (মক্কা) বিজয়ের পূর্বে ব্যয় করেছে আর যুদ্ধ করেছে তারা সমান নয় (তাদের, যারা তা বিজয়ের পরে করেছে); তাদের মর্যাদা অনেক বড় তাদের তুলনায় যারা পরে ব্যয় করেছে ও যুদ্ধ করেছে। উভয়ের জন্যই আল্লাহ কল্যাণের ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছেন। তোমরা যা কিছু কর সে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ পূর্ণভাবে অবগত।', 'And why do you not spend in the cause of Allah while to Allah belongs the heritage of the heavens and the earth? Not equal among you are those who spent before the conquest [of Makkah] and fought [and those who did so after it]. Those are greater in degree than they who spent afterwards and fought. But to all Allah has promised the best [reward]. And Allah, with what you do, is Acquainted.', 'তোমাদের হল কী যে তোমরা আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করবে না! আকাশ ও পৃথিবীর উত্তরাধিকার তো আল্লাহরই জন্য (কাজেই তাঁর পথে ব্যয় করলে তোমরা গরীব হয়ে যাবে এ আশঙ্কার কোন কারণ নেই)। তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা (মক্কা) বিজয়ের পূর্বে ব্যয় করেছে আর যুদ্ধ করেছে তারা সমান নয় (তাদের, যারা তা বিজয়ের পরে করেছে); তাদের মর্যাদা অনেক বড় তাদের তুলনায় যারা পরে ব্যয় করেছে ও যুদ্ধ করেছে। উভয়ের জন্যই আল্লাহ কল্যাণের ও‘য়াদা দিয়েছেন। তোমরা যা কিছু কর সে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ পূর্ণভাবে অবগত।', 'And why do you not spend in the cause of Allah while to Allah belongs the heritage of the heavens and the earth? Not equal among you are those who spent before the conquest [of Makkah] and fought [and those who did so after it]. Those are greater in degree than they who spent afterwards and fought. But to all Allah has promised the best [reward]. And Allah, with what you do, is Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057010.mp3', now()),
  (57, 11, '', '[{"id":12530,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":12531,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَا","transliteration":"dhā","translation_bn":"সেই (ব্যক্তি)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":12532,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12533,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُقْرِضُ","transliteration":"yuq''riḍu","translation_bn":"ঋণ দেবে","root":"قرض","lemma":"أَقْرَضُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12534,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":12535,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَرْضًا","transliteration":"qarḍan","translation_bn":"ঋণ","root":"قرض","lemma":"قَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12536,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَسَنًۭا","transliteration":"ḥasanan","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":12537,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَيُضَـٰعِفَهُۥ","transliteration":"fayuḍāʿifahu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা বহুগুণ বৃদ্ধি করবেন","root":"ضعف","lemma":"يُضَٰعِفُ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":12538,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12539,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"walahu","translation_bn":"এবং তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12540,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرٌۭ","transliteration":"ajrun","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার (আছে)","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12541,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَرِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"karīmun","translation_bn":"সম্মানজনক","root":"كرم","lemma":"كَرِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":12542,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man dhā alladhī yuq''riḍu l-laha qarḍan ḥasanan fayuḍāʿifahu lahu walahu ajrun karīmun', 'এমন কে আছে যে, আল্লাহকে উত্তম ঋণ দিবে? তাহলে তিনি তা তার জন্য কয়েকগুণ বাড়িয়ে দিবেন আর তার জন্য আছে সম্মানজনক প্রতিফল।', 'Who is it that would loan Allah a goodly loan so He will multiply it for him and he will have a noble reward?', 'এমন কে আছে যে, আল্লাহকে উত্তম ঋণ দিবে? তাহলে তিনি তা তার জন্য কয়েকগুণ বাড়িয়ে দিবেন আর তার জন্য আছে সম্মানজনক প্রতিফল।', 'Who is it that would loan Allah a goodly loan so He will multiply it for him and he will have a noble reward?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057011.mp3', now()),
  (57, 12, '', '[{"id":13848,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"সেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13849,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَى","transliteration":"tarā","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13850,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মুমিন পুরুষকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13851,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"wal-mu''mināti","translation_bn":"ও মুমিন নারীকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13852,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَسْعَىٰ","transliteration":"yasʿā","translation_bn":"ছুটে চলছে","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13853,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نُورُهُم","transliteration":"nūruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের আলো","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13854,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"তাদের সামনে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":13855,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের সামনে","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13856,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَبِأَيْمَـٰنِهِم","transliteration":"wabi-aymānihim","translation_bn":"ও তাদের ডানে","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13857,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بُشْرَىٰكُمُ","transliteration":"bush''rākumu","translation_bn":"\"(বলা হবে) তোমাদের জন্যে সুসংবাদ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13858,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13859,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٌۭ","transliteration":"jannātun","translation_bn":"এক জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13860,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13861,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13862,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তার নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13863,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13864,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তারা স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13865,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۚ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13867,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":13868,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সেই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":13869,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَوْزُ","transliteration":"l-fawzu","translation_bn":"সাফল্য","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَوْز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13870,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmu","translation_bn":"মহা\"","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13871,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma tarā l-mu''minīna wal-mu''mināti yasʿā nūruhum bayna aydīhim wabi-aymānihim bush''rākumu l-yawma jannātun tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru khālidīna fīhā dhālika huwa l-fawzu l-ʿaẓīmu', 'সে দিন তুমি মু’মিন ও মু’মিনাদের দেখবে, তাদের সামনে আর তাদের ডানে তাদের জ্যোতি ছুটতে থাকবে। (তাদেরকে বলা হবে) ‘আজ তোমাদের জন্য জান্নাতের সুসংবাদ যার নীচ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, তাতে (তোমরা) চিরকাল থাকবে। এটাই হল বিরাট সফলতা।', 'On the Day you see the believing men and believing women, their light proceeding before them and on their right, [it will be said], "Your good tidings today are [of] gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein you will abide eternally." That is what is the great attainment.', 'সে দিন তুমি মু’মিন ও মু’মিনাদের দেখবে, তাদের সামনে আর তাদের ডানে তাদের জ্যোতি ছুটতে থাকবে। (তাদেরকে বলা হবে) ‘আজ তোমাদের জন্য জান্নাতের সুসংবাদ যার নীচ দিয়ে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, তাতে (তোমরা) চিরকাল থাকবে। এটাই হল বিরাট সফলতা।', 'On the Day you see the believing men and believing women, their light proceeding before them and on their right, [it will be said], "Your good tidings today are [of] gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein you will abide eternally." That is what is the great attainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057012.mp3', now()),
