ion_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22640,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","translation_bn":"জীবন","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22641,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَآ","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22642,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":22643,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"مَتَـٰعُ","transliteration":"matāʿu","translation_bn":"সামগ্রী","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22644,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُرُورِ","transliteration":"l-ghurūri","translation_bn":"ছলনার","root":"غرر","lemma":"غُرُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22645,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'iʿ''lamū annamā l-ḥayatu l-dun''yā laʿibun walahwun wazīnatun watafākhurun baynakum watakāthurun fī l-amwāli wal-awlādi kamathali ghaythin aʿjaba l-kufāra nabātuhu thumma yahīju fatarāhu muṣ''farran thumma yakūnu ḥuṭāman wafī l-ākhirati ʿadhābun shadīdun wamaghfiratun mina l-lahi wariḍ''wānun wamā l-ḥayatu l-dun''yā illā matāʿu l-ghurūri', 'তোমরা জেনে রেখ, দুনিয়ার জীবন ক্রীড়া-কৌতুক, শোভা-সৌন্দর্য, পারস্পরিক গর্ব-অহঙ্কার আর ধন-মাল ও সন্তানাদিতে আধিক্যের প্রতিযোগিতা মাত্র। তার উদাহরণ হল বৃষ্টি, আর তা হতে উৎপন্ন শষ্যাদি কৃষকের মনকে আনন্দে ভরে দেয়, তারপর তা পেকে যায়, তখন তুমি তাকে হলুদ বর্ণ দেখতে পাও, পরে তা খড় ভুষি হয়ে যায়। (আর আখেরাতের চিত্র অন্যরকম, পাপাচারীদের জন্য), আখেরাতে আছে কঠিন শাস্তি, (আর নেককারদের জন্য আছে) আল্লাহর ক্ষমা ও সন্তুষ্টি। আর দুনিয়ার জীবনটা তো ধোঁকার বস্তু ছাড়া আর কিছুই না।', 'Know that the life of this world is but amusement and diversion and adornment and boasting to one another and competition in increase of wealth and children - like the example of a rain whose [resulting] plant growth pleases the tillers; then it dries and you see it turned yellow; then it becomes [scattered] debris. And in the Hereafter is severe punishment and forgiveness from Allah and approval. And what is the worldly life except the enjoyment of delusion.', 'তোমরা জেনে রেখ, দুনিয়ার জীবন ক্রীড়া-কৌতুক, শোভা-সৌন্দর্য, পারস্পরিক গর্ব-অহঙ্কার আর ধন-মাল ও সন্তানাদিতে আধিক্যের প্রতিযোগিতা মাত্র। তার উদাহরণ হল বৃষ্টি, আর তা হতে উৎপন্ন শষ্যাদি কৃষকের মনকে আনন্দে ভরে দেয়, তারপর তা পেকে যায়, তখন তুমি তাকে হলুদ বর্ণ দেখতে পাও, পরে তা খড় ভুষি হয়ে যায়। (আর আখেরাতের চিত্র অন্যরকম, পাপাচারীদের জন্য), আখেরাতে আছে কঠিন শাস্তি, (আর নেককারদের জন্য আছে) আল্লাহর ক্ষমা ও সন্তুষ্টি। আর দুনিয়ার জীবনটা তো ধোঁকার বস্তু ছাড়া আর কিছুই না।', 'Know that the life of this world is but amusement and diversion and adornment and boasting to one another and competition in increase of wealth and children - like the example of a rain whose [resulting] plant growth pleases the tillers; then it dries and you see it turned yellow; then it becomes [scattered] debris. And in the Hereafter is severe punishment and forgiveness from Allah and approval. And what is the worldly life except the enjoyment of delusion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057020.mp3', now()),
  (57, 21, '', '[{"id":23785,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَابِقُوٓا۟","transliteration":"sābiqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা এগিয়ে যাও","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَابِقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23786,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23787,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَغْفِرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"maghfiratin","translation_bn":"ক্ষমার","root":"غفر","lemma":"مَّغْفِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23788,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23789,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23790,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَجَنَّةٍ","transliteration":"wajannatin","translation_bn":"ও (এমন) জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23791,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَرْضُهَا","transliteration":"ʿarḍuhā","translation_bn":"যার প্রশস্ততা","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23792,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَعَرْضِ","transliteration":"kaʿarḍi","translation_bn":"প্রশস্ততার মতো","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23793,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23794,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23795,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُعِدَّتْ","transliteration":"uʿiddat","translation_bn":"প্রস্তুত করা হয়েছে","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23796,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23797,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23798,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23799,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"warusulihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলদের (উপর)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23801,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":23802,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلُ","transliteration":"faḍlu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23803,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23804,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِيهِ","transliteration":"yu''tīhi","translation_bn":"তা দান করবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23805,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":23806,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23808,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23809,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"অধিকারী","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23810,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","transliteration":"l-faḍli","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23811,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmi","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23812,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sābiqū ilā maghfiratin min rabbikum wajannatin ʿarḍuhā kaʿarḍi l-samāi wal-arḍi uʿiddat lilladhīna āmanū bil-lahi warusulihi dhālika faḍlu l-lahi yu''tīhi man yashāu wal-lahu dhū l-faḍli l-ʿaẓīmi', 'তোমরা এগিয়ে যাও তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের ক্ষমা ও জান্নাত লাভের জন্য, যার প্রশস্ততা আসমান ও যমীনের প্রশস্ততার মত। তা প্রস্তুত রাখা হয়েছে তাদের জন্য যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলদের প্রতি ঈমান এনেছে। এটা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ, তিনি তা দেন যাকে ইচ্ছে করেন, আল্লাহ বড়ই অনুগ্রহশীল।', 'Race toward forgiveness from your Lord and a Garden whose width is like the width of the heavens and earth, prepared for those who believed in Allah and His messengers. That is the bounty of Allah which He gives to whom He wills, and Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', 'তোমরা এগিয়ে যাও তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের ক্ষমা ও জান্নাত লাভের জন্য, যার প্রশস্ততা আসমান ও যমীনের প্রশস্ততার মত। তা প্রস্তুত রাখা হয়েছে তাদের জন্য যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলদের প্রতি ঈমান এনেছে। এটা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ, তিনি তা দেন যাকে ইচ্ছে করেন, আল্লাহ বড়ই অনুগ্রহশীল।', 'Race toward forgiveness from your Lord and a Garden whose width is like the width of the heavens and earth, prepared for those who believed in Allah and His messengers. That is the bounty of Allah which He gives to whom He wills, and Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057021.mp3', now()),
  (57, 22, '', '[{"id":24468,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":24469,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَ","transliteration":"aṣāba","translation_bn":"আপতিত","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24470,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24471,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُّصِيبَةٍۢ","transliteration":"muṣībatin","translation_bn":"বিপদ","root":"صوب","lemma":"مُّصِيبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24472,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24473,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24474,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24475,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24476,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِكُمْ","transliteration":"anfusikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের নিজেদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24477,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া যা","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":24478,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24479,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ","transliteration":"kitābin","translation_bn":"একটি কিতাবে (লিখিত)","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24480,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24481,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24482,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":24483,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَّبْرَأَهَآ ۚ","transliteration":"nabra-ahā","translation_bn":"তা আমরা ঘটাব","root":"برا","lemma":"نَّبْرَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24485,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":24486,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":24487,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24488,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":24489,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"yasīrun","translation_bn":"সহজ","root":"يسر","lemma":"يَسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":24490,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā aṣāba min muṣībatin fī l-arḍi walā fī anfusikum illā fī kitābin min qabli an nabra-ahā inna dhālika ʿalā l-lahi yasīrun', 'পৃথিবীতে অথবা তোমাদের নিজেদের উপর এমন কোন মুসীবত আসে না যা আমি সংঘটিত করার পূর্বে কিতাবে লিপিবদ্ধ রাখি না। এটা (করা) আল্লাহর জন্য খুবই সহজ।', 'No disaster strikes upon the earth or among yourselves except that it is in a register before We bring it into being - indeed that, for Allah, is easy -', 'পৃথিবীতে অথবা তোমাদের নিজেদের উপর এমন কোন মুসীবত আসে না যা আমি সংঘটিত করার পূর্বে কিতাবে লিপিবদ্ধ রাখি না। এটা (করা) আল্লাহর জন্য খুবই সহজ।', 'No disaster strikes upon the earth or among yourselves except that it is in a register before We bring it into being - indeed that, for Allah, is easy -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057022.mp3', now()),
  (57, 23, '', '[{"id":25812,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّكَيْلَا","transliteration":"likaylā","translation_bn":"না এটা এজন্য যে","root":"—","lemma":"كَى\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25813,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَأْسَوْا۟","transliteration":"tasaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিমর্ষ হও","root":"اسو","lemma":"تَأْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25814,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25815,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":25816,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَاتَكُمْ","transliteration":"fātakum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হারাও","root":"فوت","lemma":"فَاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25817,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25818,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَفْرَحُوا۟","transliteration":"tafraḥū","translation_bn":"উল্লাসিত হও তোমরা","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25819,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25820,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"ātākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দান করেন তিনি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25822,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":25823,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":25824,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25825,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25826,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُخْتَالٍۢ","transliteration":"mukh''tālin","translation_bn":"উদ্ধত","root":"خيل","lemma":"مُخْتَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":25827,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَخُورٍ","transliteration":"fakhūrin","translation_bn":"অহংকারীকে","root":"فخر","lemma":"فَخُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":25828,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'likaylā tasaw ʿalā mā fātakum walā tafraḥū bimā ātākum wal-lahu lā yuḥibbu kulla mukh''tālin fakhūrin', 'এটা এজন্য যে, তোমাদের যে ক্ষতি হয়েছে তার জন্য তোমরা যেন হতাশাগ্রস্ত না হও, আর তোমাদেরকে যা দান করা হয়েছে তার জন্য তোমরা যেন উৎফুল্ল না হও, কেননা আল্লাহ অহংকারী ও অধিক গর্বকারীকে পছন্দ করেন না-', 'In order that you not despair over what has eluded you and not exult [in pride] over what He has given you. And Allah does not like everyone self-deluded and boastful -', 'এটা এজন্য যে, তোমাদের যে ক্ষতি হয়েছে তার জন্য তোমরা যেন হতাশাগ্রস্ত না হও, আর তোমাদেরকে যা দান করা হয়েছে তার জন্য তোমরা যেন উৎফুল্ল না হও, কেননা আল্লাহ অহংকারী ও অধিক গর্বকারীকে পছন্দ করেন না-', 'In order that you not despair over what has eluded you and not exult [in pride] over what He has given you. And Allah does not like everyone self-deluded and boastful -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057023.mp3', now()),
  (57, 24, '', '[{"id":26541,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":26542,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَبْخَلُونَ","transliteration":"yabkhalūna","translation_bn":"কৃপণতা করে","root":"بخل","lemma":"بَخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26543,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَيَأْمُرُونَ","transliteration":"wayamurūna","translation_bn":"ও নির্দেশ দেয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26544,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"লোকদেরকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26545,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبُخْلِ ۗ","transliteration":"bil-bukh''li","translation_bn":"কৃপণতার ব্যাপারে","root":"بخل","lemma":"بُخْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26547,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26548,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَلَّ","transliteration":"yatawalla","translation_bn":"মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় (সে জেনে রাখুক)","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26549,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26550,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":26551,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":26552,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26553,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَمِيدُ","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdu","translation_bn":"প্রশংসিত","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26554,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna yabkhalūna wayamurūna l-nāsa bil-bukh''li waman yatawalla fa-inna l-laha huwa l-ghaniyu l-ḥamīdu', 'যারা কৃপণতা করে আর মানুষকে কৃপণতা করার আদেশ দেয় এবং যে ব্যক্তি (আল্লাহর পথ হতে) মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় (সে জেনে রাখুক) আল্লাহ অভাব মুক্ত, প্রশংসিত।', '[Those] who are stingy and enjoin upon people stinginess. And whoever turns away - then indeed, Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', 'যারা কৃপণতা করে আর মানুষকে কৃপণতা করার আদেশ দেয় এবং যে ব্যক্তি (আল্লাহর পথ হতে) মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় (সে জেনে রাখুক) আল্লাহ অভাব মুক্ত, প্রশংসিত।', '[Those] who are stingy and enjoin upon people stinginess. And whoever turns away - then indeed, Allah is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057024.mp3', now()),
  (57, 25, '', '[{"id":27931,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":27932,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27933,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلَنَا","transliteration":"rusulanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27934,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণাদি সহ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27935,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27936,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُمُ","transliteration":"maʿahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":27937,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27938,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمِيزَانَ","transliteration":"wal-mīzāna","translation_bn":"ও ন্যায়দণ্ড","root":"وزن","lemma":"مِيزَان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27939,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِيَقُومَ","transliteration":"liyaqūma","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠিত হয় যেন","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27940,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27941,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-qis''ṭi","translation_bn":"ন্যায়বিচারের সাথে","root":"قسط","lemma":"قِسْط","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27943,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27944,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَدِيدَ","transliteration":"l-ḥadīda","translation_bn":"লোহা","root":"حدد","lemma":"حَدِيد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27945,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"যার মধ্যে রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27946,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسٌۭ","transliteration":"basun","translation_bn":"শক্তি","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27947,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدٌۭ","transliteration":"shadīdun","translation_bn":"প্রচণ্ড","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27948,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنَـٰفِعُ","transliteration":"wamanāfiʿu","translation_bn":"এবং নানা উপকার","root":"نفع","lemma":"مَنَٰفِع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27949,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের জন্য","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27950,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"waliyaʿlama","translation_bn":"এবং (এ উদ্দেশ্যে ) জানেন যেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27951,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":27952,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":27953,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُهُۥ","transliteration":"yanṣuruhu","translation_bn":"তাঁকে সাহায্য করে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27954,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلَهُۥ","transliteration":"warusulahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলদের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27955,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","translation_bn":"(তাঁকে) না দেখা অবস্থায়","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27957,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":27958,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":27959,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"قَوِىٌّ","transliteration":"qawiyyun","translation_bn":"শক্তিধর","root":"قوي","lemma":"قَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27960,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমাশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":27961,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad arsalnā rusulanā bil-bayināti wa-anzalnā maʿahumu l-kitāba wal-mīzāna liyaqūma l-nāsu bil-qis''ṭi wa-anzalnā l-ḥadīda fīhi basun shadīdun wamanāfiʿu lilnnāsi waliyaʿlama l-lahu man yanṣuruhu warusulahu bil-ghaybi inna l-laha qawiyyun ʿazīzun', 'আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণসহ পাঠিয়েছি আর তাদের সঙ্গে অবতীর্ণ করেছি কিতাব ও (সত্য মিথ্যার) মানদন্ড যাতে মানুষ ইনসাফ ও সুবিচারের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত হতে পারে। আমি অবতীর্ণ করেছি লোহা যাতে আছে প্রচন্ড শক্তি আর মানুষের জন্য নানাবিধ উপকার যাতে আল্লাহ পরীক্ষা করতে পারেন আল্লাহকে না দেখেই তাঁকে আর তাঁর রসূলদেরকে কারা (এই লোহার শক্তি দিয়ে ও যাবতীয় উপায়ে) সাহায্য করে। আল্লাহ বড়ই শক্তিমান, মহাপরিক্রমশালী।', 'We have already sent Our messengers with clear evidences and sent down with them the Scripture and the balance that the people may maintain [their affairs] in justice. And We sent down iron, wherein is great military might and benefits for the people, and so that Allah may make evident those who support Him and His messengers unseen. Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', 'আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণসহ পাঠিয়েছি আর তাদের সঙ্গে অবতীর্ণ করেছি কিতাব ও (সত্য মিথ্যার) মানদন্ড যাতে মানুষ ইনসাফ ও সুবিচারের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত হতে পারে। আমি অবতীর্ণ করেছি লোহা যাতে আছে প্রচন্ড শক্তি আর মানুষের জন্য নানাবিধ উপকার যাতে আল্লাহ পরীক্ষা করতে পারেন আল্লাহকে না দেখেই তাঁকে আর তাঁর রসূলদেরকে কারা (এই লোহার শক্তি দিয়ে ও যাবতীয় উপায়ে) সাহায্য করে। আল্লাহ বড়ই শক্তিমান, মহাপরিক্রমশালী।', 'We have already sent Our messengers with clear evidences and sent down with them the Scripture and the balance that the people may maintain [their affairs] in justice. And We sent down iron, wherein is great military might and benefits for the people, and so that Allah may make evident those who support Him and His messengers unseen. Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057025.mp3', now()),
  (57, 26, '', '[{"id":29320,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29321,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَا","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29322,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُوحًۭا","transliteration":"nūḥan","translation_bn":"নূহকে","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29323,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَإِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"wa-ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ও ইবরাহীমকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29324,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বজায় রেখেছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29325,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29326,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّتِهِمَا","transliteration":"dhurriyyatihimā","translation_bn":"উভয়ের বংশধরদের","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29327,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّبُوَّةَ","transliteration":"l-nubuwata","translation_bn":"নবুয়্যত","root":"نبا","lemma":"نُّبُوَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29328,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-kitāba","translation_bn":"ও কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29330,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"famin''hum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29331,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّهْتَدٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"muh''tadin","translation_bn":"(কিছু হয়েছে) সৎ পথ প্রাপ্ত","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29333,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَثِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"wakathīrun","translation_bn":"আর অনেকেই","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29334,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29335,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29336,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā nūḥan wa-ib''rāhīma wajaʿalnā fī dhurriyyatihimā l-nubuwata wal-kitāba famin''hum muh''tadin wakathīrun min''hum fāsiqūna', 'আমি নূহ (আলাইহিস সালাম) আর ইব্রাহীম (আলাইহিস সালাম)-কে পাঠিয়েছিলাম আর তাদের বংশধরদের মধ্যে নুবুওয়াত ও কিতাবের ব্যবস্থা প্রতিষ্ঠা করেছিলাম। তাদের মধ্যে কেউ কেউ সঠিক পথ অবলম্বন করেছিল আর তাদের অধিকাংশই ছিল পাপাচারী।', 'And We have already sent Noah and Abraham and placed in their descendants prophethood and scripture; and among them is he who is guided, but many of them are defiantly disobedient.', 'আমি নূহ (আলাইহিস সালাম) আর ইব্রাহীম (আলাইহিস সালাম)-কে পাঠিয়েছিলাম আর তাদের বংশধরদের মধ্যে নুবুওয়াত ও কিতাবের ব্যবস্থা প্রতিষ্ঠা করেছিলাম। তাদের মধ্যে কেউ কেউ সঠিক পথ অবলম্বন করেছিল আর তাদের অধিকাংশই ছিল পাপাচারী।', 'And We have already sent Noah and Abraham and placed in their descendants prophethood and scripture; and among them is he who is guided, but many of them are defiantly disobedient.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057026.mp3', now()),
  (57, 27, '', '[{"id":29697,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29698,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَفَّيْنَا","transliteration":"qaffaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা অনুগামী করেছি","root":"قفو","lemma":"قَفَّيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29699,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29700,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَاثَـٰرِهِم","transliteration":"āthārihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পদচিহ্নের","root":"اثر","lemma":"أَثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29701,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِرُسُلِنَا","transliteration":"birusulinā","translation_bn":"আমাদের  রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29702,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَقَفَّيْنَا","transliteration":"waqaffaynā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা এরপর অনুগামী করেছি","root":"قفو","lemma":"قَفَّيْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29703,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِعِيسَى","transliteration":"biʿīsā","translation_bn":"ঈসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"عِيسَى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29704,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنِ","transliteration":"ib''ni","translation_bn":"পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29705,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَرْيَمَ","transliteration":"maryama","translation_bn":"মারইয়ামের","root":"—","lemma":"مَرْيَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29706,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা তাকে দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29707,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنجِيلَ","transliteration":"l-injīla","translation_bn":"ইনজিল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنجِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29708,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29709,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29710,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِ","transliteration":"qulūbi","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29711,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29712,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعُوهُ","transliteration":"ittabaʿūhu","translation_bn":"তা্র অনুসরণ করেছে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29713,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَأْفَةًۭ","transliteration":"rafatan","translation_bn":"করুণা","root":"راف","lemma":"رَأْفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29714,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ","transliteration":"waraḥmatan","translation_bn":"ও দয়া","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29715,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَرَهْبَانِيَّةً","transliteration":"warahbāniyyatan","translation_bn":"আর বৈরাগ্যবাদ/ সন্ন্যাসবাদ","root":"رهب","lemma":"رَهْبَانِيَّة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29716,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْتَدَعُوهَا","transliteration":"ib''tadaʿūhā","translation_bn":"তা তারা উদ্ভাবন করেছিল","root":"بدع","lemma":"ٱبْتَدَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29717,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":29718,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كَتَبْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"katabnāhā","translation_bn":"তার আমরা বিধান দিয়েছি","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29719,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29720,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":29721,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْتِغَآءَ","transliteration":"ib''tighāa","translation_bn":"(তারা করেছিল) সন্ধানে","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتِغَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29722,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"رِضْوَٰنِ","transliteration":"riḍ''wāni","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্টির","root":"رضو","lemma":"رِضْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29723,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29724,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29725,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"رَعَوْهَا","transliteration":"raʿawhā","translation_bn":"তা পালন করেছিল","root":"رعي","lemma":"رَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29726,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّ","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","translation_bn":"যথাযথ ভাবে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29727,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"رِعَايَتِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"riʿāyatihā","translation_bn":"তা পালন করা (উচিৎ যেমন)","root":"رعي","lemma":"رِعَايَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29729,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"فَـَٔاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"faātaynā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29730,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29731,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিল","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29732,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29733,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ajrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পুরস্কার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29735,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"وَكَثِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"wakathīrun","translation_bn":"এবং অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29736,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29737,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী (ফাসেক)","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29738,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma qaffaynā ʿalā āthārihim birusulinā waqaffaynā biʿīsā ib''ni maryama waātaynāhu l-injīla wajaʿalnā fī qulūbi alladhīna ittabaʿūhu rafatan waraḥmatan warahbāniyyatan ib''tadaʿūhā mā katabnāhā ʿalayhim illā ib''tighāa riḍ''wāni l-lahi famā raʿawhā ḥaqqa riʿāyatihā faātaynā alladhīna āmanū min''hum ajrahum wakathīrun min''hum fāsiqūna', 'অতঃপর তাদের পথ ধরে আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম, অতঃপর তাদের পেছনে আমি মারইয়াম-পুত্র ‘ঈসা (আলাইহিস সালাম)-কে পাঠিয়েছিলাম আর তাকে দিয়েছিলাম ইঞ্জীল। আর যারা তাকে অনুসরণ করেছিল তাদের অন্তরে দিয়েছিলাম করুণা ও দয়ামায়া। আর বৈরাগ্যবাদ- তা তারা নিজেরাই নতুনভাবে চালু করেছে আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টি লাভের আশায়। আমি তাদের উপর এ বিধান অপরিহার্য করিনি। আর সেটাও তারা লালন করতে পারেনি যেভাবে তা লালন করা প্রয়োজন ছিল। তাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান গ্রহণ করেছিল তাদেরকে আমি তাদের প্রাপ্য পুরস্কার দিয়েছিলাম। কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই ছিল পাপাচারী।', 'Then We sent following their footsteps Our messengers and followed [them] with Jesus, the son of Mary, and gave him the Gospel. And We placed in the hearts of those who followed him compassion and mercy and monasticism, which they innovated; We did not prescribe it for them except [that they did so] seeking the approval of Allah. But they did not observe it with due observance. So We gave the ones who believed among them their reward, but many of them are defiantly disobedient.', 'অতঃপর তাদের পথ ধরে আমি আমার রসূলদেরকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম, অতঃপর তাদের পেছনে আমি মারইয়াম-পুত্র ‘ঈসা (আলাইহিস সালাম)-কে পাঠিয়েছিলাম আর তাকে দিয়েছিলাম ইঞ্জীল। আর যারা তাকে অনুসরণ করেছিল তাদের অন্তরে দিয়েছিলাম করুণা ও দয়ামায়া। আর বৈরাগ্যবাদ- তা তারা নিজেরাই নতুনভাবে চালু করেছে আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টি লাভের আশায়। আমি তাদের উপর এ বিধান অপরিহার্য করিনি। আর সেটাও তারা লালন করতে পারেনি যেভাবে তা লালন করা প্রয়োজন ছিল। তাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান গ্রহণ করেছিল তাদেরকে আমি তাদের প্রাপ্য পুরস্কার দিয়েছিলাম। কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই ছিল পাপাচারী।', 'Then We sent following their footsteps Our messengers and followed [them] with Jesus, the son of Mary, and gave him the Gospel. And We placed in the hearts of those who followed him compassion and mercy and monasticism, which they innovated; We did not prescribe it for them except [that they did so] seeking the approval of Allah. But they did not observe it with due observance. So We gave the ones who believed among them their reward, but many of them are defiantly disobedient.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057027.mp3', now()),
  (57, 28, '', '[{"id":30784,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":30785,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30786,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30787,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30788,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30789,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَءَامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"waāminū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30790,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِرَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"birasūlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসূলের প্রতি","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30791,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِكُمْ","transliteration":"yu''tikum","translation_bn":"তিনি তোমাদের দিবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30792,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كِفْلَيْنِ","transliteration":"kif''layni","translation_bn":"দ্বিগুণ অংশ","root":"كفل","lemma":"كِفْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30793,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30794,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَّحْمَتِهِۦ","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুগ্রহ","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30795,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَجْعَل","transliteration":"wayajʿal","translation_bn":"এবং দেবেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30796,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30797,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نُورًۭا","transliteration":"nūran","translation_bn":"জ্যোতি","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30798,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَمْشُونَ","transliteration":"tamshūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা চলবে","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30799,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তা দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30800,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَيَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wayaghfir","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30801,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30803,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30804,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30805,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30806,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ittaqū l-laha waāminū birasūlihi yu''tikum kif''layni min raḥmatihi wayajʿal lakum nūran tamshūna bihi wayaghfir lakum wal-lahu ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'ওহে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর আর তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি ঈমান আন, তিনি তাঁর অনুগ্রহে তোমাদেরকে দ্বিগুণ পুরস্কার দিবেন আর তিনি তোমাদের জন্য আলোর ব্যবস্থা করবেন যা দিয়ে তোমরা পথ চলবে, আর তিনি তোমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দিবেন। আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and believe in His Messenger; He will [then] give you a double portion of His mercy and make for you a light by which you will walk and forgive you; and Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'ওহে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর আর তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি ঈমান আন, তিনি তাঁর অনুগ্রহে তোমাদেরকে দ্বিগুণ পুরস্কার দিবেন আর তিনি তোমাদের জন্য আলোর ব্যবস্থা করবেন যা দিয়ে তোমরা পথ চলবে, আর তিনি তোমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দিবেন। আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and believe in His Messenger; He will [then] give you a double portion of His mercy and make for you a light by which you will walk and forgive you; and Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057028.mp3', now()),
  (57, 29, '', '[{"id":32349,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّئَلَّا","transliteration":"li-allā","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32350,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"yaʿlama","translation_bn":"জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32351,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلُ","transliteration":"ahlu","translation_bn":"অধিকারীরা","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32352,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32353,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":32354,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَقْدِرُونَ","transliteration":"yaqdirūna","translation_bn":"তারা অধিকার রাখে","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32355,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32356,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32357,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32358,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِ","transliteration":"faḍli","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32359,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۙ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32361,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32362,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلَ","transliteration":"l-faḍla","translation_bn":"(সমস্ত) অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32363,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِيَدِ","transliteration":"biyadi","translation_bn":"হাতে","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32364,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32365,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِيهِ","transliteration":"yu''tīhi","translation_bn":"তা দান করেন তিনি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32366,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32367,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32369,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32370,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"অধিকারী","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32371,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","transliteration":"l-faḍli","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32372,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmi","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32373,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'li-allā yaʿlama ahlu l-kitābi allā yaqdirūna ʿalā shayin min faḍli l-lahi wa-anna l-faḍla biyadi l-lahi yu''tīhi man yashāu wal-lahu dhū l-faḍli l-ʿaẓīmi', '(আমি আহলে কিতাব ছাড়া অন্যত্র নুবুওয়াত দিলাম) এ জন্য যে, আহলে কিতাবগণ যেন জেনে নিতে পারে যে, আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের কোন কিছুকেই তাদের নিয়ন্ত্রণ করার কোন ক্ষমতা নেই, আর (তারা যেন আরো জেনে নিতে পারে যে) অনুগ্রহ একমাত্র আল্লাহর হাতেই, যাকে ইচ্ছে তিনিই তা দেন। আল্লাহ বিশাল অনুগ্রহের অধিকারী।', '[This is] so that the People of the Scripture may know that they are not able [to obtain] anything from the bounty of Allah and that [all] bounty is in the hand of Allah; He gives it to whom He wills. And Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', '(আমি আহলে কিতাব ছাড়া অন্যত্র নুবুওয়াত দিলাম) এ জন্য যে, আহলে কিতাবগণ যেন জেনে নিতে পারে যে, আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের কোন কিছুকেই তাদের নিয়ন্ত্রণ করার কোন ক্ষমতা নেই, আর (তারা যেন আরো জেনে নিতে পারে যে) অনুগ্রহ একমাত্র আল্লাহর হাতেই, যাকে ইচ্ছে তিনিই তা দেন। আল্লাহ বিশাল অনুগ্রহের অধিকারী।', '[This is] so that the People of the Scripture may know that they are not able [to obtain] anything from the bounty of Allah and that [all] bounty is in the hand of Allah; He gives it to whom He wills. And Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/057029.mp3', now())
