"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمُ","transliteration":"jahannamu","translation_bn":"জাহান্নাম","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":8850,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"yaṣlawnahā","translation_bn":"তাতে তারা প্রবেশ করবে","root":"صلي","lemma":"يَصْلَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8852,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"فَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"fabi''sa","translation_bn":"অতি নিকৃষ্ট তা","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8853,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"আবাসস্থল (হিসেবে)","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8854,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara ilā alladhīna nuhū ʿani l-najwā thumma yaʿūdūna limā nuhū ʿanhu wayatanājawna bil-ith''mi wal-ʿud''wāni wamaʿṣiyati l-rasūli wa-idhā jāūka ḥayyawka bimā lam yuḥayyika bihi l-lahu wayaqūlūna fī anfusihim lawlā yuʿadhibunā l-lahu bimā naqūlu ḥasbuhum jahannamu yaṣlawnahā fabi''sa l-maṣīru', 'তুমি কি তাদেরকে দেখনি যাদেরকে গোপন পরামর্শ করতে নিষেধ করা হয়েছিল, অতঃপর তারা আবার তাই করল যা করতে তাদেরকে নিষেধ করা হয়েছিল, তারা গোপনে পরামর্শ করল পাপাচার, সীমালঙ্ঘন আর রসূলকে অমান্য করা নিয়ে। তারা যখন তোমার কাছে আসে তখন তারা তোমাকে এমনভাবে সম্ভাষণ করে যেমনভাবে আল্লাহ তোমাকে সম্ভাষণ করেননি। তারা মনে মনে বলে- ‘আমরা যা বলি তার জন্য আল্লাহ আমাদেরকে ‘আযাব দেন না কেন? জাহান্নামই তাদের জন্য যথেষ্ট, তাতে তারা জ্বলবে, কতই না নিকৃষ্ট সেই গন্তব্যস্থল!', 'Have you not considered those who were forbidden from private conversation, then they return to that which they were forbidden and converse among themselves about sin and aggression and disobedience to the Messenger? And when they come to you, they greet you with that [word] by which Allah does not greet you and say among themselves, "Why does Allah not punish us for what we say?" Sufficient for them is Hell, which they will [enter to] burn, and wretched is the destination.', 'তুমি কি তাদেরকে দেখনি যাদেরকে গোপন পরামর্শ করতে নিষেধ করা হয়েছিল, অতঃপর তারা আবার তাই করল যা করতে তাদেরকে নিষেধ করা হয়েছিল, তারা গোপনে পরামর্শ করল পাপাচার, সীমালঙ্ঘন আর রসূলকে অমান্য করা নিয়ে। তারা যখন তোমার কাছে আসে তখন তারা তোমাকে এমনভাবে সম্ভাষণ করে যেমনভাবে আল্লাহ তোমাকে সম্ভাষণ করেননি। তারা মনে মনে বলে- ‘আমরা যা বলি তার জন্য আল্লাহ আমাদেরকে ‘আযাব দেন না কেন? জাহান্নামই তাদের জন্য যথেষ্ট, তাতে তারা জ্বলবে, কতই না নিকৃষ্ট সেই গন্তব্যস্থল!', 'Have you not considered those who were forbidden from private conversation, then they return to that which they were forbidden and converse among themselves about sin and aggression and disobedience to the Messenger? And when they come to you, they greet you with that [word] by which Allah does not greet you and say among themselves, "Why does Allah not punish us for what we say?" Sufficient for them is Hell, which they will [enter to] burn, and wretched is the destination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058008.mp3', now()),
  (58, 9, '', '[{"id":10040,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":10041,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":10042,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10043,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":10044,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَنَـٰجَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"tanājaytum","translation_bn":"তোমরা গোপনে পরামর্শ করো","root":"نجو","lemma":"تَنَٰجَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10045,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"না তবে","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10046,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَتَنَـٰجَوْا۟","transliteration":"tatanājaw","translation_bn":"পরস্পরে গোপন পরামর্শ করো","root":"نجو","lemma":"تَنَٰجَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10047,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْإِثْمِ","transliteration":"bil-ith''mi","translation_bn":"পাপের বিষয়ে","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10048,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ","transliteration":"wal-ʿud''wāni","translation_bn":"ও বাড়াবাড়ির","root":"عدو","lemma":"عُدْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10049,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَعْصِيَتِ","transliteration":"wamaʿṣiyati","translation_bn":"এবং অবাধ্যতার (ক্ষেত্রে)","root":"عصي","lemma":"مَعْصِيَت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10050,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"l-rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10051,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَتَنَـٰجَوْا۟","transliteration":"watanājaw","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা গোপনে পরামর্শ করো","root":"نجو","lemma":"تَنَٰجَيْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10052,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبِرِّ","transliteration":"bil-biri","translation_bn":"কল্যাণকর কাজ সম্পর্কে","root":"برر","lemma":"بِرّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10053,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلتَّقْوَىٰ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-taqwā","translation_bn":"এবং তাকওয়ার (ক্ষেত্রে)","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10055,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10056,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":10057,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি (এমন সত্তা যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":10058,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10059,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تُحْشَرُونَ","transliteration":"tuḥ''sharūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সমবেত করা হবে","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10060,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū idhā tanājaytum falā tatanājaw bil-ith''mi wal-ʿud''wāni wamaʿṣiyati l-rasūli watanājaw bil-biri wal-taqwā wa-ittaqū l-laha alladhī ilayhi tuḥ''sharūna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা যখন গোপন পরামর্শ কর, তখন পাপাচার, সীমালঙ্ঘন আর রসূলকে অমান্য করার পরামর্শ কর না। তোমরা সৎকর্ম ও তাকওয়া অবলম্বনের ব্যাপারে পরামর্শ করো। আর তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যাঁর কাছে তোমাদেরকে সমবেত করা হবে।', 'O you who have believed, when you converse privately, do not converse about sin and aggression and disobedience to the Messenger but converse about righteousness and piety. And fear Allah, to whom you will be gathered.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা যখন গোপন পরামর্শ কর, তখন পাপাচার, সীমালঙ্ঘন আর রসূলকে অমান্য করার পরামর্শ কর না। তোমরা সৎকর্ম ও তাকওয়া অবলম্বনের ব্যাপারে পরামর্শ করো। আর তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যাঁর কাছে তোমাদেরকে সমবেত করা হবে।', 'O you who have believed, when you converse privately, do not converse about sin and aggression and disobedience to the Messenger but converse about righteousness and piety. And fear Allah, to whom you will be gathered.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058009.mp3', now()),
  (58, 10, '', '[{"id":11256,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":11257,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّجْوَىٰ","transliteration":"l-najwā","translation_bn":"গোপন পরামর্শ (করা হয়)","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجْوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11258,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11259,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","translation_bn":"শয়তানের","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11260,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِيَحْزُنَ","transliteration":"liyaḥzuna","translation_bn":"দুঃখ দেয়ার জন্যে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11261,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":11262,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11263,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"walaysa","translation_bn":"আর না (কেউ)","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11264,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِضَآرِّهِمْ","transliteration":"biḍārrihim","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে ক্ষতি করতে পারবে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَا^رّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11265,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11266,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":11267,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِ","transliteration":"bi-idh''ni","translation_bn":"অনুমতি","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11268,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11270,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَى","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"এবং উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11271,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11272,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","transliteration":"falyatawakkali","translation_bn":"ভরসা করা কর্তব্য","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11273,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11274,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā l-najwā mina l-shayṭāni liyaḥzuna alladhīna āmanū walaysa biḍārrihim shayan illā bi-idh''ni l-lahi waʿalā l-lahi falyatawakkali l-mu''minūna', 'গোপন পরামর্শ হল মু’মিনদেরকে দুঃখ দেয়ার জন্য শয়ত্বান প্ররোচিত কাজ। তবে আল্লাহর অনুমতি ছাড়া তা তাদের কোন ক্ষতি করতে পারে না। মু’মিনদের কর্তব্য হল একমাত্র আল্লাহরই উপর ভরসা করা।', 'Private conversation is only from Satan that he may grieve those who have believed, but he will not harm them at all except by permission of Allah. And upon Allah let the believers rely.', 'গোপন পরামর্শ হল মু’মিনদেরকে দুঃখ দেয়ার জন্য শয়ত্বান প্ররোচিত কাজ। তবে আল্লাহর অনুমতি ছাড়া তা তাদের কোন ক্ষতি করতে পারে না। মু’মিনদের কর্তব্য হল একমাত্র আল্লাহরই উপর ভরসা করা।', 'Private conversation is only from Satan that he may grieve those who have believed, but he will not harm them at all except by permission of Allah. And upon Allah let the believers rely.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058010.mp3', now()),
  (58, 11, '', '[{"id":12565,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":12566,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12567,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12568,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":12569,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12570,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12571,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَفَسَّحُوا۟","transliteration":"tafassaḥū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা প্রশস্ত করে দাও\"","root":"فسح","lemma":"تَفَسَّحُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12572,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12573,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَجَـٰلِسِ","transliteration":"l-majālisi","translation_bn":"বৈঠকের","root":"جلس","lemma":"مَجَٰلِس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12574,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱفْسَحُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-if''saḥū","translation_bn":"তোমরা তখন প্রশস্ত করে দাও","root":"فسح","lemma":"يَفْسَحِ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12575,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَفْسَحِ","transliteration":"yafsaḥi","translation_bn":"প্রশস্থতা দেবেন","root":"فسح","lemma":"يَفْسَحِ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12576,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":12577,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12579,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12580,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12581,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱنشُزُوا۟","transliteration":"unshuzū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা উঠে যাও\"","root":"نشز","lemma":"ٱنشُزُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12582,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنشُزُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-unshuzū","translation_bn":"তোমরা তখন উঠে যেয়ো","root":"نشز","lemma":"ٱنشُزُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12583,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَرْفَعِ","transliteration":"yarfaʿi","translation_bn":"উন্নত করবেন/ বাড়িয়ে দেবেন","root":"رفع","lemma":"رَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12584,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":12585,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12586,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12587,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12588,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12589,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12590,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمَ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''ma","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12591,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"darajātin","translation_bn":"মর্যাদায় (উন্নত করবেন)","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12593,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12594,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"সেবিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12595,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12596,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12597,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū idhā qīla lakum tafassaḥū fī l-majālisi fa-if''saḥū yafsaḥi l-lahu lakum wa-idhā qīla unshuzū fa-unshuzū yarfaʿi l-lahu alladhīna āmanū minkum wa-alladhīna ūtū l-ʿil''ma darajātin wal-lahu bimā taʿmalūna khabīrun', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমাদেরকে যখন বলা হয়- ‘বৈঠক প্রশস্ত করে দাও’, তখন তোমরা তা প্রশস্ত করে দিবে, আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে প্রশস্ততা দান করবেন। আর যখন বলা হয়- ‘তোমরা উঠে যাও’, তখন তোমরা উঠে যাবে। তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দান করা হয়েছে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে মর্যাদায় উচ্চ করবেন। তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তার খবর রাখেন।', 'O you who have believed, when you are told, "Space yourselves" in assemblies, then make space; Allah will make space for you. And when you are told, "Arise," then arise; Allah will raise those who have believed among you and those who were given knowledge, by degrees. And Allah is Acquainted with what you do.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমাদেরকে যখন বলা হয়- ‘বৈঠক প্রশস্ত করে দাও’, তখন তোমরা তা প্রশস্ত করে দিবে, আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে প্রশস্ততা দান করবেন। আর যখন বলা হয়- ‘তোমরা উঠে যাও’, তখন তোমরা উঠে যাবে। তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যাদেরকে জ্ঞান দান করা হয়েছে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে মর্যাদায় উচ্চ করবেন। তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তার খবর রাখেন।', 'O you who have believed, when you are told, "Space yourselves" in assemblies, then make space; Allah will make space for you. And when you are told, "Arise," then arise; Allah will raise those who have believed among you and those who were given knowledge, by degrees. And Allah is Acquainted with what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058011.mp3', now()),
  (58, 12, '', '[{"id":13897,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":13898,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":13899,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13900,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":13901,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَـٰجَيْتُمُ","transliteration":"nājaytumu","translation_bn":"তোমরা একান্তে কথা বলবে","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَٰجَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13902,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","transliteration":"l-rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসূলের সাথে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13903,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدِّمُوا۟","transliteration":"faqaddimū","translation_bn":"তোমরা পেশ করবে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13904,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"(মাঝে)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":13905,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَدَىْ","transliteration":"yaday","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13906,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَجْوَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"najwākum","translation_bn":"তোমার একান্তে কথা বলার","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجْوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13907,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"صَدَقَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"ṣadaqatan","translation_bn":"সদকা","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13909,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":13910,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13911,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13912,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطْهَرُ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-aṭharu","translation_bn":"এবং পবিত্র","root":"طهر","lemma":"أَطْهَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13914,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13915,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":13916,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَجِدُوا۟","transliteration":"tajidū","translation_bn":"তোমরা পাও (কিছুই)","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13917,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13918,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13919,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13920,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13921,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū idhā nājaytumu l-rasūla faqaddimū bayna yaday najwākum ṣadaqatan dhālika khayrun lakum wa-aṭharu fa-in lam tajidū fa-inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা যখন রসূলের সঙ্গে গোপনে কথা বল, তখন গোপনে কথা বলার আগে সদাক্বাহ দাও, এটাই তোমাদের জন্য উত্তম ও অতি পবিত্র পন্থা। আর যদি সদাক্বাহ জোগাড় করতে না পার, তাহলে আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'O you who have believed, when you [wish to] privately consult the Messenger, present before your consultation a charity. That is better for you and purer. But if you find not [the means] - then indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা যখন রসূলের সঙ্গে গোপনে কথা বল, তখন গোপনে কথা বলার আগে সদাক্বাহ দাও, এটাই তোমাদের জন্য উত্তম ও অতি পবিত্র পন্থা। আর যদি সদাক্বাহ জোগাড় করতে না পার, তাহলে আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'O you who have believed, when you [wish to] privately consult the Messenger, present before your consultation a charity. That is better for you and purer. But if you find not [the means] - then indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058012.mp3', now()),
  (58, 13, '', '[{"id":15041,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ءَأَشْفَقْتُمْ","transliteration":"a-ashfaqtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা কি ভয় পেয়ে গেছ","root":"شفق","lemma":"أَشْفَقْ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":15042,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":15043,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُقَدِّمُوا۟","transliteration":"tuqaddimū","translation_bn":"তোমরা দিবে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15044,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"(মাঝে)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":15045,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَدَىْ","transliteration":"yaday","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15046,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَجْوَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"najwākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের একান্তে কথা বলার","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجْوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15047,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَدَقَـٰتٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"ṣadaqātin","translation_bn":"সদকা","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15049,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذْ","transliteration":"fa-idh","translation_bn":"যদি অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15050,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":15051,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَفْعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"tafʿalū","translation_bn":"তোমরা করতে পার","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15052,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَتَابَ","transliteration":"watāba","translation_bn":"আর মাফ করে দিলেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15053,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15054,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15055,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَأَقِيمُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aqīmū","translation_bn":"তবে তোমরা প্রতিষ্ঠা কর","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15056,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15057,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"waātū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা দাও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15058,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-zakata","translation_bn":"জাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15059,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15060,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15061,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15063,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":15064,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":15065,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15066,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ কর","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15067,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'a-ashfaqtum an tuqaddimū bayna yaday najwākum ṣadaqātin fa-idh lam tafʿalū watāba l-lahu ʿalaykum fa-aqīmū l-ṣalata waātū l-zakata wa-aṭīʿū l-laha warasūlahu wal-lahu khabīrun bimā taʿmalūna', 'তোমরা কি ভয় পেয়ে গেলে যে, তোমাদেরকে (নবীর সঙ্গে) গোপনে কথাবার্তা বলার আগে সদাক্বাহ দিতে হবে? তোমরা যদি তা না কর, তাহলে আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দিলেন, কাজেই তোমরা নামায কায়িম কর, যাকাত দাও এবং আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আনুগত্য কর। তোমরা যা কর সে বিষয়ে আল্লাহ পুরোপুরি অবগত।', 'Have you feared to present before your consultation charities? Then when you do not and Allah has forgiven you, then [at least] establish prayer and give zakah and obey Allah and His Messenger. And Allah is Acquainted with what you do.', 'তোমরা কি ভয় পেয়ে গেলে যে, তোমাদেরকে (নবীর সঙ্গে) গোপনে কথাবার্তা বলার আগে সদাক্বাহ দিতে হবে? তোমরা যদি তা না কর, তাহলে আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দিলেন, কাজেই তোমরা নামায কায়িম কর, যাকাত দাও এবং আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের আনুগত্য কর। তোমরা যা কর সে বিষয়ে আল্লাহ পুরোপুরি অবগত।', 'Have you feared to present before your consultation charities? Then when you do not and Allah has forgiven you, then [at least] establish prayer and give zakah and obey Allah and His Messenger. And Allah is Acquainted with what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058013.mp3', now()),
  (58, 14, '', '[{"id":16110,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নি কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":16111,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখ","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16112,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16113,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":16114,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"বন্ধু বানিয়ে নিয়েছে","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16115,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"(এমন) সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16116,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"غَضِبَ","transliteration":"ghaḍiba","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ দিয়েছেন","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16117,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":16118,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"যাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16119,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":16120,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":16121,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16122,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16123,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16124,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَيَحْلِفُونَ","transliteration":"wayaḥlifūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা শপথ করে","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَفْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16125,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16126,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبِ","transliteration":"l-kadhibi","translation_bn":"মিথ্যার","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":16127,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"অথচ তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":16128,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানেও","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16129,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara ilā alladhīna tawallaw qawman ghaḍiba l-lahu ʿalayhim mā hum minkum walā min''hum wayaḥlifūna ʿalā l-kadhibi wahum yaʿlamūna', 'তুমি কি তাদেরকে দেখনি যারা সেই সম্প্রদায়ের সঙ্গে বন্ধুত্ব করে যেই সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি আল্লাহ রাগান্বিত? তারা না তোমাদের লোক, আর না তাদের লোক আর তারা জেনে শুনে মিথ্যে শপথ করে।', 'Have you not considered those who make allies of a people with whom Allah has become angry? They are neither of you nor of them, and they swear to untruth while they know [they are lying].', 'তুমি কি তাদেরকে দেখনি যারা সেই সম্প্রদায়ের সঙ্গে বন্ধুত্ব করে যেই সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি আল্লাহ রাগান্বিত? তারা না তোমাদের লোক, আর না তাদের লোক আর তারা জেনে শুনে মিথ্যে শপথ করে।', 'Have you not considered those who make allies of a people with whom Allah has become angry? They are neither of you nor of them, and they swear to untruth while they know [they are lying].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058014.mp3', now()),
  (58, 15, '', '[{"id":17326,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَعَدَّ","transliteration":"aʿadda","translation_bn":"প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17327,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":17328,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17329,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًۭا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17330,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدًا ۖ","transliteration":"shadīdan","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":17332,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":17333,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَآءَ","transliteration":"sāa","translation_bn":"অতি মন্দ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17334,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17335,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17336,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করে আসছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17337,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aʿadda l-lahu lahum ʿadhāban shadīdan innahum sāa mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন কঠিন শাস্তি, তারা যা করে তা কতই না মন্দ!', 'Allah has prepared for them a severe punishment. Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.', 'আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন কঠিন শাস্তি, তারা যা করে তা কতই না মন্দ!', 'Allah has prepared for them a severe punishment. Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058015.mp3', now()),
  (58, 16, '', '[{"id":18414,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","translation_bn":"তারা গ্রহণ করেছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18415,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ","transliteration":"aymānahum","translation_bn":"তাদের শপথগুলোকে","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18416,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جُنَّةًۭ","transliteration":"junnatan","translation_bn":"ঢালস্বরূপ","root":"جنن","lemma":"جُنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18417,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَصَدُّوا۟","transliteration":"faṣaddū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা বাধা দেয়","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18418,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18419,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18420,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18421,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"falahum","translation_bn":"অতএব তাদের জন্য (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18422,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18423,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُّهِينٌۭ","transliteration":"muhīnun","translation_bn":"অপমানকর","root":"هون","lemma":"مُّهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18424,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ittakhadhū aymānahum junnatan faṣaddū ʿan sabīli l-lahi falahum ʿadhābun muhīnun', 'তারা তাদের শপথগুলোকে ঢাল বানিয়ে নিয়েছে, এর সাহায্যে তারা মানুষকে আল্লাহর পথ থেকে ফিরিয়ে রাখে, এ কারণে তাদের জন্য আছে অপমানজনক শাস্তি।', 'They took their [false] oaths as a cover, so they averted [people] from the way of Allah, and for them is a humiliating punishment.', 'তারা তাদের শপথগুলোকে ঢাল বানিয়ে নিয়েছে, এর সাহায্যে তারা মানুষকে আল্লাহর পথ থেকে ফিরিয়ে রাখে, এ কারণে তাদের জন্য আছে অপমানজনক শাস্তি।', 'They took their [false] oaths as a cover, so they averted [people] from the way of Allah, and for them is a humiliating punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058016.mp3', now()),
  (58, 17, '', '[{"id":19416,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনই না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":19417,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُغْنِىَ","transliteration":"tugh''niya","translation_bn":"কাজে লাগবে","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19418,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19419,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ","transliteration":"amwāluhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ধনসম্পদ","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19420,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19421,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلَـٰدُهُم","transliteration":"awlāduhum","translation_bn":"তাদের সন্তানাদি (বাঁচার জন্য)","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19422,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19423,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19424,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19426,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":19427,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19428,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19430,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":19431,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19432,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","transliteration":"khālidūna","translation_bn":"চিরকাল থাকবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19433,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lan tugh''niya ʿanhum amwāluhum walā awlāduhum mina l-lahi shayan ulāika aṣḥābu l-nāri hum fīhā khālidūna', 'তাদের ধন-সম্পদ আর সন্তানাদি আল্লাহর শাস্তি থেকে তাদেরকে বাঁচানোর ব্যাপারে কোন কাজে আসবে না, তারা জাহান্নামের অধিবাসী, সেখানে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Never will their wealth or their children avail them against Allah at all. Those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally', 'তাদের ধন-সম্পদ আর সন্তানাদি আল্লাহর শাস্তি থেকে তাদেরকে বাঁচানোর ব্যাপারে কোন কাজে আসবে না, তারা জাহান্নামের অধিবাসী, সেখানে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Never will their wealth or their children avail them against Allah at all. Those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058017.mp3', now()),
  (58, 18, '', '[{"id":20479,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20480,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَبْعَثُهُمُ","transliteration":"yabʿathuhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের উঠাবেন","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20481,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20482,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সকলকেই","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20483,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَيَحْلِفُونَ","transliteration":"fayaḥlifūna","translation_bn":"তারা তখনও শপথ করবে","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَفْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20484,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20485,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20486,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَحْلِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥlifūna","translation_bn":"তারা শপথ করে","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20487,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20489,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَيَحْسَبُونَ","transliteration":"wayaḥsabūna","translation_bn":"ও তারা মনে করে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20490,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20491,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(প্রতিষ্ঠিত) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20492,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20494,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":20495,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20496,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":20497,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰذِبُونَ","transliteration":"l-kādhibūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদী","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20498,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yawma yabʿathuhumu l-lahu jamīʿan fayaḥlifūna lahu kamā yaḥlifūna lakum wayaḥsabūna annahum ʿalā shayin alā innahum humu l-kādhibūna', 'আল্লাহ যেদিন তাদের সবাইকে আবার জীবিত করে উঠাবেন, তখন তারা আল্লাহর কাছে ঠিক সে রকম শপথই করবে, যেমন শপথ তারা তোমাদের নিকট করে, আর তারা মনে করে যে, তাদের কিছু (কোন ভিত্তি) আছে। জেনে রেখ, তারা খুবই মিথ্যেবাদী।', 'On the Day Allah will resurrect them all, and they will swear to Him as they swear to you and think that they are [standing] on something. Unquestionably, it is they who are the liars.', 'আল্লাহ যেদিন তাদের সবাইকে আবার জীবিত করে উঠাবেন, তখন তারা আল্লাহর কাছে ঠিক সে রকম শপথই করবে, যেমন শপথ তারা তোমাদের নিকট করে, আর তারা মনে করে যে, তাদের কিছু (কোন ভিত্তি) আছে। জেনে রেখ, তারা খুবই মিথ্যেবাদী।', 'On the Day Allah will resurrect them all, and they will swear to Him as they swear to you and think that they are [standing] on something. Unquestionably, it is they who are the liars.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058018.mp3', now()),
  (58, 19, '', '[{"id":21829,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَحْوَذَ","transliteration":"is''taḥwadha","translation_bn":"প্রভুত্ব বিস্তার করেছে","root":"حوذ","lemma":"ٱسْتَحْوَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21830,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمُ","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21831,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21832,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنسَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-ansāhum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের ভুলিয়ে দিয়েছে","root":"نسي","lemma":"أَنسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21833,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرَ","transliteration":"dhik''ra","translation_bn":"স্মরণ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21834,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":21836,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক (অন্তর্ভুক্ত)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":21837,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حِزْبُ","transliteration":"ḥiz''bu","translation_bn":"দলের","root":"حزب","lemma":"حِزْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21838,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","translation_bn":"শয়তানের","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21840,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":21841,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":21842,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حِزْبَ","transliteration":"ḥiz''ba","translation_bn":"দল","root":"حزب","lemma":"حِزْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21843,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","translation_bn":"শয়তানের","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21844,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":21845,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ","transliteration":"l-khāsirūna","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হবে","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَٰسِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21846,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'is''taḥwadha ʿalayhimu l-shayṭānu fa-ansāhum dhik''ra l-lahi ulāika ḥiz''bu l-shayṭāni alā inna ḥiz''ba l-shayṭāni humu l-khāsirūna', 'শয়ত্বান তাদের উপর প্রভাব খাটিয়ে বসেছে, আর তাদেরকে আল্লাহর স্মরণ ভুলিয়ে দিয়েছে। তারা শয়ত্বানের দল। জেনে রেখ, শয়ত্বানের দলই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Satan has overcome them and made them forget the remembrance of Allah. Those are the party of Satan. Unquestionably, the party of Satan - they will be the losers.', 'শয়ত্বান তাদের উপর প্রভাব খাটিয়ে বসেছে, আর তাদেরকে আল্লাহর স্মরণ ভুলিয়ে দিয়েছে। তারা শয়ত্বানের দল। জেনে রেখ, শয়ত্বানের দলই ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Satan has overcome them and made them forget the remembrance of Allah. Those are the party of Satan. Unquestionably, the party of Satan - they will be the losers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058019.mp3', now()),
  (58, 20, '', '[{"id":22664,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":22665,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":22666,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُحَآدُّونَ","transliteration":"yuḥāddūna","translation_bn":"বিরোধিতা করে","root":"حدد","lemma":"يُحَا^دُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22667,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":22668,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22669,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":22670,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":22671,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَذَلِّينَ","transliteration":"l-adhalīna","translation_bn":"চরম অপমানিতদের","root":"ذلل","lemma":"أَذَلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22672,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna yuḥāddūna l-laha warasūlahu ulāika fī l-adhalīna', 'যারা আল্লাহর ও তাঁর রসূলের বিরোধিতা করে, তারাই সবচেয়ে বেশী লাঞ্ছিতদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'Indeed, the ones who oppose Allah and His Messenger - those will be among the most humbled.', 'যারা আল্লাহর ও তাঁর রসূলের বিরোধিতা করে, তারাই সবচেয়ে বেশী লাঞ্ছিতদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'Indeed, the ones who oppose Allah and His Messenger - those will be among the most humbled.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058020.mp3', now()),
  (58, 21, '', '[{"id":23813,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَتَبَ","transliteration":"kataba","translation_bn":"লিখে দিয়েছেন","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23814,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23815,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَأَغْلِبَنَّ","transliteration":"la-aghlibanna","translation_bn":"\"অবশ্যই বিজয়ী হব","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَلَبُ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":23816,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":23817,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلِىٓ ۚ","transliteration":"warusulī","translation_bn":"ও আমার রাসূলরা\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":23819,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":23820,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23821,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَوِىٌّ","transliteration":"qawiyyun","translation_bn":"শক্তিধর","root":"قوي","lemma":"قَوِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":23822,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":23823,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kataba l-lahu la-aghlibanna anā warusulī inna l-laha qawiyyun ʿazīzun', 'আল্লাহ লিখে দিয়েছেন যে, অবশ্য অবশ্যই আমি ও আমার রসূলগণ বিজয়ী থাকব। আল্লাহ মহা শক্তিমান ও পরাক্রমশালী।', 'Allah has written, "I will surely overcome, I and My messengers." Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', 'আল্লাহ লিখে দিয়েছেন যে, অবশ্য অবশ্যই আমি ও আমার রসূলগণ বিজয়ী থাকব। আল্লাহ মহা শক্তিমান ও পরাক্রমশালী।', 'Allah has written, "I will surely overcome, I and My messengers." Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/058021.mp3', now()),
  (58, 22, '', '[{"id":24778,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":24779,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَجِدُ","transliteration":"tajidu","translation_bn":"পাবে তুমি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24780,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে (এমন যে)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24781,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাস করে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24782,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":24783,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","translation_bn":"ও উপর দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24784,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","translation_bn":"শেষ","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24785,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُوَآدُّونَ","transliteration":"yuwāddūna","translation_bn":"(আবার তারা) বন্ধুত্বও করে","root":"ودد","lemma":"وَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24786,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাদের সাথে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":24787,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَآدَّ","transliteration":"ḥādda","translation_bn":"বিরোধিতা করে","root":"حدد","lemma":"حَا^دَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24788,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":24789,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24790,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24791,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":24792,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"ābāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পিতা","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24793,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24794,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَبْنَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"abnāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24795,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24796,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِخْوَٰنَهُمْ","transliteration":"ikh''wānahum","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাইয়েরা","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24797,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24798,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَشِيرَتَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿashīratahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জাতি-গোত্র","root":"عشر","lemma":"عَشِيرَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24800,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":24801,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَتَبَ","transliteration":"kataba","translation_bn":"সুদৃঢ় করে