َه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":7710,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدُ","transliteration":"shadīdu","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7711,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِقَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿiqābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তিদানে","root":"عقب","lemma":"عِقَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":7712,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā afāa l-lahu ʿalā rasūlihi min ahli l-qurā falillahi walilrrasūli walidhī l-qur''bā wal-yatāmā wal-masākīni wa-ib''ni l-sabīli kay lā yakūna dūlatan bayna l-aghniyāi minkum wamā ātākumu l-rasūlu fakhudhūhu wamā nahākum ʿanhu fa-intahū wa-ittaqū l-laha inna l-laha shadīdu l-ʿiqābi', 'যে ধন-সম্পদ আল্লাহ জনপদবাসীদের কাছ থেকে নিয়ে তাঁর রসূলকে দিলেন তা আল্লাহর জন্য তাঁর রসূলের জন্য আর রসূলের আত্মীয়-স্বজন, ইয়াতীম, মিসকীন ও পথিকদের জন্য যাতে তা তোমাদের মধ্যকার সম্পদশালীদের মধ্যেই আবর্তিত না হয়। রসূল তোমাদেরকে যা দেয় তা গ্রহণ কর, আর তোমাদেরকে যাত্থেকে নিষেধ করে তাত্থেকে বিরত থাক, আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ কঠিন শাস্তিদাতা।', 'And what Allah restored to His Messenger from the people of the towns - it is for Allah and for the Messenger and for [his] near relatives and orphans and the [stranded] traveler - so that it will not be a perpetual distribution among the rich from among you. And whatever the Messenger has given you - take; and what he has forbidden you - refrain from. And fear Allah; indeed, Allah is severe in penalty.', 'যে ধন-সম্পদ আল্লাহ জনপদবাসীদের কাছ থেকে নিয়ে তাঁর রসূলকে দিলেন তা আল্লাহর জন্য তাঁর রসূলের জন্য আর রসূলের আত্মীয়-স্বজন, ইয়াতীম, মিসকীন ও পথিকদের জন্য যাতে তা তোমাদের মধ্যকার সম্পদশালীদের মধ্যেই আবর্তিত না হয়। রসূল তোমাদেরকে যা দেয় তা গ্রহণ কর, আর তোমাদেরকে যাত্থেকে নিষেধ করে তাত্থেকে বিরত থাক, আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, আল্লাহ কঠিন শাস্তিদাতা।', 'And what Allah restored to His Messenger from the people of the towns - it is for Allah and for the Messenger and for [his] near relatives and orphans and the [stranded] traveler - so that it will not be a perpetual distribution among the rich from among you. And whatever the Messenger has given you - take; and what he has forbidden you - refrain from. And fear Allah; indeed, Allah is severe in penalty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059007.mp3', now()),
  (59, 8, '', '[{"id":8862,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِلْفُقَرَآءِ","transliteration":"lil''fuqarāi","translation_bn":"অভাবগ্রস্তদের জন্যে","root":"فقر","lemma":"فَقِير","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8863,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُهَـٰجِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-muhājirīna","translation_bn":"মাোহাজিরদের","root":"هجر","lemma":"مُهَاجِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8864,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":8865,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُخْرِجُوا۟","transliteration":"ukh''rijū","translation_bn":"বহিষ্কৃত হয়েছে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8866,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8867,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","transliteration":"diyārihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ঘোড়বাড়ী গুলো","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8868,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","transliteration":"wa-amwālihim","translation_bn":"ও তাদের সম্পদগুলো","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8869,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَبْتَغُونَ","transliteration":"yabtaghūna","translation_bn":"তারা পেতে চা্য়","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8870,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلًۭا","transliteration":"faḍlan","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8871,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8872,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":8873,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرِضْوَٰنًۭا","transliteration":"wariḍ''wānan","translation_bn":"ও সন্তুষ্টি","root":"رضو","lemma":"رِضْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8874,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَيَنصُرُونَ","transliteration":"wayanṣurūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা সাহায্য করে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8875,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":8876,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ ۚ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তার রসূলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8878,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসবলোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":8879,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":8880,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقُونَ","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8881,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lil''fuqarāi l-muhājirīna alladhīna ukh''rijū min diyārihim wa-amwālihim yabtaghūna faḍlan mina l-lahi wariḍ''wānan wayanṣurūna l-laha warasūlahu ulāika humu l-ṣādiqūna', '(আর এ সম্পদ) সে সব দরিদ্র মুহাজিরদের জন্য যাদেরকে তাদের বাড়ীঘর ও সম্পত্তি-সম্পদ থেকে উৎখাত করা হয়েছে। যারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও সন্তুষ্টি কামনা করে, আর তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলকে সাহায্য করে। এরাই সত্যবাদী।', 'For the poor emigrants who were expelled from their homes and their properties, seeking bounty from Allah and [His] approval and supporting Allah and His Messenger, [there is also a share]. Those are the truthful.', '(আর এ সম্পদ) সে সব দরিদ্র মুহাজিরদের জন্য যাদেরকে তাদের বাড়ীঘর ও সম্পত্তি-সম্পদ থেকে উৎখাত করা হয়েছে। যারা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও সন্তুষ্টি কামনা করে, আর তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলকে সাহায্য করে। এরাই সত্যবাদী।', 'For the poor emigrants who were expelled from their homes and their properties, seeking bounty from Allah and [His] approval and supporting Allah and His Messenger, [there is also a share]. Those are the truthful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059008.mp3', now()),
  (59, 9, '', '[{"id":10061,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10062,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَبَوَّءُو","transliteration":"tabawwaū","translation_bn":"বসবাস করেছে","root":"بوا","lemma":"يَتَبَوَّأُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10063,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّارَ","transliteration":"l-dāra","translation_bn":"(এই) নগরীতে","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10064,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِيمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"wal-īmāna","translation_bn":"এবং ঈমান (এনেছে)","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10065,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10066,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের  পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10067,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّونَ","transliteration":"yuḥibbūna","translation_bn":"তারা ভালোবাসে","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10068,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":10069,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَاجَرَ","transliteration":"hājara","translation_bn":"হিজরত করেছে","root":"هجر","lemma":"هَاجَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10070,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10071,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10072,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدُونَ","transliteration":"yajidūna","translation_bn":"তারাপায়","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10073,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10074,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صُدُورِهِمْ","transliteration":"ṣudūrihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরগুলোর","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10075,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَاجَةًۭ","transliteration":"ḥājatan","translation_bn":"প্রয়োজনের (অনুভূতি)","root":"حوج","lemma":"حَاجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10076,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّآ","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"(যা) তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10077,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"তাদের দেয়া হয়","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10078,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَيُؤْثِرُونَ","transliteration":"wayu''thirūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা প্রাধান্য দেয়","root":"اثر","lemma":"ا^ثَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10079,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10080,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10081,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":10082,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10083,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"তাদের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":10084,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"خَصَاصَةٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"khaṣāṣatun","translation_bn":"অঅভাব অনটন","root":"خصص","lemma":"خَصَاصَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10086,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10087,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يُوقَ","transliteration":"yūqa","translation_bn":"রক্ষা করবে","root":"وقي","lemma":"وَقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10088,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"شُحَّ","transliteration":"shuḥḥa","translation_bn":"কৃপণতা (থেকে)","root":"شحح","lemma":"شُحّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10089,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسِهِۦ","transliteration":"nafsihi","translation_bn":"তার নিজেকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10090,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব অতঃপর লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":10091,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":10092,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"l-muf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম","root":"فلح","lemma":"مُفْلِحُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10093,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna tabawwaū l-dāra wal-īmāna min qablihim yuḥibbūna man hājara ilayhim walā yajidūna fī ṣudūrihim ḥājatan mimmā ūtū wayu''thirūna ʿalā anfusihim walaw kāna bihim khaṣāṣatun waman yūqa shuḥḥa nafsihi fa-ulāika humu l-muf''liḥūna', '(আর এ সম্পদ তাদের জন্যও) যারা মুহাজিরদের আসার আগে থেকেই (মাদীনাহ) নগরীর বাসিন্দা ছিল আর ঈমান গ্রহণ করেছে। তারা তাদেরকে ভালবাসে যারা তাদের কাছে হিজরাত করে এসেছে। মুহাজিরদেরকে যা দেয়া হয়েছে তা পাওয়ার জন্য তারা নিজেদের অন্তরে কোন কামনা রাখে না, আর তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ মুহাজিরদেরকে) নিজেদের উপর অগ্রাধিকার দেয়- নিজেরা যতই অভাবগ্রস্ত হোক না কেন। বস্তুত: যাদেরকে হৃদয়ের সংকীর্ণতা থেকে রক্ষা করা হয়েছে তারাই সফলকাম।', 'And [also for] those who were settled in al-Madinah and [adopted] the faith before them. They love those who emigrated to them and find not any want in their breasts of what the emigrants were given but give [them] preference over themselves, even though they are in privation. And whoever is protected from the stinginess of his soul - it is those who will be the successful.', '(আর এ সম্পদ তাদের জন্যও) যারা মুহাজিরদের আসার আগে থেকেই (মাদীনাহ) নগরীর বাসিন্দা ছিল আর ঈমান গ্রহণ করেছে। তারা তাদেরকে ভালবাসে যারা তাদের কাছে হিজরাত করে এসেছে। মুহাজিরদেরকে যা দেয়া হয়েছে তা পাওয়ার জন্য তারা নিজেদের অন্তরে কোন কামনা রাখে না, আর তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ মুহাজিরদেরকে) নিজেদের উপর অগ্রাধিকার দেয়- নিজেরা যতই অভাবগ্রস্ত হোক না কেন। বস্তুত: যাদেরকে হৃদয়ের সংকীর্ণতা থেকে রক্ষা করা হয়েছে তারাই সফলকাম।', 'And [also for] those who were settled in al-Madinah and [adopted] the faith before them. They love those who emigrated to them and find not any want in their breasts of what the emigrants were given but give [them] preference over themselves, even though they are in privation. And whoever is protected from the stinginess of his soul - it is those who will be the successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059009.mp3', now()),
  (59, 10, '', '[{"id":11275,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11276,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءُو","transliteration":"jāū","translation_bn":"এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11277,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11278,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِمْ","transliteration":"baʿdihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11279,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11280,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11281,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱغْفِرْ","transliteration":"igh''fir","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা কর","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11282,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَنَا","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11283,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلِإِخْوَٰنِنَا","transliteration":"wali-ikh''wāninā","translation_bn":"ও আমাদের ভাই দেরকে","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11284,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":11285,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقُونَا","transliteration":"sabaqūnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের অগ্রণী হয়েছে","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11286,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"bil-īmāni","translation_bn":"ইমানের ক্ষেত্রে","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11287,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":11288,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَجْعَلْ","transliteration":"tajʿal","translation_bn":"রেখো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11289,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11290,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِنَا","transliteration":"qulūbinā","translation_bn":"আমদের অন্তর গুলোর","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11291,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"غِلًّۭا","transliteration":"ghillan","translation_bn":"হিংসা বিদ্বেষ","root":"غلل","lemma":"غِلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11292,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"যারাা (তাদের) জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11293,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ইমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11294,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমাাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11295,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ","transliteration":"innaka","translation_bn":"তুমি নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":11296,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"رَءُوفٌۭ","transliteration":"raūfun","translation_bn":"দয়ালু","root":"راف","lemma":"رَءُوف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11297,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"মেহেরবান\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":11298,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna jāū min baʿdihim yaqūlūna rabbanā igh''fir lanā wali-ikh''wāninā alladhīna sabaqūnā bil-īmāni walā tajʿal fī qulūbinā ghillan lilladhīna āmanū rabbanā innaka raūfun raḥīmun', '(এ সম্পদ তাদের জন্যও) যারা অগ্রবর্তীদের পরে (ইসলামের ছায়াতলে) এসেছে। তারা বলে- ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে আর আমাদের ভাইদেরকে ক্ষমা কর যারা ঈমানের ক্ষেত্রে আমাদের অগ্রবর্তী হয়েছে, আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদের ব্যাপারে আমাদের অন্তরে কোন হিংসা বিদ্বেষ রেখো না। হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি বড়ই করুণাময়, অতি দয়ালু।’', 'And [there is a share for] those who came after them, saying, "Our Lord, forgive us and our brothers who preceded us in faith and put not in our hearts [any] resentment toward those who have believed. Our Lord, indeed You are Kind and Merciful."', '(এ সম্পদ তাদের জন্যও) যারা অগ্রবর্তীদের পরে (ইসলামের ছায়াতলে) এসেছে। তারা বলে- ‘হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে আর আমাদের ভাইদেরকে ক্ষমা কর যারা ঈমানের ক্ষেত্রে আমাদের অগ্রবর্তী হয়েছে, আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদের ব্যাপারে আমাদের অন্তরে কোন হিংসা বিদ্বেষ রেখো না। হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! তুমি বড়ই করুণাময়, অতি দয়ালু।’', 'And [there is a share for] those who came after them, saying, "Our Lord, forgive us and our brothers who preceded us in faith and put not in our hearts [any] resentment toward those who have believed. Our Lord, indeed You are Kind and Merciful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059010.mp3', now()),
  (59, 11, '', '[{"id":12604,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"নাইকি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":12605,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَرَ","transliteration":"tara","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখ","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12606,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12607,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12608,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَافَقُوا۟","transliteration":"nāfaqū","translation_bn":"মুনাফেকী করেছে","root":"نفق","lemma":"نَافَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12609,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলেে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12610,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِإِخْوَٰنِهِمُ","transliteration":"li-ikh''wānihimu","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাই দের","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12611,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12612,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"কুফুরি করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12613,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12614,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"আহলে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12615,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবদের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12616,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَئِنْ","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"\"যদি নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":12617,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أُخْرِجْتُمْ","transliteration":"ukh''rij''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা বহিষ্কৃত হও","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12618,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَنَخْرُجَنَّ","transliteration":"lanakhrujanna","translation_bn":"আমরা বের হব অবশ্যই","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":12619,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكُمْ","transliteration":"maʿakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":12620,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12621,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"نُطِيعُ","transliteration":"nuṭīʿu","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য করব আমরা","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12622,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِيكُمْ","transliteration":"fīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12623,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدًا","transliteration":"aḥadan","translation_bn":"কারও","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12624,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"কখনও","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":12625,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12626,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"قُوتِلْتُمْ","transliteration":"qūtil''tum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের (বিরুদ্ধে) যুদ্ধ করা হয়","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12627,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَنَنصُرَنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lananṣurannakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাহায্য আমরা অবশ্যই করব\"","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":12628,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12629,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَشْهَدُ","transliteration":"yashhadu","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12630,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"তারা নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":12631,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মিথ্যাবাদী","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":12632,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam tara ilā alladhīna nāfaqū yaqūlūna li-ikh''wānihimu alladhīna kafarū min ahli l-kitābi la-in ukh''rij''tum lanakhrujanna maʿakum walā nuṭīʿu fīkum aḥadan abadan wa-in qūtil''tum lananṣurannakum wal-lahu yashhadu innahum lakādhibūna', 'তুমি কি তাদেরকে দেখনি যারা মুনাফিকী করেছিল? আহলে কিতাবের মধ্যে যারা কুফুরী করেছিল তাদের সেই ভাইদেরকে তারা (অর্থাৎ মুনাফিকরা) বলেছিল- ‘তোমরা যদি বহিস্কৃত হও, তাহলে অবশ্য অবশ্যই আমরাও তোমাদের সাথে বেরিয়ে যাব, আর তোমাদের ব্যাপারে আমরা কক্ষনো কারো কথা মেনে নেব না। আর যদি তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করা হয়, তাহলে আমরা অবশ্য অবশ্যই তোমাদেরকে সাহায্য করব। আল্লাহ সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন, তারা অবশ্যই মিথ্যেবাদী।', 'Have you not considered those who practice hypocrisy, saying to their brothers who have disbelieved among the People of the Scripture, "If you are expelled, we will surely leave with you, and we will not obey, in regard to you, anyone - ever; and if you are fought, we will surely aid you." But Allah testifies that they are liars.', 'তুমি কি তাদেরকে দেখনি যারা মুনাফিকী করেছিল? আহলে কিতাবের মধ্যে যারা কুফুরী করেছিল তাদের সেই ভাইদেরকে তারা (অর্থাৎ মুনাফিকরা) বলেছিল- ‘তোমরা যদি বহিস্কৃত হও, তাহলে অবশ্য অবশ্যই আমরাও তোমাদের সাথে বেরিয়ে যাব, আর তোমাদের ব্যাপারে আমরা কক্ষনো কারো কথা মেনে নেব না। আর যদি তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করা হয়, তাহলে আমরা অবশ্য অবশ্যই তোমাদেরকে সাহায্য করব। আল্লাহ সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন, তারা অবশ্যই মিথ্যেবাদী।', 'Have you not considered those who practice hypocrisy, saying to their brothers who have disbelieved among the People of the Scripture, "If you are expelled, we will surely leave with you, and we will not obey, in regard to you, anyone - ever; and if you are fought, we will surely aid you." But Allah testifies that they are liars.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059011.mp3', now()),
  (59, 12, '', '[{"id":13932,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَئِنْ","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"যদি বস্তুত","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":13933,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُخْرِجُوا۟","transliteration":"ukh''rijū","translation_bn":"তারা বহিষ্কৃত হয়","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13934,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":13935,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجُونَ","transliteration":"yakhrujūna","translation_bn":"তারা বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13936,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُمْ","transliteration":"maʿahum","translation_bn":"তাদের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":13937,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13938,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُوتِلُوا۟","transliteration":"qūtilū","translation_bn":"তাদের (বিরুদ্ধে) যুদ্ধ করা হয়","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13939,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":13940,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُونَهُمْ","transliteration":"yanṣurūnahum","translation_bn":"তাদের সাহায্য তারা করবে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13941,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13942,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَّصَرُوهُمْ","transliteration":"naṣarūhum","translation_bn":"তাদের তারা সাহায্য করেও","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13943,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَيُوَلُّنَّ","transliteration":"layuwallunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":13944,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَدْبَـٰرَ","transliteration":"l-adbāra","translation_bn":"পৃষ্ঠ প্রদর্শন করবে","root":"دبر","lemma":"دُبُر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13945,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13946,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":13947,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُنصَرُونَ","transliteration":"yunṣarūna","translation_bn":"তাদের  সাহায্য করা হবে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13948,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'la-in ukh''rijū lā yakhrujūna maʿahum wala-in qūtilū lā yanṣurūnahum wala-in naṣarūhum layuwallunna l-adbāra thumma lā yunṣarūna', 'তারা বহিস্কৃত হলেও এরা তাদের সাথে বেরিয়ে যাবে না। তাদের উপর আক্রমণ করা হলেও এরা তাদেরকে কক্ষনো সাহায্য করবে না। আর এরা সাহায্য করলেও তারা (অর্থাৎ মুনাফিকরা) অবশ্য অবশ্যই পৃষ্ঠপ্রদর্শন করবে, অতঃপর তারা (অর্থাৎ কাফিররা) আর কোন সাহায্যই পাবে না।', 'If they are expelled, they will not leave with them, and if they are fought, they will not aid them. And [even] if they should aid them, they will surely turn their backs; then [thereafter] they will not be aided.', 'তারা বহিস্কৃত হলেও এরা তাদের সাথে বেরিয়ে যাবে না। তাদের উপর আক্রমণ করা হলেও এরা তাদেরকে কক্ষনো সাহায্য করবে না। আর এরা সাহায্য করলেও তারা (অর্থাৎ মুনাফিকরা) অবশ্য অবশ্যই পৃষ্ঠপ্রদর্শন করবে, অতঃপর তারা (অর্থাৎ কাফিররা) আর কোন সাহায্যই পাবে না।', 'If they are expelled, they will not leave with them, and if they are fought, they will not aid them. And [even] if they should aid them, they will surely turn their backs; then [thereafter] they will not be aided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059012.mp3', now()),
  (59, 13, '', '[{"id":15073,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"la-antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রকৃত পক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"لَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":15074,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدُّ","transliteration":"ashaddu","translation_bn":"অধিকতর","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15075,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَهْبَةًۭ","transliteration":"rahbatan","translation_bn":"ভয়ংকর","root":"رهب","lemma":"رَهْبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15076,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15077,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"صُدُورِهِم","transliteration":"ṣudūrihim","translation_bn":"তাদের বুকের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15078,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15079,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15081,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":15082,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"তারা যে একারণে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15083,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"(এমন) একজাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15084,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":15085,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"তারা বুঝে","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15086,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'la-antum ashaddu rahbatan fī ṣudūrihim mina l-lahi dhālika bi-annahum qawmun lā yafqahūna', 'তাদের অন্তরে আল্লাহর চেয়ে তোমাদের ভয়ই বেশি প্রবল। এর কারণ এই যে, তারা এক বিবেক-বুদ্ধিহীন সম্প্রদায়।', 'You [believers] are more fearful within their breasts than Allah. That is because they are a people who do not understand.', 'তাদের অন্তরে আল্লাহর চেয়ে তোমাদের ভয়ই বেশি প্রবল। এর কারণ এই যে, তারা এক বিবেক-বুদ্ধিহীন সম্প্রদায়।', 'You [believers] are more fearful within their breasts than Allah. That is because they are a people who do not understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059013.mp3', now()),
  (59, 14, '', '[{"id":16130,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":16131,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُقَـٰتِلُونَكُمْ","transliteration":"yuqātilūnakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাথে লড়বে তারা","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16132,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"একত্রে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16133,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":16134,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16135,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُرًۭى","transliteration":"quran","translation_bn":"জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16136,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّحَصَّنَةٍ","transliteration":"muḥaṣṣanatin","translation_bn":"দুর্গ পরিবেষ্টিত","root":"حصن","lemma":"مُّحَصَّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":16137,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":16138,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16139,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَرَآءِ","transliteration":"warāi","translation_bn":"পিছনে","root":"وري","lemma":"وَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16140,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جُدُرٍۭ ۚ","transliteration":"judurin","translation_bn":"প্রাচীরসমূহের","root":"جدر","lemma":"جُدُر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16142,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسُهُم","transliteration":"basuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের বিরুদ্ধতা","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16143,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্য","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":16144,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"shadīdun","translation_bn":"প্রবল","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16146,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَحْسَبُهُمْ","transliteration":"taḥsabuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের মনে কর তুমি","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16147,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"ঐক্যবদ্ধ","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16148,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلُوبُهُمْ","transliteration":"waqulūbuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরগুলো কিন্তু","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":16149,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَتَّىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"shattā","translation_bn":"দ্বিধাবিভক্ত","root":"شتت","lemma":"شَتَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16151,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":16152,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"তারা যে কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":16153,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"একজাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":16154,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":16155,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":16156,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yuqātilūnakum jamīʿan illā fī quran muḥaṣṣanatin aw min warāi judurin basuhum baynahum shadīdun taḥsabuhum jamīʿan waqulūbuhum shattā dhālika bi-annahum qawmun lā yaʿqilūna', 'তারা ঐক্যবদ্ধ হয়ে তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করতে সমর্থ নয়, সুরক্ষিত জনপদে বা দেয়ালের আড়ালে অবস্থান ছাড়া। তাদের নিজেদের মধ্যেই আছে ভীষণ শত্রুতা। তুমি তাদেরকে ঐক্যবদ্ধ মনে কর কিন্তু তাদের অন্তরগুলো ভিন্ন ভিন্ন। এর কারণ এই যে, তারা এক নির্বোধ সম্প্রদায়।', 'They will not fight you all except within fortified cities or from behind walls. Their violence among themselves is severe. You think they are together, but their hearts are diverse. That is because they are a people who do not reason.', 'তারা ঐক্যবদ্ধ হয়ে তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করতে সমর্থ নয়, সুরক্ষিত জনপদে বা দেয়ালের আড়ালে অবস্থান ছাড়া। তাদের নিজেদের মধ্যেই আছে ভীষণ শত্রুতা। তুমি তাদেরকে ঐক্যবদ্ধ মনে কর কিন্তু তাদের অন্তরগুলো ভিন্ন ভিন্ন। এর কারণ এই যে, তারা এক নির্বোধ সম্প্রদায়।', 'They will not fight you all except within fortified cities or from behind walls. Their violence among themselves is severe. You think they are together, but their hearts are diverse. That is because they are a people who do not reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059014.mp3', now()),
  (59, 15, '', '[{"id":17366,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَمَثَلِ","transliteration":"kamathali","translation_bn":"দৃষ্ঠান্ত যেমন","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17367,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17368,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17369,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পূর্বে ছিল","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17370,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَرِيبًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"qarīban","translation_bn":"কিছুকাল","root":"قرب","lemma":"قَرِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":17372,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذَاقُوا۟","transliteration":"dhāqū","translation_bn":"তারা স্বাদ নিয়েছে","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17373,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَبَالَ","transliteration":"wabāla","translation_bn":"কুফলের","root":"وبل","lemma":"وَبَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17374,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِهِمْ","transliteration":"amrihim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাজের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17375,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":17376,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"আজাব","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17377,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"কষ্টদায়ক","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":17378,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kamathali alladhīna min qablihim qarīban dhāqū wabāla amrihim walahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'এরা তাদের (অর্থাৎ ইয়াহূদী বানু কাইনুকার) মত যারা এদের পূর্বে নিকটবর্তী সময়েই তাদের কৃতকর্মের কুফল আস্বাদন করেছে। তাদের জন্য আছে মর্মান্তিক শাস্তি।', '[Theirs is] like the example of those shortly before them: they tasted the bad consequence of their affair, and they will have a painful punishment.', 'এরা তাদের (অর্থাৎ ইয়াহূদী বানু কাইনুকার) মত যারা এদের পূর্বে নিকটবর্তী সময়েই তাদের কৃতকর্মের কুফল আস্বাদন করেছে। তাদের জন্য আছে মর্মান্তিক শাস্তি।', '[Theirs is] like the example of those shortly before them: they tasted the bad consequence of their affair, and they will have a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059015.mp3', now()),
  (59, 16, '', '[{"id":18431,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَمَثَلِ","transliteration":"kamathali","translation_bn":"দৃষ্ঠান্ত যেমন","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18432,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","translation_bn":"শয়তানের","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18433,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":18434,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলেছিল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18435,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِلْإِنسَـٰنِ","transliteration":"lil''insāni","translation_bn":"মানুুষকে","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18436,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱكْفُرْ","transliteration":"uk''fur","translation_bn":"\"তুমি কুফরিকর\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18437,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"যখন অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18438,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرَ","transliteration":"kafara","translation_bn":"কুফুরি করল","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18439,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলেল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18440,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"আমি নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":18441,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَرِىٓءٌۭ","transliteration":"barīon","translation_bn":"দ্বায়িত্বমুক্ত","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرِى^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18442,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكَ","transliteration":"minka","translation_bn":"তোমার হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18443,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"আমি নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":18444,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"ভয়করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18445,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18446,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّ","transliteration":"rabba","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18447,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"সারা বিশ্বের\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18448,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kamathali l-shayṭāni idh qāla lil''insāni uk''fur falammā kafara qāla innī barīon minka innī akhāfu l-laha rabba l-ʿālamīna', '(তাদের মিত্ররা তাদেরকে প্রতারিত করেছে) শয়ত্বানের মত। যখন মানুষকে সে বলে- ‘কুফুরী কর’। অতঃপর মানুষ যখন কুফুরী করে তখন শয়ত্বান বলে- ‘তোমার সাথে আমার কোন সম্পর্ক নেই, আমি বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহকে ভয় করি।’', '[The hypocrites are] like the example of Satan when he says to man, "Disbelieve." But when he disbelieves, he says, "Indeed, I am disassociated from you. Indeed, I fear Allah, Lord of the worlds."', '(তাদের মিত্ররা তাদেরকে প্রতারিত করেছে) শয়ত্বানের মত। যখন মানুষকে সে বলে- ‘কুফুরী কর’। অতঃপর মানুষ যখন কুফুরী করে তখন শয়ত্বান বলে- ‘তোমার সাথে আমার কোন সম্পর্ক নেই, আমি বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহকে ভয় করি।’', '[The hypocrites are] like the example of Satan when he says to man, "Disbelieve." But when he disbelieves, he says, "Indeed, I am disassociated from you. Indeed, I fear Allah, Lord of the worlds."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059016.mp3', now()),
  (59, 17, '', '[{"id":19562,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكَانَ","transliteration":"fakāna","translation_bn":"হল অতঃপর","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":19563,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَتَهُمَآ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatahumā","translation_bn":"তাদের দুজনের পরিনতি","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19564,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمَا","transliteration":"annahumā","translation_bn":"দুজনই যে হবে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":19565,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19566,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19567,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدَيْنِ","transliteration":"khālidayni","translation_bn":"দুজনে চিরকাল থাকবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19568,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۚ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19570,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19571,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَزَٰٓؤُا۟","transliteration":"jazāu","translation_bn":"প্রতিদান","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19572,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"যালিমদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19573,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakāna ʿāqibatahumā annahumā fī l-nāri khālidayni fīhā wadhālika jazāu l-ẓālimīna', 'কাজেই তাদের উভয়ের পরিণাম হবে এই যে, তারা চিরকাল জাহান্নামে থাকবে, আর যালিমদের এটাই প্রতিফল।', 'So the outcome for both of them is that they will be in the Fire, abiding eternally therein. And that is the recompense of the wrong-doers.', 'কাজেই তাদের উভয়ের পরিণাম হবে এই যে, তারা চিরকাল জাহান্নামে থাকবে, আর যালিমদের এটাই প্রতিফল।', 'So the outcome for both of them is that they will be in the Fire, abiding eternally therein. And that is the recompense of the wrong-doers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059017.mp3', now()),
  (59, 18, '', '[{"id":20499,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"ওহে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":20500,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":20501,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ইমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20502,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয়কর","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20503,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20504,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلْتَنظُرْ","transliteration":"waltanẓur","translation_bn":"এবং যেন লক্ষ্য করে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":20505,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٌۭ","transliteration":"nafsun","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20506,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":20507,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَدَّمَتْ","transliteration":"qaddamat","translation_bn":"আগে পাঠিয়েছে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20508,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِغَدٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"lighadin","translation_bn":"আগামীকালে জন্যে","root":"غدو","lemma":"غَد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20510,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা ভয়কর","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":20511,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20513,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":20514,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":20515,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":20516,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":20517,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ কর","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":20518,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ittaqū l-laha waltanẓur nafsun mā qaddamat lighadin wa-ittaqū l-laha inna l-laha khabīrun bimā taʿmalūna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর। প্রত্যেকেই চিন্তা করে দেখুক, আগামীকালের জন্য সে কী (পুণ্য কাজ) অগ্রিম পাঠিয়েছে। আর তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পুরোপুরি খবর রাখেন।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah. And let every soul look to what it has put forth for tomorrow - and fear Allah. Indeed, Allah is Acquainted with what you do.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর। প্রত্যেকেই চিন্তা করে দেখুক, আগামীকালের জন্য সে কী (পুণ্য কাজ) অগ্রিম পাঠিয়েছে। আর তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পুরোপুরি খবর রাখেন।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah. And let every soul look to what it has put forth for tomorrow - and fear Allah. Indeed, Allah is Acquainted with what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059018.mp3', now()),
  (59, 19, '', '[{"id":21572,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":21573,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"takūnū","translation_bn":"তোমরা হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21574,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) মত যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":21575,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَسُوا۟","transliteration":"nasū","translation_bn":"ভূলে গিয়েছিল","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":21576,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":21577,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنسَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-ansāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ভুলালেন অতঃপর তিনি","root":"نسي","lemma":"أَنسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":21578,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"তারা নিজেদেরকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":21580,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":21581,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":21582,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقُونَ","transliteration":"l-fāsiqūna","translation_bn":"ফাসেক","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":21583,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā takūnū ka-alladhīna nasū l-laha fa-ansāhum anfusahum ulāika humu l-fāsiqūna', 'তোমরা তাদের মত হয়ো না যারা আল্লাহকে ভুলে গেছে, ফলে আল্লাহও তাদেরকে করেছেন আত্মভোলা। এরা পাপাচারী লোক।', 'And be not like those who forgot Allah, so He made them forget themselves. Those are the defiantly disobedient.', 'তোমরা তাদের মত হয়ো না যারা আল্লাহকে ভুলে গেছে, ফলে আল্লাহও তাদেরকে করেছেন আত্মভোলা। এরা পাপাচারী লোক।', 'And be not like those who forgot Allah, so He made them forget themselves. Those are the defiantly disobedient.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059019.mp3', now()),
  (59, 20, '', '[{"id":22673,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":22674,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِىٓ","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":22675,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীরা","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22676,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"দোজখের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22677,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"wa-aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"ও অধিবাসীরা","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":22678,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22680,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধধিবাসীরা","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":22681,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22682,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":22683,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ","transliteration":"l-fāizūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَا^ئِزُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":22684,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yastawī aṣḥābu l-nāri wa-aṣḥābu l-janati aṣḥābu l-janati humu l-fāizūna', 'জাহান্নামের অধিবাসী আর জান্নাতের অধিবাসী সমান হতে পারে না, জান্নাতের অধিবাসীরাই সফল।', 'Not equal are the companions of the Fire and the companions of Paradise. The companions of Paradise - they are the attainers [of success].', 'জাহান্নামের অধিবাসী আর জান্নাতের অধিবাসী সমান হতে পারে না, জান্নাতের অধিবাসীরাই সফল।', 'Not equal are the companions of the Fire and the companions of Paradise. The companions of Paradise - they are the attainers [of success].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059020.mp3', now()),
  (59, 21, '', '[{"id":23908,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":23909,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَا","transliteration":"anzalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অবতীর্ণ করতাম","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23910,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":23911,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","transliteration":"l-qur''āna","translation_bn":"কুরআন","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23912,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23913,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَبَلٍۢ","transliteration":"jabalin","translation_bn":"একটি পর্বতের","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23914,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّرَأَيْتَهُۥ","transliteration":"lara-aytahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয় আপনি তা দেখতেন","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":23915,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰشِعًۭا","transliteration":"khāshiʿan","translation_bn":"বিনীত ,","root":"خشع","lemma":"خَاشِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23916,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّتَصَدِّعًۭا","transliteration":"mutaṣaddiʿan","translation_bn":"দুভাগে বিভক্ত ভঙ্গ","root":"صدع","lemma":"مُّتَصَدِّع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23917,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23918,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خَشْيَةِ","transliteration":"khashyati","translation_bn":"ভয়","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":23919,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":23921,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَتِلْكَ","transliteration":"watil''ka","translation_bn":"আর এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23922,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْثَـٰلُ","transliteration":"l-amthālu","translation_bn":"উদাহরণ ( সম্পূর্ণ ) ,","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":23923,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"نَضْرِبُهَا","transliteration":"naḍribuhā","translation_bn":"আমরা তাদের উপস্থাপন করি","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23924,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের কাছে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":23925,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যেন তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":23926,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","translation_bn":"চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":23927,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'law anzalnā hādhā l-qur''āna ʿalā jabalin lara-aytahu khāshiʿan mutaṣaddiʿan min khashyati l-lahi watil''ka l-amthālu naḍribuhā lilnnāsi laʿallahum yatafakkarūna', 'আমি যদি এ কুরআনকে পাহাড়ের উপর অবতীর্ণ করতাম, তাহলে তুমি আল্লাহর ভয়ে তাকে বিনীত ও বিদীর্ণ দেখতে। এ সব উদাহরণ আমি মানুষের জন্য বর্ণনা করি যাতে তারা (নিজেদের ব্যাপারে) চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে।', 'If We had sent down this Qur''an upon a mountain, you would have seen it humbled and coming apart from fear of Allah. And these examples We present to the people that perhaps they will give thought.', 'আমি যদি এ কুরআনকে পাহাড়ের উপর অবতীর্ণ করতাম, তাহলে তুমি আল্লাহর ভয়ে তাকে বিনীত ও বিদীর্ণ দেখতে। এ সব উদাহরণ আমি মানুষের জন্য বর্ণনা করি যাতে তারা (নিজেদের ব্যাপারে) চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে।', 'If We had sent down this Qur''an upon a mountain, you would have seen it humbled and coming apart from fear of Allah. And these examples We present to the people that perhaps they will give thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059021.mp3', now()),
  (59, 22, '', '[{"id":24851,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":24852,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":24853,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":24854,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নাই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":24855,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24856,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":24857,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তাঁর,","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":24859,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰلِمُ","transliteration":"ʿālimu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":24860,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","translation_bn":"গোপন","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24861,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-shahādati","translation_bn":"ও প্রকাশ্য","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهَٰدَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":24863,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":24864,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","translation_bn":"পরম করুণাময়","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24865,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","translation_bn":"অসীম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":24866,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২২)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa l-lahu alladhī lā ilāha illā huwa ʿālimu l-ghaybi wal-shahādati huwa l-raḥmānu l-raḥīmu', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ, যিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, অদৃশ্য ও দৃশের জ্ঞানের অধিকারী, পরম দয়াময়, পরম দয়ালু।', 'He is Allah, other than whom there is no deity, Knower of the unseen and the witnessed. He is the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ, যিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, অদৃশ্য ও দৃশের জ্ঞানের অধিকারী, পরম দয়াময়, পরম দয়ালু।', 'He is Allah, other than whom there is no deity, Knower of the unseen and the witnessed. He is the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059022.mp3', now()),
  (59, 23, '', '[{"id":25854,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":25855,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25856,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":25857,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নাই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":25858,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25859,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":25860,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তাঁর,","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":25861,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلِكُ","transliteration":"l-maliku","translation_bn":"বাদশাহ,","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25862,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُدُّوسُ","transliteration":"l-qudūsu","translation_bn":"অতীব প্রবিত্র,","root":"قدس","lemma":"قُدُّوس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25863,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّلَـٰمُ","transliteration":"l-salāmu","translation_bn":"শান্তিদাতা,","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25864,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"l-mu''minu","translation_bn":"নিরাপত্তাদাতা,","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25865,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُهَيْمِنُ","transliteration":"l-muhayminu","translation_bn":"সংরক্ষক,","root":"همن","lemma":"مُهَيْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25866,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী,","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25867,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَبَّارُ","transliteration":"l-jabāru","translation_bn":"প্রবল,","root":"جبر","lemma":"جَبَّار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25868,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَكَبِّرُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-mutakabiru","translation_bn":"মহিমান্বিত,","root":"كبر","lemma":"مُتَكَبِّر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":25870,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","transliteration":"sub''ḥāna","translation_bn":"পবিত্র","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":25871,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (র)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":25872,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"যা হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":25873,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তারা শরীক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":25874,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa l-lahu alladhī lā ilāha illā huwa l-maliku l-qudūsu l-salāmu l-mu''minu l-muhayminu l-ʿazīzu l-jabāru l-mutakabiru sub''ḥāna l-lahi ʿammā yush''rikūna', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ যিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তিনিই বাদশাহ, অতি পবিত্র, পূর্ণ শান্তিময়, নিরাপত্তা দানকারী, প্রতাপশালী, পর্যবেক্ষক, মহা পরাক্রমশালী, অপ্রতিরোধ্য, প্রকৃত গর্বের অধিকারী। তারা যাকে (তাঁর) শরীক করে তাত্থেকে তিনি পবিত্র, মহান।', 'He is Allah, other than whom there is no deity, the Sovereign, the Pure, the Perfection, the Bestower of Faith, the Overseer, the Exalted in Might, the Compeller, the Superior. Exalted is Allah above whatever they associate with Him.', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ যিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তিনিই বাদশাহ, অতি পবিত্র, পূর্ণ শান্তিময়, নিরাপত্তা দানকারী, প্রতাপশালী, পর্যবেক্ষক, মহা পরাক্রমশালী, অপ্রতিরোধ্য, প্রকৃত গর্বের অধিকারী। তারা যাকে (তাঁর) শরীক করে তাত্থেকে তিনি পবিত্র, মহান।', 'He is Allah, other than whom there is no deity, the Sovereign, the Pure, the Perfection, the Bestower of Faith, the Overseer, the Exalted in Might, the Compeller, the Superior. Exalted is Allah above whatever they associate with Him.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059023.mp3', now()),
  (59, 24, '', '[{"id":26951,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":26952,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":26953,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَـٰلِقُ","transliteration":"l-khāliqu","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টিকর্তা,","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَٰلِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26954,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَارِئُ","transliteration":"l-bāri-u","translation_bn":"উদ্ভাবনকর্তা,","root":"برا","lemma":"بَارِئ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26955,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُصَوِّرُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-muṣawiru","translation_bn":"আকৃতিদাতা,","root":"صور","lemma":"مُصَوِّر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26957,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর জন্যই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26958,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَسْمَآءُ","transliteration":"l-asmāu","translation_bn":"নামসমুহ","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26959,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26961,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُسَبِّحُ","transliteration":"yusabbiḥu","translation_bn":"গৌরব বর্ণনা করে","root":"سبح","lemma":"سَبَّحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26962,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তারই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26963,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":26964,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26965,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আসমানে","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26966,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"এবং পৃথিবীতে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26968,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26969,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী,","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26970,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26971,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa l-lahu l-khāliqu l-bāri-u l-muṣawiru lahu l-asmāu l-ḥus''nā yusabbiḥu lahu mā fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wahuwa l-ʿazīzu l-ḥakīmu', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ সৃষ্টিকারী, উদ্ভাবনকারী, আকার আকৃতি প্রদানকারী। সমস্ত উত্তম নামের অধিকারী। আসমান ও যমীনে যা আছে সবই তাঁর গৌরব ও মহিমা ঘোষণা করে। তিনি প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত মহা প্রজ্ঞাবান।', 'He is Allah, the Creator, the Inventor, the Fashioner; to Him belong the best names. Whatever is in the heavens and earth is exalting Him. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ সৃষ্টিকারী, উদ্ভাবনকারী, আকার আকৃতি প্রদানকারী। সমস্ত উত্তম নামের অধিকারী। আসমান ও যমীনে যা আছে সবই তাঁর গৌরব ও মহিমা ঘোষণা করে। তিনি প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত মহা প্রজ্ঞাবান।', 'He is Allah, the Creator, the Inventor, the Fashioner; to Him belong the best names. Whatever is in the heavens and earth is exalting Him. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/059024.mp3', now())
