r_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13972,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":13973,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِنَّ","transliteration":"aydīhinna","translation_bn":"তাদের হাতগুলো","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13974,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَأَرْجُلِهِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-arjulihinna","translation_bn":"ও তাদের পাগুলো","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13975,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13976,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَعْصِينَكَ","transliteration":"yaʿṣīnaka","translation_bn":"তোমরা তারা অবাধ্য হবে","root":"عصي","lemma":"عَصَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13977,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13978,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"مَعْرُوفٍۢ ۙ","transliteration":"maʿrūfin","translation_bn":"সৎকাজের","root":"عرف","lemma":"مَّعْرُوف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13980,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"فَبَايِعْهُنَّ","transliteration":"fabāyiʿ''hunna","translation_bn":"তাদের বয়াত নাও তবে","root":"بيع","lemma":"بَايَعْ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":13981,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wa-is''taghfir","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষমা চাও","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13982,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"لَهُنَّ","transliteration":"lahunna","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য (কাফিরদের)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُنَّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13983,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (কাছে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13985,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":13986,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":13987,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13988,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"মেহেরবান","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13989,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nabiyu idhā jāaka l-mu''minātu yubāyiʿ''naka ʿalā an lā yush''rik''na bil-lahi shayan walā yasriq''na walā yaznīna walā yaqtul''na awlādahunna walā yatīna bibuh''tānin yaftarīnahu bayna aydīhinna wa-arjulihinna walā yaʿṣīnaka fī maʿrūfin fabāyiʿ''hunna wa-is''taghfir lahunna l-laha inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'হে নবী! যখন মু’মিনা নারীরা তোমার কাছে এসে বাই‘আত করে যে, তারা আল্লাহর সঙ্গে কোন কিছুকে শরীক করবে না, চুরি করবে না, যিনা করবে না, নিজেদের সন্তান হত্যা করবে না, জেনে শুনে কোন অপবাদ রচনা ক’রে রটাবে না এবং কোন ভাল কাজে তোমার অবাধ্যতা করবে না- তাহলে তুমি তাদের বাই‘আত (অর্থাৎ তোমার প্রতি আনুগত্যের শপথ) গ্রহণ কর এবং তাদের জন্য আল্লাহর নিকট ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর; আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'O Prophet, when the believing women come to you pledging to you that they will not associate anything with Allah, nor will they steal, nor will they commit unlawful sexual intercourse, nor will they kill their children, nor will they bring forth a slander they have invented between their arms and legs, nor will they disobey you in what is right - then accept their pledge and ask forgiveness for them of Allah. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'হে নবী! যখন মু’মিনা নারীরা তোমার কাছে এসে বাই‘আত করে যে, তারা আল্লাহর সঙ্গে কোন কিছুকে শরীক করবে না, চুরি করবে না, যিনা করবে না, নিজেদের সন্তান হত্যা করবে না, জেনে শুনে কোন অপবাদ রচনা ক’রে রটাবে না এবং কোন ভাল কাজে তোমার অবাধ্যতা করবে না- তাহলে তুমি তাদের বাই‘আত (অর্থাৎ তোমার প্রতি আনুগত্যের শপথ) গ্রহণ কর এবং তাদের জন্য আল্লাহর নিকট ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর; আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'O Prophet, when the believing women come to you pledging to you that they will not associate anything with Allah, nor will they steal, nor will they commit unlawful sexual intercourse, nor will they kill their children, nor will they bring forth a slander they have invented between their arms and legs, nor will they disobey you in what is right - then accept their pledge and ask forgiveness for them of Allah. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/060012.mp3', now()),
  (60, 13, '', '[{"id":15093,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"ওহে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":15094,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":15095,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15096,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":15097,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَتَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tatawallaw","translation_bn":"তোমতা বন্ধুত্ব করো","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15098,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"লোকদের (সংগে)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15099,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"غَضِبَ","transliteration":"ghaḍiba","translation_bn":"গযব দিয়েছেন","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15100,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":15101,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"যাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15102,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":15103,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَئِسُوا۟","transliteration":"ya-isū","translation_bn":"তারা নিরাশ হয়েছে","root":"ياس","lemma":"يَئِسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15104,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15105,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"পরকাল","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15106,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15107,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَئِسَ","transliteration":"ya-isa","translation_bn":"নিরাশ হয়েছে","root":"ياس","lemma":"يَئِسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":15108,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفَّارُ","transliteration":"l-kufāru","translation_bn":"কাফিররা","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15109,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":15110,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبِ","transliteration":"aṣḥābi","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদের","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":15111,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُبُورِ","transliteration":"l-qubūri","translation_bn":"কবরগু্লো","root":"قبر","lemma":"قَبْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":15112,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā tatawallaw qawman ghaḍiba l-lahu ʿalayhim qad ya-isū mina l-ākhirati kamā ya-isa l-kufāru min aṣḥābi l-qubūri', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা এমন সম্প্রদায়ের সঙ্গে বন্ধুত্ব করো না আল্লাহ যাদের প্রতি রাগান্বিত। তারা পরকাল সম্পর্কে তেমনি নিরাশ যেমন কবরবাসী কাফিররা নিরাশ (কারণ তারা পরকালকে অবিশ্বাস করার কারণে তার জন্য কোন প্রস্তুতি গ্রহণ করেনি।)', 'O you who have believed, do not make allies of a people with whom Allah has become angry. They have despaired of [reward in] the Hereafter just as the disbelievers have despaired of [meeting] the inhabitants of the graves.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা এমন সম্প্রদায়ের সঙ্গে বন্ধুত্ব করো না আল্লাহ যাদের প্রতি রাগান্বিত। তারা পরকাল সম্পর্কে তেমনি নিরাশ যেমন কবরবাসী কাফিররা নিরাশ (কারণ তারা পরকালকে অবিশ্বাস করার কারণে তার জন্য কোন প্রস্তুতি গ্রহণ করেনি।)', 'O you who have believed, do not make allies of a people with whom Allah has become angry. They have despaired of [reward in] the Hereafter just as the disbelievers have despaired of [meeting] the inhabitants of the graves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/060013.mp3', now())
