in","translation_bn":"কষ্টের","root":"عسر","lemma":"عُسْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7839,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يُسْرًۭا","transliteration":"yus''ran","translation_bn":"স্বস্তি","root":"يسر","lemma":"يُسْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":7840,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'liyunfiq dhū saʿatin min saʿatihi waman qudira ʿalayhi riz''quhu falyunfiq mimmā ātāhu l-lahu lā yukallifu l-lahu nafsan illā mā ātāhā sayajʿalu l-lahu baʿda ʿus''rin yus''ran', 'সচ্ছল ব্যক্তি তার সচ্ছলতা অনুসারে ব্যয় করবে। আর যার রিযক সীমিত করা হয়েছে, সে ব্যয় করবে আল্লাহ তাকে যা দিয়েছেন তাত্থেকে। আল্লাহ যাকে যতটা দিয়েছেন তার অতিরিক্ত বোঝা তার উপর চাপান না। আল্লাহ কষ্টের পর আরাম দিবেন।', 'Let a man of wealth spend from his wealth, and he whose provision is restricted - let him spend from what Allah has given him. Allah does not charge a soul except [according to] what He has given it. Allah will bring about, after hardship, ease.', 'সচ্ছল ব্যক্তি তার সচ্ছলতা অনুসারে ব্যয় করবে। আর যার রিযক সীমিত করা হয়েছে, সে ব্যয় করবে আল্লাহ তাকে যা দিয়েছেন তাত্থেকে। আল্লাহ যাকে যতটা দিয়েছেন তার অতিরিক্ত বোঝা তার উপর চাপান না। আল্লাহ কষ্টের পর আরাম দিবেন।', 'Let a man of wealth spend from his wealth, and he whose provision is restricted - let him spend from what Allah has given him. Allah does not charge a soul except [according to] what He has given it. Allah will bring about, after hardship, ease.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/065007.mp3', now()),
  (65, 8, '', '[{"id":8975,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَأَيِّن","transliteration":"waka-ayyin","translation_bn":"এবং কত","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَيِّن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":8976,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8977,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনপদ","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8978,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَتَتْ","transliteration":"ʿatat","translation_bn":"অমান্য করেছিল","root":"عتو","lemma":"عَتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":8979,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"বিপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":8980,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِ","transliteration":"amri","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8981,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهَا","transliteration":"rabbihā","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8982,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلِهِۦ","transliteration":"warusulihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রসূলদের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8983,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَحَاسَبْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"faḥāsabnāhā","translation_bn":"তার আমরা হিসাব অতঃপর নিয়েছি","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَاسَبْ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":8984,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حِسَابًۭا","transliteration":"ḥisāban","translation_bn":"হিসাব","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8985,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدًۭا","transliteration":"shadīdan","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":8986,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعَذَّبْنَـٰهَا","transliteration":"waʿadhabnāhā","translation_bn":"ও তার আমরা শাস্তি দিয়েছি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":8987,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًۭا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":8988,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نُّكْرًۭا","transliteration":"nuk''ran","translation_bn":"ভীষণ","root":"نكر","lemma":"نُّكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":8989,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waka-ayyin min qaryatin ʿatat ʿan amri rabbihā warusulihi faḥāsabnāhā ḥisāban shadīdan waʿadhabnāhā ʿadhāban nuk''ran', 'কত জনপদ তাদের প্রতিপালকের আর তাঁর রসূলদের হুকুম অমান্য করেছে। ফলে আমরা তাদের থেকে কঠিনভাবে প্রতিশোধ নিয়েছি আর তাদেরকে ‘আযাব দিয়েছি কঠিন ‘আযাব।', 'And how many a city was insolent toward the command of its Lord and His messengers, so We took it to severe account and punished it with a terrible punishment.', 'কত জনপদ তাদের প্রতিপালকের আর তাঁর রসূলদের হুকুম অমান্য করেছে। ফলে আমরা তাদের থেকে কঠিনভাবে প্রতিশোধ নিয়েছি আর তাদেরকে ‘আযাব দিয়েছি কঠিন ‘আযাব।', 'And how many a city was insolent toward the command of its Lord and His messengers, so We took it to severe account and punished it with a terrible punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/065008.mp3', now()),
  (65, 9, '', '[{"id":10218,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَذَاقَتْ","transliteration":"fadhāqat","translation_bn":"স্বাদ নিয়েছে অতঃপর","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10219,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَبَالَ","transliteration":"wabāla","translation_bn":"কুফলের","root":"وبل","lemma":"وَبَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10220,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِهَا","transliteration":"amrihā","translation_bn":"তার কাজের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10221,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10222,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10223,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِهَا","transliteration":"amrihā","translation_bn":"তার কাজের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10224,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خُسْرًا","transliteration":"khus''ran","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি","root":"خسر","lemma":"خُسْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10225,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fadhāqat wabāla amrihā wakāna ʿāqibatu amrihā khus''ran', 'তারা তাদের কৃতকর্মের খারাপ প্রতিফল আস্বাদন করল, ধ্বংসই হল তাদের কাজের পরিণতি।', 'And it tasted the bad consequence of its affair, and the outcome of its affair was loss.', 'তারা তাদের কৃতকর্মের খারাপ প্রতিফল আস্বাদন করল, ধ্বংসই হল তাদের কাজের পরিণতি।', 'And it tasted the bad consequence of its affair, and the outcome of its affair was loss.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/065009.mp3', now()),
  (65, 10, '', '[{"id":11439,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَعَدَّ","transliteration":"aʿadda","translation_bn":"প্রস্তুত রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11440,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11441,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11442,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًۭا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"আযাব","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11443,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"shadīdan","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":11445,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা ভয় কর","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11446,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11447,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى","transliteration":"yāulī","translation_bn":"হে","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":11448,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-albābi","translation_bn":"বোধসম্পন্নরা","root":"لبب","lemma":"أَلْبَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11449,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":11450,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11452,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":11453,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11454,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":11455,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ilaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":11456,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرًۭا","transliteration":"dhik''ran","translation_bn":"উপদেশ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11457,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aʿadda l-lahu lahum ʿadhāban shadīdan fa-ittaqū l-laha yāulī l-albābi alladhīna āmanū qad anzala l-lahu ilaykum dhik''ran', 'আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য কঠিন শাস্তি প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন। অতএব হে জ্ঞানবুদ্ধিসম্পন্ন মানুষেরা! যারা ঈমান এনেছ তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর। আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতি অবতীর্ণ করেছেন উপদেশ।', 'Allah has prepared for them a severe punishment; so fear Allah, O you of understanding who have believed. Allah has sent down to you the Qur''an.', 'আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য কঠিন শাস্তি প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন। অতএব হে জ্ঞানবুদ্ধিসম্পন্ন মানুষেরা! যারা ঈমান এনেছ তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর। আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতি অবতীর্ণ করেছেন উপদেশ।', 'Allah has prepared for them a severe punishment; so fear Allah, O you of understanding who have believed. Allah has sent down to you the Qur''an.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/065010.mp3', now()),
  (65, 11, '', '[{"id":12733,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَّسُولًۭا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"রসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12734,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتْلُوا۟","transliteration":"yatlū","translation_bn":"পাঠ করেন","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12735,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12736,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"আয়াতগুলো","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12737,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":12738,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُبَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"mubayyinātin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبَيِّنَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12739,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِّيُخْرِجَ","transliteration":"liyukh''rija","translation_bn":"বের করার জন্যে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12740,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":12741,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12742,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12743,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"নেকীসমূহ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12744,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12745,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারাদি","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12746,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12747,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّورِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nūri","translation_bn":"আলোর","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12749,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12750,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنۢ","transliteration":"yu''min","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12751,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12752,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْمَلْ","transliteration":"wayaʿmal","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":12753,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"নেক","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12754,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُدْخِلْهُ","transliteration":"yud''khil''hu","translation_bn":"তাকে প্রবেশ করাবেন তিনি","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12755,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12756,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12757,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12758,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তারা পাদদেশ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12759,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাধারাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":12760,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"বসবাসকারী স্থায়ীভাবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12761,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12762,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"চিরকাল","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":12764,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":12765,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنَ","transliteration":"aḥsana","translation_bn":"অতি উত্তম করেছেন","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":12766,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":12767,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":12768,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"رِزْقًا","transliteration":"riz''qan","translation_bn":"রিযক","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":12769,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rasūlan yatlū ʿalaykum āyāti l-lahi mubayyinātin liyukh''rija alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti mina l-ẓulumāti ilā l-nūri waman yu''min bil-lahi wayaʿmal ṣāliḥan yud''khil''hu jannātin tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru khālidīna fīhā abadan qad aḥsana l-lahu lahu riz''qan', '(তদুপরি তিনি পাঠিয়েছেন) একজন রসূল যে তোমাদের কাছে আল্লাহর স্পষ্ট আয়াত পাঠ করে, যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে তাদেরকে গাঢ় অন্ধকার থেকে আলোতে আনার জন্য। আর যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনবে আর সৎ কাজ করবে, তিনি তাকে দাখিল করবেন জান্নাতে যার নীচ দিয়ে বয়ে চলেছে নির্ঝরিণী। তাতে তারা চিরকাল সর্বকাল থাকবে। আল্লাহ তার জন্য অতি উত্তম রিযকের ব্যবস্থা করে রেখেছেন।', '[He sent] a Messenger [Muhammad] reciting to you the distinct verses of Allah that He may bring out those who believe and do righteous deeds from darknesses into the light. And whoever believes in Allah and does righteousness - He will admit him into gardens beneath which rivers flow to abide therein forever. Allah will have perfected for him a provision.', '(তদুপরি তিনি পাঠিয়েছেন) একজন রসূল যে তোমাদের কাছে আল্লাহর স্পষ্ট আয়াত পাঠ করে, যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎ কাজ করে তাদেরকে গাঢ় অন্ধকার থেকে আলোতে আনার জন্য। আর যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনবে আর সৎ কাজ করবে, তিনি তাকে দাখিল করবেন জান্নাতে যার নীচ দিয়ে বয়ে চলেছে নির্ঝরিণী। তাতে তারা চিরকাল সর্বকাল থাকবে। আল্লাহ তার জন্য অতি উত্তম রিযকের ব্যবস্থা করে রেখেছেন।', '[He sent] a Messenger [Muhammad] reciting to you the distinct verses of Allah that He may bring out those who believe and do righteous deeds from darknesses into the light. And whoever believes in Allah and does righteousness - He will admit him into gardens beneath which rivers flow to abide therein forever. Allah will have perfected for him a provision.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/065011.mp3', now()),
  (65, 12, '', '[{"id":14030,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"al-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14031,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(তিনিই) যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":14032,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14033,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَبْعَ","transliteration":"sabʿa","translation_bn":"সাত","root":"سبع","lemma":"سَبْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14034,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَمَـٰوَٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"samāwātin","translation_bn":"আসমান","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14035,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"ও পর্যায় হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14036,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14037,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَهُنَّ","transliteration":"mith''lahunna","translation_bn":"তাদের অনুরূপ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14038,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَتَنَزَّلُ","transliteration":"yatanazzalu","translation_bn":"নাযিল হয়","root":"نزل","lemma":"تَنَزَّلَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14039,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","transliteration":"l-amru","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14040,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُنَّ","transliteration":"baynahunna","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":14041,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِتَعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"litaʿlamū","translation_bn":"তোমরা জান যেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":14042,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":14043,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14044,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14045,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14046,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14047,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমতাবান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14048,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"ও বাস্তবিকই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":14049,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":14050,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":14051,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَحَاطَ","transliteration":"aḥāṭa","translation_bn":"পরিবেষ্টন করে রেখেছেন","root":"حوط","lemma":"أَحَاطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":14052,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":14053,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14054,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمًۢا","transliteration":"ʿil''man","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14055,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-lahu alladhī khalaqa sabʿa samāwātin wamina l-arḍi mith''lahunna yatanazzalu l-amru baynahunna litaʿlamū anna l-laha ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun wa-anna l-laha qad aḥāṭa bikulli shayin ʿil''man', 'আল্লাহই সাত আসমান বানিয়েছেন আর ওগুলোর মত পৃথিবীও, সবগুলোর মাঝে (অর্থাৎ সকল আসমানে আর সকল যমীনে) নেমে আসে আল্লাহর নির্দেশ যাতে তোমরা জানতে পার যে, আল্লাহ সব কিছুর উপর ক্ষমতাবান আর আল্লাহ (স্বীয়) জ্ঞানে সব কিছুকে ঘিরে রেখেছেন।', 'It is Allah who has created seven heavens and of the earth, the like of them. [His] command descends among them so you may know that Allah is over all things competent and that Allah has encompassed all things in knowledge.', 'আল্লাহই সাত আসমান বানিয়েছেন আর ওগুলোর মত পৃথিবীও, সবগুলোর মাঝে (অর্থাৎ সকল আসমানে আর সকল যমীনে) নেমে আসে আল্লাহর নির্দেশ যাতে তোমরা জানতে পার যে, আল্লাহ সব কিছুর উপর ক্ষমতাবান আর আল্লাহ (স্বীয়) জ্ঞানে সব কিছুকে ঘিরে রেখেছেন।', 'It is Allah who has created seven heavens and of the earth, the like of them. [His] command descends among them so you may know that Allah is over all things competent and that Allah has encompassed all things in knowledge.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/065012.mp3', now())
