সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29786,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَدَّعُونَ","transliteration":"taddaʿūna","translation_bn":"দাবি করতে\"","root":"دعو","lemma":"يَدَّعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29787,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā ra-awhu zul''fatan sīat wujūhu alladhīna kafarū waqīla hādhā alladhī kuntum bihi taddaʿūna', 'অতঃপর যখন তারা তাকে (অর্থাৎ ক্বিয়ামতকে) নিকটে উপস্থিত দেখতে পাবে, তখন কাফিরদের মুখ মলিন হয়ে যাবে, আর (তাদেরকে) বলা হবে, ‘এই তো (ও‘য়াদা বাস্তবায়িত হয়েছে) যা তোমরা চাচ্ছিলে।’', 'But when they see it approaching, the faces of those who disbelieve will be distressed, and it will be said, "This is that for which you used to call."', 'অতঃপর যখন তারা তাকে (অর্থাৎ ক্বিয়ামতকে) নিকটে উপস্থিত দেখতে পাবে, তখন কাফিরদের মুখ মলিন হয়ে যাবে, আর (তাদেরকে) বলা হবে, ‘এই তো (ও‘য়াদা বাস্তবায়িত হয়েছে) যা তোমরা চাচ্ছিলে।’', 'But when they see it approaching, the faces of those who disbelieve will be distressed, and it will be said, "This is that for which you used to call."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/067027.mp3', now()),
  (67, 28, '', '[{"id":30889,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30890,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা চিন্তা কি করেছ","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":30891,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":30892,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَكَنِىَ","transliteration":"ahlakaniya","translation_bn":"আমাকে ধ্বংস করেন","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30893,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30894,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30895,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّعِىَ","transliteration":"maʿiya","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":30896,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30897,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَحِمَنَا","transliteration":"raḥimanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের প্রতি দয়া করেন","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30898,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"কে কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":30899,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُجِيرُ","transliteration":"yujīru","translation_bn":"আশ্রয় দেবে","root":"جور","lemma":"يُجِيرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30900,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার কারীদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30901,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30902,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"আযাব","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30903,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"alīmin","translation_bn":"অত্যন্ত পীড়াদায়ক\"","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30904,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum in ahlakaniya l-lahu waman maʿiya aw raḥimanā faman yujīru l-kāfirīna min ʿadhābin alīmin', 'বল, ‘‘তোমরা ভেবে দেখেছ কি আল্লাহ যদি আমাকে আর আমার সঙ্গী সাথীদেরকে ধ্বংস করে দেন অথবা আমাদের উপর দয়া করেন (তাতে তোমাদের লাভটা কী?) মর্মান্তিক শাস্তি থেকে কাফিদেরকে বাঁচাবে কে?', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Have you considered: whether Allah should cause my death and those with me or have mercy upon us, who can protect the disbelievers from a painful punishment?"', 'বল, ‘‘তোমরা ভেবে দেখেছ কি আল্লাহ যদি আমাকে আর আমার সঙ্গী সাথীদেরকে ধ্বংস করে দেন অথবা আমাদের উপর দয়া করেন (তাতে তোমাদের লাভটা কী?) মর্মান্তিক শাস্তি থেকে কাফিদেরকে বাঁচাবে কে?', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Have you considered: whether Allah should cause my death and those with me or have mercy upon us, who can protect the disbelievers from a painful punishment?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/067028.mp3', now()),
