":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31918,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":31919,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul huwa l-raḥmānu āmannā bihi waʿalayhi tawakkalnā fasataʿlamūna man huwa fī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'বল, ‘তিনিই দয়াময়, আমরা তাঁর উপরেই ঈমান রাখি, আর তাঁর উপরেই নির্ভর করি। তোমরা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে কে সুস্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে আছে (আমরা না তোমরা)।’', 'Say, "He is the Most Merciful; we have believed in Him, and upon Him we have relied. And you will [come to] know who it is that is in clear error."', 'বল, ‘তিনিই দয়াময়, আমরা তাঁর উপরেই ঈমান রাখি, আর তাঁর উপরেই নির্ভর করি। তোমরা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে কে সুস্পষ্ট গুমরাহীতে আছে (আমরা না তোমরা)।’', 'Say, "He is the Most Merciful; we have believed in Him, and upon Him we have relied. And you will [come to] know who it is that is in clear error."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/067029.mp3', now()),
  (67, 30, '', '[{"id":32537,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32538,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ভেবে কি দেখেছ","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":32539,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":32540,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَصْبَحَ","transliteration":"aṣbaḥa","translation_bn":"হয়ে যায়","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32541,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَآؤُكُمْ","transliteration":"māukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32542,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"غَوْرًۭا","transliteration":"ghawran","translation_bn":"ভূগর্ভস্থ","root":"غور","lemma":"غَوْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32543,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"কে তবে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":32544,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيكُم","transliteration":"yatīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে আনবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32545,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآءٍۢ","transliteration":"bimāin","translation_bn":"পানি","root":"موه","lemma":"مَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32546,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَّعِينٍۭ","transliteration":"maʿīnin","translation_bn":"প্রবহমান\"","root":"عين","lemma":"مَّعِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":32547,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum in aṣbaḥa māukum ghawran faman yatīkum bimāin maʿīnin', 'বল, ‘‘তোমরা ভেবে দেখেছ কি যদি তোমাদের পানি ভূগর্ভের তলদেশে চলে যায়, তাহলে তোমাদেরকে কে এনে দেবে প্রবহমান পানি?’’', 'Say, "Have you considered: if your water was to become sunken [into the earth], then who could bring you flowing water?"', 'বল, ‘‘তোমরা ভেবে দেখেছ কি যদি তোমাদের পানি ভূগর্ভের তলদেশে চলে যায়, তাহলে তোমাদেরকে কে এনে দেবে প্রবহমান পানি?’’', 'Say, "Have you considered: if your water was to become sunken [into the earth], then who could bring you flowing water?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/067030.mp3', now())
