uwa aʿlamu biman ḍalla ʿan sabīlihi wahuwa aʿlamu bil-muh''tadīna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক বেশি জানেন কে তাঁর পথ থেকে গুমরাহ হয়ে গেছে, আর সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্তদেরকেও তিনি ভাল করে জানেন।', 'Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has gone astray from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক বেশি জানেন কে তাঁর পথ থেকে গুমরাহ হয়ে গেছে, আর সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্তদেরকেও তিনি ভাল করে জানেন।', 'Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who has gone astray from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/068007.mp3', now()),
  (68, 8, '', '[{"id":9067,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"না অতএব","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":9068,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُطِعِ","transliteration":"tuṭiʿi","translation_bn":"মেনো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":9069,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","transliteration":"l-mukadhibīna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপকারীদের।","root":"كذب","lemma":"مُّكَذِّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":9070,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falā tuṭiʿi l-mukadhibīna', 'কাজেই তুমি মিথ্যাবাদীদের কথা মান্য কর না।', 'Then do not obey the deniers.', 'কাজেই তুমি মিথ্যাবাদীদের কথা মান্য কর না।', 'Then do not obey the deniers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/068008.mp3', now()),
  (68, 9, '', '[{"id":10283,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَدُّوا۟","transliteration":"waddū","translation_bn":"তারা চাই","root":"ودد","lemma":"وَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10284,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":10285,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُدْهِنُ","transliteration":"tud''hinu","translation_bn":"তুমি নমনীয় হও","root":"دهن","lemma":"يُدْهِنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10286,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَيُدْهِنُونَ","transliteration":"fayud''hinūna","translation_bn":"তবে তারা নমনীয় হবে","root":"دهن","lemma":"يُدْهِنُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10287,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waddū law tud''hinu fayud''hinūna', 'তারা চায় যে, তুমি যদি নমনীয় হও, তবে তারাও নমনীয় হবে,', 'They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you].', 'তারা চায় যে, তুমি যদি নমনীয় হও, তবে তারাও নমনীয় হবে,', 'They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/068009.mp3', now()),
  (68, 10, '', '[{"id":11458,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":11459,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُطِعْ","transliteration":"tuṭiʿ","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করে!","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":11460,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11461,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَلَّافٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥallāfin","translation_bn":"অত্যাধিক শপথকারী","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَّاف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":11462,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّهِينٍ","transliteration":"mahīnin","translation_bn":"গুরুত্বহীন(ব্যক্তির)","root":"مهن","lemma":"مَّهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":11463,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tuṭiʿ kulla ḥallāfin mahīnin', 'তুমি তার অনুসরণ কর না, যে বেশি বেশি কসম খায় আর যে (বার বার মিথ্যা কসম খাওয়ার কারণে মানুষের কাছে) লাঞ্ছিত।', 'And do not obey every worthless habitual swearer', 'তুমি তার অনুসরণ কর না, যে বেশি বেশি কসম খায় আর যে (বার বার মিথ্যা কসম খাওয়ার কারণে মানুষের কাছে) লাঞ্ছিত।', 'And do not obey every worthless habitual swearer', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/068010.mp3', now()),
  (68, 11, '', '[{"id":13076,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَمَّازٍۢ","transliteration":"hammāzin","translation_bn":"নিন্দাকারী","root":"همز","lemma":"هَمَّاز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13077,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّشَّآءٍۭ","transliteration":"mashāin","translation_bn":"ঘুরে বেড়াই","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَّا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":13078,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِنَمِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"binamīmin","translation_bn":"চোগলখুরীসহ","root":"نمم","lemma":"نَمِيم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13079,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hammāzin mashāin binamīmin', 'যে পশ্চাতে নিন্দা করে একের কথা অপরের কাছে লাগিয়ে ফিরে,', '[And] scorner, going about with malicious gossip -', 'যে পশ্চাতে নিন্দা করে একের কথা অপরের কাছে লাগিয়ে ফিরে,', '[And] scorner, going about with malicious gossip -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/068011.mp3', now()),
